window.GEPT_JIEJIN_UNITS=[{"unit":1,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 1 (001.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Human Body, Physical Actions & Health | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"ankle","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the joint between the foot and the lower leg","chinese":"腳踝","sentence":"Yesterday afternoon, Peter jumped off the garden wall, but he landed badly and hurt his right ______, so he could not walk home.","translation":"昨天下午彼得跳下花園圍牆，但他著地姿勢不佳並傷到了右腳踝，所以他無法走回家。"},{"word":"bone","pos":"(n.)","definition":"any of the hard pieces that make up the skeleton","chinese":"骨頭","sentence":"The stray dog looked very hungry and tired, so the kind lady gave him a beef ______ to chew on in the yard.","translation":"那隻流浪狗看起來非常飢餓且疲累，所以那位好心的女士給了牠一根牛骨頭在院子裡啃咬。"},{"word":"brain","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the organ inside the head that controls thought and memory","chinese":"大腦；智力","sentence":"Regular physical exercise is good for your health, and reading books can help train your ______ to stay active and sharp.","translation":"規律的身體運動對健康有益，而閱讀書籍可以幫助訓練你的大腦保持活躍與敏銳。"},{"word":"chin","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the bottom part of the face below the mouth","chinese":"下巴","sentence":"My little brother fell off his bicycle on the street, and he scraped his ______ on the ground, but he did not cry.","translation":"我的小弟弟在街上從腳踏車上摔了下來，他的下巴在地上擦傷，但他並沒有哭。"},{"word":"hip","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the area on either side of the body below the waist","chinese":"臀部；髖部","sentence":"My grandmother slipped on the wet kitchen floor this morning, so my father took her to the hospital to check her left ______.","translation":"我的祖母今天早上在濕滑的廚房地板上滑倒，所以我父親帶她去醫院檢查她的左側臀部（髖部）。"},{"word":"beard","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the hair that grows on a man's chin and cheeks","chinese":"鬍鬚","sentence":"Uncle David decided to grow a thick ______ during his winter vacation, but his wife asked him to shave it off yesterday.","translation":"大衛叔叔決定在寒假期間留濃密的鬍鬚，但他的妻子昨天要求他將它刮掉。"},{"word":"nail","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the hard surface covering the tip of fingers; a metal pin","chinese":"指甲；釘子","sentence":"Tom was very nervous before the English speech contest began, so he sat in the corner and kept biting his finger ______.","translation":"湯姆在英語演講比賽開始前非常緊張，所以他坐在角落裡一直咬自己的手指甲。"},{"word":"skin","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"the natural outer layer that covers the body","chinese":"皮膚；擦破皮","sentence":"You should put on some sunscreen before going to the beach, or the hot summer sun will easily burn your ______.","translation":"你去海灘前應該擦點防曬乳，否則炎熱的夏日陽光很容易曬傷你的皮膚。"},{"word":"tear(tear / tore / torn)","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to pull paper or cloth into pieces; water from eyes","chinese":"撕裂；眼淚","sentence":"Please be very careful when you open the old envelope, and do not ______ the letter inside because it is very important.","translation":"當你打開那個舊信封時請非常小心，不要撕破裡面的信件，因為它非常重要。"},{"word":"throat","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the front passage inside the neck","chinese":"喉嚨","sentence":"I caught a bad cold on Monday morning, so I had a sore ______ and could not speak loudly in class all day.","translation":"我星期一早上得了重感冒，所以我喉嚨痛且一整天在課堂上都無法大聲說話。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"During the fast basketball match yesterday, Jason stepped on another player's foot and twisted his right ______, so he could not walk for three days.","options":["bone","ankle","beard","chin"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: ankle (腳踝)【全文中譯】昨天那場快節奏的籃球賽中，傑森踩到了另一名球員的腳並扭傷了他的右腳踝，所以他整整三天無法走路。【選項解析】(A) bone 骨頭  (B) ankle 腳踝  (C) beard 鬍鬚  (D) chin 下巴。由 stepped on... foot（踩到腳）與 could not walk（無法走路）可知應選 ankle。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The soup was served extremely hot, and Susan took a large mouthful without blowing on it, which burned her ______ badly.","options":["throat","nail","hip","bone"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: throat (喉嚨)【全文中譯】那碗湯上桌時非常燙，蘇珊沒吹涼就喝了一大口，結果嚴重燙傷了她的喉嚨。【選項解析】(A) throat 喉嚨  (B) nail 指甲  (C) hip 臀部  (D) bone 骨頭。由 took a large mouthful of hot soup（喝了一大口熱湯）可知會燙到喉嚨。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Grandfather likes to look neat, so he uses shaving cream and a sharp razor every morning to remove his white ______ completely.","options":["skin","brain","beard","ankle"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: beard (鬍鬚)【全文中譯】祖父喜歡看起來整潔，所以他每天早上都用刮鬍膏和鋒利的剃刀將他的白鬍鬚徹底刮乾淨。【選項解析】(A) skin 皮膚  (B) brain 大腦  (C) beard 鬍鬚  (D) ankle 腳踝。由 shaving cream（刮鬍膏）與 razor（剃刀）可知答案為 beard。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Scientists explain that doing crossword puzzles and reading new books can challenge your ______ and keep your memory sharp as you get older.","options":["hip","brain","nail","throat"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: brain (大腦)【全文中譯】科學家解釋，做填字遊戲和閱讀新書可以挑戰你的大腦，並在年齡增長時保持記憶力敏銳。【選項解析】(A) hip 臀部  (B) brain 大腦  (C) nail 指甲  (D) throat 喉嚨。由 crossword puzzles（填字遊戲）與 keep memory sharp（保持記憶敏銳）可知指大腦。"},{"number":5,"stem":"When the hammer slipped from my hand, it hit my left thumb and turned my finger ______ dark purple and very sore.","options":["beard","bone","chin","nail"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: nail (指甲)【全文中譯】當鐵鎚從我手中滑落時，它砸中了我的左拇指，把我的手指甲打成了深紫色且非常疼痛。【選項解析】(A) beard 鬍鬚  (B) bone 骨頭  (C) chin 下巴  (D) nail 指甲。由 finger nail（手指甲）以及被鐵鎚砸到變紫色可知選 nail。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Please be very gentle when opening this old historical document, or you might easily ______ the fragile paper into pieces.","options":["tear","cough","touch","ache"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: tear (撕破)【全文中譯】打開這份古老的歷史文獻時請務必小心，否則你很容易把脆弱的紙張撕成碎片。【選項解析】(A) tear 撕裂  (B) cough 咳嗽  (C) touch 接觸  (D) ache 疼痛。由 fragile paper into pieces（脆弱紙張成碎片）可知選動詞 tear。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The elderly gentleman fell down on the icy sidewalk, and the doctor said he cracked a small ______ in his left leg.","options":["beard","bone","brain","chin"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: bone (骨頭)【全文中譯】那位年長紳士在結冰的人行道上摔倒，醫生說他摔裂了左腿的一根小骨頭。【選項解析】(A) beard 鬍鬚  (B) bone 骨頭  (C) brain 大腦  (D) chin 下巴。由 cracked a small bone in leg（腿部骨裂）可知答案為 bone。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The boxer kept his hands high to protect his face, but his opponent still landed a punch right on his ______.","options":["ankle","chin","nail","hip"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: chin (下巴)【全文中譯】拳擊手雙手高舉以保護臉部，但他的對手仍然一拳正好擊中了他的下巴。【選項解析】(A) ankle 腳踝  (B) chin 下巴  (C) nail 指甲  (D) hip 臀部。由 protect his face（保護臉部）與 punched on可知是在臉部的 chin。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The doctor advised Mark to apply protective lotion before going swimming, because the strong sunlight could severely damage his sensitive ______.","options":["skin","throat","brain","beard"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: skin (皮膚)【全文中譯】醫生建議馬克在去游泳前塗抹防護乳液，因為強烈的陽光會嚴重傷害他敏感的皮膚。【選項解析】(A) skin 皮膚  (B) throat 喉嚨  (C) brain 大腦  (D) beard 鬍鬚。由 apply lotion（塗乳液）與 strong sunlight（強烈陽光）可知受保護的是 skin。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Because Mrs. Baker wears an old belt that is too tight around her ______, she often feels uncomfortable when sitting down to work.","options":["chin","hip","brain","nail"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: hip (臀部；髖部)【全文中譯】因為貝克太太繫在臀部周圍的舊皮帶太緊了，所以她坐下來工作時經常感到不舒服。【選項解析】(A) chin 下巴  (B) hip 臀部  (C) brain 大腦  (D) nail 指甲。由 belt around hip（繫在臀部/髖部的皮帶）可知答案為 hip。"},{"number":11,"stem":"After shouting loudly to cheer for our school soccer team in the rain, my ______ was very dry and I needed warm water.","options":["nail","beard","throat","ankle"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: throat (喉嚨)【全文中譯】在雨中大聲為我們學校足球隊加油之後，我的喉嚨非常乾，而且我需要喝溫水。【選項解析】(A) nail 指甲  (B) beard 鬍鬚  (C) throat 喉嚨  (D) ankle 腳踝。由 shouting loudly（大聲吶喊）與 dry 可知喉嚨乾渴。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The puppy was thrilled when we gave him a large beef ______ from the butcher, and he happily chewed it in the yard all day.","options":["brain","chin","skin","bone"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: bone (骨頭)【全文中譯】當我們從小肉舖拿了一根大牛骨頭給小狗時，牠興奮極了，整天開心地在院子裡啃著它。【選項解析】(A) brain 大腦  (B) chin 下巴  (C) skin 皮膚  (D) bone 骨頭。由 beef bone from butcher（肉舖的牛骨）與 chewed it 可知選 bone。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Henry decided to grow a thick brown ______ during the cold winter, but his mother said it made him look much older.","options":["ankle","beard","throat","nail"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: beard (鬍鬚)【全文中譯】亨利決定在寒冷的冬天留濃密的棕色鬍鬚，但他母親說這讓他看起來老很多。【選項解析】(A) ankle 腳踝  (B) beard 鬍鬚  (C) throat 喉嚨  (D) nail 指甲。由 grow a thick brown beard（留濃密鬍鬚）可知答案為 beard。"},{"number":14,"stem":"If you pull the heavy box too quickly across the sharp metal shelf, the cardboard will ______ and everything will drop onto the floor.","options":["ache","cough","tear","burn"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: tear (撕裂)【全文中譯】如果你把笨重的箱子在鋒利的金屬架上拉得太快，紙板會破裂，裡面的東西就會全掉到地上。【選項解析】(A) ache 疼痛  (B) cough 咳嗽  (C) tear 撕裂  (D) burn 燃燒。由 pull across sharp metal... cardboard will tear 可知選 tear。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Little Tina was nervous about her final piano test, so she kept biting her finger ______ while waiting outside the music classroom.","options":["nail","hip","beard","brain"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: nail (指甲)【全文中譯】小蒂娜對鋼琴期末測驗感到非常緊張，所以在音樂教室外等待時，她一直咬著自己的手指甲。【選項解析】(A) nail 指甲  (B) hip 臀部  (C) beard 鬍鬚  (D) brain 大腦。由 biting finger nail（咬指甲）為緊張時常見動作。"},{"number":16,"stem":"While playing soccer on the school field, David fell and scraped his left ______ on the rough ground, causing it to bleed slightly.","options":["brain","throat","skin","beard"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: skin (皮膚)【全文中譯】大衛在學校操場踢足球時摔倒，在粗糙的地面上擦破了左側皮膚，導致微微流血。【選項解析】(A) brain 大腦  (B) throat 喉嚨  (C) skin 皮膚  (D) beard 鬍鬚。由 scraped his skin and bled（擦破皮流血）可知答案為 skin。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Resting properly after intense study sessions gives your ______ enough time to process new information and stay refreshed.","options":["brain","ankle","chin","nail"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: brain (大腦)【全文中譯】密集學習後適度休息，可以讓你的大腦有足夠的時間處理新資訊並保持精力充沛。【選項解析】(A) brain 大腦  (B) ankle 腳踝  (C) chin 下巴  (D) nail 指甲。由 process new information（處理新資訊）可知為主體大腦。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The little girl rested her small ______ on her hands while listening attentively to the wonderful bedtime story told by her grandfather.","options":["ankle","bone","chin","throat"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: chin (下巴)【全文中譯】小女孩在聚精會神聆聽祖父講述美妙的床邊故事時，雙手托著她小巧的下巴。【選項解析】(A) ankle 腳踝  (B) bone 骨頭  (C) chin 下巴  (D) throat 喉嚨。由 rested her chin on hands（雙手托腮/托下巴）可知答案為 chin。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Wearing high-heeled shoes for many hours made Emily lose her balance, and she painfully twisted her left ______ on the stairs.","options":["throat","beard","skin","ankle"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: ankle (腳踝)【全文中譯】穿著高跟鞋好幾個小時讓艾蜜莉失去平衡，她在樓梯上痛苦地扭傷了左腳踝。【選項解析】(A) throat 喉嚨  (B) beard 鬍鬚  (C) skin 皮膚  (D) ankle 腳踝。由 high-heeled shoes（高跟鞋）與 twisted on the stairs 可知為 ankle。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The stray dog got into a fight with another animal, and the veterinarian had to take an X-ray to see if any ______ was broken.","options":["chin","bone","nail","brain"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: bone (骨頭)【全文中譯】那隻流浪狗與另一隻動物打架，獸醫必須照 X 光片來檢查是否有任何骨頭折斷了。【選項解析】(A) chin 下巴  (B) bone 骨頭  (C) nail 指甲  (D) brain 大腦。由 take an X-ray（照X光）與 broken 可知檢查的是 bone。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The heavy bag knocked against Amanda's left ______ as she squeezed through the narrow train door, leaving a visible blue bruise.","options":["beard","brain","hip","throat"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: hip (臀部；髖部)【全文中譯】當阿曼達擠過狹窄的火車門時，沉重的提袋撞到了她的左側臀部，留下了一塊明顯的瘀青。【選項解析】(A) beard 鬍鬚  (B) brain 大腦  (C) hip 臀部  (D) throat 喉嚨。由 knocked against hip as she squeezed through 可知為身體兩側的 hip。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Kevin spoke for over two hours during the company presentation, which left his ______ completely hoarse and tired.","options":["throat","nail","bone","ankle"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: throat (喉嚨)【全文中譯】凱文在公司簡報中講了兩個多小時的話，這讓他的喉嚨完全沙啞且疲憊不堪。【選項解析】(A) throat 喉嚨  (B) nail 指甲  (C) bone 骨頭  (D) ankle 腳踝。由 spoke for over two hours（說話超過兩小時）與 hoarse（沙啞）可知為 throat。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The young artist accidently made a deep ______ in the expensive painting canvas while cutting open the package with a box cutter.","options":["beard","bone","chin","tear"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: tear (裂痕/破損)【全文中譯】那位年輕藝術家用美工刀割開包裝時，不小心在那幅昂貴的畫布上劃出了一道很深的裂痕。【選項解析】(A) beard 鬍鬚  (B) bone 骨頭  (C) chin 下巴  (D) tear 裂口/撕痕。名詞 tear 表示布料或紙張的撕裂口，與 canvas 相符。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The beautician carefully trimmed, shaped, and polished every single finger ______ before applying the elegant pink polish for the bride.","options":["nail","hip","throat","brain"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: nail (指甲)【全文中譯】美容師在為新娘塗上優雅的粉色指甲油之前，仔細修剪、塑形並拋光了每一根手指甲。【選項解析】(A) nail 指甲  (B) hip 臀部  (C) throat 喉嚨  (D) brain 大腦。由 trimmed, shaped and polished, pink polish 可知為 finger nail。"},{"number":25,"stem":"People with fair ______ need to be especially cautious on sunny beaches, because they are prone to painful sunburns within minutes.","options":["bone","beard","skin","chin"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: skin (皮膚)【全文中譯】皮膚白皙的人在陽光明媚的海灘上需要格外小心，因為他們很容易在幾分鐘內就被曬傷。【選項解析】(A) bone 骨頭  (B) beard 鬍鬚  (C) skin 皮膚  (D) chin 下巴。由 fair skin（白皙皮膚）與 painful sunburns（曬傷）可知答案為 skin。"}]},{"unit":2,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 2 (002.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Body Parts, Physical Health & Medical Conditions | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"thumb","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the short, thick first finger on the human hand","chinese":"拇指","sentence":"When Emma opened the heavy glass door, her left ______ was caught in the frame, but luckily it was not broken.","translation":"當艾瑪推開厚重的玻璃門時，她的左手拇指被門框夾到了，但幸運的是沒有骨折。"},{"word":"toe","pos":"(n.)","definition":"any of the five separate parts at the end of each foot","chinese":"腳趾","sentence":"Jason accidentally kicked the corner of the wooden table, and he hurt his big ______, so he sat on the sofa in pain.","translation":"傑森不小心踢到木桌的角落並傷到了他的大腳趾，所以他痛苦地坐在沙發上。"},{"word":"tongue","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the soft organ inside the mouth used for tasting and speaking","chinese":"舌頭","sentence":"The spicy noodle soup was still extremely hot, and Kevin burned his ______ badly, so he had to drink a glass of cold water.","translation":"那碗辣麵湯依然非常燙，凱文嚴重燙傷了舌頭，所以他不得不喝下一杯冰水。"},{"word":"tummy","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the stomach or belly, especially used by or with children","chinese":"肚子；胃","sentence":"The little girl ate too many chocolate candies before lunch, so she had a sore ______ and could not finish her meal.","translation":"小女孩在午餐前吃了太多巧克力糖，所以她肚子痛且無法吃完正餐。"},{"word":"waist","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the narrow middle part of the human body above the hips","chinese":"腰部","sentence":"My uncle has exercised every morning for six months, and his ______ has become much smaller, so he needs to buy a new belt.","translation":"我叔叔連續六個月每天早晨運動，他的腰圍縮小了許多，所以他需要買一條新皮帶。"},{"word":"wrist","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the joint between the hand and the lower arm","chinese":"手腕","sentence":"David fell off his skateboard on the playground, and he sprained his right ______ when he tried to stop himself from hitting the floor.","translation":"大衛在操場上從滑板上摔了下來，當他試圖用手撐地防止摔倒時扭傷了右手腕。"},{"word":"AIDS","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a serious disease caused by a virus that harms the immune system","chinese":"愛滋病","sentence":"Modern doctors have developed new treatments for ______, and many international groups work together to prevent its spread worldwide.","translation":"現代醫生已經開發出治療愛滋病的新療法，許多國際組織也攜手合作以防止其在全球蔓延。"},{"word":"cancer","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a very serious disease in which abnormal cells grow uncontrollably","chinese":"癌症","sentence":"Smoking cigarettes significantly increases the risk of lung ______, so the government launched an educational campaign across the country.","translation":"吸菸會顯著增加罹患肺癌的風險，因此政府在全國展開了一項教育宣導宣傳。"},{"word":"cough","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to force air out of the throat with a sudden sound; the illness","chinese":"咳嗽","sentence":"The classroom was completely quiet during the exam, but Jerry had a dry ______ and tried his best not to disturb others.","translation":"考試期間教室裡非常安靜，但傑瑞患有乾咳並竭盡全力不去打擾他人。"},{"word":"death","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the end of life; the state of being dead","chinese":"死亡","sentence":"The sudden ______ of the beloved leader deeply shocked the entire nation, and thousands of citizens gathered to pay their respects.","translation":"這位敬愛領袖的突然去世深深震驚了全國，數千名市民聚集在一起表達敬意。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"When the heavy dictionary slipped from the desk, it landed directly on David's right foot and bruised his big ______.","options":["thumb","toe","wrist","waist"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: toe (腳趾) 【全文中譯】當厚重的字典從書桌上滑落時，它直接砸在戴維的右腳上並砸傷了他的大腳趾。 【選項解析】(A) thumb 拇指  (B) toe 腳趾  (C) wrist 手腕  (D) waist 腰部。由 right foot（右腳）可知砸到的是腳趾 toe。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The hot tea was poured straight from the boiling kettle, and Linda burned her ______ when she took a hasty sip.","options":["tongue","waist","tummy","wrist"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: tongue (舌頭) 【全文中譯】熱茶直接從沸騰的水壺倒出，琳達匆忙喝了一小口時嚴重燙傷了她的舌頭。 【選項解析】(A) tongue 舌頭  (B) waist 腰部  (C) tummy 肚子  (D) wrist 手腕。由 boiling kettle（沸水壺）與 took a hasty sip（匆忙喝一小口）可知燙傷的是 tongue。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Because my grandfather lost ten kilograms during his illness, his trousers were too loose around his ______.","options":["tongue","cough","waist","thumb"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: waist (腰部) 【全文中譯】因為我的祖父在生病期間瘦了十公斤，所以他的長褲在腰圍處顯得太鬆了。 【選項解析】(A) tongue 舌頭  (B) cough 咳嗽  (C) waist 腰部  (D) thumb 拇指。由 trousers were too loose（褲子太鬆）可知是指腰圍 waist。"},{"number":4,"stem":"While typing rapidly on the keyboard for hours, the programmer felt a sharp pain in her right ______ and decided to rest.","options":["tummy","toe","cancer","wrist"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: wrist (手腕) 【全文中譯】在鍵盤上連續飛快打字數小時後，程式設計師感到右手腕陣陣劇痛並決定休息。 【選項解析】(A) tummy 肚子  (B) toe 腳趾  (C) cancer 癌症  (D) wrist 手腕。由 typing rapidly on the keyboard（在鍵盤打字）可知手腕 wrist 容易痠痛。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The doctor explained that regular medical checkups can help detect early signs of ______, which greatly improves recovery rates.","options":["cancer","thumb","waist","toe"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: cancer (癌症) 【全文中譯】醫生解釋定期健康檢查有助於發現癌症的早期徵兆，這能大幅提高康復率。 【選項解析】(A) cancer 癌症  (B) thumb 拇指  (C) waist 腰部  (D) toe 腳趾。由 early signs of... improves recovery rates 可知指重大疾病 cancer。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Little Tommy drank three bottles of cold soda in an hour, so he ran to his mother complaining about a painful ______.","options":["wrist","tummy","death","tongue"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: tummy (肚子；胃) 【全文中譯】小湯米在一小時內喝了三瓶冰汽水，所以他跑去找媽媽抱怨肚子痛。 【選項解析】(A) wrist 手腕  (B) tummy 肚子  (C) death 死亡  (D) tongue 舌頭。由 drank three bottles of cold soda（喝了三瓶冰汽水）可知導致 tummy 痛。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The elderly gentleman wore a thick scarf to protect his chest against the cold wind, but his dry ______ still kept him awake at night.","options":["waist","thumb","cough","toe"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: cough (咳嗽) 【全文中譯】那位年長紳士圍了條厚圍巾以抵禦寒風保護胸部，但他的乾咳依然讓他在夜裡難以入眠。 【選項解析】(A) waist 腰部  (B) thumb 拇指  (C) cough 咳嗽  (D) toe 腳趾。由 dry cough（乾咳）及 kept him awake at night 可知選 cough。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The hitchhiker stood beside the highway with his ______ raised high in the air to signal passing drivers for a ride.","options":["thumb","toe","tongue","tummy"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: thumb (拇指) 【全文中譯】搭便車者站在公路旁，將拇指高高舉在空中以示意過往司機搭載。 【選項解析】(A) thumb 拇指  (B) toe 腳趾  (C) tongue 舌頭  (D) tummy 肚子。搭便車的國際手勢是舉起大拇指 thumb。"},{"number":9,"stem":"News of the brave firefighter's heroic ______ during the rescue mission brought tears to everyone in the town.","options":["waist","death","tummy","wrist"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: death (死亡；殉職) 【全文中譯】這位英勇消防員在救援任務中英勇殉職的消息，讓鎮上的每個人都流下了眼淚。 【選項解析】(A) waist 腰部  (B) death 死亡  (C) tummy 肚子  (D) wrist 手腕。由 heroic death during rescue mission（救援任務中英勇殉職）可知選 death。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Public health organizations hold seminars every December to teach young adults about the prevention of ______.","options":["toe","AIDS","thumb","waist"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: AIDS (愛滋病) 【全文中譯】公共衛生組織每年十二月都會舉辦研討會，向年輕人宣導預防愛滋病的知識。 【選項解析】(A) toe 腳趾  (B) AIDS 愛滋病  (C) thumb 拇指  (D) waist 腰部。每年12月1日為世界愛滋病日（World AIDS Day），防治疾病為 AIDS。"},{"number":11,"stem":"After hiking down the rocky mountain path in tight boots, Amanda noticed that her left ______ was badly swollen.","options":["toe","waist","tongue","cancer"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: toe (腳趾) 【全文中譯】穿著過緊的靴子走下多石的山徑後，阿曼達發現她的左腳趾嚴重腫脹。 【選項解析】(A) toe 腳趾  (B) waist 腰部  (C) tongue 舌頭  (D) cancer 癌症。由 tight boots（過緊的靴子）與 hiking down mountain path 可知受擠壓腫脹的是 toe。"},{"number":12,"stem":"When playing badminton yesterday, Samuel slipped on the wooden court and painfully twisted his right ______.","options":["tummy","cough","wrist","tongue"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: wrist (手腕) 【全文中譯】昨天打羽毛球時，塞繆爾在木質球場上滑倒，痛苦地扭傷了右手腕。 【選項解析】(A) tummy 肚子  (B) cough 咳嗽  (C) wrist 手腕  (D) tongue 舌頭。跌倒撐地或揮拍扭傷關節，此處指 wrist（手腕）。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The little boy stuck out his ______ playfully at his sister behind his mother's back, but she caught him doing it.","options":["cancer","tongue","waist","toe"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: tongue (舌頭) 【全文中譯】小男孩趁媽媽不注意時，調皮地對他妹妹吐舌頭，但他被抓了個正著。 【選項解析】(A) cancer 癌症  (B) tongue 舌頭  (C) waist 腰部  (D) toe 腳趾。stick out one's tongue 為常見片語「吐舌頭」。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Mr. Harrison fastened a leather belt tightly around his ______ before lifting the heavy wooden crates onto the truck.","options":["waist","wrist","tongue","death"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: waist (腰部) 【全文中譯】哈里森先生在把沉重的木箱搬上卡車前，將皮帶緊緊繫在腰部以提供支撐。 【選項解析】(A) waist 腰部  (B) wrist 手腕  (C) tongue 舌頭  (D) death 死亡。皮帶繫在腰部，故選 waist。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Heavy air pollution in industrial areas often makes people ______ continuously whenever they walk outside without a face mask.","options":["taste","cough","touch","heal"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: cough (咳嗽) 【全文中譯】工業區嚴重的空氣污染經常使人們在沒戴口罩外出時不斷咳嗽。 【選項解析】(A) taste 品嚐  (B) cough 咳嗽  (C) touch 接觸  (D) heal 治癒。空氣污染刺激呼吸道引發 cough（咳嗽）。"},{"number":16,"stem":"The sudden tragic ______ of the talented young musician was reported on the front page of every morning newspaper.","options":["death","tummy","thumb","toe"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: death (死亡；離世) 【全文中譯】這位才華洋溢的年輕音樂家突然英年早逝的噩耗，登上了每家早報的頭版。 【選項解析】(A) death 死亡  (B) tummy 肚子  (C) thumb 拇指  (D) toe 腳趾。由 tragic death（悲劇性去世）與 front page of morning newspaper 可知選 death。"},{"number":17,"stem":"The nurse gently placed an ice pack on the toddler's swollen ______ after he slammed it in the bedroom drawer.","options":["cancer","tongue","thumb","waist"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: thumb (拇指) 【全文中譯】小幼童的拇指被臥室抽屜夾到後，護士溫柔地在他的腫脹拇指上敷了冰塊。 【選項解析】(A) cancer 癌症  (B) tongue 舌頭  (C) thumb 拇指  (D) waist 腰部。由 slammed it in the drawer（被抽屜夾到）可知指手指/拇指 thumb。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Eating spoiled seafood from the night market caused severe cramps in my ______, so I visited the clinic immediately.","options":["tummy","wrist","toe","thumb"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: tummy (肚子；胃) 【全文中譯】吃了夜市變質的海鮮導致我的肚子嚴重絞痛，所以我立刻去了診所就診。 【選項解析】(A) tummy 肚子  (B) wrist 手腕  (C) toe 腳趾  (D) thumb 拇指。吃了變質海鮮引起 tummy（肚子）痙攣絞痛。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Modern medical research has found effective antiviral drugs that allow people living with ______ to lead normal lives.","options":["AIDS","waist","wrist","tongue"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: AIDS (愛滋病) 【全文中譯】現代醫學研究發現了有效的抗病毒藥物，使愛滋病患者能夠過著正常生活。 【選項解析】(A) AIDS 愛滋病  (B) waist 腰部  (C) wrist 手腕  (D) tongue 舌頭。living with AIDS（與愛滋病共存）為固定醫療社會用語。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The doctor confirmed that the tumor in the patient's stomach was benign and not caused by ______, which relieved the whole family.","options":["death","cancer","tummy","cough"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: cancer (癌症) 【全文中譯】醫生證實病患胃部的腫瘤是良性的，並非由癌症所引起，這讓全家人鬆了一口氣。 【選項解析】(A) death 死亡  (B) cancer 癌症  (C) tummy 肚子  (D) cough 咳嗽。tumor is benign and not caused by cancer（腫瘤為良性且非癌症）。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Be careful when running barefoot across the sandy beach, or a hidden piece of broken glass could cut your ______.","options":["tongue","waist","toe","cough"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: toe (腳趾) 【全文中譯】赤腳跑過沙灘時要小心，否則隱藏的碎玻璃可能會割傷你的腳趾。 【選項解析】(A) tongue 舌頭  (B) waist 腰部  (C) toe 腳趾  (D) cough 咳嗽。running barefoot（赤腳跑步）容易割傷腳趾 toe。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The tennis coach told the players to wrap protective tape around each ______ to avoid strain during competitive matches.","options":["wrist","tummy","cancer","death"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: wrist (手腕) 【全文中譯】網球教練告訴球員們在手腕上纏繞防護膠帶，以避免在激烈比賽中受傷。 【選項解析】(A) wrist 手腕  (B) tummy 肚子  (C) cancer 癌症  (D) death 死亡。網球運動需大量手腕力量，需保護 wrist。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The doctor asked the patient to open his mouth wide and stick out his ______ so she could inspect his swollen throat.","options":["waist","tongue","toe","thumb"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: tongue (舌頭) 【全文中譯】醫生請病人張大嘴巴並伸出舌頭，以便檢查他腫脹的喉嚨。 【選項解析】(A) waist 腰部  (B) tongue 舌頭  (C) toe 腳趾  (D) thumb 拇指。stick out one's tongue to inspect swollen throat（伸出舌頭檢查喉嚨）。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Whenever autumn arrives and temperatures drop quickly, grandfather begins to ______ and drink warm honey water.","options":["crawl","cough","bleed","climb"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: cough (咳嗽) 【全文中譯】每逢秋季來臨、氣溫驟降時，祖父就開始咳嗽並飲用溫蜂蜜水舒緩。 【選項解析】(A) crawl 爬行  (B) cough 咳嗽  (C) bleed 流血  (D) climb 攀爬。氣溫下降引發咳嗽，故選 cough。"},{"number":25,"stem":"When giving someone encouragement, raising your ______ upward is widely understood as a gesture of support and approval.","options":["waist","toe","thumb","tummy"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: thumb (拇指) 【全文中譯】在給予他人鼓勵時，大拇指朝上被廣泛理解為支持與讚許的手勢。 【選項解析】(A) waist 腰部  (B) toe 腳趾  (C) thumb 拇指  (D) tummy 肚子。raising thumb upward（豎起大拇指）是肯定讚許的肢體語言。"}]},{"unit":3,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 3 (003.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Illnesses, Symptoms & Physical Sensations | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"deaf","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"unable to hear anything or unable to hear well","chinese":"聾的；重聽的","sentence":"The elderly musician became completely ______ in his left ear, but he continued to compose touching songs by feeling the piano's vibrations.","translation":"這位年長的音樂家左耳完全聾了，但他透過感受鋼琴的振動繼續創作出感人的歌曲。"},{"word":"dizzy","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"feeling as if everything is turning around and that you might fall","chinese":"頭暈的","sentence":"After riding the fast roller coaster three times in the amusement park, Laura felt very ______ and had to sit on the bench.","translation":"在遊樂園連續坐了三次快速雲霄飛車後，蘿拉感到非常頭暈，不得不坐在長椅上。"},{"word":"dumb","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"temporarily unable to speak, or permanently unable to speak; stupid","chinese":"啞的；說不出話的；愚蠢的","sentence":"When Mark heard the sudden news that he had won the grand prize, he was struck ______ with shock and could not say a single word.","translation":"當馬克聽到自己獲得大獎的突發消息時，他震驚得說不出話來，一個字也說不出來。"},{"word":"fever","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a medical condition in which the body temperature is higher than normal","chinese":"發燒","sentence":"The little boy developed a high ______ of thirty-nine degrees late at night, so his worried parents took him straight to the emergency room.","translation":"小男孩在深夜發了三十九度的高燒，擔憂的父母立刻將他直接送往急診室。"},{"word":"flu","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an infectious illness like a very bad cold that causes fever and weakness","chinese":"流行性感冒；流感","sentence":"Several students in our class caught the ______ this week, so the teacher advised everyone to wash hands often and wear masks.","translation":"我們班這週有幾位同學得了流行性感冒，所以老師建議大家要勤洗手並戴口罩。"},{"word":"healthy","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"strong and well; not sick; good for health","chinese":"健康的；健壯的","sentence":"My grandfather eats plenty of fresh vegetables every day and walks two miles, so he remains remarkably ______ at the age of eighty.","translation":"我的祖父每天吃大量新鮮蔬菜並步行兩英里，因此他在八十歲高齡依然非常健康。"},{"word":"ill","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"not feeling well; suffering from a disease or sickness","chinese":"生病的；不舒服的","sentence":"Because our English teacher suddenly fell ______ with a severe stomachache yesterday, another teacher had to take over our afternoon class.","translation":"因為我們的英文老師昨天突然因嚴重胃痛而生病，另一位老師不得不接替我們下午的課。"},{"word":"pain","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the unpleasant physical feeling caused by injury or illness","chinese":"疼痛；痛苦","sentence":"After running the full marathon on Sunday morning, Jack experienced severe muscle ______ in both legs and could hardly climb the stairs.","translation":"週日早晨跑完完整的馬拉松後，傑克的雙腿經歷了嚴重的肌肉疼痛，幾乎無法爬樓梯。"},{"word":"painful","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"causing physical pain or mental suffering","chinese":"令人疼痛的；痛苦的","sentence":"The deep cut on Robert's right thumb was extremely ______, but the nurse treated it gently with antiseptic cream and a clean bandage.","translation":"羅伯特右手大拇指上的深傷口極為令人疼痛，但護士用消毒藥膏和乾淨繃帶溫柔地進行了處理。"},{"word":"pale","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"having less color than usual, especially on the face because of illness","chinese":"蒼白的；灰白的","sentence":"When the nurse noticed how ______ the young patient looked after giving blood, she immediately brought him a cup of warm sweet tea.","translation":"當護士注意到那位年輕病人在捐血後臉色多麼蒼白時，她立刻給他端來一杯溫熱的甜茶。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"After spinning around in circles during the game, little Tommy felt so ______ that he fell onto the soft grass.","options":["healthy","dizzy","pale","deaf"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: dizzy (頭暈的) 【全文中譯】在遊戲中原地旋轉幾圈後，小湯米感到非常頭暈，以致於跌倒在柔軟的草地上。 【選項解析】(A) healthy 健康的  (B) dizzy 頭暈的  (C) pale 蒼白的  (D) deaf 聾的。由 spinning around in circles（旋轉圈圈）可知會感到 dizzy。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The doctor placed a thermometer under the baby's arm and confirmed that she had a dangerous ______ of 39.5 degrees.","options":["fever","pain","flu","tummy"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: fever (發燒) 【全文中譯】醫生在嬰兒的手臂下放了體溫計，證實她發了高達 39.5 度的危險高燒。 【選項解析】(A) fever 發燒  (B) pain 疼痛  (C) flu 流感  (D) tummy 肚子。由 thermometer（體溫計）及 39.5 degrees 可知選 fever。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Mr. Brown has been ______ since childhood, so he communicates smoothly with his family members using sign language.","options":["dizzy","healthy","deaf","painful"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: deaf (聾的) 【全文中譯】布朗先生自幼就耳聾，因此他使用手語與家人順暢地溝通。 【選項解析】(A) dizzy 頭暈的  (B) healthy 健康的  (C) deaf 聾的  (D) painful 疼痛的。由 sign language（手語）可知其為 deaf。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Many factory workers caught the winter ______ at the same time, so the manager had to close the assembly line for three days.","options":["pain","flu","fever","death"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: flu (流行性感冒) 【全文中譯】許多工廠工人在同一時間感染了冬季流感，所以經理不得不將裝配線關閉三天。 【選項解析】(A) pain 疼痛  (B) flu 流感  (C) fever 發燒  (D) death 死亡。由 winter... close assembly line for three days 可知指傳染性疾病 flu。"},{"number":5,"stem":"When the student heard the terrifying thunder shake the classroom windows, his face turned completely ______ with fright.","options":["healthy","dizzy","pale","painful"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: pale (蒼白的) 【全文中譯】當那位學生聽到可怕的雷聲震動教室窗戶時，他的臉嚇得完全發白。 【選項解析】(A) healthy 健康的  (B) dizzy 頭暈的  (C) pale 蒼白的  (D) painful 疼痛的。turn pale with fright（嚇得臉色蒼白）為常見搭配。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Eating fresh organic fruit and exercising regularly are the best ways to keep your body strong and ______.","options":["ill","deaf","dizzy","healthy"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: healthy (健康的) 【全文中譯】吃新鮮有機水果和規律運動，是保持身體強壯與健康的最有效方法。 【選項解析】(A) ill 生病的  (B) deaf 聾的  (C) dizzy 頭暈的  (D) healthy 健康的。strong and healthy（強壯健康的）為同義補充。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The dentist gave Kevin an injection before pulling the rotten tooth, so the operation was not ______ at all.","options":["painful","deaf","dumb","pale"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: painful (令人疼痛的) 【全文中譯】牙醫在拔除蛀牙前給凱文打了麻醉針，所以手術過程一點也不令人疼痛。 【選項解析】(A) painful 疼痛的  (B) deaf 聾的  (C) dumb 啞的  (D) pale 蒼白的。打了麻藥（injection）使得拔牙過程 not painful。"},{"number":8,"stem":"When the injured player was carried off the soccer field on a stretcher, he was groaning with unbearable ______ in his ankle.","options":["fever","flu","pain","cancer"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: pain (疼痛) 【全文中譯】當受傷的球員被用擔架抬下足球場時，他因腳踝難以忍受的疼痛而呻吟著。 【選項解析】(A) fever 發燒  (B) flu 流感  (C) pain 疼痛  (D) cancer 癌症。groaning with unbearable pain（因難以忍受的劇痛而呻吟）。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The little boy was struck ______ with astonishment when the magician pulled a live white rabbit out of the empty black hat.","options":["healthy","dumb","deaf","dizzy"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: dumb (說不出話的；驚呆的) 【全文中譯】當魔術師從空黑帽子裡拉出一隻活生生的白兔時，小男孩驚訝得目瞪口呆說不出話來。 【選項解析】(A) healthy 健康的  (B) dumb 啞的/說不出話的  (C) deaf 聾的  (D) dizzy 頭暈的。struck dumb with astonishment（驚訝得目瞪口呆/說不出話）。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Because several employees became seriously ______ after eating contaminated food at the cafeteria, the health bureau launched an inspection.","options":["healthy","painful","ill","deaf"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: ill (生病的) 【全文中譯】由於幾位員工在餐廳吃了受污染的食物後嚴重生病，衛生局展開了全面檢查。 【選項解析】(A) healthy 健康的  (B) painful 疼痛的  (C) ill 生病的  (D) deaf 聾的。fall ill（生病倒下）為標準用法。"},{"number":11,"stem":"After standing under the scorching summer sun for two hours without drinking water, Samuel felt extremely ______ and fainted.","options":["deaf","dizzy","healthy","dumb"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: dizzy (頭暈的) 【全文中譯】在酷熱的夏日陽光下站了兩小時而沒喝水後，塞繆爾感到極度頭暈並昏了過去。 【選項解析】(A) deaf 聾的  (B) dizzy 頭暈的  (C) healthy 健康的  (D) dumb 啞的。酷暑脫水引發頭暈（dizzy）與昏厥。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The mother placed a cold wet towel on her son's forehead to help bring down his high ______ throughout the stormy night.","options":["flu","pain","fever","waist"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: fever (發燒) 【全文中譯】母親在兒子的額頭上放了一條冰冷濕毛巾，以幫助他在暴風雨之夜退去高燒。 【選項解析】(A) flu 流感  (B) pain 疼痛  (C) fever 發燒  (D) waist 腰部。bring down high fever（降低高燒）為常見搭配。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Even though my grandfather is slightly ______ in his right ear, he can still hear clearly if you speak directly toward him.","options":["deaf","pale","dizzy","healthy"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: deaf (重聽的；聾的) 【全文中譯】儘管我的祖父右耳稍微有點重聽，但如果你直接朝著他講話，他依然能聽得很清楚。 【選項解析】(A) deaf 聾的/重聽的  (B) pale 蒼白的  (C) dizzy 頭暈的  (D) healthy 健康的。指耳朵功能受損，選 deaf。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Drinking warm lemon water and getting plenty of rest in bed will help your body recover faster from the seasonal ______.","options":["pain","flu","cancer","fever"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: flu (流感) 【全文中譯】喝溫檸檬水並在床上多休息，將有助於你的身體更快從季節性流感中康復。 【選項解析】(A) pain 疼痛  (B) flu 流感  (C) cancer 癌症  (D) fever 發燒。seasonal flu 指季節性流感。"},{"number":15,"stem":"When Mary stepped on a rusty iron nail in the garden, she cried out in sudden ______ and called her father for help.","options":["fever","pain","flu","cough"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pain (疼痛) 【全文中譯】當瑪麗在花園裡踩到生鏽的鐵釘時，她痛苦地尖叫並大聲向父親求救。 【選項解析】(A) fever 發燒  (B) pain 疼痛  (C) flu 流感  (D) cough 咳嗽。踩到鐵釘引起的劇烈感官反應是 pain。"},{"number":16,"stem":"The nurse told the patient that the injection would feel like a tiny pinch and would not be very ______.","options":["painful","healthy","deaf","dizzy"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: painful (令人疼痛的) 【全文中譯】護士告訴病人打針感覺就像被輕輕捏一下，並不會非常令人疼痛。 【選項解析】(A) painful 疼痛的  (B) healthy 健康的  (C) deaf 聾的  (D) dizzy 頭暈的。形容打針的感受，選 painful。"},{"number":17,"stem":"After being trapped inside the dark mine for twenty hours without food, the rescued workers looked remarkably weak and ______.","options":["healthy","pale","dumb","painful"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pale (蒼白的) 【全文中譯】在漆黑的礦井中被困二十小時且沒有食物後，獲救的工人們看起來異常虛弱且面色蒼白。 【選項解析】(A) healthy 健康的  (B) pale 蒼白的  (C) dumb 啞的  (D) painful 疼痛的。weak and pale（虛弱且面色蒼白）。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Maintaining a balanced daily diet and sleeping eight hours every night will ensure you remain energetic and ______.","options":["dizzy","ill","deaf","healthy"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: healthy (健康的) 【全文中譯】維持均衡的日常飲食並每晚睡滿八小時，將確保你保持活力與健康。 【選項解析】(A) dizzy 頭暈的  (B) ill 生病的  (C) deaf 聾的  (D) healthy 健康的。energetic and healthy（充滿活力且健康）。"},{"number":19,"stem":"When the police officer asked the frightened witness what had happened, she was struck ______ and could only point at the broken door.","options":["deaf","dumb","pale","healthy"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: dumb (說不出話的) 【全文中譯】當警官詢問受驚的目擊者發生了什麼事時，她驚嚇得說不出話，只能指著破損的門。 【選項解析】(A) deaf 聾的  (B) dumb 說不出話的  (C) pale 蒼白的  (D) healthy 健康的。struck dumb 表示嚇得暫時失語。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The principal announced that school would be canceled tomorrow because our teacher suddenly fell ______ and had to stay in the hospital.","options":["healthy","dizzy","ill","pale"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: ill (生病的) 【全文中譯】校長宣布明天停課，因為我們的老師突然生病且必須住院治療。 【選項解析】(A) healthy 健康的  (B) dizzy 頭暈的  (C) ill 生病的  (D) pale 蒼白的。fell ill 表示罹病。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The cut on my finger was swollen and ______, so the doctor advised me to keep it clean and dry for a few days.","options":["painful","deaf","healthy","dumb"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: painful (令人疼痛的) 【全文中譯】我手指上的傷口紅腫且令人疼痛，所以醫生建議我保持幾天清潔乾燥。 【選項解析】(A) painful 疼痛的  (B) deaf 聾的  (C) healthy 健康的  (D) dumb 啞的。swollen and painful（紅腫疼痛）。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The patient took two painkiller pills before going to bed, and the sharp ______ in his injured shoulder gradually faded away.","options":["fever","flu","pain","death"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: pain (疼痛) 【全文中譯】病人在睡前吃了兩顆止痛藥，他受傷肩膀上的劇烈疼痛逐漸消退。 【選項解析】(A) fever 發燒  (B) flu 流感  (C) pain 疼痛  (D) death 死亡。吃止痛藥（painkiller）是為了減緩 pain。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Looking down from the top of the hundred-story skyscraper made Oliver feel so ______ that he backed away from the window immediately.","options":["healthy","dizzy","deaf","pale"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: dizzy (頭暈的) 【全文中譯】從百層摩天大樓頂端向下看讓奧利佛感到非常頭暈，以致於他立刻從窗邊退開。 【選項解析】(A) healthy 健康的  (B) dizzy 頭暈的  (C) deaf 聾的  (D) pale 蒼白的。在高處向下看引起的暈眩感即為 dizzy。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The child had a runny nose, a sore throat, and a high ______, which indicated that he had caught a serious viral infection.","options":["flu","fever","pain","tummy"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: fever (發燒) 【全文中譯】那孩子流鼻水、喉嚨痛且發高燒，這表明他感染了嚴重的病毒。 【選項解析】(A) flu 流感  (B) fever 發燒  (C) pain 疼痛  (D) tummy 肚子。have a high fever（發高燒）。"},{"number":25,"stem":"When she saw the blood dripping from her sister's knee, Amanda's face turned as ______ as a white sheet of paper.","options":["pale","dizzy","deaf","healthy"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pale (蒼白的) 【全文中譯】當看到血液從她妹妹的膝蓋滴下時，阿曼達的臉色變得像一張白紙一樣蒼白。 【選項解析】(A) pale 蒼白的  (B) dizzy 頭暈的  (C) deaf 聾的  (D) healthy 健康的。as pale as a sheet 為固定比喻「面如白紙」。"}]},{"unit":4,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 4 (004.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Recovery, Medical Facilities & Spiritual Concepts | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"recover","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to become healthy or well again after an illness or injury","chinese":"康復；恢復","sentence":"After resting quietly at home for two weeks, Samuel began to ______ from his chest infection, and he returned to school yesterday.","translation":"在家安靜休養兩週後，塞繆爾開始從胸部感染中康復，並於昨天重返學校。"},{"word":"toothache","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a sharp or dull pain in or near a tooth","chinese":"牙痛","sentence":"Linda suffered from a terrible ______ all night long, so she made an urgent appointment with her dentist early this morning.","translation":"琳達整晚飽受劇烈牙痛之苦，所以她今天清晨緊急向牙醫師預約看診。"},{"word":"weight","pos":"(n.)","definition":"how heavy someone or something is; heaviness","chinese":"重量；體重","sentence":"Because my father wanted to control his body ______, he stopped drinking sugary sodas and started jogging every evening.","translation":"因為我父親想要控制自己的體重，他不再喝含糖汽水並開始每天傍晚慢跑。"},{"word":"wound","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"an injury to the body, especially a cut or tear in the skin","chinese":"傷口；傷害","sentence":"The soldier received a deep bullet ______ on his right arm during the battle, but field doctors bandaged it quickly.","translation":"那名士兵在戰鬥中右臂受了嚴重的子彈傷口，但戰地醫生迅速為他進行了包紮。"},{"word":"ambulance","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a special vehicle used for taking sick or injured people to hospital","chinese":"救護車","sentence":"When the serious highway crash occurred, the police arrived immediately and called an ______ to transport the injured driver.","translation":"當這起嚴重的公路車禍發生時，警方立即趕到現場並呼叫救護車運送受傷的司機。"},{"word":"patient","pos":"(n.) / (adj.)","definition":"a person receiving medical care; able to wait calmly","chinese":"病人；有耐心的","sentence":"The elderly doctor was very gentle and ______ with every young child who visited the hospital clinic.","translation":"那位年邁的醫生對每一位來到醫院診所的小朋友都非常溫柔且有耐心。"},{"word":"homesick","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"sad because you are away from home and miss your family","chinese":"想家的；思鄉的","sentence":"During her first semester studying abroad in London, Emily felt deeply ______ whenever she looked at family photographs.","translation":"在倫敦留學的第一個學期裡，每當艾瑪看著家庭照片時，都感到深深的想家。"},{"word":"drugstore","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a shop where you can buy medicines, makeup, and daily items","chinese":"藥局；藥妝店","sentence":"Grandma asked me to walk over to the corner ______ to pick up her blood pressure pills and some cotton pads.","translation":"祖母叫我走到街角的藥局去幫她拿降血壓藥和一些化妝棉。"},{"word":"ghost","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the spirit of a dead person that some people believe can appear","chinese":"鬼魂；幽靈","sentence":"The children refused to enter the abandoned wooden mansion because an ancient legend claimed that a mysterious ______ lived inside.","translation":"孩子們拒絕進入那座廢棄的木製豪宅，因為一個古老的傳說聲稱裡面住著一個神秘的鬼魂。"},{"word":"god","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a superhuman being worshipped as having power over nature or human fortunes","chinese":"神；上帝","sentence":"The fishermen gathered at the coastal temple to pray to their ______ for safe voyages and calm seas ahead.","translation":"漁民們聚集在沿海的廟宇，向他們的神祈求航行平安與未來海面平靜。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"When the cyclist collided with the delivery van, bystanders immediately dialed 119 to request an ______.","options":["ambulance","drugstore","toothache","weight"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: ambulance (救護車) 【全文中譯】當自行車騎士與送貨廂型車相撞時，旁觀者立即撥打119請求救護車支援。 【選項解析】(A) ambulance 救護車  (B) drugstore 藥局  (C) toothache 牙痛  (D) weight 重量。由 dialed 119 可知是呼叫 ambulance。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The nurse cleaned the dusty gravel out of the open ______ before applying antiseptic ointment and a fresh bandage.","options":["god","wound","patient","ghost"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: wound (傷口) 【全文中譯】護士在塗抹消毒藥膏和換上乾淨繃帶之前，先清理乾淨開放性傷口裡的砂石灰塵。 【選項解析】(A) god 神  (B) wound 傷口  (C) patient 病人  (D) ghost 鬼魂。open wound 指「開放性傷口」。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Eating sweet sticky candies right before bed without brushing often leads to severe cavities and a terrible ______.","options":["weight","toothache","ambulance","wound"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: toothache (牙痛) 【全文中譯】睡前吃甜黏的糖果而沒刷牙，常常導致嚴重的蛀牙和劇烈的牙痛。 【選項解析】(A) weight 體重  (B) toothache 牙痛  (C) ambulance 救護車  (D) wound 傷口。蛀牙引發 toothache。"},{"number":4,"stem":"The doctor reassured the family that with proper medication and rest, the patient would soon ______ completely.","options":["recover","wound","pray","cough"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: recover (康復) 【全文中譯】醫生向家屬保證，只要給予適當的藥物和休息，病人很快就會完全康復。 【選項解析】(A) recover 康復  (B) wound 傷害  (C) pray 祈禱  (D) cough 咳嗽。recover completely 表示「完全康復」。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Living in a faraway foreign city for the first time often makes international college students feel quite ______.","options":["patient","homesick","healthy","deaf"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: homesick (想家的) 【全文中譯】初次獨自生活在遙遠的異國城市，常常讓國際大學生感到非常想家。 【選項解析】(A) patient 有耐心的  (B) homesick 思鄉的  (C) healthy 健康的  (D) deaf 聾的。身處異鄉感到 homesick。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Please stop by the twenty-four-hour ______ on your way home to purchase cough syrup and band-aids for your brother.","options":["ghost","ambulance","drugstore","weight"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: drugstore (藥局；藥妝店) 【全文中譯】請在回家的路上順道去那家24小時藥局，為你弟弟買止咳糖漿和OK繃。 【選項解析】(A) ghost 鬼魂  (B) ambulance 救護車  (C) drugstore 藥局  (D) weight 體重。購買止咳糖漿的地方是 drugstore。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The heavy wooden box was loaded with metal tools, so its total ______ exceeded thirty kilograms.","options":["wound","toothache","patient","weight"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: weight (重量) 【全文中譯】那個厚重的木箱裝滿了金屬工具，所以其總重量超過了三十公斤。 【選項解析】(A) wound 傷口  (B) toothache 牙痛  (C) patient 病人  (D) weight 重量。exceeded 30 kilograms 指重量（weight）。"},{"number":8,"stem":"In ancient mythologies, people believed that the storm was sent by an angry ______ to punish wicked citizens.","options":["god","ghost","ambulance","patient"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: god (神) 【全文中譯】在古代神話中，人們相信這場暴風雨是一位憤怒的神派遣來懲罰邪惡市民的。 【選項解析】(A) god 神  (B) ghost 鬼魂  (C) ambulance 救護車  (D) patient 病人。古代神話中主宰自然的神為 god。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Old villagers whispered rumors that the dark tower on the cliff was haunted by the restless ______ of a forgotten sailor.","options":["weight","ghost","drugstore","toothache"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: ghost (鬼魂) 【全文中譯】老村民們私下謠傳懸崖上的黑塔裡，遊蕩著一位被遺忘水手的焦躁鬼魂。 【選項解析】(A) weight 體重  (B) ghost 鬼魂  (C) drugstore 藥局  (D) toothache 牙痛。haunted by a ghost 表示鬧鬼。"},{"number":10,"stem":"A good elementary school teacher must remain extremely ______ when explaining complicated arithmetic to young beginners.","options":["homesick","patient","pale","dizzy"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: patient (有耐心的) 【全文中譯】優秀的小學老師在向初學者解釋複雜算術時，必須保持極大的耐心。 【選項解析】(A) homesick 想家的  (B) patient 有耐心的  (C) pale 蒼白的  (D) dizzy 頭暈的。面對初學兒童需保持 patient。"},{"number":11,"stem":"After the surgeon finished the four-hour operation, the recovering ______ was moved into the intensive care room.","options":["ambulance","patient","drugstore","ghost"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: patient (病人) 【全文中譯】在外科醫生結束長達四小時的手術後，康復中的病人被轉移至加護病房。 【選項解析】(A) ambulance 救護車  (B) patient 病人  (C) drugstore 藥局  (D) ghost 鬼魂。接受手術住院的人為 patient。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The siren of the speeding ______ wailed loudly down the crowded avenue as drivers pulled over to let it pass.","options":["ambulance","drugstore","toothache","weight"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: ambulance (救護車) 【全文中譯】疾駛中的救護車鳴響警笛呼嘯穿過擁擠的大街，沿途司機紛紛靠邊讓行。 【選項解析】(A) ambulance 救護車  (B) drugstore 藥局  (C) toothache 牙痛  (D) weight 體重。鳴警笛且司機讓行的車輛為 ambulance。"},{"number":13,"stem":"It took Oliver almost six months of physical therapy to ______ full mobility in his fractured knee.","options":["recover","tear","skin","cough"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: recover (恢復；康復) 【全文中譯】奧利佛花了將近六個月的物理治療，才使骨折的膝蓋完全恢復活動能力。 【選項解析】(A) recover 恢復  (B) tear 撕裂  (C) skin 擦破皮  (D) cough 咳嗽。recover full mobility 指「恢復完整活動能力」。"},{"number":14,"stem":"If you have a throbbing ______ that keeps you awake, you should avoid drinking ice water and visit the dentist immediately.","options":["weight","toothache","wound","ghost"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: toothache (牙痛) 【全文中譯】如果你有一陣陣令人難以入眠的跳痛牙痛，你應該避免喝冰水並立即去看牙醫。 【選項解析】(A) weight 體重  (B) toothache 牙痛  (C) wound 傷口  (D) ghost 鬼魂。看牙醫處理的問題是 toothache。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The soldier's combat ______ healed cleanly over the summer, but a faint pale scar remained visible on his cheek.","options":["ghost","ambulance","wound","god"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: wound (傷口) 【全文中譯】士兵的戰鬥傷口在夏天完全癒合了，但他臉頰上仍留下了一道淡淡的淺色疤痕。 【選項解析】(A) ghost 鬼魂  (B) ambulance 救護車  (C) wound 傷口  (D) god 神。combat wound 指「戰鬥傷口」。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Because Kevin gained too much ______ over the holidays, he decided to join a gym and reduce carbohydrate intake.","options":["weight","toothache","drugstore","patient"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: weight (體重) 【全文中譯】因為凱文在假期中體重增加太多，他決定加入健身房並減少碳水化合物攝取。 【選項解析】(A) weight 體重  (B) toothache 牙痛  (C) drugstore 藥局  (D) patient 病人。gain weight 表示「體重增加」。"},{"number":17,"stem":"The pharmacist working behind the counter at the local ______ carefully checked the doctor's prescription before handing out the pills.","options":["ambulance","drugstore","ghost","wound"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: drugstore (藥局) 【全文中譯】在當地藥局櫃檯工作的藥劑師，在發放藥丸前仔細檢查了醫生的處方籤。 【選項解析】(A) ambulance 救護車  (B) drugstore 藥局  (C) ghost 鬼魂  (D) wound 傷口。配藥的地點為 drugstore。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Spending Christmas alone in a snowy dormitory made the exchange student feel terribly sad and ______.","options":["homesick","patient","deaf","healthy"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: homesick (想家的) 【全文中譯】獨自在積雪的宿舍裡度過聖誕節，讓這位交換學生感到非常悲傷與想家。 【選項解析】(A) homesick 想家的  (B) patient 有耐心的  (C) deaf 聾的  (D) healthy 健康的。節日獨處易感到 homesick。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Before heading into the treacherous storm, the villagers knelt before their ancient ______ to ask for protection.","options":["god","ghost","patient","weight"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: god (神) 【全文中譯】在進入危險的暴風雨前，村民們跪倒在古老的神明面前祈求保佑庇護。 【選項解析】(A) god 神  (B) ghost 鬼魂  (C) patient 病人  (D) weight 重量。向神明祈禱庇護，選 god。"},{"number":20,"stem":"Spooky tales about a white-robed ______ wandering the old cemetery at midnight kept children from walking near the gate.","options":["drugstore","toothache","ghost","wound"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: ghost (幽靈；鬼魂) 【全文中譯】關於午夜時分白袍幽靈在舊墓園徘徊的恐怖故事，讓孩子們不敢走近大門。 【選項解析】(A) drugstore 藥局  (B) toothache 牙痛  (C) ghost 幽靈  (D) wound 傷口。白袍徘徊的神秘身影為 ghost。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Dealing with difficult customers requires cashiers to stay calm, courteous, and remarkably ______ at all times.","options":["homesick","patient","dizzy","pale"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: patient (有耐心的) 【全文中譯】應對難纏的顧客要求收銀員始終保持冷靜、有禮貌且具備極佳的耐心。 【選項解析】(A) homesick 想家的  (B) patient 有耐心的  (C) dizzy 頭暈的  (D) pale 蒼白的。服務顧客需要 patient。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Paramedics rushed inside the wrecked building with a folding stretcher to carry the unconscious ______ outside.","options":["drugstore","patient","ghost","god"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: patient (傷患；病人) 【全文中譯】急救人員帶著折疊擔架衝進倒塌的建築物中，將昏迷不醒的傷患抬到室外。 【選項解析】(A) drugstore 藥局  (B) patient 病患  (C) ghost 鬼魂  (D) god 神。擔架抬出的對象為 patient。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The athlete was thrilled to hear from the surgeon that his torn muscle would ______ in time for the championship match.","options":["recover","wound","tear","cough"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: recover (康復) 【全文中譯】運動員高興地從外科醫生那裡得知，他撕裂的肌肉將及時康復以趕上冠軍賽。 【選項解析】(A) recover 康復  (B) wound 傷害  (C) tear 撕破  (D) cough 咳嗽。肌肉傷勢康復，選 recover。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The sudden explosion sent shattered glass flying everywhere, causing a deep bleeding ______ across the mechanic's forehead.","options":["weight","wound","toothache","ambulance"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: wound (傷口) 【全文中譯】突然的爆炸讓破碎玻璃四處飛濺，在技工的額頭上造成了一道深深流血的傷口。 【選項解析】(A) weight 重量  (B) wound 傷口  (C) toothache 牙痛  (D) ambulance 救護車。玻璃割傷為 bleeding wound。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Many ancient cultures built magnificent stone pyramids as sacred monuments dedicated to the sun ______.","options":["god","ghost","drugstore","patient"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: god (神) 【全文中譯】許多古代文明建造了壯麗的石造金字塔，作為獻給太陽神的神聖紀念碑。 【選項解析】(A) god 神  (B) ghost 鬼魂  (C) drugstore 藥局  (D) patient 病患。sun god 指「太陽神」。"}]},{"unit":5,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 5 (005.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: People, Manners & Human Spirit | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"praise","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to express strong approval or admiration for someone","chinese":"稱讚；讚美","sentence":"The principal gathered the whole school to ______ the brave students who rescued an elderly neighbor from the flooded house.","translation":"校長召集了全校師生，稱讚那些從淹水房屋中救出年邁鄰居的英勇學生。"},{"word":"pray","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to speak to God or a saint in order to give thanks or ask for help","chinese":"祈禱；祈求","sentence":"Every night before going to sleep, the little boy kneels beside his bed to ______ for his family's continued good health.","translation":"每晚就寢前，小男孩都會跪在床邊祈禱他的家人能夠持續保持身體健康。"},{"word":"spirit","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the non-physical part of a person; mood; courage and enthusiasm","chinese":"精神；靈魂；士氣","sentence":"Although our soccer team lost the final championship match, our coach admired the fighting ______ that every player showed.","translation":"雖然我們的足球隊在最後的冠軍爭奪賽中落敗，但教練十分讚賞每位球員所展現的戰鬥精神。"},{"word":"male","pos":"(adj.) / (n.)","definition":"belonging to the sex that does not give birth to young","chinese":"男性的；雄性的","sentence":"In most bird species, the ______ bird displays brightly colored feathers to attract female partners during spring.","translation":"在大多數鳥類物種中，雄鳥在春季會展現出色彩斑斕的羽毛以吸引雌性伴侶。"},{"word":"adult","pos":"(n.) / (adj.)","definition":"a person who is fully grown or legally mature","chinese":"成年人；成熟的","sentence":"Children under the age of twelve are not permitted to enter the swimming pool unless accompanied by an ______.","translation":"十二歲以下的兒童除非有成年人陪同，否則不允許進入該游泳池。"},{"word":"elder","pos":"(adj.) / (n.)","definition":"born earlier; senior; older person in a family or tribe","chinese":"年長的；長者","sentence":"Traditional Taiwanese culture teaches children to show high respect and courtesy toward their family ______.","translation":"台灣傳統文化教育孩子們要對家庭中的年長長輩表達崇高的尊敬與禮貌。"},{"word":"youth","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the period between childhood and adult age; young people","chinese":"青年時期；青春；年輕人","sentence":"In his ______, my grandfather worked on a merchant ship and traveled to more than twenty different countries.","translation":"在他年輕的時候，我的祖父曾在一艘商船上工作，並到過二十多個不同的國家旅行。"},{"word":"guy","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a man or boy; an informal word for an individual person","chinese":"傢伙；人；男士","sentence":"Mark is a really friendly and generous ______, and he always volunteers to help his classmates with difficult math homework.","translation":"馬克真是一個非常友善且慷慨的傢伙，他總是自願幫助同學解答困難的數學作業。"},{"word":"lady","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a polite or formal way of referring to a woman","chinese":"女士；淑女","sentence":"The polite young gentleman immediately stood up on the crowded subway train to offer his seat to an elderly ______.","translation":"那位有禮貌的年輕紳士立即在擁擠的捷運列車上站起身來，將座位讓給一位年長的女士。"},{"word":"ma'am","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a polite way of addressing a woman, especially in formal service","chinese":"女士；夫人（尊稱）","sentence":"The flight attendant smiled warmly and asked, 'May I bring you another cup of hot green tea, ______?'","translation":"空服員溫暖地微笑著問道：「女士，我能再為您拿一杯熱綠茶嗎？」"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The teacher did not hesitate to ______ Alice in front of the entire class for achieving the highest score on the exam.","options":["praise","pray","recover","wound"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: praise (稱讚) 【全文中譯】老師毫不猶豫地在全班同學面前稱讚愛麗絲，因為她在考試中獲得了最高分。 【選項解析】(A) praise 稱讚  (B) pray 祈禱  (C) recover 康復  (D) wound 傷害。考最高分值得在全班面前 praise。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Whenever our village faces severe droughts in summer, farmers gather at the chapel to ______ for rain.","options":["praise","pray","tear","cough"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pray (祈禱) 【全文中譯】每當我們的村莊在夏季面臨嚴重的乾旱時，農民們就會聚集在小教堂祈求降雨。 【選項解析】(A) praise 讚美  (B) pray 祈禱  (C) tear 撕裂  (D) cough 咳嗽。pray for rain（祈雨）為固定用法。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The marathon runner was exhausted after thirty miles, but her indomitable ______ kept her pushing forward until the finish line.","options":["youth","spirit","guy","adult"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: spirit (精神；意志) 【全文中譯】馬拉松跑者在跑了三十英里後精疲力竭，但她不屈不撓的精神讓她繼續向前推進直到終點線。 【選項解析】(A) youth 青春  (B) spirit 精神  (C) guy 傢伙  (D) adult 成年人。indomitable spirit 指「不屈不撓的精神」。"},{"number":4,"stem":"While female lions do most of the hunting for the pride, the strong ______ lion defends their vast territory from intruders.","options":["elder","male","homesick","patient"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: male (雄性的) 【全文中譯】雖然母獅負責獅群的大部分狩獵，但強壯的公獅則保衛著牠們龐大的領地免受入侵者侵擾。 【選項解析】(A) elder 年長的  (B) male 雄性的  (C) homesick 想家的  (D) patient 有耐心的。與 female 雌性相對應的是 male。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Movie tickets cost ten dollars for children, but every ______ must pay fifteen dollars at the ticket booth.","options":["guy","adult","youth","spirit"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: adult (成年人) 【全文中譯】兒童電影票價為十美元，但在售票亭每位成年人必須支付十五美元。 【選項解析】(A) guy 傢伙  (B) adult 成年人  (C) youth 青年  (D) spirit 精神。與 children 相對應的票價類別為 adult。"},{"number":6,"stem":"In many indigenous communities, young people listen attentively to the wisdom shared by the village ______.","options":["elders","spirits","guys","wounds"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: elders (長輩；長者) 【全文中譯】在許多原住民社區中，年輕人都專注傾聽村莊長輩們所分享的智慧。 【選項解析】(A) elders 長者  (B) spirits 靈魂  (C) guys 傢伙  (D) wounds 傷口。village elders 指「村莊長輩」。"},{"number":7,"stem":"During the energetic days of his ______, Uncle Frank spent entire summers backpacking across the rugged European mountains.","options":["spirit","youth","adult","lady"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: youth (青年時期) 【全文中譯】在活力充沛的青年時期，法蘭克叔叔花了一整個夏天背著背包徒步穿越崎嶇的歐洲山脈。 【選項解析】(A) spirit 精神  (B) youth 青年時期  (C) adult 成年人  (D) lady 女士。in the days of his youth 指青年歲月。"},{"number":8,"stem":"That tall ______ wearing the leather jacket is my older brother, and he plays lead guitar in a university rock band.","options":["adult","guy","spirit","ma'am"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: guy (傢伙；男士) 【全文中譯】那個穿皮夾克的高個子傢伙是我哥哥，他在大學搖滾樂團裡擔任主奏吉他手。 【選項解析】(A) adult 成年人  (B) guy 傢伙  (C) spirit 精神  (D) ma'am 女士。that tall guy（那個高個子傢伙）為常見口語。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The courteous waiter bowed gently and pulled out the wooden chair for the elegant ______ wearing the black evening gown.","options":["guy","lady","spirit","youth"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: lady (女士；淑女) 【全文中譯】有禮貌的服務生溫柔地鞠躬，並為身穿黑色晚禮服的高雅女士拉開木椅。 【選項解析】(A) guy 男士  (B) lady 女士  (C) spirit 精神  (D) youth 青年。穿著晚禮服的高雅女性稱為 lady。"},{"number":10,"stem":"'Excuse me, ______, you dropped your leather purse on the pavement,' the honest schoolboy shouted across the street.","options":["guy","ma'am","spirit","youth"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: ma'am (女士；夫人) 【全文中譯】「不好意思，女士，您的皮夾掉在人行道上了，」誠實的男學童隔著街道大聲呼喊。 【選項解析】(A) guy 傢伙  (B) ma'am 女士尊稱  (C) spirit 精神  (D) youth 青年。對陌生女性的有禮尊稱為 ma'am。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Parents should frequently ______ their children when they show kindness and helpfulness toward other people.","options":["praise","pray","skin","hurt"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: praise (稱讚) 【全文中譯】當孩子們對他人展現出善良與樂於助人時，父母應當經常給予稱讚。 【選項解析】(A) praise 稱讚  (B) pray 祈禱  (C) skin 擦傷  (D) hurt 傷害。肯定良好行為應給予 praise。"},{"number":12,"stem":"When the sailor was lost in the stormy ocean, he could only ______ for a rescue ship to appear before sunset.","options":["praise","pray","cough","tear"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pray (祈禱) 【全文中譯】當水手迷失在暴風雨的大海中時，他只能祈求搜救船能在日落前出現。 【選項解析】(A) praise 稱讚  (B) pray 祈禱  (C) cough 咳嗽  (D) tear 撕破。身陷絕境向天祈求，選 pray。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Even after losing their homes in the earthquake, the survivors showed remarkable community ______ by sharing food.","options":["spirit","youth","guy","adult"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: spirit (精神；士氣) 【全文中譯】即使在地震中失去了家園，倖存者們依然透過分享食物展現了非凡的社區團結精神。 【選項解析】(A) spirit 精神  (B) youth 青年  (C) guy 傢伙  (D) adult 成年人。community spirit 指「社區團隊凝聚精神」。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Scientists observed that only the ______ peacocks have magnificent fan-shaped tails with brilliant eye patterns.","options":["elder","male","patient","deaf"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: male (雄性的) 【全文中譯】科學家觀察到，只有雄孔雀才擁有絢麗眼狀斑紋的壯觀扇形尾羽。 【選項解析】(A) elder 年長的  (B) male 雄性的  (C) patient 有耐心的  (D) deaf 聾的。male peacocks 指「雄孔雀」。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The amusement park ride is too dangerous for toddlers, so an accompanying ______ must supervise each seat.","options":["youth","adult","spirit","guy"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: adult (成年人) 【全文中譯】遊樂園的設施對幼童來說太危險了，因此每個座位都必須有一名陪同的成年人監護。 【選項解析】(A) youth 青年  (B) adult 成年人  (C) spirit 精神  (D) guy 男士。accompanying adult 指「陪同的成年人」。"},{"number":16,"stem":"It is an honorable custom in our family to consult our ______ sister whenever an important household decision arises.","options":["elder","male","pale","dizzy"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: elder (年長的) 【全文中譯】每當家中有重大決定時，先向我們年長的姐姐請教是我們家族的一項光榮傳統。 【選項解析】(A) elder 年長的  (B) male 男性的  (C) pale 蒼白的  (D) dizzy 頭暈的。elder sister 指「年長的姐姐」。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Spending one's precious ______ playing video games all day without learning useful skills is something many regret later.","options":["adult","youth","spirit","lady"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: youth (青春時期) 【全文中譯】整天玩電子遊戲而沒有學習實用技能來耗費寶貴的青春，是許多人後來會後悔的事。 【選項解析】(A) adult 成年人  (B) youth 青春  (C) spirit 精神  (D) lady 女士。precious youth 指「寶貴的青春」。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Samuel is the kind of reliable ______ who will drop whatever he is doing to come and help fix your broken car.","options":["spirit","guy","ma'am","lady"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: guy (傢伙；人) 【全文中譯】塞繆爾是那種值得信賴的人，他會放下手頭正在做的事來幫你修好故障的汽車。 【選項解析】(A) spirit 精神  (B) guy 傢伙/人  (C) ma'am 女士  (D) lady 女士。reliable guy 指「靠得住的人」。"},{"number":19,"stem":"The dignified old ______ donated millions of dollars to the children's hospital to build a modern cancer center.","options":["guy","lady","youth","spirit"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: lady (女士) 【全文中譯】那位尊貴的老婦人向兒童醫院捐贈了數百萬美元，以建立一座現代化的癌症中心。 【選項解析】(A) guy 傢伙  (B) lady 女士  (C) youth 青年  (D) spirit 精神。dignified old lady 指「尊貴的高齡女士」。"},{"number":20,"stem":"'Here is your receipt and change, ______; thank you for shopping at our department store today,' the cashier said politely.","options":["guy","ma'am","spirit","youth"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: ma'am (女士；夫人) 【全文中譯】「這是您的收據和零錢，女士；謝謝您今天光臨我們的百貨公司，」收銀員有禮貌地說道。 【選項解析】(A) guy 男士  (B) ma'am 女士尊稱  (C) spirit 精神  (D) youth 青年。商業服務中禮貌稱呼顧客為 ma'am。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The sports coach offered warm words of ______ to the young goalkeeper after he blocked three decisive penalty kicks.","options":["spirit","praise","youth","adult"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: praise (讚美；讚許) 【全文中譯】在年輕守門員撲下了三個決定性的十二碼罰球後，體育教練對他表達了熱烈的讚美。 【選項解析】(A) spirit 精神  (B) praise 讚美  (C) youth 青春  (D) adult 成年人。words of praise 指「讚許的話語」。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Millions of peaceful citizens went to their local churches and mosques to ______ for an end to the brutal war.","options":["praise","pray","recover","wound"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pray (祈禱) 【全文中譯】數百萬和平的公民前往當地的教堂和清真寺，祈求殘酷的戰爭早日結束。 【選項解析】(A) praise 讚美  (B) pray 祈求  (C) recover 康復  (D) wound 傷害。pray for an end to war 指「祈求戰爭終結」。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The school festival was full of joyful laughter, and the festive ______ of the students spread throughout the neighborhood.","options":["spirit","youth","adult","guy"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: spirit (精神；氛圍) 【全文中譯】學校園遊會充滿了歡樂的笑聲，學生們節日的歡樂氛圍感染了整個社區街坊。 【選項解析】(A) spirit 精神/氣氛  (B) youth 青春  (C) adult 成年人  (D) guy 傢伙。festive spirit 指「節日慶祝氣氛」。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The university established a generous scholarship foundation to support motivated ______ from underprivileged rural backgrounds.","options":["adults","youth","ladies","spirits"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: youth (青年人) 【全文中譯】這所大學設立了慷慨的獎學金基金會，以資助來自弱勢農村背景且積極向上的青年人。 【選項解析】(A) adults 成年人  (B) youth 青年群體  (C) ladies 女士  (D) spirits 靈魂。motivated youth 指「有志青年」。"},{"number":25,"stem":"When the polite young man offered his umbrella to the wet ______, she thanked him warmly and shared her cab.","options":["guy","lady","youth","spirit"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: lady (女士) 【全文中譯】當那位有禮貌的年輕人把雨傘讓給被雨淋濕的女士時，她熱情地感謝他並與他共乘計程車。 【選項解析】(A) guy 傢伙  (B) lady 女士  (C) youth 青春  (D) spirit 精神。wet lady 指被淋濕的女士。"}]},{"unit":6,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 6 (006.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Family Relations, Social Roles & Guests | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"granddaughter","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a daughter of your son or daughter","chinese":"孫女；外孫女","sentence":"The elderly lady smiled happily as her little ______ ran into her arms and handed her a handmade birthday card.","translation":"當小孫女跑進那位年長女士的懷裡並遞給她一張手工生日卡片時，她幸福地微笑著。"},{"word":"grandson","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a son of your son or daughter","chinese":"孫子；外孫","sentence":"Mr. Watson took his energetic ten-year-old ______ to the baseball park, and they caught a foul ball in the third inning.","translation":"華生先生帶著他精力充沛的十歲孫子去棒球場，他們在第三局接到了一顆界外球。"},{"word":"nephew","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a son of your brother or sister","chinese":"姪子；外甥","sentence":"Aunt Catherine bought a remote-controlled helicopter for her favorite ______, and they flew it together in the garden.","translation":"凱薩琳姑姑為她最喜歡的姪子買了一架遙控直升機，他們一起在花園裡放飛它。"},{"word":"niece","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a daughter of your brother or sister","chinese":"姪女；外甥女","sentence":"Uncle David was extremely proud when his smart ______ graduated from medical school with top honors last month.","translation":"上個月，當大衛叔叔聰穎的姪女以優異的成績從醫學院畢業時，他感到無比自豪。"},{"word":"relative","pos":"(n.) / (adj.)","definition":"a person connected by blood or marriage; comparative","chinese":"親戚；親屬","sentence":"During the Lunar New Year holidays, dozens of distant ______ gather at our ancestral home to share a festive reunion dinner.","translation":"在農曆新年假期期間，數十位遠房親戚聚集在我們祖厝，共同享用豐盛的團圓晚餐。"},{"word":"couple","pos":"(n.)","definition":"two people who are married or in a romantic relationship; a small number","chinese":"夫妻；情侶；一對","sentence":"The newly married young ______ rented a cozy apartment near the park, and they spent weekends decorating their living room.","translation":"這對新婚的年輕夫婦在公園附近租了一間溫馨的公寓，他們利用週末時間裝飾客廳。"},{"word":"guest","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person invited to visit someone's home or attend an event","chinese":"客人；賓客","sentence":"The hotel staff prepared fresh flowers and fruit baskets to welcome every VIP ______ attending the international conference.","translation":"飯店員工準備了鮮花和水果籃，以歡迎出席這次國際會議的每一位貴賓。"},{"word":"host","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a person who receives or entertains guests; to organize an event","chinese":"主人；主辦；主持","sentence":"The gracious ______ welcomed each visitor at the front door with a warm smile and served hot tea in the parlor.","translation":"親切的主人在前門帶著溫暖的微笑迎接每位訪客，並在客廳裡為大家奉上熱茶。"},{"word":"member","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person or animal belonging to a group, club, or society","chinese":"成員；會員","sentence":"Because Samuel has been an active ______ of the science club for three years, he was elected team leader for the competition.","translation":"因為塞繆爾連續三年擔任科學社團的活躍成員，他被推選為本次競賽的隊長。"},{"word":"visitor","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person who visits someone or somewhere for a short time","chinese":"參觀者；訪客","sentence":"Museum guides kindly reminded each foreign ______ not to take photos using flash inside the ancient Egyptian exhibition hall.","translation":"博物館導覽員親切地提醒每一位外國參觀者，在古埃及展覽廳內不得使用閃光燈拍照。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The proud grandmother baked sweet apple pies to celebrate her five-year-old ______'s first ballet performance.","options":["grandson","granddaughter","couple","host"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: granddaughter (孫女) 【全文中譯】自豪的祖母烤了香甜的蘋果派，以慶祝她五歲孫女的第一場芭蕾舞表演。 【選項解析】(A) grandson 孫子  (B) granddaughter 孫女  (C) couple 夫婦  (D) host 主人。由 ballet performance（芭蕾舞表演）及 grandmother 可知選 granddaughter。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Grandpa taught his teenage ______ how to cast a fishing line and steer the wooden boat across the lake.","options":["granddaughter","niece","grandson","guest"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: grandson (孫子) 【全文中譯】祖父教他十幾歲的孫子如何拋投釣魚線並在湖面上掌舵木船。 【選項解析】(A) granddaughter 孫女  (B) niece 姪女  (C) grandson 孫子  (D) guest 客人。由 Grandpa... steer the wooden boat 可知帶孫子 grandson 釣魚。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Uncle Kevin sent a beautiful wooden toy castle to his six-year-old ______ on his birthday.","options":["nephew","niece","host","visitor"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: nephew (姪子；外甥) 【全文中譯】凱文叔叔在六歲姪子生日時，送了一座精美的木製玩具城堡給他。 【選項解析】(A) nephew 姪子  (B) niece 姪女  (C) host 主人  (D) visitor 訪客。由 his birthday 可知姪子/外甥為男性 nephew。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Aunt Sarah helped her teenage ______ select an elegant white dress for her high school graduation ball.","options":["nephew","grandson","niece","member"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: niece (姪女；外甥女) 【全文中譯】莎拉姑姑幫助她十幾歲的姪女挑選了一件優雅的白禮服，以參加高中畢業舞會。 【選項解析】(A) nephew 姪子  (B) grandson 孫子  (C) niece 姪女  (D) member 成員。選禮服參加畢業舞會的姪女為 niece。"},{"number":5,"stem":"When my parents celebrated their wedding anniversary, more than thirty close ______ traveled across the country to attend.","options":["relatives","couples","hosts","members"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: relatives (親戚；親屬) 【全文中譯】當我父母慶祝結婚紀念日時，超過三十位近親親屬橫跨全國趕來參加盛會。 【選項解析】(A) relatives 親屬  (B) couples 夫妻  (C) hosts 主人  (D) members 會員。close relatives 指「近親」。"},{"number":6,"stem":"The newlywed ______ held hands tightly as they walked down the sunlit beach during their honeymoon in Hawaii.","options":["guest","couple","relative","visitor"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: couple (夫妻；情侶) 【全文中譯】這對新婚夫婦在夏威夷度蜜月期間，漫步在陽光明媚的沙灘上時緊緊牽著手。 【選項解析】(A) guest 客人  (B) couple 夫婦  (C) relative 親戚  (D) visitor 參觀者。newlywed couple 指「新婚夫妻」。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The polite waiter made sure that every invited dinner ______ had a glass of chilled sparkling water at the banquet.","options":["host","relative","guest","nephew"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: guest (客人；賓客) 【全文中譯】有禮貌的服務生確保宴會上每位受邀的晚宴賓客，都能享有一杯冰鎮氣泡水。 【選項解析】(A) host 主人  (B) relative 親戚  (C) guest 賓客  (D) nephew 姪子。invited dinner guest 指「受邀晚宴賓客」。"},{"number":8,"stem":"As the generous party ______, Mr. Jenkins made sure all his neighbors had plenty of barbecue and cold drinks.","options":["guest","host","grandson","niece"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: host (主人；東道主) 【全文中譯】身為慷慨的派對主人，詹金斯先生確保所有的鄰居都有充足的烤肉和冷飲。 【選項解析】(A) guest 客人  (B) host 主人  (C) grandson 孫子  (D) niece 姪女。舉辦派對款待賓客者為 host。"},{"number":9,"stem":"To join the community swimming pool and use the fitness equipment, you must register as an annual ______.","options":["visitor","member","couple","host"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: member (會員；成員) 【全文中譯】若要加入社區游泳池並使用健身器材，你必須註冊成為年度會員。 【選項解析】(A) visitor 訪客  (B) member 會員  (C) couple 夫婦  (D) host 主人。register as an annual member 指註冊成為年度會員。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Thousands of international ______ travel to Taipei every autumn to admire the colorful fireworks and historic monuments.","options":["nieces","visitors","nephews","hosts"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: visitors (參觀者；遊客) 【全文中譯】數千名國際遊客每年秋天前往台北，欣賞絢麗的煙火並參觀歷史名勝。 【選項解析】(A) nieces 姪女  (B) visitors 遊客  (C) nephews 姪子  (D) hosts 主人。到訪台北觀光者為 visitors。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Old Mrs. Higgins knitted a soft pink wool sweater for her newborn ______ before the cold winter set in.","options":["grandson","granddaughter","couple","guest"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: granddaughter (孫女) 【全文中譯】希金斯老太太在寒冬降臨前，為她剛出生的孫女織了一件柔軟的粉紅色羊毛毛衣。 【選項解析】(A) grandson 孫子  (B) granddaughter 孫女  (C) couple 夫婦  (D) guest 客人。粉紅毛衣織給新生孫女 granddaughter。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The grandfather beamed with pride when his twenty-year-old ______ scored the winning goal in the university soccer tournament.","options":["granddaughter","grandson","niece","host"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: grandson (孫子) 【全文中譯】當二十歲的孫子在大學足球錦標賽中踢進致勝球時，祖父滿臉自豪歡喜。 【選項解析】(A) granddaughter 孫女  (B) grandson 孫子  (C) niece 姪女  (D) host 主人。由 his twenty-year-old grandson 可知為孫子。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Because his father had no brothers, Jack was the only beloved ______ on his mother's side of the family.","options":["nephew","niece","couple","visitor"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: nephew (姪子；外甥) 【全文中譯】因為他父親沒有兄弟，傑克是母親那邊家族裡唯一備受疼愛的姪子/外甥。 【選項解析】(A) nephew 姪子  (B) niece 姪女  (C) couple 夫婦  (D) visitor 訪客。Jack 為男性，故為 nephew。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Mary asked her talented ______ to play the violin at her wedding ceremony, and the performance moved everyone to tears.","options":["nephew","niece","host","member"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: niece (姪女；外甥女) 【全文中譯】瑪麗請她多才多藝的姪女在婚禮上演奏小提琴，這場演奏讓所有人感動落淚。 【選項解析】(A) nephew 姪子  (B) niece 姪女  (C) host 主人  (D) member 成員。親戚晚輩中的女性演奏家為 niece。"},{"number":15,"stem":"We invited all our living ______ to the ancestral village reunion, but some could not travel due to old age.","options":["couples","relatives","visitors","guests"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: relatives (親戚) 【全文中譯】我們邀請了所有健在的親戚參加祖村宗親團聚，但有些人因年事已高無法遠行。 【選項解析】(A) couples 夫婦  (B) relatives 親屬  (C) visitors 訪客  (D) guests 賓客。ancestral village reunion 聚會對象為 relatives。"},{"number":16,"stem":"After dating for seven years through college, the romantic young ______ finally decided to announce their engagement.","options":["guest","host","couple","member"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: couple (情侶；一對) 【全文中譯】在大學相戀七年後，這對浪漫的年輕情侶終於決定宣布訂婚。 【選項解析】(A) guest 賓客  (B) host 主人  (C) couple 情侶  (D) member 成員。相戀宣布訂婚者為 couple。"},{"number":17,"stem":"The hotel manager personally greeted each important foreign ______ at the lobby entrance and arranged baggage delivery.","options":["host","guest","relative","nephew"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: guest (賓客；貴賓) 【全文中譯】飯店經理在大廳門口親自迎接每一位重要的外國貴賓，並安排行李運送。 【選項解析】(A) host 主人  (B) guest 貴賓  (C) relative 親戚  (D) nephew 姪子。飯店接待的客人為 guest。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Taiwan will proudly ______ the international technology summit next year, welcoming thousands of foreign experts.","options":["guest","host","relative","niece"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: host (主辦；主持) 【全文中譯】台灣明年將榮幸地主辦國際科技峰會，熱烈歡迎數千名外國專家與會。 【選項解析】(A) guest 款待  (B) host 主辦  (C) relative 親屬  (D) niece 姪女。host the summit 指主辦高峰會。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Every committee ______ was invited to vote on the environmental protection policy during the annual meeting.","options":["visitor","member","couple","grandson"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: member (成員；委員) 【全文中譯】每位委員會成員都被邀請在年會上就環境保護政策進行投票表決。 【選項解析】(A) visitor 訪客  (B) member 成員  (C) couple 夫婦  (D) grandson 孫子。committee member 指委員會成員。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The national park guide warned every tourist and ______ to stay strictly on the marked walking trails for safety.","options":["nephew","niece","visitor","host"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: visitor (參觀者；遊客) 【全文中譯】國家公園導覽員告誡每位遊客和參觀者，為了自身安全必須嚴格走在標記步道上。 【選項解析】(A) nephew 姪子  (B) niece 姪女  (C) visitor 參觀者  (D) host 主人。national park tourist and visitor 指國家公園遊客。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The little ______ sat happily on her grandfather's lap while he read bedtime stories from a large illustrated book.","options":["grandson","granddaughter","host","couple"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: granddaughter (孫女) 【全文中譯】小孫女高興地坐在祖父的膝蓋上，聽他朗讀大圖畫書裡的睡前故事。 【選項解析】(A) grandson 孫子  (B) granddaughter 孫女  (C) host 主人  (D) couple 夫婦。sit on grandfather's lap 聽故事的小女孩為 granddaughter。"},{"number":22,"stem":"When Mr. Davis retired, his eldest ______ took over management of the family hardware store in the downtown district.","options":["granddaughter","grandson","niece","guest"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: grandson (孫子) 【全文中譯】戴維斯先生退休後，他年紀最大的長孫接管了市中心家族五金店的經營。 【選項解析】(A) granddaughter 孫女  (B) grandson 孫子  (C) niece 姪女  (D) guest 賓客。eldest grandson 指長孫。"},{"number":23,"stem":"My sister asked me to babysit my energetic little ______ while she went to the dentist for a tooth extraction.","options":["nephew","niece","couple","host"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: nephew (姪子；外甥) 【全文中譯】我姐姐請我在她去牙醫拔牙期間，幫忙照看我那活潑好動的小外甥。 【選項解析】(A) nephew 外甥  (B) niece 外甥女  (C) couple 夫婦  (D) host 主人。照顧姊姊的兒子即為 nephew。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The kind aunt taught her young ______ how to bake chocolate chip cookies and decorate frosted birthday cupcakes.","options":["nephew","niece","grandson","visitor"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: niece (姪女；外甥女) 【全文中譯】親切的姑姑教她年幼的姪女如何烘焙巧克力脆片餅乾，並裝飾糖霜生日杯子蛋糕。 【選項解析】(A) nephew 姪子  (B) niece 姪女  (C) grandson 孫子  (D) visitor 訪客。教導女性晚輩烘焙，選 niece。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Although we do not see each other often, my distant ______ always sends handwritten greeting cards during the holidays.","options":["couple","relative","host","member"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: relative (親戚) 【全文中譯】儘管我們不常碰面，但我遠方的親戚總是在節日期間寄來手寫的問候賀卡。 【選項解析】(A) couple 夫婦  (B) relative 親戚  (C) host 主人  (D) member 成員。distant relative 指遠親。"}]},{"unit":7,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 7 (007.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Holidays, Cultural Festivals & Celebrations | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"Double Tenth Day","pos":"(n.phr.)","definition":"the national day of the Republic of China (Taiwan) celebrated on October 10","chinese":"雙十節；國慶日","sentence":"Thousands of citizens gathered in front of the Presidential Office Building on ______ ______ ______ to watch the military parade and air show.","translation":"數千名市民在雙十節聚集在總統府前，觀看盛大的閱兵典禮與飛行特技表演。"},{"word":"Dragon Boat Festival","pos":"(n.phr.)","definition":"a traditional Chinese holiday when people race dragon boats and eat rice dumplings","chinese":"端午節","sentence":"Every summer during the ______ ______ ______, our family eats delicious sticky rice dumplings and watches exciting boat races on the river.","translation":"每年夏天的端午節期間，我們全家人都會吃美味的糯米粽子，並在河畔觀看精彩刺激的划龍舟比賽。"},{"word":"Easter","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a Christian festival celebrating the resurrection of Jesus, marked by decorated eggs","chinese":"復活節","sentence":"Children ran excitedly around the church lawn on ______ Sunday morning searching for colorful chocolate eggs hidden in the bushes.","translation":"在復活節週日早晨，孩子們興奮地在教堂草坪四周奔跑，尋找藏在灌木叢中的彩色巧克力蛋。"},{"word":"Halloween","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the night of October 31 when children wear costumes and go trick-or-treating","chinese":"萬聖節前夕","sentence":"Young kids dressed up as friendly ghosts and superheroes on ______, walking from house to house shouting 'trick or treat' for candy.","translation":"年幼的孩子們在萬聖節前夕裝扮成友好的鬼魂和超級英雄，挨家挨戶走著並大喊「不給糖就搗蛋」以討取糖果。"},{"word":"Lantern Festival","pos":"(n.phr.)","definition":"a Chinese festival celebrated on the 15th day of the first lunar month","chinese":"元宵節","sentence":"People across Taiwan solve tricky riddles and admire magnificent glowing light displays during the annual ______ ______ in February.","translation":"每年二月的元宵節期間，全台灣各地的人們都會猜有趣的燈謎，並欣賞壯麗璀璨的發光花燈展覽。"},{"word":"Mother's Day","pos":"(n.phr.)","definition":"a day honoring mothers, celebrated on the second Sunday of May","chinese":"母親節","sentence":"Kevin and his sister prepared breakfast in bed and bought pink carnations to celebrate ______ ______ with their loving mom.","translation":"凱文和他的妹妹準備了床上早餐並買了粉紅康乃馨，與他們深愛的母親一同慶祝母親節。"},{"word":"Teacher's Day","pos":"(n.phr.)","definition":"a day honoring teachers, celebrated in Taiwan on September 28","chinese":"教師節","sentence":"Students across Taiwan write heartfelt greeting cards and present flowers to thank their dedicated educators on ______ ______.","translation":"全台灣的學生都會在教師節這一天寫下由衷的感謝賀卡並奉上鮮花，向盡職盡責的教育工作者表達感謝。"},{"word":"Thanksgiving Day","pos":"(n.phr.)","definition":"a North American holiday of giving thanks, celebrated with a roast turkey dinner","chinese":"感恩節","sentence":"American families reunite around the dining table on ______ ______ to enjoy roast turkey, cranberry sauce, and sweet pumpkin pie.","translation":"美國家庭會在感恩節這一天團聚在餐桌旁，一同享用烤火雞、蔓越莓醬和香甜南瓜派。"},{"word":"Valentine's Day","pos":"(n.phr.)","definition":"February 14, celebrated by sending cards and gifts to sweethearts","chinese":"情人節","sentence":"Florists and chocolate shops are packed with excited customers buying romantic red roses and gift boxes on ______ ______.","translation":"在情人節這一天，花店和巧克力店擠滿了興奮的顧客，爭相購買浪漫的紅玫瑰與精緻禮物盒。"},{"word":"wedding","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a marriage ceremony, especially considered as including the associated celebrations","chinese":"婚禮；結婚典禮","sentence":"The bride looked breathtaking in her lace gown, and more than two hundred guests attended the outdoor church ______.","translation":"新娘穿著蕾絲禮服顯得光彩照人，超過兩百位賓客出席了這場戶外教堂婚禮。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Spectators cheered wildly as colorful watercraft competed along the river during the annual ______ ______ ______.","options":["Dragon Boat Festival","Double Tenth Day","Lantern Festival","Mother's Day"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Dragon Boat Festival (端午節) 【全文中譯】當色彩繽紛的船隻在一年一度的端午節沿河競渡時，觀眾們熱情地大聲歡呼。 【選項解析】(A) Dragon Boat Festival 端午節  (B) Double Tenth Day 雙十節  (C) Lantern Festival 元宵節  (D) Mother's Day 母親節。watercraft competing along river 為划龍舟。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Huge crowds gathered in the capital to witness the fighter jet flyover and fireworks marking ______ ______ ______.","options":["Lantern Festival","Double Tenth Day","Easter","Teacher's Day"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: Double Tenth Day (雙十節；國慶日) 【全文中譯】龐大人群聚集在首都，親眼見證慶祝雙十節的戰鬥機衝場與璀璨煙火表演。 【選項解析】(A) Lantern Festival 元宵節  (B) Double Tenth Day 雙十國慶  (C) Easter 復活節  (D) Teacher's Day 教師節。戰機衝場為雙十國慶特色。"},{"number":3,"stem":"On the second Sunday of May, restaurants across the city are fully booked as families celebrate ______ ______.","options":["Mother's Day","Valentine's Day","Easter","Halloween"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Mother's Day (母親節) 【全文中譯】在五月的第二個星期日，全市的餐館全部被訂滿，因為各個家庭都在慶祝母親節。 【選項解析】(A) Mother's Day 母親節  (B) Valentine's Day 情人節  (C) Easter 復活節  (D) Halloween 萬聖節。五月第二個星期日為 Mother's Day。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Children carry decorative battery-powered lights and eat sweet glutinous rice balls to celebrate the ______ ______.","options":["Dragon Boat Festival","Easter","Lantern Festival","Thanksgiving Day"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: Lantern Festival (元宵節) 【全文中譯】孩子們提著裝有電池的造型花燈並品嚐甜湯圓，以慶祝元宵節。 【選項解析】(A) Dragon Boat Festival 端午節  (B) Easter 復活節  (C) Lantern Festival 元宵節  (D) Thanksgiving Day 感恩節。提燈籠吃湯圓為元宵節習俗。"},{"number":5,"stem":"On October thirty-first, young kids dress up in spooky monster outfits to celebrate ______ with their classmates.","options":["Easter","Halloween","wedding","Mother's Day"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: Halloween (萬聖節前夕) 【全文中譯】十月三十一日這一天，年幼的小孩會穿上嚇人的怪物服裝，與同班同學一起慶祝萬聖節。 【選項解析】(A) Easter 復活節  (B) Halloween 萬聖節  (C) wedding 婚禮  (D) Mother's Day 母親節。十月三十一日穿戲服為 Halloween。"},{"number":6,"stem":"In Christian communities, children enjoy hunting for painted pastel eggs hidden in gardens on ______ morning.","options":["Halloween","Easter","wedding","Thanksgiving Day"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: Easter (復活節) 【全文中譯】在基督教社區裡，孩子們在復活節早晨開心地在花園裡尋找隱藏的彩繪粉彩蛋。 【選項解析】(A) Halloween 萬聖節  (B) Easter 復活節  (C) wedding 婚禮  (D) Thanksgiving Day 感恩節。尋找彩蛋為 Easter 代表活動。"},{"number":7,"stem":"On September twenty-eighth, school pupils present flower bouquets and thank-you notes to celebrate ______ ______.","options":["Mother's Day","Teacher's Day","Valentine's Day","Lantern Festival"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: Teacher's Day (教師節) 【全文中譯】九月二十八日這一天，小學生們獻上花束和感謝卡片，慶祝教師節。 【選項解析】(A) Mother's Day 母親節  (B) Teacher's Day 教師節  (C) Valentine's Day 情人節  (D) Lantern Festival 元宵節。九月二十八日為台灣的教師節。"},{"number":8,"stem":"In the United States, eating roast turkey and giving thanks for family blessings are the core customs of ______ ______.","options":["Thanksgiving Day","Double Tenth Day","Valentine's Day","Halloween"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Thanksgiving Day (感恩節) 【全文中譯】在美國，吃烤火雞並為家庭幸福獻上感恩，是感恩節的核心傳統習俗。 【選項解析】(A) Thanksgiving Day 感恩節  (B) Double Tenth Day 雙十節  (C) Valentine's Day 情人節  (D) Halloween 萬聖節。吃火雞謝恩為 Thanksgiving Day。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Red roses and heart-shaped chocolate boxes are the most popular romantic gifts exchanged on ______ ______.","options":["Teacher's Day","Mother's Day","Valentine's Day","Easter"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: Valentine's Day (情人節) 【全文中譯】紅玫瑰和心形巧克力禮盒，是在情人節互相贈送的最受歡迎浪漫禮物。 【選項解析】(A) Teacher's Day 教師節  (B) Mother's Day 母親節  (C) Valentine's Day 情人節  (D) Easter 復活節。心形巧克力和紅玫瑰代表 Valentine's Day。"},{"number":10,"stem":"The cathedral bells rang joyfully across the town square as the newlyweds stepped outside after their romantic ______.","options":["wedding","Halloween","Easter","Thanksgiving Day"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: wedding (婚禮；結婚典禮) 【全文中譯】當這對新人在浪漫的婚禮後步出大門時，大教堂的鐘聲在小鎮廣場上歡快響起。 【選項解析】(A) wedding 婚禮  (B) Halloween 萬聖節  (C) Easter 復活節  (D) Thanksgiving Day 感恩節。新婚夫妻步出教堂為 wedding。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Eating sticky bamboo-wrapped rice dumplings while watching competitive river rowing is typical of the ______ ______ ______.","options":["Lantern Festival","Dragon Boat Festival","Double Tenth Day","Teacher's Day"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: Dragon Boat Festival (端午節) 【全文中譯】吃竹葉包的糯米粽子並同時觀賞精彩的河上划船競賽，是端午節的典型特色。 【選項解析】(A) Lantern Festival 元宵節  (B) Dragon Boat Festival 端午節  (C) Double Tenth Day 雙十節  (D) Teacher's Day 教師節。包粽划船即為端午節。"},{"number":12,"stem":"High school marching bands and military guards delivered spectacular performances in front of the palace on ______ ______ ______.","options":["Double Tenth Day","Lantern Festival","Mother's Day","Valentine's Day"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Double Tenth Day (雙十國慶日) 【全文中譯】高中樂旗儀隊與三軍儀隊在雙十節這一天，於總統府前呈現了精彩絕倫的演出。 【選項解析】(A) Double Tenth Day 雙十節  (B) Lantern Festival 元宵節  (C) Mother's Day 母親節  (D) Valentine's Day 情人節。府前儀隊表演為雙十國慶活動。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Buying pink carnations and taking mom out for a gourmet dinner are traditional ways to honor ______ ______.","options":["Teacher's Day","Mother's Day","Easter","Halloween"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: Mother's Day (母親節) 【全文中譯】買粉紅色康乃馨並帶媽媽去享用精緻晚餐，是慶祝母親節的傳統方式。 【選項解析】(A) Teacher's Day 教師節  (B) Mother's Day 母親節  (C) Easter 復活節  (D) Halloween 萬聖節。康乃馨贈與母親代表 Mother's Day。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Tourists from around the world flock to Pingxi to release thousands of sky lanterns into the night sky for the ______ ______.","options":["Dragon Boat Festival","Lantern Festival","Thanksgiving Day","Double Tenth Day"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: Lantern Festival (元宵天燈節) 【全文中譯】來自世界各地的遊客湧入平溪，在元宵節將數千盞天燈釋放到夜空之中。 【選項解析】(A) Dragon Boat Festival 端午節  (B) Lantern Festival 元宵天燈節  (C) Thanksgiving Day 感恩節  (D) Double Tenth Day 雙十節。平溪放天燈在元宵節。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Little children carve grinning faces into orange pumpkins and place glowing candles inside to prepare for ______.","options":["Easter","Halloween","wedding","Mother's Day"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: Halloween (萬聖節) 【全文中譯】小孩子們在橘色南瓜上雕刻出露齒笑臉並在裡面放發光蠟燭，以迎接萬聖節的到來。 【選項解析】(A) Easter 復活節  (B) Halloween 萬聖節  (C) wedding 婚禮  (D) Mother's Day 母親節。雕刻南瓜燈為 Halloween 傳統。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Chocolate bunnies and colored hard-boiled eggs are traditional festive treats enjoyed by children during ______.","options":["Halloween","Easter","wedding","Double Tenth Day"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: Easter (復活節) 【全文中譯】巧克力兔子和彩繪水煮蛋，是孩子們在復活節期間享用的傳統應景美味點心。 【選項解析】(A) Halloween 萬聖節  (B) Easter 復活節  (C) wedding 婚禮  (D) Double Tenth Day 雙十節。巧克力兔為 Easter 象徵。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Our former high school classmates met yesterday to organize a special alumni banquet honoring our instructors on ______ ______.","options":["Mother's Day","Valentine's Day","Teacher's Day","Lantern Festival"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: Teacher's Day (教師節) 【全文中譯】我們以前的高中同學昨天聚會，籌備在教師節舉辦特別的校友宴會向老師們致敬。 【選項解析】(A) Mother's Day 母親節  (B) Valentine's Day 情人節  (C) Teacher's Day 教師節  (D) Lantern Festival 元宵節。向老師致敬的節日為 Teacher's Day。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Airports and train stations in North America experience their busiest travel traffic of the entire year right before ______ ______.","options":["Thanksgiving Day","Double Tenth Day","Valentine's Day","Dragon Boat Festival"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Thanksgiving Day (感恩節) 【全文中譯】北美各地的機場與火車站，在感恩節前夕都會迎來全年度最繁忙的返鄉交通人潮。 【選項解析】(A) Thanksgiving Day 感恩節  (B) Double Tenth Day 雙十節  (C) Valentine's Day 情人節  (D) Dragon Boat Festival 端午節。北美返鄉團聚最大節日為 Thanksgiving Day。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Couples book romantic rooftop dinners overlooking the city skyline months in advance to celebrate ______ ______ together.","options":["Teacher's Day","Valentine's Day","Mother's Day","Easter"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: Valentine's Day (情人節) 【全文中譯】情侶們提前數月預訂俯瞰城市天際線的浪漫屋頂晚餐，共同慶祝情人節。 【選項解析】(A) Teacher's Day 教師節  (B) Valentine's Day 情人節  (C) Mother's Day 母親節  (D) Easter 復活節。情侶共度浪漫晚餐為 Valentine's Day。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The groom felt nervous before walking down the aisle, but seeing his beautiful bride smiled warmly made the ______ unforgettable.","options":["Halloween","wedding","Easter","Thanksgiving Day"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: wedding (婚禮) 【全文中譯】新郎在步上紅毯前感到很緊張，但看到美麗的新娘溫柔微笑，讓這場婚禮令人難忘。 【選項解析】(A) Halloween 萬聖節  (B) wedding 婚禮  (C) Easter 復活節  (D) Thanksgiving Day 感恩節。新郎新娘步入禮堂為 wedding。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Smelling the aroma of steamed meat dumplings cooked in bamboo leaves always reminds grandfather of the ______ ______ ______.","options":["Dragon Boat Festival","Lantern Festival","Double Tenth Day","Easter"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Dragon Boat Festival (端午節) 【全文中譯】聞到竹葉包裹蒸熟肉粽的香氣，總是讓祖父回想起端午節的熱鬧景象。 【選項解析】(A) Dragon Boat Festival 端午節  (B) Lantern Festival 元宵節  (C) Double Tenth Day 雙十節  (D) Easter 復活節。竹葉肉粽為端午節應景食物。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Citizens waving red, blue, and white national flags gathered in Taipei City to commemorate the historical birth of the nation on ______ ______ ______.","options":["Double Tenth Day","Teacher's Day","Mother's Day","Thanksgiving Day"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Double Tenth Day (雙十國慶日) 【全文中譯】揮舞著紅、藍、白三色國旗的市民聚集在台北市，在雙十節慶祝國家的歷史誕生。 【選項解析】(A) Double Tenth Day 雙十節  (B) Teacher's Day 教師節  (C) Mother's Day 母親節  (D) Thanksgiving Day 感恩節。雙十國慶揮舞國旗。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The florist stayed up all night arranging hundreds of red rose bouquets for rushed young lovers on ______ ______.","options":["Valentine's Day","Teacher's Day","Mother's Day","Easter"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Valentine's Day (情人節) 【全文中譯】花店老闆徹夜未眠包裝數百束紅玫瑰，以應對在情人節急匆匆前來選購的年輕情侶。 【選項解析】(A) Valentine's Day 情人節  (B) Teacher's Day 教師節  (C) Mother's Day 母親節  (D) Easter 復活節。情人節搶購紅玫瑰。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Neighborhood streets were flooded with costumed children holding plastic pumpkin buckets and asking for candy on ______ evening.","options":["Halloween","Easter","wedding","Thanksgiving Day"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Halloween (萬聖節) 【全文中譯】萬聖節當晚，街坊鄰里間擠滿了穿著各式戲服、手提塑膠南瓜桶討糖果的孩童。 【選項解析】(A) Halloween 萬聖節  (B) Easter 復活節  (C) wedding 婚禮  (D) Thanksgiving Day 感恩節。提南瓜桶討糖為 Halloween。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Delicious cranberry sauce, mashed potatoes, and roasted turkey were served to all invited relatives on ______ ______.","options":["Thanksgiving Day","Double Tenth Day","Valentine's Day","Mother's Day"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Thanksgiving Day (感恩節) 【全文中譯】美味的蔓越莓醬、馬鈴薯泥和烤火雞，在感恩節盛宴上端出來招待所有受邀的親戚。 【選項解析】(A) Thanksgiving Day 感恩節  (B) Double Tenth Day 雙十節  (C) Valentine's Day 情人節  (D) Mother's Day 母親節。火雞大餐配蔓越莓醬為 Thanksgiving Day。"}]},{"unit":8,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 8 (008.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Vegetables, Grains & Common Produce | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"bean","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an edible seed or pod of certain plants, especially used for food","chinese":"豆莢；豆子","sentence":"Mom cooked a pot of hearty beef stew with green ______ and potatoes, so our whole family enjoyed a warm dinner.","translation":"媽媽用四季豆和馬鈴薯燉煮了一鍋熱氣騰騰的牛肉煲，所以我們全家人享受了一頓溫暖的晚餐。"},{"word":"cabbage","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a large round vegetable with thick green or purple leaves","chinese":"高麗菜；包心菜","sentence":"The chef chopped fresh green ______ finely to make crispy vegetable dumplings and spicy pickled side dishes.","translation":"主廚將新鮮翠綠的高麗菜切得碎碎的，以製作香脆蔬菜水餃與香辣醃漬小菜。"},{"word":"carrot","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a long, thin, orange vegetable that grows underground","chinese":"胡蘿蔔","sentence":"The little girl fed a sweet, crunchy ______ to the hungry white rabbit in the kindergarten pet corner.","translation":"小女孩在幼兒園的寵物角落，將一根香甜酥脆的胡蘿蔔餵給飢餓的白兔。"},{"word":"cereal","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a grain used for food, such as wheat or oats, often eaten with milk","chinese":"穀類食品；麥片","sentence":"Every morning before heading to school, Jason pours cold milk over a bowl of crunchy whole-grain ______.","translation":"每天早晨上學前，傑森都會將冰牛奶倒進一碗香脆的全穀麥片中。"},{"word":"corn","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a tall plant that produces yellow grains on large ears","chinese":"玉米","sentence":"Night market vendors grill sweet yellow ______ over charcoal and brush it with savory soy sauce for tourists.","translation":"夜市攤販在炭火上碳烤香甜的黃玉米，並為遊客刷上鹹香的醬油醬汁。"},{"word":"grape","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a small round green or purple fruit that grows in bunches","chinese":"葡萄","sentence":"The French farmer harvested thousands of ripe purple ______ from the vineyard to produce award-winning wine.","translation":"法國農夫從葡萄園裡採收了數千顆成熟的紫葡萄，以釀造屢獲殊榮的葡萄酒。"},{"word":"guava","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a tropical fruit with green skin, sweet pink or white flesh, and seeds","chinese":"芭樂；番石榴","sentence":"Taiwanese farmers grow delicious crisp ______ in Changhua, and locals love to sprinkle plum powder over sliced pieces.","translation":"台灣農民在彰化種植香脆可口的芭樂，當地人非常喜歡在切片上撒上甘梅粉食用。"},{"word":"lettuce","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a leafy green vegetable used especially in raw salads or burgers","chinese":"萵苣；生菜","sentence":"The waiter layered crisp green ______ and ripe red tomatoes between the toasted bread to make a club sandwich.","translation":"服務生在烘烤過的吐司之間夾入清脆綠萵苣與熟透紅番茄，製作了一份總匯三明治。"},{"word":"mango","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a tropical fruit with smooth yellow-red skin and sweet juicy yellow flesh","chinese":"芒果","sentence":"During hot summer afternoons, tourists line up outside dessert shops in Tainan to order shaved ice topped with fresh ______.","translation":"在炎熱的夏日午後，遊客們在台南的甜品店外排隊，點選鋪滿新鮮芒果的芒果刨冰。"},{"word":"onion","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a round vegetable with many layers that has a strong smell and taste","chinese":"洋蔥","sentence":"When Samuel chopped the pungent white ______ on the cutting board, his eyes watered so much that he had to wipe them.","translation":"當塞繆爾在砧板上切嗆辣的白洋蔥時，他的眼睛流淚不止，不得不頻頻擦拭。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The market vendor recommended buying fresh sweet ______ from Tainan to make refreshing fruit shaved ice.","options":["mango","onion","bean","cereal"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: mango (芒果) 【全文中譯】市場攤商推薦購買來自台南的新鮮香甜芒果，以製作令人暑氣全消的水果刨冰。 【選項解析】(A) mango 芒果  (B) onion 洋蔥  (C) bean 豆子  (D) cereal 麥片。台南知名特產水果刨冰配料為 mango。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Whenever Linda chops a raw white ______ in the kitchen, its pungent sulfur scent makes her eyes water heavily.","options":["grape","onion","guava","corn"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: onion (洋蔥) 【全文中譯】每當琳達在廚房切生白洋蔥時，其辛辣的氣味總是讓她眼淚流個不停。 【選項解析】(A) grape 葡萄  (B) onion 洋蔥  (C) guava 芭樂  (D) corn 玉米。切時讓人流淚的蔬菜為 onion。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The farmer showed the kindergarten children how to pull sweet orange ______ out of the loose black soil.","options":["cabbages","carrots","cereals","beans"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: carrots (胡蘿蔔) 【全文中譯】農夫向幼兒園的孩子們展示如何從鬆軟的黑土中拔出甜甜的橘色胡蘿蔔。 【選項解析】(A) cabbages 高麗菜  (B) carrots 胡蘿蔔  (C) cereals 穀物  (D) beans 豆類。橘色生長在泥土裡的為 carrots。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Slicing crisp green ______ and sprinkling sweet plum powder on top is a popular snack across night markets in Taiwan.","options":["guava","onion","cereal","carrot"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: guava (芭樂；番石榴) 【全文中譯】切片清脆的綠芭樂並撒上甘甜梅子粉，是台灣夜市廣受歡迎的休閒零嘴。 【選項解析】(A) guava 芭樂  (B) onion 洋蔥  (C) cereal 麥片  (D) carrot 胡蘿蔔。搭配梅子粉食用的清脆水果為 guava。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The fast food worker placed grilled beef patties, melted cheese, and crisp green ______ inside the toasted burger bun.","options":["bean","lettuce","grape","cereal"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: lettuce (萵苣；生菜) 【全文中譯】快餐店員工將烤牛肉餅、融化的起司與清脆綠生菜夾入烤過的漢堡麵包中。 【選項解析】(A) bean 豆子  (B) lettuce 生菜  (C) grape 葡萄  (D) cereal 麥片。漢堡內夾的清脆生菜為 lettuce。"},{"number":6,"stem":"In the vineyard, the owner showed visitors how bunches of ripe dark purple ______ are picked to make sweet juice.","options":["carrots","grapes","cabbages","onions"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: grapes (葡萄) 【全文中譯】在葡萄園裡，園主向遊客展示如何採摘成串成熟的深紫葡萄來製作甜果汁。 【選項解析】(A) carrots 胡蘿蔔  (B) grapes 葡萄  (C) cabbages 高麗菜  (D) onions 洋蔥。葡萄園（vineyard）生產的是 grapes。"},{"number":7,"stem":"Pouring warm milk over a bowl of honey-toasted ______ is Oliver's favorite quick breakfast before catching the morning train.","options":["cabbage","cereal","guava","lettuce"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: cereal (穀物麥片) 【全文中譯】將熱牛奶倒進一碗蜂蜜烤麥片中，是奧利佛趕早班火車前最喜歡的快速早餐。 【選項解析】(A) cabbage 高麗菜  (B) cereal 麥片  (C) guava 芭樂  (D) lettuce 萵苣。配牛奶吃的早餐穀物為 cereal。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The soup smelled wonderful because grandmother simmered pork ribs with sweet yellow ______ for over two hours.","options":["corn","grape","lettuce","mango"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: corn (玉米) 【全文中譯】這鍋湯聞起來棒極了，因為祖母將排骨與香甜黃玉米一起慢火燉煮了兩個多小時。 【選項解析】(A) corn 玉米  (B) grape 葡萄  (C) lettuce 生菜  (D) mango 芒果。煲排骨湯常見的黃色蔬菜為 corn。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The restaurant chef stir-fried shredded ______ with garlic and dried shrimp to serve as an authentic Taiwanese side dish.","options":["grape","cabbage","mango","cereal"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: cabbage (高麗菜) 【全文中譯】餐廳大廚用大蒜和蝦米熱炒切絲的高麗菜，作為一道道地的台灣家常菜。 【選項解析】(A) grape 葡萄  (B) cabbage 高麗菜  (C) mango 芒果  (D) cereal 麥片。炒蒜泥蝦米蔬菜為 cabbage。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Vegetarians often eat soy ______ and tofu to ensure they consume sufficient dietary protein every day.","options":["beans","onions","guavas","lettuces"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: beans (豆類) 【全文中譯】素食者常吃大豆和豆腐，以確保每天攝取足夠的膳食蛋白質。 【選項解析】(A) beans 豆類  (B) onions 洋蔥  (C) guavas 芭樂  (D) lettuces 萵苣。soy beans 指大豆/黃豆。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Juicy yellow slices of ripe ______ were served alongside vanilla ice cream as a special seasonal summer dessert.","options":["mango","cabbage","onion","carrot"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: mango (芒果) 【全文中譯】香甜多汁的熟黃芒果切片與香草冰淇淋一同端上桌，作為特別的季節性夏季甜點。 【選項解析】(A) mango 芒果  (B) cabbage 高麗菜  (C) onion 洋蔥  (D) carrot 胡蘿蔔。夏季黃色多汁水果為 mango。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Caramelizing sliced brown ______ in melted butter gives French soup its distinctive rich aroma and deep golden color.","options":["grapes","onions","cereals","guavas"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: onions (洋蔥) 【全文中譯】用融化奶油慢炒焦化切片棕洋蔥，賦予了法式洋蔥湯獨特的濃郁香氣與金黃色澤。 【選項解析】(A) grapes 葡萄  (B) onions 洋蔥  (C) cereals 麥片  (D) guavas 芭樂。法式濃湯的主角為 onions。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Rabbits and horses enjoy chewing on fresh crunchy orange ______ picked straight from the vegetable garden.","options":["beans","carrots","guavas","lettuces"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: carrots (胡蘿蔔) 【全文中譯】兔子和馬喜歡咀嚼直接從蔬菜園現拔出來的新鮮酥脆橘色胡蘿蔔。 【選項解析】(A) beans 豆子  (B) carrots 胡蘿蔔  (C) guavas 芭樂  (D) lettuces 生菜。兔子馬匹愛吃的橘色蔬菜為 carrots。"},{"number":14,"stem":"We bought a large basket of crispy white ______ at the farmers' market and shared it with our relatives during the picnic.","options":["cereal","guava","onion","carrot"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: guava (芭樂) 【全文中譯】我們在農夫市集買了一大籃香脆白肉芭樂，並在野餐時與親戚們一同分享。 【選項解析】(A) cereal 麥片  (B) guava 芭樂  (C) onion 洋蔥  (D) carrot 胡蘿蔔。crispy white guava 指香脆白肉芭樂。"},{"number":15,"stem":"To make a healthy Mediterranean salad, toss chopped green ______ with olive oil, lemon juice, and feta cheese.","options":["grape","lettuce","corn","cereal"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: lettuce (生菜；萵苣) 【全文中譯】製作健康的地中海沙拉時，將切碎的綠萵苣與橄欖油、檸檬汁及羊乳酪輕輕拌勻。 【選項解析】(A) grape 葡萄  (B) lettuce 生菜  (C) corn 玉米  (D) cereal 麥片。沙拉底層綠葉為 lettuce。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Wine makers in central Italy harvest tons of red ______ every September to produce world-class dry wines.","options":["grapes","cabbages","beans","onions"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: grapes (葡萄) 【全文中譯】義大利中部的釀酒業者每年九月採收數噸紅葡萄，以釀造世界頂級的乾紅葡萄酒。 【選項解析】(A) grapes 葡萄  (B) cabbages 高麗菜  (C) beans 豆類  (D) onions 洋蔥。釀造葡萄酒原料為 grapes。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Eating a nutritious whole-wheat ______ with sliced bananas gives young athletes steady energy throughout morning practice.","options":["guava","cereal","cabbage","lettuce"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: cereal (麥片食品) 【全文中譯】食用營養豐富的全麥麥片搭配香蕉切片，能為年輕運動員在晨練期間提供穩定的能量。 【選項解析】(A) guava 芭樂  (B) cereal 麥片  (C) cabbage 高麗菜  (D) lettuce 萵苣。全麥早點為 whole-wheat cereal。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Moviegoers love to buy large buckets of freshly popped ______ coated with melted butter and sugar before entering the theater.","options":["corn","carrot","guava","mango"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: corn (玉米；爆米花原料) 【全文中譯】進電影院前，影迷們最喜歡購買塗滿融化奶油和糖的大桶現爆爆米花。 【選項解析】(A) corn 玉米  (B) carrot 胡蘿蔔  (C) guava 芭樂  (D) mango 芒果。popped corn 即爆米花 popcorn。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Grandma chopped an entire head of green ______ to prepare traditional fermented kimchi for the upcoming winter season.","options":["grape","cabbage","cereal","mango"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: cabbage (甘藍；大白菜/高麗菜) 【全文中譯】祖母切了一整顆綠高麗菜，為即將到來的寒冷冬季醃製傳統發酵泡菜。 【選項解析】(A) grape 葡萄  (B) cabbage 高麗菜  (C) cereal 麥片  (D) mango 芒果。醃製泡菜常用 cabbage。"},{"number":20,"stem":"Green string ______ should be steamed gently with olive oil and seasoned with a pinch of sea salt.","options":["beans","guavas","onions","carrots"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: beans (四季豆；豆子) 【全文中譯】綠四季豆應該用橄欖油輕輕清蒸，並撒上一小撮海鹽簡單調味即可。 【選項解析】(A) beans 豆類  (B) guavas 芭樂  (C) onions 洋蔥  (D) carrots 胡蘿蔔。green string beans 指四季豆。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Tropical fruit markets in southern Taiwan sell fresh ______ smoothies that attract long queues of thirsty tourists.","options":["mango","onion","cabbage","cereal"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: mango (芒果) 【全文中譯】南台灣的水果熱門攤位販售現打新鮮芒果冰沙，吸引了口渴遊客排起長長隊伍。 【選項解析】(A) mango 芒果  (B) onion 洋蔥  (C) cabbage 高麗菜  (D) cereal 麥片。現打冰沙特產為 mango smoothies。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Sautéing finely minced ______ and garlic is the essential first step in preparing delicious Italian tomato pasta sauce.","options":["grape","onion","guava","corn"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: onion (洋蔥) 【全文中譯】爆炒切碎的洋蔥末與蒜末，是烹調美味義大利番茄肉醬麵不可或缺的第一步。 【選項解析】(A) grape 葡萄  (B) onion 洋蔥  (C) guava 芭樂  (D) corn 玉米。義大利紅醬基底為 minced onion。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Drinking freshly squeezed juice made from sweet ______ and apples is known to provide high amounts of vitamin A.","options":["cabbages","carrots","onions","beans"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: carrots (胡蘿蔔) 【全文中譯】飲用香甜胡蘿蔔與蘋果現榨的新鮮蔬果汁，以富含極高的維生素A而聞名。 【選項解析】(A) cabbages 高麗菜  (B) carrots 胡蘿蔔  (C) onions 洋蔥  (D) beans 豆類。富含維生素A的橘色果汁原料為 carrots。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Rich in vitamin C and dietary fiber, crisp local ______ is one of the healthiest fruits you can eat on a daily basis.","options":["cereal","guava","onion","cabbage"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: guava (芭樂) 【全文中譯】富含維生素C和膳食纖維的本土脆芭樂，是你可以天天食用的最健康水果之一。 【選項解析】(A) cereal 麥片  (B) guava 芭樂  (C) onion 洋蔥  (D) cabbage 高麗菜。維生素C極高的脆水果為 guava。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Fresh organic romaine ______ should be washed thoroughly under running water before being added to chicken wraps.","options":["bean","lettuce","grape","cereal"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: lettuce (生菜；萵苣) 【全文中譯】新鮮的有機蘿蔓生菜在包入雞肉捲之前，應該先放在流動清水下徹底清洗乾淨。 【選項解析】(A) bean 豆子  (B) lettuce 生菜  (C) grape 葡萄  (D) cereal 麥片。romaine lettuce 指蘿蔓生菜。"}]},{"unit":9,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 9 (009.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Fruits, Gourds & Dairy Condiments | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"papaya","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a tropical fruit with orange flesh and small black seeds","chinese":"木瓜","sentence":"The juice shop blenders were running nonstop as customers ordered thick, sweet ______ milk throughout the warm afternoon.","translation":"果汁店的果汁機運轉不停，因為整個溫暖午後顧客們不斷點選濃郁香甜的木瓜牛奶。"},{"word":"peach","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a soft round fruit with pink-yellow fuzzy skin and a large stone","chinese":"桃子；水蜜桃","sentence":"Lala Mountain in Taoyuan is famous for growing sweet, juicy ______ that tourists love to buy during summer.","translation":"桃園拉拉山以種植香甜多汁的水蜜桃聞名，遊客們非常喜歡在夏天購買品嚐。"},{"word":"pear","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a sweet fruit that is narrow near the stem and rounded at the bottom","chinese":"梨子","sentence":"Grandfather sliced a crisp, watery Asian ______ into pieces and shared it with the children after dinner.","translation":"晚飯後，祖父將一顆清脆多汁的亞洲水梨切成片，與孩子們一同分享。"},{"word":"pineapple","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a large tropical fruit with stiff leaves and sweet, yellow flesh","chinese":"鳳梨","sentence":"Tourists visiting Taiwan always buy several boxes of traditional ______ cakes to take home as souvenirs for friends.","translation":"造訪台灣的遊客總會買好幾盒傳統鳳梨酥帶回家，作為送給親友的伴手禮。"},{"word":"potato","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a round root vegetable with brown or yellow skin that grows underground","chinese":"馬鈴薯；洋芋","sentence":"The chef mashed boiled ______ with fresh butter and warm milk to serve beside the roasted beef.","translation":"大廚將煮熟的馬鈴薯與新鮮奶油及溫牛奶壓成泥，搭配烤牛肉端上桌。"},{"word":"pumpkin","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a large round orange vegetable often used for pies or soups","chinese":"南瓜","sentence":"During autumn festivals, farmers display giant orange ______ and bake creamy pies flavored with cinnamon and nutmeg.","translation":"秋季節日期間，農夫們展示巨大的橘色南瓜，並烘烤帶有肉桂與肉荳蔻風味的香濃南瓜派。"},{"word":"strawberry","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a small soft red fruit with tiny yellow seeds on its surface","chinese":"草莓","sentence":"Families enjoyed picking sweet red ______ in the scenic mountain farms of Dahu on a sunny winter morning.","translation":"在一個陽光明媚的冬日早晨，各個家庭在大湖風景秀麗的高山農場開心地採摘香甜紅草莓。"},{"word":"tangerine","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a small sweet citrus fruit with loose, easily peeled skin","chinese":"柑橘；小柑橘","sentence":"During Lunar New Year, people place bright orange ______ on tables because their shape symbolizes good luck and wealth.","translation":"農曆新年期間，人們會在桌上擺放鮮豔的橘子，因為其形狀與名稱象徵著吉祥與財富。"},{"word":"watermelon","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a large heavy fruit with thick green skin and sweet red flesh with seeds","chinese":"西瓜","sentence":"Nothing cools you down on a sweltering July afternoon like a huge, chilled slice of sweet red ______.","translation":"在七月酷熱的午後，沒有什麼比一大片冰涼香甜的紅肉西瓜更能讓人消暑解渴了。"},{"word":"cream","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the thick white liquid containing fat taken from milk","chinese":"鮮奶油；奶油","sentence":"The pastry baker topped the freshly baked chocolate tart with a swirl of fluffy whipped ______ and berries.","translation":"糕點師傅在剛出爐的巧克力塔上擠上一圈蓬鬆細緻的打發鮮奶油和新鮮莓果。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Fresh sweet ______ milk is one of the most famous and beloved night market beverages in Taiwan.","options":["papaya","potato","pumpkin","pear"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: papaya (木瓜) 【全文中譯】新鮮香甜的木瓜牛奶是台灣最著名且備受喜愛的夜市飲品之一。 【選項解析】(A) papaya 木瓜  (B) potato 馬鈴薯  (C) pumpkin 南瓜  (D) pear 梨子。papaya milk 為知名木瓜牛奶。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Slicing an enormous chilled ______ into thick wedges brought instant refreshment to all the players after soccer practice.","options":["watermelon","potato","cream","pear"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: watermelon (西瓜) 【全文中譯】在足球訓練結束後，將一顆巨大的冰鎮西瓜切成厚片，給所有球員帶來了即時的消暑清涼。 【選項解析】(A) watermelon 西瓜  (B) potato 馬鈴薯  (C) cream 奶油  (D) pear 水梨。消暑解渴的巨大水果為 watermelon。"},{"number":3,"stem":"During the winter picking season, thousands of travelers visit Dahu to gather sweet ripe red ______ in wicker baskets.","options":["pumpkins","potatoes","strawberries","creams"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: strawberries (草莓) 【全文中譯】在冬季採摘季節，數千名遊客造訪大湖，將成熟香甜的紅草莓裝入柳條籃中。 【選項解析】(A) pumpkins 南瓜  (B) potatoes 馬鈴薯  (C) strawberries 草莓  (D) creams 鮮奶油。大湖冬季採摘代表水果為 strawberries。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Slicing sweet juicy ______ from high mountain orchards is a luxurious treat during hot summer months.","options":["peaches","potatoes","creams","pumpkins"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: peaches (水蜜桃；桃子) 【全文中譯】在高山果園採摘香甜多汁的水蜜桃切片，是炎熱夏季裡的奢華享受。 【選項解析】(A) peaches 水蜜桃  (B) potatoes 馬鈴薯  (C) creams 奶油  (D) pumpkins 南瓜。high mountain orchards 出產甜美的 peaches。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Traditional bakeries in Taichung bake golden square cakes filled with sweet ______ paste that foreigners love.","options":["potato","pineapple","cream","watermelon"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pineapple (鳳梨) 【全文中譯】台中傳統糕餅店烘焙填入香甜鳳梨餡的金黃方形酥餅，深受外國人喜愛。 【選項解析】(A) potato 馬鈴薯  (B) pineapple 鳳梨  (C) cream 鮮奶油  (D) watermelon 西瓜。pineapple cakes 指鳳梨酥。"},{"number":6,"stem":"The chef boiled several large brown ______ until soft and mashed them with butter, garlic, and fresh cream.","options":["potatoes","papayas","watermelons","strawberries"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: potatoes (馬鈴薯) 【全文中譯】大廚將幾顆大褐皮馬鈴薯煮至軟爛，並加入奶油、蒜頭與新鮮鮮奶油一起壓成馬鈴薯泥。 【選項解析】(A) potatoes 馬鈴薯  (B) papayas 木瓜  (C) watermelons 西瓜  (D) peaches 桃子。壓泥做成薯泥的蔬菜為 potatoes。"},{"number":7,"stem":"On Thanksgiving Day, families across America bake fragrant spiced pies filled with creamy orange ______ puree.","options":["pear","pumpkin","potato","watermelon"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pumpkin (南瓜) 【全文中譯】在感恩節這一天，全美各個家庭都會烘烤填入綿密橘色南瓜泥的濃郁香料派。 【選項解析】(A) pear 水梨  (B) pumpkin 南瓜  (C) potato 馬鈴薯  (D) watermelon 西瓜。感恩節南瓜派使用 pumpkin puree。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The Asian variety of ______ has crisp, watery flesh and a delicate sweetness that tastes wonderful chilled.","options":["pear","potato","cream","watermelon"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pear (水梨；梨子) 【全文中譯】亞洲水梨肉質清脆多汁、甜度清雅，冰鎮後食用口感極佳。 【選項解析】(A) pear 水梨  (B) potato 馬鈴薯  (C) cream 鮮奶油  (D) watermelon 西瓜。Asian pear 指亞洲水梨。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Peeling the loose orange skin of a sweet juicy ______ is easy and does not require a knife.","options":["watermelon","tangerine","potato","cream"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: tangerine (柑橘；橘子) 【全文中譯】剝去香甜多汁小柑橘鬆軟的橘色外皮非常容易，完全不需要用到刀子。 【選項解析】(A) watermelon 西瓜  (B) tangerine 柑橘  (C) potato 馬鈴薯  (D) cream 奶油。外皮易剝的柑橘類為 tangerine。"},{"number":10,"stem":"The barista floated a rich spoonful of fresh dairy ______ on top of the dark roasted coffee.","options":["potato","cream","pumpkin","watermelon"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: cream (鮮奶油) 【全文中譯】咖啡師在深焙黑咖啡頂端，輕輕浮上一大匙濃郁新鮮的乳脂鮮奶油。 【選項解析】(A) potato 馬鈴薯  (B) cream 鮮奶油  (C) pumpkin 南瓜  (D) watermelon 西瓜。加在咖啡上的乳製品為 dairy cream。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Blending ripe orange ______ with ice and cold milk creates a thick, creamy smoothie favored by locals.","options":["papaya","potato","pumpkin","cream"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: papaya (木瓜) 【全文中譯】將成熟橘紅的木瓜與冰塊及冷牛奶一起攪打，能調製出深受當地人喜愛的濃郁奶昔冰沙。 【選項解析】(A) papaya 木瓜  (B) potato 馬鈴薯  (C) pumpkin 南瓜  (D) cream 奶油。打成橘色牛奶冰沙為 papaya。"},{"number":12,"stem":"In the heat of midsummer, beachgoers love cutting open a sweet green ______ and sharing the cold red slices.","options":["potato","watermelon","pear","pumpkin"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: watermelon (西瓜) 【全文中譯】在盛夏酷暑中，去海灘的人們最喜歡切開香甜的綠皮西瓜，分享冰涼的紅果肉切片。 【選項解析】(A) potato 馬鈴薯  (B) watermelon 西瓜  (C) pear 水梨  (D) pumpkin 南瓜。綠皮紅肉的水果為 watermelon。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Topping a slice of rich chocolate cake with fresh red ______ and powdered sugar makes an irresistible dessert.","options":["strawberries","potatoes","pumpkins","creams"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: strawberries (草莓) 【全文中譯】在一片濃郁巧克力蛋糕上點綴新鮮紅草莓並撒上糖粉，是令人難以抗拒的甜點。 【選項解析】(A) strawberries 草莓  (B) potatoes 馬鈴薯  (C) pumpkins 南瓜  (D) creams 奶油。搭配蛋糕的新鮮紅莓為 strawberries。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Farmers in Lala Mountain take extra care to protect tender white ______ from damaging wind and insects.","options":["peaches","potatoes","pumpkins","creams"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: peaches (水蜜桃) 【全文中譯】拉拉山的農民格外用心保護嬌嫩的白肉水蜜桃，使其免受強風與害蟲的傷害。 【選項解析】(A) peaches 水蜜桃  (B) potatoes 馬鈴薯  (C) pumpkins 南瓜  (D) creams 奶油。拉拉山嬌嫩特產為 white peaches。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Taiwan produces sweet golden ______ with spineless leaves that can be eaten fresh without burning the tongue.","options":["potato","pineapple","pear","pumpkin"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pineapple (鳳梨) 【全文中譯】台灣生產無刺葉片的香甜金黃鳳梨，現切生食也不會刮傷舌頭。 【選項解析】(A) potato 馬鈴薯  (B) pineapple 鳳梨  (C) pear 水梨  (D) pumpkin 南瓜。台灣金鑽金黃水果為 pineapple。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Crispy French fries are made by cutting fresh ______ into thin strips and frying them in bubbling hot oil.","options":["potatoes","papayas","watermelons","peaches"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: potatoes (馬鈴薯) 【全文中譯】香脆的炸薯條是將新鮮馬鈴薯切成細條，再放入滾燙熱油中油炸而成。 【選項解析】(A) potatoes 馬鈴薯  (B) papayas 木瓜  (C) watermelons 西瓜  (D) peaches 桃子。炸薯條（French fries）原料為 potatoes。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Carving spooky faces into hollowed-out orange ______ is an ancient folk custom celebrated every October.","options":["pumpkins","potatoes","pears","creams"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pumpkins (南瓜) 【全文中譯】在挖空的橘色大南瓜上雕刻搞怪的笑臉，是每年十月慶祝的古老民間習俗。 【選項解析】(A) pumpkins 南瓜  (B) potatoes 馬鈴薯  (C) pears 水梨  (D) creams 鮮奶油。萬聖節雕刻用的橘色瓜為 pumpkins。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Slicing a crisp green Asian ______ provides instant cool hydration during long afternoon hikes.","options":["pear","potato","cream","pumpkin"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pear (水梨) 【全文中譯】在漫長的午後徒步健行中，切一片清脆的綠色亞洲水梨能提供即時的清涼與水分。 【選項解析】(A) pear 水梨  (B) potato 馬鈴薯  (C) cream 奶油  (D) pumpkin 南瓜。水分飽滿的清脆水果為 pear。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Placing bowls of bright orange ______ on the altar during spring festivals is believed to invite good fortune.","options":["tangerines","potatoes","watermelons","creams"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: tangerines (柑橘；橘子) 【全文中譯】在春節祭拜神案上擺放幾碗鮮豔的橘子，被認為能夠招來吉祥與好運氣。 【選項解析】(A) tangerines 柑橘  (B) potatoes 馬鈴薯  (C) watermelons 西瓜  (D) creams 奶油。新年象徵吉利的水果為 tangerines。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The baker whisked heavy whipping ______ with vanilla extract and sugar until stiff peaks formed on the beaters.","options":["potato","cream","pumpkin","watermelon"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: cream (鮮奶油) 【全文中譯】烘焙師將濃鮮奶油與香草精和糖一起攪打，直到打蛋器上形成堅挺的鮮奶油花。 【選項解析】(A) potato 馬鈴薯  (B) cream 鮮奶油  (C) pumpkin 南瓜  (D) watermelon 西瓜。打發製作擠花的是 heavy whipping cream。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Tropical fruit stands display large green ______ on ice beside ripe yellow mangoes and fresh coconuts.","options":["papayas","potatoes","pumpkins","creams"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: papayas (木瓜) 【全文中譯】熱帶水果攤在冰塊上展示著大顆綠皮木瓜，旁邊擺著成熟的黃芒果與新鮮椰子。 【選項解析】(A) papayas 木瓜  (B) potatoes 馬鈴薯  (C) pumpkins 南瓜  (D) creams 奶油。大型熱帶水果為 papayas。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Because this sweet red ______ contains more than ninety percent water, it is the best fruit for quenching summer thirst.","options":["watermelon","potato","cream","pear"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: watermelon (西瓜) 【全文中譯】因為這種香甜的紅肉西瓜含水量超過百分之九十，所以是消解夏日乾渴的最佳水果。 【選項解析】(A) watermelon 西瓜  (B) potato 馬鈴薯  (C) cream 鮮奶油  (D) pear 水梨。含水量逾90%的消暑水果為 watermelon。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Children dipped freshly picked ripe ______ into bowls of melted chocolate at the farm workshop.","options":["strawberries","potatoes","pumpkins","creams"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: strawberries (草莓) 【全文中譯】孩子們在農場工坊裡，將剛採摘下來的成熟紅草莓浸入一碗碗融化的巧克力中。 【選項解析】(A) strawberries 草莓  (B) potatoes 馬鈴薯  (C) pumpkins 南瓜  (D) creams 奶油。沾巧克力的經典水果為 strawberries。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Sweet high-altitude mountain ______ are packed carefully in padded foam nets to prevent bruising during shipment.","options":["peaches","potatoes","pumpkins","creams"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: peaches (水蜜桃) 【全文中譯】香甜的高山水蜜桃被小心翼翼地包裝在厚厚的發泡網中，以防在運送過程中碰撞瘀傷。 【選項解析】(A) peaches 水蜜桃  (B) potatoes 馬鈴薯  (C) pumpkins 南瓜  (D) creams 奶油。高山脆弱的水果為 mountain peaches。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Adding chunks of fresh sweet ______ to savory sweet-and-sour pork gives the traditional dish a delightful citrus twist.","options":["pineapple","potato","pear","pumpkin"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pineapple (鳳梨) 【全文中譯】在美味的糖醋排骨中加入香甜的新鮮鳳梨塊，為這道傳統佳餚帶來令人愉悅的果香風味。 【選項解析】(A) pineapple 鳳梨  (B) potato 馬鈴薯  (C) pear 水梨  (D) pumpkin 南瓜。糖醋料理常見配料為 pineapple。"}]},{"unit":10,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 10 (010.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Baking, Staples & Traditional Dishes | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"bake","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to cook food such as bread, cakes, or pies in an oven","chinese":"烘烤；烘焙","sentence":"On Sunday mornings, grandma loves to ______ sweet cinnamon rolls in the oven until their aroma fills the entire house.","translation":"在星期天早晨，祖母喜歡在烤箱裡烘烤香甜肉桂捲，直到香氣瀰漫整座屋子。"},{"word":"bun","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a small round sweet bread roll, or bread containing meat/vegetables","chinese":"小麵包；小圓包","sentence":"The hungry student bought a warm steamed pork ______ from the convenience store and ate it quickly on the train.","translation":"飢餓的學生從便利商店買了一個熱騰騰的蒸肉包，並在火車上快速吃完。"},{"word":"dessert","pos":"(n.)","definition":"sweet food eaten at the end of a meal","chinese":"甜點；甜食","sentence":"After finishing our savory Italian pasta dinner, we ordered tiramisu and chocolate cake for ______.","translation":"在享用完美味的義大利麵晚餐後，我們點了提拉米蘇和巧克力蛋糕作為餐後甜點。"},{"word":"donut","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a small fried cake of sweetened dough, usually shaped like a ring","chinese":"甜甜圈","sentence":"Oliver bought a box of colorful glazed ______ with rainbow sprinkles to share with his colleagues at the office.","translation":"奧利佛買了一盒帶有彩虹糖碎的鮮豔糖霜甜甜圈，在辦公室與同事們一同分享。"},{"word":"dumpling","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a small piece of dough wrapped around minced meat or vegetables","chinese":"水餃；餃子","sentence":"During Chinese New Year celebrations, our entire family sits around the table wrapping hundreds of pork ______.","translation":"在農曆新年慶祝活動期間，我們全家人圍坐在桌旁包著數百顆香蔥豬肉水餃。"},{"word":"flour","pos":"(n.)","definition":"powder obtained by grinding grain, used to make bread, cakes, and pastry","chinese":"麵粉","sentence":"Before mixing the birthday cake batter, the baker sifted white wheat ______ through a fine metal sieve.","translation":"在攪拌生日蛋糕麵糊之前，烘焙師用細金屬篩網將白色小麥麵粉過篩。"},{"word":"loaf","pos":"(n.)","definition":"bread shaped and baked in one piece (plural: loaves)","chinese":"一條（麵包）","sentence":"Dad walked over to the neighborhood bakery and purchased a warm, freshly baked ______ of whole-wheat bread.","translation":"爸爸步行到附近的麵包店，購買了一條剛出爐溫熱的全麥土司麵包。"},{"word":"spaghetti","pos":"(n.)","definition":"pasta made in long, thin, solid strings, boiled and served with sauce","chinese":"義大利麵","sentence":"Mom cooked delicious homemade ______ topped with rich tomato beef sauce and sprinkled with parmesan cheese.","translation":"媽媽烹煮了美味的自製義大利細麵，淋上濃郁的番茄牛肉肉醬，並撒上帕瑪森起司粉。"},{"word":"toast","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"sliced bread made brown and crisp by heating; a drink to honor someone","chinese":"烤土司；吐司；祝酒","sentence":"For breakfast, Kevin usually spreads sweet strawberry jam over two slices of crunchy golden ______.","translation":"早餐時，凱文通常會在兩片香脆的金黃烤土司上抹上香甜的草莓果醬。"},{"word":"tofu","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a soft white food made from mashed soybeans, used in Asian cooking","chinese":"豆腐","sentence":"Taiwanese night markets are world-famous for serving deep-fried stinky ______ accompanied by sour pickled cabbage.","translation":"台灣夜市以供應油炸臭豆腐聞名全球，通常會搭配酸脆的醃漬泡菜一同享用。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Mom preheated the oven to two hundred degrees so she could ______ chocolate chip cookies for the party.","options":["bake","toast","recover","pray"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: bake (烘烤；烘焙) 【全文中譯】媽媽將烤箱預熱到兩百度，以便能為派對烘烤巧克力脆片餅乾。 【選項解析】(A) bake 烘烤  (B) toast 烤土司/祝酒  (C) recover 康復  (D) pray 祈禱。preheated the oven to bake cookies 為典型烘焙搭配。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Night market stalls in Taipei draw brave foreign tourists eager to sample crispy deep-fried stinky ______.","options":["donut","tofu","loaf","bun"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: tofu (豆腐) 【全文中譯】台北的夜市攤位吸引了許多勇敢的外國遊客，爭相品嚐香脆油炸的臭豆腐。 【選項解析】(A) donut 甜甜圈  (B) tofu 豆腐  (C) loaf 一條  (D) bun 包子。stinky tofu 指臭豆腐。"},{"number":3,"stem":"For a hearty breakfast, grandfather popped two thick slices of white bread into the electric toaster to make ______.","options":["dumpling","toast","dessert","spaghetti"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: toast (烤土司) 【全文中譯】為了享用豐盛的早餐，祖父把兩片厚白麵包放進電烤麵包機做成烤土司。 【選項解析】(A) dumpling 水餃  (B) toast 烤土司  (C) dessert 甜點  (D) spaghetti 義大利麵。放入烤麵包機烤出的為 toast。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Italian restaurants serve al dente ______ tossed with garlic, olive oil, fresh basil, and minced clams.","options":["flour","spaghetti","loaf","bun"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: spaghetti (義大利細麵) 【全文中譯】義大利餐廳供應拌入大蒜、橄欖油、新鮮羅勒和蛤蜊肉的彈牙義大利麵。 【選項解析】(A) flour 麵粉  (B) spaghetti 義大利麵  (C) loaf 一條  (D) bun 小麵包。義大利餐廳長條麵食為 spaghetti。"},{"number":5,"stem":"On New Year's Eve, the grandmother gathered her children around the kitchen counter to wrap savory pork ______.","options":["dumplings","desserts","loaves","toasts"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: dumplings (水餃；餃子) 【全文中譯】除夕夜這一天，祖母將孩子們召集在廚房料理台旁，一起包美味的豬肉水餃。 【選項解析】(A) dumplings 水餃  (B) desserts 甜點  (C) loaves 麵包條  (D) toasts 烤土司。wrap pork dumplings 指包豬肉水餃。"},{"number":6,"stem":"The artisan bakery sells fresh sourdough by the whole ______, and customers line up before opening hours.","options":["bun","donut","loaf","dessert"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: loaf (一條麵包) 【全文中譯】這家手工麵包坊按整條出售新鮮酸種麵包，顧客在營業前就已排成長龍。 【選項解析】(A) bun 小圓麵包  (B) donut 甜甜圈  (C) loaf 一條麵包  (D) dessert 甜點。sell by the whole loaf 指按整條販售。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The children cheered excitedly when dad brought home a pink box containing six chocolate-frosted ring ______.","options":["loaves","donuts","flours","tofus"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: donuts (甜甜圈) 【全文中譯】當爸爸帶回一個裝著六個巧克力糖霜環形甜甜圈的粉紅盒子時，孩子們興奮歡呼。 【選項解析】(A) loaves 麵包條  (B) donuts 甜甜圈  (C) flours 麵粉  (D) tofus 豆腐。ring donuts 指圓環甜甜圈。"},{"number":8,"stem":"To make smooth pancake batter, whisk eggs and milk gradually into a large ceramic bowl of white wheat ______.","options":["flour","toast","spaghetti","dessert"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: flour (麵粉) 【全文中譯】製作滑順的鬆餅麵糊時，將雞蛋和牛奶逐漸攪拌進裝滿白色小麥麵粉的大陶瓷碗中。 【選項解析】(A) flour 麵粉  (B) toast 吐司  (C) spaghetti 義大利麵  (D) dessert 甜點。調製麵糊的主要乾原料為 wheat flour。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The street vendor sells piping-hot steamed vegetable ______ filled with crunchy cabbage and mushrooms every morning.","options":["loaves","buns","desserts","toasts"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: buns (包子；小麵包) 【全文中譯】街頭攤販每天早晨販售熱氣騰騰的蒸蔬菜包子，裡面包滿了清脆的高麗菜與香菇。 【選項解析】(A) loaves 麵包條  (B) buns 包子  (C) desserts 甜點  (D) toasts 吐司。steamed vegetable buns 指蒸蔬菜包子。"},{"number":10,"stem":"After the lavish wedding banquet, guests enjoyed matcha ice cream and seasonal fruits served for ______.","options":["dessert","flour","loaf","dumpling"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: dessert (餐後甜點) 【全文中譯】在奢華的婚宴結束後，賓客們享用了作為餐後甜點端上桌的抹茶冰淇淋與時令水果。 【選項解析】(A) dessert 甜點  (B) flour 麵粉  (C) loaf 麵包條  (D) dumpling 水餃。餐後甜點為 dessert。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Every Christmas Eve, our mother loves to ______ festive gingerbread cookies shaped like stars and reindeer.","options":["bake","toast","wound","cough"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: bake (烘烤；烘焙) 【全文中譯】每年平安夜，我們的母親最喜歡烘烤形狀像星星和馴鹿的應景薑餅餅乾。 【選項解析】(A) bake 烘烤  (B) toast 祝酒/烤吐司  (C) wound 傷害  (D) cough 咳嗽。bake cookies 指烤餅乾。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Silken soft ______ simmered in spicy Sichuan chili oil is one of the most famous dishes in Chinese cuisine.","options":["donut","tofu","spaghetti","loaf"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: tofu (豆腐) 【全文中譯】在香辣四川辣油中慢煨的嫩豆腐，是中華料理中最著名的佳餚之一。 【選項解析】(A) donut 甜甜圈  (B) tofu 豆腐  (C) spaghetti 義大利麵  (D) loaf 麵包條。麻婆豆腐的主食材為 silken soft tofu。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Spreading creamy peanut butter over warm, crunchy slices of whole-wheat ______ is Samuel's favorite morning meal.","options":["dumpling","toast","dessert","flour"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: toast (烤土司) 【全文中譯】在溫暖酥脆的全麥烤土司切片上塗抹香濃花生醬，是塞繆爾最喜歡的早晨餐點。 【選項解析】(A) dumpling 水餃  (B) toast 烤土司  (C) dessert 甜點  (D) flour 麵粉。塗花生醬食用的為 crunchy toast。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The chef simmered tomato meat sauce for three hours before pouring it over a steaming plate of fresh ______.","options":["flour","spaghetti","loaf","bun"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: spaghetti (義大利麵) 【全文中譯】大廚將番茄肉醬燉煮了三個小時，然後淋在熱氣騰騰的新鮮義大利細麵盤上。 【選項解析】(A) flour 麵粉  (B) spaghetti 義大利麵  (C) loaf 麵包條  (D) bun 包子。淋肉醬的主食為 spaghetti。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Steamed soup ______ filled with rich hot broth and minced pork are world-renowned delicacies from Taiwan.","options":["dumplings","desserts","loaves","toasts"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: dumplings (小籠包；水餃) 【全文中譯】充滿濃郁熱湯汁與豬肉餡的清蒸小籠包，是享譽國際的台灣道地美食。 【選項解析】(A) dumplings 湯包/水餃  (B) desserts 甜點  (C) loaves 麵包條  (D) toasts 吐司。steamed soup dumplings 指小籠湯包。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Dad sliced a freshly baked ______ of rye bread into even pieces and spread butter across each slice.","options":["bun","donut","loaf","dessert"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: loaf (一條麵包) 【全文中譯】爸爸將剛出爐的一整條裸麥麵包切成均勻薄片，並在每片上面塗抹奶油。 【選項解析】(A) bun 小麵包  (B) donut 甜甜圈  (C) loaf 一條  (D) dessert 甜點。a loaf of rye bread 指一條黑麥麵包。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Police officers in American movies are frequently shown enjoying sweet glazed ring ______ with hot black coffee.","options":["loaves","donuts","tofus","flours"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: donuts (甜甜圈) 【全文中譯】在美國電影中，經常可以看到警察一邊享用熱黑咖啡，一邊品嚐甜糖霜環形甜甜圈。 【選項解析】(A) loaves 麵包條  (B) donuts 甜甜圈  (C) tofus 豆腐  (D) flours 麵粉。美劇警察經典食物為 glazed ring donuts。"},{"number":18,"stem":"You will need two cups of all-purpose ______ and three eggs to prepare the dough for homemade noodles.","options":["flour","toast","spaghetti","dessert"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: flour (麵粉) 【全文中譯】你需要兩杯中筋麵粉和三顆雞蛋，來為自製手工麵條揉製麵糰。 【選項解析】(A) flour 麵粉  (B) toast 吐司  (C) spaghetti 義大利麵  (D) dessert 甜點。all-purpose flour 指中筋麵粉。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Walking past the traditional breakfast shop, the aroma of freshly steamed pork ______ made my mouth water.","options":["loaves","buns","desserts","toasts"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: buns (包子；肉包) 【全文中譯】走過傳統早餐店，剛出爐蒸熟豬肉包子的誘人香氣讓我垂涎欲滴。 【選項解析】(A) loaves 麵包條  (B) buns 包子  (C) desserts 甜點  (D) toasts 吐司。steamed pork buns 指蒸肉包。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The restaurant offers a mouthwatering array of sweet chocolate brownies and berry tarts on its afternoon ______ menu.","options":["dessert","flour","loaf","dumpling"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: dessert (甜點) 【全文中譯】這家餐廳在下午茶甜點菜單上，提供了令人垂涎欲滴的香濃巧克力布朗尼與莓果塔。 【選項解析】(A) dessert 甜點  (B) flour 麵粉  (C) loaf 麵包條  (D) dumpling 水餃。afternoon dessert menu 指下午茶甜點菜單。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The kitchen smelled wonderful because aunt Catherine was learning how to ______ traditional French bread at home.","options":["bake","toast","tear","recover"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: bake (烘焙) 【全文中譯】廚房裡飄著撲鼻香氣，因為凱薩琳姑姑正在家學習如何烘焙傳統法式長棍麵包。 【選項解析】(A) bake 烘烤  (B) toast 烤土司  (C) tear 撕開  (D) recover 恢復。bake French bread 指烤法式麵包。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Healthy organic miso soup is traditionally garnished with tiny cubes of soft white ______ and green scallions.","options":["donut","tofu","loaf","bun"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: tofu (豆腐) 【全文中譯】健康的有機味噌湯傳統上會點綴切成微小方塊的柔軟白豆腐和翠綠蔥花。 【選項解析】(A) donut 甜甜圈  (B) tofu 豆腐  (C) loaf 麵包條  (D) bun 包子。味噌湯內的白色小方塊為 tofu。"},{"number":23,"stem":"When you make a hot sandwich, grilling the bread until it turns into golden crispy ______ improves the texture.","options":["dumpling","toast","dessert","spaghetti"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: toast (烤土司) 【全文中譯】製作熱三明治時，將麵包烘烤至金黃酥脆的烤土司能顯著提升整體的口感層次。 【選項解析】(A) dumpling 水餃  (B) toast 烤土司  (C) dessert 甜點  (D) spaghetti 義大利麵。grilled into crispy toast 指烤成脆土司。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Twirling long strings of delicious boiled ______ with a fork and spoon requires a little practice for beginners.","options":["flour","spaghetti","loaf","bun"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: spaghetti (義大利麵) 【全文中譯】用叉子和湯匙捲起長條煮熟的美味義大利細麵，對初學者來說需要一點練習。 【選項解析】(A) flour 麵粉  (B) spaghetti 義大利麵  (C) loaf 麵包條  (D) bun 包子。twirling long strings of spaghetti 指用叉子捲義大利麵。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Boil the frozen beef ______ in a large pot of water for seven minutes until they float to the surface.","options":["dumplings","desserts","loaves","toasts"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: dumplings (水餃) 【全文中譯】將冷凍牛肉水餃放入大鍋沸水中煮七分鐘，直到它們全部浮出水面即可撈起享用。 【選項解析】(A) dumplings 水餃  (B) desserts 甜點  (C) loaves 麵包條  (D) toasts 烤土司。boil frozen beef dumplings 指水煮冷凍牛肉水餃。"}]},{"unit":11,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 11 (011.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Beverages, Condiments & Seasonings | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"beer","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an alcoholic drink made from grain and hops","chinese":"啤酒","sentence":"My father worked hard in the garden all Saturday afternoon, so he drank a cold glass of ______ with dinner.","translation":"我父親星期六整個下午都在花園裡辛勞工作，所以他晚餐時喝了一杯冰涼的啤酒。"},{"word":"soda","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a sweet, cold carbonated soft drink","chinese":"汽水；碳酸飲料","sentence":"The children played soccer under the burning hot sun, and they bought two large cans of cold ______ at the convenience store.","translation":"孩子們在炎熱的烈日下踢足球，他們在便利商店買了兩大罐冰涼的汽水。"},{"word":"honey","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a sweet, sticky yellow liquid made by bees","chinese":"蜂蜜","sentence":"Grandmother had a dry cough during the cold winter night, so my mother made her warm lemon tea with natural ______.","translation":"祖母在寒冷的冬夜裡乾咳，所以我母親用天然蜂蜜為她泡了一杯溫熱的檸檬茶。"},{"word":"ketchup","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a thick red sauce made from tomatoes, vinegar, and sugar","chinese":"番茄醬","sentence":"The French fries tasted a little plain without seasoning, so David squeezed some tomato ______ on his plate to dip them.","translation":"炸薯條沒有調味料時味道有點淡，所以戴維在盤子裡擠了一些番茄醬來沾薯條。"},{"word":"pepper","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a sharp-tasting black or white powder made from dried berries","chinese":"胡椒粉","sentence":"The beef soup was very warm and rich, but my brother added a little black ______ to give it an extra spicy flavor.","translation":"牛肉湯非常溫暖濃郁，但我哥哥加了一點黑胡椒粉以增添額外的辛香風味。"},{"word":"soy sauce","pos":"(n.phr.)","definition":"a dark, salty liquid made from fermented soybeans","chinese":"醬油","sentence":"My aunt fried a large plate of pork dumplings for lunch, and we mixed some dark ______ with vinegar for dipping.","translation":"我姑姑午餐時煎了一大盤豬肉餃子，我們混合了一些深色醬油和醋當作沾醬。"},{"word":"sugar","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a sweet white substance obtained from plants","chinese":"糖","sentence":"The black coffee was too bitter for Mary to finish, so she added two small spoons of white ______ into the cup.","translation":"黑咖啡太苦了讓瑪麗喝不完，所以她在杯子裡加了兩小匙白糖。"},{"word":"vinegar","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a sour liquid made from fermented wine, cider, or rice","chinese":"醋","sentence":"The cook chopped some fresh cabbage and carrots finely, and he poured a spoonful of apple ______ over the salad.","translation":"廚師把新鮮的高麗菜和紅蘿蔔切得很細，並在沙拉上淋了一匙蘋果醋。"},{"word":"delicious","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"having a very pleasant and enjoyable taste or smell","chinese":"美味的；可口的","sentence":"Mrs. Lin baked an apple pie following her secret recipe, and everyone at the dinner table agreed that it was truly ______.","translation":"林太太依照她的私房食譜烤了一個蘋果派，餐桌上的每個人都一致認為它非常美味。"},{"word":"yummy","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"tasting very good (often used informally)","chinese":"好吃的；美味的（口語）","sentence":"The bakery on the corner sells chocolate muffins every morning, and the little girl said they were the most ______ treats she ever had.","translation":"轉角的麵包店每天早上都賣巧克力馬芬蛋糕，小女孩說那是她吃過最好吃的點心。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"After finishing a heavy plate of beef dumplings, uncle David ordered a cold bottle of ______ to relax with his colleagues.","options":["beer","pepper","ketchup","vinegar"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: beer (啤酒) 【全文中譯】吃完一大盤牛肉水餃後，戴維叔叔點了一瓶冰啤酒和同事一起放鬆。 【選項解析】(A) beer 啤酒  (B) pepper 胡椒  (C) ketchup 番茄醬  (D) vinegar 醋。beer 為酒類飲品，符合語境。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The dentist warned Tommy that drinking too much sweet ______ would cause serious tooth decay over time.","options":["sugar","soda","beer","pepper"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: soda (汽水) 【全文中譯】牙醫警告湯米，長久下來喝太多含糖汽水會導致嚴重的蛀牙。 【選項解析】(A) sugar 糖  (B) soda 汽水  (C) beer 啤酒  (D) pepper 胡椒。drinking... sweet soda 指飲用汽水飲料。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Whenever grandfather suffers from a sore throat in winter, he drinks a cup of warm water mixed with pure ______.","options":["ketchup","vinegar","honey","soda"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: honey (蜂蜜) 【全文中譯】每當祖父在冬天喉嚨痛時，他都會喝一杯混有純蜂蜜的溫開水。 【選項解析】(A) ketchup 番茄醬  (B) vinegar 醋  (C) honey 蜂蜜  (D) soda 汽水。溫水加蜂蜜潤喉為常見生活常識。"},{"number":4,"stem":"The waiter brought out a hot basket of French fries, and the kids immediately asked for a bottle of tomato ______.","options":["beer","honey","pepper","ketchup"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: ketchup (番茄醬) 【全文中譯】服務生端上一熱籃炸薯條，孩子們立刻要了一瓶番茄醬。 【選項解析】(A) beer 啤酒  (B) honey 蜂蜜  (C) pepper 胡椒  (D) ketchup 番茄醬。沾薯條必備 ketchup。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The vegetable soup tasted somewhat bland, so the chef sprinkled some ground black ______ into the pot.","options":["pepper","soda","beer","honey"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pepper (胡椒粉) 【全文中譯】蔬菜湯嚐起來有點清淡，所以主廚在鍋裡灑了一些黑胡椒粉。 【選項解析】(A) pepper 胡椒  (B) soda 汽水  (C) beer 啤酒  (D) honey 蜂蜜。sprinkled ground black pepper（撒上黑胡椒粉）。"},{"number":6,"stem":"In traditional Taiwanese kitchens, cooks frequently use dark ______ to braise pork and marinate chicken.","options":["soda","soy sauce","ketchup","beer"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: soy sauce (醬油) 【全文中譯】在傳統台灣廚房裡，廚師經常使用純黑醬油來滷肉和醃雞肉。 【選項解析】(A) soda 汽水  (B) soy sauce 醬油  (C) ketchup 番茄醬  (D) beer 啤酒。滷肉常用 soy sauce。"},{"number":7,"stem":"Drinking milk tea without any added ______ is healthier because it helps you control your daily calorie intake.","options":["beer","pepper","sugar","vinegar"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: sugar (糖) 【全文中譯】喝鮮奶茶時不加任何額外的糖比較健康，因為能幫你控制每日熱量。 【選項解析】(A) beer 啤酒  (B) pepper 胡椒  (C) sugar 糖  (D) vinegar 醋。without any added sugar 指無糖飲料。"},{"number":8,"stem":"To make the cabbage salad taste crisp and sour, mother poured two spoons of white ______ over the bowl.","options":["soda","ketchup","honey","vinegar"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: vinegar (醋) 【全文中譯】為了讓高麗菜沙拉嚐起來酸脆爽口，媽媽在碗裡淋了兩匙白醋。 【選項解析】(A) soda 汽水  (B) ketchup 番茄醬  (C) honey 蜂蜜  (D) vinegar 醋。酸味來源為 vinegar。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The birthday cake was decorated with fresh strawberries, and all the guests praised how ______ it was.","options":["delicious","pale","dumb","deaf"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: delicious (美味的) 【全文中譯】生日蛋糕以新鮮草莓裝飾，所有的賓客都盛讚它有多麼美味。 【選項解析】(A) delicious 美味的  (B) pale 蒼白的  (C) dumb 啞的  (D) deaf 聾的。修飾蛋糕美味選 delicious。"},{"number":10,"stem":"The young boy licked his fingers happily because the chocolate doughnut his mother baked was extremely ______.","options":["ill","yummy","dizzy","blind"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: yummy (好吃的) 【全文中譯】小男孩開心地舔著手指，因為媽媽烤的巧克力甜甜圈非常好吃。 【選項解析】(A) ill 生病的  (B) yummy 好吃的  (C) dizzy 頭暈的  (D) blind 盲的。兒童口語稱讚食物用 yummy。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Because father had to drive everyone home after the party, he drank fruit juice instead of alcoholic ______.","options":["vinegar","ketchup","beer","sugar"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: beer (啤酒) 【全文中譯】因為父親在派對結束後要開車載大家回家，所以他喝果汁而非含酒精的啤酒。 【選項解析】(A) vinegar 醋  (B) ketchup 番茄醬  (C) beer 啤酒  (D) sugar 糖。alcoholic beer（含酒精啤酒）。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The summer afternoon was boiling hot, so the hikers stopped at a vending machine to buy a chilled can of ______.","options":["pepper","soda","soy sauce","honey"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: soda (汽水) 【全文中譯】夏日午後酷熱難耐，登山客在自動販賣機停下腳步買了一罐冰涼的汽水。 【選項解析】(A) pepper 胡椒  (B) soda 汽水  (C) soy sauce 醬油  (D) honey 蜂蜜。chilled can of soda（罐裝冰汽水）。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Bears in the wild often search hollow tree trunks because they love to eat sweet natural ______.","options":["honey","beer","ketchup","vinegar"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: honey (蜂蜜) 【全文中譯】野外的熊經常搜尋空心樹幹，因為牠們喜愛食用香甜的天然蜂蜜。 【選項解析】(A) honey 蜂蜜  (B) beer 啤酒  (C) ketchup 番茄醬  (D) vinegar 醋。熊愛吃 honey 符合自然事實。"},{"number":14,"stem":"If you dip your hot dog into red ______ and mustard, it will taste much more flavorful.","options":["sugar","beer","soda","ketchup"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: ketchup (番茄醬) 【全文中譯】如果你把熱狗沾上紅色番茄醬和芥末醬，吃起來會更有風味。 【選項解析】(A) sugar 糖  (B) beer 啤酒  (C) soda 汽水  (D) ketchup 番茄醬。熱狗搭配 red ketchup。"},{"number":15,"stem":"When cooking scrambled eggs in the morning, a tiny pinch of salt and black ______ makes a big difference.","options":["beer","pepper","honey","soda"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pepper (胡椒粉) 【全文中譯】早晨煎炒蛋時，加入微量鹽巴與黑胡椒粉會帶來極大風味提升。 【選項解析】(A) beer 啤酒  (B) pepper 胡椒  (C) honey 蜂蜜  (D) soda 汽水。salt and black pepper（鹽與黑胡椒）。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Steamed fish will taste fresh and savory if you pour a spoonful of seasoned ______ over it before serving.","options":["soy sauce","ketchup","beer","honey"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: soy sauce (醬油) 【全文中譯】如果在端上桌前淋上一匙調味醬油，清蒸魚嚐起來會鮮甜可口。 【選項解析】(A) soy sauce 醬油  (B) ketchup 番茄醬  (C) beer 啤酒  (D) honey 蜂蜜。清蒸魚搭配 soy sauce。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Eating too many desserts that contain refined white ______ can lead to health problems like obesity.","options":["beer","vinegar","sugar","pepper"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: sugar (糖) 【全文中譯】吃太多含有精緻白糖的甜點，可能會導致如肥胖等健康問題。 【選項解析】(A) beer 啤酒  (B) vinegar 醋  (C) sugar 糖  (D) pepper 胡椒。refined white sugar（精製白糖）。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Pickled cucumbers require a mixture of water, salt, and rice ______ to develop their characteristic sour taste.","options":["ketchup","honey","soda","vinegar"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: vinegar (醋) 【全文中譯】醃黃瓜需要水、鹽巴和米醋的混合液，以產生其招牌的酸味。 【選項解析】(A) ketchup 番茄醬  (B) honey 蜂蜜  (C) soda 汽水  (D) vinegar 醋。醃製酸物必備 rice vinegar。"},{"number":19,"stem":"My grandmother cooked a pot of chicken soup with ginseng, and the whole family agreed that it was exceptionally ______.","options":["delicious","deaf","homesick","painful"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: delicious (美味的) 【全文中譯】我的祖母煮了一鍋人蔘雞湯，全家人都一致認為它格外美味。 【選項解析】(A) delicious 美味的  (B) deaf 聾的  (C) homesick 想家的  (D) painful 疼痛的。形容雞湯鮮美用 delicious。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The children cheered excitedly when aunt May arrived with a box of ______ fruit tarts from the downtown bakery.","options":["dizzy","yummy","pale","ill"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: yummy (好吃的) 【全文中譯】當梅姑姑帶著一盒從市中心麵包店買來的好吃水果塔抵達時，孩子們興奮歡呼。 【選項解析】(A) dizzy 頭暈的  (B) yummy 好吃的  (C) pale 蒼白的  (D) ill 生病的。修飾 fruit tarts 選 yummy。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The restaurant refused to sell cold draft ______ to teenagers because the legal drinking age is strictly eighteen.","options":["pepper","honey","beer","vinegar"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: beer (啤酒) 【全文中譯】這家餐廳拒絕向青少年販售冰生啤酒，因為法定飲酒年齡嚴格定為十八歲。 【選項解析】(A) pepper 胡椒  (B) honey 蜂蜜  (C) beer 啤酒  (D) vinegar 醋。draft beer（生啤酒）。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Avoid leaving an open can of carbonated ______ on the desk, or it will lose all its bubbles and taste flat.","options":["beer","soda","sugar","pepper"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: soda (汽水) 【全文中譯】避免在書桌上放置開罐的碳酸汽水，否則它會流失氣泡且喝起來平淡無味。 【選項解析】(A) beer 啤酒  (B) soda 汽水  (C) sugar 糖  (D) pepper 胡椒。carbonated soda 指碳酸汽水。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Bees fly from flower to flower gathering nectar, which they carry back to their hive to produce golden ______.","options":["honey","ketchup","vinegar","soda"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: honey (蜂蜜) 【全文中譯】蜜蜂穿梭在花朵間採集花蜜，並將其帶回蜂巢製造金黃色蜂蜜。 【選項解析】(A) honey 蜂蜜  (B) ketchup 番茄醬  (C) vinegar 醋  (D) soda 汽水。蜜蜂產物為 golden honey。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The toddler accidentally dropped his burger on the floor, and bright red ______ stained his yellow shirt.","options":["soda","pepper","beer","ketchup"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: ketchup (番茄醬) 【全文中譯】幼兒不小心把漢堡掉在地板上，鮮紅色的番茄醬沾污了他的黃色襯衫。 【選項解析】(A) soda 汽水  (B) pepper 胡椒  (C) beer 啤酒  (D) ketchup 番茄醬。漢堡內的醬料是 red ketchup。"},{"number":25,"stem":"People often place a salt shaker and a black ______ grinder on the dining table for guests to season their food.","options":["pepper","sugar","honey","beer"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pepper (胡椒粉) 【全文中譯】人們常在餐桌上放置鹽罐和黑胡椒研磨罐，供賓客為食物調味。 【選項解析】(A) pepper 胡椒  (B) sugar 糖  (C) honey 蜂蜜  (D) beer 啤酒。black pepper grinder（黑胡椒研磨罐）。"}]},{"unit":12,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 12 (012.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Dining Out, Kitchen Utensils & Cooking | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"brunch","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a meal eaten late in the morning that combines breakfast and lunch","chinese":"早午餐","sentence":"On Sunday mornings, our family likes to sleep late and go to a cozy cafe for ______.","translation":"在星期天早晨，我們全家喜歡睡到自然醒，然後去一家溫馨的咖啡館享用早午餐。"},{"word":"cafeteria","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a restaurant where customers collect food on trays and pay at a register","chinese":"自助餐廳；學校/公司員工餐廳","sentence":"High school students lined up with their plastic trays in the school ______ to buy hot noodles.","translation":"高中生們端著塑膠托盤在學校員工餐廳（自助餐廳）排隊購買熱麵。"},{"word":"buffet","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a meal where people serve themselves from a table of different dishes","chinese":"歐式自助餐；吃到飽餐飲","sentence":"The luxury hotel offered an amazing seafood ______ with fresh crabs, prawns, and grilled fish.","translation":"這家豪華飯店提供了令人驚嘆的海鮮自助餐，備有新鮮螃蟹、明蝦與烤魚。"},{"word":"pan","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a wide, shallow metal container used for frying or cooking food","chinese":"平底鍋","sentence":"Mother heated some olive oil in the frying ______ before adding the diced garlic and onions.","translation":"母親在平底鍋裡加熱了一些橄欖油，然後加入切碎的大蒜與洋蔥。"},{"word":"plate","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a flat, usually round dish from which food is eaten","chinese":"盤子","sentence":"The waiter carried a large white ceramic ______ with grilled steak and roasted vegetables.","translation":"服務生端著一個裝有烤牛排和烤蔬菜的白色大陶瓷盤子。"},{"word":"pot","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a deep round container used for cooking stews, soups, or boiling water","chinese":"深鍋；湯鍋","sentence":"Father placed a heavy metal ______ of vegetable soup on the kitchen counter to cool.","translation":"父親將一重金屬蔬菜湯鍋放在廚房流理台上使其冷卻。"},{"word":"saucer","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a small, shallow curved dish placed under a teacup","chinese":"茶碟；茶托","sentence":"The graceful lady picked up the delicate teacup and rested it gently on its matching ______.","translation":"那位優雅的女士端起精緻的茶杯，並將它輕輕放在配套的茶碟上。"},{"word":"teapot","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a container with a handle and spout used for making and serving tea","chinese":"茶壺","sentence":"Grandpa poured steaming oolong tea from the purple clay ______ into our tiny porcelain cups.","translation":"爺爺從紫砂茶壺中倒出熱氣騰騰的烏龍茶到我們的細瓷小杯子裡。"},{"word":"wok","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a large, bowl-shaped pan used especially in Chinese cooking","chinese":"炒鍋；中華炒鍋","sentence":"The experienced chef stirred the sliced beef rapidly inside the hot iron ______ over high heat.","translation":"經驗豐富的主廚在大火上的熱鐵炒鍋內迅速翻炒牛肉片。"},{"word":"boil (boil / boiled / boiled)","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to heat a liquid until bubbles rise to the surface","chinese":"煮沸；水滾","sentence":"You should let the clean water ______ completely before using it to prepare baby formula.","translation":"你在用乾淨的水沖泡嬰兒奶粉之前，應該讓水完全煮沸。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Sleeping late on weekends is pleasant, so Susan often meets her college friends at 11 a.m. for ______.","options":["brunch","plate","saucer","wok"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: brunch (早午餐) 【全文中譯】週末睡晚很享受，所以蘇珊常在上午11點和大學朋友相約吃早午餐。 【選項解析】(A) brunch 早午餐  (B) plate 盤子  (C) saucer 茶碟  (D) wok 炒鍋。上午11點結合早餐與午餐為 brunch。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Every day at noon, hundreds of factory workers eat their lunch together in the company ______.","options":["pan","cafeteria","teapot","pot"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: cafeteria (員工/學生餐廳) 【全文中譯】每天中午，數百名工廠作業員在公司自助餐廳一起吃午餐。 【選項解析】(A) pan 平底鍋  (B) cafeteria 員工/學生餐廳  (C) teapot 茶壺  (D) pot 鍋子。員工集體用餐場所為 cafeteria。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Because this restaurant serves an all-you-can-eat ______, customers can choose whatever dishes they prefer.","options":["plate","saucer","buffet","wok"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: buffet (自助餐) 【全文中譯】因為這家餐廳提供吃到飽自助餐，顧客可以自由挑選喜歡的菜餚。 【選項解析】(A) plate 盤子  (B) saucer 茶碟  (C) buffet 自助餐  (D) wok 炒鍋。all-you-can-eat buffet（吃到飽自助餐）。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Dad heated some butter in the flat frying ______ and cooked delicious sunny-side-up eggs for everyone.","options":["saucer","brunch","teapot","pan"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: pan (平底鍋) 【全文中譯】爸爸在平底煎鍋中加熱了一些奶油，為大家煎了美味的太陽蛋。 【選項解析】(A) saucer 茶碟  (B) brunch 早午餐  (C) teapot 茶壺  (D) pan 平底鍋。frying pan 為平底煎鍋。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The waiter accidentally dropped the porcelain ______ on the floor, and it broke into three sharp pieces.","options":["plate","cafeteria","brunch","buffet"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: plate (盤子) 【全文中譯】服務生不小心把瓷盤掉在地板上，碎成了三塊鋒利的碎片。 【選項解析】(A) plate 盤子  (B) cafeteria 餐廳  (C) brunch 早午餐  (D) buffet 自助餐。porcelain plate（瓷盤）。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Grandmother cooked a fragrant beef stew inside a large stainless steel ______ for over three hours.","options":["saucer","pot","plate","buffet"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pot (湯鍋；深鍋) 【全文中譯】祖母在大不鏽鋼湯鍋中燉煮香濃的燉牛肉超過三個小時。 【選項解析】(A) saucer 茶碟  (B) pot 湯鍋  (C) plate 盤子  (D) buffet 自助餐。燉湯用深鍋 pot。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The tea spilled slightly over the rim of the cup, but luckily it fell onto the ceramic ______ underneath.","options":["wok","cafeteria","saucer","pan"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: saucer (茶碟) 【全文中譯】茶水從杯緣稍微溢出，但幸好落在了下方的陶瓷茶碟上。 【選項解析】(A) wok 炒鍋  (B) cafeteria 餐廳  (C) saucer 茶碟  (D) pan 平底鍋。茶杯下方的托盤為 saucer。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Mother filled the ceramic ______ with dried green tea leaves and poured boiling spring water into it.","options":["teapot","plate","pan","buffet"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: teapot (茶壺) 【全文中譯】媽媽將乾燥綠茶葉放進陶瓷茶壺中，並倒入沸騰的泉水。 【選項解析】(A) teapot 茶壺  (B) plate 盤子  (C) pan 平底鍋  (D) buffet 自助餐。泡茶容器為 teapot。"},{"number":9,"stem":"In traditional Chinese cuisine, fried rice tastes much better when tossed skillfully inside a round iron ______.","options":["saucer","cafeteria","brunch","wok"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: wok (炒鍋) 【全文中譯】在傳統中式料理中，炒飯在圓形鐵炒鍋中熟練翻炒會更美味。 【選項解析】(A) saucer 茶碟  (B) cafeteria 餐廳  (C) brunch 早午餐  (D) wok 中式炒鍋。中式熱鍋翻炒為 iron wok。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Before dropping the dry noodles into the soup, make sure the seasoned broth begins to ______.","options":["skin","boil","tear","cough"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: boil (煮沸) 【全文中譯】在將乾麵條放入湯裡之前，確保調味過的高湯已經開始沸騰。 【選項解析】(A) skin 擦破皮  (B) boil 煮沸  (C) tear 撕開  (D) cough 咳嗽。高湯沸騰用 boil。"},{"number":11,"stem":"We were not hungry at 8 a.m., so we decided to skip breakfast and enjoy a relaxing weekend ______.","options":["plate","saucer","brunch","pan"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: brunch (早午餐) 【全文中譯】我們早上八點還不餓，所以決定省略早餐，享受放鬆的週末早午餐。 【選項解析】(A) plate 盤子  (B) saucer 茶碟  (C) brunch 早午餐  (D) pan 平底鍋。跳過早餐直接吃 brunch。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Students can buy sandwiches, fruit, and bottled milk at reasonable prices inside the university ______.","options":["wok","cafeteria","teapot","pot"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: cafeteria (學校餐廳) 【全文中譯】學生可以在大學學生餐廳內以合理價格買到三明治、水果與瓶裝牛奶。 【選項解析】(A) wok 炒鍋  (B) cafeteria 學校餐廳  (C) teapot 茶壺  (D) pot 鍋子。大學校園餐廳用 university cafeteria。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The wedding reception featured an enormous international ______ with dishes from Japan, Italy, and France.","options":["buffet","plate","saucer","pan"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: buffet (自助餐) 【全文中譯】這場婚宴備有盛大的國際自助餐，供應來自日本、義大利與法國的菜餚。 【選項解析】(A) buffet 自助餐  (B) plate 盤子  (C) saucer 茶碟  (D) pan 平底鍋。international buffet（國際自助餐）。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Be careful not to touch the hot handle of the frying ______ with your bare hand while cooking.","options":["brunch","saucer","plate","pan"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: pan (平底鍋) 【全文中譯】烹飪時請小心不要用徒手去碰平底煎鍋發燙的手把。 【選項解析】(A) brunch 早午餐  (B) saucer 茶碟  (C) plate 盤子  (D) pan 平底鍋。frying pan handle（平底鍋手把）。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Uncle George piled grilled chicken and sweet corn onto his ceramic ______ during the backyard party.","options":["plate","teapot","wok","saucer"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: plate (盤子) 【全文中譯】後院派對期間，喬治叔叔在他的瓷盤上堆滿了烤雞與甜玉米。 【選項解析】(A) plate 盤子  (B) teapot 茶壺  (C) wok 炒鍋  (D) saucer 茶碟。盛裝食物於 plate 上。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Put the dirty soup ______ into the kitchen sink and soak it in warm soapy water for an hour.","options":["brunch","pot","buffet","saucer"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pot (深鍋) 【全文中譯】把油膩的湯鍋放進廚房水槽，浸泡在溫肥皂水裡一小時。 【選項解析】(A) brunch 早午餐  (B) pot 湯鍋  (C) buffet 自助餐  (D) saucer 茶碟。soup pot（湯鍋）。"},{"number":17,"stem":"A small decorative spoon was placed neatly beside the coffee cup on top of the small ______.","options":["wok","plate","saucer","pan"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: saucer (茶碟) 【全文中譯】一把小裝飾匙整齊地擺放在咖啡杯旁的小茶碟上。 【選項解析】(A) wok 炒鍋  (B) plate 盤子  (C) saucer 茶碟  (D) pan 平底鍋。杯子下方的碟子為 saucer。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The tourist bought a beautiful antique purple clay ______ as a souvenir during his trip to Yingge.","options":["plate","teapot","cafeteria","buffet"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: teapot (茶壺) 【全文中譯】這位觀光客在鶯歌之旅中買了一件漂亮的仿古紫砂茶壺作為紀念品。 【選項解析】(A) plate 盤子  (B) teapot 茶壺  (C) cafeteria 餐廳  (D) buffet 自助餐。purple clay teapot（紫砂茶壺）。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Street food vendors in the night market stir-fry fresh vegetables vigorously using a very hot ______.","options":["saucer","brunch","teapot","wok"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: wok (炒鍋) 【全文中譯】夜市街頭攤販使用高溫的中華炒鍋奮力翻炒新鮮蔬菜。 【選項解析】(A) saucer 茶碟  (B) brunch 早午餐  (C) teapot 茶壺  (D) wok 炒鍋。熱鍋熱炒用 hot wok。"},{"number":20,"stem":"You must ______ the fresh chicken eggs in hot water for six minutes to make soft-boiled yolks.","options":["boil","pray","praise","quit"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: boil (煮沸；水煮) 【全文中譯】你必須把新鮮雞蛋放在熱水中煮六分鐘，才能做出半熟蛋黃。 【選項解析】(A) boil 煮沸  (B) pray 祈禱  (C) praise 讚揚  (D) quit 放棄。水煮蛋用 boil。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Many trendy restaurants in Taipei are crowded on Sunday mornings because young people love meeting for ______.","options":["wok","plate","brunch","saucer"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: brunch (早午餐) 【全文中譯】台北很多時髦餐廳在週日早晨客滿，因為年輕人喜歡相約吃早午餐。 【選項解析】(A) wok 炒鍋  (B) plate 盤子  (C) brunch 早午餐  (D) saucer 茶碟。Sunday morning brunch（週日早午餐）。"},{"number":22,"stem":"During the lunch break, hospital nurses and doctors usually gather to eat nutritious meals in the staff ______.","options":["pan","cafeteria","teapot","saucer"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: cafeteria (員工餐廳) 【全文中譯】午休時間，醫院的護理師和醫師通常聚集在員工餐廳享用營養餐點。 【選項解析】(A) pan 平底鍋  (B) cafeteria 員工餐廳  (C) teapot 茶壺  (D) saucer 茶碟。staff cafeteria（員工餐廳）。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Eating at a hotel dinner ______ allows guests to sample twenty different desserts in one evening.","options":["buffet","pot","wok","plate"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: buffet (自助餐) 【全文中譯】在飯店享用自助晚餐讓賓客能在一個晚上品嚐二十種不同甜點。 【選項解析】(A) buffet 自助餐  (B) pot 鍋子  (C) wok 炒鍋  (D) plate 盤子。hotel dinner buffet（飯店自助晚餐）。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Use a wooden spatula when cooking fish in a non-stick ______ so that you do not scratch the surface.","options":["brunch","saucer","teapot","pan"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: pan (平底鍋) 【全文中譯】在不沾平底鍋裡煎魚時請使用木鏟，這樣才不會刮傷鍋面。 【選項解析】(A) brunch 早午餐  (B) saucer 茶碟  (C) teapot 茶壺  (D) pan 平底鍋。non-stick pan（不沾平底鍋）。"},{"number":25,"stem":"When the kettle whistle sounds, it indicates that the clean water inside has reached a vigorous ______.","options":["boil","hire","serve","cough"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: boil (煮沸；沸騰狀態) 【全文中譯】當水壺鳴笛聲響起時，代表裡面的水已經達到劇烈沸騰狀態。 【選項解析】(A) boil 沸騰  (B) hire 僱用  (C) serve 服務  (D) cough 咳嗽。reached a vigorous boil（達到劇烈沸騰）。"}]},{"unit":13,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 13 (013.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Clothing, Formal Attire & Accessories | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"blouse","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a woman's shirt or upper garment","chinese":"女性襯衫；罩衫","sentence":"Helen wore a lightweight silk ______ with dark blue trousers to her job interview yesterday morning.","translation":"海倫昨天早上穿著一件輕盈的絲質女性襯衫搭配深藍色長褲去參加求職面試。"},{"word":"pajamas","pos":"(n.)","definition":"soft loose clothing worn in bed","chinese":"睡衣褲","sentence":"The little boy brushed his teeth, put on his warm cotton ______, and climbed into bed with a storybook.","translation":"小男孩刷了牙，穿上他溫暖的純棉睡衣褲，拿著故事書爬上了床。"},{"word":"suit","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a jacket and matching trousers or skirt; to fit well","chinese":"套裝；西裝；適合","sentence":"Mr. Anderson bought an elegant black ______ for the annual corporate dinner, and it fit him perfectly.","translation":"安德森先生為年度公司晚宴買了一套優雅的黑色西裝，而且穿在他身上非常合身。"},{"word":"trousers","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a piece of clothing covering the body from waist to ankle on each leg","chinese":"長褲","sentence":"My brother spilled tomato soup on his khaki ______, so he had to wash them before going to class.","translation":"我哥哥把番茄湯灑在他的卡其長褲上，所以他去上課前必須先把褲子洗乾淨。"},{"word":"T-shirt","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a simple short-sleeved cotton casual shirt with no collar","chinese":"短袖圓領汗衫；T恤","sentence":"During the humid summer months, teenagers prefer wearing a loose white ______ with casual shorts.","translation":"在潮濕的夏季月份裡，青少年更喜歡穿著寬鬆的白色T恤搭配休閒短褲。"},{"word":"underwear","pos":"(n.)","definition":"clothes worn under other clothes next to the skin","chinese":"內衣褲","sentence":"Packing clean socks and ______ is essential whenever you plan a three-day hiking trip in the mountains.","translation":"每當你計畫去山裡進行為期三天的健行旅行時，打包乾淨的襪子和內衣褲是必不可少的。"},{"word":"vest","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a sleeveless upper garment worn over a shirt","chinese":"背心","sentence":"The police officer wore a bulletproof ______ under his uniform to protect himself while on night patrol.","translation":"警官在制服底下穿了一件防彈背心，以便在夜間巡邏時保護自己。"},{"word":"scarf","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a length of fabric worn around the neck for warmth or style","chinese":"圍巾","sentence":"Cold northern winds blew across the city streets, so Jessica wrapped a wool ______ securely around her neck.","translation":"冰冷的北風吹過城市街道，所以潔西卡把一條羊毛圍巾緊緊圍在脖子上。"},{"word":"tie (tie / tied / tied)","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a narrow strip of material worn around the neck; to bind","chinese":"領帶；繫；綁","sentence":"The young salesman learned how to fasten his silk ______ neatly before meeting important clients.","translation":"這位年輕業務員在拜訪重要客戶之前，學會了如何把他的絲質領帶繫得整整齊齊。"},{"word":"necklace","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an ornamental chain or string of beads worn around the neck","chinese":"項鍊","sentence":"On their twentieth wedding anniversary, my father surprised my mother with an expensive pearl ______.","translation":"在他們結婚二十週年紀念日，我父親送給我母親一條昂貴的珍珠項鍊作為驚喜。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"For the formal business presentation, Emily wore a professional white silk ______ paired with a dark pencil skirt.","options":["blouse","pajamas","trousers","underwear"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: blouse (女性襯衫) 【全文中譯】為了正式的商務簡報，艾蜜莉穿著專業的白色絲質女襯衫搭配深色窄裙。 【選項解析】(A) blouse 女襯衫  (B) pajamas 睡衣  (C) trousers 長褲  (D) underwear 內衣。女性正式上衣用 blouse。"},{"number":2,"stem":"After taking a warm shower before bed, little Leo put on his striped cotton ______ and fell asleep quickly.","options":["blouse","pajamas","necklace","tie"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pajamas (睡衣褲) 【全文中譯】睡前沖完溫水澡後，小里歐穿上條紋純棉睡衣褲並很快進入夢鄉。 【選項解析】(A) blouse 女襯衫  (B) pajamas 睡衣  (C) necklace 項鍊  (D) tie 領帶。睡前穿著 pajamas。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The bank manager arrived at the international conference dressed in a well-tailored navy blue ______.","options":["blouse","pajamas","suit","scarf"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: suit (西裝；套裝) 【全文中譯】銀行經理穿著一套剪裁得體的海軍藍西裝抵達國際研討會現場。 【選項解析】(A) blouse 女襯衫  (B) pajamas 睡衣  (C) suit 西裝  (D) scarf 圍巾。商務正式西裝用 suit。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Jason accidentally ripped a hole in his school ______ when climbing over the rusty iron playground fence.","options":["blouse","suit","tie","trousers"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: trousers (長褲) 【全文中譯】傑森在翻越操場生鏽的鐵圍欄時，不小心把學校長褲勾破了一個洞。 【選項解析】(A) blouse 女襯衫  (B) suit 套裝  (C) tie 領帶  (D) trousers 長褲。爬圍欄易撕破 trousers。"},{"number":5,"stem":"On hot July afternoons, college students enjoy wearing a light cotton ______ while walking around campus.","options":["T-shirt","necklace","suit","tie"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: T-shirt (T恤) 【全文中譯】在炎熱的七月午後，大學生們在校園漫步時喜歡穿著輕便的棉質T恤。 【選項解析】(A) T-shirt T恤  (B) necklace 項鍊  (C) suit 西裝  (D) tie 領帶。夏季休閒短袖為 T-shirt。"},{"number":6,"stem":"For reasons of personal hygiene, doctors recommend changing your daily ______ every single morning.","options":["scarf","underwear","necklace","suit"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: underwear (內衣褲) 【全文中譯】基於個人衛生考量，醫生建議每天早晨更換乾淨的貼身內衣褲。 【選項解析】(A) scarf 圍巾  (B) underwear 內衣褲  (C) necklace 項鍊  (D) suit 西裝。個人衛生更換 underwear。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The construction worker wore a bright yellow safety ______ so that passing drivers could easily see him.","options":["necklace","pajamas","vest","blouse"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: vest (背心) 【全文中譯】建築工人穿著一件亮黃色的安全背心，讓過往車輛司機能輕易看見他。 【選項解析】(A) necklace 項鍊  (B) pajamas 睡衣  (C) vest 背心  (D) blouse 女襯衫。safety vest 為安全背心。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Because the winter wind was freezing, grandma knitted a thick wool ______ to keep her neck warm.","options":["blouse","suit","trousers","scarf"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: scarf (圍巾) 【全文中譯】因為冬天的風冷冽刺骨，祖母織了一條厚羊毛圍巾來為脖子保暖。 【選項解析】(A) blouse 女襯衫  (B) suit 西裝  (C) trousers 長褲  (D) scarf 圍巾。脖子保暖必備 wool scarf。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Men are usually required to wear a dark jacket and a matching silk ______ at formal diplomacy banquets.","options":["tie","pajamas","underwear","blouse"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: tie (領帶) 【全文中譯】在正式的外交宴會上，男士通常被要求穿著深色外套並繫上相襯的絲質領帶。 【選項解析】(A) tie 領帶  (B) pajamas 睡衣  (C) underwear 內衣  (D) blouse 女襯衫。搭配西裝外套繫 tie。"},{"number":10,"stem":"The museum exhibition featured an ancient gold ______ decorated with emeralds and shiny diamonds.","options":["trousers","necklace","T-shirt","vest"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: necklace (項鍊) 【全文中譯】博物館展覽展出了一條以祖母綠和閃亮鑽石點綴的古老金項鍊。 【選項解析】(A) trousers 長褲  (B) necklace 項鍊  (C) T-shirt T恤  (D) vest 背心。頸部首飾為 necklace。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Mother bought a lovely pink floral ______ to wear to my sister's graduation ceremony next weekend.","options":["pajamas","trousers","blouse","underwear"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: blouse (女襯衫) 【全文中譯】媽媽買了一件優雅的粉紅碎花女性襯衫，準備下週末參加我姊姊的畢業典禮時穿。 【選項解析】(A) pajamas 睡衣  (B) trousers 長褲  (C) blouse 女襯衫  (D) underwear 內衣。粉紅碎花女襯衫為 blouse。"},{"number":12,"stem":"It is inappropriate to walk into a luxury hotel lobby wearing your bedroom slippers and ______.","options":["blouse","suit","necklace","pajamas"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: pajamas (睡衣) 【全文中譯】穿著臥室拖鞋和睡衣走進豪華飯店大廳是相當不合適的舉動。 【選項解析】(A) blouse 女襯衫  (B) suit 西裝  (C) necklace 項鍊  (D) pajamas 睡衣。居家睡衣用 pajamas。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The groom looked very handsome in his custom-made wedding ______ as he waited for his bride.","options":["suit","pajamas","blouse","scarf"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: suit (西裝) 【全文中譯】新郎穿著他的量身訂製結婚西裝，在等待新娘時看起來非常英挺帥氣。 【選項解析】(A) suit 西裝  (B) pajamas 睡衣  (C) blouse 女襯衫  (D) scarf 圍巾。新郎穿著 wedding suit。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Mr. White sent his wrinkled wool ______ to the dry cleaner so they would look neat for the interview.","options":["blouse","trousers","tie","necklace"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: trousers (長褲) 【全文中譯】懷特先生將起皺的羊毛長褲送到乾洗店，以便在面試時看起來端莊筆挺。 【選項解析】(A) blouse 女襯衫  (B) trousers 長褲  (C) tie 領帶  (D) necklace 項鍊。長褲為 trousers。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Peter bought a black rock band ______ at the concert and wore it proudly to school the following Monday.","options":["necklace","scarf","T-shirt","suit"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: T-shirt (T恤) 【全文中譯】彼得在演唱會上買了一件黑色搖滾樂團T恤，並在下週一驕傲地穿去學校。 【選項解析】(A) necklace 項鍊  (B) scarf 圍巾  (C) T-shirt T恤  (D) suit 西裝。樂團紀念衫通常為 band T-shirt。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Travelers should always pack three extra sets of clean ______ when embarking on an overseas flight.","options":["blouse","necklace","tie","underwear"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: underwear (內衣褲) 【全文中譯】搭機前往海外旅行時，旅客應隨時額外打包三套乾淨的換洗貼身內衣褲。 【選項解析】(A) blouse 女襯衫  (B) necklace 項鍊  (C) tie 領帶  (D) underwear 內衣褲。出國備用內衣褲為 underwear。"},{"number":17,"stem":"In autumn, grandfather likes to wear a knitted wool ______ over his shirt to keep his chest comfortable.","options":["vest","pajamas","blouse","necklace"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: vest (背心) 【全文中譯】在秋天，祖父喜歡在襯衫外穿一件針織羊毛背心以保持胸部溫暖舒適。 【選項解析】(A) vest 背心  (B) pajamas 睡衣  (C) blouse 女襯衫  (D) necklace 項鍊。套在襯衫外的無袖衣物為 vest。"},{"number":18,"stem":"During the snowy evening walk, Sophia pulled her red cashmere ______ higher over her mouth and nose.","options":["blouse","scarf","suit","trousers"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: scarf (圍巾) 【全文中譯】在下雪的夜晚散步時，索菲亞將紅色羊絨圍巾拉高遮住口鼻以避寒。 【選項解析】(A) blouse 女襯衫  (B) scarf 圍巾  (C) suit 西裝  (D) trousers 長褲。圍在頸部防寒為 cashmere scarf。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Can you teach me how to ______ a proper knot on this school necktie before the morning assembly starts?","options":["boil","skin","tie","tear"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: tie (繫；打結) 【全文中譯】在朝會開始之前，你能教我如何在這條學校領帶上打出漂亮的結嗎？ 【選項解析】(A) boil 煮沸  (B) skin 擦破皮  (C) tie 繫/打結  (D) tear 撕破。tie a knot（打結）。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The thief snatched the diamond ______ from the lady's neck and disappeared quickly into the crowded alley.","options":["trousers","pajamas","blouse","necklace"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: necklace (項鍊) 【全文中譯】小偷從那位女士的脖子上扯下鑽石項鍊，迅速消失在擁擠的巷弄中。 【選項解析】(A) trousers 長褲  (B) pajamas 睡衣  (C) blouse 女襯衫  (D) necklace 項鍊。戴在脖子上的珠寶是 necklace。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The saleslady showed Mrs. Davis an elegant silk ______ with delicate lace around the round collar.","options":["blouse","trousers","pajamas","underwear"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: blouse (女襯衫) 【全文中譯】女店員向戴維斯太太展示了一件圓領帶有精美蕾絲的優雅絲質女襯衫。 【選項解析】(A) blouse 女襯衫  (B) trousers 長褲  (C) pajamas 睡衣  (D) underwear 內衣。圓領女襯衫用 blouse。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Cozy flannel ______ are especially popular among children during freezing December nights.","options":["suits","pajamas","scarves","necklaces"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pajamas (睡衣) 【全文中譯】舒適的法蘭絨睡衣在寒冷的十二月夜晚特別受到孩子們的歡迎。 【選項解析】(A) suits 西裝  (B) pajamas 睡衣  (C) scarves 圍巾  (D) necklaces 項鍊。flannel pajamas（法蘭絨睡衣）。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Lawyers usually wear a sharp formal ______ in court to present a respectable and serious appearance.","options":["blouse","pajamas","suit","necklace"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: suit (西裝) 【全文中譯】律師通常在法庭穿著筆挺的正式西裝，以展現莊重嚴肅的專業形象。 【選項解析】(A) blouse 女襯衫  (B) pajamas 睡衣  (C) suit 西裝  (D) necklace 項鍊。法庭正式西裝為 sharp formal suit。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Because these blue denim ______ are too long, mother offered to shorten the cuffs on her sewing machine.","options":["blouses","ties","scarves","trousers"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: trousers (長褲) 【全文中譯】因為這條藍色牛仔長褲太長了，母親主動提出要用裁縫機幫忙改短褲管。 【選項解析】(A) blouses 女襯衫  (B) ties 領帶  (C) scarves 圍巾  (D) trousers 長褲。牛仔長褲為 denim trousers。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Tom bought a simple white ______ and used fabric markers to draw his own cartoon design on the front.","options":["T-shirt","suit","necklace","tie"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: T-shirt (T恤) 【全文中譯】湯姆買了一件純白T恤，並用布料彩繪筆在正面畫上了他自己的卡通設計。 【選項解析】(A) T-shirt T恤  (B) suit 西裝  (C) necklace 項鍊  (D) tie 領帶。白色素T為 white T-shirt。"}]},{"unit":14,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 14 (014.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Footwear, Personal Accessories & Precious Metals | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"slippers","pos":"(n.)","definition":"comfortable loose soft shoes worn indoors","chinese":"室內拖鞋","sentence":"When guests enter our home, mother kindly offers them a clean pair of cotton ______ to wear.","translation":"當客人走進我們家時，母親會親切地提供他們一雙乾淨的室內純棉拖鞋穿著。"},{"word":"sneakers","pos":"(n.)","definition":"soft sports shoes suitable for casual wear and athletics","chinese":"運動鞋；球鞋","sentence":"Mark laced up his lightweight running ______ before heading down to the school athletic track.","translation":"馬克在前往學校田徑場之前，繫緊了他輕便慢跑運動鞋的鞋帶。"},{"word":"socks","pos":"(n.)","definition":"soft knitted coverings for the feet worn inside shoes","chinese":"短襪","sentence":"You should wear thick cotton ______ when hiking in the mountains to prevent blisters on your feet.","translation":"在山區健行時，你應該穿著厚棉短襪以防止腳上起水泡。"},{"word":"handkerchief","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a small square piece of cloth used for wiping the nose or face","chinese":"手帕","sentence":"The gentle old man took a clean white ______ from his pocket and wiped the tears from his eyes.","translation":"那位溫和的老先生從口袋裡拿出一條乾淨的白色手帕，擦乾了他眼中的淚水。"},{"word":"purse","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a small bag used especially by women for holding coins, money, and makeup","chinese":"女用手提包；小錢包","sentence":"While riding the crowded subway train, Brenda kept a firm grip on her leather ______.","translation":"在搭乘擁擠的地鐵列車時，布蘭達緊緊抓著她的皮質女用手提包。"},{"word":"wallet","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a flat folding pocketbook used especially by men for holding paper money and cards","chinese":"皮夾；短夾","sentence":"After paying for the groceries at the counter, dad put his credit card back into his brown leather ______.","translation":"在櫃檯付完雜貨費用後，爸爸把信用卡放回他棕色的皮革短夾裡。"},{"word":"diamond","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an extremely hard, precious clear gemstone made of pure carbon","chinese":"鑽石","sentence":"The romantic gentleman knelt down in the restaurant and offered his girlfriend a sparkling ______ ring.","translation":"那位浪漫的紳士在餐廳裡單膝跪地，向他的女友獻上一枚閃閃發光的鑽石戒指。"},{"word":"gold","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a valuable soft yellow metallic element used for coins and jewelry","chinese":"黃金","sentence":"During periods of financial crisis, many investors prefer buying physical ______ to protect their wealth.","translation":"在金融危機時期，許多投資人更喜歡購買實體黃金來保護他們的財富。"},{"word":"golden","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"made of gold or having a bright yellow, shining color","chinese":"金黃色的；金色的","sentence":"The autumn afternoon sun cast a warm ______ glow over the ripening wheat fields across the valley.","translation":"秋日午後的陽光在整個山谷成熟的麥田上灑下了溫暖的金黃色光芒。"},{"word":"silver","pos":"(n.) / (adj.)","definition":"a shiny white metallic element used for coins, ornaments, and utensils","chinese":"銀；白銀；銀製的","sentence":"The royal banquet table was laid out with delicate porcelain dishes and polished antique ______ spoons.","translation":"皇家宴會桌上擺滿了精緻的瓷器餐具與擦得發亮的仿古銀製湯匙。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Japanese tradition requires visitors to take off their outdoor shoes and slip into indoor ______ at the entryway.","options":["slippers","handkerchief","purse","wallet"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: slippers (室內拖鞋) 【全文中譯】日本傳統要求訪客在玄關脫下室外鞋，並換上室內拖鞋。 【選項解析】(A) slippers 拖鞋  (B) handkerchief 手帕  (C) purse 女用包  (D) wallet 短夾。玄關換穿 indoor slippers。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Because we plan to play basketball on the outdoor asphalt court, you must wear good athletic ______.","options":["purse","sneakers","wallet","diamond"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: sneakers (運動鞋) 【全文中譯】因為我們打算在戶外柏油球場打籃球，你必須穿著優質的運動鞋。 【選項解析】(A) purse 女用包  (B) sneakers 運動鞋  (C) wallet 短夾  (D) diamond 鑽石。打籃球穿 athletic sneakers。"},{"number":3,"stem":"On freezing winter mornings, little Jenny wears two pairs of warm woolen ______ inside her heavy boots.","options":["slippers","purse","socks","wallet"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: socks (短襪) 【全文中譯】在寒冬早晨，小珍妮在厚重的靴子裡穿了兩雙保暖的羊毛襪。 【選項解析】(A) slippers 拖鞋  (B) purse 女用包  (C) socks 襪子  (D) wallet 短夾。靴子內穿 woolen socks。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Grandfather sneezed loudly during the church sermon, but he quickly covered his nose with a linen ______.","options":["diamond","wallet","purse","handkerchief"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: handkerchief (手帕) 【全文中譯】祖父在教堂講道時大聲打了噴嚏，但他很快用亞麻手帕遮住了鼻子。 【選項解析】(A) diamond 鑽石  (B) wallet 短夾  (C) purse 女用包  (D) handkerchief 手帕。打噴嚏遮掩用 handkerchief。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The lady realized with horror that she had accidentally left her designer leather ______ on the bus seat.","options":["purse","sneakers","socks","slippers"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: purse (手提包) 【全文中譯】這位女士驚恐地發現，她不小心把名牌皮革手提包遺留在公車座位上了。 【選項解析】(A) purse 女用手提包  (B) sneakers 運動鞋  (C) socks 襪子  (D) slippers 拖鞋。遺忘在公車上的隨身包為 purse。"},{"number":6,"stem":"When the young man opened his leather ______ to pay the taxi driver, he found only two coins left inside.","options":["handkerchief","wallet","sneakers","socks"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: wallet (皮夾) 【全文中譯】當年經人打開皮革短夾要付計程車司機車資時，發現裡面只剩兩枚硬幣。 【選項解析】(A) handkerchief 手帕  (B) wallet 皮夾  (C) sneakers 運動鞋  (D) socks 襪子。裝鈔票與卡片的為 wallet。"},{"number":7,"stem":"Because a ______ is the hardest natural substance known on earth, it is used for heavy industrial cutting.","options":["wallet","purse","diamond","handkerchief"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: diamond (鑽石) 【全文中譯】因為鑽石是地球上已知最堅硬的天然物質，所以被用於重工業切割。 【選項解析】(A) wallet 皮夾  (B) purse 手提包  (C) diamond 鑽石  (D) handkerchief 手帕。最堅硬物質為 diamond。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The winning athlete proudly stepped onto the victory podium and received a medal crafted from pure ______.","options":["slippers","purse","wallet","gold"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: gold (黃金) 【全文中譯】獲勝的運動員驕傲地站上頒獎台，接過一面由純金打造的獎牌。 【選項解析】(A) slippers 拖鞋  (B) purse 手提包  (C) wallet 皮夾  (D) gold 黃金。第一名金牌為 pure gold。"},{"number":9,"stem":"In fairytale stories, the brave prince had bright ______ hair and rode across the kingdom on a white horse.","options":["golden","deaf","dizzy","pale"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: golden (金黃色的) 【全文中譯】在童話故事裡，英勇的王子擁有一頭金黃色秀髮，騎著白馬巡視王國。 【選項解析】(A) golden 金色的  (B) deaf 聾的  (C) dizzy 頭暈的  (D) pale 蒼白的。形容金髮用 golden hair。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Grandmother keeps her grandmother's antique ______ teapot locked securely inside the glass cabinet.","options":["ill","silver","painful","blind"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: silver (銀製的) 【全文中譯】祖母把她祖母留下來的仿古純銀茶壺安全地鎖在玻璃櫃中。 【選項解析】(A) ill 生病的  (B) silver 銀製的  (C) painful 疼痛的  (D) blind 盲的。貴重茶具為 silver teapot。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Take off those muddy soccer shoes immediately and put on these clean rubber ______ by the door.","options":["handkerchief","purse","slippers","wallet"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: slippers (室內拖鞋) 【全文中譯】立刻脫下那雙沾滿泥巴的足球鞋，換上門邊這些乾淨的橡膠拖鞋。 【選項解析】(A) handkerchief 手帕  (B) purse 手提包  (C) slippers 拖鞋  (D) wallet 皮夾。室內換穿 rubber slippers。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Modern marathon runners invest in high-tech running ______ designed with thick carbon-fiber cushions.","options":["wallets","purses","handkerchiefs","sneakers"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: sneakers (運動鞋) 【全文中譯】現代馬拉松跑者投資於設計有厚碳纖維緩震墊的高科技慢跑運動鞋。 【選項解析】(A) wallets 皮夾  (B) purses 手提包  (C) handkerchiefs 手帕  (D) sneakers 運動鞋。馬拉松穿 running sneakers。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Always remember to pack several pairs of clean cotton ______ before embarking on a week-long hiking expedition.","options":["socks","wallets","purses","diamonds"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: socks (短襪) 【全文中譯】在展開為期一週的健行探險前，務必記得打包數雙乾淨的純棉短襪。 【選項解析】(A) socks 短襪  (B) wallets 皮夾  (C) purses 手提包  (D) diamonds 鑽石。健行必備換洗 cotton socks。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The kind schoolteacher gently handed her cotton ______ to the crying child to wipe away his tears.","options":["sneakers","handkerchief","wallet","purse"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: handkerchief (手帕) 【全文中譯】親切的學校老師溫柔地將她的純棉手帕遞給哭泣的孩子擦眼淚。 【選項解析】(A) sneakers 運動鞋  (B) handkerchief 手帕  (C) wallet 皮夾  (D) purse 手提包。擦眼淚用 cotton handkerchief。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Aunt Clara keeps her smartphone, car keys, and house keys organized neatly inside her floral ______.","options":["socks","wallet","purse","sneakers"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: purse (手提包) 【全文中譯】克拉拉姑姑把智慧型手機、車鑰匙和家門鑰匙整齊收納在碎花手提包裡。 【選項解析】(A) socks 短襪  (B) wallet 皮夾  (C) purse 女用提包  (D) sneakers 運動鞋。女用隨身提包為 purse。"},{"number":16,"stem":"The police arrested a pickpocket who was caught stealing an expensive leather ______ from an elderly tourist.","options":["handkerchief","sneakers","slippers","wallet"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: wallet (皮夾) 【全文中譯】警方逮捕了一名扒手，他被當場抓到偷竊一名年長觀光客昂貴的真皮皮夾。 【選項解析】(A) handkerchief 手帕  (B) sneakers 運動鞋  (C) slippers 拖鞋  (D) wallet 皮夾。扒手常竊取 leather wallet。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Many couples choose a solitaire ______ engagement ring as a traditional symbol of everlasting love.","options":["diamond","handkerchief","purse","wallet"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: diamond (鑽石) 【全文中譯】許多伴侶選擇單顆美鑽求婚戒指，作為永恆愛情的傳統象徵。 【選項解析】(A) diamond 鑽石  (B) handkerchief 手帕  (C) purse 手提包  (D) wallet 皮夾。求婚戒為 diamond engagement ring。"},{"number":18,"stem":"In ancient times, wealthy merchants conducted international trade using heavy coins minted from solid ______.","options":["wallet","gold","purse","sneakers"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: gold (黃金) 【全文中譯】在古代，富裕的商人使用以純金鑄造的沉重硬幣進行國際貿易。 【選項解析】(A) wallet 皮夾  (B) gold 黃金  (C) purse 手提包  (D) sneakers 運動鞋。古錢幣以 solid gold 鑄造。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Looking down from the mountain peak at dawn, we watched the morning sunlight paint the horizon a brilliant ______ yellow.","options":["dumb","homesick","golden","deaf"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: golden (金黃色的) 【全文中譯】黎明時分從山頂俯瞰，我們看著晨曦將地平線染成一片絢麗的金黃色。 【選項解析】(A) dumb 啞的  (B) homesick 想家的  (C) golden 金黃色的  (D) deaf 聾的。形容金色晨光用 golden yellow。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The talented musician was awarded a polished ______ trophy for winning second place in the piano contest.","options":["dizzy","blind","pale","silver"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: silver (銀製的) 【全文中譯】這位有才華的音樂家因獲得鋼琴大賽第二名而獲頒一座精緻的銀製獎盃。 【選項解析】(A) dizzy 頭暈的  (B) blind 盲的  (C) pale 蒼白的  (D) silver 銀製的。第二名獲頒 silver trophy。"},{"number":21,"stem":"In traditional Asian households, guests never walk across polished wooden floors without wearing indoor ______.","options":["slippers","handkerchief","purse","wallet"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: slippers (拖鞋) 【全文中譯】在傳統亞洲家庭中，客人在磨光木地板上走動時絕不會不穿室內拖鞋。 【選項解析】(A) slippers 拖鞋  (B) handkerchief 手帕  (C) purse 手提包  (D) wallet 皮夾。室內防滑保潔穿 slippers。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Kevin bought a pair of black canvas ______ to wear with his casual denim jeans during weekend outings.","options":["wallets","sneakers","purses","handkerchiefs"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: sneakers (球鞋；運動鞋) 【全文中譯】凱文買了一雙黑色帆布球鞋，以便在週末外出時搭配休閒牛仔褲穿著。 【選項解析】(A) wallets 皮夾  (B) sneakers 球鞋  (C) purses 手提包  (D) handkerchiefs 手帕。休閒帆布鞋為 canvas sneakers。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The washing machine ate one of my striped ______, so now I have an odd pair that does not match.","options":["purses","wallets","socks","diamonds"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: socks (短襪) 【全文中譯】洗衣機吃掉了我的一隻條紋襪，所以現在我有一雙湊不成套的襪子。 【選項解析】(A) purses 手提包  (B) wallets 皮夾  (C) socks 短襪  (D) diamonds 鑽石。一隻落單的襪子為 sock。"},{"number":24,"stem":"A gentleman in the 19th century always kept an ironed silk ______ in the breast pocket of his coat.","options":["wallet","purse","sneakers","handkerchief"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: handkerchief (手帕) 【全文中譯】19世紀的紳士總會在外套胸前口袋裡放一條熨燙整齊的絲質手帕。 【選項解析】(A) wallet 皮夾  (B) purse 手提包  (C) sneakers 運動鞋  (D) handkerchief 手帕。紳士口袋巾為 silk handkerchief。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Don't leave your open ______ unattended on the restaurant table while getting food from the buffet counter.","options":["purse","slippers","sneakers","socks"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: purse (手提包) 【全文中譯】在自助餐檯取餐時，切勿將打開的手提包無人看管地放在餐桌上。 【選項解析】(A) purse 手提包  (B) slippers 拖鞋  (C) sneakers 運動鞋  (D) socks 短襪。隨身女用手提包為 purse。"}]},{"unit":15,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 15 (015.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Stationery, Office Supplies & Materials | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"cotton","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a soft white fibrous substance used for making clothes and thread","chinese":"棉花；純棉","sentence":"People living in tropical climates prefer wearing light clothes made of pure ______ because it absorbs sweat well.","translation":"生活在熱帶氣候的人們更喜歡穿著純棉製成的輕便衣服，因為它吸汗效果好。"},{"word":"pipe","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a tube through which liquids or gases flow; a smoking device","chinese":"管子；煙斗","sentence":"The plumber had to replace a leaking copper ______ under the kitchen sink to prevent further water damage.","translation":"水電工必須更換廚房水槽下一根漏水的銅管，以防止水災進一步擴大。"},{"word":"tape (tape / taped / taped)","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a narrow strip of sticky material; to record audio/video","chinese":"膠帶；磁帶；用膠帶黏貼；錄製","sentence":"Before moving to the new apartment, father used strong packaging ______ to seal all the cardboard boxes.","translation":"在搬到新公寓之前，父親用強韌的封箱膠帶把所有的紙箱都密封好。"},{"word":"CD","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a compact disc used for storing digital audio, video, or data","chinese":"光碟；雷射唱片","sentence":"My uncle has an impressive music collection with over five hundred jazz albums stored on original ______.","translation":"我叔叔擁有令人印象深刻的音樂收藏，有超過五百張爵士專輯保存在原版光碟上。"},{"word":"envelope","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a flat paper container used especially for enclosing a letter","chinese":"信封","sentence":"After writing a heartfelt thank-you letter to her teacher, Maria slipped it into a clean white ______.","translation":"在給她的老師寫了一封由衷的感謝信之後，瑪麗亞將信滑入一個乾淨的白色信封中。"},{"word":"glue (glue / glued / glued)","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a sticky substance used for joining things together","chinese":"膠水；黏貼","sentence":"The little girl made a colorful paper lantern for the festival, and she used liquid ______ to stick the parts.","translation":"小女孩為節日做了一個色彩繽紛的紙燈籠，她用液態膠水將各個部分黏合在一起。"},{"word":"ink","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a colored liquid used for writing, drawing, or printing","chinese":"墨水；油墨","sentence":"The office printer stopped working suddenly because the black ______ cartridge ran completely dry.","translation":"辦公室印表機突然停止運作，因為黑色墨水匣裡面的墨水已經徹底用乾了。"},{"word":"marker","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a felt-tipped pen used for writing bold lines or highlighting","chinese":"麥克筆；彩色筆","sentence":"The English teacher picked up a red dry-erase ______ and wrote three important grammar rules on the whiteboard.","translation":"英文老師拿起一支給白板用的紅色乾擦麥克筆，在白板上寫了三條重要的文法規則。"},{"word":"paste (paste / pasted / pasted)","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a thick wet mixture used for sticking paper; to glue","chinese":"糊狀物；漿糊；張貼","sentence":"The students spread homemade wheat ______ evenly over the wall to hang their artistic campaign posters.","translation":"學生們將自製的麵粉漿糊均勻塗抹在牆上，以張貼他們的藝術宣傳海報。"},{"word":"textbook","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a comprehensive book used for the formal study of a subject","chinese":"教科書；課本","sentence":"Every student must bring their science ______ to class every morning so that we can read chapter four together.","translation":"每位學生每天早上都必須帶他們的自然教科書來上課，這樣我們才能一起閱讀第四章。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Because the summer heat in southern Taiwan is intense, I only buy casual shirts tailored from breathable natural ______.","options":["cotton","CD","envelope","pipe"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: cotton (純棉) 【全文中譯】因為南台灣夏季炎熱難耐，我只購買透氣天然純棉剪裁的休閒襯衫。 【選項解析】(A) cotton 棉花/純棉  (B) CD 光碟  (C) envelope 信封  (D) pipe 管子。透氣布料為 natural cotton。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The heavy freeze caused a burst water ______ in the garden, and cold water flooded the lawn.","options":["envelope","pipe","marker","paste"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pipe (管子；水管) 【全文中譯】嚴重的冰凍導致花園裡的一根水管爆裂，冰水淹沒了整個草坪。 【選項解析】(A) envelope 信封  (B) pipe 水管  (C) marker 麥克筆  (D) paste 漿糊。burst water pipe（爆裂水管）。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Mother securely fastened the edges of the parcel using three layers of brown packing ______.","options":["textbook","ink","tape","CD"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: tape (膠帶) 【全文中譯】母親用三層棕色封箱膠帶將包裹的邊緣牢固地封合起來。 【選項解析】(A) textbook 教科書  (B) ink 墨水  (C) tape 膠帶  (D) CD 光碟。封箱使用 packing tape。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Before digital streaming became popular worldwide, people bought music tracks on shiny round ______.","options":["pipes","cottons","envelopes","CDs"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: CD (光碟) 【全文中譯】在數位串流風靡全球之前，人們都在閃亮圓形光碟上購買音樂曲目。 【選項解析】(A) pipes 管子  (B) cottons 棉花  (C) envelopes 信封  (D) CDs 光碟。音樂載體為 shiny round CDs。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Please remember to moisten the flap of the ______ and press it firmly before putting it in the mailbox.","options":["envelope","pipe","CD","textbook"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: envelope (信封) 【全文中譯】在把信投入郵筒前，請記得將信封封口沾濕並用力按緊。 【選項解析】(A) envelope 信封  (B) pipe 管子  (C) CD 光碟  (D) textbook 教科書。信件封口為 flap of the envelope。"},{"number":6,"stem":"When Billy dropped his toy airplane, its plastic wing snapped off, but he fixed it with model ______.","options":["pipe","glue","cotton","CD"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: glue (膠水) 【全文中譯】當比利把玩具飛機掉在地上時，塑膠機翼斷了，但他用模型膠水修好了它。 【選項解析】(A) pipe 管子  (B) glue 膠水  (C) cotton 棉花  (D) CD 光碟。修復塑膠模型使用 model glue。"},{"number":7,"stem":"Be careful when refilling the calligraphy pen, or dark blue ______ will splash across your desk.","options":["pipe","envelope","ink","textbook"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: ink (墨水) 【全文中譯】在補充鋼筆墨水時要小心，否則深藍色墨水會濺得整個書桌都是。 【選項解析】(A) pipe 管子  (B) envelope 信封  (C) ink 墨水  (D) textbook 教科書。鋼筆內部液體為 dark blue ink。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The lecturer used a bold black ______ to draw a clear diagram on the whiteboard during the seminar.","options":["envelope","pipe","CD","marker"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: marker (麥克筆) 【全文中譯】演講者在研討會期間用一支粗黑色麥克筆在白板上畫了一個清晰的圖表。 【選項解析】(A) envelope 信封  (B) pipe 管子  (C) CD 光碟  (D) marker 麥克筆。白板書寫工具為 dry-erase marker。"},{"number":9,"stem":"In art class, the children used sticky wallpaper ______ to assemble papier-mâché sculptures.","options":["paste","pipe","CD","envelope"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: paste (漿糊) 【全文中譯】在美術課上，孩子們使用具黏性的壁紙漿糊來組裝紙黏土雕塑。 【選項解析】(A) paste 漿糊  (B) pipe 管子  (C) CD 光碟  (D) envelope 信封。黏合紙雕使用 wallpaper paste。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Turn to page ninety in your biology ______ and answer the three questions printed at the bottom.","options":["pipe","textbook","envelope","tape"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: textbook (教科書) 【全文中譯】翻開自然教科書第九十頁，並回答印在最底部的三個問題。 【選項解析】(A) pipe 管子  (B) textbook 教科書  (C) envelope 信封  (D) tape 膠帶。課堂教材翻到某頁用 textbook。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Hospital bandages are made of sterilized ______ gauze to protect sensitive wounds from external infection.","options":["pipe","CD","cotton","envelope"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: cotton (棉質) 【全文中譯】醫院繃帶由滅菌棉紗布製成，以保護敏感傷口免受外部感染。 【選項解析】(A) pipe 管子  (B) CD 光碟  (C) cotton 棉花/純棉  (D) envelope 信封。醫用棉紗為 cotton gauze。"},{"number":12,"stem":"An experienced plumber climbed into the crawlspace to inspect the main drainage ______ of the apartment.","options":["marker","envelope","CD","pipe"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: pipe (管線) 【全文中譯】經驗豐富的水電工爬進管道夾層，檢查公寓的主要排水管。 【選項解析】(A) marker 麥克筆  (B) envelope 信封  (C) CD 光碟  (D) pipe 管線。主排水管為 main drainage pipe。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The detective carefully wrapped a piece of transparent adhesive ______ around the suspect's drinking glass.","options":["tape","pipe","CD","textbook"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: tape (膠帶) 【全文中譯】刑警小心翼翼地在嫌疑犯喝水的水杯周圍纏上一條透明膠帶以採集指紋。 【選項解析】(A) tape 膠帶  (B) pipe 管子  (C) CD 光碟  (D) textbook 教科書。透明膠帶為 transparent adhesive tape。"},{"number":14,"stem":"My older sister still enjoys collecting physical albums, so she bought a classic rock ______ at the music store.","options":["pipe","CD","cotton","envelope"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: CD (唱片光碟) 【全文中譯】我姊姊仍然喜歡收藏實體專輯，所以她在唱片行買了一張經典搖滾CD。 【選項解析】(A) pipe 管子  (B) CD 唱片光碟  (C) cotton 棉花  (D) envelope 信封。實體音樂專輯為 classic rock CD。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Don't forget to affix a valid postage stamp to the top right corner of the paper ______ before mailing.","options":["pipe","CD","envelope","marker"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: envelope (信封) 【全文中譯】寄出信件前，不要忘記在紙信封的右上角貼上一張有效的郵票。 【選項解析】(A) pipe 管子  (B) CD 光碟  (C) envelope 信封  (D) marker 麥克筆。信封右上角貼郵票為 paper envelope。"},{"number":16,"stem":"The wooden chair leg became loose after years of use, so grandpa repaired it with strong wood ______.","options":["pipe","envelope","CD","glue"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: glue (膠水；木工膠) 【全文中譯】木椅腳經過多年使用變鬆了，所以祖父用強效木工膠將其修復好。 【選項解析】(A) pipe 管子  (B) envelope 信封  (C) CD 光碟  (D) glue 膠水。修補木椅用 strong wood glue。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Medieval scribes dipped pointed bird feathers into dark squid ______ to write historical manuscripts.","options":["ink","pipe","CD","envelope"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: ink (墨水) 【全文中譯】中世紀的抄寫員將削尖的鳥羽毛浸入深色墨水之中來書寫歷史手稿。 【選項解析】(A) ink 墨水  (B) pipe 管子  (C) CD 光碟  (D) envelope 信封。沾水筆書寫用 dark squid ink。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Make sure to put the cap back on the highlighter ______ tightly, or the tip will dry out completely overnight.","options":["CD","marker","envelope","pipe"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: marker (麥克筆；螢光筆) 【全文中譯】務必把螢光麥克筆的筆蓋蓋緊，否則筆尖隔夜就會徹底乾掉。 【選項解析】(A) CD 光碟  (B) marker 麥克筆  (C) envelope 信封  (D) pipe 管子。螢光筆為 highlighter marker。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Before computers existed, editors used scissors and starch ______ to lay out newspaper columns by hand.","options":["pipe","CD","paste","envelope"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: paste (漿糊) 【全文中譯】在電腦出現之前，編輯們用剪刀和澱粉漿糊手工排版報紙專欄版面。 【選項解析】(A) pipe 管子  (B) CD 光碟  (C) paste 漿糊  (D) envelope 信封。黏貼排版使用 starch paste。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The high school principal announced that all students would receive their new history ______ next Monday morning.","options":["envelopes","pipes","CDs","textbooks"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: textbook (教科書) 【全文中譯】高中校長宣布，全體學生將在下星期一早晨領取他們的新歷史教科書。 【選項解析】(A) envelopes 信封  (B) pipes 管子  (C) CDs 光碟  (D) textbooks 教科書。學期發放教材為 history textbooks。"},{"number":21,"stem":"High-quality bedding sheets made from organic Egyptian ______ provide a remarkably comfortable night of rest.","options":["cotton","pipe","envelope","CD"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: cotton (純棉) 【全文中譯】由有機埃及棉製成的高品質床單，能提供格外舒適的夜間睡眠休憩。 【選項解析】(A) cotton 純棉  (B) pipe 管子  (C) envelope 信封  (D) CD 光碟。埃及純棉為 Egyptian cotton。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Factory emissions travel through a tall exhaust ______ high into the sky above the industrial park.","options":["CD","pipe","envelope","textbook"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pipe (排氣管) 【全文中譯】工廠廢氣穿過工業區上方高聳的排氣管排放到遙遠的高空之中。 【選項解析】(A) CD 光碟  (B) pipe 排氣管  (C) envelope 信封  (D) textbook 教科書。廢氣排放管道為 tall exhaust pipe。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The athlete wrapped athletic ______ around his sprained ankle to give it extra stability during the race.","options":["CD","pipe","tape","textbook"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: tape (貼紮膠帶) 【全文中譯】運動員在他扭傷的腳踝上纏繞運動白貼膠帶，以在比賽中增加穩定度。 【選項解析】(A) CD 光碟  (B) pipe 管子  (C) tape 膠帶  (D) textbook 教科書。運動防護貼紮為 athletic tape。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Put the installation ______ into your computer's optical drive and follow the instructions on the screen.","options":["pipe","envelope","textbook","CD"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: CD (安裝光碟) 【全文中譯】將安裝光碟放入電腦的光碟機中，並依照螢幕上的操作指示進行。 【選項解析】(A) pipe 管子  (B) envelope 信封  (C) textbook 教科書  (D) CD 安裝光碟。電腦光碟機放入 installation CD。"},{"number":25,"stem":"When the confidential document arrived, the red wax seal on the back of the parchment ______ was unbroken.","options":["envelope","pipe","CD","tape"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: envelope (信封) 【全文中譯】當機密文件送達時，羊皮紙信封背面的紅色火漆印章完好無損。 【選項解析】(A) envelope 信封  (B) pipe 管子  (C) CD 光碟  (D) tape 膠帶。附有火漆印章的信件容器為 parchment envelope。"}]},{"unit":16,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 16 (016.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Home Architecture, Rooms & Interior Storage | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"balcony","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a platform projecting from the wall of a building","chinese":"陽台","sentence":"On cool summer evenings, my grandparents enjoy sitting on the second-floor ______ to watch the street below.","translation":"在涼爽的夏日傍晚，我的祖父母喜歡坐在二樓陽台上觀看下方街景。"},{"word":"basement","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the lowest floor of a building located entirely or partly underground","chinese":"地下室","sentence":"During heavy summer rainstorms, father went down to the dark ______ to check if water had entered.","translation":"在夏季強烈暴風雨期間，父親走到黑暗的地下室檢查是否有水滲入。"},{"word":"garage","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a building or indoor space used for housing motor vehicles","chinese":"車庫","sentence":"Uncle Robert parked his new electric car inside the spacious ______ and plugged it into the charger.","translation":"羅伯特叔叔將他的新電動車停進寬敞的車庫裡，並插上充電器。"},{"word":"fence","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a wooden or metal barrier enclosing an area of land","chinese":"籬笆；柵欄","sentence":"Our neighbor built a tall wooden ______ around his backyard to prevent his energetic dog from running out.","translation":"我們的鄰居在後院周圍建了一道高高的木籬笆，以防止他精力充沛的狗跑出去。"},{"word":"yard","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a piece of ground adjoining a house, often with grass or gardens","chinese":"庭院；院子","sentence":"The cheerful children chased colourful butterflies around the grassy front ______ until dinner was ready.","translation":"活潑開朗的孩子們在綠草如茵的前院追逐色彩繽紛的蝴蝶，直到晚餐準備就緒。"},{"word":"bookcase","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a piece of furniture with shelves used for storing books","chinese":"書櫃；書架","sentence":"Professor Miller ordered a custom-made mahogany ______ to display his vast collection of antique literature.","translation":"米勒教授訂製了一個紅木書架，以展示他收藏的大量古代文學典籍。"},{"word":"shelf","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a flat horizontal board fixed to a wall or frame for displaying objects","chinese":"層架；架子","sentence":"Mother asked Kevin to reach up and fetch the large porcelain bowl from the highest wooden ______.","translation":"母親請凱文把手伸高，從最高處的木製層架上取下那個大瓷碗。"},{"word":"closet","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a tall cupboard or small recess used for storing clothes and coats","chinese":"壁櫥；衣櫥","sentence":"Before leaving for work, Mr. Davis opened the bedroom ______ and selected a crisp navy blue suit.","translation":"出門上班前，戴維斯先生打開臥室衣櫥，挑選了一套筆挺的海軍藍西裝。"},{"word":"drawer","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a sliding box-like container fitted into a desk or chest of drawers","chinese":"抽屜","sentence":"Grandmother kept her golden scissors, sewing needles, and thread safely stored in the top desk ______.","translation":"祖母把她的金剪刀、縫紉針和線安全地收納在書桌最上方的抽屜裡。"},{"word":"dresser","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a piece of bedroom furniture with drawers and usually a mirror","chinese":"梳妝台；矮衣櫃","sentence":"My older sister sat in front of the bedroom ______ every morning to comb her hair and apply light makeup.","translation":"我姊姊每天早上坐在臥室梳妝台前梳理頭髮並化上淡淡的妝容。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"From our fourth-floor apartment ______, we can observe the annual New Year fireworks display across the river.","options":["balcony","basement","garage","fence"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: balcony (陽台) 【全文中譯】從我們四樓公寓的陽台，我們可以觀看對岸一年一度的跨年煙火秀。 【選項解析】(A) balcony 陽台  (B) basement 地下室  (C) garage 車庫  (D) fence 籬笆。高樓層觀景位置為 balcony。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The old laundry washing machines and heating boilers are installed down in the concrete ______.","options":["balcony","basement","drawer","dresser"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: basement (地下室) 【全文中譯】老舊的洗衣機和供暖鍋爐都安裝在下方的混凝土地下室裡。 【選項解析】(A) balcony 陽台  (B) basement 地下室  (C) drawer 抽屜  (D) dresser 梳妝台。鍋爐設備常置於 basement。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Mr. Brown drove into the two-car ______ and closed the automatic metal roller door behind his vehicle.","options":["balcony","basement","garage","shelf"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: garage (車庫) 【全文中譯】布朗先生開進雙車位車庫，並關閉了車輛後方的自動金屬鐵捲門。 【選項解析】(A) balcony 陽台  (B) basement 地下室  (C) garage 車庫  (D) shelf 架子。停車空間為 two-car garage。"},{"number":4,"stem":"The farmer repaired the wooden boundary ______ to stop wild deer from entering and eating his cabbage crop.","options":["balcony","drawer","dresser","fence"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: fence (籬笆) 【全文中譯】農夫修補了木製邊界籬笆，以防止野生鹿跑進來啃食他的高麗菜作物。 【選項解析】(A) balcony 陽台  (B) drawer 抽屜  (C) dresser 梳妝台  (D) fence 籬笆。防野生動物入侵建 wooden boundary fence。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The neighborhood kids love playing badminton and pitching tents in our large grassy back ______.","options":["yard","bookcase","closet","drawer"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: yard (庭院) 【全文中譯】鄰居的孩子們喜歡在我們寬敞、綠草如茵的後院打羽毛球和搭帳篷。 【選項解析】(A) yard 庭院  (B) bookcase 書櫃  (C) closet 衣櫥  (D) drawer 抽屜。戶外活動場所為 grassy back yard。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Dad organized all his encyclopedia volumes in alphabetical order on the large living room ______.","options":["yard","bookcase","drawer","dresser"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: bookcase (書櫃) 【全文中譯】爸爸按照字母順序將他所有的百科全書整齊收納在客廳大書櫃上。 【選項解析】(A) yard 庭院  (B) bookcase 書櫃  (C) drawer 抽屜  (D) dresser 梳妝台。存放百科全書為 bookcase。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The store clerk placed several glass perfume bottles carefully on the illuminated display ______.","options":["garage","fence","shelf","basement"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: shelf (層架) 【全文中譯】店員小心翼翼地將數個玻璃香水瓶擺放在有照明的展示層架上。 【選項解析】(A) garage 車庫  (B) fence 籬笆  (C) shelf 層架  (D) basement 地下室。商品陳列板為 display shelf。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Hang your winter overcoat on a wooden hanger and place it inside the hallway ______.","options":["fence","yard","balcony","closet"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: closet (衣櫥) 【全文中譯】把你的冬季大衣掛在木衣架上，並放進走廊的衣櫥裡面。 【選項解析】(A) fence 籬笆  (B) yard 庭院  (C) balcony 陽台  (D) closet 衣櫥。懸掛大衣放置於 hallway closet。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Tom opened the wooden desk ______ to look for a pair of scissors and a fresh ballpoint pen.","options":["drawer","fence","garage","yard"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: drawer (抽屜) 【全文中譯】湯姆拉開木製書桌抽屜，尋找一把剪刀和一支新的原子筆。 【選項解析】(A) drawer 抽屜  (B) fence 籬笆  (C) garage 車庫  (D) yard 庭院。書桌可抽拉收納為 desk drawer。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Mother keeps perfume bottles, cosmetics, and jewelry boxes neatly arranged on top of her bedroom ______.","options":["fence","dresser","yard","basement"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: dresser (梳妝台) 【全文中譯】母親將香水瓶、化妝品和首飾盒整齊排列在她的臥室梳妝台上。 【選項解析】(A) fence 籬笆  (B) dresser 梳妝台  (C) yard 庭院  (D) basement 地下室。擺放化妝品之矮櫃為 bedroom dresser。"},{"number":11,"stem":"We set up a small table and two folding chairs on the flower-filled ______ to drink afternoon coffee.","options":["basement","fence","balcony","drawer"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: balcony (陽台) 【全文中譯】我們在繁花盛開的陽台上擺放了一張小桌子和兩張折疊椅來喝下午茶咖啡。 【選項解析】(A) basement 地下室  (B) fence 籬笆  (C) balcony 陽台  (D) drawer 抽屜。戶外喝咖啡於 flower-filled balcony。"},{"number":12,"stem":"During the tornado warning, families in the Midwestern United States quickly retreated to the storm ______.","options":["fence","balcony","dresser","basement"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: basement (地下室) 【全文中譯】在龍捲風警報期間，美國中西部的家庭迅速撤離到防風暴地下室避難。 【選項解析】(A) fence 籬笆  (B) balcony 陽台  (C) dresser 梳妝台  (D) basement 地下室。避龍捲風進 storm basement。"},{"number":13,"stem":"You should clear those old boxes out of the private ______ so there is enough room to park the family minivan.","options":["garage","balcony","drawer","fence"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: garage (車庫) 【全文中譯】你應該把那些舊箱子從私人車庫清走，這樣才有足夠空間停放休旅車。 【選項解析】(A) garage 車庫  (B) balcony 陽台  (C) drawer 抽屜  (D) fence 籬笆。停放廂型車需清理 private garage。"},{"number":14,"stem":"A white picket ______ borders the charming country cottage and separates the front lawn from the lane.","options":["yard","fence","drawer","dresser"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: fence (籬笆) 【全文中譯】一道白色尖頭木籬笆環繞著迷人的鄉村農舍，並將前草坪與小徑隔開。 【選項解析】(A) yard 庭院  (B) fence 籬笆  (C) drawer 抽屜  (D) dresser 梳妝台。經典美式白色籬笆為 white picket fence。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The children planted sunflowers and sweet cherry tomatoes along the perimeter of the sunny ______.","options":["bookcase","drawer","yard","closet"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: yard (院子) 【全文中譯】孩子們在陽光充沛的院子周圍種下了向日葵和甜櫻桃番茄。 【選項解析】(A) bookcase 書櫃  (B) drawer 抽屜  (C) yard 院子  (D) closet 衣櫥。戶外種植花卉蔬菜在 sunny yard。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Hundreds of leather-bound classical novels fill every single row of the professor's oak ______.","options":["drawer","yard","fence","bookcase"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: bookcase (書櫃) 【全文中譯】數百本皮質封面的古典小說填滿了教授橡木書架上的每一格。 【選項解析】(A) drawer 抽屜  (B) yard 院子  (C) fence 籬笆  (D) bookcase 書櫃。藏書傢俱為 oak bookcase。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Can you reach up to that high kitchen ______ and hand me down the jar of dried oregano seasoning?","options":["shelf","fence","yard","basement"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: shelf (架子) 【全文中譯】你能伸手夠到廚房上方的高架子，把那罐牛至香料遞給我嗎？ 【選項解析】(A) shelf 架子  (B) fence 籬笆  (C) yard 院子  (D) basement 地下室。廚房置物板為 kitchen shelf。"},{"number":18,"stem":"In winter, mother stores heavy down blankets in vacuum-sealed plastic bags inside the master bedroom ______.","options":["fence","closet","yard","balcony"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: closet (衣櫥) 【全文中譯】在冬天，母親把厚羽絨被收納在真空袋裡，放在主臥室的衣櫥裡。 【選項解析】(A) fence 籬笆  (B) closet 衣櫥  (C) yard 院子  (D) balcony 陽台。存放棉被於 master bedroom closet。"},{"number":19,"stem":"I can never find clean socks because my brother constantly mixes up his clothes in the shared dresser ______.","options":["fence","yard","drawer","balcony"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: drawer (抽屜) 【全文中譯】我總是找不到乾淨的襪子，因為我弟弟總是在共用的矮櫃抽屜裡把衣服混在一起。 【選項解析】(A) fence 籬笆  (B) yard 院子  (C) drawer 抽屜  (D) balcony 陽台。存放衣物的滑動盒為 dresser drawer。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The mirror attached to the vintage wooden ______ had to be cleaned because it was covered in dust.","options":["fence","yard","balcony","dresser"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: dresser (梳妝台) 【全文中譯】附在那座復古木製梳妝台上的鏡子必須擦拭，因為上面沾滿了灰塵。 【選項解析】(A) fence 籬笆  (B) yard 院子  (C) balcony 陽台  (D) dresser 梳妝台。附帶鏡子的梳妝矮櫃為 vintage wooden dresser。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Potted geraniums and fresh basil plants flourish under the warm morning sun on our open ______.","options":["balcony","drawer","dresser","closet"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: balcony (陽台) 【全文中譯】盆栽天竺葵與新鮮羅勒植物在我們開放式陽台上的溫暖晨光下茂盛生長。 【選項解析】(A) balcony 陽台  (B) drawer 抽屜  (C) dresser 梳妝台  (D) closet 衣櫥。植栽盆栽放於 open balcony。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Because there are no windows down in the underground ______, we installed bright overhead LED tube lights.","options":["balcony","basement","fence","yard"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: basement (地下室) 【全文中譯】因為地下室沒有窗戶，所以我們安裝了明亮的頂置LED燈管。 【選項解析】(A) balcony 陽台  (B) basement 地下室  (C) fence 籬笆  (D) yard 庭院。地底無窗空間為 underground basement。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The mechanic's home ______ is equipped with heavy-duty diagnostic computers and hydraulic lifting jacks.","options":["balcony","shelf","garage","drawer"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: garage (車庫) 【全文中譯】這位技師的自家車庫配備了重型診斷電腦和油壓千斤頂起重機。 【選項解析】(A) balcony 陽台  (B) shelf 架子  (C) garage 車庫  (D) drawer 抽屜。修車場兼車庫為 home garage。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The barbed-wire security ______ surrounding the military installation is monitored by electronic cameras 24 hours a day.","options":["drawer","yard","balcony","fence"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: fence (鐵絲網籬笆) 【全文中譯】圍繞軍事基地的鐵絲網安全籬笆全天候24小時由電子監控攝影機監看。 【選項解析】(A) drawer 抽屜  (B) yard 院子  (C) balcony 陽台  (D) fence 鐵絲網籬笆。防護圍牆為 security fence。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Father spent all Saturday afternoon mowing the overgrown green grass in our spacious front ______.","options":["yard","closet","bookcase","dresser"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: yard (前院) 【全文中譯】父親星期六整個下午都在為我們寬敞前院雜草叢生的綠草修剪草皮。 【選項解析】(A) yard 前院  (B) closet 衣櫥  (C) bookcase 書架  (D) dresser 梳妝台。割草修剪在 spacious front yard。"}]},{"unit":17,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 17 (017.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Home Fixtures, Domestic Appliances & Floor Coverings | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"ceiling","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the overhead upper surface of a room","chinese":"天花板","sentence":"The historic cathedral features a magnificent dome with biblical scenes painted across the high ______.","translation":"這座歷史悠久的大教堂擁有壯麗的穹頂，高聳的天花板上繪製著聖經場景。"},{"word":"roof","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the structure forming the upper covering of a building","chinese":"屋頂","sentence":"A violent typhoon damaged the terracotta tiles, so two workers climbed up to repair the house ______.","translation":"強烈颱風破壞了紅陶瓦片，所以兩名工人爬上去修復房子的屋頂。"},{"word":"curtain","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a piece of hanging cloth used to screen a window","chinese":"窗簾；簾子","sentence":"Because the afternoon sunlight was shining directly into the study, Linda pulled the thick velvet ______ closed.","translation":"因為午後的陽光直接照進書房，琳達把厚重的天鵝絨窗簾拉上了。"},{"word":"dryer","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an appliance that removes moisture, especially for clothes or hair","chinese":"烘乾機；吹風機","sentence":"After washing his muddy soccer kit, Tom placed the clean uniforms into the electric clothes ______.","translation":"在洗好沾滿泥巴的足球裝備後，湯姆把乾淨的球衣放進了電動乾衣機中。"},{"word":"heater","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an apparatus used for warming the air in a room or building","chinese":"暖氣機；電暖爐","sentence":"When mountain temperatures dropped below zero degrees in January, we gathered around the portable electric ______.","translation":"當一月份山區氣溫降至零度以下時，我們聚集在便攜式電暖爐周圍取暖。"},{"word":"microwave","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an oven that cooks or warms food using high-frequency electromagnetic waves","chinese":"微波爐","sentence":"If you arrive home late and find the dinner cold, you can reheat the chicken soup in the kitchen ______.","translation":"如果你很晚才到家發現晚餐涼了，你可以把雞湯放進廚房微波爐裡重新加熱。"},{"word":"oven","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an enclosed compartment used for baking or roasting food","chinese":"烤箱","sentence":"Mother preheated the electric baking ______ to 180 degrees before putting the apple pie inside.","translation":"母親在把蘋果派放進去之前，先把電烤箱預熱到攝氏一百八十度。"},{"word":"stove","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an apparatus for cooking or heating that operates by burning fuel or electricity","chinese":"瓦斯爐；火爐","sentence":"Always remember to turn off the gas knobs on the kitchen ______ before leaving the house.","translation":"出門前請務必記得關閉廚房瓦斯爐上的旋鈕開關。"},{"word":"carpet","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a thick heavy woven floor covering covering an entire room","chinese":"地毯","sentence":"The luxury presidential suite was decorated with Persian rugs and a thick, soft woolen ______ on the floor.","translation":"豪華總統套房鋪設著波斯地毯，地板上鋪著一層厚實柔軟的羊毛地毯。"},{"word":"mat","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a small piece of coarse material placed on a floor for wiping shoes","chinese":"地墊；門墊；墊子","sentence":"Before stepping into the Japanese-style living room, visitors wipe the mud off their shoes on the door ______.","translation":"在走進日式客廳之前，訪客會在門墊上擦掉鞋子上的泥土。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"We hired an electrician to install a modern crystal chandelier directly onto the high living room ______.","options":["ceiling","carpet","stove","mat"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: ceiling (天花板) 【全文中譯】我們僱用了一名電工，把一盞現代水晶吊燈直接安裝在客廳挑高的天花板上。 【選項解析】(A) ceiling 天花板  (B) carpet 地毯  (C) stove 瓦斯爐  (D) mat 地墊。吊燈安裝於 ceiling 上。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Heavy snow accumulated on the slanted wooden ______ of the alpine cottage during the winter storm.","options":["curtain","roof","microwave","dryer"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: roof (屋頂) 【全文中譯】在冬季暴風雪期間，大量積雪堆積在高山小屋傾斜的木屋頂上。 【選項解析】(A) curtain 窗簾  (B) roof 屋頂  (C) microwave 微波爐  (D) dryer 乾衣機。積雪堆積在 slanted wooden roof。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Sunlight woke the baby early, so mother bought a blackout ______ to keep the nursery dim and quiet.","options":["heater","stove","curtain","oven"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: curtain (窗簾) 【全文中譯】陽光很早就把嬰兒吵醒了，所以媽媽買了一副遮光窗簾以保持嬰兒房昏暗寧靜。 【選項解析】(A) heater 暖氣  (B) stove 爐子  (C) curtain 窗簾  (D) oven 烤箱。遮光使用 blackout curtain。"},{"number":4,"stem":"If you leave wet towels sitting inside the laundry ______ after the cycle ends, they will develop an unpleasant smell.","options":["ceiling","mat","roof","dryer"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: dryer (烘衣機) 【全文中譯】如果烘衣循環結束後把濕毛巾留在洗衣烘衣機裡，毛巾會產生難聞的氣味。 【選項解析】(A) ceiling 天花板  (B) mat 墊子  (C) roof 屋頂  (D) dryer 乾衣機。洗衣烘乾設備為 laundry dryer。"},{"number":5,"stem":"In the cold mountain cabin, our family sat around the kerosene ______ to warm our freezing hands.","options":["heater","carpet","curtain","roof"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: heater (暖氣機；暖爐) 【全文中譯】在寒冷的高山木屋中，我們全家圍坐在煤油暖爐旁溫暖凍僵的雙手。 【選項解析】(A) heater 暖爐  (B) carpet 地毯  (C) curtain 窗簾  (D) roof 屋頂。取暖設備為 kerosene heater。"},{"number":6,"stem":"You can defrost that frozen beef steak in three minutes if you use the automatic setting on the ______.","options":["curtain","microwave","mat","ceiling"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: microwave (微波爐) 【全文中譯】如果你使用微波爐上的自動設定，可以在三分鐘內解凍那塊冷凍牛排。 【選項解析】(A) curtain 窗簾  (B) microwave 微波爐  (C) mat 墊子  (D) ceiling 天花板。快速解凍用 microwave。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The pastry chef placed twenty chocolate chip cookies on a baking sheet and slid them into the hot ______.","options":["ceiling","curtain","oven","carpet"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: oven (烤箱) 【全文中譯】西點廚師把二十塊巧克力脆片餅乾放在烤盤上，並滑進滾燙的烤箱中。 【選項解析】(A) ceiling 天花板  (B) curtain 窗簾  (C) oven 烤箱  (D) carpet 地毯。烘烤餅乾使用 hot oven。"},{"number":8,"stem":"A pot of vegetable broth was bubbling gently over the medium flame on the four-burner kitchen ______.","options":["roof","carpet","ceiling","stove"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: stove (瓦斯爐) 【全文中譯】一鍋蔬菜高湯在四口瓦斯爐的中火上微滾冒泡。 【選項解析】(A) roof 屋頂  (B) carpet 地毯  (C) ceiling 天花板  (D) stove 瓦斯爐。瓦斯爐火上煮湯為 kitchen stove。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Walking barefoot across the plush living room ______ feels wonderfully soft during chilly winter mornings.","options":["carpet","roof","ceiling","stove"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: carpet (地毯) 【全文中譯】在寒冷的冬日早晨，赤腳走在客廳厚實柔軟的地毯上感覺無比舒服。 【選項解析】(A) carpet 地毯  (B) roof 屋頂  (C) ceiling 天花板  (D) stove 爐子。赤腳踩在 plush carpet 上。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Please wipe your wet shoes thoroughly on the rubber welcome ______ before entering the classroom.","options":["ceiling","mat","heater","oven"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: mat (地墊；門墊) 【全文中譯】在進入教室之前，請在橡膠歡迎門墊上徹底擦乾淨你濕漉漉的鞋子。 【選項解析】(A) ceiling 天花板  (B) mat 地墊  (C) heater 暖爐  (D) oven 烤箱。擦鞋門墊為 welcome mat。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Water stains began to appear on the white plaster ______ because the bathroom pipe on the floor above was leaking.","options":["carpet","stove","ceiling","mat"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: ceiling (天花板) 【全文中譯】因為樓上浴室水管漏水，白色灰泥天花板上開始出現水漬。 【選項解析】(A) carpet 地毯  (B) stove 爐子  (C) ceiling 天花板  (D) mat 地墊。天花板漏水為 water stains on plaster ceiling。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Solar panels were installed across the south-facing ______ of the school library to generate clean electricity.","options":["curtain","microwave","dryer","roof"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: roof (屋頂) 【全文中譯】學校圖書館朝南的屋頂上安裝了太陽能電池板以產生乾淨的電力。 【選項解析】(A) curtain 窗簾  (B) microwave 微波爐  (C) dryer 乾衣機  (D) roof 屋頂。屋頂裝太陽能板為 south-facing roof。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The stage actor waited nervously behind the heavy red velvet ______ before walking out to face the crowd.","options":["curtain","stove","oven","heater"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: curtain (舞台布幔；幕布) 【全文中譯】舞台劇演員在厚重紅色天鵝絨布幔後緊張等待，然後才步出舞台面對觀眾。 【選項解析】(A) curtain 舞台布幔  (B) stove 爐子  (C) oven 烤箱  (D) heater 暖爐。舞台簾幕為 velvet curtain。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Hang your delicate silk blouses on a clothesline instead of tossing them into the hot tumbling ______.","options":["ceiling","dryer","roof","mat"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: dryer (烘乾機) 【全文中譯】把你嬌貴的絲質襯衫掛在曬衣繩上，不要扔進滾燙滾動的烘衣機裡。 【選項解析】(A) ceiling 天花板  (B) dryer 烘乾機  (C) roof 屋頂  (D) mat 地墊。高溫烘乾設備為 tumbling dryer。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Turn on the bathroom space ______ ten minutes before taking a shower so that the room becomes comfortably warm.","options":["carpet","curtain","heater","roof"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: heater (暖風機) 【全文中譯】在沖澡前十分鐘開啟浴室暖風機，這樣整個房間就會變得溫暖舒適。 【選項解析】(A) carpet 地毯  (B) curtain 窗簾  (C) heater 暖風機  (D) roof 屋頂。浴室加溫器為 bathroom space heater。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Reheating pizza in a ______ makes the cheese melt, but baking it in an oven keeps the crust crispy.","options":["ceiling","roof","mat","microwave"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: microwave (微波爐) 【全文中譯】用微波爐重新加熱披薩能讓起司融化，但在烤箱裡烤能讓餅皮保持酥脆。 【選項解析】(A) ceiling 天花板  (B) roof 屋頂  (C) mat 墊子  (D) microwave 微波爐。快速熱融起司使用 microwave。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Don't touch the interior metal racks of the baking ______ without wearing thick heat-resistant mitts.","options":["oven","curtain","carpet","roof"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: oven (烤箱) 【全文中譯】未戴上厚耐熱手套之前，切勿徒手觸碰烘烤烤箱內部的金屬架。 【選項解析】(A) oven 烤箱  (B) curtain 窗簾  (C) carpet 地毯  (D) roof 屋頂。高溫烘焙設備為 baking oven。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Mother placed a large iron tea kettle directly over the gas burner on the stainless steel ______.","options":["roof","stove","ceiling","mat"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: stove (瓦斯爐) 【全文中譯】母親將大鐵水壺直接放在不鏽鋼瓦斯爐的燃氣爐頭上。 【選項解析】(A) roof 屋頂  (B) stove 瓦斯爐  (C) ceiling 天花板  (D) mat 墊子。爐火加熱水壺在 stainless steel stove。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Red wine spilled across the cream-colored bedroom ______, and it took professional cleaners two hours to remove the stain.","options":["ceiling","stove","carpet","roof"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: carpet (地毯) 【全文中譯】紅酒灑在米色的臥室地毯上，專業清潔工花了兩小時才徹底清除污漬。 【選項解析】(A) ceiling 天花板  (B) stove 爐子  (C) carpet 地毯  (D) roof 屋頂。地面紡織鋪層為 bedroom carpet。"},{"number":20,"stem":"After getting out of the hot bathtub, step onto the absorbent cotton bath ______ to avoid slipping.","options":["ceiling","roof","heater","mat"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: mat (腳踏墊) 【全文中譯】走出熱水浴缸後，踏在吸水的純棉浴室踏墊上以防滑倒。 【選項解析】(A) ceiling 天花板  (B) roof 屋頂  (C) heater 暖氣  (D) mat 腳踏墊。浴室吸水墊為 bath mat。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The tall office building was designed with suspended acoustic panels attached to the high concrete ______.","options":["ceiling","carpet","stove","oven"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: ceiling (天花板) 【全文中譯】這棟高層辦公大樓設計有安裝在挑高混凝土天花板上的吸音隔音板。 【選項解析】(A) ceiling 天花板  (B) carpet 地毯  (C) stove 爐子  (D) oven 烤箱。挑高混凝土上方為 concrete ceiling。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Firefighters climbed up tall hydraulic ladders to extinguish the flames blazing across the factory ______.","options":["curtain","roof","microwave","dryer"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: roof (屋頂) 【全文中譯】消防隊員爬上高大的雲梯以撲滅在工廠屋頂上熊熊燃燒的烈火。 【選項解析】(A) curtain 窗簾  (B) roof 屋頂  (C) microwave 微波爐  (D) dryer 乾衣機。火勢蔓延於 factory roof。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Pulling back the bedroom ______ revealed a magnificent panorama of the sun rising over the distant mountains.","options":["heater","stove","curtain","mat"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: curtain (窗簾) 【全文中譯】拉開臥室窗簾，遠處群山頂上朝陽升起的壯麗全景展露無遺。 【選項解析】(A) heater 暖風機  (B) stove 爐子  (C) curtain 窗簾  (D) mat 墊子。拉開窗簾用 pulling back bedroom curtain。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Clean out the lint filter in your laundry ______ after every single load to prevent a potential fire hazard.","options":["ceiling","roof","carpet","dryer"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: dryer (乾衣機) 【全文中譯】每次烘乾後請清除乾衣機內的棉絮濾網，以防止潛在的火災危險。 【選項解析】(A) ceiling 天花板  (B) roof 屋頂  (C) carpet 地毯  (D) dryer 乾衣機。清除濾網為 laundry dryer。"},{"number":25,"stem":"When winter storms knock out municipal power, our neighbors rely on a wood-burning ______ for warmth.","options":["heater","mat","ceiling","curtain"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: heater (火爐；暖氣機) 【全文中譯】當冬日暴風雨切斷市政電力時，我們的鄰居仰賴燃木火爐來獲取溫暖。 【選項解析】(A) heater 暖氣/火爐  (B) mat 墊子  (C) ceiling 天花板  (D) curtain 窗簾。供暖設備為 wood-burning heater。"}]},{"unit":18,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 18 (018.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Furniture, Bedding & Bathroom Hardware | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"bench","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a long seat for several people, typically made of wood or stone","chinese":"長凳；長椅","sentence":"The elderly couple sat quietly on a wooden park ______ to rest and feed the pigeons under the oak tree.","translation":"那對老夫婦靜靜地坐在公園木長椅上休息，並在橡樹下餵食鴿子。"},{"word":"armchair","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a comfortable chair with supports for the arms","chinese":"單人扶手沙發椅","sentence":"Grandfather settled into his leather ______ with a cup of hot tea to read the evening newspaper.","translation":"祖父坐在他的皮質單人扶手椅裡，喝著熱茶閱讀晚報。"},{"word":"pillow","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a soft cushion used to support the head during sleep","chinese":"枕頭","sentence":"I was so exhausted after hiking up the mountain that my eyes closed the moment my head touched the ______.","translation":"登山健行後我筋疲力竭，以至於我的頭一碰到枕頭眼睛就閉上了。"},{"word":"sheet","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a large piece of cotton or linen used on a bed; a broad thin piece","chinese":"床單；一張薄紙/板","sentence":"Mother laundered the bed linen every Saturday morning and spread a clean white cotton ______ across the mattress.","translation":"母親每週六早晨洗滌寢具，並在床墊上鋪上一張乾淨的白色純棉床單。"},{"word":"blanket","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a thick piece of woolen or warm material used as a bed covering","chinese":"毛毯；厚毯子","sentence":"The mountain night was bitterly cold, so the camp counselor handed each student an extra wool ______.","translation":"山裡的夜晚寒冷徹骨，所以營隊輔導員給每位學生分發了一條額外的羊毛毯。"},{"word":"sink (sink / sank / sunk)","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a fixed basin with a water supply; to go down below surface","chinese":"水槽；下沉；沉沒","sentence":"Before preparing dinner, the chef washed his hands with soap and cleaned the fresh vegetables in the kitchen ______.","translation":"在準備晚餐前，廚師用肥皂洗手並在廚房水槽清洗新鮮蔬菜。"},{"word":"tub","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a wide, open container used especially for taking a bath","chinese":"浴缸；桶","sentence":"After running a twenty-kilometer race in the rain, Samuel soaked his sore muscles in a warm bath ______.","translation":"在雨中跑完二十公里賽跑後，塞繆爾在溫暖的浴缸中浸泡舒緩痠痛的肌肉。"},{"word":"mirror","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a reflective glass surface used for viewing one's appearance","chinese":"鏡子","sentence":"The actor stood backstage in front of the illuminated dressing ______ to make sure his costume was perfect.","translation":"演員站在後台有照明的更衣梳妝鏡前，確保他的戲服完美無瑕。"},{"word":"faucet","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a device by which a flow of liquid from a pipe is controlled","chinese":"水龍頭","sentence":"To conserve water during the dry season, always remember to turn off the bathroom ______ while brushing teeth.","translation":"為了在乾季節約用水，刷牙時請務必記得關緊浴室水龍頭。"},{"word":"bucket","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a cylindrical vessel used for carrying liquids or materials","chinese":"提桶；水桶","sentence":"The janitor filled a yellow plastic ______ with soapy water to mop the classroom hallway floor.","translation":"工友在黃色塑膠水桶裡裝滿肥皂水，以拖洗教室走廊的地板。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"We rested our tired legs on a shaded stone ______ overlooking the botanical lotus pond.","options":["bench","pillow","faucet","sink"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: bench (長凳；長椅) 【全文中譯】我們在俯瞰植物園蓮花池的石長椅上休息疲憊的雙腿。 【選項解析】(A) bench 長凳  (B) pillow 枕頭  (C) faucet 水龍頭  (D) sink 水槽。戶外休息處為 stone bench。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The tired businessman collapsed into the soft velvet ______ by the fireplace and fell asleep.","options":["bucket","armchair","tub","sheet"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: armchair (單人扶手椅) 【全文中譯】疲累的商人倒在壁爐旁柔軟的天鵝絨單人扶手椅裡睡著了。 【選項解析】(A) bucket 水桶  (B) armchair 扶手椅  (C) tub 浴缸  (D) sheet 床單。壁爐旁個人座椅為 velvet armchair。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Sleeping on an ergonomic feather ______ helps support your neck and prevents morning stiffness.","options":["faucet","bucket","pillow","bench"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: pillow (枕頭) 【全文中譯】睡在人體工學羽絨枕上有助於支撐頸部，防止晨起頸部僵硬。 【選項解析】(A) faucet 水龍頭  (B) bucket 水桶  (C) pillow 枕頭  (D) bench 長椅。頸部支撐寢具為 feather pillow。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Mother ironed the freshly washed linen ______ before tucking it neatly under the hotel mattress.","options":["sink","armchair","faucet","sheet"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: sheet (床單) 【全文中譯】母親熨燙了剛洗好的亞麻床單，然後整齊地塞入飯店床墊下。 【選項解析】(A) sink 水槽  (B) armchair 扶手椅  (C) faucet 水龍頭  (D) sheet 床單。鋪在床墊上的為 linen sheet。"},{"number":5,"stem":"When freezing blizzards hit the cabin, we wrapped ourselves in a thick knitted ______ on the couch.","options":["blanket","sink","bucket","bench"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: blanket (毛毯) 【全文中譯】當刺骨的暴風雪襲擊木屋時，我們在沙發上將自己裹在厚針織毯裡。 【選項解析】(A) blanket 毛毯  (B) sink 水槽  (C) bucket 水桶  (D) bench 長椅。禦寒裹身用 thick knitted blanket。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Please place all dirty plates and coffee mugs into the stainless steel kitchen ______ to be washed.","options":["armchair","sink","blanket","pillow"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: sink (水槽) 【全文中譯】請把所有髒盤子和咖啡杯放進廚房不鏽鋼水槽裡等待清洗。 【選項解析】(A) armchair 扶手椅  (B) sink 水槽  (C) blanket 毛毯  (D) pillow 枕頭。洗碗槽為 kitchen sink。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The mother filled the ceramic ______ with warm water and bubbles so her toddler could take a fun bath.","options":["bench","sheet","tub","faucet"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: tub (浴缸) 【全文中譯】母親在陶瓷浴缸裡放滿溫水和泡泡，讓幼兒能洗個好玩的澡。 【選項解析】(A) bench 長椅  (B) sheet 床單  (C) tub 浴缸  (D) faucet 水龍頭。泡澡容器為 ceramic bath tub。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The girl looked at her reflection in the full-length bedroom ______ while trying on her prom dress.","options":["bucket","blanket","sink","mirror"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: mirror (鏡子) 【全文中譯】女孩試穿畢業舞會禮服時，看著臥室全身鏡中的自己倒影。 【選項解析】(A) bucket 水桶  (B) blanket 毛毯  (C) sink 水槽  (D) mirror 鏡子。全身穿衣鏡為 full-length mirror。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Call a plumber right away because the leaky chrome ______ in the guest bathroom has been dripping all night.","options":["faucet","blanket","sheet","bench"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: faucet (水龍頭) 【全文中譯】立刻打電話叫水電工，因為客用浴室裡漏水的鉻合金水龍頭滴了一整晚。 【選項解析】(A) faucet 水龍頭  (B) blanket 毛毯  (C) sheet 床單  (D) bench 長椅。滴水的管件為 leaky faucet。"},{"number":10,"stem":"The firefighter carried a heavy metal ______ of sand to extinguish the small chemical flame.","options":["pillow","bucket","sheet","armchair"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: bucket (水桶；提桶) 【全文中譯】消防隊員提著一金屬桶沙子，以撲滅微小的化學火焰。 【選項解析】(A) pillow 枕頭  (B) bucket 提桶  (C) sheet 床單  (D) armchair 扶手椅。提裝沙子用 metal bucket。"},{"number":11,"stem":"After hiking five miles through the forest, the couple sat down on a rustic wooden ______ to drink water.","options":["sheet","sink","bench","faucet"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: bench (長凳) 【全文中譯】在穿越森林健行五英里後，這對伴侶在一張質樸的木長椅上坐下喝水。 【選項解析】(A) sheet 床單  (B) sink 水槽  (C) bench 長凳  (D) faucet 水龍頭。健行休憩坐在 rustic wooden bench。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Grandmother enjoys knitting sweaters while sitting comfortably in her favorite reclining ______.","options":["bucket","tub","pillow","armchair"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: armchair (單人扶手椅) 【全文中譯】祖母喜歡舒適地坐在她最喜歡的躺椅式單人扶手椅裡織毛衣。 【選項解析】(A) bucket 水桶  (B) tub 浴缸  (C) pillow 枕頭  (D) armchair 扶手椅。單人斜躺椅為 reclining armchair。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The little boy had a playful fight with his sister using a fluffy feather ______ on the bed.","options":["pillow","faucet","sink","bench"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pillow (枕頭) 【全文中譯】小男孩在床上用蓬鬆的羽毛枕頭和他的妹妹展開了嬉戲打鬧。 【選項解析】(A) pillow 枕頭  (B) faucet 水龍頭  (C) sink 水槽  (D) bench 長椅。枕頭戰為 fluffy feather pillow fight。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The teacher handed each student a clean ______ of blank paper to write their creative poetry assignment.","options":["tub","sheet","armchair","bucket"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: sheet (一張) 【全文中譯】老師分發給每位學生一張乾淨的空白紙，供他們書寫創意詩歌作業。 【選項解析】(A) tub 桶  (B) sheet 一張紙  (C) armchair 扶手椅  (D) bucket 水桶。a clean sheet of blank paper（一張白紙）。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The homeless shelter collected hundreds of thermal ______ to distribute to people during the cold wave.","options":["faucets","sinks","blankets","benches"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: blanket (保暖毯) 【全文中譯】遊民收容所募集了數百條保暖毯，準備在寒流期間分發給民眾。 【選項解析】(A) faucets 水龍頭  (B) sinks 水槽  (C) blankets 保暖毯  (D) benches 長椅。寒流發送物資為 thermal blankets。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Soap scum accumulated around the porcelain bathroom ______ because no one had cleaned it for weeks.","options":["armchair","pillow","sheet","sink"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: sink (洗手槽) 【全文中譯】陶瓷浴室水槽周圍積滿了肥皂垢，因為已經好幾週沒人清理了。 【選項解析】(A) armchair 扶手椅  (B) pillow 枕頭  (C) sheet 床單  (D) sink 洗手槽。浴室洗臉槽為 porcelain bathroom sink。"},{"number":17,"stem":"After a stressful day at the office, relaxing in a hot scented ______ helps relieve physical tension.","options":["tub","bench","faucet","mirror"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: tub (浴缸) 【全文中譯】在辦公室度過充滿壓力的一天後，在熱香氛浴缸裡放鬆能舒緩身體緊繃。 【選項解析】(A) tub 浴缸  (B) bench 長凳  (C) faucet 水龍頭  (D) mirror 鏡子。泡香氛熱水澡在 hot scented tub。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The driver adjusted his rear-view ______ carefully before backing the minivan out of the tight driveway.","options":["bucket","mirror","blanket","sheet"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: mirror (後視鏡) 【全文中譯】在將休旅車倒出狹窄車道前，駕駛仔細調整了他的車內後視鏡。 【選項解析】(A) bucket 水桶  (B) mirror 鏡子  (C) blanket 毛毯  (D) sheet 床單。後照鏡為 rear-view mirror。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Don't leave the garden ______ running while you answer the phone, or you will waste gallons of water.","options":["pillow","armchair","faucet","sheet"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: faucet (水龍頭) 【全文中譯】接聽電話時不要讓花園水龍頭一直開著流水，否則會浪費數加侖水資源。 【選項解析】(A) pillow 枕頭  (B) armchair 扶手椅  (C) faucet 水龍頭  (D) sheet 床單。戶外龍頭為 garden faucet。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The little boy took his colorful plastic shovel and ______ to build sandcastles along the seaside beach.","options":["sheet","mirror","bench","bucket"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: bucket (小水桶) 【全文中譯】小男孩拿著他色彩繽紛的塑膠小鏟子和水桶，在海邊沙灘上建造沙堡。 【選項解析】(A) sheet 床單  (B) mirror 鏡子  (C) bench 長椅  (D) bucket 水桶。沙灘玩沙玩具為 shovel and bucket。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Tourists sat on the green park ______ to eat takeout sandwiches and enjoy the afternoon sunshine.","options":["bench","faucet","sink","pillow"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: bench (長椅) 【全文中譯】觀光客坐在綠色公園長椅上吃外帶三明治，享受午後陽光照拂。 【選項解析】(A) bench 長椅  (B) faucet 水龍頭  (C) sink 水槽  (D) pillow 枕頭。公園長椅為 green park bench。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Father rested his weary head against the cushioned back of the antique ______ and watched television.","options":["tub","armchair","bucket","sheet"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: armchair (單人沙發椅) 【全文中譯】父親把疲憊的頭靠在古董單人沙發椅的軟墊靠背上看電視。 【選項解析】(A) tub 浴缸  (B) armchair 單人椅  (C) bucket 水桶  (D) sheet 床單。古董單人扶手沙發為 antique armchair。"},{"number":23,"stem":"If you wake up with neck pain every day, you probably need a firmer orthopedic ______.","options":["bucket","faucet","pillow","sink"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: pillow (枕頭) 【全文中譯】如果你每天醒來都脖子痛，你可能需要一個更堅挺的人體工學枕頭。 【選項解析】(A) bucket 水桶  (B) faucet 水龍頭  (C) pillow 枕頭  (D) sink 水槽。支撐頸椎的枕頭為 firmer orthopedic pillow。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Housekeeping staff at the resort replace the cotton bed ______ after each guest checks out of the room.","options":["faucet","armchair","tub","sheet"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: sheet (床單) 【全文中譯】度假村的房務人員在每位房客退房之後都會更換棉質床單。 【選項解析】(A) faucet 水龍頭  (B) armchair 扶手椅  (C) tub 浴缸  (D) sheet 床單。換洗床單為 cotton bed sheet。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Even during chilly autumn evenings, wrapping a warm fleece ______ over your legs keeps you cozy outdoors.","options":["blanket","sink","faucet","mirror"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: blanket (刷毛毯) 【全文中譯】即使在涼颼颼的秋日傍晚，在雙腿上披一條溫暖的刷毛毯能讓你在戶外保持舒適。 【選項解析】(A) blanket 毛毯  (B) sink 水槽  (C) faucet 水龍頭  (D) mirror 鏡子。蓋在腿上的保暖被為 warm fleece blanket。"}]},{"unit":19,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 19 (019.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Household Hardware, Lighting & Everyday Gadgets | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"toilet","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a fixed bowl with a seat and water flush system used for urination and defecation","chinese":"抽水馬桶；洗手間","sentence":"When traveling on a long-distance express train, you can find a clean public ______ at either end of the carriage.","translation":"在長途特快車上旅行時，你可以在車廂的任一端找到一間乾淨的公用洗手間（抽水馬桶）。"},{"word":"candle","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a cylinder of wax with a central wick burned to provide light or fragrance","chinese":"蠟燭","sentence":"When the sudden thunderstorm caused a blackout across the neighborhood, grandmother lit a scented ______ on the dining table.","translation":"當突如其來的雷雨導致整個社區停電時，祖母在餐桌上點燃了一支香氛蠟燭。"},{"word":"flashlight","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a portable handheld battery-powered electric lamp","chinese":"手電筒","sentence":"The security guard carried a heavy-duty LED ______ while patrolling the dark warehouse grounds at midnight.","translation":"警衛在半夜巡邏黑暗的倉庫廠區時，手裡拿著一支高功率的LED手電筒。"},{"word":"needle","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a very thin pointed steel tool with an eye for thread used in sewing","chinese":"縫紉針；指針","sentence":"Aunt Mary threaded a sharp steel ______ carefully before mending the torn sleeve on her husband's wool jacket.","translation":"瑪麗姑姑在修補丈夫羊毛夾克上破損的袖子之前，小心翼翼地穿好了一根鋒利的鋼縫紉針。"},{"word":"pin (pin / pinned / pinned)","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a tiny thin piece of metal used for fastening clothes or paper","chinese":"大頭針；別針；別住","sentence":"The tailor used a sharp silver ______ to hold the pant cuff in place before he began sewing the hem.","translation":"裁縫師在開始縫製褲管邊緣之前，用一枚鋒利的銀色別針把褲腳固定在原位。"},{"word":"hanger","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a curved piece of wood, metal, or plastic on which clothes are hung","chinese":"衣架","sentence":"Please hang your damp winter raincoat neatly on a sturdy wooden ______ instead of throwing it over the couch.","translation":"請把你潮濕的冬季雨衣整齊掛在堅固的木衣架上，不要隨手扔在沙發上。"},{"word":"lock (lock / locked / locked)","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a mechanism for keeping a door secure; to fasten with a key","chinese":"門鎖；上鎖","sentence":"Before our family leaves the house for a long vacation, father always checks that the front door ______ is secure.","translation":"在我們全家出門度長假之前，父親總是會檢查前門門鎖是否已經鎖好牢固。"},{"word":"freezer","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a refrigerated cabinet or room preserved at below freezing temperatures","chinese":"冷凍庫；冷凍櫃","sentence":"Mother bought two large tubs of vanilla ice cream and placed them immediately inside the kitchen ______ to keep firm.","translation":"母親買了兩大桶香草冰淇淋，並立刻放進廚房冷凍庫以保持硬度。"},{"word":"recorder","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an apparatus for recording sound or visual signals digitally or on tape","chinese":"錄音機；記錄器；直笛","sentence":"The university journalist placed a digital audio ______ on the interview table to capture every word accurately.","translation":"大學校刊記者在訪談桌上放了一台數位錄音機，以便準確記錄下每一個字。"},{"word":"video","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"the recording, reproducing, or broadcasting of moving visual images","chinese":"影片；錄影；錄製影片","sentence":"During my sister's high school graduation ceremony, my proud father recorded the entire event on digital ______.","translation":"在我姊姊的高中畢業典禮上，我引以為傲的父親用數位影片記錄下了整場活動。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Excuse me, could you tell me where the nearest public ______ is located in this department store?","options":["toilet","candle","needle","lock"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: toilet (洗手間；馬桶) 【全文中譯】不好意思，你能告訴我這家百貨公司最近的公用洗手間在哪裡嗎？ 【選項解析】(A) toilet 洗手間  (B) candle 蠟燭  (C) needle 針  (D) lock 門鎖。百貨公司公廁為 public toilet。"},{"number":2,"stem":"On her ninth birthday, the birthday girl made a silent wish and blew out all nine ______ on the cake.","options":["toilets","candles","needles","freezers"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: candle (蠟燭) 【全文中譯】在她九歲生日那天，壽星默默許了願，吹熄了蛋糕上全部的九支蠟燭。 【選項解析】(A) toilets 馬桶  (B) candles 蠟燭  (C) needles 針  (D) freezers 冷凍櫃。蛋糕上吹熄 candles。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The campers walked through the dense woods at midnight using a battery-powered ______ to illuminate the trail.","options":["hanger","needle","flashlight","lock"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: flashlight (手電筒) 【全文中譯】露營者在半夜穿越茂密森林，使用電池供電的手電筒照亮山徑。 【選項解析】(A) hanger 衣架  (B) needle 針  (C) flashlight 手電筒  (D) lock 門鎖。夜晚照亮路徑使用 flashlight。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Grandma put on her reading glasses so that she could thread the tiny eye of the sewing ______.","options":["candle","toilet","freezer","needle"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: needle (縫紉針) 【全文中譯】祖母戴上老花眼鏡，這樣她才能把線穿過縫紉針細小的針眼。 【選項解析】(A) candle 蠟燭  (B) toilet 馬桶  (C) freezer 冷凍庫  (D) needle 縫紉針。針眼穿線為 eye of the sewing needle。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The doctor fastened the paper name tag to the lapel of her white coat using a small gold safety ______.","options":["pin","toilet","freezer","candle"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pin (別針) 【全文中譯】女醫生用一枚小金安全別針，把紙質名牌別在她白袍的翻領上。 【選項解析】(A) pin 別針  (B) toilet 馬桶  (C) freezer 冷凍櫃  (D) candle 蠟燭。別名牌使用 safety pin。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Don't leave your tailored suit crumpled on the desk; suspend it neatly upon a plastic coat ______.","options":["candle","hanger","needle","toilet"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: hanger (衣架) 【全文中譯】不要把你的合身西裝皺巴巴地丟在桌上，整齊地吊掛在塑膠衣架上吧。 【選項解析】(A) candle 蠟燭  (B) hanger 衣架  (C) needle 針  (D) toilet 馬桶。掛衣服用 coat hanger。"},{"number":7,"stem":"Make sure to turn the brass key twice to secure the deadbolt ______ on the main entrance door.","options":["candle","needle","lock","freezer"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: lock (門鎖) 【全文中譯】請務必轉動黃銅鑰匙兩圈，以確保大門上的固定鎖栓鎖牢固。 【選項解析】(A) candle 蠟燭  (B) needle 針  (C) lock 門鎖  (D) freezer 冷凍櫃。鑰匙上鎖為 deadbolt lock。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Keep raw salmon and meat dumplings frozen at minus twenty degrees inside the deep ______.","options":["toilet","candle","needle","freezer"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: freezer (冷凍庫) 【全文中譯】將生鮭魚和生肉水餃放在深度冷凍櫃中，保持在零下二十度冰凍。 【選項解析】(A) toilet 馬桶  (B) candle 蠟燭  (C) needle 針  (D) freezer 冷凍庫。維持零下20度低溫為 deep freezer。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The detective pressed the record button on his pocket voice ______ to save the witness statement.","options":["recorder","candle","toilet","needle"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: recorder (錄音機) 【全文中譯】刑警按下口袋錄音機上的錄音鍵，以完整保存目擊者的證詞。 【選項解析】(A) recorder 錄音機  (B) candle 蠟燭  (C) toilet 馬桶  (D) needle 針。存證錄音使用 voice recorder。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Millions of students watch educational science ______ on YouTube to help them review difficult exam concepts.","options":["candles","videos","needles","toilets"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: video (影片) 【全文中譯】數百萬名學生在YouTube上觀看自然科學教育影片，協助複習難懂的考試觀念。 【選項解析】(A) candles 蠟燭  (B) videos 影片  (C) needles 針  (D) toilets 馬桶。網路觀看教學影片為 educational science videos。"},{"number":11,"stem":"After using the private restroom, remember to push the handle downward to flush the porcelain ______.","options":["candle","needle","toilet","lock"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: toilet (抽水馬桶) 【全文中譯】使用完私人洗手間後，記得將把手往下壓以沖洗陶瓷馬桶。 【選項解析】(A) candle 蠟燭  (B) needle 針  (C) toilet 馬桶  (D) lock 門鎖。沖水馬桶為 flush the porcelain toilet。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The romantic restaurant set a flickering wax ______ in a glass holder on every single dining table.","options":["toilet","needle","freezer","candle"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: candle (蠟燭) 【全文中譯】這家浪漫餐廳在每張餐桌的玻璃燭台裡都擺了一支閃爍的蠟燭。 【選項解析】(A) toilet 馬桶  (B) needle 針  (C) freezer 冷凍櫃  (D) candle 蠟燭。餐桌氣氛點燃 wax candle。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Always keep a spare ______ and extra alkaline batteries in your car's emergency glove compartment.","options":["flashlight","toilet","needle","hanger"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: flashlight (手電筒) 【全文中譯】請隨時在車子的緊急手套箱中備有一支備用手電筒和多餘的鹼性電池。 【選項解析】(A) flashlight 手電筒  (B) toilet 馬桶  (C) needle 針  (D) hanger 衣架。緊急照明必備 spare flashlight。"},{"number":14,"stem":"A nurse cleaned the sharp hypodermic ______ with rubbing alcohol before administering the annual flu vaccine.","options":["toilet","needle","candle","lock"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: needle (注射針頭) 【全文中譯】護理師在施打年度流感疫苗之前，先用消毒酒精擦拭鋒利的皮下注射針頭。 【選項解析】(A) toilet 馬桶  (B) needle 注射針頭  (C) candle 蠟燭  (D) lock 門鎖。醫用針頭為 hypodermic needle。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The teacher used a colorful thumb ______ to attach the class field trip schedule to the cork noticeboard.","options":["toilet","candle","pin","freezer"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: pin (圖釘) 【全文中譯】老師用一枚彩色圖釘把班級校外教學日程表固定在軟木公告欄上。 【選項解析】(A) toilet 馬桶  (B) candle 蠟燭  (C) pin 圖釘  (D) freezer 冷凍櫃。固定紙張於軟木板用 thumb pin。"},{"number":16,"stem":"There were no empty coat ______ left in the restaurant cloakroom, so the waiter folded my jacket over a chair.","options":["toilets","needles","candles","hangers"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: hanger (衣架) 【全文中譯】餐廳寄物處沒有多餘的衣架了，所以服務生把我的夾克折疊放在椅子上。 【選項解析】(A) toilets 馬桶  (B) needles 針  (C) candles 蠟燭  (D) hangers 衣架。寄物懸掛使用 coat hangers。"},{"number":17,"stem":"A thief tried to pick the heavy iron pad ______ with a bent metal wire, but the security alarm sounded.","options":["lock","candle","toilet","needle"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: lock (鎖頭；掛鎖) 【全文中譯】小偷試圖用彎曲金屬線撬開笨重的鐵掛鎖，但安全警報器響了。 【選項解析】(A) lock 掛鎖  (B) candle 蠟燭  (C) toilet 馬桶  (D) needle 針。被撬開的五金為 pad lock。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Ice cream and frozen popsicles will melt into sticky liquid if you fail to store them in the ______.","options":["candle","freezer","toilet","needle"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: freezer (冷凍庫) 【全文中譯】如果你沒把冰淇淋和冰棒放進冷凍庫裡保存，它們會融化成黏稠的液體。 【選項解析】(A) candle 蠟燭  (B) freezer 冷凍庫  (C) toilet 馬桶  (D) needle 針。防融化置於 freezer。"},{"number":19,"stem":"In elementary school music class, all fourth-grade children learn how to play simple songs on a plastic ______.","options":["toilet","candle","recorder","needle"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: recorder (直笛) 【全文中譯】在國小音樂課上，所有四年級的孩子都會學習如何在塑膠直笛上吹奏簡單歌曲。 【選項解析】(A) toilet 馬桶  (B) candle 蠟燭  (C) recorder 直笛  (D) needle 針。學校吹奏樂器為 plastic recorder。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The police reviewed the security camera surveillance ______ to identify the vehicle involved in the hit-and-run.","options":["candle","needle","toilet","video"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: video (錄影片段) 【全文中譯】警方調閱監視攝影機的監控錄影畫面，以辨識涉及肇事逃逸的車輛。 【選項解析】(A) candle 蠟燭  (B) needle 針  (C) toilet 馬桶  (D) video 錄影畫面。監視器影像為 surveillance video。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The airline flight attendant reminded passengers that smoking inside the aircraft ______ is strictly prohibited by law.","options":["toilet","needle","candle","lock"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: toilet (洗手間) 【全文中譯】飛機空服員提醒旅客，法律嚴格禁止在飛機洗手間內吸菸。 【選項解析】(A) toilet 洗手間  (B) needle 針  (C) candle 蠟燭  (D) lock 門鎖。飛機上洗手間為 aircraft toilet。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Scented lavender ______ emit a calming aroma that helps soothe insomnia before going to sleep at night.","options":["toilets","candles","needles","locks"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: candle (香氛蠟燭) 【全文中譯】薰衣草香氛蠟燭能散發舒緩香氣，有助於在夜晚入睡前撫平失眠。 【選項解析】(A) toilets 馬桶  (B) candles 蠟燭  (C) needles 針  (D) locks 門鎖。放鬆薰香點燃 scented lavender candles。"},{"number":23,"stem":"When our fuse box tripped during the thunderstorm, dad reached into the drawer for a reliable ______.","options":["needle","toilet","flashlight","hanger"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: flashlight (手電筒) 【全文中譯】暴風雨中保險絲跳電時，爸爸伸手到抽屜裡拿出一支可靠的手電筒。 【選項解析】(A) needle 針  (B) toilet 馬桶  (C) flashlight 手電筒  (D) hanger 衣架。停電備用照明為 reliable flashlight。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Searching for a missing sewing ______ on a shaggy carpet is very difficult and dangerous for bare feet.","options":["toilet","candle","lock","needle"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: needle (縫紉針) 【全文中譯】在長毛地毯上尋找掉落的縫紉針非常困難，而且對赤腳來說非常危險。 【選項解析】(A) toilet 馬桶  (B) candle 蠟燭  (C) lock 門鎖  (D) needle 縫紉針。掉落的尖銳金屬是 sewing needle。"},{"number":25,"stem":"When the customer bought a dress, the cashier attached the paper price tag with a small metal ______.","options":["pin","toilet","freezer","candle"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pin (別針) 【全文中譯】當顧客買下洋裝時，收銀員用一枚小金屬別針將紙質價格標籤固定好。 【選項解析】(A) pin 別針  (B) toilet 馬桶  (C) freezer 冷凍庫  (D) candle 蠟燭。固定標籤使用 small metal pin。"}]},{"unit":20,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 20 (020.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Sports, Leisure Activities & Camping Recreation | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"activity","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a thing that a person or group does or has done","chinese":"活動","sentence":"The summer camp offered many exciting outdoor ______ such as kayaking, rock climbing, and forest hiking.","translation":"夏令營提供了許多令人興奮的戶外活動，例如划皮艇、攀岩以及森林健行。"},{"word":"badminton","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a court game played with lightweight rackets and a shuttlecock","chinese":"羽毛球運動","sentence":"After finishing classes on Friday afternoon, Kevin and his classmate played three intense games of ______.","translation":"星期五下午放學後，凱文和他的同學在體育館打了三場激烈的羽毛球比賽。"},{"word":"bowling","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a game in which players roll a heavy ball down a wooden lane to knock down pins","chinese":"保齡球運動","sentence":"For my brother's sixteenth birthday celebration, we booked two lanes at the downtown ______ alley.","translation":"為了慶祝我弟弟的十六歲生日，我們在市中心的保齡球館預訂了兩個球道。"},{"word":"football","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a game played with an oval ball on an outdoor field; American football or soccer","chinese":"美式足球；橄欖球；足球","sentence":"High school students gathered at the outdoor stadium on Friday night to cheer for their varsity ______ team.","translation":"高中生們週五晚上聚集在戶外體育場，為他們的學校美式足球代表隊加油吶喊。"},{"word":"frisbee","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a plastic flying disc thrown for recreation or in competitive team sports","chinese":"飛盤","sentence":"On sunny Saturday afternoons, dog owners gather in the riverside park and toss a bright plastic ______ to their pets.","translation":"在陽光明媚的週六午後，養狗人士聚集在河濱公園，向他們的寵物拋擲鮮豔的塑膠飛盤。"},{"word":"golf","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a club-and-ball sport played across an outdoor course of 9 or 18 holes","chinese":"高爾夫球","sentence":"My retired grandfather plays eighteen holes of ______ every Wednesday morning with his former business partners.","translation":"我退休的祖父每週三早上都會與他以前的商業夥伴打十八洞高爾夫球。"},{"word":"soccer","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a football game played between two teams of eleven players with a round ball","chinese":"足球（英式足球）","sentence":"During the FIFA World Cup tournament, millions of passionate fans watch their national ______ team on television.","translation":"在國際足協世界盃錦標賽期間，數以百萬計的熱情球迷在電視機前觀看他們的國家足球隊比賽。"},{"word":"volleyball","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a team game played by hitting an inflated ball back and forth over a high net","chinese":"排球","sentence":"During their summer vacation at Kenting, the teenagers enjoyed playing beach ______ under the blue sky.","translation":"在墾丁放暑假期間，青少年們在藍天下的沙灘上盡情享受打沙灘排球的樂趣。"},{"word":"tent","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a portable shelter made of fabric supported by poles and ropes","chinese":"帳篷","sentence":"Before the mountain rainstorm arrived, the hikers pitched their waterproof canvas ______ on high ground.","translation":"在山區暴風雨來臨之前，登山者們在高地上搭起了他們的防水帆布帳篷。"},{"word":"chess","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a strategic board game for two players played on a checkered board with sixteen pieces each","chinese":"西洋棋；國際象棋","sentence":"Grandmaster players must think three or four moves ahead when competing in a national ______ championship.","translation":"國際特級大師在參加全國西洋棋錦標賽時，必須提前深思熟慮三到四步棋。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Regular physical ______ such as jogging and swimming helps keep your heart healthy and reduces stress.","options":["activity","tent","frisbee","chess"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: activity (活動) 【全文中譯】慢跑和游泳等規律的身體活動有助於保持心臟健康並減輕壓力。 【選項解析】(A) activity 活動  (B) tent 帳篷  (C) frisbee 飛盤  (D) chess 西洋棋。身體活動為 physical activity。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Samuel bought a professional carbon-fiber racket and a tube of goose feather shuttlecocks for ______.","options":["football","badminton","bowling","golf"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: badminton (羽毛球) 【全文中譯】塞繆爾買了一支專業碳纖維球拍和一筒鵝毛羽毛球來打羽球。 【選項解析】(A) football 美式足球  (B) badminton 羽毛球  (C) bowling 保齡球  (D) golf 高爾夫。羽球器材為 shuttlecock for badminton。"},{"number":3,"stem":"When you roll the heavy ball down the polished lane and knock down all ten pins in ______, you score a strike.","options":["soccer","chess","bowling","golf"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: bowling (保齡球) 【全文中譯】當你在保齡球運動中將重球滾下磨光球道並擊倒所有十個球瓶時，就是全倒。 【選項解析】(A) soccer 足球  (B) chess 西洋棋  (C) bowling 保齡球  (D) golf 高爾夫。擊倒十瓶為 bowling strike。"},{"number":4,"stem":"In American high schools, playing on the varsity ______ team is considered a great athletic achievement.","options":["chess","tent","activity","football"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: football (美式足球) 【全文中譯】在美國高中，加入學校美式足球代表隊被視為一項重大的體育成就。 【選項解析】(A) chess 西洋棋  (B) tent 帳篷  (C) activity 活動  (D) football 美式足球。學校校隊為 varsity football team。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The border collie jumped two feet into the air to catch the spinning yellow plastic ______ with its teeth.","options":["frisbee","golf","bowling","chess"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: frisbee (飛盤) 【全文中譯】這隻邊境牧羊犬躍入空中兩英尺高，用牙齒接住了旋轉的黃色塑膠飛盤。 【選項解析】(A) frisbee 飛盤  (B) golf 高爾夫  (C) bowling 保齡球  (D) chess 西洋棋。空中旋轉拋接玩具為 plastic frisbee。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Wealthy executives often conduct informal business negotiations while walking across a green ______ course.","options":["chess","golf","badminton","volleyball"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: golf (高爾夫球) 【全文中譯】富裕的企業主管經常在漫步走過翠綠的高爾夫球場時進行非正式商業談判。 【選項解析】(A) chess 西洋棋  (B) golf 高爾夫  (C) badminton 羽毛球  (D) volleyball 排球。綠草球場為 golf course。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The Brazilian athlete kicked the black-and-white ball into the top corner of the goal net during the ______ match.","options":["bowling","golf","soccer","chess"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: soccer (足球) 【全文中譯】巴西運動員在足球比賽中將黑白相間的皮球踢進球門網的上角得分。 【選項解析】(A) bowling 保齡球  (B) golf 高爾夫  (C) soccer 足球  (D) chess 西洋棋。黑白皮球踢進球門為 soccer match。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Two teams of six players dive across the indoor court to prevent the leather ball from hitting the floor in ______.","options":["chess","golf","tent","volleyball"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: volleyball (排球) 【全文中譯】在排球運動中，兩支各六人的隊伍在室內球場奮力撲救，防止皮球落水。 【選項解析】(A) chess 西洋棋  (B) golf 高爾夫  (C) tent 帳篷  (D) volleyball 排球。隔網擊球為 volleyball。"},{"number":9,"stem":"We hammered four steel pegs firmly into the soil to prevent our camping ______ from blowing away in the wind.","options":["tent","chess","activity","bowling"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: tent (帳篷) 【全文中譯】我們將四根鋼營釘牢固敲進泥土中，以防止露營帳篷在狂風中被吹走。 【選項解析】(A) tent 帳篷  (B) chess 西洋棋  (C) activity 活動  (D) bowling 保齡球。防風固定為 camping tent。"},{"number":10,"stem":"In the ancient strategic board game of ______, the ultimate objective is to trap and checkmate the opponent's king.","options":["golf","chess","soccer","football"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: chess (西洋棋) 【全文中譯】在古老的策略棋盤遊戲西洋棋中，最終目標是困住並將死對手的國王。 【選項解析】(A) golf 高爾夫  (B) chess 西洋棋  (C) soccer 足球  (D) football 美式足球。圍困將死國王為 game of chess。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Physical education teachers organize a variety of group sports ______ to keep elementary students active.","options":["tents","frisbees","activities","golfs"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: activity (活動) 【全文中譯】體育老師組織各種團體體育活動，讓小學生保持活躍好動。 【選項解析】(A) tents 帳篷  (B) frisbees 飛盤  (C) activities 活動  (D) golfs 高爾夫。運動項目為 group sports activities。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Hit the shuttlecock firmly over the high net with your racket so that your ______ opponent cannot return it.","options":["bowling","chess","golf","badminton"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: badminton (羽毛球) 【全文中譯】用球拍用力將羽毛球擊過高網，讓你的羽毛球對手無法回擊。 【選項解析】(A) bowling 保齡球  (B) chess 西洋棋  (C) golf 高爾夫  (D) badminton 羽毛球。羽毛球運動對手為 badminton opponent。"},{"number":13,"stem":"You must put on special leather-soled shoes before stepping onto the polished wooden floor of the ______ alley.","options":["bowling","football","chess","tent"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: bowling (保齡球) 【全文中譯】在踩上磨光木地板的保齡球球道之前，你必須先換上專用皮底鞋。 【選項解析】(A) bowling 保齡球  (B) football 美式足球  (C) chess 西洋棋  (D) tent 帳篷。保齡球場館為 bowling alley。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The quarterback threw a fifty-yard touchdown pass in the final seconds of the championship ______ game.","options":["golf","football","chess","bowling"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: football (美式足球) 【全文中譯】四分衛在冠軍美式足球賽的最後幾秒投擲了一記五十碼的達陣傳球。 【選項解析】(A) golf 高爾夫  (B) football 美式足球  (C) chess 西洋棋  (D) bowling 保齡球。四分衛傳球達陣為 football game。"},{"number":15,"stem":"College students relaxing on the campus lawn enjoyed throwing a neon orange ______ back and forth in the breeze.","options":["bowling","golf","frisbee","tent"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: frisbee (飛盤) 【全文中譯】在校園草坪上放鬆的大學生們享受在微風中來回拋擲螢光橘色飛盤。 【選項解析】(A) bowling 保齡球  (B) golf 高爾夫  (C) frisbee 飛盤  (D) tent 帳篷。草地上拋接玩具為 neon orange frisbee。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Players carry a set of fourteen metal and wooden clubs inside a heavy leather bag across the ______ course.","options":["chess","soccer","volleyball","golf"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: golf (高爾夫球) 【全文中譯】球員們在高爾夫球場上背著裝有一套十四支金屬與木質球桿的重皮袋。 【選項解析】(A) chess 西洋棋  (B) soccer 足球  (C) volleyball 排球  (D) golf 高爾夫。十四支球桿為 golf course 規則。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Referees blow their whistles and show yellow caution cards whenever a ______ player commits a dangerous sliding tackle.","options":["soccer","chess","bowling","golf"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: soccer (足球) 【全文中譯】每當足球員做出危險的鏟球動作時，裁判會吹哨並亮出黃牌警告。 【選項解析】(A) soccer 足球  (B) chess 西洋棋  (C) bowling 保齡球  (D) golf 高爾夫。鏟球亮黃牌為 soccer player。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Playing beach ______ in the soft sand provides an intense cardiovascular workout for your legs and shoulders.","options":["chess","volleyball","golf","bowling"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: volleyball (排球) 【全文中譯】在鬆軟沙灘上打沙灘排球為雙腿和肩膀提供了高強度的有氧鍛鍊。 【選項解析】(A) chess 西洋棋  (B) volleyball 排球  (C) golf 高爾夫  (D) bowling 保齡球。沙灘運動為 beach volleyball。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Because the heavy rain began to leak through the fabric, we covered our nylon camping ______ with a plastic tarp.","options":["chess","golf","tent","activity"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: tent (帳篷) 【全文中譯】因為大雨開始滲過布料，我們在尼龍露營帳篷上覆蓋了一張塑膠防水布。 【選項解析】(A) chess 西洋棋  (B) golf 高爾夫  (C) tent 帳篷  (D) activity 活動。露營遮蔽所為 nylon camping tent。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The Russian grandmaster spent forty minutes analyzing the board position before moving his wooden queen in ______.","options":["football","bowling","golf","chess"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: chess (西洋棋) 【全文中譯】俄羅斯特級大師在西洋棋中移動木製皇后棋子之前，花了四十分鐘分析局面。 【選項解析】(A) football 美式足球  (B) bowling 保齡球  (C) golf 高爾夫  (D) chess 西洋棋。棋局棋子移動為 game of chess。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Swimming, cycling, and mountain hiking are our family's favorite recreational weekend ______.","options":["activities","tents","golfs","frisbees"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: activity (活動) 【全文中譯】游泳、騎自行車以及登山健行是我們全家最喜愛的週末休閒活動。 【選項解析】(A) activities 活動  (B) tents 帳篷  (C) golfs 高爾夫  (D) frisbees 飛盤。休閒活動為 recreational weekend activities。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Fast reflexes and agile footwork are essential for anyone who aspires to play competitive singles ______.","options":["golf","badminton","bowling","chess"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: badminton (羽毛球) 【全文中譯】靈敏的反應速度和敏捷的步法對於渴望打好競技單打羽球的人至關重要。 【選項解析】(A) golf 高爾夫  (B) badminton 羽毛球  (C) bowling 保齡球  (D) chess 西洋棋。競賽單打為 competitive singles badminton。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Knocking down all remaining pins on your second ball roll in a ______ frame is known as picking up a spare.","options":["chess","football","bowling","golf"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: bowling (保齡球) 【全文中譯】在保齡球局中用第二球擊倒所有剩下的球瓶，在術語中被稱為補中（解球）。 【選項解析】(A) chess 西洋棋  (B) football 美式足球  (C) bowling 保齡球  (D) golf 高爾夫。補中為 picking up a spare in bowling。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Thousands of screaming spectators packed the stadium bleachers to witness the traditional college ______ rivalry.","options":["chess","bowling","golf","football"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: football (美式足球) 【全文中譯】數千名尖叫吶喊的觀眾擠滿了體育場看台，見證傳統的大學美式足球對決宿敵戰。 【選項解析】(A) chess 西洋棋  (B) bowling 保齡球  (C) golf 高爾夫  (D) football 美式足球。大學體育宿敵賽為 college football rivalry。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Throwing a lightweight aerodynamic ______ requires a smooth flick of the wrist and good wind control.","options":["frisbee","tent","chess","bowling"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: frisbee (飛盤) 【全文中譯】拋擲輕巧且符合空氣動力學的飛盤需要流暢的手腕抖動和良好的風向掌控。 【選項解析】(A) frisbee 飛盤  (B) tent 帳篷  (C) chess 西洋棋  (D) bowling 保齡球。空氣動力飛行盤為 aerodynamic frisbee。"}]},{"unit":21,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 21 (021.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Entertainment, Performing Arts & Musical Instruments | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"drama","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a play for theater, radio, or television; exciting events","chinese":"戲劇","sentence":"The high school English club staged a famous Shakespeare ______ in the school hall, and parents gave them a standing ovation.","translation":"高中英語社團在學校禮堂上演了一齣著名的莎士比亞戲劇，家長們起立給予他們熱烈鼓掌。"},{"word":"film","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a motion picture; thin layer; to record moving pictures","chinese":"電影；膠卷；拍攝","sentence":"We stayed home on Friday night to watch an award-winning documentary ______, but my younger sister fell asleep on the couch.","translation":"我們週五晚上留在家裡看一部獲獎的紀錄片電影，但我妹妹卻在沙發上睡著了。"},{"word":"cartoon","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an animated film or a humorous drawing in a newspaper","chinese":"卡通；漫畫","sentence":"Children usually wake up very early on Saturday mornings to watch their favorite ______ on television while eating cereal.","translation":"孩子們通常在週六早晨很早就起床，一邊吃麥片一邊看電視上他們最喜歡的卡通。"},{"word":"KTV","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a commercial entertainment venue where people sing karaoke","chinese":"KTV；卡拉OK包廂","sentence":"After completing our final semester examinations, our classmates booked a private room at a nearby ______ to sing pop songs.","translation":"完成期末考試後，我們同班同學在附近的一家 KTV 預訂了一間包廂唱流行歌曲。"},{"word":"MTV","pos":"(n.)","definition":"Music Television; music videos broadcast on screen","chinese":"音樂電視；音樂錄影帶頻道","sentence":"During the summer holidays, teenagers spent hours watching trendy pop songs and artist interviews on ______, which was very popular.","translation":"在暑假期間，青少年花好幾個小時在 MTV 上觀看熱門流行歌曲和藝人訪談，這在當時非常流行。"},{"word":"jazz","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a type of modern music with strong rhythms and improvisation","chinese":"爵士樂","sentence":"The cozy downtown cafe invited a talented saxophone player to perform live ______ every Friday evening, so many customers arrived early.","translation":"市中心那家溫馨的咖啡館邀請了一位才華洋溢的薩克斯風樂手在每週五傍晚現場演奏爵士樂，所以許多顧客很早就抵達了。"},{"word":"drum","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a musical percussion instrument; to beat repeatedly","chinese":"鼓；打鼓","sentence":"Kevin joined the marching band as the main rhythm player, so he practiced beating the bass ______ for two hours every afternoon.","translation":"凱文加入行進樂隊擔任主要節奏手，所以他每天下午花兩個小時練習敲擊大鼓。"},{"word":"flute","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a high-pitched wind instrument made of wood or metal","chinese":"長笛","sentence":"Sarah stood under the spotlight on stage and played a sweet melody on her silver ______, which touched everyone in the auditorium.","translation":"莎拉站在舞台的聚光燈下，用她的銀色長笛吹奏出甜美的旋律，感動了禮堂裡的每個人。"},{"word":"guitar","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a musical instrument usually with six strings played by plucking","chinese":"吉他","sentence":"Jason sat beside the warm campfire on the beach and strummed his acoustic ______ while his friends sang classic folk songs together.","translation":"傑森坐在海灘溫暖的營火旁撥弄著他的民謠吉他，而他的朋友們則一起哼唱著經典民謠。"},{"word":"trumpet","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a brass musical instrument with a flared bell and valves","chinese":"小號；喇叭","sentence":"The brass band leader raised his hand to start the march, and the loud sound of the golden ______ echoed across the athletic field.","translation":"銅管樂隊指揮舉手示意開始進行曲，金黃色小號響亮的聲音隨即在運動場上迴盪。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The school music department formed a brass ensemble, and Mark was chosen to play the shiny golden ______.","options":["flute","drum","trumpet","guitar"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: trumpet (小號；喇叭) 【全文中譯】學校音樂系組建了一個銅管樂隊，馬克被選中演奏閃亮的金色小號。 【選項解析】(A) flute 長笛 (B) drum 鼓 (C) trumpet 小號 (D) guitar 吉他。由 brass ensemble（銅管樂團）與 shiny golden 可知選 trumpet。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Every Sunday morning, little kids sit in front of the screen laughing happily at an entertaining animal ______.","options":["cartoon","drama","film","KTV"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: cartoon (卡通；動畫) 【全文中譯】每逢週日早晨，小孩子們坐在螢幕前開心地看著逗趣的動物卡通大笑。 【選項解析】(A) cartoon 卡通 (B) drama 戲劇 (C) film 電影 (D) KTV 卡拉OK包廂。由 little kids 與 laughing at entertaining animal 可知選 cartoon。"},{"number":3,"stem":"When we camped on the mountain top last weekend, our music teacher brought his wooden ______ and taught us folk tunes.","options":["trumpet","flute","guitar","drum"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: guitar (吉他) 【全文中譯】上週末我們在山頂露營時，音樂老師帶了他的木吉他教我們民謠曲調。 【選項解析】(A) trumpet 小號 (B) flute 長笛 (C) guitar 吉他 (D) drum 鼓。露營彈唱民謠最常使用 wooden acoustic guitar。"},{"number":4,"stem":"The director spent over three years in the rainforest to shoot a breathtaking nature ______ about endangered animals.","options":["film","KTV","MTV","jazz"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: film (電影；紀錄片) 【全文中譯】導演在雨林中花了三年多時間拍攝了一部關於瀕危動物的令人驚嘆的自然電影。 【選項解析】(A) film 電影 (B) KTV (C) MTV (D) jazz 爵士樂。由 shoot a breathtaking nature... 可知此處指電影/紀錄片 film。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The rock concert was so energetic that the sound of the loud bass ______ could be felt vibrating through the arena floor.","options":["flute","drum","trumpet","guitar"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: drum (鼓) 【全文中譯】搖滾音樂會活力十足，以至於大低音鼓的響亮聲音在體育場地板上震動。 【選項解析】(A) flute 長笛 (B) drum 鼓 (C) trumpet 小號 (D) guitar 吉他。由 bass drum（低音大鼓）與 vibrating the floor 可知選 drum。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Linda took deep breaths and placed her lips on the mouth hole of the silver ______ to play a calm classical tune.","options":["drum","trumpet","flute","guitar"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: flute (長笛) 【全文中譯】琳達深吸一口氣，將嘴唇貼在銀色長笛的吹孔上吹出平靜的古典曲調。 【選項解析】(A) drum 鼓 (B) trumpet 小號 (C) flute 長笛 (D) guitar 吉他。由 mouth hole（吹孔）與 silver 可知為長笛 flute。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The theatrical troupe performed an intense historical ______ about ancient emperors that received rave reviews from critics.","options":["drama","cartoon","MTV","KTV"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: drama (戲劇) 【全文中譯】該劇團演出了一齣關於古代帝王的緊張歷史劇，獲得評論家的一致好評。 【選項解析】(A) drama 戲劇 (B) cartoon 卡通 (C) MTV (D) KTV。劇團（theatrical troupe）演出歷史戲劇 drama。"},{"number":8,"stem":"In the 1990s, almost every teenager tuned their home television to ______ to discover the latest international music hits.","options":["film","MTV","drama","cartoon"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: MTV (音樂電視) 【全文中譯】在 1990 年代，幾乎所有青少年都將家裡的電視轉到 MTV 來發現最新的國際流行歌曲。 【選項解析】(A) film 電影 (B) MTV 音樂電視 (C) drama 戲劇 (D) cartoon 卡通。電視音樂頻道指 MTV。"},{"number":9,"stem":"For Amy's eighteenth birthday celebration, her best friends rented a soundproof room at a popular ______ downtown.","options":["cartoon","KTV","jazz","film"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: KTV (卡拉OK) 【全文中譯】為了慶祝艾米的十八歲生日，她最好的朋友們在市中心一家熱門的 KTV 租了一間隔音包廂。 【選項解析】(A) cartoon 卡通 (B) KTV (C) jazz 爵士樂 (D) film 電影。包廂唱歌娛樂場所為 KTV。"},{"number":10,"stem":"The cozy lounge near the river is famous for playing relaxing smooth ______ while guests chat softly over coffee.","options":["jazz","drama","cartoon","film"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: jazz (爵士樂) 【全文中譯】河畔這家溫馨的休閒酒吧以播放令人放鬆的輕爵士樂聞名，客人們在喝咖啡時輕聲交談。 【選項解析】(A) jazz 爵士樂 (B) drama 戲劇 (C) cartoon 卡通 (D) film 電影。smooth jazz（流暢爵士樂）為經典音樂類型。"},{"number":11,"stem":"You need to replace the third nylon string on your acoustic ______ because it broke during yesterday's rehearsal.","options":["flute","drum","guitar","trumpet"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: guitar (吉他) 【全文中譯】你需要更換原聲吉他上的第三根尼龍弦，因為它在昨天的排練中斷了。 【選項解析】(A) flute 長笛 (B) drum 鼓 (C) guitar 吉他 (D) trumpet 小號。弦樂器有 strings（琴弦），此處為 guitar。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The royal herald blew a clear signal on his brass ______ to announce the arrival of the queen at the ceremony.","options":["trumpet","guitar","flute","drum"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: trumpet (小號；號角) 【全文中譯】皇家傳令官吹響了他的銅號角發出清晰信號，在儀式上宣布女王的到來。 【選項解析】(A) trumpet 小號 (B) guitar 吉他 (C) flute 長笛 (D) drum 鼓。傳令官吹號（blew a signal on brass trumpet）。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The animated short ______ won an Oscar award because its hand-drawn pictures and humorous storyline were magnificent.","options":["drama","KTV","MTV","cartoon"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: cartoon (卡通；動畫短片) 【全文中譯】這部動畫短片獲得了奧斯卡獎，因為其手繪畫面和幽默故事情節非常壯麗。 【選項解析】(A) drama 戲劇 (B) KTV (C) MTV (D) cartoon 卡通。animated short cartoon（動畫短片）。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Peter wanted to learn percussion, so his parents bought him a pair of wooden sticks and a snare ______.","options":["guitar","trumpet","drum","flute"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: drum (鼓) 【全文中譯】彼得想學打擊樂，所以他的父母給他買了一對鼓棒和小軍鼓。 【選項解析】(A) guitar 吉他 (B) trumpet 小號 (C) drum 鼓 (D) flute 長笛。percussion（打擊樂）與 sticks、snare drum 相對應。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Many local actors auditioned for the leading role in the new television ______ produced by the public network.","options":["drama","MTV","KTV","jazz"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: drama (戲劇；電視劇) 【全文中譯】許多當地演員參加了公共電視網製作的新電視劇主角的試鏡。 【選項解析】(A) drama 戲劇 (B) MTV (C) KTV (D) jazz 爵士樂。television drama（電視劇）。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Because the movie tickets were completely sold out, we decided to stream a classic detective ______ on our laptop instead.","options":["KTV","film","cartoon","jazz"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: film (電影) 【全文中譯】因為電影票完全賣光了，我們決定改在筆記型電腦上看一部經典偵探電影。 【選項解析】(A) KTV (B) film 電影 (C) cartoon 卡通 (D) jazz 爵士樂。movie tickets 售罄改看 classic detective film。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Her fingers moved gracefully over the silver keys of the wind ______, producing high and airy notes in the quiet hall.","options":["drum","guitar","trumpet","flute"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: flute (長笛) 【全文中譯】她的手指優雅地在管樂長笛的銀鍵上移動，在安靜的禮堂吹出高亢空靈的音符。 【選項解析】(A) drum 鼓 (B) guitar 吉他 (C) trumpet 小號 (D) flute 長笛。wind instrument 與 silver keys 表長笛 flute。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The international youth hostel organized a Friday night session where guests sang karaoke just like in a private ______.","options":["KTV","drama","cartoon","film"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: KTV (卡拉OK) 【全文中譯】國際青年旅舍舉辦了週五晚會，讓房客像在私人 KTV 一樣引吭高歌。 【選項解析】(A) KTV (B) drama 戲劇 (C) cartoon 卡通 (D) film 電影。sang karaoke just like in a private KTV。"},{"number":19,"stem":"New Orleans is globally recognized as the historic birthplace of ______, attracting millions of music lovers each year.","options":["cartoon","jazz","drama","film"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: jazz (爵士樂) 【全文中譯】紐奧良被公認為爵士樂的歷史發源地，每年吸引數百萬音樂愛好者。 【選項解析】(A) cartoon 卡通 (B) jazz 爵士樂 (C) drama 戲劇 (D) film 電影。New Orleans is the birthplace of jazz。"},{"number":20,"stem":"Before music streaming websites were created, music video clips broadcast on ______ were the primary way to promote albums.","options":["MTV","drama","cartoon","KTV"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: MTV (音樂電視) 【全文中譯】在音樂串流網站出現之前，MTV 播放的音樂錄影帶是宣傳專輯的主要方式。 【選項解析】(A) MTV (B) drama 戲劇 (C) cartoon 卡通 (D) KTV。music video clips broadcast on MTV。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The street performer tapped his foot to the rhythm while plucking the steel strings of his six-string ______.","options":["drum","flute","guitar","trumpet"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: guitar (吉他) 【全文中譯】街頭藝人一邊隨著節奏踏腳，一邊撥動他的六弦吉他的鋼弦。 【選項解析】(A) drum 鼓 (B) flute 長笛 (C) guitar 吉他 (D) trumpet 小號。plucking the steel strings of a six-string guitar。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The military ceremony began with a solemn salute accompanied by a single soldier playing the ______ in the distance.","options":["flute","trumpet","guitar","drum"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: trumpet (小號；號角) 【全文中譯】軍事儀式在莊嚴的敬禮中開始，遠處傳來一名士兵吹奏號角的小號聲。 【選項解析】(A) flute 長笛 (B) trumpet 小號 (C) guitar 吉他 (D) drum 鼓。軍事號角演奏通常為 trumpet。"},{"number":23,"stem":"On Sunday afternoons, newspapers often include a colorful comic section filled with short strips and funny ______.","options":["films","cartoons","dramas","MTVs"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: cartoon (漫畫；卡通連環畫) 【全文中譯】在週日下午，報紙通常會附帶一個彩色的漫畫版面，上面有短篇連環畫和有趣的漫畫。 【選項解析】(A) films (B) cartoons (C) dramas (D) MTVs。comic section of newspapers filled with cartoons。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The theater company specializes in staging classical Greek ______ that explore human struggles and moral choices.","options":["drama","KTV","jazz","MTV"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: drama (戲劇) 【全文中譯】該劇團專門上演探索人類奮鬥與道德抉擇的古典希臘戲劇。 【選項解析】(A) drama 戲劇 (B) KTV (C) jazz 爵士樂 (D) MTV。classical Greek drama（古希臘戲劇）。"},{"number":25,"stem":"The energetic marching band marched onto the football field, led by the rhythmic beats of the big tenor ______.","options":["guitar","flute","trumpet","drum"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: drum (鼓) 【全文中譯】充滿活力的行進樂隊走進美式足球場，由中音大鼓有節奏的敲擊聲引領著前進。 【選項解析】(A) guitar 吉他 (B) flute 長笛 (C) trumpet 小號 (D) drum 鼓。rhythmic beats of the tenor drum。"}]},{"unit":22,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 22 (022.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Professions, Roles & Career Paths | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"violin","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a four-stringed wooden musical instrument played with a bow","chinese":"小提琴","sentence":"The orchestra concert master tucked the wooden ______ under her chin and played a beautiful solo that silenced the audience.","translation":"管弦樂團首席將木製小提琴夾在下巴下，演奏了一段優美的獨奏，令全場觀眾屏息聆聽。"},{"word":"career","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a profession or occupation chosen as one's life's work","chinese":"職業；事業","sentence":"After graduating from college with honors, Kevin decided to pursue a professional ______ in computer software development.","translation":"在大學以優異成績畢業後，凱文決定在電腦軟體開發領域追求專業的事業生涯。"},{"word":"actor","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person whose profession is acting on stage, in movies, or on television","chinese":"男演員；演員","sentence":"The famous Hollywood ______ practiced his lines repeatedly in the dressing room before stepping out in front of the cameras.","translation":"這位著名好萊塢演員在走進鏡頭前，在更衣室裡反覆練習他的台詞。"},{"word":"actress","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a woman whose profession is acting on stage, in movies, or on television","chinese":"女演員","sentence":"The young ______ received an international award for her brilliant performance as a brave doctor in the wartime film.","translation":"這位年輕女演員因在戰爭電影中精彩詮釋一位勇敢的醫生而榮獲國際大獎。"},{"word":"artist","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person who produces paintings or drawings as a profession or hobby","chinese":"藝術家；畫家","sentence":"The talented local ______ displayed thirty colorful oil paintings in the gallery, and visitors admired her creative imagination.","translation":"這位才華洋溢的在地藝術家在畫廊展出了三十幅色彩繽紛的油畫，參觀者對她的創意思維讚歎不已。"},{"word":"assistant","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person who helps someone in a higher position with their work","chinese":"助理；助手","sentence":"The general manager hired a bilingual ______ to organize business meetings, reply to client emails, and book flight tickets.","translation":"總經理僱用了一位雙語助手來安排商務會議、回覆客戶電子郵件以及訂購機票。"},{"word":"banker","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an officer or manager of a bank or financial institution","chinese":"銀行家；銀行主管","sentence":"My uncle works as a senior ______ in Taipei, and he helps local business owners obtain loans to expand their factories.","translation":"我叔叔在台北擔任資深銀行主管，他協助當地企業主獲得貸款以擴大他們的工廠。"},{"word":"barber","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person whose business is cutting men's hair and shaving beards","chinese":"理髮師（男士）","sentence":"Grandfather always visits the same traditional ______ on the corner to have his hair trimmed and his beard neatly shaved.","translation":"祖父總是去街角那家傳統理髮店剪頭髮，並請理髮師把他的鬍鬚刮得整整齊齊。"},{"word":"captain","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the person in command of a ship or aircraft; team leader","chinese":"船長；機長；隊長","sentence":"The experienced ship ______ steered the large cargo vessel safely through the stormy sea into the deep harbor.","translation":"這位經驗豐富的船長駕駛著大型貨輪安全穿過暴風雨肆虐的海洋，駛入深水港灣。"},{"word":"clerk","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person employed in an office or bank to keep records; shop assistant","chinese":"辦事員；店員","sentence":"When the customer brought the winter jacket to the counter, the polite store ______ scanned the price tag and accepted payment.","translation":"當顧客將冬季夾克拿到櫃檯時，有禮貌的店員掃描了價格標籤並收取了款項。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"During the symphony performance, the musician played a sad melody on her classical four-string ______.","options":["violin","career","captain","clerk"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: violin (小提琴) 【全文中譯】在交響樂演出中，這位音樂家在她那把古典四弦小提琴上演奏了悲傷的旋律。 【選項解析】(A) violin 小提琴 (B) career 事業 (C) captain 船長 (D) clerk 職員。four-string instrument 指小提琴 violin。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Choosing a suitable lifelong ______ requires careful thought about personal interests, strengths, and market opportunities.","options":["barber","career","assistant","actress"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: career (職業；事業) 【全文中譯】選擇合適的終身職業需要仔細思考個人興趣、優勢與市場機會。 【選項解析】(A) barber 理髮師 (B) career 事業 (C) assistant 助手 (D) actress 女演員。lifelong career（終身職業生涯）。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The handsome Hollywood ______ appeared on the red carpet to sign autographs for hundreds of cheering movie fans.","options":["clerk","banker","actor","violin"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: actor (演員；男演員) 【全文中譯】這位英俊的好萊塢演員出現在紅地毯上，為數百名歡呼的影迷簽名。 【選項解析】(A) clerk 店員 (B) banker 銀行家 (C) actor 男演員 (D) violin 小提琴。Hollywood actor 在紅毯簽名。"},{"number":4,"stem":"She worked hard in theatrical plays for a decade before becoming a world-renowned ______ in dramatic feature films.","options":["career","actress","barber","captain"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: actress (女演員) 【全文中譯】她在舞台劇中努力了十年，才成為劇情長片中舉世聞名的女演員。 【選項解析】(A) career (B) actress 女演員 (C) barber 理髮師 (D) captain 機長。由 female role / renowned 可知指女演員 actress。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The creative ______ spent months in his studio mixing oil colors on canvas to complete a magnificent landscape portrait.","options":["artist","clerk","banker","assistant"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: artist (藝術家；畫家) 【全文中譯】這位富有創意的藝術家在工作室花了數月在畫布上調配油畫顏料，完成了一幅壯麗的風景肖像畫。 【選項解析】(A) artist 藝術家 (B) clerk 職員 (C) banker 銀行家 (D) assistant 助理。油畫顏料與畫布對應 artist。"},{"number":6,"stem":"The professor asked his laboratory ______ to prepare test tubes and chemical solutions before the morning chemistry lecture.","options":["captain","career","violin","assistant"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: assistant (助手；助理) 【全文中譯】教授請他的實驗室助手在早晨化學課之前準備好試管和化學溶液。 【選項解析】(A) captain 隊長 (B) career 事業 (C) violin (D) assistant 助理。laboratory assistant（實驗室助理）。"},{"number":7,"stem":"If you plan to borrow money to buy a new house, you should consult an experienced ______ at the local financial branch.","options":["actor","banker","artist","barber"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: banker (銀行家；銀行經理) 【全文中譯】如果你打算借錢買新房子，你應該諮詢當地金融分行一位經驗豐富的銀行主管。 【選項解析】(A) actor 演員 (B) banker 銀行家 (C) artist 藝術家 (D) barber 理髮師。辦理房屋貸款洽詢 banker。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Every two months, my father visits his neighborhood ______ for a quick haircut and a relaxing warm towel shave.","options":["barber","captain","actress","career"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: barber (理髮師) 【全文中譯】每隔兩個月，我父親都會去住家附近的理髮師那裡快速剪個頭髮並享受放鬆的熱毛巾刮鬍服務。 【選項解析】(A) barber 理髮師 (B) captain 船長 (C) actress 女演員 (D) career 事業。剪髮刮鬍為 barber 專業工作。"},{"number":9,"stem":"In the middle of the heavy thunderstorm, the airplane ______ calmly announced that landing would be delayed for safety.","options":["clerk","artist","captain","assistant"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: captain (機長；船長) 【全文中譯】在狂風暴雨中，飛機機長沉著地廣播通知為了安全起見將延後降落。 【選項解析】(A) clerk 職員 (B) artist 藝術家 (C) captain 機長 (D) assistant 助理。airplane captain（飛機機長）。"},{"number":10,"stem":"The hotel front desk ______ greeted incoming guests with a warm smile and handed them their room electronic key cards.","options":["violin","clerk","career","actor"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: clerk (辦事員；櫃檯店員) 【全文中譯】飯店櫃檯接待員帶著溫暖的微笑迎接抵達的客人，並遞給他們房間感應鑰匙卡。 【選項解析】(A) violin (B) clerk 櫃檯接待員 (C) career (D) actor。front desk clerk 指櫃檯接待員。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Practicing the ______ requires great hand coordination because you hold the instrument with the left hand and the bow with the right.","options":["career","violin","captain","banker"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: violin (小提琴) 【全文中譯】練習小提琴需要極佳的雙手協調，因為你用左手拿琴、右手握弓。 【選項解析】(A) career (B) violin 小提琴 (C) captain (D) banker。手持弓拉奏之樂器為 violin。"},{"number":12,"stem":"After ten successful years in journalism, Maria changed her ______ and started teaching media studies at a university.","options":["assistant","barber","career","artist"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: career (事業；職涯) 【全文中譯】在新聞界成功工作十年後，瑪麗亞轉換了跑道，開始在大學教授媒體研究。 【選項解析】(A) assistant (B) barber (C) career 事業 (D) artist。changed her career 指轉換事業生涯。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The stage ______ forgot his line for a few seconds, but he improvised cleverly so the audience noticed nothing.","options":["actor","clerk","violin","banker"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: actor (男演員；演員) 【全文中譯】這位舞台劇演員忘詞了幾秒鐘，但他巧妙地即興發揮，使觀眾完全沒有察覺。 【選項解析】(A) actor 演員 (B) clerk (C) violin (D) banker。stage actor（舞台劇演員）。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The talented ______ received praise from critics for her role as Queen Victoria in the historical television series.","options":["captain","career","actress","barber"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: actress (女演員) 【全文中譯】這位才華橫溢的女演員因在歷史電視劇中飾演維多利亞女王而獲得評論家的讚賞。 【選項解析】(A) captain (B) career (C) actress 女演員 (D) barber。飾演女角色的演員為 actress。"},{"number":15,"stem":"An exhibition of modern sculptures created by an Italian ______ opened at the city museum yesterday afternoon.","options":["artist","clerk","assistant","banker"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: artist (藝術家) 【全文中譯】一位義大利藝術家創作的現代雕塑展昨天下午在市立博物館開幕。 【選項解析】(A) artist 藝術家 (B) clerk (C) assistant (D) banker。創作現代雕塑者為 artist。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Because the corporate executive had an extremely busy travel schedule, his personal ______ booked all hotel reservations.","options":["violin","career","actor","assistant"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: assistant (助理；特助) 【全文中譯】由於這位企業高層的差旅日程極為緊湊，他的個人特助預訂了所有的飯店住宿。 【選項解析】(A) violin (B) career (C) actor (D) assistant 助理。personal assistant 指個人特助。"},{"number":17,"stem":"As an investment ______, Mr. Davis analyzes international stock markets and advises wealthy clients on financial decisions.","options":["banker","barber","captain","artist"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: banker (銀行家) 【全文中譯】作為一名投資銀行家，戴維斯先生分析國際股票市場並為富有客戶提供財務決策建議。 【選項解析】(A) banker 銀行家 (B) barber (C) captain (D) artist。investment banker（投資銀行家）。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The vintage ______ shop on Baker Street still uses antique leather chairs and metal straight razors to trim beards.","options":["career","barber","actress","violin"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: barber (理髮店；理髮師) 【全文中譯】貝克街上的那家老式理髮店仍在使用復古皮椅和金屬直剃刀來修整鬍鬚。 【選項解析】(A) career (B) barber 理髮師 (C) actress (D) violin。vintage barber shop（老式理髮店）。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Before departing from the harbor, the ferry ______ checked the weather forecast and made sure all life vests were ready.","options":["clerk","assistant","captain","actor"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: captain (船長) 【全文中譯】在從港口出發之前，渡輪船長檢查了天氣預報並確保所有救生衣均已就緒。 【選項解析】(A) clerk (B) assistant (C) captain 船長 (D) actor。ferry captain 指渡輪船長。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The supermarket checkout ______ scanned twenty groceries in just two minutes and kindly gave the shopper a paper receipt.","options":["career","clerk","violin","artist"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: clerk (店員) 【全文中譯】超市結帳店員僅用兩分鐘就掃描了二十件雜貨，並親切地遞給購物者一張紙本收據。 【選項解析】(A) career (B) clerk 店員 (C) violin (D) artist。checkout clerk（結帳店員）。"},{"number":21,"stem":"She was recognized as a child musical prodigy who could play complex concertos on the ______ at the age of seven.","options":["captain","violin","banker","barber"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: violin (小提琴) 【全文中譯】她被公認為音樂神童，在七歲時就能在小提琴上演奏複雜的協奏曲。 【選項解析】(A) captain (B) violin 小提琴 (C) banker (D) barber。play complex concertos on the violin。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Dedicated students who wish to build a rewarding professional ______ in medicine must study hard for many years.","options":["career","assistant","clerk","actress"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: career (事業；專業生涯) 【全文中譯】立志在醫學領域建立有成就感專業事業的有志學生，必須苦讀多年。 【選項解析】(A) career 事業 (B) assistant (C) clerk (D) actress。build a rewarding professional career。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The film director gave clear instructions to the young ______ on how to express sadness during the final farewell scene.","options":["violin","barber","actor","career"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: actor (演員) 【全文中譯】電影導演向這位年輕演員給予明確指示，教導如何在最後的告別場景中表達悲傷。 【選項解析】(A) violin (B) barber (C) actor 演員 (D) career。film director 給予 actor 指導。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The theater award for Best Leading ______ was presented to an inspiring performer who portrayed a courageous schoolteacher.","options":["actress","captain","banker","clerk"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: actress (女演員) 【全文中譯】最佳女主角劇院大獎頒發給了一位飾演勇敢女教師的激勵人心表演者。 【選項解析】(A) actress 女演員 (B) captain (C) banker (D) clerk。Best Leading Actress（最佳女主角獎）。"},{"number":25,"stem":"A gallery owner agreed to represent the aspiring ______ after seeing her stunning watercolor portraits of elderly villagers.","options":["career","assistant","violin","artist"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: artist (藝術家) 【全文中譯】畫廊主人在看到這位有抱負的藝術家畫出老年村民令人驚艷的水彩肖像畫後，同意代理她的作品。 【選項解析】(A) career (B) assistant (C) violin (D) artist 藝術家。aspiring artist 指新進藝術家。"}]},{"unit":23,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 23 (023.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Specialized Occupations, Legal & Technical Experts | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"coach","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"an athletic trainer; long-distance bus; to train someone","chinese":"教練；長途巴士；指導","sentence":"The high school basketball ______ blew his whistle loudly to stop the practice and explained how to set a better defense.","translation":"高中籃球教練大聲吹響哨子暫停練習，並解釋如何建立更好的防守陣型。"},{"word":"dentist","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a doctor who specializes in treating teeth and gums","chinese":"牙醫","sentence":"Because my younger brother ate too many candies without brushing his teeth, mother took him to the ______ to check a cavity.","translation":"因為我弟弟吃太多糖果且沒刷牙，母親帶他去看牙醫以檢查蛀牙。"},{"word":"engineer","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person trained in designing or building machines, structures, or software","chinese":"工程師","sentence":"The senior mechanical ______ inspected the blueprint carefully before the construction crew began assembling the new bridge.","translation":"資深機械工程師在施工團隊開始組裝新橋樑之前，仔細檢查了設計藍圖。"},{"word":"expert","pos":"(n.) / (adj.)","definition":"a person with comprehensive and authoritative knowledge in a particular area","chinese":"專家；熟練的","sentence":"The financial news station invited a stock market ______ to analyze global inflation trends and advise viewers on investments.","translation":"財經新聞台邀請了一位股票市場專家來分析全球通貨膨脹趨勢，並為觀眾提供投資建議。"},{"word":"hunter","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person or animal that pursues and kills wild animals for food or sport","chinese":"獵人","sentence":"In ancient times, the skilled forest ______ tracked footprints in the snow for hours to find food for the hungry tribe.","translation":"在古代，熟練的森林獵人在雪地中追蹤腳印數小時，為飢餓的部落尋找食物。"},{"word":"journalist","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person who writes news stories for newspapers, magazines, or broadcasts","chinese":"新聞記者","sentence":"The courageous investigative ______ traveled into remote areas to interview villagers and report on local water pollution.","translation":"這位勇敢的調查新聞記者深入偏遠地區採訪村民，報導當地的水質污染問題。"},{"word":"judge","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a public officer appointed to decide cases in court; to form an opinion","chinese":"法官；裁判；評斷","sentence":"After listening carefully to both lawyers in the courtroom, the impartial ______ delivered a fair sentence to the defendant.","translation":"在法庭上仔細聆聽兩位律師的陳述後，公正的法官對被告宣判了公平的判決。"},{"word":"lawyer","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person who practices or studies law; an attorney or legal counselor","chinese":"律師","sentence":"Before signing the business partnership agreement, Mr. Lin consulted a corporate ______ to ensure all contractual terms were legal.","translation":"在簽署商業合夥協議之前，林先生諮詢了一位公司律師以確保所有合約條款皆合法。"},{"word":"manager","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person responsible for controlling or administering an organization or staff","chinese":"經理；主管","sentence":"The customer service ______ resolved the client's complaint politely and offered a full refund for the defective product.","translation":"客服部經理客氣地解決了顧客的投訴，並為該瑕疵產品提供了全額退款。"},{"word":"model","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a person employed to display clothes; a representation of an object","chinese":"模特兒；模型；模範","sentence":"The international fashion ______ walked gracefully down the catwalk in Paris, showcasing the designer's latest winter collection.","translation":"這位國際時尚模特兒優雅地走在巴黎伸展台上，展示設計師最新的冬季時裝系列。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"If you experience severe tooth pain when drinking cold water, you should book an appointment with a certified ______.","options":["engineer","dentist","journalist","hunter"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: dentist (牙醫) 【全文中譯】如果你喝冰水時感到嚴重的牙齒疼痛，你應該預約一名合格的牙醫看診。 【選項解析】(A) engineer 工程師 (B) dentist 牙醫 (C) journalist 記者 (D) hunter 獵人。tooth pain 由牙醫看診。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The football team was losing at halftime, but their enthusiastic ______ inspired them with an energetic motivational speech.","options":["coach","judge","lawyer","model"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: coach (教練) 【全文中譯】足球隊在中場休息時處於落後，但他們熱情的教練用激勵人心的演說鼓舞了他們。 【選項解析】(A) coach 教練 (B) judge 法官 (C) lawyer 律師 (D) model 模特兒。球隊指導者為 coach。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The tech startup hired a talented software ______ to build an interactive mobile app for online grocery shopping.","options":["dentist","hunter","engineer","coach"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: engineer (工程師) 【全文中譯】這家科技新創公司聘請了一位才華洋溢的軟體工程師，為線上雜貨購物建立互動式手機應用程式。 【選項解析】(A) dentist (B) hunter (C) engineer 工程師 (D) coach。software engineer（軟體工程師）。"},{"number":4,"stem":"The university invited an environmental ______ to deliver a lecture on the global effects of melting glaciers.","options":["expert","model","coach","dentist"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: expert (專家) 【全文中譯】大學邀請了一位環境專家，就冰川融化對全球造成的影響發表演講。 【選項解析】(A) expert 專家 (B) model (C) coach (D) dentist。environmental expert（環境專家）。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The ancient tribe relied on an experienced ______ to track deer through the thick forest during harsh winter months.","options":["lawyer","hunter","judge","manager"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: hunter (獵人) 【全文中譯】在嚴寒的冬季月份裡，古老的部落依靠經驗豐富的獵人穿越茂密的森林追蹤鹿群。 【選項解析】(A) lawyer (B) hunter 獵人 (C) judge (D) manager。track deer 表追蹤獵物，此為 hunter。"},{"number":6,"stem":"The brave ______ won a prestigious press award after exposing corrupt activities inside the regional government.","options":["dentist","coach","journalist","engineer"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: journalist (新聞記者) 【全文中譯】這位勇敢的記者在揭露地方政府內部的腐敗活動後，榮獲了聲譽卓著的新聞大獎。 【選項解析】(A) dentist (B) coach (C) journalist 記者 (D) engineer。investigative journalist（調查記者）。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The courtroom was completely silent as the supreme ______ banged his wooden gavel and read the official verdict.","options":["judge","model","hunter","expert"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: judge (法官) 【全文中譯】當最高法官敲響他的木槌並宣讀官方判決時，整個法庭一片肅靜。 【選項解析】(A) judge 法官 (B) model (C) hunter (D) expert。敲木槌宣判者為 judge。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The accused company hired a top defense ______ to present solid evidence and protect their intellectual property rights.","options":["coach","dentist","lawyer","engineer"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: lawyer (律師) 【全文中譯】被指控的公司聘請了頂尖的辯護律師提供確鑿證據，以保護他們的智慧財產權。 【選項解析】(A) coach (B) dentist (C) lawyer 律師 (D) engineer。defense lawyer（辯護律師）。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The restaurant ______ walked from table to table asking guests whether they enjoyed their special holiday meals.","options":["hunter","manager","judge","expert"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: manager (經理；主管) 【全文中譯】餐廳經理在桌子間穿梭巡視，詢問客人是否喜歡特別的節日餐點。 【選項解析】(A) hunter (B) manager 經理 (C) judge (D) expert。restaurant manager（餐廳經理）。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Tall and elegant, the runway ______ wore an exquisite evening gown created by a prominent French fashion designer.","options":["journalist","engineer","dentist","model"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: model (模特兒) 【全文中譯】身材高挑優雅的伸展台模特兒穿著由法國知名服裝設計師創作的精美晚禮服。 【選項解析】(A) journalist (B) engineer (C) dentist (D) model 模特兒。runway model 指走伸展台之模特兒。"},{"number":11,"stem":"You must brush and floss your teeth every night, or your ______ will have to drill your cavities on your next visit.","options":["dentist","coach","lawyer","judge"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: dentist (牙醫) 【全文中譯】你每晚必須刷牙並使用牙線，否則牙醫在下次看診時就得幫你鑽牙補蛀牙了。 【選項解析】(A) dentist 牙醫 (B) coach (C) lawyer (D) judge。drill cavities（鑽補蛀牙）為牙醫之工作。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The track and field ______ instructed the sprinters to practice starting blocks repeatedly to shave off split seconds.","options":["hunter","coach","journalist","model"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: coach (教練) 【全文中譯】田徑教練指示短跑運動員反覆練習起跑架，以縮短微秒時間。 【選項解析】(A) hunter (B) coach 教練 (C) journalist (D) model。track and field coach（田徑教練）。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Civil ______ from the national transport ministry conducted safety inspections on all suspension bridges after the earthquake.","options":["engineers","dentists","judges","hunters"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: engineers (工程師) 【全文中譯】國家交通部的土木工程師在地震後對所有懸索橋進行了安全檢查。 【選項解析】(A) engineers 工程師 (B) dentists (C) judges (D) hunters。civil engineers（土木工程師）。"},{"number":14,"stem":"A medical ______ appeared on the breakfast television show to explain how daily aerobic exercise strengthens the heart.","options":["lawyer","model","expert","manager"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: expert (專家) 【全文中譯】一位醫學專家出現在早安電視節目中，向觀眾解釋每日有氧運動如何增強心臟功能。 【選項解析】(A) lawyer (B) model (C) expert 專家 (D) manager。medical expert（醫學專家）。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Armed with a hunting rifle, the seasoned ______ walked quietly across the misty hills before sunrise.","options":["journalist","hunter","engineer","dentist"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: hunter (獵人) 【全文中譯】帶著獵槍的老練獵人在日出前悄悄走過多霧的山丘。 【選項解析】(A) journalist (B) hunter 獵人 (C) engineer (D) dentist。armed with hunting rifle 指獵人 hunter。"},{"number":16,"stem":"The young newspaper ______ interviewed eyewitnesses at the traffic accident site and filed her story before deadline.","options":["coach","judge","journalist","model"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: journalist (新聞記者) 【全文中譯】這位年輕的報社記者在車禍現場採訪了目擊者，並在截稿時間前發送了報導。 【選項解析】(A) coach (B) judge (C) journalist 記者 (D) model。interviewed eyewitnesses 表採訪目擊者。"},{"number":17,"stem":"In a criminal trial, the presiding ______ must remain neutral and guarantee that court rules are strictly followed.","options":["judge","dentist","engineer","hunter"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: judge (法官) 【全文中譯】在刑事審判中，主審法官必須保持中立並確保法院規則得到嚴格執行。 【選項解析】(A) judge 法官 (B) dentist (C) engineer (D) hunter。presiding judge（主審法官）。"},{"number":18,"stem":"You should never sign any contract without having your trusted family ______ review the legal clauses carefully.","options":["coach","model","lawyer","expert"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: lawyer (律師) 【全文中譯】在簽署任何合約之前，切勿未讓您信任的家庭律師仔細審閱法律條款。 【選項解析】(A) coach (B) model (C) lawyer 律師 (D) expert。review legal clauses 指律師審閱條款。"},{"number":19,"stem":"When sales dropped by fifteen percent, the branch ______ organized an emergency strategy meeting with all staff members.","options":["hunter","journalist","dentist","manager"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: manager (經理；分行長) 【全文中譯】當銷售額下滑百分之十五時，分公司經理與所有員工組織了一次緊急策略會議。 【選項解析】(A) hunter (B) journalist (C) dentist (D) manager 經理。branch manager（分公司經理）。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The miniature wooden ______ of the ancient cathedral took the architecture student six months of meticulous work.","options":["model","judge","coach","lawyer"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: model (模型) 【全文中譯】這座古老大教堂的微型木製模型耗費了這位建築系學生六個月的精細心血。 【選項解析】(A) model 模型 (B) judge (C) coach (D) lawyer。miniature wooden model（微型木製模型）。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The pediatric ______ gave the crying toddler a cute sticker after painlessly cleaning his baby teeth.","options":["engineer","dentist","hunter","journalist"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: dentist (牙醫) 【全文中譯】小兒牙醫在無痛清理完幼兒的乳牙後，給了嚎啕大哭的小童一張可愛的貼紙。 【選項解析】(A) engineer (B) dentist 牙醫 (C) hunter (D) journalist。pediatric dentist（小兒牙醫）。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The swim team ______ timed each lap carefully and corrected the swimmers' arm strokes from the edge of the pool.","options":["lawyer","judge","coach","model"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: coach (教練) 【全文中譯】游泳隊教練在池畔仔細為每一趟計時，並修正游泳選手的划水動作。 【選項解析】(A) lawyer (B) judge (C) coach 教練 (D) model。swim team coach（游泳隊教練）。"},{"number":23,"stem":"An electrical ______ was called to the manufacturing plant when the primary power generator suddenly overheated.","options":["engineer","expert","hunter","manager"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: engineer (工程師) 【全文中譯】當主發電機突然過熱時，一位電機工程師被緊急召集到製造廠處置。 【選項解析】(A) engineer 工程師 (B) expert (C) hunter (D) manager。electrical engineer（電機工程師）。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The television host introduced a culinary ______ who demonstrated traditional pastry techniques to the studio audience.","options":["dentist","judge","coach","expert"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: expert (專家) 【全文中譯】電視主持人介紹了一位烹飪專家，向攝影棚觀眾示範傳統糕點技藝。 【選項解析】(A) dentist (B) judge (C) coach (D) expert 專家。culinary expert（烹飪專家）。"},{"number":25,"stem":"The department store ______ supervised fifty employees and handled daily scheduling to maintain smooth operations.","options":["hunter","manager","model","journalist"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: manager (經理) 【全文中譯】百貨公司經理監督五十名員工並處理日常排班，以維護業務順暢運作。 【選項解析】(A) hunter (B) manager 經理 (C) model (D) journalist。department store manager（百貨公司經理）。"}]},{"unit":24,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 24 (024.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Public Service, Academia & Cultural Professions | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"musician","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person who plays a musical instrument or writes music","chinese":"音樂家","sentence":"The talented classical ______ composed an original piano sonata, and she performed it with great passion at the national theater.","translation":"這位才華洋溢的古典音樂家創作了一首原創鋼琴奏鳴曲，她在國家劇院充滿激情地演奏了這首曲子。"},{"word":"priest","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an ordained minister of the Christian Church having religious authority","chinese":"神父；牧師","sentence":"Every Sunday morning, the elderly Catholic ______ gave an inspiring sermon about compassion to all believers in the church.","translation":"每逢週日早晨，這位年邁的天主教神父都會在教堂向全體信徒發表關於慈悲的激勵人心講道。"},{"word":"painter","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an artist who paints pictures; a person who paints buildings","chinese":"畫家；油漆匠","sentence":"The French Impressionist ______ set up his easel in the flower garden to capture the morning sunlight on his canvas.","translation":"這位法國印象派畫家在花園中架起畫架，試圖在畫布上捕捉晨曦的光影變化。"},{"word":"photographer","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person who takes photographs, either as a job or hobby","chinese":"攝影師","sentence":"The wildlife ______ waited patiently behind camouflage netting for six hours to take pictures of rare mountain eagles.","translation":"這位野生動物攝影師在偽裝網後耐心等待了六個小時，只為拍攝稀有山雕的照片。"},{"word":"policeman","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a male member of a police force","chinese":"警察；警員","sentence":"The brave traffic ______ stood at the busy downtown intersection directing vehicles after the traffic lights broke down.","translation":"在紅綠燈故障後，英勇的交通警察站在繁忙的市中心十字路口指揮車輛行進。"},{"word":"president","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the elected head of a republican state; leader of an organization","chinese":"總統；總裁；理事長","sentence":"The newly elected national ______ delivered a hopeful inaugural address promising to improve education and reduce unemployment.","translation":"新當選的國家總統發表了充滿希望的就職演說，承諾改善教育並降低失業率。"},{"word":"principal","pos":"(n.) / (adj.)","definition":"the head of a school; first in order of importance","chinese":"校長；主要的","sentence":"During the morning assembly, the school ______ awarded medals to outstanding students who won the regional science contest.","translation":"在晨會期間，學校校長向贏得區域科學競賽的優秀學生頒發了獎牌。"},{"word":"professor","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a university teacher of the highest academic rank","chinese":"教授","sentence":"The history ______ delivered an engaging lecture on ancient Egyptian pyramids and answered questions from curious students.","translation":"歷史系教授發表了一場關於古埃及金字塔的生動演講，並回答了好奇學生的提問。"},{"word":"reporter","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person who reports news or conducts interviews for television or press","chinese":"記者；通訊員","sentence":"The television news ______ held a microphone in the pouring rain, broadcasting live updates about the approaching typhoon.","translation":"電視新聞記者在傾盆大雨中手持麥克風，現場直播關於颱風逼近的最新動態。"},{"word":"sailor","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person who works as a member of the crew of a ship or boat","chinese":"水手；海員","sentence":"The young naval ______ tightened the thick ropes on deck and looked out across the boundless ocean toward the horizon.","translation":"年輕的海軍水手緊緊拉繫甲板上的粗繩，放眼望向地平線對面的無垠大洋。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The orchestra invited a renowned guest ______ to perform a stunning violin solo during their anniversary concert.","options":["sailor","musician","policeman","priest"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: musician (音樂家) 【全文中譯】管弦樂團邀請了一位著名客座音樂家，在他們的週年音樂會上演奏了精彩的小提琴獨奏。 【選項解析】(A) sailor 水手 (B) musician 音樂家 (C) policeman 警察 (D) priest 神父。演奏小提琴者為 musician。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The village gathered inside the historic stone chapel where the local ______ offered comforting prayers for the sick.","options":["priest","photographer","president","painter"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: priest (神父；牧師) 【全文中譯】村民聚集在歷史悠久的石造小教堂內，當地的神父為病患獻上撫慰人心的祈禱。 【選項解析】(A) priest 神父 (B) photographer 攝影師 (C) president 總統 (D) painter 畫家。在教堂帶領祈禱者為 priest。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The renowned landscape ______ dipped his fine brush into watercolor and painted green hills overlooking the river.","options":["principal","policeman","painter","professor"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: painter (畫家) 【全文中譯】著名的風景畫家將細毛畫筆浸入水彩中，畫出了俯瞰河流的青山綠水。 【選項解析】(A) principal 校長 (B) policeman (C) painter 畫家 (D) professor。以水彩揮毫畫畫者為 painter。"},{"number":4,"stem":"A professional fashion ______ adjusted the studio lighting to capture high-resolution portraits for the magazine cover.","options":["sailor","reporter","priest","photographer"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: photographer (攝影師) 【全文中譯】專業時尚攝影師調整了攝影棚燈光，為雜誌封面拍攝高解析度的肖像照。 【選項解析】(A) sailor (B) reporter (C) priest (D) photographer 攝影師。調整燈光拍攝雜誌封面照者為 photographer。"},{"number":5,"stem":"When a pedestrian lost her purse on the street, an alert ______ helped her track down the suspect immediately.","options":["musician","policeman","professor","painter"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: policeman (警察) 【全文中譯】當一名行人在街上遺失錢包時，一名警覺的警員立即幫助她追查嫌疑人。 【選項解析】(A) musician (B) policeman 警察 (C) professor (D) painter。維持治安、追查嫌犯者為 policeman。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Citizens crowded around their television sets to watch the state ______ announce the signing of the peace treaty.","options":["president","sailor","photographer","priest"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: president (總統) 【全文中譯】民眾擠在電視機前，觀看國家總統宣布簽署和平條約。 【選項解析】(A) president 總統 (B) sailor (C) photographer (D) priest。簽署國家和約者為 state president。"},{"number":7,"stem":"At the beginning of the new academic year, the elementary school ______ welcomed new first graders at the school gate.","options":["painter","musician","principal","reporter"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: principal (校長) 【全文中譯】在新學年開始時，小學校長在校門口迎接新入學的一年級新生。 【選項解析】(A) painter (B) musician (C) principal 校長 (D) reporter。迎接入學校園之長官為 school principal。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The university ______ published a groundbreaking academic paper on renewable solar energy in a prestigious scientific journal.","options":["professor","sailor","policeman","priest"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: professor (教授) 【全文中譯】這位大學教授在頂尖科學期刊上發表了一篇關於可再生太陽能的開創性學術論文。 【選項解析】(A) professor 教授 (B) sailor (C) policeman (D) priest。發表科學論文的大學教員為 professor。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The sports news ______ interviewed the marathon champion immediately after he crossed the finish line in record time.","options":["painter","reporter","principal","president"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: reporter (記者) 【全文中譯】體育新聞記者在馬拉松冠軍以破紀錄時間衝過終點線後立即對他進行了採訪。 【選項解析】(A) painter (B) reporter 記者 (C) principal (D) president。新聞採訪者為 reporter。"},{"number":10,"stem":"During the fierce ocean storm, every experienced ______ wore a safety harness while securing loose cargo on deck.","options":["musician","photographer","professor","sailor"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: sailor (水手) 【全文中譯】在猛烈的海洋風暴中，每位經驗豐富的水手在甲板上固定鬆動貨物時都繫著安全帶。 【選項解析】(A) musician (B) photographer (C) professor (D) sailor 水手。船艦甲板工作人員為 sailor。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Jazz and classical ______ spend years mastering their instruments and practicing complex musical scales every day.","options":["musicians","policemen","priests","sailors"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: musicians (音樂家) 【全文中譯】爵士與古典音樂家耗費數年時間精通樂器，每天練習複雜的音樂音階。 【選項解析】(A) musicians 音樂家 (B) policemen (C) priests (D) sailors。精通樂器音階者為 musicians。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The parish ______ conducted wedding vows for the young couple in front of their tearful relatives and close friends.","options":["painter","priest","photographer","president"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: priest (神父；牧師) 【全文中譯】教區神父在新人熱淚盈眶的親戚和摯友面前主持了他們的結婚誓詞。 【選項解析】(A) painter (B) priest 神父 (C) photographer (D) president。主持教會婚禮者為 parish priest。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Before remodeling the living room, we hired an interior ______ to paint all the walls with warm pastel tones.","options":["professor","sailor","painter","principal"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: painter (油漆匠) 【全文中譯】在改造客廳之前，我們僱用了一位室內油漆工用溫暖的粉彩色調粉刷所有牆壁。 【選項解析】(A) professor (B) sailor (C) painter 油漆工 (D) principal。粉刷牆壁者為 painter。"},{"number":14,"stem":"An aerial ______ flew in a small helicopter above the grand canyon to capture panoramic sunrise photographs.","options":["photographer","policeman","musician","priest"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: photographer (攝影師) 【全文中譯】一位空拍攝影師乘坐小型直升機飛越大峽谷，捕捉日出的全景照片。 【選項解析】(A) photographer 攝影師 (B) policeman (C) musician (D) priest。拍攝日出照片者為 photographer。"},{"number":15,"stem":"An undercover ______ arrested two car thieves who had broken into vehicles parked outside the shopping mall.","options":["reporter","professor","policeman","painter"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: policeman (便衣警察) 【全文中譯】一名便衣警察逮捕了兩名闖入商場外停放車輛行竊的汽車竊賊。 【選項解析】(A) reporter (B) professor (C) policeman 警察 (D) painter。undercover policeman（便衣警察）。"},{"number":16,"stem":"The company ______ delivered a strategic speech to shareholders, explaining plans to expand operations into Southeast Asia.","options":["sailor","president","principal","musician"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: president (總裁；董事長) 【全文中譯】公司總裁向股東發表了戰略演講，解釋進軍東南亞市場的業務拓展計畫。 【選項解析】(A) sailor (B) president 總裁 (C) principal (D) musician。company president（公司總裁/董事長）。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Parents scheduled an appointment with the high school ______ to discuss the school's new anti-bullying policy.","options":["painter","photographer","priest","principal"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: principal (校長) 【全文中譯】家長與高中校長約定面談時間，以討論學校最新的反霸凌政策。 【選項解析】(A) painter (B) photographer (C) priest (D) principal 校長。掌管學校政策之代表為 principal。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The chemistry ______ spent office hours guiding graduate students through their laboratory experiments and thesis research.","options":["professor","policeman","sailor","reporter"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: professor (教授) 【全文中譯】化學教授利用課餘諮詢時間指導研究生的實驗室實驗和學位論文研究。 【選項解析】(A) professor 教授 (B) policeman (C) sailor (D) reporter。指導研究生論文者為 professor。"},{"number":19,"stem":"An investigative ______ uncovered secret financial records showing that factory owners had hidden environmental damages.","options":["musician","reporter","priest","painter"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: reporter (記者) 【全文中譯】一位調查記者揭露了秘密財務記錄，顯示工廠負責人隱瞞了環境損害真相。 【選項解析】(A) musician (B) reporter 記者 (C) priest (D) painter。investigative reporter（調查記者）。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The merchant vessel employed thirty crew members, and each seasoned ______ took turns keeping watch on the bridge.","options":["photographer","principal","sailor","president"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: sailor (水手；船員) 【全文中譯】這艘商船僱用了三十名船員，每位經驗豐富的水手輪流在艦橋上值勤望遠。 【選項解析】(A) photographer (B) principal (C) sailor 水手 (D) president。商船船員為 sailor。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Street ______ played lively acoustic tunes in the public square, and passing tourists dropped coins into their guitar cases.","options":["musicians","professors","priests","policemen"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: musicians (街頭音樂家) 【全文中譯】街頭音樂家在公共廣場演奏輕快的民謠曲調，路過的遊客紛紛將硬幣投進他們的吉他琴盒中。 【選項解析】(A) musicians 音樂家 (B) professors (C) priests (D) policemen。street musicians 指街頭街頭藝人/音樂家。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The kind ______ visited elderly residents in the nursing home every Friday, offering blessings and cheerful company.","options":["sailor","painter","reporter","priest"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: priest (神父) 【全文中譯】慈祥的神父每週五探訪安養院的年長居民，為他們獻上祝福與歡樂的陪伴。 【選項解析】(A) sailor (B) painter (C) reporter (D) priest 神父。給予宗教祝福者為 priest。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The famous oil ______ spent forty years creating realistic portraits of common working people in rural villages.","options":["photographer","painter","policeman","principal"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: painter (畫家) 【全文中譯】這位著名的油畫家花了四十年時間創作鄉村普通勞動人民的寫實肖像畫。 【選項解析】(A) photographer (B) painter 畫家 (C) policeman (D) principal。oil painter（油畫家）。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The sports ______ stood near the sidelines taking rapid burst shots of the gymnasts performing aerial flips.","options":["photographer","president","professor","priest"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: photographer (攝影師) 【全文中譯】體育攝影師站在場邊連續高速快門連拍體操運動員做空中翻滾的畫面。 【選項解析】(A) photographer 攝影師 (B) president (C) professor (D) priest。高速快門拍攝運動員者為 photographer。"},{"number":25,"stem":"A bicycle ______ patrolled the park paths each afternoon to ensure visitors obeyed safety regulations.","options":["sailor","musician","policeman","reporter"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: policeman (警察) 【全文中譯】一名騎單車的巡警每天下午在公園小徑上巡邏，以確保遊客遵守安全規定。 【選項解析】(A) sailor (B) musician (C) policeman 警察 (D) reporter。bicycle policeman（自行車巡警）。"}]},{"unit":25,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 25 (025.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Service Roles, Royalty & Specialized Trades | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"salesman","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a man whose job involves selling goods or services","chinese":"業務員；推銷員","sentence":"The friendly car ______ explained all the safety features of the hybrid sedan and offered us a free test drive.","translation":"這位親切的汽車業務員解釋了這輛油電混合轎車的所有安全功能，並為我們提供了免費試駕。"},{"word":"scientist","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person who studies or has expert knowledge in one or more sciences","chinese":"科學家","sentence":"The environmental ______ analyzed water samples collected from the river and discovered dangerous levels of chemical waste.","translation":"這位環境科學家分析了從該河流採集的水樣，並發現了危險含量的化學廢料。"},{"word":"mechanic","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person who repairs and maintains machinery, especially car engines","chinese":"技工；修車工","sentence":"When my old car suddenly broke down on the highway, a skillful ______ replaced the damaged alternator in two hours.","translation":"當我的老爺車在公路上突然拋錨時，一位技術精湛的技工在兩小時內更換了損壞的發電機。"},{"word":"secretary","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person employed to assist with correspondence, keep records, and make appointments","chinese":"秘書","sentence":"The executive ______ answered incoming telephone calls politely and scheduled important meetings on the company digital calendar.","translation":"這位主管秘書客氣地接聽打進來的電話，並在公司的數位行事曆上安排了重要會議。"},{"word":"servant","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person who performs duties for others, especially in a domestic setting","chinese":"僕人；傭人","sentence":"In ancient European castles, numerous ______ cleaned grand dining halls, prepared elaborate meals, and looked after the nobility.","translation":"在古代歐洲城堡中，眾多僕人負責打掃宏偉的宴會廳、準備豐盛的餐點，並伺候貴族階層。"},{"word":"vendor","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person or company offering something for sale, especially street traders","chinese":"小販；攤販；廠商","sentence":"Every Saturday night, the street food ______ sets up his mobile stall in the night market to grill fragrant sausages for customers.","translation":"每逢週六晚上，街頭小販都會在夜市擺出移動攤位，為顧客現烤香氣四溢的香腸。"},{"word":"thief","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person who steals another person's property, especially secretly (pl. thieves)","chinese":"小偷；竊賊","sentence":"An alert store security officer caught the sneaky ______ trying to sneak out the back exit with stolen electronic watches.","translation":"一名警覺的店內保全人員抓住了這個鬼鬼祟祟的小偷，他當時正試圖帶著偷來的電子手錶從後門溜出去。"},{"word":"speaker","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person who speaks, especially at a formal event; audio device","chinese":"演講者；講者；揚聲器","sentence":"The keynote ______ delivered an inspiring talk on artificial intelligence, and the auditorium erupted in loud applause.","translation":"主講人在會上發表了關於人工智慧的激勵人心演講，整個禮堂爆發出熱烈的掌聲。"},{"word":"prince","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the son of a monarch; a close male member of a royal family","chinese":"王子；親王","sentence":"The handsome young ______ rode his white horse through the palace gates to greet thousands of cheering royal subjects.","translation":"這位英俊的年輕王子騎著白馬穿過宮殿大門，向數千名歡呼的王室子民揮手致意。"},{"word":"princess","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the daughter of a monarch; the wife of a prince","chinese":"公主；王妃","sentence":"The royal ______ wore a sparkling diamond tiara to the banquet and smiled warmly at international diplomatic guests.","translation":"這位王室公主戴著閃亮的鑽石皇冠出席宴會，並對國際外交嘉賓報以溫暖的微笑。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"When the family car began making a strange rattling sound, my father took it to a reliable auto ______.","options":["scientist","mechanic","vendor","prince"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: mechanic (技工；修車工) 【全文中譯】當家裡的汽車開始發出奇怪的咔嗒聲時，父親把它送到了可靠的汽車技工那裡檢修。 【選項解析】(A) scientist 科學家 (B) mechanic 技工 (C) vendor 小販 (D) prince 王子。auto mechanic（汽車修理工）。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The pharmaceutical ______ conducted complex laboratory trials to test the safety of a new influenza vaccine.","options":["thief","salesman","scientist","servant"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: scientist (科學家) 【全文中譯】製藥科學家進行了複雜的實驗室試驗，以測試新型流感疫苗的安全性。 【選項解析】(A) thief (B) salesman (C) scientist 科學家 (D) servant。進行疫苗實驗室試驗者為 pharmaceutical scientist。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The energetic computer ______ demonstrated the latest tablet features to shoppers gathered at the electronics expo.","options":["salesman","princess","mechanic","thief"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: salesman (業務員；銷售員) 【全文中譯】充滿活力的電腦銷售員向聚集在電子展覽會上的購物者示範最新平板電腦的功能。 【選項解析】(A) salesman 業務員 (B) princess (C) mechanic (D) thief。推銷電子展品者為 computer salesman。"},{"number":4,"stem":"The director asked his confidential ______ to draft a formal reply to the foreign government's invitation letter.","options":["vendor","secretary","prince","scientist"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: secretary (秘書) 【全文中譯】主管請他的機要秘書起草一份給外國政府邀請函的正式回信。 【選項解析】(A) vendor (B) secretary 秘書 (C) prince (D) scientist。起草正式信函、掌管文書者為 confidential secretary。"},{"number":5,"stem":"In the 18th century, wealthy aristocratic families employed a faithful household ______ to maintain their country manor.","options":["servant","salesman","speaker","mechanic"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: servant (僕人；傭人) 【全文中譯】在 18 世紀，富有的貴族家庭僱用忠誠的家僕來維護他們的鄉村莊園。 【選項解析】(A) servant 僕人 (B) salesman (C) speaker (D) mechanic。照顧鄉村莊園的傭工為 household servant。"},{"number":6,"stem":"A night market ______ pushed his wooden cart into the crowded alley and began frying delicious scallion pancakes.","options":["prince","scientist","vendor","secretary"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: vendor (攤販；小販) 【全文中譯】夜市小販把木推車推進擁擠的小巷，開始現煎美味的蔥油餅。 【選項解析】(A) prince (B) scientist (C) vendor 小販 (D) secretary。night market vendor 指夜市小販。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The house was broken into while the family was on vacation, and the ______ stole valuable jewelry from the safe.","options":["salesman","thief","mechanic","servant"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: thief (小偷；竊賊) 【全文中譯】這家人度假時房子遭人破門而入，竊賊從保險箱裡偷走了昂貴的珠寶。 【選項解析】(A) salesman (B) thief 竊賊 (C) mechanic (D) servant。破門偷走珠寶者為 thief。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The guest ______ at the graduation ceremony encouraged students to be resilient when confronting future challenges.","options":["speaker","princess","thief","vendor"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: speaker (演講者；講者) 【全文中譯】畢業典禮上的特邀演講嘉賓鼓勵學生在面對未來的挑戰時要保持堅韌不拔。 【選項解析】(A) speaker 演講者 (B) princess (C) thief (D) vendor。guest speaker（特邀演講嘉賓）。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The young crown ______ was next in line for the throne and was trained strictly in international politics from childhood.","options":["mechanic","prince","salesman","secretary"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: prince (王子) 【全文中譯】年輕的王儲是王位的第一順位繼承人，從小就接受嚴格的國際政治訓練。 【選項解析】(A) mechanic (B) prince 王子 (C) salesman (D) secretary。crown prince 指皇太子/王儲。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Little girls around the world love fairy tales where a beautiful ______ lives happily ever after in a grand palace.","options":["scientist","vendor","thief","princess"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: princess (公主) 【全文中譯】全世界的小女孩都喜歡童話故事，在故事中美麗的公主在宏偉的城堡裡從此過著幸福快樂的生活。 【選項解析】(A) scientist (B) vendor (C) thief (D) princess 公主。童話故事中的王室女主角為 princess。"},{"number":11,"stem":"An aircraft ______ inspected the jet engine blades thoroughly before granting final takeoff clearance.","options":["mechanic","prince","salesman","speaker"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: mechanic (技工；機械維修師) 【全文中譯】飛機機械技工在給予最終起飛許可前，徹底檢查了噴射發動機葉片。 【選項解析】(A) mechanic 技工 (B) prince (C) salesman (D) speaker。aircraft mechanic（飛機維修工程師/技工）。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Nobel Prize-winning ______ from around the world gathered in Stockholm to discuss global climate challenges.","options":["servants","thieves","scientists","vendors"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: scientists (科學家) 【全文中譯】來自世界各地的諾貝爾獎得主科學家聚集在斯德哥爾摩，討論全球氣候挑戰。 【選項解析】(A) servants (B) thieves (C) scientists 科學家 (D) vendors。Nobel Prize-winning scientists。"},{"number":13,"stem":"A door-to-door vacuum ______ knocked on our front door yesterday, but mother politely declined his demonstration.","options":["secretary","salesman","prince","princess"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: salesman (推銷員) 【全文中譯】一名挨家挨戶推銷吸塵器的業務員昨天敲了我們的前門，但母親客氣地拒絕了他的示範。 【選項解析】(A) secretary (B) salesman 推銷員 (C) prince (D) princess。door-to-door vacuum salesman。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The school board appointed a competent ______ to take minutes during executive meetings and maintain archived records.","options":["mechanic","thief","vendor","secretary"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: secretary (秘書；書記) 【全文中譯】學校董事會任命了一位稱職的秘書在執行會議期間記錄會議紀錄並維護存檔記錄。 【選項解析】(A) mechanic (B) thief (C) vendor (D) secretary 秘書。負責會議記錄（take minutes）者為 secretary。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The cruel master ordered his overworked ______ to chop firewood all night without offering him any warm food.","options":["scientist","servant","speaker","salesman"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: servant (僕人) 【全文中譯】殘忍的主人命令他那過勞的僕人整夜砍柴，卻沒有給他任何溫暖的食物。 【選項解析】(A) scientist (B) servant 僕人 (C) speaker (D) salesman。服侍主人（master）的人為 servant。"},{"number":16,"stem":"A souvenir ______ set up a stall near the famous landmark selling handmade wooden postcards to foreign tourists.","options":["vendor","prince","thief","secretary"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: vendor (紀念品攤販) 【全文中譯】紀念品小販在著名地標附近擺了一個攤位，向外國遊客出售手工木製明信片。 【選項解析】(A) vendor 攤販 (B) prince (C) thief (D) secretary。souvenir vendor（紀念品攤販）。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Police detectives matched fingerprints found on the broken window frame to a notorious jewel ______.","options":["salesman","mechanic","thief","scientist"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: thief (竊賊) 【全文中譯】警察偵探將破碎窗框上發現的指紋與一名臭名昭著的珠寶大盜進行了比對匹配。 【選項解析】(A) salesman (B) mechanic (C) thief 竊賊 (D) scientist。jewel thief（珠寶竊賊）。"},{"number":18,"stem":"During the debate competition, each student ______ had exactly three minutes to present an opening argument.","options":["prince","speaker","vendor","servant"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: speaker (演講者；辯手) 【全文中譯】在辯論比賽中，每位學生發言者正好有三分鐘時間陳述開場論點。 【選項解析】(A) prince (B) speaker 發言者 (C) vendor (D) servant。debate speaker 指辯論發言選手。"},{"number":19,"stem":"In the royal fairy tale, the handsome ______ rode through enchanted forests to rescue his beloved companion.","options":["prince","secretary","mechanic","salesman"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: prince (王子) 【全文中譯】在王室童話中，英俊的王子騎馬穿越魔法森林去拯救他心愛的伴侶。 【選項解析】(A) prince 王子 (B) secretary (C) mechanic (D) salesman。handsome prince 為童話典型形象。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The charity gala was hosted by an elegant ______, who donated millions of dollars to build children's hospitals.","options":["thief","vendor","princess","scientist"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: princess (王妃；公主) 【全文中譯】這場慈善晚會由一位優雅的公主主持，她捐贈了數百萬美元建造兒童醫院。 【選項解析】(A) thief (B) vendor (C) princess 公主 (D) scientist。royal princess 出席主持慈善晚會。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Because my bicycle chain snapped in half, the neighborhood bike ______ repaired it with a replacement link.","options":["salesman","mechanic","speaker","prince"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: mechanic (技工) 【全文中譯】因為我的自行車鏈條斷成了兩截，鄰里自行車技工用替換鏈節把它修好了。 【選項解析】(A) salesman (B) mechanic 技工 (C) speaker (D) prince。bike mechanic 指自行車修護技工。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Dedicated marine ______ spent three months studying coral reef restoration off the southern coast of Taiwan.","options":["servants","scientists","vendors","thieves"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: scientists (海洋科學家) 【全文中譯】敬業的海洋科學家花了三個月時間研究台灣南部海岸附近的珊瑚礁修復工作。 【選項解析】(A) servants (B) scientists 科學家 (C) vendors (D) thieves。marine scientists 指海洋科學家。"},{"number":23,"stem":"An enthusiastic insurance ______ called Mr. Wang to explain the financial advantages of long-term retirement policies.","options":["princess","secretary","salesman","mechanic"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: salesman (保險業務員) 【全文中譯】一位熱心的保險業務員打電話給王先生，解釋長期退休保單的財務優勢。 【選項解析】(A) princess (B) secretary (C) salesman 業務員 (D) mechanic。insurance salesman 指保險業務員。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The personal ______ managed the celebrity's daily schedule, answered fan mail, and organized press conferences.","options":["thief","secretary","vendor","speaker"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: secretary (私人秘書) 【全文中譯】私人秘書管理名人的日常行程安排、回覆粉絲信件並組織記者會。 【選項解析】(A) thief (B) secretary 秘書 (C) vendor (D) speaker。personal secretary 指私人秘書。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Street food ______ outside the sports arena did booming business selling hot dogs and cold soda during the game.","options":["princes","mechanics","scientists","vendors"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: vendors (街頭小販) 【全文中譯】體育場外的街頭食品小販在比賽期間賣熱狗和冷冰汽水，生意興隆。 【選項解析】(A) princes (B) mechanics (C) scientists (D) vendors 攤販。street food vendors 指路邊飲食攤商。"}]},{"unit":26,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 26 (026.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Business, Employment & Commerce | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"serve","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to perform duties or services for an organization, customer, or country","chinese":"服務；供應；服役","sentence":"The friendly family restaurant continues to ______ traditional Taiwanese beef noodles, and long queues form outside every weekend.","translation":"這家溫馨的家庭餐館繼續供應道地的台灣牛肉麵，每個週末外面都會排起長長的人龍。"},{"word":"service","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the action of helping or doing work for someone; customer care","chinese":"服務；協助","sentence":"The hotel staff was praised by overseas travelers because the room ______ was prompt, courteous, and exceptionally helpful.","translation":"飯店員工受到海外旅客的讚賞，因為客房服務迅速、謙恭有禮且非常有幫助。"},{"word":"customer","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person or organization that buys goods or services from a store or business","chinese":"顧客；客戶","sentence":"The supermarket manager politely greeted every loyal ______ who walked through the front doors on Saturday morning.","translation":"超市經理在週六早晨客氣地向走進大門的每一位忠實顧客打招呼。"},{"word":"trade","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"the buying and selling of goods and services between people or countries","chinese":"貿易；交易；商業","sentence":"International ______ between Asian and European nations has expanded rapidly because shipping routes have become more efficient.","translation":"亞洲和歐洲國家之間的國際貿易迅速擴張，因為航運路線變得更加高效。"},{"word":"company","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a commercial business; the condition of being with someone","chinese":"公司；同行；陪伴","sentence":"After working for ten years in finance, Jason and his college friends established an innovative tech ______ in Taipei.","translation":"在金融領域工作了十年之後，傑森和他的大學好友在台北成立了一家創新科技公司。"},{"word":"employee","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person employed for wages or salary, especially at non-executive level","chinese":"員工；受僱者","sentence":"The generous manufacturing firm offered every hardworking ______ a generous year-end bonus and three weeks of paid leave.","translation":"這家慷慨的製造業公司為每位辛勤工作的員工提供了優厚的年終獎金和三週的有薪假。"},{"word":"interview","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a formal meeting at which someone is questioned to assess suitability","chinese":"面試；訪談；採訪","sentence":"David felt slightly nervous before his morning job ______, so he reviewed common questions while waiting in the reception hall.","translation":"大衛在早晨的求職面試前感到有些緊張，所以他在接待大廳等待時複習了常見問題。"},{"word":"hire","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to employ someone for wages; to rent equipment for temporary use","chinese":"僱用；聘請；租用","sentence":"Because the software department had several big projects, the board decided to ______ ten experienced programmers immediately.","translation":"因為軟體部門有幾個大專案，董事會決定立即聘請十位有經驗的程式設計師。"},{"word":"contract","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a written or spoken agreement intended to be enforceable by law","chinese":"合約；契約；縮小","sentence":"Both corporate leaders read every clause in the legal ______ carefully before signing their names at the bottom.","translation":"兩位企業領導人在底部簽名之前，仔細閱讀了這份法律合約中的每一個條款。"},{"word":"quit (quit / quit)","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to leave a place usually permanently; to stop an action or employment","chinese":"辭職；放棄；停止","sentence":"After working long overnight hours for three years, Sarah decided to ______ her stressful job to pursue her passion for painting.","translation":"在連續三年上夜班長時間工作之後，莎拉決定辭掉這份壓力很大的工作，去追求她對畫畫的熱情。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The cafeteria staff works hard from eleven to two every weekday to ______ fresh hot meals to hungry high school students.","options":["quit","serve","trade","hire"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: serve (供應；服務) 【全文中譯】自助餐廳員工每個工作日的十一點到兩點辛勤工作，為飢腸轆轆的高中生供應新鮮熱食。 【選項解析】(A) quit 辭職 (B) serve 供應 (C) trade 貿易 (D) hire 僱用。供應餐點用 serve meals。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The airline won an international award because their flight attendants offered outstanding customer ______ to passengers.","options":["service","contract","company","interview"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: service (服務) 【全文中譯】該航空公司榮獲國際大獎，因為其空服人員向乘客提供了卓越的顧客服務。 【選項解析】(A) service 服務 (B) contract 合約 (C) company 公司 (D) interview 面試。customer service 指客戶服務。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The store manager offered a ten percent discount voucher to any satisfied ______ who completed an online feedback survey.","options":["employee","trade","customer","company"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: customer (顧客；客戶) 【全文中譯】超市經理向任何完成線上反饋調查的滿意顧客提供九折優惠券。 【選項解析】(A) employee 員工 (B) trade 貿易 (C) customer 顧客 (D) company 公司。給予完成問卷的顧客優惠。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Maritime ______ agreements signed between the two neighboring countries lowered tariffs on agricultural exports.","options":["interview","trade","service","contract"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: trade (貿易) 【全文中譯】兩個鄰國之間簽署的海上貿易協定降低了農產品出口關稅。 【選項解析】(A) interview 面試 (B) trade 貿易 (C) service 服務 (D) contract 合約。maritime trade agreements（海上貿易協定）。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The multinational pharmaceutical ______ invested millions of dollars in developing affordable medicine for developing nations.","options":["employee","customer","trade","company"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: company (公司) 【全文中譯】這家跨國製藥公司斥資數百萬美元，為開發中國家開發價格合理的藥品。 【選項解析】(A) employee (B) customer (C) trade (D) company 公司。multinational pharmaceutical company（跨國製藥公司）。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Every full-time ______ in the factory receives comprehensive health insurance coverage and two weeks of paid vacation.","options":["employee","service","contract","interview"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: employee (員工) 【全文中譯】工廠裡的每一位全職員工都享有全面的醫療保險保障和兩週的有薪假。 【選項解析】(A) employee 員工 (B) service (C) contract (D) interview。受僱享福利者為 full-time employee。"},{"number":7,"stem":"Maria practiced her self-introduction several times before attending the final round of her job ______ at the bank.","options":["trade","interview","company","service"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: interview (面試) 【全文中譯】瑪麗亞在參加銀行最後一輪求職面試之前，多次練習了自己的自我介紹。 【選項解析】(A) trade (B) interview 面試 (C) company (D) service。job interview 指求職面試。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Because peak tourist season was approaching, the beachfront resort planned to ______ twenty temporary kitchen assistants.","options":["serve","quit","hire","trade"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: hire (僱用；聘請) 【全文中譯】由於旅遊旺季即將到來，這家海濱度假村計劃立即聘請二十名臨時廚房助手。 【選項解析】(A) serve (B) quit (C) hire 聘請 (D) trade。招募臨時工為 hire assistants。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Before buying the apartment, Mr. Lin asked his lawyer to inspect the property purchase ______ for hidden liabilities.","options":["contract","employee","service","customer"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: contract (合約) 【全文中譯】在購買該公寓之前，林先生請他的律師仔細檢查房產購買合約以防暗藏債務。 【選項解析】(A) contract 合約 (B) employee (C) service (D) customer。property purchase contract（購屋合約）。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Mark was extremely exhausted from working eighty hours a week, so he finally gathered his courage to ______ his position.","options":["serve","hire","quit","trade"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: quit (辭職；放棄) 【全文中譯】馬克因每週工作八十小時而極度精疲力竭，因此他終於鼓起勇氣辭去了職位。 【選項解析】(A) serve (B) hire (C) quit 辭職 (D) trade。辭去職務用 quit his position。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Flight attendants smiled warmly as they began to ______ beverages and warm snacks to passengers on the long flight.","options":["trade","quit","hire","serve"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: serve (供應；端送) 【全文中譯】空服人員面帶溫暖的微笑，開始在長途飛行中為乘客供應飲料和溫熱小吃。 【選項解析】(A) trade (B) quit (C) hire (D) serve 供應。客艙供應餐飲用 serve beverages。"},{"number":12,"stem":"After ten years of dependable ______, the senior technician was rewarded with a gold watch at the annual company party.","options":["service","interview","customer","contract"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: service (服務；貢獻) 【全文中譯】在長達十年的可靠服務奉獻之後，資深技術員在公司年度聚會上獲贈一只金錶。 【選項解析】(A) service 服務年資 (B) interview (C) customer (D) contract。ten years of dependable service。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The clothing boutique welcomed a wealthy ______ who purchased five silk dresses and three matching winter coats.","options":["trade","customer","company","employee"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: customer (顧客) 【全文中譯】這家服飾精品店迎來了一位富有的顧客，她買了五件絲綢洋裝和三件配套的冬衣。 【選項解析】(A) trade (B) customer 顧客 (C) company (D) employee。購買服飾者為 boutique customer。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Ancient merchants traveled along the Silk Road to ______ Chinese silk and porcelain for European glass and wine.","options":["quit","serve","trade","hire"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: trade (交易；交換) 【全文中譯】古代商人沿著絲綢之路跋涉，用中國的絲綢和瓷器換取歐洲的玻璃和葡萄酒。 【選項解析】(A) quit (B) serve (C) trade 交換/以物易物 (D) hire。trade silk for wine（以絲綢交換葡萄酒）。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The logistics ______ purchased fifty new electric delivery vans to reduce carbon emissions across the metropolitan area.","options":["company","service","customer","contract"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: company (公司) 【全文中譯】這家物流公司採購了五十輛全新電動貨車，以減少大都會區的碳排放量。 【選項解析】(A) company 公司 (B) service (C) customer (D) contract。logistics company（物流公司）。"},{"number":16,"stem":"An outstanding ______ who exceeded monthly sales targets by fifty percent was promoted to regional marketing director.","options":["service","interview","employee","trade"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: employee (員工) 【全文中譯】一位月銷售額超出目標百分之五十的傑出員工，被拔擢為區域行銷總監。 【選項解析】(A) service (B) interview (C) employee 員工 (D) trade。工作表現優異受拔擢者為 employee。"},{"number":17,"stem":"The magazine reporter conducted an in-depth ______ with the famous film director regarding his cinematic inspirations.","options":["company","contract","interview","customer"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: interview (專訪；訪談) 【全文中譯】雜誌記者就其電影創作靈感對這位著名電影導演進行了深度訪談。 【選項解析】(A) company (B) contract (C) interview 專訪 (D) customer。conducted an in-depth interview。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The tech corporation announced plans to ______ two hundred skilled data analysts for their newly opened research center.","options":["quit","trade","serve","hire"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: hire (招聘；僱用) 【全文中譯】這家科技巨頭宣佈計劃為其新落成的研發中心招聘兩百名熟練的數據分析師。 【選項解析】(A) quit (B) trade (C) serve (D) hire 招聘。企業召募人才用 hire analysts。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Players who sign a professional athletic ______ must maintain rigorous physical fitness throughout the competitive season.","options":["customer","contract","employee","service"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: contract (合約；契約) 【全文中譯】簽署職業運動合約的選手必須在整個賽季期間維持嚴格的身材體能狀態。 【選項解析】(A) customer (B) contract 契約 (C) employee (D) service。athletic contract（運動員合約）。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The doctor warned the patient that he must ______ smoking cigarettes immediately to avoid permanent heart damage.","options":["quit","serve","trade","hire"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: quit (戒除；戒掉) 【全文中譯】醫生警告該病患必須立即戒菸，以免造成永久性心臟損傷。 【選項解析】(A) quit 戒除 (B) serve (C) trade (D) hire。quit smoking 指戒菸。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The elegant restaurant strives to ______ authentic Italian cuisine using fresh imported olive oil and homemade cheese.","options":["hire","serve","trade","quit"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: serve (供應；端出) 【全文中譯】這家優雅的餐館力求使用新鮮進口橄欖油和自製乳酪，供應正宗義大利美食。 【選項解析】(A) hire (B) serve 供應 (C) trade (D) quit。餐館供應美食用 serve cuisine。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Fast and polite customer ______ is the primary reason why online shoppers remain loyal to this e-commerce platform.","options":["contract","service","employee","company"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: service (服務) 【全文中譯】迅速且有禮貌的客戶服務，是線上購物者對該電子商務平台保持忠誠的主要原因。 【選項解析】(A) contract (B) service 服務 (C) employee (D) company。customer service 指售後與客戶服務。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The banking clerk assisted an elderly ______ who needed help filling out an international wire transfer document.","options":["trade","interview","customer","service"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: customer (顧客；客戶) 【全文中譯】銀行行員協助了一位需要填寫國際電匯文件表格的老年客戶。 【選項解析】(A) trade (B) interview (C) customer 客戶 (D) service。至銀行臨櫃辦理業務者為 bank customer。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The export-oriented nation relies heavily on foreign ______ to import crude oil and export advanced semiconductors.","options":["trade","contract","company","employee"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: trade (貿易) 【全文中譯】這個以出口為導向的國家高度依賴對外貿易來進口原油並出口先進半導體。 【選項解析】(A) trade 貿易 (B) contract (C) company (D) employee。foreign trade 指對外貿易。"},{"number":25,"stem":"During the panel ______, candidates were evaluated on problem-solving abilities, communication skills, and team spirit.","options":["company","service","customer","interview"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: interview (面試) 【全文中譯】在小組面試期間，評審依據問題解決能力、溝通技巧和團隊合作精神來評估應試者。 【選項解析】(A) company (B) service (C) customer (D) interview 面試。panel interview 指小組集體面試。"}]},{"unit":27,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 27 (027.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Aviation, Public Transit & Highway Infrastructure | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"aircraft","pos":"(n.)","definition":"any airplane, helicopter, or flying machine (pl. aircraft)","chinese":"航空器；飛機","sentence":"The international airport ordered fifteen modern commercial ______ to meet the rising demand for overseas travel.","translation":"該國際機場訂購了十五架現代商用航空器，以滿足日益增長的出境旅遊需求。"},{"word":"airline","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a company that provides regular flights for passengers or cargo","chinese":"航空公司","sentence":"Our family booked discounted round-trip tickets through a reputable budget ______, and the customer service was surprisingly good.","translation":"我們全家透過一家聲譽良好的廉價航空公司訂購了折扣來回機票，其客戶服務出乎意料地好。"},{"word":"flight","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a journey made through the air, especially in an airplane","chinese":"航班；飛行","sentence":"Because severe stormy weather hit Tokyo, our direct afternoon ______ was delayed on the airport runway for two hours.","translation":"因為嚴重暴風雨襲擊東京，我們下午的直飛航班在機場跑道上延誤了兩個小時。"},{"word":"plane","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an airplane; a powered flying vehicle with fixed wings","chinese":"飛機","sentence":"The passengers fastened their seatbelts tightly as the heavy passenger ______ accelerated rapidly down the runway.","translation":"當這架沉重的大型客運飛機在跑道上快速加速時，機上乘客緊緊繫上了安全帶。"},{"word":"helicopter","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an aircraft that derives lift from rotating overhead blades","chinese":"直升機","sentence":"A rescue ______ hovered steadily above the raging river to lift stranded mountain hikers into the cabin safely.","translation":"一架救援直升機在洶湧的河流上方平穩盤旋，將受困的山區登山客安全吊起進入機艙。"},{"word":"MRT","pos":"(n.)","definition":"Mass Rapid Transit; the metropolitan subway and elevated train system","chinese":"捷運；大眾捷運系統","sentence":"Commuters in Taipei prefer taking the punctual ______ during rush hours because city street traffic is often gridlocked.","translation":"台北的通勤族在尖峰時段更喜歡搭乘準時的捷運，因為市區街道交通經常嚴重堵塞。"},{"word":"subway","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an underground railway system in a city","chinese":"地下鐵；地鐵","sentence":"During our winter holiday in New York, we bought a weekly pass to ride the underground ______ across Manhattan easily.","translation":"在紐約度寒假期間，我們買了一張週票，方便搭乘地下地鐵暢行曼哈頓。"},{"word":"highway","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a main public road, especially connecting major cities","chinese":"公路；高速公路","sentence":"Long-distance truck drivers usually travel along the national ______ late at night when the roadway is clear of traffic.","translation":"長途卡車司機通常在深夜路面車流稀少時，沿著國道高速公路行駛。"},{"word":"overpass","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a bridge that carries one road or path above another road","chinese":"天橋；陸橋；高架道","sentence":"Pedestrians are encouraged to walk across the elevated ______ to cross the dangerous ten-lane avenue safely.","translation":"政府鼓勵行人走上高架天橋，以安全穿越這條危險的十線道大馬路。"},{"word":"underpass","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a tunnel or sunken roadway allowing vehicles or pedestrians to pass beneath","chinese":"地下道；地下車道","sentence":"Because the heavy monsoon storm flooded the low-lying ______, city traffic police closed the road to prevent accidents.","translation":"因為強烈的季風暴雨淹沒了低窪的地下道，市區交通警察封閉了道路以防止意外發生。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Technicians at the air base conducted thorough maintenance on each military ______ before morning training drills began.","options":["overpass","aircraft","subway","underpass"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: aircraft (航空器；軍機) 【全文中譯】空軍基地的技術人員在晨間訓練演習開始前，對每架軍用航空器進行了徹底維修。 【選項解析】(A) overpass 天橋 (B) aircraft 航空器 (C) subway 地鐵 (D) underpass 地下道。military aircraft（軍用飛機/航空器）。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The national ______ expanded its flight network by opening five new direct routes to major European capitals.","options":["airline","underpass","overpass","highway"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: airline (航空公司) 【全文中譯】這家國家航空公司透過開通五條直飛歐洲主要首都的新航線，擴大了其航線網絡。 【選項解析】(A) airline 航空公司 (B) underpass (C) overpass (D) highway。開通直飛航線的企業為 airline。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The captain announced that our transatlantic ______ would land thirty minutes ahead of schedule due to strong tailwinds.","options":["underpass","highway","flight","overpass"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: flight (航班；飛行航程) 【全文中譯】機長廣播宣布由於強勁順風，我們的跨大西洋航班將提前三十分鐘降落。 【選項解析】(A) underpass (B) highway (C) flight 航班 (D) overpass。transatlantic flight（跨大西洋航班）。"},{"number":4,"stem":"As the cargo ______ touched down smoothly on the concrete runway, the cabin crew breathed a sigh of relief.","options":["subway","plane","MRT","overpass"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: plane (飛機；貨機) 【全文中譯】當貨運飛機平穩降落在混凝土跑道上時，機組人員鬆了一口氣。 【選項解析】(A) subway (B) plane 飛機 (C) MRT (D) overpass。cargo plane 指貨運飛機。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The emergency medical service dispatched a rescue ______ to evacuate the critically injured hiker from the canyon.","options":["underpass","airline","helicopter","highway"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: helicopter (直升機) 【全文中譯】緊急醫療服務派遣了一架救援直升機，從峽谷中疏散受重傷的登山客。 【選項解析】(A) underpass (B) airline (C) helicopter 直升機 (D) highway。rescue helicopter（搜救直升機）。"},{"number":6,"stem":"In urban Taiwan, riding the air-conditioned ______ is widely considered the most convenient way to travel around town.","options":["MRT","highway","plane","overpass"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: MRT (捷運) 【全文中譯】在台灣市區，搭乘配備冷氣的大眾捷運被普遍認為是周遊城市最方便的方式。 【選項解析】(A) MRT 捷運 (B) highway (C) plane (D) overpass。都會區冷氣大眾運輸工具指 MRT。"},{"number":7,"stem":"Travelers navigating through London can easily reach any district by following colorful maps inside the ______ system.","options":["airline","subway","helicopter","overpass"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: subway (地鐵系統) 【全文中譯】遊覽倫敦的旅客只要跟隨地鐵系統內色彩豐富的地圖，就能輕鬆到達任何區域。 【選項解析】(A) airline (B) subway 地鐵 (C) helicopter (D) overpass。London subway / underground 指地鐵。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The government widened the coastal ______ from two lanes to four lanes to accommodate heavy weekend tourist traffic.","options":["flight","underpass","aircraft","highway"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: highway (公路；高速公路) 【全文中譯】政府將沿海公路從雙向兩線拓寬為四線道，以容納週末繁忙的觀光車流。 【選項解析】(A) flight (B) underpass (C) aircraft (D) highway 公路。拓寬車道容納車流指 coastal highway。"},{"number":9,"stem":"To avoid crossing the speeding expressway on foot, workers climbed the concrete ______ to reach the factory opposite.","options":["overpass","airline","plane","flight"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: overpass (天橋；陸橋) 【全文中譯】為了避免徒步穿越車速飛快的快速道路，工人們登上混凝土天橋以前往對面的工廠。 【選項解析】(A) overpass 天橋 (B) airline (C) plane (D) flight。跨越道路之陸橋為 pedestrian overpass。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Drainage pumps were installed at the entrance of the pedestrian ______ to prevent rainwater from accumulating during typhoons.","options":["helicopter","underpass","aircraft","airline"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: underpass (地下道) 【全文中譯】行人地下道入口處安裝了排水抽水機，以防颱風期間雨水積聚成災。 【選項解析】(A) helicopter (B) underpass 地下道 (C) aircraft (D) airline。pedestrian underpass 指行人地下道。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Aerospace engineers designed an experimental ______ powered entirely by solar batteries and ultra-light materials.","options":["underpass","subway","aircraft","highway"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: aircraft (航空器) 【全文中譯】航太工程師設計了一架完全由太陽能電池和超輕材料驅動的實驗性航空器。 【選項解析】(A) underpass (B) subway (C) aircraft 航空器 (D) highway。experimental aircraft 指實驗飛行器。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Because the budget ______ charges extra fees for checked baggage, many backpackers travel with just one carry-on bag.","options":["airline","overpass","MRT","underpass"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: airline (航空公司) 【全文中譯】因為廉價航空公司對托運行李收取額外費用，許多背包客只攜帶一件隨身行李出行。 【選項解析】(A) airline 航空公司 (B) overpass (C) MRT (D) underpass。budget airline（廉價航空公司）。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Passengers were advised to confirm their international ______ status online before traveling to the airport terminal.","options":["highway","overpass","flight","underpass"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: flight (航班) 【全文中譯】旅客被建議在前往機場航廈之前，先上網確認他們的國際航班狀態。 【選項解析】(A) highway (B) overpass (C) flight 航班 (D) underpass。international flight status（國際航班動態）。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The twin-engine passenger ______ climbed above the gray rain clouds into bright and steady sunshine.","options":["underpass","plane","subway","overpass"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: plane (飛機) 【全文中譯】這架雙引擎客機爬升穿過灰色雨雲，進入陽光明媚平穩的雲層上方。 【選項解析】(A) underpass (B) plane 飛機 (C) subway (D) overpass。twin-engine passenger plane（雙引擎客機）。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The traffic surveillance ______ broadcast live video of the highway collision to the police command center.","options":["airline","subway","underpass","helicopter"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: helicopter (直升機) 【全文中譯】交通監控直升機將公路相撞事故的現場畫面即時傳輸到警方指揮中心。 【選項解析】(A) airline (B) subway (C) underpass (D) helicopter 直升機。surveillance helicopter（監控直升機）。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Students tapped their contactless smartcards at the automatic ticket gate to enter the crowded ______ platform.","options":["MRT","highway","aircraft","overpass"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: MRT (捷運月台) 【全文中譯】學生在自動驗票閘門感應非接觸式晶片智慧卡，走進擁擠的捷運月台。 【選項解析】(A) MRT 捷運 (B) highway (C) aircraft (D) overpass。crowded MRT platform（擁擠的捷運月台）。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Street performers often play guitars and harmonicas near the bustling exits of the underground ______ station.","options":["highway","helicopter","subway","airline"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: subway (地鐵站) 【全文中譯】街頭藝人經常在繁忙的地下地鐵站出口附近彈吉他吹口琴。 【選項解析】(A) highway (B) helicopter (C) subway 地鐵 (D) airline。underground subway station（地下地鐵站）。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Long lines of automobiles crept forward slowly along the interstate ______ during the holiday weekend rush.","options":["underpass","flight","aircraft","highway"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: highway (高速公路) 【全文中譯】在假日週末的高峰期，長長的汽車隊伍在州際高速公路上緩慢向前蠕動。 【選項解析】(A) underpass (B) flight (C) aircraft (D) highway 高速公路。interstate highway（州際公路）。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Urban planners built an illuminated pedestrian ______ across the boulevard so students could reach the library safely.","options":["overpass","airline","helicopter","plane"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: overpass (人行天橋) 【全文中譯】都市規劃人員在大道上方建造了一座有照明設施的行人天橋，以便學生能安全前往圖書館。 【選項解析】(A) overpass 天橋 (B) airline (C) helicopter (D) plane。illuminated pedestrian overpass。"},{"number":20,"stem":"City maintenance workers cleared leaves and trash from the storm drains inside the vehicle ______ after midnight.","options":["aircraft","underpass","flight","airline"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: underpass (車行地下道) 【全文中譯】市政維護人員在午夜過後清理了車行地下道內雨水落水管中的樹葉和垃圾。 【選項解析】(A) aircraft (B) underpass 地下道 (C) flight (D) airline。vehicle underpass（車行地下道）。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The carrier transports perishable seafood worldwide using refrigerated containers loaded onto heavy cargo ______.","options":["subways","highways","aircraft","underpasses"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: aircraft (貨運航空器) 【全文中譯】該承運商利用裝載到大型貨運航空器上的冷藏貨櫃，向全球運送易腐海鮮。 【選項解析】(A) subways (B) highways (C) aircraft 航空器 (D) underpasses。heavy cargo aircraft（大型貨機）。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Customer loyalty programs run by this global ______ reward frequent flyers with free upgrades and lounge passes.","options":["airline","overpass","underpass","highway"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: airline (航空公司) 【全文中譯】這家全球航空公司營運的客戶忠誠計劃，以免費升等和貴賓室使用券獎勵常客。 【選項解析】(A) airline 航空公司 (B) overpass (C) underpass (D) highway。global airline loyalty program。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Due to unexpected mechanical trouble on engine number two, the long-distance ______ made an emergency landing.","options":["underpass","overpass","highway","flight"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: flight (長途航班) 【全文中譯】由於二號發動機發生意外機械故障，該長途航班進行了緊急降落。 【選項解析】(A) underpass (B) overpass (C) highway (D) flight 航班。long-distance flight（長途航班）。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The young boy looked out the bedroom window with excitement, pointing up at a silver ______ soaring in the blue sky.","options":["subway","plane","underpass","overpass"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: plane (飛機) 【全文中譯】小男孩興奮地望向臥室窗外，用手指著天空中一架翱翔在藍天裡的銀色飛機。 【選項解析】(A) subway (B) plane 飛機 (C) underpass (D) overpass。soaring in the sky 表 plane 飛機。"},{"number":25,"stem":"During wildfire operations, a heavy water-dropping ______ refilled its tank from a nearby mountain reservoir.","options":["highway","underpass","helicopter","MRT"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: helicopter (滅火直升機) 【全文中譯】在森林野火撲滅作業中，一架重型灑水直升機從附近的山區水庫補充了水箱水槽。 【選項解析】(A) highway (B) underpass (C) helicopter 直升機 (D) MRT。water-dropping helicopter（灑水滅火直升機）。"}]},{"unit":28,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 28 (028.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Rail Transit, Travel Motion & Visual Signals | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"jeep","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a sturdy motor vehicle with four-wheel drive, used over rough terrain","chinese":"吉普車","sentence":"The wildlife rangers drove a rugged open-top ______ across the rocky grassland to observe migrating wild animals.","translation":"野生動物巡警駕駛著一輛耐用的敞篷吉普車穿過崎嶇的草原，觀察遷徙的野生動物。"},{"word":"railroad","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a permanent track composed of rails on which trains run; train system","chinese":"鐵路；鐵路系統","sentence":"Workers constructed the famous historic mountain ______ over a century ago to transport timber from deep alpine forests.","translation":"一個多世紀前，工人們修建了這條著名的歷史登山鐵路，將木材從高山深林中運送出來。"},{"word":"platform","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a raised level surface on which people stand at a train station or stage","chinese":"月台；講台；平台","sentence":"Dozens of eager commuters stood behind the yellow safety line on the railway ______ waiting for the morning express train.","translation":"數十名熱切的通勤者站在鐵路月台上的黃色安全線後方，等待著早班特快列車。"},{"word":"passenger","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a traveler on a public or private conveyance other than the driver or crew","chinese":"乘客；旅客","sentence":"The flight attendant gently reminded each seated ______ to keep their seatbelts fastened during turbulent weather conditions.","translation":"空服人員溫柔地提醒每一位就座的乘客，在不穩定的氣流天氣條件下務必繫好安全帶。"},{"word":"path","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a way or track laid down for walking or made by continual treading","chinese":"小徑；路線；道路","sentence":"A quiet stone ______ wound through the green bamboo grove, leading visitors toward an ancient wooden Buddhist monastery.","translation":"一條幽靜的石砌小徑穿過翠綠的竹林，引導遊客走向一座古老的木造佛寺。"},{"word":"tunnel","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"an artificial underground passage, especially one built through a hill","chinese":"隧道；地道；挖地道","sentence":"The high-speed bullet train turned on its bright headlights before speeding through the long mountain ______.","translation":"高速高鐵列車在急速駛過長長的山區隧道之前，打開了明亮的前照燈。"},{"word":"sign","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a notice bearing information or instructions; to write one's name","chinese":"標誌；指示牌；簽署","sentence":"The yellow highway warning ______ alerted motorists to watch out for falling rocks during heavy rainy weather.","translation":"黃色公路警示標誌提醒駕駛人，在大雨滂沱的天氣中要小心落石。"},{"word":"movement","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an act of changing physical location or position; a group trend","chinese":"動作；移動；運動","sentence":"The dance instructor watched the student's graceful arm ______ carefully and offered tips on keeping perfect balance.","translation":"舞蹈教練仔細觀察學生優雅的手臂動作，並提供了保持完美平衡的訣竅。"},{"word":"motion","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the action or process of moving or being moved; gesture","chinese":"移動；動作；提議","sentence":"The sensor lights in the dark hallway are activated by physical ______, so they turn on whenever someone walks past.","translation":"黑暗走廊裡的感應燈是由人體移動感應觸發的，因此每當有人走過時它們就會亮起。"},{"word":"effect","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a change which is a result or consequence of an action or other cause","chinese":"影響；效果；結果","sentence":"Scientific studies demonstrate that regular physical exercise has a beneficial long-term ______ on cardiovascular health.","translation":"科學研究顯示，規律的體能鍛鍊對心血管健康具有持久且有益的良好影響。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The safari guide drove a four-wheel-drive ______ across the bumpy muddy road so tourists could photograph zebras.","options":["path","jeep","tunnel","effect"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: jeep (吉普車) 【全文中譯】荒野遊獵嚮導駕駛四輪驅動吉普車穿過崎嶇泥濘的道路，以便遊客拍攝斑馬。 【選項解析】(A) path 小徑 (B) jeep 吉普車 (C) tunnel 隧道 (D) effect 效果。四輪驅動穿越崎嶇道路者為 4WD jeep。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The high-speed transcontinental ______ connected remote coastal fishing towns to thriving industrial trade hubs.","options":["passenger","railroad","motion","movement"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: railroad (鐵路) 【全文中譯】這條跨洲高速鐵路將偏遠的沿海漁鎮與繁榮的工業貿易樞紐連接起來。 【選項解析】(A) passenger 乘客 (B) railroad 鐵路 (C) motion 動作 (D) movement 移動。transcontinental railroad（橫貫大陸鐵路）。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Hundreds of passengers waited patiently on the cold station ______ as the morning commuter train approached.","options":["sign","effect","platform","jeep"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: platform (月台) 【全文中譯】數百名乘客在早班通勤火車進站時，在寒冷的車站月台上耐心等待。 【選項解析】(A) sign 標誌 (B) effect (C) platform 月台 (D) jeep。station platform 表車站月台。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Every international airline ______ must present a valid passport and boarding pass before entering the departure gate.","options":["passenger","movement","tunnel","railroad"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: passenger (乘客；旅客) 【全文中譯】每位國際航班旅客在進入登機門之前，都必須出示有效護照和登機證。 【選項解析】(A) passenger 乘客 (B) movement (C) tunnel (D) railroad。搭乘航班之旅客為 flight passenger。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Follow the winding gravel ______ through the flower garden, and you will find a peaceful marble fountain at the end.","options":["motion","effect","sign","path"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: path (小徑；道路) 【全文中譯】沿著穿過花園的蜿蜒碎石小徑漫步，你將在盡頭發現一座寧靜的大理石噴泉。 【選項解析】(A) motion (B) effect (C) sign (D) path 小徑。gravel path 指碎石小路。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Vehicles entering the dark undersea ______ are strictly required to turn on headlights and obey the lower speed limit.","options":["tunnel","jeep","passenger","platform"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: tunnel (隧道；海底地道) 【全文中譯】進入黑暗海底隧道的車輛被嚴格要求開啟前大燈並遵守較低的速限規定。 【選項解析】(A) tunnel 隧道 (B) jeep (C) passenger (D) platform。undersea tunnel（海底隧道）。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The metal road ______ showed a sharp right turn ahead, prompting the attentive driver to slow down immediately.","options":["effect","sign","motion","movement"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: sign (標誌；指示牌) 【全文中譯】金屬道路標誌顯示前方急向右轉，促使警覺的司機立即減速。 【選項解析】(A) effect (B) sign 道路標誌 (C) motion (D) movement。road sign 指道路交通標誌。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The wildlife camera captured the stealthy ______ of a leopard stalking a deer through the tall savannah grass.","options":["movement","platform","railroad","passenger"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: movement (動作；移動姿態) 【全文中譯】野生動物相機捕捉到一隻花豹穿過大草原高草潛伏靠近鹿群的悄悄動作。 【選項解析】(A) movement 移動/動作 (B) platform (C) railroad (D) passenger。stealthy movement 指潛行動作。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The automated camera caught the subtle hand ______ of the magician as he replaced the playing card unseen.","options":["tunnel","path","motion","jeep"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: motion (動作；移動) 【全文中譯】自動攝影機捕捉到了魔術師在無人注意下掉換撲克牌時的微妙手部動作。 【選項解析】(A) tunnel (B) path (C) motion 動作 (D) jeep。hand motion 指手部細微動作。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Lack of sleep had a negative ______ on David's academic concentration, causing his exam scores to drop.","options":["effect","sign","platform","railroad"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: effect (影響；效果) 【全文中譯】睡眠不足對大衛的學術專注力產生了負面影響，導致他的考試成績下滑。 【選項解析】(A) effect 影響 (B) sign (C) platform (D) railroad。negative effect on... 指對……產生負面影響。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Soldiers used an armored military ______ to navigate rugged mountain trails where regular cars could not travel.","options":["passenger","effect","path","jeep"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: jeep (軍用吉普車) 【全文中譯】士兵們使用裝甲軍用吉普車穿梭於普通汽車無法通行的崎嶇山徑。 【選項解析】(A) passenger (B) effect (C) path (D) jeep 吉普車。military jeep 指軍用吉普車。"},{"number":12,"stem":"In the 19th century, expansion of the transcontinental ______ stimulated trade and settlement across North America.","options":["railroad","movement","tunnel","sign"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: railroad (鐵路) 【全文中譯】在 19 世紀，橫貫大陸鐵路的擴張促進了整個北美的貿易和定居拓荒。 【選項解析】(A) railroad 鐵路 (B) movement (C) tunnel (D) sign。expansion of railroad（鐵路拓建）。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The station announcer warned travelers not to lean over the edge of the subway ______ while waiting for trains.","options":["motion","platform","effect","jeep"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: platform (月台) 【全文中譯】車站廣播提醒旅客在等車時，切勿探身越過地鐵月台邊緣。 【選項解析】(A) motion (B) platform 月台 (C) effect (D) jeep。edge of subway platform（地鐵月台邊緣）。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The elderly bus ______ was offered a courtesy seat by a polite student who noticed she was carrying heavy groceries.","options":["passenger","path","sign","railroad"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: passenger (公車乘客) 【全文中譯】一位有禮貌的學生看到這位老婦人提著沉重的雜貨，便主動給這位年邁的公車乘客讓座。 【選項解析】(A) passenger 乘客 (B) path (C) sign (D) railroad。bus passenger 指公車乘客。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Hikers enjoyed walking along the scenic coastal ______, which offered breathtaking panoramic views of the blue ocean.","options":["movement","effect","path","tunnel"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: path (景觀步道；步道) 【全文中譯】徒步旅行者享受漫步於風景優美的海岸步道，該小徑提供蔚藍海洋令人驚嘆的全景。 【選項解析】(A) movement (B) effect (C) path 步道 (D) tunnel。scenic coastal path（濱海觀景步道）。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Construction teams drilled through solid granite for five years to build the twenty-kilometer railway ______.","options":["tunnel","passenger","jeep","platform"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: tunnel (鐵路隧道) 【全文中譯】施工團隊耗時五年鑽穿堅硬的花崗岩，修建完成了這條長達二十公里的鐵路隧道。 【選項解析】(A) tunnel 隧道 (B) passenger (C) jeep (D) platform。railway tunnel 指鐵路隧道。"},{"number":17,"stem":"A red octagonal stop ______ was erected at the dangerous street corner to prevent further vehicular collisions.","options":["motion","effect","sign","path"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: sign (停標誌；標牌) 【全文中譯】危險的街角樹立了一個紅色的八角形停車標誌，以防止再次發生車輛碰撞事故。 【選項解析】(A) motion (B) effect (C) sign 交通標誌 (D) path。stop sign 指八角形停字標誌。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The doctor checked the range of joint ______ in the athlete's shoulder following his reconstructive surgery.","options":["railroad","movement","platform","tunnel"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: movement (關節活動度；動作範圍) 【全文中譯】在運動員進行韌帶重建手術後，醫生檢查了他肩部的關節活動幅度。 【選項解析】(A) railroad (B) movement 活動度/活動範圍 (C) platform (D) tunnel。range of joint movement 指關節活動度。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Modern automatic doors operate using infrared ______ sensors that detect approaching people and open smoothly.","options":["motion","jeep","passenger","effect"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: motion (動態；運動感知) 【全文中譯】現代自動門使用紅外線動態感應器運作，該感應器探測到接近的人員並平穩打開門。 【選項解析】(A) motion 動態 (B) jeep (C) passenger (D) effect。motion sensor 指動態感應器。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The unexpected positive ______ of planting urban trees was a noticeable reduction in neighborhood summer heat.","options":["sign","path","platform","effect"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: effect (效應；效果) 【全文中譯】種植城市樹木帶來的意料之外積極效應，是鄰里夏季高溫顯著降低。 【選項解析】(A) sign (B) path (C) platform (D) effect 效應/效果。positive effect（正向效應）。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The tour guide parked the sturdy ______ beside the canyon viewpoint so passengers could take memorable landscape photos.","options":["jeep","railroad","movement","motion"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: jeep (吉普車) 【全文中譯】導遊將堅固的吉普車停在峽谷觀景點旁，以便乘客拍攝難忘的風景照。 【選項解析】(A) jeep 吉普車 (B) railroad (C) movement (D) motion。parked the sturdy jeep。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Steam locomotives operated along this historical mountain ______ for decades before modern diesel trains were introduced.","options":["effect","passenger","railroad","sign"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: railroad (高山鐵路) 【全文中譯】在現代柴油火車問世之前，蒸汽機車在這條歷史高山鐵路上行駛了數十年。 【選項解析】(A) effect (B) passenger (C) railroad 鐵路 (D) sign。mountain railroad 指高山登山鐵路。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The crowded railway ______ was cleared quickly as passengers boarded the ten arriving passenger carriages.","options":["path","platform","motion","tunnel"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: platform (月台) 【全文中譯】當旅客登上進站的十節客運車廂時，擁擠的鐵路月台迅速被清空疏散。 【選項解析】(A) path (B) platform 月台 (C) motion (D) tunnel。railway platform 指火車月台。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The train captain apologized over the intercom to every delayed ______ for the unexpected signal breakdown.","options":["passenger","jeep","effect","movement"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: passenger (旅客) 【全文中譯】列車長透過廣播對講機向每一位因意外號誌故障而行程受阻的延誤旅客致歉。 【選項解析】(A) passenger 旅客 (B) jeep (C) effect (D) movement。delayed passenger 指被延誤之乘客。"},{"number":25,"stem":"A narrow dirt ______ led through the quiet orchard directly to the farmer's welcoming wooden cottage.","options":["motion","tunnel","path","sign"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: path (泥土小路；小徑) 【全文中譯】一條狹窄的泥土小徑穿過寧靜的果園，直接通向農夫熱情好客的木造小屋。 【選項解析】(A) motion (B) tunnel (C) path 小徑 (D) sign。narrow dirt path 指泥土小徑。"}]},{"unit":29,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 29 (029.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Weather, Atmospheric Conditions & Cosmos | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"climate","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the weather conditions prevailing in an area over a long period","chinese":"氣候","sentence":"The Mediterranean region is famous for its mild winter ______, which attracts millions of northern European holidaymakers each year.","translation":"地中海地區以其溫和的冬季氣候聞名，每年吸引數百萬北歐度假者前來。"},{"word":"temperature","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the degree of heat or cold measured by a thermometer","chinese":"溫度；氣溫；體溫","sentence":"When the winter cold front arrived from Siberia, the nighttime ______ dropped rapidly below five degrees Celsius in the mountains.","translation":"當來自西伯利亞的冬季冷鋒抵達時，山區的夜間氣溫迅速降至攝氏五度以下。"},{"word":"fog","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a thick cloud of tiny water droplets suspended in the atmosphere near earth","chinese":"霧；濃霧","sentence":"Heavy morning ______ settled over the harbor, forcing ship captains to blow loud foghorns to avoid collisions with other vessels.","translation":"清晨的濃霧籠罩著港口，迫使船長們鳴響響亮的霧號以避免與其他船隻相撞。"},{"word":"thunder","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a loud rumbling or crashing noise heard after a lightning flash","chinese":"雷聲；雷鳴；打雷","sentence":"A sudden roll of loud ______ shook the window glass, and the frightened family rushed inside before the heavy rainfall started.","translation":"一陣突如其來的滾滾雷聲震動了窗戶玻璃，受驚的全家人在暴雨降臨前匆忙躲進屋內。"},{"word":"lightning","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the natural electrical discharge of very short duration between clouds","chinese":"閃電","sentence":"A blinding flash of sharp ______ illuminated the dark midnight sky, striking a tall pine tree on the hill a second later.","translation":"一道耀眼的銳利閃電照亮了漆黑的午夜天空，一秒鐘後擊中了山丘上的一棵高大松樹。"},{"word":"storm","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a violent disturbance of the atmosphere with strong winds, rain, or snow","chinese":"暴風雨；風暴","sentence":"The tropical ______ brought ferocious gale-force winds and heavy rain, uprooting trees and causing temporary power outages in town.","translation":"熱帶風暴帶來了兇猛的狂風和暴雨，連根拔起了樹木並導致鎮上暫時停電。"},{"word":"stormy","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"characterized by violent weather with strong winds, rain, or thunder","chinese":"暴風雨的；波濤洶湧的","sentence":"The brave fishermen decided to stay safely inside the sheltered harbor because ______ seas made sailing extremely hazardous.","translation":"勇敢的漁民決定安全地留在遮蔽的避風港內，因為暴風雨的洶湧大海使出航極其危險。"},{"word":"snowy","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"covered with snow, or characterized by snowfall","chinese":"下雪的；積雪的；多雪的","sentence":"Children dressed in warm wool jackets ran out into the ______ yard, joyfully building a round snowman with their neighborhood friends.","translation":"穿著保暖羊毛夾克的孩子們跑進積雪的院子裡，歡天喜地與鄰居朋友一起堆起圓圓的雪人。"},{"word":"humid","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"marked by a relatively high level of water vapor in the atmosphere","chinese":"潮濕的；濕潤的","sentence":"Summer afternoons in Taipei are intensely hot and ______, so most people carry small towels and stay inside air-conditioned shops.","translation":"台北夏日的午後非常炎熱潮濕，所以大多數人都隨身攜帶小毛巾並待在有冷氣的店鋪裡。"},{"word":"universe","pos":"(n.)","definition":"all existing matter, energy, and space considered as a whole; cosmos","chinese":"宇宙；全人類","sentence":"Astronomers use giant space telescopes orbiting Earth to study distant galaxies and discover the mysterious secrets of the vast ______.","translation":"天文學家使用環繞地球運行的巨型太空望遠鏡研究遙遠的星系，發現浩瀚宇宙的神祕秘密。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Tropical islands usually have a warm and sunny ______ throughout the year, making them popular holiday destinations.","options":["fog","climate","lightning","thunder"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: climate (氣候) 【全文中譯】熱帶島嶼通常全年氣候溫暖晴朗，使其成為受歡迎的度假勝地。 【選項解析】(A) fog 霧 (B) climate 氣候 (C) lightning 閃電 (D) thunder 雷聲。warm and sunny climate 指氣候。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The nurse used a digital ear thermometer to check the sick toddler's body ______ before administering medicine.","options":["temperature","universe","storm","climate"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: temperature (體溫；溫度) 【全文中譯】護士在給藥前，使用數位耳溫槍檢查生病幼兒的體溫。 【選項解析】(A) temperature 體溫 (B) universe 宇宙 (C) storm 暴風雨 (D) climate。body temperature 指體溫。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Dense gray ______ enveloped the mountain highway, reducing visibility to less than ten meters ahead of the windshield.","options":["thunder","fog","climate","universe"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: fog (濃霧) 【全文中譯】濃密的灰色晨霧籠罩了高山公路，使擋風玻璃前的能見度降低到不足十公尺。 【選項解析】(A) thunder (B) fog 霧 (C) climate (D) universe。dense fog 指濃霧造成視線不佳。"},{"number":4,"stem":"We saw the bright flash in the sky, and five seconds later a terrifying boom of ______ echoed through the valley.","options":["temperature","climate","thunder","fog"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: thunder (雷聲) 【全文中譯】我們看到天空中閃過一道亮光，五秒鐘後一聲可怕的雷鳴在山谷中迴盪。 【選項解析】(A) temperature (B) climate (C) thunder 雷聲 (D) fog。先見閃電後聞雷聲 boom of thunder。"},{"number":5,"stem":"You should never stand under a tall solitary tree in an open meadow during a thunderstorm to avoid being struck by ______.","options":["lightning","climate","universe","temperature"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: lightning (閃電) 【全文中譯】雷雨期間切勿站在空曠草地上的孤立高樹下，以避免遭到雷擊閃電襲擊。 【選項解析】(A) lightning 閃電 (B) climate (C) universe (D) temperature。struck by lightning 指遭雷擊。"},{"number":6,"stem":"The maritime bureau issued a severe weather alert warning that a powerful winter ______ would reach the northern coast by dawn.","options":["climate","temperature","fog","storm"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: storm (暴風雨；風暴) 【全文中譯】海事局發布惡劣天氣警報，警告一場強大的冬季暴風雨將在黎明前襲擊北部海岸。 【選項解析】(A) climate (B) temperature (C) fog (D) storm 風暴。winter storm 指冬季暴風雨。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The cargo ship rocked violently from side to side in the ______ waters, forcing the crew to secure all loose containers.","options":["stormy","snowy","humid","mild"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: stormy (暴風雨的；波濤洶湧的) 【全文中譯】貨輪在暴風雨肆虐的波濤洶湧海水中劇烈左右搖晃，迫使船員固定所有鬆動的貨櫃。 【選項解析】(A) stormy 暴風雨的 (B) snowy 下雪的 (C) humid 潮濕的 (D) mild。stormy waters 指波濤洶湧的海水。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The ski resort opened earlier than expected this year because heavy ______ conditions covered the slopes with deep powder.","options":["humid","stormy","snowy","dry"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: snowy (下雪的；積雪的) 【全文中譯】該滑雪度假勝地今年比預期更早開放，因為大雪覆蓋了滑雪坡道呈現厚厚粉雪。 【選項解析】(A) humid (B) stormy (C) snowy 積雪的 (D) dry。snowy conditions 指降雪積雪狀況。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Because the subtropical rainforest climate is extremely warm and ______, exotic ferns and colorful orchids thrive on tree trunks.","options":["snowy","stormy","humid","cold"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: humid (潮濕的) 【全文中譯】由於亞熱帶雨林氣候極其溫暖潮濕，奇異的蕨類植物和色彩鮮豔的蘭花在樹幹上蓬勃生長。 【選項解析】(A) snowy (B) stormy (C) humid 潮濕的 (D) cold。warm and humid 指溫暖潮濕。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Modern cosmologists estimate that our observable ______ contains billions of galaxies, each holding hundreds of billions of stars.","options":["storm","universe","temperature","climate"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: universe (宇宙) 【全文中譯】現代宇宙學家估計我們可觀測的宇宙包含數十億個星系，每個星系擁有數千億顆恆星。 【選項解析】(A) storm (B) universe 宇宙 (C) temperature (D) climate。observable universe 指可觀測宇宙。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Global warming is causing profound disruptions to Earth's seasonal ______, resulting in prolonged droughts and severe floods.","options":["fog","thunder","lightning","climate"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: climate (氣候系統) 【全文中譯】全球暖化對地球的季節性氣候造成深刻破壞，導致長期乾旱和嚴重洪水。 【選項解析】(A) fog (B) thunder (C) lightning (D) climate 氣候。Earth's seasonal climate。"},{"number":12,"stem":"During the heatwave in July, the afternoon ______ climbed above thirty-eight degrees Celsius in central urban districts.","options":["temperature","storm","universe","fog"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: temperature (氣溫) 【全文中譯】在七月的熱浪中，中部市區午後氣溫攀升至攝氏三十八度以上。 【選項解析】(A) temperature 氣溫 (B) storm (C) universe (D) fog。temperature climbed above 38 degrees。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Flights departing from the international airport were grounded for two hours until the thick morning ______ dissipated.","options":["climate","fog","lightning","universe"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: fog (晨霧) 【全文中譯】從國際機場起飛的航班停飛了兩個小時，直到濃厚的晨霧散去。 【選項解析】(A) climate (B) fog 霧 (C) lightning (D) universe。thick morning fog 指濃郁晨霧。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The frightened puppy hid under the sofa because the deafening roar of ______ made the whole living room vibrate.","options":["temperature","climate","thunder","fog"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: thunder (雷聲) 【全文中譯】受驚嚇的小狗躲在沙發底下，因為震耳欲聾的打雷轟鳴聲讓整個客廳都在震動。 【選項解析】(A) temperature (B) climate (C) thunder 雷聲 (D) fog。roar of thunder 指打雷轟鳴。"},{"number":15,"stem":"An electrical bolt of ______ hit the metal TV antenna on the roof, instantly disabling electrical appliances throughout the house.","options":["lightning","climate","temperature","universe"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: lightning (閃電雷擊) 【全文中譯】一道閃電擊中了屋頂的金屬電視天線，瞬間損壞了全屋的電器設備。 【選項解析】(A) lightning 閃電 (B) climate (C) temperature (D) universe。bolt of lightning 指一道閃電。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Fierce gale winds from the tropical ______ tore roof tiles off houses and knocked down power lines across the coastal county.","options":["climate","temperature","storm","fog"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: storm (熱帶風暴；暴風雨) 【全文中譯】熱帶風暴帶來的猛烈狂風掀掉了房屋的屋瓦，並吹倒了沿海縣市的電線。 【選項解析】(A) climate (B) temperature (C) storm 風暴 (D) fog。tropical storm 指熱帶風暴。"},{"number":17,"stem":"The small fishing boat could not cross the ______ sea, so the captain returned to the safety of the rocky cove.","options":["snowy","stormy","humid","clear"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: stormy (暴風雨肆虐的) 【全文中譯】小型漁船無法穿越暴風雨肆虐的大海，因此船長返回了多岩石海灣的安全水域。 【選項解析】(A) snowy (B) stormy 暴風雨的 (C) humid (D) clear。stormy sea 指暴風雨之大海。"},{"number":18,"stem":"In December, tourists love visiting the ______ peaks of Hokkaido to enjoy hot springs and ski on pristine white trails.","options":["humid","stormy","snowy","hot"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: snowy (積雪的；白雪皚皚的) 【全文中譯】在十二月，遊客喜歡造訪北海道白雪皚皚的山峰，享受溫泉並在潔白的純淨雪道上滑雪。 【選項解析】(A) humid (B) stormy (C) snowy 積雪的 (D) hot。snowy peaks 指積雪山峰。"},{"number":19,"stem":"When the weather is excessively hot and ______, moisture in the air prevents sweat from evaporating, making people feel uncomfortable.","options":["snowy","stormy","humid","windy"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: humid (潮濕悶熱的) 【全文中譯】當天氣過度炎熱潮濕時，空氣中的水分阻止汗水蒸發，使人感到非常不舒服。 【選項解析】(A) snowy (B) stormy (C) humid 潮濕的 (D) windy。hot and humid 指濕熱。"},{"number":20,"stem":"Space probes explore the outer boundaries of our solar system, sending back extraordinary pictures from across the known ______.","options":["storm","temperature","climate","universe"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: universe (宇宙) 【全文中譯】太空探測器探索我們太陽系的外邊界，從已知宇宙的各個角落傳回非凡的照片。 【選項解析】(A) storm (B) temperature (C) climate (D) universe 宇宙。known universe 指已知宇宙。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Planting olive and citrus trees requires a warm Mediterranean ______, where winters are mild and summers are dry.","options":["climate","fog","lightning","thunder"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: climate (地中海型氣候) 【全文中譯】種植橄欖和柑橘樹需要溫暖的地中海型氣候，那裡冬季溫和，夏季乾燥。 【選項解析】(A) climate 氣候 (B) fog (C) lightning (D) thunder。Mediterranean climate（地中海氣候）。"},{"number":22,"stem":"To bake the chocolate cake perfectly, set the electronic kitchen oven ______ to one hundred and eighty degrees Celsius.","options":["climate","temperature","universe","storm"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: temperature (烤箱溫度) 【全文中譯】為了完美烘烤巧克力蛋糕，請將廚房電子烤箱溫度設定為攝氏一百八十度。 【選項解析】(A) climate (B) temperature 溫度 (C) universe (D) storm。oven temperature 指烤箱溫度。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Early morning motorists turned on yellow ______ lights and maintained double following distance along the foggy highway.","options":["lightning","thunder","fog","climate"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: fog (霧燈) 【全文中譯】清晨的駕駛人開啟黃色霧燈，並在多霧的高速公路上保持兩倍的跟車距離。 【選項解析】(A) lightning (B) thunder (C) fog 霧 (D) climate。fog lights 指車輛霧燈。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The sudden flash was followed immediately by sharp rattling ______, signaling that the storm center was directly overhead.","options":["temperature","universe","climate","thunder"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: thunder (雷鳴) 【全文中譯】突如其來的閃光之後緊接著是一陣劇烈的連環雷鳴，顯示風暴中心就在正上方。 【選項解析】(A) temperature (B) universe (C) climate (D) thunder 雷聲。rattling thunder 指轟鳴雷聲。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Protective copper rods are installed on tall skyscrapers to channel hazardous strikes of ______ harmlessly deep into the ground.","options":["lightning","fog","climate","temperature"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: lightning (閃電；避雷針引雷) 【全文中譯】摩天大樓上安裝了保護性的銅避雷針，將危險的閃電襲擊安全導入地底深處。 【選項解析】(A) lightning 閃電 (B) fog (C) climate (D) temperature。strikes of lightning 指閃電雷擊。"}]},{"unit":30,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 30 (030.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Natural Landscapes, Bodies of Water & Coastal Geography | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"nature","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the physical world including plants, animals, and landscapes","chinese":"大自然；自然界；天性","sentence":"Spending a quiet weekend camping in the national park allows city residents to reconnect with the peace of ______.","translation":"在國家公園度過安靜的露營週末，使城市居民能夠重新連結大自然的寧靜。"},{"word":"natural","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"existing in or caused by nature; not made or caused by humankind","chinese":"自然的；天然的；天生的","sentence":"The remote tropical island is completely surrounded by pristine ______ coral reefs teeming with colorful exotic fish.","translation":"這座偏遠的熱帶島嶼完全被未受破壞的天然珊瑚礁環繞，裡面充滿了色彩斑斕的奇異魚類。"},{"word":"ocean","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a very large expanse of sea, in particular each of the main areas","chinese":"海洋；大洋","sentence":"A great white shark swam gracefully beneath the surface of the Pacific ______, hunting for seals near the coastal islands.","translation":"一隻大白鯊在太平洋海面下優雅地游動，在沿海島嶼附近獵食海豹。"},{"word":"shore","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the land along the edge of a sea, lake, or other large body of water","chinese":"岸；濱；海岸","sentence":"Children took off their sandals and walked along the sandy lake ______, collecting smooth pebbles and shiny seashells in buckets.","translation":"孩子們脫下涼鞋，沿著沙質湖岸漫步，把光滑的鵝卵石和閃亮的貝殼收集在水桶裡。"},{"word":"coast","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the part of the land near the sea; the edge of the land","chinese":"海岸；沿岸地區","sentence":"The eastern ______ of Taiwan features dramatic rocky cliffs rising steeply from the sparkling deep blue waters.","translation":"台灣東部海岸以從閃爍深藍海水中陡峭拔起的壯麗岩石峭壁為特色。"},{"word":"stream","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a small, narrow river of water; continuous flow of liquid","chinese":"小溪；溪流；流動","sentence":"Hikers filled their reusable aluminum bottles with cold fresh water running down from the clean alpine mountain ______.","translation":"登山客用乾淨的高山小溪流淌而下的冰涼清泉，裝滿了他們的可重複使用鋁製水壺。"},{"word":"waterfall","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a cascade of water falling from a height, formed when a river falls steeply","chinese":"瀑布","sentence":"Tourists took pictures of the breathtaking mountain ______, whose thundering white spray formed a vibrant rainbow in the sun.","translation":"遊客拍攝了令人驚嘆的高山瀑布，其轟鳴的白色水花在陽光下形成了一道生動的彩虹。"},{"word":"pool","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a small body of still water; an artificial swimming pool","chinese":"水池；游泳池","sentence":"After swimming ten laps in the outdoor Olympic ______, Mark rested on a lounge chair beside the cool blue water.","translation":"在室外奧林匹克游泳池游了十趟之後，馬克在冰涼碧藍池水旁的休閒椅上休息。"},{"word":"pond","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a small body of still water formed naturally or hollowing out","chinese":"池塘","sentence":"Green frogs croaked loudly among the blooming water lilies floating on the surface of the quiet farm ______.","translation":"在靜謐農場池塘水面上漂浮的盛開睡蓮叢中，綠色的青蛙大聲地鳴叫著。"},{"word":"wave","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a ridge of water moving on the surface of water; to move the hand","chinese":"海浪；波浪；揮手","sentence":"Surfers paddled their boards into the sea, waiting patiently for a massive ocean ______ to carry them back to the beach.","translation":"衝浪客將衝浪板划向海中，耐心等待一股巨大的海浪將他們載回海灘。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Photographers love to hike into deep mountain reserves to document the untouched beauty of raw ______.","options":["pool","nature","pond","wave"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: nature (大自然) 【全文中譯】攝影師喜歡徒步深入高山保護區，記錄原始大自然未受破壞的壯麗景色。 【選項解析】(A) pool (B) nature 大自然 (C) pond (D) wave。untouched beauty of raw nature。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Eating fresh organic fruit without artificial preservatives is considered a healthy ______ dietary habit.","options":["stormy","natural","humid","snowy"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: natural (天然的；自然的) 【全文中譯】食用無人工防腐劑的新鮮有機水果，被認為是一種健康的天然飲食習慣。 【選項解析】(A) stormy (B) natural 天然的 (C) humid (D) snowy。healthy natural dietary habit。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The Atlantic ______ separates the Americas from Europe and Africa, serving as a vital commercial shipping lane.","options":["pond","stream","ocean","pool"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: ocean (大洋；大西洋) 【全文中譯】大西洋將美洲與歐洲和非洲分開，是一條至關重要的商業海上航道。 【選項解析】(A) pond (B) stream (C) ocean 大洋 (D) pool。Atlantic Ocean（大西洋）。"},{"number":4,"stem":"We stood on the sandy lake ______ at twilight, watching the golden orange sunset reflect across the quiet water.","options":["shore","wave","waterfall","stream"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: shore (湖岸；岸邊) 【全文中譯】黃昏時分我們站在沙質湖岸上，看著金橘色的日落倒映在平靜的水面上。 【選項解析】(A) shore 岸邊 (B) wave (C) waterfall (D) stream。sandy lake shore 指沙質湖岸。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Driving along the scenic highway following the Pacific ______, travelers admired rugged cliffs rising above the sea.","options":["pond","pool","coast","waterfall"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: coast (海岸；海岸線) 【全文中譯】沿著沿太平洋海岸行駛的景觀公路開車，旅客讚歎著拔起於海面上的崎嶇峭壁。 【選項解析】(A) pond (B) pool (C) coast 海岸 (D) waterfall。Pacific coast（太平洋海岸）。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Cold mountain water flowed swiftly along the rocky ______, providing a home for rare native freshwater trout.","options":["stream","ocean","shore","wave"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: stream (小溪；溪流) 【全文中譯】高山冷冽的溪水沿著多石的小溪急速流淌，為罕見的本土淡水鱒魚提供了棲息地。 【選項解析】(A) stream 溪流 (B) ocean (C) shore (D) wave。rocky stream 指多石的小溪。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The Shifen ______ in Pingxi is often praised as the Little Niagara of Taiwan due to its broad curtain of falling water.","options":["pool","waterfall","pond","shore"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: waterfall (瀑布) 【全文中譯】平溪的十分瀑布因其寬闊的水簾而經常被譽為台灣的小尼加拉瓜瀑布。 【選項解析】(A) pool (B) waterfall 瀑布 (C) pond (D) shore。Shifen Waterfall（十分瀑布）。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The luxury hotel features a heated indoor swimming ______ where guests can exercise comfortably during the winter.","options":["stream","coast","pool","ocean"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: pool (游泳池) 【全文中譯】這家豪華飯店設有溫水室內游泳池，客人可以在冬季舒適地進行鍛鍊。 【選項解析】(A) stream (B) coast (C) pool 游泳池 (D) ocean。indoor swimming pool 指室內游泳池。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Yellow ducklings swam in a neat line behind their mother across the tranquil surface of the village ______.","options":["ocean","waterfall","shore","pond"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: pond (池塘) 【全文中譯】黃色的小鴨子排成整齊的隊伍跟在鴨媽媽身後，游過鄉村池塘平靜的水面。 【選項解析】(A) ocean (B) waterfall (C) shore (D) pond 池塘。village pond 指鄉村池塘。"},{"number":10,"stem":"A towering ocean ______ crashed against the sea wall, sending white sea foam flying high into the windy air.","options":["pond","pool","wave","stream"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: wave (海浪；波浪) 【全文中譯】高聳的海浪撞擊在防波堤上，將白色的海浪泡沫高高拋入起風的空中。 【選項解析】(A) pond (B) pool (C) wave 海浪 (D) stream。ocean wave 指海浪。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Ecotourism encourages travelers to respect wild ______ by not littering or disturbing endangered plant habitats.","options":["nature","pool","pond","wave"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: nature (大自然) 【全文中譯】生態旅遊鼓勵旅行者不亂扔垃圾或不打擾瀕危植物棲息地，以此尊重野生大自然。 【選項解析】(A) nature 大自然 (B) pool (C) pond (D) wave。respect wild nature。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Honey produced by wild bees in mountain forests is a delicious ______ sweetener containing beneficial nutrients.","options":["stormy","humid","natural","snowy"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: natural (天然的) 【全文中譯】高山森林野蜂釀造的蜂蜜是一種美味的天然甜味劑，含有有益人體的營養素。 【選項解析】(A) stormy (B) humid (C) natural 天然的 (D) snowy。natural sweetener 指天然甜味劑。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Marine biologists dive deep into the blue ______ to record the migration patterns of humpback whales.","options":["pond","pool","stream","ocean"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: ocean (海洋；大洋) 【全文中譯】海洋生物學家潛入蔚藍大洋深處，記錄座頭鯨的遷徙路線模式。 【選項解析】(A) pond (B) pool (C) stream (D) ocean 海洋。deep into the blue ocean。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The shipwrecked sailors safely reached the rocky island ______ and collapsed onto the dry sand in relief.","options":["waterfall","shore","stream","wave"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: shore (岸邊；海岸) 【全文中譯】遇難的水手安全到達了多岩石的島嶼岸邊，如釋重負地倒在乾燥的沙灘上。 【選項解析】(A) waterfall (B) shore 岸邊 (C) stream (D) wave。rocky island shore 指島嶼岸邊。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Many lighthouses were constructed along the rocky ______ to guide incoming cargo vessels away from hidden reefs.","options":["coast","pond","pool","waterfall"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: coast (海岸；沿海地區) 【全文中譯】岩石海岸沿線修建了許多燈塔，以引導進港貨輪避開暗礁。 【選項解析】(A) coast 海岸 (B) pond (C) pool (D) waterfall。rocky coast 指多岩海岸。"},{"number":16,"stem":"The little girl knelt beside the clear mountain ______ and dipped her hands into the refreshing icy water.","options":["ocean","shore","stream","wave"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: stream (小溪) 【全文中譯】小女孩跪在清澈的高山小溪旁，將雙手浸入清涼冰冽的水中。 【選項解析】(A) ocean (B) shore (C) stream 小溪 (D) wave。clear mountain stream 指清澈高山小溪。"},{"number":17,"stem":"After a long hike up the mountain trail, visitors heard the thundering roar of the spectacular eighty-meter ______.","options":["pool","waterfall","coast","pond"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: waterfall (瀑布) 【全文中譯】沿著山徑長途跋涉後，遊客聽到了壯觀的八十公尺大瀑布轟鳴的咆哮聲。 【選項解析】(A) pool (B) waterfall 瀑布 (C) coast (D) pond。spectacular waterfall（壯觀的瀑布）。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Community centers often host water aerobics classes in the heated public ______ for senior citizens.","options":["ocean","pool","stream","shore"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pool (泳池) 【全文中譯】社區中心經常在公共溫水游泳池為年長者舉辦水中健美操課程。 【選項解析】(A) ocean (B) pool 游泳池 (C) stream (D) shore。heated public pool 指公共溫水泳池。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Grandfather sits on a wooden bench beside the backyard koi ______, feeding colorful fish every sunny morning.","options":["ocean","waterfall","pond","coast"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: pond (錦鯉池；水塘) 【全文中譯】祖父坐在後院錦鯉池旁的木椅上，每個陽光明媚的早晨都會餵食色彩繽紛的魚兒。 【選項解析】(A) ocean (B) waterfall (C) pond 池塘 (D) coast。backyard koi pond 指錦鯉池。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The skillful surfer rode inside the barrel of the powerful rolling ______ all the way to the sandy beach.","options":["pond","pool","stream","wave"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: wave (海浪；浪管) 【全文中譯】技術精湛的衝浪好手在強勁翻滾的海浪浪管內滑行，一路滑到了沙灘上。 【選項解析】(A) pond (B) pool (C) stream (D) wave 浪潮/海浪。barrel of the rolling wave。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Living in harmony with Mother ______ is an essential principle taught by many traditional indigenous cultures.","options":["Nature","Wave","Pool","Pond"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Nature (大自然；大地之母) 【全文中譯】與大自然母親和諧相處是許多傳統原住民文化所傳授的重要基本原則。 【選項解析】(A) Nature 大自然 (B) Wave (C) Pool (D) Pond。Mother Nature 指大自然母親。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Marble is a durable ______ stone created from limestone under immense heat and pressure deep within Earth's crust.","options":["humid","stormy","natural","snowy"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: natural (天然的) 【全文中譯】大理石是由石灰岩在地殼深處巨大的高溫高壓下形成的耐用天然石材。 【選項解析】(A) humid (B) stormy (C) natural 天然的 (D) snowy。durable natural stone。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Container vessels take roughly two weeks to navigate across the vast Pacific ______ from Asia to North America.","options":["stream","pool","ocean","pond"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: ocean (大洋；太平洋) 【全文中譯】貨櫃船大約需要兩週時間才能橫渡遼闊的太平洋從亞洲駛向北美。 【選項解析】(A) stream (B) pool (C) ocean 大洋 (D) pond。vast Pacific Ocean。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Flocks of white seagulls landed along the ocean ______, pecking at tiny crabs left behind by the receding tide.","options":["waterfall","stream","shore","wave"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: shore (海岸；水邊) 【全文中譯】成群的白海鷗降落在海岸邊，啄食退潮後留下的微小螃蟹。 【選項解析】(A) waterfall (B) stream (C) shore 海岸/岸邊 (D) wave。along the ocean shore。"},{"number":25,"stem":"High tide produced rolling white ______ that swept away the elaborate sandcastles children had built on the beach.","options":["ponds","pools","streams","waves"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: waves (海浪；波浪) 【全文中譯】漲潮時翻滾的白浪沖走了孩子們在海灘上建造的精美沙堡。 【選項解析】(A) ponds (B) pools (C) streams (D) waves 海浪。rolling white waves 指滾滾白浪。"}]},{"unit":31,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 31 (031.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Landforms, Forest Ecology & Natural Resources | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"desert","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a large dry area with very little rain; to leave behind","chinese":"沙漠；拋棄","sentence":"Camels can travel for several days across the hot ______ without drinking water, but inexperienced tourists should never travel alone.","translation":"駱駝可以在炎熱的沙漠中行走數天而不喝水，但缺乏經驗的遊客絕不應單獨旅行。"},{"word":"forest","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a large area of land covered with trees and wild plants","chinese":"森林","sentence":"The hikers walked along the mountain trail into the green ______, where many wild animals and singing birds live peacefully.","translation":"健行者沿著山徑走進綠意盎然的森林，許多野生動物和歌唱的鳥類在那裡平靜地生活。"},{"word":"wood","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the hard material from tree trunks; a small forest","chinese":"木頭；樹林","sentence":"My grandfather built this sturdy dining table out of solid ______, and it has lasted in our house for over thirty years.","translation":"我的祖父用實木打造了這張堅固的餐桌，它在我們家裡已經使用了超過三十年。"},{"word":"plant","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a living organism grown in earth; to put seeds or plants into soil","chinese":"植物；種植","sentence":"Every spring my mother likes to ______ colorful flowers in the garden, and she waters them carefully every morning.","translation":"每年春天我媽媽喜歡在花園裡種植色彩繽紛的花朵，而且她每天早晨都細心地給它們澆水。"},{"word":"root","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the part of a plant that grows underground for water and support","chinese":"根部；根源","sentence":"The old banyan tree fell during the heavy typhoon because its ______ was not deep enough in the sandy ground.","translation":"那棵老榕樹在強烈颱風中倒塌了，因為它的根部在沙質土壤中不夠深。"},{"word":"seed","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a small hard part produced by a plant that can grow into a new plant","chinese":"種子","sentence":"The farmer scattered pumpkin ______ across the freshly plowed soil, and he hoped for gentle rain during the coming weekend.","translation":"農夫把南瓜種子播撒在剛犁好的泥土上，並期望即將到來的週末能下起溫和的小雨。"},{"word":"rock","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a large hard piece of stone; to move gently backwards and forwards","chinese":"岩石；搖晃","sentence":"The brave climber stood firmly on the huge gray ______, and he enjoyed the breathtaking sunrise above the cloudy valley.","translation":"勇敢的登山者穩穩地站在巨大的灰色岩石上，並欣賞雲霧繚繞的山谷上方令人屏息的日出。"},{"word":"stone","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a hard solid mineral substance found in the ground","chinese":"石頭；石材","sentence":"Local workers constructed a high ______ wall around the ancient castle to protect the villagers from strong coastal winds.","translation":"當地的工人們在古堡周圍建造了一堵高大的石頭圍牆，以保護村民免受強烈海風的侵襲。"},{"word":"sand","pos":"(n.)","definition":"tiny grains of broken rock found on beaches and in deserts","chinese":"沙子","sentence":"The happy children took off their shoes and ran across the golden ______, and they built several tall castles near the sea.","translation":"快樂的孩子們脫下鞋子跑過金黃色的沙子，並在海邊建造了幾座高高的城堡。"},{"word":"valley","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a low area of land between hills or mountains, often with a river","chinese":"山谷；溪谷","sentence":"A clear freshwater river flows through the peaceful green ______, and local farmers grow sweet apples along both riverbanks.","translation":"一條清澈的淡水河流淌過寧靜綠色的山谷，當地農民在兩側河岸種植甜蘋果。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Because the huge banyan tree had such a deep ______, it remained standing firmly even during the fiercest typhoon.","options":["root","seed","rock","sand"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: root (植物根部) 【全文中譯】因為這棵巨大的榕樹擁有如此深長的根部，即使在最猛烈的颱風中它依然屹立不倒。 【選項解析】(A) root 根部  (B) seed 種子  (C) rock 岩石  (D) sand 沙子。由 tree had such a deep... remained standing 可知是樹根 root。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The local carpenter used fine oak ______ to build the sturdy bookshelves, and he polished them with natural oil.","options":["valley","wood","desert","root"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: wood (木材；木頭) 【全文中譯】當地的木匠使用優質橡木木材打造堅固的書架，並用天然護木油將其擦拭拋光。 【選項解析】(A) valley 山谷  (B) wood 木材  (C) desert 沙漠  (D) root 根部。由 carpenter（木匠）與 oak（橡木）可知選 wood。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Very few green plants can survive in the dry ______ because the scorching sun evaporates water almost immediately.","options":["forest","rock","desert","seed"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: desert (沙漠) 【全文中譯】極少有綠色植物能在乾旱的沙漠中生存，因為熾熱的太陽幾乎瞬間就會將水分蒸發殆盡。 【選項解析】(A) forest 森林  (B) rock 岩石  (C) desert 沙漠  (D) seed 種子。由 dry（乾旱）與 scorching sun（烈日）可知指 desert。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Before springtime begins, our science teacher taught us how to bury each tiny sunflower ______ into rich, damp soil.","options":["stone","wood","valley","seed"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: seed (種子) 【全文中譯】春天來臨之前，我們的自然老師教我們如何將每一顆小小的向日葵種子埋入肥沃濕潤的泥土中。 【選項解析】(A) stone 石頭  (B) wood 木頭  (C) valley 山谷  (D) seed 種子。由 bury into rich, damp soil（埋進泥土種植）可知指種子 seed。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Thousands of wild birds and monkeys make their natural homes in this tropical ______, which is protected by national law.","options":["forest","sand","root","desert"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: forest (森林) 【全文中譯】成千上萬的野生鳥類與猴子在這座熱帶森林中建立天然家園，受到國家法律的嚴格保護。 【選項解析】(A) forest 森林  (B) sand 沙子  (C) root 根部  (D) desert 沙漠。由 wild birds and monkeys make homes 可知為森林 forest。"},{"number":6,"stem":"A peaceful freshwater stream flows gently down through the grassy ______, where dairy cows graze every sunny afternoon.","options":["seed","valley","rock","wood"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: valley (山谷；溪谷) 【全文中譯】一條寧靜的淡水溪流緩緩流經草木繁茂的山谷，乳牛每逢晴朗午後便在此吃草悠遊。 【選項解析】(A) seed 種子  (B) valley 山谷  (C) rock 岩石  (D) wood 木材。stream flows down through the grassy... 可知為山谷 valley。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The careless young driver hit a sharp roadside ______ on the mountain road, which caused his front tire to blow out.","options":["sand","forest","rock","valley"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: rock (岩石；大石頭) 【全文中譯】粗心的年輕司機在山路上撞到了路旁尖銳的岩石，導致他的前輪當場爆胎。 【選項解析】(A) sand 沙子  (B) forest 森林  (C) rock 岩石  (D) valley 山谷。sharp roadside rock（路邊尖銳岩石）導致爆胎。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The playful children spent three happy hours on the beach building miniature castles with damp ______ and seashells.","options":["desert","root","wood","sand"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: sand (沙子) 【全文中譯】貪玩的孩子們在海灘上度過了三小時的歡樂時光，用潮濕的沙子與貝殼建造袖珍城堡。 【選項解析】(A) desert 沙漠  (B) root 根部  (C) wood 木頭  (D) sand 沙子。在海灘用 damp sand（濕沙）堆城堡。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The ancient bridge was constructed entirely of heavy grey ______, so it remained strong despite centuries of river floods.","options":["stone","seed","valley","forest"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: stone (石頭；石材) 【全文中譯】這座古橋完全由沉重的灰色石材建造而成，因此歷經數百年的河水氾濫依然堅固不摧。 【選項解析】(A) stone 石頭/石材  (B) seed 種子  (C) valley 山谷  (D) forest 森林。constructed of heavy grey stone（由灰色石材打造）。"},{"number":10,"stem":"During Arbor Day every year, students gather at the community park to ______ twenty young saplings along the pathway.","options":["desert","plant","rock","stone"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: plant (種植) 【全文中譯】每年植樹節期間，學生們聚集在社區公園，沿著小徑種植二十棵幼苗樹木。 【選項解析】(A) desert 拋棄  (B) plant 種植  (C) rock 搖晃  (D) stone 投石。plant saplings（種植樹苗）。"},{"number":11,"stem":"After walking barefoot across the scorching beach ______, my feet felt very hot and uncomfortable until I washed them.","options":["root","wood","sand","forest"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: sand (沙子) 【全文中譯】赤腳走過滾燙的海灘沙地後，我的雙腳感到非常灼熱不適，直到我沖水後才好轉。 【選項解析】(A) root 根部  (B) wood 木頭  (C) sand 沙子  (D) forest 森林。beach sand（海灘沙地）。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Deep inside the dense mountain ______, sunlight could hardly reach the ground through the thick canopy of evergreen leaves.","options":["desert","seed","rock","forest"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: forest (森林) 【全文中譯】在茂密的山林深處，陽光透過常綠樹葉形成的厚重樹冠，幾乎無法照射到地面。 【選項解析】(A) desert 沙漠  (B) seed 種子  (C) rock 岩石  (D) forest 森林。dense mountain forest（茂密山林）。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The tiny brown apple ______ looks completely dry and lifeless, but with water and sunshine it can grow into a tall tree.","options":["seed","valley","sand","stone"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: seed (種子) 【全文中譯】這顆小小的褐色蘋果種子看起來完全乾燥毫無生機，但在水和陽光滋潤下能長成大樹。 【選項解析】(A) seed 種子  (B) valley 山谷  (C) sand 沙子  (D) stone 石頭。apple seed（蘋果種子）。"},{"number":14,"stem":"A mother duck led her cute ducklings down toward the quiet ______, where cool mountain water formed a shallow pond.","options":["root","valley","wood","desert"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: valley (山谷；溪谷) 【全文中譯】鴨媽媽帶領著可愛的小鴨群走向寧靜的山谷，那裡的清涼山泉匯聚成一個淺淺的水塘。 【選項解析】(A) root 根部  (B) valley 山谷  (C) wood 木頭  (D) desert 沙漠。走向山谷谷地（valley）。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Many colorful orchids do not grow in soil; instead, their strong aerial ______ cling tightly to the rough bark of trees.","options":["sand","seed","root","stone"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: root (植物根部) 【全文中譯】許多色彩斑斕的蘭花並不長在土壤中；相反地，它們強健的氣生根緊緊吸附在粗糙的樹皮上。 【選項解析】(A) sand 沙子  (B) seed 種子  (C) root 根部  (D) stone 石頭。aerial roots（氣生根）。"},{"number":16,"stem":"The cruel owner decided to ______ his poor pet dog on the remote highway, which sparked severe public criticism.","options":["rock","stone","plant","desert"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: desert (遺棄；拋棄) 【全文中譯】殘忍的飼主決定在偏遠公路上拋棄他可憐的寵物狗，這引發了社會大眾的強烈批評。 【選項解析】(A) rock 搖動  (B) stone 扔石頭  (C) plant 種植  (D) desert 拋棄。desert one's pet（拋棄寵物）。"},{"number":17,"stem":"This beautiful acoustic guitar was crafted by hand from rose ______, producing an exceptionally warm and resonant musical tone.","options":["wood","valley","sand","root"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: wood (木材；木料) 【全文中譯】這把美麗的原聲木吉他由玫瑰木純手工打造，產生極為溫暖而共鳴的音樂音色。 【選項解析】(A) wood 木材  (B) valley 山谷  (C) sand 沙子  (D) root 根部。rosewood（玫瑰木）。"},{"number":18,"stem":"While hiking along the steep coastal cliff, David accidentally kicked a loose ______, sending it tumbling into the ocean.","options":["desert","stone","seed","forest"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: stone (小石塊；石頭) 【全文中譯】在陡峭的海岸懸崖健行時，戴維不小心踢落了一塊鬆動的石頭，使其一路翻滾跌入大洋中。 【選項解析】(A) desert 沙漠  (B) stone 石頭  (C) seed 種子  (D) forest 森林。kicked a loose stone（踢到鬆動石塊）。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Looking down from the mountain top, the vast golden ______ stretched endlessly toward the distant horizon under the blue sky.","options":["root","wood","desert","valley"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: desert (沙漠) 【全文中譯】從山頂俯瞰，遼闊的金黃色沙漠在藍天下無邊無際地向著遠方的地平線延伸蔓延。 【選項解析】(A) root 根部  (B) wood 木材  (C) desert 沙漠  (D) valley 山谷。golden desert stretched endlessly（金色沙漠綿延不絕）。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The gentle ocean waves washed smooth round pebbles and warm golden ______ over our feet as we walked along the shore.","options":["seed","forest","stone","sand"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: sand (沙子) 【全文中譯】當我們漫步在海灘上時，溫柔的海浪將圓滑的卵石和溫暖金黃的細沙沖刷過我們的腳背。 【選項解析】(A) seed 種子  (B) forest 森林  (C) stone 石頭  (D) sand 沙子。golden sand on the shore（岸邊金沙）。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The curious little boy tried to throw a flat ______ across the pond surface so that it would skip several times.","options":["stone","root","wood","desert"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: stone (石頭) 【全文中譯】好奇的小男孩試著把一塊扁平的石頭丟過池塘水面，希望它能在水上連續打好幾個水漂。 【選項解析】(A) stone 石頭  (B) root 根部  (C) wood 木頭  (D) desert 沙漠。throw a flat stone（丟扁平石頭打水漂）。"},{"number":22,"stem":"If you want sweet juicy tomatoes next summer, you must ______ the young seedlings in a spot that receives plenty of sunshine.","options":["desert","plant","stone","rock"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: plant (種植；栽種) 【全文中譯】如果你想在明年夏天吃到甜美多汁的番茄，你就必須把幼苗栽種在陽光充足的地點。 【選項解析】(A) desert 拋棄  (B) plant 種植  (C) stone 砸石  (D) rock 搖擺。plant seedlings（栽種幼苗）。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The courageous climbers pitched their nylon tents beside a massive granite ______ to shield themselves from freezing gale winds.","options":["valley","sand","rock","seed"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: rock (岩石；大岩峰) 【全文中譯】勇敢的攀登者在巨大的花崗岩岩石旁搭起尼龍帳篷，以遮蔽狂暴刺骨的寒風侵襲。 【選項解析】(A) valley 山谷  (B) sand 沙子  (C) rock 岩石  (D) seed 種子。granite rock（花崗岩石）。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Between the two towering mountain ridges lies a fertile green ______, where generations of villagers have cultivated rice fields.","options":["forest","desert","wood","valley"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: valley (山谷；溪谷) 【全文中譯】在兩座高聳的山脊之間坐落著一片肥沃翠綠的山谷，世世代代的村民都在這裡耕作稻田。 【選項解析】(A) forest 森林  (B) desert 沙漠  (C) wood 木頭  (D) valley 山谷。fertile green valley（肥沃綠色山谷）。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Without enough healthy soil to hold moisture, the delicate tree ______ will quickly dry out and the entire sapling will die.","options":["root","stone","sand","rock"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: root (植物根部) 【全文中譯】如果沒有足夠健康濕潤的土壤來保持水分，嬌嫩的樹根將迅速乾枯，整株樹苗也會隨之枯死。 【選項解析】(A) root 根部  (B) stone 石頭  (C) sand 沙子  (D) rock 岩石。delicate tree roots（嬌嫩樹根）。"}]},{"unit":32,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 32 (032.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Countryside, Physical Terrain & Local Environments | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"field","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an area of open land planted with crops or pasture","chinese":"田野；田地；領域","sentence":"The hardworking farmers were harvesting ripe golden wheat in the large ______, and they worked until sunset.","translation":"勤勞的農民們在大田地裡收割成熟的金黃色小麥，而且他們一直工作到日落。"},{"word":"plain","pos":"(n.) / (adj.)","definition":"a large flat area of land; simple and not decorated","chinese":"平原；樸素的","sentence":"Large herds of wild animals run freely across the vast grassy ______, which spreads for hundreds of miles.","translation":"大群野生動物在遼闊廣袤的草質平原上自由奔跑，該平原向外延伸了數百英里。"},{"word":"mud","pos":"(n.)","definition":"wet, soft earth formed by mixing soil and water","chinese":"泥巴；泥濘","sentence":"Heavy rain turned the dirt playground into sticky brown ______, so all the school children had to play inside.","translation":"大雨將泥土操場變成了黏稠的褐色泥巴，所以所有小學生都必須在室內玩耍。"},{"word":"hole","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an empty space in an object or opening in the ground","chinese":"洞穴；孔洞","sentence":"The clever little rabbit dug a deep ______ under the wooden fence to escape from the neighbor's barking dog.","translation":"聰明的小兔子在木柵欄下挖了一個深洞，以逃避鄰居家狂吠的狗。"},{"word":"environment","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the natural world in which people, animals, and plants live","chinese":"自然環境","sentence":"Everyone should reduce plastic waste to protect our natural ______, or future generations will face serious pollution.","translation":"每個人都應該減少塑膠垃圾以保護我們的自然環境，否則未來世代將面臨嚴重的污染。"},{"word":"area","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a particular region or part of a town, country, or space","chinese":"地區；區域","sentence":"The city government built several new public parks in this residential ______, making life much more pleasant for families.","translation":"市政府在這個住宅區域建造了幾座新的公園，讓各個家庭的生活變得更加愜意。"},{"word":"spot","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a particular place; a small mark; to see or notice","chinese":"地點；污漬；發現","sentence":"We found a quiet shady ______ under a huge oak tree, where our family enjoyed a wonderful afternoon picnic.","translation":"我們在一棵大橡樹下找到了一個安靜陰涼的地點，我們全家人在那裡享用了美好的午後野餐。"},{"word":"corner","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the place where two walls, lines, or streets meet","chinese":"角落；街角","sentence":"There is a friendly convenience store located on the street ______, and it is open twenty-four hours every day.","translation":"在街道街角坐落著一家親切的便利商店，而且它每天二十四小時營業。"},{"word":"county","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an administrative division of a country or state","chinese":"郡；縣","sentence":"My grandparents have lived in this quiet farming ______ for sixty years, and they know almost every neighbor here.","translation":"我的祖父母在這個安靜的農業縣居住了一甲子，而且他們幾乎認識這裡的每一位鄰居。"},{"word":"countryside","pos":"(n.)","definition":"land outside of cities and towns, with fields and farms","chinese":"鄉村；鄉下","sentence":"Many city residents enjoy driving out to the green ______ on weekends to breathe fresh air and escape busy crowds.","translation":"許多城市居民喜歡在週末開車前往綠意盎然的鄉村，以呼吸新鮮空氣並遠離繁忙擁擠的人群。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"During early autumn, the golden wheat in the vast open ______ rippled beautifully whenever a gentle breeze blew.","options":["field","hole","mud","corner"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: field (田野；田地) 【全文中譯】初秋時節，每當微風吹拂，遼闊開闊的田野中金黃色的小麥便泛起層層美麗的麥浪。 【選項解析】(A) field 田地  (B) hole 洞穴  (C) mud 泥巴  (D) corner 角落。open field（開闊田野）種植麥浪。"},{"number":2,"stem":"After two days of non-stop tropical rain, the unpaved school driveway was completely covered in thick slippery ______.","options":["environment","mud","county","plain"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: mud (泥巴；泥濘) 【全文中譯】在連續兩天未停歇的熱帶大雨過後，未鋪柏油的學校車道完全覆蓋在厚重濕滑的泥巴中。 【選項解析】(A) environment 環境  (B) mud 泥巴  (C) county 縣市  (D) plain 平原。雨後未鋪路面形成 thick slippery mud（濕滑泥巴）。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The playful dog used its paws to dig a deep ______ in the backyard, where it buried its favorite beef bone.","options":["area","countryside","hole","spot"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: hole (洞穴；坑洞) 【全文中譯】調皮的狗用爪子在後院挖了一個深洞，並把牠最心愛的牛骨頭埋在裡面藏起來。 【選項解析】(A) area 區域  (B) countryside 鄉村  (C) hole 洞穴  (D) spot 地點。dig a deep hole（挖深洞）。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Millions of wild buffalo once grazed peacefully across the expansive North American ______, stretching to the horizon.","options":["mud","corner","field","plain"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: plain (平原) 【全文中譯】數以百萬計的野牛曾平靜地在遼闊的北美大平原上覓食，該平原一路延伸至無盡的地平線。 【選項解析】(A) mud 泥巴  (B) corner 街角  (C) field 田地  (D) plain 平原。North American plain（北美大平原）。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Planting more trees and conserving clean water are effective ways to protect our fragile global ______ for the future.","options":["environment","hole","county","spot"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: environment (自然環境) 【全文中譯】種植更多樹木與節約潔淨水源，是為未來世代保護我們脆弱地球環境的有效方法。 【選項解析】(A) environment 環境  (B) hole 洞  (C) county 縣  (D) spot 地點。protect global environment（保護全球環境）。"},{"number":6,"stem":"The police cordoned off the entire downtown ______ after the gas leak, and they guided all residents to safety.","options":["countryside","area","plain","mud"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: area (區域；地區) 【全文中譯】瓦斯外洩事故發生後，警方立刻封鎖了整個市中心區域，並引導所有居民撤離至安全處所。 【選項解析】(A) countryside 鄉下  (B) area 區域  (C) plain 平原  (D) mud 泥土。cordoned off entire downtown area（封鎖市中心區域）。"},{"number":7,"stem":"We arrived early at the botanical garden and reserved a lovely scenic ______ right beside the calm lotus pond.","options":["hole","county","spot","field"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: spot (地點；場所) 【全文中譯】我們很早便抵達了植物園，並在寧靜的荷花池畔搶先預訂了一個極佳的風景觀賞地點。 【選項解析】(A) hole 洞  (B) county 縣  (C) spot 地點  (D) field 田野。scenic spot（風景優美的地點）。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The old red mailbox stands right on the street ______, so you will easily see it as soon as you turn right.","options":["environment","mud","plain","corner"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: corner (街角；角落) 【全文中譯】那個老舊的紅色郵筒就立在街道的轉角處，所以你一右轉就能輕易地看見它。 【選項解析】(A) environment 環境  (B) mud 泥巴  (C) plain 平原  (D) corner 轉角/街角。street corner（街角）。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Yilan is a beautiful coastal ______ in northeastern Taiwan, well known for its hot springs and green rice paddies.","options":["county","hole","spot","corner"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: county (縣；郡) 【全文中譯】宜蘭是台灣東北部一個美麗的沿海縣份，以其舒暢的溫泉與翠綠的稻田聞名遐邇。 【選項解析】(A) county 縣  (B) hole 洞  (C) spot 地點  (D) corner 角落。coastal county（沿海縣份）。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Tired of the deafening noise and smog of city life, Mr. Davis moved his entire family to the quiet ______.","options":["mud","countryside","area","plain"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: countryside (鄉村；郊外) 【全文中譯】厭倦了城市生活震耳欲聾的喧囂與烏煙瘴氣，戴維斯先生將全家人搬遷至寧靜的鄉村定居。 【選項解析】(A) mud 泥土  (B) countryside 鄉村  (C) area 地區  (D) plain 平原。move to quiet countryside（搬到寧靜鄉村）。"},{"number":11,"stem":"When playing soccer in the wet park, David slipped in the ______ and got his white jersey completely stained brown.","options":["corner","environment","mud","county"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: mud (泥巴) 【全文中譯】在濕滑的公園踢足球時，戴維在泥巴裡滑了一跤，使得他的白色球衣徹底沾滿了褐色泥漬。 【選項解析】(A) corner 角落  (B) environment 環境  (C) mud 泥巴  (D) county 縣。slipped in the mud（在泥濘中滑倒）。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The golf ball rolled across the trimmed lawn and dropped cleanly into the shallow ______ on the green.","options":["field","plain","countryside","hole"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: hole (孔洞；球洞) 【全文中譯】高爾夫球滾過修剪整齊的草坪，乾淨俐落地落入了果嶺上那個淺淺的球洞之中。 【選項解析】(A) field 田地  (B) plain 平原  (C) countryside 鄉村  (D) hole 球洞。dropped into shallow hole（掉進球洞）。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The industrial factory was fined heavily by the government for dumping toxic chemical wastewater into the local ______.","options":["environment","spot","corner","hole"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: environment (生態環境) 【全文中譯】這家工廠因將有毒化學廢水排放至當地的生態環境中，遭到政府處以巨額罰款。 【選項解析】(A) environment 環境  (B) spot 地點  (C) corner 角落  (D) hole 洞穴。dump wastewater into environment（排廢水入環境）。"},{"number":14,"stem":"A scarecrow wearing a funny straw hat was erected in the middle of the corn ______ to keep hungry crows away.","options":["county","field","mud","plain"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: field (田地；農田) 【全文中譯】玉米田中央豎立起了一個頭戴滑稽草帽的稻草人，以防止飢餓的烏鴉靠近偷食作物。 【選項解析】(A) county 縣  (B) field 田地  (C) mud 泥巴  (D) plain 平原。corn field（玉米田）。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The ancient nomadic tribes rode their horses freely across the wide Mongolian ______, following seasonal water sources.","options":["corner","hole","plain","environment"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: plain (平原) 【全文中譯】古老的遊牧部落在遼闊的蒙古平原上自由策馬奔馳，追隨不同季節的水草資源遷徙。 【選項解析】(A) corner 轉角  (B) hole 洞穴  (C) plain 平原  (D) environment 環境。Mongolian plain（蒙古大平原）。"},{"number":16,"stem":"The cozy little coffee shop tucked away in the quiet street ______ serves the freshest handmade cinnamon rolls in town.","options":["mud","area","county","corner"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: corner (街角；角落) 【全文中譯】這家隱匿在安靜街角的小巧溫馨咖啡館，供應全鎮最新鮮手工烘焙的肉桂捲。 【選項解析】(A) mud 泥巴  (B) area 地區  (C) county 縣  (D) corner 街角。street corner（街角）。"},{"number":17,"stem":"This scenic coastal ______ is a favorite nesting location for rare sea birds, attracting photographers from around the world.","options":["spot","hole","plain","mud"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: spot (地點；場所) 【全文中譯】這個風景秀麗的海岸地點是珍稀海鳥喜愛的築巢場所，吸引了來自世界各地的攝影師前來。 【選項解析】(A) spot 地點  (B) hole 洞穴  (C) plain 平原  (D) mud 泥巴。coastal spot（海岸地點）。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Due to rapid economic growth, this rural ______ has transformed into a bustling commercial center with high-tech offices.","options":["field","area","corner","hole"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: area (區域；地區) 【全文中譯】由於經濟快速成長，這個鄉村區域已轉型為擁有高科技辦公大樓的繁華商業中心。 【選項解析】(A) field 田野  (B) area 區域  (C) corner 角落  (D) hole 洞。rural area（鄉村地區）。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Taitung ______ is famous for its clean Pacific coastline, indigenous cultural heritage, and sweet organic custard apples.","options":["mud","plain","county","spot"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: county (縣) 【全文中譯】台東縣以其潔淨的太平洋海岸線、原住民文化遺產以及甜美的有機釋迦聞名於世。 【選項解析】(A) mud 泥土  (B) plain 平原  (C) county 縣  (D) spot 地點。Taitung County（台東縣）。"},{"number":20,"stem":"Whenever the holiday season arrives, we love taking a scenic train ride into the peaceful green ______ to recharge.","options":["hole","corner","environment","countryside"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: countryside (鄉村；農村) 【全文中譯】每逢度假季節來臨，我們都喜歡搭乘風景優美的火車前往寧靜翠綠的鄉村放鬆充電。 【選項解析】(A) hole 洞穴  (B) corner 角落  (C) environment 環境  (D) countryside 鄉村。peaceful green countryside（寧靜綠色鄉村）。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The heavy tractor drove slowly through the agricultural ______, plowing deep straight furrows for planting new vegetables.","options":["field","mud","spot","corner"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: field (農田；田地) 【全文中譯】沉重的耕耘機緩慢行駛過農田，犁出筆直深邃的田溝以便栽種新的蔬菜。 【選項解析】(A) field 田地  (B) mud 泥巴  (C) spot 地點  (D) corner 轉角。agricultural field（農田）。"},{"number":22,"stem":"After slipping on the rainy mountain path, my hiking boots were coated with thick sticky ______ that was difficult to scrape off.","options":["plain","mud","hole","area"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: mud (泥土；爛泥) 【全文中譯】在陰雨的山徑上滑倒後，我的登山靴上包裹了厚厚一層黏稠的爛泥，非常難以刮除乾淨。 【選項解析】(A) plain 平原  (B) mud 爛泥/泥巴  (C) hole 洞  (D) area 地區。coated with thick sticky mud（裹著黏爛泥）。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The careful inspector noticed a small circular ______ in the water pipe, which had been leaking water under the floor.","options":["county","corner","hole","environment"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: hole (小孔；破洞) 【全文中譯】細心的檢修人員發現水管上有一個微小的圓形破洞，水一直沿著地板下方在滲漏。 【選項解析】(A) county 縣  (B) corner 轉角  (C) hole 破洞/孔  (D) environment 環境。circular hole in pipe（水管上的圓孔洞）。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The train crossed the flat endless ______ for hours, offering passengers sweeping views of golden grasslands under open skies.","options":["countryside","spot","field","plain"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: plain (平原) 【全文中譯】火車在平坦無垠的大平原上行駛了數小時，讓乘客飽覽蒼穹下金黃草原的壯麗景致。 【選項解析】(A) countryside 鄉村  (B) spot 地點  (C) field 田地  (D) plain 平原。flat endless plain（平坦無際的大平原）。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Community leaders held an urgent town hall meeting to discuss how to keep the neighbourhood ______ clean and safe.","options":["environment","mud","hole","corner"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: environment (環境) 【全文中譯】社區領袖們召開了緊急鎮民大會，共同商討如何保持鄰里周邊環境的潔淨與安全。 【選項解析】(A) environment 環境  (B) mud 泥濘  (C) hole 洞穴  (D) corner 角落。neighbourhood environment（鄰里環境）。"}]},{"unit":33,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 33 (033.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Community, Environmental Protection & Local Industry | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"local","pos":"(adj.) / (n.)","definition":"relating to a particular area or neighborhood","chinese":"當地的；本地人","sentence":"The friendly ______ residents welcomed foreign visitors warmly, and they shared traditional homemade snacks with everyone.","translation":"友善的當地居民熱情地歡迎外國訪客，並且與每個人分享傳統的手工自製點心。"},{"word":"overseas","pos":"(adv.) / (adj.)","definition":"in or to a foreign country across the sea","chinese":"在海外；海外的","sentence":"After graduating from high school, Emily plans to study ______ in England to improve her English language skills.","translation":"高中畢業之後，艾蜜莉計劃前往英國海外留學，以提升她的英語語言能力。"},{"word":"neighbor","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person living near or next door to someone","chinese":"鄰居","sentence":"Our next-door ______ is a kind retired teacher who always helps water our plants when we go on vacation.","translation":"我們的隔壁鄰居是一位和藹的退休老師，當我們去度假時總是幫忙替我們的植物澆水。"},{"word":"pollute","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to make air, water, or soil dirty and harmful to life","chinese":"污染","sentence":"Chemical factories must not ______ the river with untreated waste, or thousands of fish will die in the water.","translation":"化學工廠絕不可用未經處理的廢棄物污染河流，否則水中成千上萬的魚群將會死亡。"},{"word":"pollution","pos":"(n.)","definition":"damage caused to water, air, or land by harmful substances","chinese":"污染（名詞）","sentence":"Heavy traffic in big cities creates severe air ______, causing serious breathing problems for young children and elderly people.","translation":"大城市的擁擠交通造成了嚴重的空氣污染，導致幼童與年長者嚴重的呼吸道問題。"},{"word":"recycle","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to collect and treat rubbish to produce useful materials again","chinese":"資源回收；循環再造","sentence":"Students are encouraged to ______ used paper and plastic bottles, which greatly helps reduce garbage in our school.","translation":"學生們受到鼓勵要回收廢紙與塑膠瓶，這極大有助於減少我們學校裡的垃圾量。"},{"word":"industry","pos":"(n.)","definition":"economic activity concerned with processing raw materials and manufacturing","chinese":"工業；產業","sentence":"Taiwan is world-famous for its advanced semiconductor ______, which supplies vital computer chips to tech companies everywhere.","translation":"台灣以其先進的半導體產業聞名全球，為各地的科技公司供應至關重要的電腦晶片。"},{"word":"noisy","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"making a lot of loud or unpleasant noise","chinese":"喧鬧的；吵雜的","sentence":"The downtown night market was very crowded and ______, but we enjoyed eating delicious local street food there.","translation":"市中心的夜市非常擁擠且喧鬧，但我們在那裡吃著美味的當地街頭小吃非常開心。"},{"word":"poison","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a substance that causes illness or death when absorbed; to harm with it","chinese":"毒藥；毒害","sentence":"Store all household cleaning chemicals in high locked cabinets so curious young children do not accidentally drink dangerous ______.","translation":"將所有家用清潔化學品存放在高處上鎖的櫥櫃中，以免好奇的年幼孩童不小心喝下危險的毒藥。"},{"word":"excellent","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"extremely good; outstanding","chinese":"優秀的；卓越的","sentence":"Grace received an ______ grade on her final science project because she worked diligently on it every single day.","translation":"葛瑞絲在她的期末科學專題中獲得了優秀的成績，因為她每一天都極其勤勉地投入其中。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The hospitable ______ villagers opened their homes to travelers and served hot ginger tea on cold mornings.","options":["local","noisy","excellent","overseas"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: local (當地的；本地的) 【全文中譯】熱情好客的當地村民向旅客敞開家門，並在寒冷的早晨端上熱薑茶款待。 【選項解析】(A) local 當地的  (B) noisy 吵鬧的  (C) excellent 優秀的  (D) overseas 海外的。local villagers（當地村民）。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Because the apartment complex is right beside an elevated highway, the bedrooms are often very ______ at night.","options":["local","noisy","excellent","overseas"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: noisy (吵鬧的；喧囂的) 【全文中譯】因為這棟公寓大樓緊鄰高架公路，臥室在夜間往往非常吵鬧喧囂。 【選項解析】(A) local 本地的  (B) noisy 吵雜的  (C) excellent 優秀的  (D) overseas 海外的。beside an elevated highway 可知很 noisy。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Samuel earned an ______ score on his chemistry exam, so his parents took him out to his favorite Italian restaurant.","options":["local","overseas","excellent","noisy"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: excellent (優秀的；出色的) 【全文中譯】塞繆爾在化學考試中拿到了優秀的成績，所以父母帶他前往他最愛的義大利餐廳慶祝。 【選項解析】(A) local 當地的  (B) overseas 海外的  (C) excellent 優秀的  (D) noisy 吵鬧的。excellent score（優秀成績）。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Many ambitious young engineers choose to work ______ in Silicon Valley to gain valuable international experience.","options":["noisy","local","excellent","overseas"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: overseas (在海外) 【全文中譯】許多有抱負的年輕工程師選擇前往矽谷海外工作，以累積寶貴的國際實務經驗。 【選項解析】(A) noisy 吵鬧的  (B) local 當地的  (C) excellent 優秀的  (D) overseas 在海外。work overseas（在海外工作）。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Toxic exhaust fumes from millions of motor scooters create serious air ______ in the metropolitan area every morning.","options":["pollution","industry","poison","neighbor"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pollution (污染) 【全文中譯】來自數百萬輛機車的有毒廢氣，每天早晨都會在都會區造成嚴重的空氣污染問題。 【選項解析】(A) pollution 污染  (B) industry 工業  (C) poison 毒藥  (D) neighbor 鄰居。air pollution（空氣污染）。"},{"number":6,"stem":"The high-tech manufacturing ______ in Hsinchu Science Park provides thousands of well-paid jobs for college graduates.","options":["neighbor","industry","pollution","poison"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: industry (產業；工業) 【全文中譯】新竹科學園區的高科技製造產業，為廣大大學畢業生提供了數以千計的高薪職缺。 【選項解析】(A) neighbor 鄰居  (B) industry 產業  (C) pollution 污染  (D) poison 毒藥。manufacturing industry（製造產業）。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The caring nurse warned parents that rat ______ must always be kept far out of reach of curious infants.","options":["pollution","neighbor","poison","industry"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: poison (毒藥；毒劑) 【全文中譯】細心的護士警告各位家長，老鼠藥必須永遠放在好奇幼兒拿不到的高處以免發生意外。 【選項解析】(A) pollution 污染  (B) neighbor 鄰居  (C) poison 毒藥  (D) industry 工業。rat poison（老鼠藥）。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Whenever Mr. Lin travels on business, his friendly next-door ______ gladly collects his mail and feeds his pet cat.","options":["poison","pollution","industry","neighbor"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: neighbor (鄰居) 【全文中譯】每當林先生出差旅行時，他親切的隔壁鄰居總是樂於幫忙收取信件並餵食他的寵物貓。 【選項解析】(A) poison 毒藥  (B) pollution 污染  (C) industry 工業  (D) neighbor 鄰居。next-door neighbor（隔壁鄰居）。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Environmental laws strictly forbid industrial factories to ______ clean mountain streams with dangerous chemical dyes.","options":["pollute","recycle","poison","desert"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pollute (污染) 【全文中譯】環境保護法規嚴格禁止工業廠房使用危險化學染劑污染原本清澈純淨的山澗溪流。 【選項解析】(A) pollute 污染  (B) recycle 回收  (C) poison 下毒  (D) desert 拋棄。pollute clean mountain streams（污染山澗）。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Our school cafeteria launched a green initiative to ______ all aluminum cans and plastic containers after lunchtime.","options":["pollute","recycle","poison","plant"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: recycle (資源回收) 【全文中譯】我們學校的餐廳推動了一項環保倡議，在午餐時間過後回收所有的鋁罐與塑膠容器。 【選項解析】(A) pollute 污染  (B) recycle 回收  (C) poison 下毒  (D) plant 種植。recycle used cans and containers（回收罐子與容器）。"},{"number":11,"stem":"After living in Tokyo for three years, Kevin decided to return from ______ and start his own graphic design company in Taipei.","options":["noisy","local","overseas","excellent"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: overseas (海外) 【全文中譯】在東京居住了三年之後，凱文決定從海外歸國，並在台北創立了自己的平面設計公司。 【選項解析】(A) noisy 吵鬧的  (B) local 本地的  (C) overseas 海外  (D) excellent 優秀的。return from overseas（從海外歸國）。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The library reading room has a strict silence rule because people cannot concentrate when students are being ______.","options":["excellent","local","overseas","noisy"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: noisy (吵鬧的) 【全文中譯】圖書館閱覽室設有嚴格的安靜規定，因為當學生吵鬧喧嘩時大家便無法專心閱讀。 【選項解析】(A) excellent 優秀的  (B) local 本地的  (C) overseas 海外的  (D) noisy 吵鬧的。being noisy（吵鬧喧嘩）。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Buying fresh produce from the ______ farmers market supports agricultural families and reduces transport emissions.","options":["local","noisy","overseas","excellent"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: local (當地的) 【全文中譯】從當地的農夫市集採購新鮮蔬果，既能支持在地農戶家庭，又能減少長途運輸碳排放。 【選項解析】(A) local 當地的  (B) noisy 吵鬧的  (C) overseas 海外的  (D) excellent 優秀的。local farmers market（當地農夫市集）。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The talented chef cooked an ______ banquet for the wedding guests, and everyone praised the delicate seafood dishes.","options":["overseas","excellent","local","noisy"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: excellent (極好的；精緻的) 【全文中譯】才華橫溢的主廚為婚禮賓客烹調了一席出色的盛宴，每個人都對精緻海鮮料理讚不絕口。 【選項解析】(A) overseas 海外的  (B) excellent 出色的  (C) local 當地的  (D) noisy 吵鬧的。excellent banquet（出色的盛宴）。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Burning low-grade coal in power plants releases harmful particulate matter that causes heavy smog and health ______.","options":["neighbor","industry","pollution","poison"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: pollution (污染) 【全文中譯】發電廠燃燒劣質煤炭會釋放有害懸浮微粒，導致嚴重的煙霧問題並造成健康的重度污染。 【選項解析】(A) neighbor 鄰居  (B) industry 工業  (C) pollution 污染  (D) poison 毒藥。health/environmental pollution（污染）。"},{"number":16,"stem":"The global tourism ______ suffered heavy economic losses when international flights were suspended during the crisis.","options":["poison","neighbor","pollution","industry"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: industry (產業；行業) 【全文中譯】在危機期間國際航班全面停飛時，全球的觀光旅遊產業遭受了沉重無比的經濟打擊。 【選項解析】(A) poison 毒藥  (B) neighbor 鄰居  (C) pollution 污染  (D) industry 產業。tourism industry（觀光產業）。"},{"number":17,"stem":"The label on the pest control spray clearly warned that the liquid contains deadly ______ and must not touch bare skin.","options":["poison","industry","pollution","neighbor"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: poison (毒劑；毒藥) 【全文中譯】除蟲噴霧上的標籤明確警告該液體含有致命毒藥成份，絕不可接觸到人體裸露皮膚。 【選項解析】(A) poison 毒藥/毒素  (B) industry 工業  (C) pollution 污染  (D) neighbor 鄰居。deadly poison（致命毒藥）。"},{"number":18,"stem":"When our car broke down in the driveway, our generous ______ came over with his toolbox and helped us repair it.","options":["pollution","neighbor","poison","industry"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: neighbor (鄰居) 【全文中譯】當我們的車子在車道上拋錨時，慷慨的鄰居立刻帶著工具箱走過來熱心協助修理。 【選項解析】(A) pollution 污染  (B) neighbor 鄰居  (C) poison 毒劑  (D) industry 產業。generous neighbor（慷慨鄰居）。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Careless tourists often ______ the pristine beach by leaving behind plastic wrappers and empty beverage cups.","options":["recycle","plant","pollute","poison"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: pollute (污染) 【全文中譯】粗心的遊客經常將塑膠包裝紙與空飲料杯隨意丟棄，污染了原本純淨原始的海灘環境。 【選項解析】(A) recycle 回收  (B) plant 種植  (C) pollute 污染  (D) poison 下毒。pollute the beach（污染海灘）。"},{"number":20,"stem":"It is our civic duty to separate household waste properly so sanitation workers can ______ cardboard boxes efficiently.","options":["pollute","poison","rock","recycle"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: recycle (資源回收) 【全文中譯】妥善做好家庭垃圾分類是我們的公民責任，如此清潔隊員才能有效率地回收瓦楞紙箱。 【選項解析】(A) pollute 污染  (B) poison 下毒  (C) rock 搖擺  (D) recycle 回收。recycle cardboard boxes（回收紙箱）。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The restaurant is renowned for its ______ customer service, ensuring that every guest feels genuinely respected and valued.","options":["excellent","noisy","local","overseas"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: excellent (優秀的；卓越的) 【全文中譯】這家餐廳以其卓越的顧客服務聞名，確保每一位到訪的客人都感受到被由衷重視與款待。 【選項解析】(A) excellent 卓越的  (B) noisy 吵鬧的  (C) local 當地的  (D) overseas 海外的。excellent customer service（卓越客戶服務）。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The construction site was so ______ that workers were required by safety regulations to wear heavy ear protection.","options":["overseas","noisy","local","excellent"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: noisy (吵鬧的；刺耳的) 【全文中譯】施工現場非常吵鬧嘈雜，因此根據安全法規要求，工人們必須戴上厚重的護耳保護套。 【選項解析】(A) overseas 海外的  (B) noisy 嘈雜的  (C) local 當地的  (D) excellent 優秀的。construction site was noisy（工地非常吵鬧）。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Taiwanese food stalls pride themselves on using ______ ingredients grown by agricultural farmers in neighboring counties.","options":["overseas","noisy","local","excellent"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: local (當地的；在地的) 【全文中譯】台灣的小吃攤以使用鄰近各縣在地農夫所種植的優質在地食材而深感自豪與驕傲。 【選項解析】(A) overseas 海外的  (B) noisy 吵鬧的  (C) local 在地的  (D) excellent 優秀的。local ingredients（在地食材）。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The government signed an economic partnership to encourage young entrepreneurs to expand their business ventures ______.","options":["local","noisy","excellent","overseas"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: overseas (在海外；向海外) 【全文中譯】政府簽署了經濟夥伴合作協議，以鼓勵年輕創業家們將其商業版圖與投資積極拓展至海外。 【選項解析】(A) local 本地的  (B) noisy 吵鬧的  (C) excellent 優秀的  (D) overseas 在海外。expand business overseas（拓展至海外）。"},{"number":25,"stem":"If oil tankers leak petroleum into the open sea, the toxic slick will ______ marine ecosystems and kill coral reefs.","options":["pollute","recycle","plant","rock"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pollute (污染) 【全文中譯】如果油輪在開闊公海上洩漏石油，有毒的浮油將會嚴重污染海洋生態系統並殺死珊瑚礁。 【選項解析】(A) pollute 污染  (B) recycle 回收  (C) plant 種植  (D) rock 搖擺。pollute marine ecosystems（污染海洋生態系統）。"}]},{"unit":34,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 34 (034.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Insects, Small Creatures & Household Pets | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"ant","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a tiny insect that lives in highly organized colonies underground","chinese":"螞蟻","sentence":"A long line of tiny black ______ worked together tirelessly to carry bread crumbs back to their underground nest.","translation":"一長隊小黑螞蟻不知疲倦地齊心協力，把麵包屑搬回地下的蟻巢。"},{"word":"bug","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"any small insect; an error in software; to annoy someone","chinese":"小蟲；臭蟲；打擾","sentence":"During warm summer nights, many flying ______ gather around the porch light, so we keep the screen door shut.","translation":"在溫暖的夏夜裡，許多飛蟲聚集在門廊燈周圍，所以我們把紗門緊閉。"},{"word":"butterfly","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an insect with four large, usually brightly colored wings","chinese":"蝴蝶","sentence":"A colorful ______ landed gently on the blooming rose petal, fluttering its delicate wings in the morning sunshine.","translation":"一隻五彩斑斕的蝴蝶輕輕停在盛開的玫瑰花瓣上，在晨光中輕輕拍動著嬌嫩的翅膀。"},{"word":"cockroach","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a large brown insect commonly found in houses and kitchens","chinese":"蟑螂","sentence":"When I switched on the kitchen light at midnight, an ugly brown ______ scurried quickly behind the refrigerator.","translation":"半夜我打開廚房電燈時，一隻難看的褐色蟑螂迅速竄到了冰箱後面躲藏。"},{"word":"insect","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a small creature with six legs and usually two pairs of wings","chinese":"昆蟲","sentence":"The biology teacher showed students how an ______ breathes through tiny holes on the sides of its body.","translation":"生物老師向學生們展示了一隻昆蟲如何透過身體兩側的微小氣孔來進行呼吸。"},{"word":"mosquito","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a small flying insect that bites skin to drink blood","chinese":"蚊子","sentence":"Remember to apply bug spray before walking near the swamp, or a hungry ______ will bite your bare arms.","translation":"走在沼澤附近前請記得噴防蚊液，否則飢餓的蚊子會叮咬你裸露的手臂。"},{"word":"snail","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a small soft creature with a spiral shell that moves slowly","chinese":"蝸牛","sentence":"After the afternoon rain shower, a little ______ slid slowly across the wet garden wall leaving a shiny trail.","translation":"午後陣雨過後，一隻小蝸牛在潮濕的花園圍牆上緩慢滑行，留下一道閃亮的黏液痕跡。"},{"word":"spider","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an eight-legged creature that spins silk webs to catch prey","chinese":"蜘蛛","sentence":"A patient ______ spun an intricate circular web between two tree branches to catch flying flies for food.","translation":"一隻有耐心的蜘蛛在兩根樹枝間織出了一張複雜精緻的圓形網，用來捕食飛蠅充飢。"},{"word":"kitten","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a young baby cat","chinese":"小貓；幼貓","sentence":"Our pet cat gave birth to four adorable ______, and they spent all morning playing with a ball of wool.","translation":"我們的寵物貓生下了四隻可愛的幼貓，牠們整個早晨都在玩一顆毛線球。"},{"word":"puppy","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a young baby dog","chinese":"小狗；幼犬","sentence":"For my brother's tenth birthday, grandfather brought home a fluffy golden retriever ______ that wagged its tail happily.","translation":"在弟弟十歲生日時，祖父帶回家一隻毛茸茸且開心搖著尾巴的黃金獵犬幼犬。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"A dedicated colony of industrious ______ walked in a straight line across the kitchen counter toward the sugar jar.","options":["ants","snails","spiders","puppies"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: ant (螞蟻) 【全文中譯】一大群辛勤工作的螞蟻在廚房流理台上排成一條筆直的隊伍，朝著糖罐走去。 【選項解析】(A) ants 螞蟻  (B) snails 蝸牛  (C) spiders 蜘蛛  (D) puppies 小狗。colony of ants（蟻群）。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Because it carries a heavy spiral shell on its back, the garden ______ moves at an exceptionally slow pace.","options":["kitten","snail","mosquito","butterfly"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: snail (蝸牛) 【全文中譯】因為背上揹著沉重堅硬的螺旋外殼，花園蝸牛總是以格外緩慢的步調移動行進。 【選項解析】(A) kitten 幼貓  (B) snail 蝸牛  (C) mosquito 蚊子  (D) butterfly 蝴蝶。spiral shell on back, exceptionally slow（背螺旋殼且速度極慢）。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The eight-legged garden ______ sat motionless at the center of its web, waiting for an unsuspecting fly to arrive.","options":["puppy","cockroach","spider","ant"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: spider (蜘蛛) 【全文中譯】這隻八隻腳的花園蜘蛛在蛛網中央紋絲不動地坐著，靜靜等待毫無防備的飛蠅到來。 【選項解析】(A) puppy 幼犬  (B) cockroach 蟑螂  (C) spider 蜘蛛  (D) ant 螞蟻。eight-legged, center of web（八隻腳且在網中央）。"},{"number":4,"stem":"When we opened the pet carrier, an adorable golden ______ stepped out hesitantly and barked softly at our family.","options":["insect","bug","snail","puppy"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: puppy (小狗；幼犬) 【全文中譯】當我們打開寵物提籃時，一隻可愛的金色小狗猶豫地走了出來，對著我們全家輕輕汪汪叫。 【選項解析】(A) insect 昆蟲  (B) bug 蟲子  (C) snail 蝸牛  (D) puppy 幼犬。barked softly（輕柔地吠叫）可知為小狗 puppy。"},{"number":5,"stem":"A sleeping ginger ______ curled up comfortably in a warm basket beside the fireplace and purred gently all evening.","options":["kitten","butterfly","cockroach","mosquito"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: kitten (幼貓；小貓) 【全文中譯】一隻正在睡覺的橘色小貓在壁爐旁溫暖的籃子裡舒服地蜷縮著，整晚發出溫柔的呼嚕聲。 【選項解析】(A) kitten 小貓  (B) butterfly 蝴蝶  (C) cockroach 蟑螂  (D) mosquito 蚊子。purred gently（發出呼嚕聲）為貓咪特徵。"},{"number":6,"stem":"In the sunny botanical garden, a magnificent yellow ______ fluttered effortlessly from one lavender flower to another.","options":["snail","butterfly","spider","puppy"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: butterfly (蝴蝶) 【全文中譯】在陽光明媚的植物園裡，一隻美麗絢麗的黃色蝴蝶毫不費力地從一朵薰衣草花朵翩翩飛到另一朵。 【選項解析】(A) snail 蝸牛  (B) butterfly 蝴蝶  (C) spider 蜘蛛  (D) puppy 幼犬。fluttered from flower to flower（在花朵間翩翩飛舞）。"},{"number":7,"stem":"Standing pools of stagnant rainwater provide ideal breeding grounds where each female ______ can lay hundreds of eggs.","options":["kitten","ant","mosquito","bug"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: mosquito (蚊子) 【全文中譯】積存不流動的雨水水窪提供了極佳的繁殖溫床，每隻母蚊子都能在其中產下數百顆卵。 【選項解析】(A) kitten 小貓  (B) ant 螞蟻  (C) mosquito 蚊子  (D) bug 蟲子。standing pools of rainwater breed mosquitoes（積水滋生蚊子）。"},{"number":8,"stem":"If you leave dirty greasy food dishes in the sink overnight, an unwelcome kitchen ______ will certainly come out to feed.","options":["puppy","snail","spider","cockroach"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: cockroach (蟑螂) 【全文中譯】如果你將油膩骯髒的餐盤留在水槽裡過夜，不受歡迎的廚房蟑螂肯定會大搖大擺出來覓食。 【選項解析】(A) puppy 小狗  (B) snail 蝸牛  (C) spider 蜘蛛  (D) cockroach 蟑螂。kitchen cockroach（廚房蟑螂）。"},{"number":9,"stem":"In general, every adult ______ has three main body parts and six legs, which clearly distinguishes it from a spider.","options":["insect","kitten","puppy","snail"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: insect (昆蟲) 【全文中譯】一般而言，每隻成年昆蟲都具備三個主要身體部分與六隻腳，這明顯將其與蜘蛛區隔開來。 【選項解析】(A) insect 昆蟲  (B) kitten 小貓  (C) puppy 小狗  (D) snail 蝸牛。three body parts, six legs（三段身體、六隻腳）是昆蟲定義。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Keep the screen windows tightly closed at dusk, or a persistent summer ______ will fly inside and buzz near your ear.","options":["kitten","bug","puppy","snail"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: bug (小蟲；飛蟲) 【全文中譯】黃昏時務必將紗窗緊緊關閉，否則頑固的夏季飛蟲會飛進室內並在你的耳邊嗡嗡作響。 【選項解析】(A) kitten 小貓  (B) bug 飛蟲  (C) puppy 小狗  (D) snail 蝸牛。flying bug buzzes near ear（飛蟲在耳邊嗡嗡叫）。"},{"number":11,"stem":"After stepping outside in the damp grass after the rain, I almost stepped on a little ______ crawling along the path.","options":["puppy","spider","snail","mosquito"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: snail (蝸牛) 【全文中譯】雨後走到潮濕草地上時，我差點踩到了一隻正沿著小徑緩慢爬行的小蝸牛。 【選項解析】(A) puppy 小狗  (B) spider 蜘蛛  (C) snail 蝸牛  (D) mosquito 蚊子。damp grass after rain, crawling slowly（雨後草地爬行的小蝸牛）。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The mother dog lovingly washed each newborn ______ with her warm tongue until its soft fur was completely clean.","options":["kitten","butterfly","cockroach","puppy"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: puppy (小狗；幼犬) 【全文中譯】狗媽媽用溫暖的舌頭慈愛地為每一隻初生的小狗清理身體，直到牠們柔嫩的絨毛徹底乾淨。 【選項解析】(A) kitten 小貓  (B) butterfly 蝴蝶  (C) cockroach 蟑螂  (D) puppy 幼犬。mother dog cleans newborn puppy（母狗舔舐初生幼犬）。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The sweet honey spilled on the wooden porch attracted hundreds of red ______ within less than twenty minutes.","options":["ants","snails","spiders","puppies"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: ant (螞蟻) 【全文中譯】灑在木門廊上的甜蜂蜜，在不到二十分鐘的時間內就招引來了數以百計的紅火蟻/紅螞蟻。 【選項解析】(A) ants 螞蟻  (B) snails 蝸牛  (C) spiders 蜘蛛  (D) puppies 小狗。honey attracts ants（蜂蜜吸引螞蟻）。"},{"number":14,"stem":"A fluffy white ______ with bright blue eyes chased a falling autumn leaf across the living room carpet playfully.","options":["cockroach","kitten","bug","mosquito"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: kitten (幼貓；小貓) 【全文中譯】一隻擁有明亮藍色眼睛的毛茸茸白色小貓，在客廳地毯上頑皮地追逐著一片飄落的秋葉。 【選項解析】(A) cockroach 蟑螂  (B) kitten 小貓  (C) bug 蟲子  (D) mosquito 蚊子。fluffy kitten chases leaf（毛茸茸小貓追落葉）。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Ron has an intense fear of ______ and screamed loudly when he saw a hairy one crawling up the bathroom wall.","options":["butterflies","snails","spiders","puppies"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: spider (蜘蛛) 【全文中譯】榮恩對蜘蛛懷有強烈的恐懼症，當他看到一隻多毛的蜘蛛正沿著浴室牆壁向上爬時不禁大聲尖叫。 【選項解析】(A) butterflies 蝴蝶  (B) snails 蝸牛  (C) spiders 蜘蛛  (D) puppies 小狗。fear of spiders（怕蜘蛛，符合哈利波特原著情節）。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Turn off the bright lights in the tent, or every flying ______ in the campsite will swarm directly toward our faces.","options":["puppy","snail","kitten","insect"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: insect (昆蟲；飛蟲) 【全文中譯】把帳篷裡的明亮照明關掉，否則營地裡的所有飛蟲都會直奔著我們的臉龐蜂擁而來。 【選項解析】(A) puppy 小狗  (B) snail 蝸牛  (C) kitten 小貓  (D) insect 昆蟲。flying insect swarms toward light（飛蟲撲向光源）。"},{"number":17,"stem":"That nasty ______ gave me an itchy red bite on my left ankle while I was reading a book on the patio yesterday.","options":["mosquito","snail","puppy","butterfly"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: mosquito (蚊子) 【全文中譯】昨天當我在露台看書時，那隻可惡的蚊子在我左腳踝上狠狠叮咬了一口，奇癢無比。 【選項解析】(A) mosquito 蚊子  (B) snail 蝸牛  (C) puppy 小狗  (D) butterfly 蝴蝶。itchy red bite on ankle（腳踝被叮出紅腫發癢的包）。"},{"number":18,"stem":"When my sister opened the old cardboard box in the damp basement, a giant ______ ran out from beneath the newspapers.","options":["butterfly","cockroach","puppy","kitten"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: cockroach (蟑螂) 【全文中譯】當我姐姐打開潮濕地下室裡的舊紙箱時，一隻巨大的蟑螂立刻從報紙底下竄了出來。 【選項解析】(A) butterfly 蝴蝶  (B) cockroach 蟑螂  (C) puppy 小狗  (D) kitten 小貓。damp basement, giant cockroach（地下室竄出大蟑螂）。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Before transforming into a graceful flying ______, the creature spends its early life as a leaf-eating caterpillar.","options":["spider","snail","butterfly","mosquito"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: butterfly (蝴蝶) 【全文中譯】在蛻變成為一隻優雅翩翩飛舞的蝴蝶之前，這個生物生命早期是一隻啃食樹葉的毛毛蟲。 【選項解析】(A) spider 蜘蛛  (B) snail 蝸牛  (C) butterfly 蝴蝶  (D) mosquito 蚊子。transforms from caterpillar into butterfly（毛毛蟲變蝴蝶）。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The software engineer stayed at the computer terminal until midnight trying to track down a critical programming ______.","options":["puppy","kitten","snail","bug"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: bug (程式錯誤；漏洞) 【全文中譯】軟體工程師一直留在電腦終端機前工作到半夜，試圖追蹤找出一個關鍵的程式錯誤漏洞。 【選項解析】(A) puppy 小狗  (B) kitten 小貓  (C) snail 蝸牛  (D) bug 程式錯誤。programming bug（軟體臭蟲/錯誤）。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The curious little boy used a magnifying glass to inspect the head and antennae of a tiny worker ______ on the pavement.","options":["ant","spider","puppy","snail"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: ant (螞蟻) 【全文中譯】好奇的小男孩拿著放大鏡，仔細觀察人行道上一隻小工蟻的頭部與觸角結構。 【選項解析】(A) ant 螞蟻  (B) spider 蜘蛛  (C) puppy 小狗  (D) snail 蝸牛。worker ant（工蟻）。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The pet shelter launched a campaign encouraging families to adopt an energetic rescue ______ instead of buying one.","options":["mosquito","puppy","cockroach","bug"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: puppy (小狗；幼犬) 【全文中譯】動物收容所發起了一項宣導活動，鼓勵各個家庭領養充滿活力的流浪收容幼犬以代替購買。 【選項解析】(A) mosquito 蚊子  (B) puppy 幼犬  (C) cockroach 蟑螂  (D) bug 蟲子。adopt a rescue puppy（領養救援幼犬）。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The silver track on the stone walkway showed where a slimy ______ had traveled slowly during the misty morning hours.","options":["puppy","kitten","snail","spider"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: snail (蝸牛) 【全文中譯】石板步道上留下的一道銀色黏液痕跡，顯示出一隻黏糊糊的蝸牛在晨霧繚繞的清晨曾緩慢爬過。 【選項解析】(A) puppy 小狗  (B) kitten 小貓  (C) snail 蝸牛  (D) spider 蜘蛛。silver track of slimy snail（蝸牛走過的銀白黏液痕跡）。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The clever mother cat carried each fragile newborn ______ one by one by the scruff of their necks to a safer dry box.","options":["cockroach","mosquito","bug","kitten"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: kitten (小貓；幼貓) 【全文中譯】聰明的母貓用嘴叼起脆弱初生小貓頸部的皮，一隻一隻地將牠們搬移到更安全乾燥的箱子裡。 【選項解析】(A) cockroach 蟑螂  (B) mosquito 蚊子  (C) bug 蟲子  (D) kitten 幼貓。mother cat moves newborn kitten（母貓搬動小貓）。"},{"number":25,"stem":"A hungry garden ______ constructed an invisible web between two tomato plants, trapping small garden pests.","options":["spider","puppy","kitten","snail"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: spider (蜘蛛) 【全文中譯】一隻飢餓的花園蜘蛛在兩株番茄植物之間織出了一張隱形蛛網，用來誘捕小型花園害蟲。 【選項解析】(A) spider 蜘蛛  (B) puppy 小狗  (C) kitten 小貓  (D) snail 蝸牛。spider constructed web（蜘蛛結網）。"}]},{"unit":35,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 35 (035.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Marine Animals, Waterfowl & Farm Birds | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"dolphin","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a highly intelligent sea mammal with a curved beak and blowhole","chinese":"海豚","sentence":"A playful ______ leapt gracefully out of the sparkling blue waves, thrilling all the tourists on the cruise boat.","translation":"一隻愛玩的海豚優雅地躍出閃爍蔚藍的海浪，讓遊輪上的所有遊客雀躍不已。"},{"word":"whale","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a very large sea mammal that breathes air through a blowhole","chinese":"鯨魚","sentence":"The blue ______ is the largest animal on Earth, and it migrates thousands of miles across polar oceans.","translation":"藍鯨是地球上體型最大的動物，牠會在極地海洋間進行長達數千英里的遷徙。"},{"word":"shark","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a large predatory fish with sharp teeth and a prominent dorsal fin","chinese":"鯊魚","sentence":"When the lifeguards spotted a large ______ swimming near the crowded shore, they ordered all swimmers out of the water.","translation":"當救生員發現一條大型鯊魚在擁擠的海岸附近游動時，他們立刻命令所有泳客離開水面。"},{"word":"shrimp","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a small edible sea creature with a soft shell and long legs","chinese":"蝦子","sentence":"The night market food vendor fried fresh ______ with garlic and pepper, creating a mouth-watering aroma.","translation":"夜市的熟食攤販用大蒜和胡椒熱炒新鮮的蝦子，散發出一股令人垂涎欲滴的香氣。"},{"word":"crab","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a sea creature with a hard flat shell and ten legs, including two large pincers","chinese":"螃蟹","sentence":"A small red ______ walked sideways across the wet sand, using its sharp claws to catch tiny morsels.","translation":"一隻紅色的小螃蟹在濕潤的沙灘上橫著行走，用牠鋒利的雙螯捕捉細小的食物碎屑。"},{"word":"turtle","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a slow-moving reptile with a hard bony shell protecting its body","chinese":"烏龜；海龜","sentence":"A green sea ______ crawled slowly up onto the sandy beach at night to lay dozens of round white eggs.","translation":"一隻綠蠵龜在夜間緩慢爬上沙灘，在沙坑中產下了數十顆圓形的白卵。"},{"word":"duck","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a common water bird with webbed feet and a broad flat beak","chinese":"鴨子","sentence":"A mother ______ led her six fluffy yellow ducklings across the calm pond, quacking softly to keep them close.","translation":"一隻鴨媽媽帶著她六隻毛茸茸的黃色小鴨橫渡平靜的池塘，輕聲嘎嘎叫著以讓牠們跟緊。"},{"word":"goose (goose / geese)","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a large water bird with a long neck, larger than a duck","chinese":"鵝（複數為 geese）","sentence":"A flock of wild ______ flew overhead in a neat V-shaped pattern as cold winter approached the northern lakes.","translation":"寒冬逼近北方湖泊之際，一群野生鵝在上空以整齊的V字隊形向南方振翅翱翔。"},{"word":"swan","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a large graceful water bird with long neck and white feathers","chinese":"天鵝","sentence":"A beautiful white ______ glided smoothly across the mirror-like lake, bending its long neck into the cool water.","translation":"一隻美麗的白天鵝在如鏡面般的湖水上平穩滑行，並將修長的頸部探入清涼的水中。"},{"word":"hen","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an adult female chicken kept for producing eggs or meat","chinese":"母雞","sentence":"The farmer feeds each speckled ______ with cracked corn every morning, and he collects fresh eggs every afternoon.","translation":"農夫每天早晨用碎玉米餵養每一隻斑紋母雞，並且在每天下午收集新鮮的雞蛋。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The acrobatic ______ swam alongside our tour boat and performed breathtaking backflips above the blue water.","options":["dolphin","turtle","hen","duck"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: dolphin (海豚) 【全文中譯】身手矯捷的海豚在我們的觀光遊船旁並肩暢泳，並在蔚藍海水上方做出了驚險優雅的後空翻。 【選項解析】(A) dolphin 海豚  (B) turtle 烏龜  (C) hen 母雞  (D) duck 鴨子。acrobatic dolphin leaps above water（特技般躍出水面的海豚）。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Because it has a massive skeleton and thick layer of blubber, the blue ______ can withstand icy polar waters easily.","options":["hen","whale","crab","duck"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: whale (鯨魚) 【全文中譯】因為擁有龐大的骨架與厚實的鯨脂層，藍鯨能夠極其輕鬆地抵禦極地極寒的海水環境。 【選項解析】(A) hen 母雞  (B) whale 鯨魚  (C) crab 螃蟹  (D) duck 鴨子。blue whale with blubber layer（擁有鯨脂的藍鯨）。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Beach warning sirens blared loudly after a coastal fisherman spotted a dangerous white ______ near the surfing zone.","options":["duck","turtle","shark","swan"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: shark (鯊魚) 【全文中譯】在一名沿海漁民於衝浪區域附近發現一條危險的大白鯊之後，海灘警戒警報聲大作。 【選項解析】(A) duck 鴨子  (B) turtle 海龜  (C) shark 鯊魚  (D) swan 天鵝。dangerous white shark near surfing zone（衝浪區出現大白鯊）。"},{"number":4,"stem":"The seafood chef prepared a steaming bowl of noodles garnished with juicy pink ______ and green scallions.","options":["hen","swan","goose","shrimp"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: shrimp (蝦子) 【全文中譯】海鮮大廚端上了一碗熱騰騰的湯麵，上面鋪滿了多汁粉嫩的蝦子與碧綠的青蔥作為佐料。 【選項解析】(A) hen 母雞  (B) swan 天鵝  (C) goose 鵝  (D) shrimp 蝦子。garnished with juicy pink shrimp（點綴粉紅蝦子）。"},{"number":5,"stem":"When disturbed on the rocky shore, the tiny hermit ______ pulled its soft body entirely into its borrowed shell.","options":["crab","dolphin","whale","hen"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: crab (螃蟹) 【全文中譯】當在岩石海岸受到驚擾時，這隻小寄居蟹便會將牠柔軟的身軀徹底縮回牠所借宿的外殼中。 【選項解析】(A) crab 螃蟹/寄居蟹  (B) dolphin 海豚  (C) whale 鯨魚  (D) hen 母雞。hermit crab in shell（寄居蟹縮回殼中）。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Marine biologists placed a GPS satellite tracker on the shell of the endangered sea ______ to study its Pacific route.","options":["goose","turtle","hen","duck"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: turtle (海龜) 【全文中譯】海洋生物學家在瀕危海龜的外殼上安裝了GPS衛星定位追蹤器，用以研究牠橫越太平洋的路線。 【選項解析】(A) goose 鵝  (B) turtle 海龜  (C) hen 母雞  (D) duck 鴨子。satellite tracker on shell of sea turtle（海龜殼上的衛星追蹤器）。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The noisy yellow ______ waddled across the muddy farm trail and splashed happily into the rain puddle.","options":["whale","shark","duck","dolphin"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: duck (鴨子) 【全文中譯】這隻吵鬧的黃色小鴨搖搖擺擺地走過泥濘農場小徑，並歡快地啪嗒一聲跳進了雨水窪裡。 【選項解析】(A) whale 鯨魚  (B) shark 鯊魚  (C) duck 鴨子  (D) dolphin 海豚。yellow duck waddled and splashed（搖擺跳進水窪的黃色鴨子）。"},{"number":8,"stem":"In the fairy tale story, the awkward gray bird transformed miraculously into a magnificent white ______.","options":["shrimp","crab","hen","swan"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: swan (天鵝) 【全文中譯】在童話故事當中，那隻笨拙醜陋的灰色小鳥奇蹟般地蛻變成為了一隻優雅美麗的白天鵝。 【選項解析】(A) shrimp 蝦子  (B) crab 螃蟹  (C) hen 母雞  (D) swan 天鵝。ugly bird turned into white swan（醜小鴨變白天鵝）。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The backyard coop houses twenty healthy brown ______ that lay dozens of organic eggs for our breakfast table.","options":["hens","whales","sharks","dolphins"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: hen (母雞) 【全文中譯】後院的雞舍裡飼養了二十隻健康的褐色母雞，為我們的早餐餐桌產下數打優質有機雞蛋。 【選項解析】(A) hens 母雞  (B) whales 鯨魚  (C) sharks 鯊魚  (D) dolphins 海豚。hens lay organic eggs（母雞產有機蛋）。"},{"number":10,"stem":"As autumn arrived in the north, a large flock of wild ______ honked loudly while flying south toward warmer climates.","options":["shrimp","geese","crabs","sharks"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: geese (鵝；野雁（複數）) 【全文中譯】北方入秋之際，一大群野鵝在上空大聲鳴叫，成群結隊地往南方溫暖的氣候展翅遷徙。 【選項解析】(A) shrimp 蝦子  (B) geese 野鵝/野雁（複數）  (C) crabs 螃蟹  (D) sharks 鯊魚。flock of wild geese fly south（野鵝/雁群向南飛）。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Snorkelers near the coral reef were amazed when a friendly ______ approached them and clicked curiously.","options":["turtle","hen","dolphin","duck"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: dolphin (海豚) 【全文中譯】在珊瑚礁附近浮潛的遊客驚喜不已，因為一隻友善的海豚主動游近他們身旁並好奇地發出喀嗒聲。 【選項解析】(A) turtle 海龜  (B) hen 母雞  (C) dolphin 海豚  (D) duck 鴨子。friendly dolphin clicked（發出喀嗒回聲定位聲的海豚）。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Watch your bare toes while walking along the rocky tide pools, or a pinching ______ might snap at your feet.","options":["swan","whale","hen","crab"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: crab (螃蟹) 【全文中譯】赤腳走過多石的潮間帶水坑時要當心，否則夾人很痛的螃蟹可能會朝著你的雙腳狠狠夾上一把。 【選項解析】(A) swan 天鵝  (B) whale 鯨魚  (C) hen 母雞  (D) crab 螃蟹。pinching crab snaps at feet（夾人的螃蟹）。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The giant humpback ______ breached high above the ocean surface, creating a colossal splash seen from miles away.","options":["whale","duck","shrimp","hen"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: whale (鯨魚) 【全文中譯】龐大的座頭鯨高高躍出大洋水面，激起數英里外都能看見的滔天巨大水花。 【選項解析】(A) whale 鯨魚  (B) duck 鴨子  (C) shrimp 蝦子  (D) hen 母雞。humpback whale breached（座頭鯨躍出水面）。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The old giant tortoises and freshwater ______ can often live for more than one hundred years in peaceful habitats.","options":["sharks","turtles","dolphins","geese"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: turtle (烏龜；海龜) 【全文中譯】古老的象龜與淡水陸龜在安寧與不受打擾的天然棲息地中，往往能夠存活超過一百歲以上。 【選項解析】(A) sharks 鯊魚  (B) turtles 烏龜  (C) dolphins 海豚  (D) geese 鵝。tortoises and turtles live 100+ years（龜類長壽百歲）。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Many species of pelagic ______ have multiple rows of razor-sharp teeth that continuously regenerate throughout their lives.","options":["ducks","swans","sharks","hens"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: shark (鯊魚) 【全文中譯】許多種遠洋鯊魚都擁有多排如剃刀般鋒利的牙齒，並且在一生當中持續不斷地脫落與再生。 【選項解析】(A) ducks 鴨子  (B) swans 天鵝  (C) sharks 鯊魚  (D) hens 母雞。pelagic sharks with sharp teeth（遠洋鯊魚的鋒利再生牙齒）。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Taiwanese night markets are famous for serving crispy fried ______ balls coated in sweet mayonnaise and pineapple chunks.","options":["duck","turtle","swan","shrimp"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: shrimp (蝦子) 【全文中譯】台灣夜市以供應酥脆爽口的鳳梨蝦球聞名，上面淋著甜甜的美乃滋並佐以香甜鳳梨塊。 【選項解析】(A) duck 鴨子  (B) turtle 烏龜  (C) swan 天鵝  (D) shrimp 蝦子。crispy fried shrimp balls（鳳梨蝦球）。"},{"number":17,"stem":"A mother ______ clucked nervously in the grass when a stray farm cat approached too close to her newly hatched chicks.","options":["hen","whale","dolphin","shark"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: hen (母雞) 【全文中譯】當一隻流浪農場貓靠得離剛孵化的幼雛太近時，母雞在草叢中緊張無比地咯咯咕噥叫著保護孩子。 【選項解析】(A) hen 母雞  (B) whale 鯨魚  (C) dolphin 海豚  (D) shark 鯊魚。mother hen clucked to protect chicks（母雞咯咯叫保護小雞）。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Two elegant white ______ mated for life and floated serenely across the palace fountain in the public garden.","options":["crabs","swans","turtles","sharks"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: swan (天鵝) 【全文中譯】兩隻優雅的白天鵝終生相伴為偶，在公園皇宮噴泉池中安詳愜意地並肩飄行。 【選項解析】(A) crabs 螃蟹  (B) swans 天鵝  (C) turtles 烏龜  (D) sharks 鯊魚。elegant white swans mate for life（終生相伴的白天鵝）。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Children threw dry bread crumbs into the pond water, watching the hungry ______ paddle their webbed feet quickly.","options":["sharks","whales","ducks","crabs"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: duck (鴨子) 【全文中譯】孩子們將乾麵包屑扔進池塘水中，看著飢餓的鴨群迅速划動牠們帶蹼的雙腳前來爭食。 【選項解析】(A) sharks 鯊魚  (B) whales 鯨魚  (C) ducks 鴨子  (D) crabs 螃蟹。ducks paddle webbed feet（鴨子划動蹼足）。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The aggressive domestic ______ hissed loudly at the postman and chased him all the way to the garden gate.","options":["dolphin","shrimp","turtle","goose"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: goose (鵝) 【全文中譯】這隻脾氣兇悍的看門鵝對著郵差大聲發出嘶嘶威嚇聲，一路將他追趕到了花園大門口。 【選項解析】(A) dolphin 海豚  (B) shrimp 蝦子  (C) turtle 烏龜  (D) goose 鵝。domestic goose hissed and chased（看門鵝嘶嘶叫追人）。"},{"number":21,"stem":"With its streamlined body and clever playful nature, the bottlenose ______ is widely loved by children worldwide.","options":["dolphin","hen","crab","duck"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: dolphin (海豚) 【全文中譯】憑藉其流線型的身軀與聰明貪玩的天性，瓶鼻海豚受到全世界兒童的廣泛喜愛。 【選項解析】(A) dolphin 海豚  (B) hen 母雞  (C) crab 螃蟹  (D) duck 鴨子。bottlenose dolphin（瓶鼻海豚）。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The protective mother sea ______ spends hours digging an egg chamber high above the high-tide watermark.","options":["shark","turtle","swan","whale"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: turtle (海龜) 【全文中譯】保護後代的海龜媽媽在遠高於高潮線的沙灘高處，耗費數小時挖掘產卵土穴。 【選項解析】(A) shark 鯊魚  (B) turtle 海龜  (C) swan 天鵝  (D) whale 鯨魚。mother sea turtle digs egg chamber（海龜媽媽挖沙產卵）。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The ocean expedition used an underwater steel cage so researchers could safely observe a fierce tiger ______.","options":["duck","hen","shark","goose"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: shark (鯊魚) 【全文中譯】海洋探險隊使用了水下防護鋼籠，使研究人員能夠在安全保障下近距離觀察兇猛的虎鯊。 【選項解析】(A) duck 鴨子  (B) hen 母雞  (C) shark 鯊魚  (D) goose 鵝。underwater steel cage to observe tiger shark（鋼籠觀察虎鯊）。"},{"number":24,"stem":"A bowl of savory seafood porridge topped with boiled ______ and sweet ginger is a classic Taiwanese breakfast dish.","options":["swan","whale","turtle","shrimp"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: shrimp (蝦子) 【全文中譯】一碗鋪滿水煮蝦子與鮮甜薑絲的美味海鮮粥，是台灣最道地經典的美味早餐之一。 【選項解析】(A) swan 天鵝  (B) whale 鯨魚  (C) turtle 烏龜  (D) shrimp 蝦子。seafood porridge topped with boiled shrimp（鮮蝦海鮮粥）。"},{"number":25,"stem":"When the rooster crowed at dawn, the speckled ______ hopped down from her wooden roost and searched for worms.","options":["hen","dolphin","shark","whale"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: hen (母雞) 【全文中譯】破曉時分公雞啼鳴時，這隻斑點母雞便從木製棲架上跳了下來，在泥土中尋找小蟲食用。 【選項解析】(A) hen 母雞  (B) dolphin 海豚  (C) shark 鯊魚  (D) whale 鯨魚。speckled hen hopped down（斑點母雞跳下棲架）。"}]},{"unit":36,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 36 (036.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Wild Animals, Forest Creatures & Zoo Mammals | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"turkey","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a large American bird with naked head and tail feathers, eaten as food","chinese":"火雞","sentence":"American families traditionally roast a large stuffed ______ for dinner on Thanksgiving Day every November.","translation":"美國家庭傳統上在每年十一月的感恩節晚餐時，都會烤一隻碩大且塞滿餡料的火雞。"},{"word":"frog","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a tailless amphibious creature with long legs for jumping and a croak","chinese":"青蛙","sentence":"A small green ______ hopped quickly off the broad lily pad into the pond when a snake came near.","translation":"當一條蛇靠近時，一隻綠色小青蛙迅速從寬大的荷葉上跳進了池塘裡。"},{"word":"kangaroo","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a large Australian herbivore that moves by leaping with strong hind legs","chinese":"袋鼠","sentence":"An Australian mother ______ carried her tiny baby inside her front pouch while hopping across the dry grassy plains.","translation":"一隻澳洲袋鼠媽媽在乾草平原上跳躍前進時，在前腹的育兒袋裡懷抱著她的小寶寶。"},{"word":"wolf (wolf / wolves)","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a wild predatory canine that hunts cooperatively in a pack","chinese":"狼（複數為 wolves）","sentence":"On freezing winter nights, a hungry pack of gray ______ howled eerily at the full moon across the snowy valley.","translation":"在酷寒的冬夜裡，一群飢餓的灰狼隔著積雪覆蓋的山谷，對著滿月發出令人毛骨悚然的嚎叫。"},{"word":"fox","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a small carnivorous canine with a bushy tail and a clever, sneaky reputation","chinese":"狐狸","sentence":"A clever red ______ stole silently into the chicken coop after midnight and caught two fat roosting hens.","translation":"一隻聰明伶俐的紅狐狸在半夜悄悄溜進雞舍，抓走了兩隻肥胖停棲的母雞。"},{"word":"panda","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a large black-and-white bear native to China that feeds on bamboo","chinese":"熊貓；大貓熊","sentence":"The chubby giant ______ sat quietly on the grassy zoo lawn, munching happily on fresh green bamboo stalks.","translation":"圓滾滾的大貓熊安靜地坐在動物園的草坪上，津津有味地大口啃食著新鮮翠綠的竹莖。"},{"word":"koala","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an Australian tree-dwelling marsupial with gray fur that eats eucalyptus leaves","chinese":"無尾熊","sentence":"A sleepy gray ______ clung tightly to the tall eucalyptus tree branch and dozed peacefully under the warm sun.","translation":"一隻睡眼惺忪的灰色無尾熊緊緊抱住高高的尤加利樹枝，在溫暖的陽光下安詳打盹。"},{"word":"donkey","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a domesticated hoofed mammal related to the horse, with long ears","chinese":"驢子","sentence":"The stubborn brown ______ refused to move forward along the steep mountain path until the farmer offered it a juicy apple.","translation":"那隻頑固的褐色驢子拒絕沿著陡峭山徑往前走，直到農夫遞給牠一顆多汁的蘋果才肯邁步。"},{"word":"zebra","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an African wild horse with distinct black and white vertical stripes","chinese":"斑馬","sentence":"A herd of African ______ stood close together near the waterhole, their black and white stripes confusing watching predators.","translation":"一群非洲斑馬在水坑邊緊緊聚集在一起，牠們的黑白條紋讓伺機而動的掠食者眼花撩亂。"},{"word":"hippopotamus","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a huge thick-skinned African mammal that lives mostly in rivers","chinese":"河馬","sentence":"The massive gray ______ submerged its heavy body in the muddy river, keeping only its eyes and nostrils above water.","translation":"龐大的灰色河馬將沉重的身軀浸泡在泥濘的河水中，僅僅把眼睛和鼻孔露出水面。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"During the traditional Thanksgiving feast, grandmother carved the golden roasted ______ with a sharp carving knife.","options":["turkey","koala","panda","donkey"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: turkey (火雞) 【全文中譯】在傳統的感恩節大餐期間，祖母用一把鋒利的切肉刀將烤得金黃酥脆的火雞切片分食。 【選項解析】(A) turkey 火雞  (B) koala 無尾熊  (C) panda 貓熊  (D) donkey 驢子。Thanksgiving golden roasted turkey（感恩節烤火雞）。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The mother ______ in the Australian bush carries her tiny joey securely inside her warm abdominal pouch.","options":["frog","kangaroo","wolf","zebra"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: kangaroo (袋鼠) 【全文中譯】在澳洲叢林裡的袋鼠媽媽，將幼小的袋鼠寶寶安全無虞地懷抱在溫暖的前腹育兒袋中。 【選項解析】(A) frog 青蛙  (B) kangaroo 袋鼠  (C) wolf 狼  (D) zebra 斑馬。Australian mother kangaroo with pouch（有育兒袋的澳洲袋鼠）。"},{"number":3,"stem":"On stormy winter nights in the dense pine forest, a lone gray ______ howled mournfully into the freezing wind.","options":["donkey","turkey","wolf","panda"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: wolf (狼) 【全文中譯】在茂密松樹林暴風雨肆虐的冬夜裡，一隻孤獨的灰狼對著刺骨寒風發出了悲涼的長嚎。 【選項解析】(A) donkey 驢子  (B) turkey 火雞  (C) wolf 狼  (D) panda 貓熊。gray wolf howled mournfully（灰狼悲涼嚎叫）。"},{"number":4,"stem":"A sly red ______ with a magnificent bushy tail crept stealthily through the tall grass toward the duck pond.","options":["hippopotamus","frog","zebra","fox"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: fox (狐狸) 【全文中譯】一隻擁有美麗濃密蓬鬆尾巴的狡黠紅狐狸，悄悄穿過高高的草叢向著野鴨池塘潛行。 【選項解析】(A) hippopotamus 河馬  (B) frog 青蛙  (C) zebra 斑馬  (D) fox 狐狸。sly red fox with bushy tail（蓬鬆尾巴的狡猾紅狐）。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Visitors to the Taipei Zoo lined up for hours just to catch a glimpse of the playful baby ______ playing with a tire.","options":["panda","donkey","turkey","wolf"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: panda (貓熊；熊貓) 【全文中譯】前來台北市立動物園的遊客排隊數小時，只為一睹那隻正在跟輪胎玩耍的調皮貓熊寶寶。 【選項解析】(A) panda 貓熊  (B) donkey 驢子  (C) turkey 火雞  (D) wolf 狼。Taipei Zoo baby panda（台北動物園貓熊寶寶）。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Native only to eastern Australia, the gentle furry ______ sleeps up to twenty hours each day high in eucalyptus branches.","options":["frog","koala","wolf","zebra"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: koala (無尾熊) 【全文中譯】僅產於澳洲東部的溫和毛茸茸無尾熊，每天在高高的尤加利樹枝上沉睡長達二十小時。 【選項解析】(A) frog 青蛙  (B) koala 無尾熊  (C) wolf 狼  (D) zebra 斑馬。sleeps 20 hours in eucalyptus branches（在尤加利樹上睡20小時的無尾熊）。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The hardworking pack ______ carried two heavy baskets of fresh mountain tea down the steep rocky steps patiently.","options":["kangaroo","fox","donkey","panda"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: donkey (驢子) 【全文中譯】這隻任勞任怨的馱運驢子耐心地馱著兩大簍新鮮高山茶葉，一步一步走下陡峭多石的階梯。 【選項解析】(A) kangaroo 袋鼠  (B) fox 狐狸  (C) donkey 驢子  (D) panda 貓熊。pack donkey carried baskets（馱著籮筐的驢子）。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Predators find it difficult to target an individual ______ because the herd's dazzling striped coats create visual confusion.","options":["turkey","koala","frog","zebra"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: zebra (斑馬) 【全文中譯】掠食肉食動物很難單獨鎖定單隻斑馬，因為斑馬群耀眼的黑白條紋會在視覺上產生極大困惑。 【選項解析】(A) turkey 火雞  (B) koala 無尾熊  (C) frog 青蛙  (D) zebra 斑馬。striped coats of zebras（斑馬的黑白條紋外衣）。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The giant river ______ opened its enormous pink jaws wide to warn a rival male to stay away from its territory.","options":["hippopotamus","donkey","fox","kangaroo"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: hippopotamus (河馬) 【全文中譯】龐大的巨大河馬大大張開牠粉紅色的大嘴，警告與其競爭的雄性個體遠離其領域範圍。 【選項解析】(A) hippopotamus 河馬  (B) donkey 驢子  (C) fox 狐狸  (D) kangaroo 袋鼠。hippopotamus opened pink jaws wide（河馬大張血盆大口）。"},{"number":10,"stem":"The tiny tree ______ has sticky suction cups on its toes that allow it to climb smooth green plant leaves effortlessly.","options":["turkey","frog","wolf","panda"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: frog (青蛙) 【全文中譯】這隻微小的樹蛙腳趾上具備黏性吸盤，使牠能夠毫不費力地攀爬光滑翠綠的植物葉面。 【選項解析】(A) turkey 火雞  (B) frog 青蛙/樹蛙  (C) wolf 狼  (D) panda 貓熊。tree frog with suction cups（帶吸盤腳趾的樹蛙）。"},{"number":11,"stem":"In the fable of Little Red Riding Hood, the deceptive ______ disguises itself in grandmother's nightgown.","options":["koala","zebra","wolf","donkey"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: wolf (狼) 【全文中譯】在小紅帽的童話寓言中，狡詐奸巧的大野狼穿上了祖母的睡袍偽裝成老奶奶騙人。 【選項解析】(A) koala 無尾熊  (B) zebra 斑馬  (C) wolf 大野狼  (D) donkey 驢子。Little Red Riding Hood, deceptive wolf（小紅帽與大野狼）。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Farmers often complain when a wild ______ sneaks into the orchard at night and damages low-hanging fruit trees.","options":["kangaroo","hippopotamus","turkey","fox"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: fox (狐狸) 【全文中譯】當野狐狸半夜潛入果園並損壞低垂的果樹時，果農們往往忍不住抱怨連連。 【選項解析】(A) kangaroo 袋鼠  (B) hippopotamus 河馬  (C) turkey 火雞  (D) fox 狐狸。wild fox sneaks into orchard（野狐狸溜進果園）。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Because an adult ______ eats almost exclusively bamboo shoots and leaves, habitat preservation is vital for its survival.","options":["panda","wolf","donkey","frog"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: panda (大貓熊) 【全文中譯】因為成年大貓熊幾乎完全以竹筍與竹葉為食，因此保護其天然棲息地對其存續至關重要。 【選項解析】(A) panda 貓熊  (B) wolf 狼  (C) donkey 驢子  (D) frog 青蛙。eats exclusively bamboo（專吃竹子的大貓熊）。"},{"number":14,"stem":"A mother ______ resting in a tree fork will fiercely protect her offspring if an eagle circles too close overhead.","options":["zebra","koala","turkey","wolf"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: koala (無尾熊) 【全文中譯】在尤加利樹椏上休息的無尾熊媽媽，如果發現老鷹在上空盤旋得太近，會拼死保護幼崽。 【選項解析】(A) zebra 斑馬  (B) koala 無尾熊  (C) turkey 火雞  (D) wolf 狼。mother koala in tree fork（樹杈上的無尾熊媽媽）。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Sancho Panza rode a humble gray ______ beside Don Quixote's skinny horse during their chivalric adventures in Spain.","options":["kangaroo","fox","donkey","hippopotamus"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: donkey (驢子) 【全文中譯】桑丘·潘薩騎著一頭謙遜樸實的灰驢子，在西班牙的騎士冒險旅程中緊跟在唐吉訶德身後。 【選項解析】(A) kangaroo 袋鼠  (B) fox 狐狸  (C) donkey 驢子  (D) hippopotamus 河馬。Sancho Panza rode a donkey（桑丘騎著灰驢子）。"},{"number":16,"stem":"As the safari jeep drove across the Serengeti, passengers watched hundreds of ______ grazing peacefully alongside antelopes.","options":["turkeys","wolves","frogs","zebras"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: zebra (斑馬) 【全文中譯】當野生動物觀光吉普車行駛過塞倫蓋提大草原時，遊客們看見數百隻斑馬與羚羊和睦並肩吃草。 【選項解析】(A) turkeys 火雞  (B) wolves 狼  (C) frogs 青蛙  (D) zebras 斑馬。zebras grazing in Serengeti（塞倫蓋提草原上的斑馬群）。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Although the bulky ______ looks slow and docile, it can run surprisingly fast on land and is extremely dangerous.","options":["hippopotamus","koala","donkey","panda"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: hippopotamus (河馬) 【全文中譯】雖然笨重粗壯的河馬看起來既緩慢又溫順，但牠在陸地上奔跑速度驚人且極具攻擊危險性。 【選項解析】(A) hippopotamus 河馬  (B) koala 無尾熊  (C) donkey 驢子  (D) panda 貓熊。bulky hippopotamus runs fast on land（陸地上奔跑迅速的笨重河馬）。"},{"number":18,"stem":"In springtime, the male ______ croaks loudly from the reeds along the lake edge to attract a breeding mate.","options":["wolf","frog","turkey","zebra"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: frog (青蛙) 【全文中譯】春天時節，雄蛙在湖畔邊的蘆葦叢中大聲呱呱啼鳴，以吸引雌性個體前來交配繁殖。 【選項解析】(A) wolf 狼  (B) frog 青蛙  (C) turkey 火雞  (D) zebra 斑馬。male frog croaks in reeds（雄青蛙在蘆葦中啼鳴）。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Native American legends often portray the cunning ______ as a master trickster who uses clever wits to survive.","options":["koala","donkey","fox","hippopotamus"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: fox (狐狸) 【全文中譯】美洲原住民的傳說往往將狡黠的狐狸描繪為足智多謀的惡作劇大師，善用過人機智生存。 【選項解析】(A) koala 無尾熊  (B) donkey 驢子  (C) fox 狐狸  (D) hippopotamus 河馬。cunning fox as trickster（狡猾機靈的狐狸）。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The large wild ______ ruffled its colorful feathers and puffed out its chest in a proud courtship display.","options":["kangaroo","panda","zebra","turkey"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: turkey (火雞) 【全文中譯】這隻大型野生雄火雞抖動著牠色彩繽紛的羽毛，驕傲地挺起胸膛展現其求偶展示。 【選項解析】(A) kangaroo 袋鼠  (B) panda 貓熊  (C) zebra 斑馬  (D) turkey 火雞。wild turkey ruffled feathers（野生火雞抖動羽毛求偶）。"},{"number":21,"stem":"A powerful pack of arctic ______ will travel dozens of miles across barren icy terrain in pursuit of caribou herds.","options":["wolves","koalas","donkeys","pandas"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: wolf (狼；北極狼（複數）) 【全文中譯】一群強大的北極狼會在貧瘠荒蕪的冰原上跋涉數十英里，不知疲倦地追擊著馴鹿群。 【選項解析】(A) wolves 狼群  (B) koalas 無尾熊  (C) donkeys 驢子  (D) pandas 貓熊。pack of arctic wolves hunt caribou（北極狼群捕食馴鹿）。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Tourists visiting wildlife sanctuaries in Brisbane love having their photos taken while holding a placid little ______.","options":["wolf","koala","hippopotamus","zebra"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: koala (無尾熊) 【全文中譯】參訪布里斯本野生動物保護區的遊客，最喜歡在抱著溫馴安靜的小無尾熊時合影留念。 【選項解析】(A) wolf 狼  (B) koala 無尾熊  (C) hippopotamus 河馬  (D) zebra 斑馬。holding a placid koala（抱著溫順的無尾熊拍照）。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The old man placed a woven straw blanket over the back of his tired ______ to keep it warm in the cold stable.","options":["kangaroo","fox","donkey","panda"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: donkey (驢子) 【全文中譯】老先生將一條編織草毯蓋在他疲憊的驢子背上，讓牠在寒冷的馬廄中保持溫暖。 【選項解析】(A) kangaroo 袋鼠  (B) fox 狐狸  (C) donkey 驢子  (D) panda 貓熊。blanket on tired donkey（老驢子背上的草毯）。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The newborn ______ took its first wobbly steps on thin spindly legs while its mother licked its black and white coat.","options":["turkey","frog","wolf","zebra"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: zebra (斑馬) 【全文中譯】剛出生的初生小斑馬用細弱搖晃的腿邁出最初的步伐，而牠的母親在一旁舔拭著牠的黑白斑紋。 【選項解析】(A) turkey 火雞  (B) frog 青蛙  (C) wolf 狼  (D) zebra 斑馬。newborn zebra with black and white coat（初生小斑馬）。"},{"number":25,"stem":"During the intense midday heat, the entire family of ______ stayed completely submerged in the cool river shallows.","options":["hippopotamuses","foxes","turkeys","kangaroos"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: hippopotamus (河馬（複數）) 【全文中譯】在正午酷熱難耐的烈日高照下，整群河馬家庭完全浸泡在清涼的河水淺灘中消暑。 【選項解析】(A) hippopotamuses 河馬群  (B) foxes 狐狸  (C) turkeys 火雞  (D) kangaroos 袋鼠。family of hippopotamuses submerged（浸泡水中的河馬家族）。"}]},{"unit":37,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 37 (037.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Mammals, Birds of Prey & Avian Anatomy | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"lamb","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a young sheep; meat from a young sheep","chinese":"小羊；羊肉","sentence":"The gentle white ______ followed its mother across the green hillside, skipping playfully over small rocks.","translation":"溫順的白色小羊跟著母親穿過綠色的山坡，歡快地在小石頭上方跳躍。"},{"word":"deer (deer / deer)","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a graceful hoofed mammal with antlers on males","chinese":"鹿（單複數同形）","sentence":"A quiet wild ______ stepped cautiously out from the dense pine trees to drink fresh spring water from the stream.","translation":"一隻安靜的野生鹿謹慎地從茂密的松樹林中踏出步履，從溪流中飲用清澈的泉水。"},{"word":"ox (ox / oxen)","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a large domesticated bovine animal used for heavy farm work","chinese":"公牛；閹牛（複數為 oxen）","sentence":"The hardworking farmer used a strong ______ to pull the heavy iron plow through the muddy paddy field.","translation":"辛勤工作的農夫使用一頭強壯的公牛拉動沉重的鐵犁，翻耕泥濘的稻田。"},{"word":"rat","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a rodent resembling a large mouse with a long bare tail","chinese":"大老鼠","sentence":"The old warehouse was overrun by dirty ______, so the storage manager called a professional pest controller immediately.","translation":"老舊的倉庫裡擠滿了骯髒的大老鼠，所以倉儲經理立刻打電話給專業的除蟲專家處理。"},{"word":"bat","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a nocturnal flying mammal with leathery wings; wooden club for baseball","chinese":"蝙蝠；球棒","sentence":"During the warm summer evening, hundreds of hungry ______ flew out of the dark cave to hunt for flying mosquitoes.","translation":"在溫暖的夏夜裡，數百隻飢餓的蝙蝠從黑暗的洞穴中飛出，在空中捕食飛蚊。"},{"word":"parrot","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a brightly colored tropical bird with a curved beak that can imitate speech","chinese":"鸚鵡","sentence":"The clever green ______ learned how to repeat several funny English phrases whenever visitors walked into the pet shop.","translation":"這隻聰明的綠色鸚鵡學會了每當訪客走進寵物店時，便開口重複說出好幾句有趣的英語短句。"},{"word":"eagle","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a large bird of prey with massive hooked beak, keen eyesight, and broad wings","chinese":"老鷹；雕","sentence":"A majestic golden ______ soared high above the jagged mountain peaks, scanning the rocky ground below for small rabbits.","translation":"一隻雄偉的金雕在高聳崎嶇的山峰上方翱翔，俯瞰下方的岩石地面搜尋野兔的蹤影。"},{"word":"pigeon","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a stout seed-eating bird with a small head, short legs, and cooing call","chinese":"鴿子","sentence":"Crowds of gentle gray ______ gathered on the sunny city square, pecking eagerly at bread crumbs tossed by tourists.","translation":"成群溫和的灰鴿子聚集在陽光明媚的城市廣場上，熱切地啄食著遊客拋撒下來的麵包屑。"},{"word":"swallow","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a small migratory bird with forked tail; to cause food to pass down throat","chinese":"燕子；吞嚥","sentence":"Before the cold winter arrives, the agile ______ builds its mud nest under the roof tiles of our old house.","translation":"在寒冷的冬天到來之前，敏捷的燕子會在我們老房子屋瓦下用泥土築巢。"},{"word":"wing","pos":"(n.)","definition":"one of the movable feathered or leathery limbs used for flying","chinese":"翅膀；機翼","sentence":"The injured wild seagull could not fly back to its coastal nest because its left ______ had been hurt by fishing line.","translation":"那隻受傷的野生海鷗無法飛回海岸上的巢穴，因為牠的左翅膀被釣魚線割傷了。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The tender roasted ______ chops were seasoned with fresh rosemary and garlic, delighting every guest at dinner.","options":["lamb","bat","rat","ox"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: lamb (小羊；羊肉) 【全文中譯】鮮嫩的烤羊排用新鮮迷迭香與大蒜調味，讓晚餐席間的每一位賓客都大快朵頤。 【選項解析】(A) lamb 羊肉/小羊  (B) bat 蝙蝠  (C) rat 大老鼠  (D) ox 公牛。roasted lamb chops（烤羊排）。"},{"number":2,"stem":"A slender spotted ______ stood motionless among the tall forest ferns, listening carefully for any approaching predator.","options":["parrot","deer","pigeon","swallow"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: deer (鹿) 【全文中譯】一隻體態修長的斑點梅花鹿一動也不動地佇立在茂密的森林蕨類之間，仔細聆聽是否有任何掠食者接近。 【選項解析】(A) parrot 鸚鵡  (B) deer 鹿  (C) pigeon 鴿子  (D) swallow 燕子。spotted deer stood motionless（斑點鹿佇立）。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The ancient bronze sculpture depicted a muscular farm ______ pulling a loaded grain wagon through a rustic village.","options":["rat","eagle","ox","bat"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: ox (公牛；耕牛) 【全文中譯】這座古老的青銅雕塑生動描繪了一頭肌肉發達的農家耕牛，拉著滿載穀物的貨車穿過古樸的村落。 【選項解析】(A) rat 大老鼠  (B) eagle 老鷹  (C) ox 公牛/耕牛  (D) bat 蝙蝠。muscular farm ox pulling wagon（拉貨車的耕牛）。"},{"number":4,"stem":"The warehouse cat caught an unwelcome brown ______ that had been chewing on cardboard storage boxes in the dark.","options":["deer","lamb","swallow","rat"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: rat (大老鼠) 【全文中譯】倉庫裡養的貓抓到了一隻令人討厭的褐色大老鼠，牠一直在黑暗中啃咬紙箱包裝。 【選項解析】(A) deer 鹿  (B) lamb 小羊  (C) swallow 燕子  (D) rat 大老鼠。chewing on storage boxes 可知為老鼠 rat。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Using sophisticated echolocation, the cave-dwelling ______ flies effortlessly through pitch darkness without colliding with walls.","options":["bat","pigeon","lamb","ox"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: bat (蝙蝠) 【全文中譯】利用先進精密的超音波回聲定位，棲息在洞穴裡的蝙蝠在漆黑中毫不費力地飛行，完全不會撞擊牆壁。 【選項解析】(A) bat 蝙蝠  (B) pigeon 鴿子  (C) lamb 小羊  (D) ox 公牛。echolocation, cave-dwelling bat（回聲定位的洞穴蝙蝠）。"},{"number":6,"stem":"The colorful scarlet ______ perched on the sailor's shoulder and whistled a cheerful nautical tune in the harbor.","options":["rat","parrot","ox","deer"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: parrot (鸚鵡) 【全文中譯】五彩斑斕的緋紅金剛鸚鵡棲息在水手的肩膀上，在港口歡快地吹著航海水手的口哨調子。 【選項解析】(A) rat 大老鼠  (B) parrot 鸚鵡  (C) ox 公牛  (D) deer 鹿。scarlet parrot perched on shoulder（停在肩膀上的鸚鵡）。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The mighty bald ______ dove at lightning speed from the cliff top and snatched a silvery fish from the lake with its talons.","options":["pigeon","swallow","eagle","lamb"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: eagle (老鷹；白頭海鵰) 【全文中譯】威風凜凜的白頭海鵰以閃電般的速度自懸崖頂端俯衝而下，用銳利的利爪從湖水中抓起一條銀光閃閃的魚。 【選項解析】(A) pigeon 鴿子  (B) swallow 燕子  (C) eagle 老鷹/雕  (D) lamb 小羊。bald eagle snatched fish with talons（海鵰用利爪抓魚）。"},{"number":8,"stem":"In many European historic town squares, hundreds of city ______ flutter down from stone monuments to be fed by tourists.","options":["oxen","bats","rats","pigeons"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: pigeon (鴿子) 【全文中譯】在許多歐洲歷史名城的城鎮廣場上，數以百計的城市鴿子從石雕古蹟上翩翩飛下，接受遊客的餵食。 【選項解析】(A) oxen 公牛  (B) bats 蝙蝠  (C) rats 老鼠  (D) pigeons 鴿子。city pigeons in town squares（廣場鴿子）。"},{"number":9,"stem":"In early spring, a pair of graceful ______ returned to their old nesting site under the eaves of our wooden porch.","options":["swallows","oxen","deer","rats"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: swallow (燕子) 【全文中譯】初春時節，一對優雅的燕子重返我們木門廊屋簷下的舊巢築穴，迎接溫暖季節的到來。 【選項解析】(A) swallows 燕子  (B) oxen 公牛  (C) deer 鹿  (D) rats 老鼠。swallows nesting under eaves（屋簷下築巢的燕子）。"},{"number":10,"stem":"The young albatross spread its immense six-foot ______ into the strong ocean gust and took flight toward the horizon.","options":["deer","wing","ox","lamb"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: wing (翅膀；機翼) 【全文中譯】年輕的信天翁將牠那長達六英尺的巨大雙翼迎著強烈海風舒展開來，向著無垠的地平線振翅高飛。 【選項解析】(A) deer 鹿  (B) wing 翅膀  (C) ox 公牛  (D) lamb 小羊。spread six-foot wing（展開六英尺長的翅膀）。"},{"number":11,"stem":"When the young boy felt a severe sore throat, it was extremely painful for him to ______ any solid food or drink.","options":["fly","bark","swallow","hunt"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: swallow (吞嚥) 【全文中譯】當小男孩感到喉嚨劇烈疼痛時，吞嚥任何固體食物或飲料對他而言都是極為痛苦的折磨。 【選項解析】(A) fly 飛翔  (B) bark 吠叫  (C) swallow 吞嚥  (D) hunt 狩獵。painful to swallow food（吞嚥食物很痛）。"},{"number":12,"stem":"A mother ewe called out gently to her newborn ______, guiding it toward a sheltered patch of clover in the meadow.","options":["ox","rat","bat","lamb"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: lamb (小羊) 【全文中譯】母羊對著剛出生的小羊溫柔地呼喚，引導牠走向草地上背風的一小片三葉草叢。 【選項解析】(A) ox 公牛  (B) rat 大老鼠  (C) bat 蝙蝠  (D) lamb 小羊。ewe to newborn lamb（母羊對新生小羊）。"},{"number":13,"stem":"While driving along the rural mountain highway at dusk, we had to brake suddenly because a large ______ crossed the road.","options":["deer","pigeon","parrot","swallow"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: deer (鹿) 【全文中譯】傍晚行駛在鄉間山區公路上時，我們不得不緊急煞車，因為一頭巨大的野鹿正漫步橫越馬路。 【選項解析】(A) deer 鹿  (B) pigeon 鴿子  (C) parrot 鸚鵡  (D) swallow 燕子。deer crossed the road（鹿穿越馬路）。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Historically, traditional rice farmers in East Asia relied heavily on the water ______ for tilling flooded paddy soil.","options":["bat","ox","rat","eagle"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: ox (水牛；耕牛) 【全文中譯】在歷史上，東亞地區傳統的稻農在翻耕淹水的稻田泥土時，高度依賴水牛提供的強大勞力。 【選項解析】(A) bat 蝙蝠  (B) ox 水牛/耕牛  (C) rat 大老鼠  (D) eagle 老鷹。water ox for tilling paddy（水田耕牛）。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The health inspection team shut down the basement restaurant after discovering signs of food contamination caused by sewer ______.","options":["deer","pigeons","rats","swallows"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: rat (大老鼠（複數）) 【全文中譯】在發現地下道溝渠大老鼠所引發的食物污染跡象之後，衛生稽查團隊勒令這家地下室餐廳立刻停業。 【選項解析】(A) deer 鹿  (B) pigeons 鴿子  (C) rats 老鼠  (D) swallows 燕子。contamination by sewer rats（溝渠老鼠引發污染）。"},{"number":16,"stem":"During the nocturnal tour of the rainforest, the guide used an infrared lamp to point out a giant fruit ______ hanging upside down.","options":["lamb","ox","deer","bat"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: bat (蝙蝠) 【全文中譯】在熱帶雨林的夜間生態導覽中，嚮導使用紅外線燈指向一隻正倒掛在樹枝上的巨大食果蝙蝠。 【選項解析】(A) lamb 小羊  (B) ox 公牛  (C) deer 鹿  (D) bat 蝙蝠。fruit bat hanging upside down（倒掛的果蝠）。"},{"number":17,"stem":"That intelligent African gray ______ has an astounding vocabulary and can mimic telephone ringtones with perfect accuracy.","options":["parrot","rat","lamb","ox"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: parrot (鸚鵡) 【全文中譯】那隻聰明無比的非洲灰鸚鵡擁有令人驚嘆的詞彙量，且能夠以百分之百的準確度模仿電話鈴聲。 【選項解析】(A) parrot 鸚鵡  (B) rat 大老鼠  (C) lamb 小羊  (D) ox 公牛。African gray parrot mimics ringtones（模仿鈴聲的非洲灰鸚鵡）。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The fierce golden ______ perched high atop the telephone pole, keeping its watchful eyes fixed on the open field below.","options":["swallow","eagle","deer","rat"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: eagle (老鷹；鵰) 【全文中譯】這隻兇猛強悍的金雕高高棲息在電線桿頂端，警覺銳利的雙眼緊緊鎖定著下方開闊的田野動靜。 【選項解析】(A) swallow 燕子  (B) eagle 老鷹  (C) deer 鹿  (D) rat 大老鼠。fierce golden eagle perched high（高高棲息的金雕）。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Homing ______ were famously used during wartime to carry vital handwritten messages across enemy battle lines.","options":["oxen","lambs","pigeons","bats"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: pigeon (鴿子；信鴿（複數）) 【全文中譯】信鴿在戰時曾以穿越敵軍交火前線、傳遞關鍵手寫軍事情報機密而名垂青史。 【選項解析】(A) oxen 公牛  (B) lambs 小羊  (C) pigeons 信鴿/鴿子  (D) bats 蝙蝠。homing pigeons carried messages（軍用傳信鴿）。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The aeroplane made an emergency landing at the airport after an engine under the right ______ malfunctioned shortly after takeoff.","options":["rat","deer","ox","wing"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: wing (機翼；翅膀) 【全文中譯】在起飛後不久因右側機翼下方的一具引擎發生故障，這架客機在機場實施了緊急迫降。 【選項解析】(A) rat 老鼠  (B) deer 鹿  (C) ox 公牛  (D) wing 機翼。engine under right wing（右機翼下的發動機）。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The fluffy little white ______ bounded across the grassy pasture, eager to drink warm milk from its mother.","options":["lamb","bat","eagle","rat"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: lamb (小羊) 【全文中譯】毛茸茸的小白羊在青翠的牧場上歡快奔馳跳躍，渴望能喝上一口媽媽溫暖甜美的奶水。 【選項解析】(A) lamb 小羊  (B) bat 蝙蝠  (C) eagle 老鷹  (D) rat 老鼠。fluffy little white lamb（毛茸茸白色小羊）。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Hunting regulations strictly protect female ______ and young fawns during the autumn breeding season in national parks.","options":["oxen","deer","rats","pigeons"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: deer (鹿) 【全文中譯】狩獵法規在國家公園的秋季繁殖期間，嚴格保護雌鹿與年幼的小鹿免於遭受獵殺獵捕。 【選項解析】(A) oxen 公牛  (B) deer 鹿  (C) rats 老鼠  (D) pigeons 鴿子。female deer and young fawns（母鹿與幼鹿）。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The ancient proverb says that a stubborn person can sometimes be as immovable and headstrong as an angry ______.","options":["parrot","swallow","ox","bat"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: ox (公牛) 【全文中譯】古老諺語說，一個脾氣倔強執拗的人有時候會像一頭憤怒的公牛一樣固執而難以動搖說服。 【選項解析】(A) parrot 鸚鵡  (B) swallow 燕子  (C) ox 公牛  (D) bat 蝙蝠。as stubborn as an ox（像牛一樣固執頑劣）。"},{"number":24,"stem":"In the attic storage room, we found that a destructive ______ had gnawed through several important old paper documents.","options":["deer","lamb","pigeon","rat"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: rat (大老鼠) 【全文中譯】在閣樓的儲藏室裡，我們發現一隻破壞力極強的大老鼠已經咬破了好幾份重要的珍貴舊文件。 【選項解析】(A) deer 鹿  (B) lamb 小羊  (C) pigeon 鴿子  (D) rat 大老鼠。destructive rat gnawed paper（老鼠啃咬紙張）。"},{"number":25,"stem":"A graceful pair of migratory ______ dipped low over the water surface to catch flying insects during the warm afternoon.","options":["swallows","oxen","bats","rats"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: swallow (燕子（複數）) 【全文中譯】一對優雅的候鳥燕子在溫暖的午後低空掠過水面，在半空中輕巧敏捷地捕捉飛蟲食用。 【選項解析】(A) swallows 燕子  (B) oxen 公牛  (C) bats 蝙蝠  (D) rats 老鼠。migratory swallows dipped over water（水面低飛捕蟲的候鳥燕子）。"}]},{"unit":38,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 38 (038.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Animal Anatomy, Ancient Beasts, Cages & Emotional States | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"tail","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the flexible rear part extending from an animal's body","chinese":"尾巴","sentence":"The joyful puppy wagged its fluffy ______ enthusiastically as soon as its owner walked through the front door.","translation":"當主人一踏進前門時，那隻快樂的小狗便興奮熱情地搖動著牠毛茸茸的尾巴。"},{"word":"dragon","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a mythical giant reptile often depicted with wings, claws, and breathing fire","chinese":"龍","sentence":"In ancient Chinese culture, the magnificent golden ______ is a sacred symbol of royal power, prosperity, and good luck.","translation":"在古代中國文化當中，雄偉的金龍是象徵皇家權力、繁榮昌盛與吉祥好運的神聖代表。"},{"word":"dinosaur","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an extinct prehistoric reptile that lived millions of years ago","chinese":"恐龍","sentence":"Children at the natural science museum were fascinated by the towering skeleton of a prehistoric carnivorous ______.","translation":"自然科學博物館裡的孩子們，被一具高聳巨大的史前肉食性恐龍骨架深深吸引著。"},{"word":"cage","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a structure made of bars or wire in which animals or birds are kept","chinese":"籠子；鳥籠","sentence":"Animal welfare advocates argue that wild exotic birds should never be kept confined inside a cramped metal ______.","translation":"動物福祉倡導者主張，野生珍禽異鳥絕不應該被終身囚禁在狹窄冰冷的金屬籠子裡。"},{"word":"nest","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a structure built by birds or insects to lay eggs and shelter their young","chinese":"鳥巢；窩","sentence":"High in the oak tree branches, two mother robins carefully constructed a cozy mud and twig ______ for their chicks.","translation":"在高高的橡樹枝上，兩隻知更鳥媽媽用泥土和細枝細心築起了一個舒適的鳥巢給牠們的雛鳥。"},{"word":"emotion","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a strong feeling such as joy, sorrow, love, or anger","chinese":"情緒；感情","sentence":"When the Olympic champion stood on the medal podium, she was overwhelmed with strong ______ and wept tears of joy.","translation":"當這位奧運冠軍站在獎牌頒獎台上時，她內心湧現出強烈澎湃的情緒，流下了喜悅的淚水。"},{"word":"sense","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a physical faculty such as sight; a feeling; to perceive","chinese":"感覺；感官；理解力","sentence":"Dogs have an extraordinarily sharp ______ of smell that allows police officers to track missing people through forests.","translation":"狗狗擁有極為靈敏銳利的嗅覺感官，讓警員能夠循線在森林深處追蹤失蹤人員。"},{"word":"feeling","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an emotional state, physical sensation, or belief","chinese":"感覺；感受","sentence":"I had an uncomfortable gut ______ that something was wrong with our itinerary, so I rechecked all plane tickets.","translation":"我心中升起一種隱隱不安的直覺感受，覺得我們的行程安排出了差錯，因此重新核對了所有機票。"},{"word":"asleep","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"in a state of sleep; not awake","chinese":"睡著的","sentence":"Exhausted after studying all night for the biology exam, Jason fell fast ______ at his desk with his textbook open.","translation":"為了生物考試徹夜苦讀而筋疲力盡的傑森，攤開著教科書在書桌上沉沉睡著了。"},{"word":"mad","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"very angry; insane; wildly enthusiastic","chinese":"生氣的；瘋狂的","sentence":"Father was extremely ______ when he discovered that my brother had broken the garage window with a baseball.","translation":"當父親發現弟弟用棒球打破了車庫窗戶時，他感到極度生氣而暴跳如雷。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"When the veterinarian entered the examination room, the nervous cat puffed up its fur and twitched its long ______.","options":["tail","cage","nest","dragon"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: tail (尾巴) 【全文中譯】當獸醫走進診間時，那隻緊張的貓咪豎起了全身的毛，不安地頻頻抽動著長長的尾巴。 【選項解析】(A) tail 尾巴  (B) cage 籠子  (C) nest 巢穴  (D) dragon 龍。twitched long tail（抽動長尾巴）。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Traditional dragon boat racers paddle vigorously under the stern gaze of an ornately carved wooden ______ head.","options":["nest","dragon","dinosaur","cage"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: dragon (龍) 【全文中譯】傳統的龍舟划手們在雕工繁複精美的木雕龍頭威嚴注視下，奮力齊心划槳向前奔馳。 【選項解析】(A) nest 巢  (B) dragon 龍  (C) dinosaur 恐龍  (D) cage 籠子。dragon boat, wooden dragon head（龍舟與雕花龍頭）。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Paleontologists in Argentina excavated the massive fossilized leg bone of a colossal plant-eating ______.","options":["cage","tail","dinosaur","nest"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: dinosaur (恐龍) 【全文中譯】阿根廷的古生物學家挖掘出了一具龐大史前植食性巨型恐龍的石化巨大腿骨化石。 【選項解析】(A) cage 籠子  (B) tail 尾巴  (C) dinosaur 恐龍  (D) nest 巢穴。fossilized bone of prehistoric dinosaur（史前恐龍化石骨）。"},{"number":4,"stem":"The zoo keepers gently placed the injured eagle into a padded transport ______ before driving to the animal hospital.","options":["emotion","tail","nest","cage"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: cage (籠子；運輸籠) 【全文中譯】在開車前往動物醫院之前，動物園管理員小心翼翼地將受傷的老鷹安置於鋪有軟墊的運輸籠中。 【選項解析】(A) emotion 情緒  (B) tail 尾巴  (C) nest 鳥巢  (D) cage 運輸籠/籠子。padded transport cage（鋪墊的運輸籠）。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The mother sparrow flew back and forth dozens of times with dry moss to line her newly built ______.","options":["nest","dinosaur","dragon","cage"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: nest (鳥巢；窩) 【全文中譯】麻雀媽媽叼著乾燥的苔蘚來回飛了數十趟，為她剛搭建好的舒適鳥巢鋪上柔軟的內襯墊料。 【選項解析】(A) nest 鳥巢  (B) dinosaur 恐龍  (C) dragon 龍  (D) cage 籠子。line newly built nest（給新築的鳥巢鋪墊襯物）。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Great actors possess the remarkable ability to convey profound human ______ without speaking a single spoken word.","options":["cage","emotion","tail","dinosaur"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: emotion (情感；情緒) 【全文中譯】傑出的偉大演員具備非凡卓越的感染力，即使不發一語也能傳神地傳達出人類深刻細膩的情感。 【選項解析】(A) cage 籠子  (B) emotion 情感  (C) tail 尾巴  (D) dinosaur 恐龍。convey profound human emotion（傳達人類深刻情感）。"},{"number":7,"stem":"Good leaders must have a strong ______ of responsibility, always putting the welfare of their team members first.","options":["tail","nest","sense","cage"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: sense (感覺；意識) 【全文中譯】優秀的領導者必須具備強烈的責任感，始終把團隊成員的福祉與權益放在第一優先位置。 【選項解析】(A) tail 尾巴  (B) nest 窩  (C) sense 意識/感覺  (D) cage 籠子。sense of responsibility（責任感）。"},{"number":8,"stem":"After being betrayed by someone he trusted completely, Samuel was left with a lingering ______ of bitter disappointment.","options":["dragon","dinosaur","cage","feeling"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: feeling (感覺；感受) 【全文中譯】在遭到完全信任的人無情背叛之後，塞繆爾心中久久揮之不去一股苦澀失落的心痛感受。 【選項解析】(A) dragon 龍  (B) dinosaur 恐龍  (C) cage 籠子  (D) feeling 感受。lingering feeling of disappointment（久久不散的失落感）。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The bedtime lullaby was so gentle that the crying baby stopped fussing and was sound ______ within minutes.","options":["asleep","mad","excellent","local"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: asleep (睡著的) 【全文中譯】這首睡前搖籃曲如此溫柔安詳，啼哭的嬰兒停止了吵鬧，在幾分鐘內便安然熟睡了過去。 【選項解析】(A) asleep 熟睡的  (B) mad 生氣的  (C) excellent 優秀的  (D) local 當地的。sound asleep（安然熟睡）。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Mother got furious and terribly ______ when my younger sister spilled red grape juice all over the new white sofa.","options":["asleep","mad","noisy","overseas"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: mad (生氣的；發怒的) 【全文中譯】當我妹妹把紅葡萄汁灑得新白色沙發上到處都是時，媽媽極度生氣且火冒三丈。 【選項解析】(A) asleep 睡著的  (B) mad 抓狂發怒的  (C) noisy 吵鬧的  (D) overseas 海外的。furious and terribly mad（極度憤怒抓狂）。"},{"number":11,"stem":"A peacock fan display occurs when the male bird raises and spreads its iridescent ______ feathers in courtship.","options":["nest","cage","tail","emotion"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: tail (尾巴；尾羽) 【全文中譯】孔雀開屏求偶時，雄鳥會在求偶儀式中豎起並展開牠那泛著彩虹光澤的絢麗長尾羽。 【選項解析】(A) nest 巢  (B) cage 籠  (C) tail 尾羽/尾巴  (D) emotion 情緒。spreads tail feathers（展開尾羽）。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Welsh mythology proudly features a red ______ emblazoned across their historic national green and white flag.","options":["dinosaur","cage","nest","dragon"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: dragon (龍) 【全文中譯】威爾斯的民族神話驕傲地將一條栩栩如生的紅龍徽章，銘刻在他們歷史悠久的綠白國旗中央。 【選項解析】(A) dinosaur 恐龍  (B) cage 籠子  (C) nest 鳥巢  (D) dragon 龍。Welsh red dragon on flag（威爾斯國旗上的紅龍）。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The Tyrannosaurus Rex is undoubtedly the most famous prehistoric carnivorous ______ featured in Hollywood cinema.","options":["dinosaur","cage","tail","nest"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: dinosaur (恐龍) 【全文中譯】雷克斯暴龍無疑是好萊塢電影銀幕上所描繪過最家喻戶曉的史前肉食性巨獸恐龍。 【選項解析】(A) dinosaur 恐龍  (B) cage 籠子  (C) tail 尾巴  (D) nest 鳥巢。prehistoric carnivorous dinosaur（史前肉食恐龍）。"},{"number":14,"stem":"It broke the little girl's heart to see the singing canary locked behind the iron bars of an ornamental ______.","options":["tail","cage","nest","dinosaur"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: cage (籠子；鳥籠) 【全文中譯】看著唱歌的金絲雀被鎖在裝飾性金屬鳥籠冰冷的鐵欄杆之後，小女孩感到無比心碎難過。 【選項解析】(A) tail 尾巴  (B) cage 鳥籠/籠子  (C) nest 窩  (D) dinosaur 恐龍。canary locked behind bars of cage（關在籠中的金絲雀）。"},{"number":15,"stem":"High up in the cliff crags, the golden eagle built a sturdy twig ______ that has weathered storms for decades.","options":["dragon","cage","nest","emotion"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: nest (鳥巢；巨巢) 【全文中譯】在高高的懸崖峭壁石縫間，金雕築造了一個堅固耐用的細枝巨巢，歷經數十年的風暴仍完好。 【選項解析】(A) dragon 龍  (B) cage 籠  (C) nest 鳥巢  (D) emotion 情緒。sturdy twig nest on cliff（懸崖上的樹枝巨巢）。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Compassion and empathy are positive human ______ that unite people across different cultural backgrounds.","options":["cages","tails","nests","emotions"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: emotion (情感；情緒（複數）) 【全文中譯】同情心與同理心是人類積極正向的寶貴情感，能夠跨越不同的文化背景將人們緊緊凝聚在一起。 【選項解析】(A) cages 籠子  (B) tails 尾巴  (C) nests 窩巢  (D) emotions 情感。positive human emotions（正向的人類情感）。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Spiders do not have ears, but they have an acute ______ of vibration that warns them of approaching danger on their webs.","options":["sense","tail","cage","nest"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: sense (感官；感覺) 【全文中譯】蜘蛛沒有耳朵，但牠們擁有敏銳無比的震動感官，能夠警告牠們蛛網上有潛在危險逼近。 【選項解析】(A) sense 感官/感覺  (B) tail 尾巴  (C) cage 籠子  (D) nest 巢。acute sense of vibration（敏銳的震動感官）。"},{"number":18,"stem":"A sudden ______ of dizziness overcame the traveler due to dehydration after hiking under the blistering midday sun.","options":["cage","feeling","dinosaur","dragon"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: feeling (感覺；眩暈感) 【全文中譯】在烈日當空的日正當中健行導致脫水後，旅人心中突然襲來一陣強烈劇烈的眩暈感。 【選項解析】(A) cage 籠子  (B) feeling 感覺/感覺症狀  (C) dinosaur 恐龍  (D) dragon 龍。sudden feeling of dizziness（突然一陣眩暈感）。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Because the house was completely dark and quiet at 2 a.m., everyone in the family was already sound ______.","options":["mad","noisy","asleep","local"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: asleep (睡著的) 【全文中譯】因為凌晨兩點整棟房子完全漆黑一片且鴉雀無聲，全家人都早已進入了香甜的夢鄉之中。 【選項解析】(A) mad 生氣的  (B) noisy 吵鬧的  (C) asleep 睡著的  (D) local 本地的。sound asleep at 2 a.m.（凌晨兩點沉睡中）。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The boss was so wildly ______ about the leaked quarterly sales figures that he called an emergency board meeting immediately.","options":["asleep","excellent","overseas","mad"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: mad (抓狂的；憤怒的) 【全文中譯】老闆對於外洩的季度銷售數據機密感到極其抓狂震怒，當場立刻召集了緊急董事會議。 【選項解析】(A) asleep 睡著的  (B) excellent 出色的  (C) overseas 海外的  (D) mad 抓狂發火的。wildly mad about leak（對洩密極度抓狂發火）。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The horse swished its bushy ______ back and forth rhythmically to drive away persistent horseflies on the farm.","options":["tail","nest","cage","dragon"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: tail (尾巴) 【全文中譯】馬兒在農場裡有節奏地來回甩動著牠蓬鬆的尾巴，以驅趕那些揮之不去、惹人討厭的牛虻飛蟲。 【選項解析】(A) tail 尾巴  (B) nest 窩  (C) cage 籠  (D) dragon 龍。swished bushy tail to drive away flies（甩動尾巴驅趕蒼蠅）。"},{"number":22,"stem":"In popular Western fantasy novels, the fire-breathing ______ fiercely hoards mounds of gold inside its mountain cavern.","options":["nest","dragon","tail","cage"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: dragon (巨龍) 【全文中譯】在西方著名的奇幻小說中，那隻會口吐烈火的惡龍在牠的深山洞穴裡貪婪地囤積堆積如山的黃金。 【選項解析】(A) nest 巢  (B) dragon 巨龍  (C) tail 尾巴  (D) cage 籠子。fire-breathing dragon hoards gold（吐火巨龍看守囤積黃金）。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Scientists discover fossilized footprints that reveal fascinating clues about how large herds of ______ traveled together.","options":["cages","tails","dinosaurs","nests"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: dinosaur (恐龍（複數）) 【全文中譯】科學家發現了石化恐龍足跡，為研究龐大的恐龍群體如何結伴長途跋涉提供了引人入勝的線索。 【選項解析】(A) cages 籠子  (B) tails 尾巴  (C) dinosaurs 恐龍群  (D) nests 巢穴。herds of dinosaurs traveled（成群恐龍集體遷徙遷行）。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The pet hamster spent hours running on its plastic exercise wheel inside its transparent acrylic ______.","options":["tail","nest","dragon","cage"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: cage (籠子；寵物箱) 【全文中譯】寵物倉鼠在牠那透明壓克力打造的寵物箱籠子裡，花了好幾個小時在塑膠滾輪上賣力奔跑。 【選項解析】(A) tail 尾巴  (B) nest 窩  (C) dragon 龍  (D) cage 籠子/寵物籠。transparent acrylic cage（透明壓克力寵物籠）。"},{"number":25,"stem":"A mother duck carefully gathered dry grass and soft down feathers to make a warm insulated ______ near the pond.","options":["nest","dragon","cage","dinosaur"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: nest (鳥巢；窩) 【全文中譯】野鴨媽媽在池塘邊細心收集了乾燥的青草與柔軟的絨羽，築造出一個溫暖保暖的鴨窩孵卵。 【選項解析】(A) nest 鳥窩/巢  (B) dragon 龍  (C) cage 籠子  (D) dinosaur 恐龍。insulated nest near the pond（池塘邊保暖的鳥巢）。"}]},{"unit":39,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 39 (039.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Fear, Psychological Sensations & States of Mind | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"frightened","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"afraid or anxious, often suddenly","chinese":"受驚嚇的；害怕的","sentence":"The ______ little boy hid behind his mother's winter coat when the neighbor's huge guard dog barked loudly.","translation":"當鄰居巨大的看門狗大聲吠叫時，受驚嚇的小男孩躲在母親的冬衣外套後面。"},{"word":"fear","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"an unpleasant emotion caused by the threat of danger; to be afraid of","chinese":"恐懼；害怕","sentence":"Many young children have an intense ______ of darkness, so their parents often leave a small lamp on in the bedroom.","translation":"許多幼童對黑暗有著強烈的恐懼，所以他們的父母常在臥室裡留一盞小夜燈。"},{"word":"scared","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"fearful or frightened","chinese":"害怕的；提心吊膽的","sentence":"Emma felt very ______ when the elevator stopped suddenly between floors, but she remembered to press the emergency bell.","translation":"當電梯在樓層之間突然停止時，艾瑪感到非常害怕，但她記得按下緊急通報鈕。"},{"word":"terrible","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"extremely bad, serious, or unpleasant","chinese":"可怕的；糟糕的","sentence":"A ______ traffic accident blocked all three lanes on the highway this morning, causing hours of frustrating delay.","translation":"今天早上高速公路上發生了一起嚴重的可怕車禍，阻塞了全部三個車道，造成數小時的延誤。"},{"word":"horrible","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"causing horror; dreadful or very shocking","chinese":"令人恐懼的；極糟的","sentence":"The smell coming from the abandoned trash container was truly ______, so everyone held their noses while walking past.","translation":"廢棄垃圾子車散發出來的氣味實在太令人作嘔可怕了，以至於每個人走過時都捏住了鼻子。"},{"word":"calm","pos":"(adj.) / (v.)","definition":"not showing or feeling anger, fear, or other strong emotions","chinese":"平靜的；鎮靜的","sentence":"The experienced flight captain remained completely ______ during the turbulent storm, reassuring all nervous passengers.","translation":"經驗豐富的機長在顛簸的暴風雨中保持著完全的冷靜鎮定，安撫了所有緊張的乘客。"},{"word":"nervous","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"easily agitated or alarmed; anxious about something","chinese":"緊張不安的","sentence":"Kevin always feels extremely ______ right before giving an oral presentation in front of the whole class.","translation":"凱文在全班同學面前進行口頭報告之前，總是感到極度緊張不安。"},{"word":"pleased","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"feeling or showing pleasure and satisfaction","chinese":"感到欣慰滿意的","sentence":"Grandmother was very ______ when all her children and grandchildren returned home to celebrate her eightieth birthday.","translation":"當所有兒孫都返回老家為她慶祝八十大壽時，祖母感到非常欣慰而滿心歡喜。"},{"word":"pleasant","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"giving a sense of happy satisfaction or enjoyment","chinese":"令人愉快的；宜人的","sentence":"We spent a very ______ afternoon walking through the botanical park, enjoying the fragrant blooming flowers.","translation":"我們在植物公園裡散步，度過了一個非常令人愉快的午後，盡情欣賞芳香盛開的繁花。"},{"word":"pleasure","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a feeling of happy satisfaction and enjoyment","chinese":"樂趣；榮幸","sentence":"It was an absolute ______ to meet your parents at the school concert, and we hope to chat again soon.","translation":"在學校音樂會上見到您的雙親真是莫大的榮幸與樂事，我們希望很快能再次暢談。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The loud boom of thunder sounded right above the roof, leaving the toddler utterly ______ and crying for his blanket.","options":["frightened","calm","pleased","pleasant"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: frightened (受驚嚇的；害怕的) 【全文中譯】屋頂正上方突然響起一聲巨大的雷鳴巨響，把剛會走路的小幼童嚇得魂飛魄散，哭著要他的小毛毯。 【選項解析】(A) frightened 嚇壞的  (B) calm 鎮定的  (C) pleased 滿意的  (D) pleasant 愉快的。loud boom of thunder, toddler utterly frightened（雷聲把幼兒嚇壞了）。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Firefighters must learn to master and control their natural ______ so they can enter burning structures safely.","options":["pleasure","fear","feeling","sense"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: fear (恐懼；害怕) 【全文中譯】消防隊員必須學習掌握與克制自己本能的恐懼情緒，如此才能安全踏入烈火燃燒的火場建築內。 【選項解析】(A) pleasure 樂趣  (B) fear 恐懼  (C) feeling 感覺  (D) sense 感官。master natural fear（克服恐懼）。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The young girl was too ______ of the deep ocean waves to leave the sandy towel area without her parents.","options":["calm","pleased","scared","pleasant"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: scared (害怕的；不敢的) 【全文中譯】這個小女孩太過害怕遠海波濤洶湧的深浪，以致於沒有父母陪同根本不敢離開沙灘浴巾區域半步。 【選項解析】(A) calm 平靜的  (B) pleased 欣慰的  (C) scared 害怕的  (D) pleasant 宜人的。too scared to leave（太害怕不敢離開）。"},{"number":4,"stem":"A sudden ______ snowstorm paralyzed the entire mountain pass, forcing dozens of stranded drivers to abandon their cars.","options":["calm","pleased","pleasant","terrible"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: terrible (可怕的；嚴重的) 【全文中譯】一場突如其來的可怕暴風雪癱瘓了整座山口公路，迫使數十名受困司機不得不棄車逃生避難。 【選項解析】(A) calm 平靜的  (B) pleased 欣慰的  (C) pleasant 愉快的  (D) terrible 可怕的/嚴重的。terrible snowstorm（可怕嚴重的暴風雪）。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The dark cellar was infested with mold and rats, making it an utterly ______ place to stay even for ten minutes.","options":["horrible","calm","pleased","pleasant"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: horrible (可怕糟糕的；令人作嘔的) 【全文中譯】這個陰暗的地下室長滿了霉菌且老鼠橫行，使它成為一個即使只待上十分鐘也令人難以忍受的可怕場所。 【選項解析】(A) horrible 可怕糟糕的  (B) calm 平靜的  (C) pleased 滿意的  (D) pleasant 宜人的。mold and rats, utterly horrible place（發霉鼠患的可怕地方）。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Taking deep, slow breaths can help your racing heartbeat slow down so you can remain ______ under pressure.","options":["scared","calm","frightened","terrible"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: calm (冷靜的；鎮定的) 【全文中譯】進行深沉緩慢的深呼吸有助於減緩你狂跳的心率，讓你在巨大壓力之下依然能夠保持冷靜從容。 【選項解析】(A) scared 害怕的  (B) calm 冷靜的  (C) frightened 受驚的  (D) terrible 糟糕的。remain calm under pressure（在壓力下保持冷靜）。"},{"number":7,"stem":"Amanda's hands were shaking and she felt terribly ______ just before walking into the college interview room.","options":["pleased","calm","nervous","pleasant"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: nervous (緊張的) 【全文中譯】在邁步走進大學甄試面試考場之前，阿曼達的雙手不由自主地顫抖著，整個人感到無比緊張不安。 【選項解析】(A) pleased 欣慰的  (B) calm 冷靜的  (C) nervous 緊張的  (D) pleasant 愉快的。hands shaking, terribly nervous（雙手發抖且極度緊張）。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The school principal was genuinely ______ with the students' stellar performance during the charity fundraiser.","options":["scared","terrible","frightened","pleased"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: pleased (欣慰滿意的) 【全文中譯】校長對於全校學生在慈善募款活動期間所展現出的傑出卓越表現，感到由衷欣慰與深切讚賞。 【選項解析】(A) scared 害怕的  (B) terrible 糟糕的  (C) frightened 受驚的  (D) pleased 欣慰高興的。genuinely pleased with performance（對表現感到欣慰）。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The gentle autumn sunshine and cool mountain breeze made for an extraordinarily ______ afternoon stroll in the hills.","options":["pleasant","frightened","scared","terrible"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pleasant (令人愉快的；宜人的) 【全文中譯】柔和溫煦的秋日陽光配上午後涼爽的山風，造就了一場漫步在丘陵間極其令人愉悅愜意的午後漫步。 【選項解析】(A) pleasant 令人愉悅宜人的  (B) frightened 害怕的  (C) scared 受驚的  (D) terrible 糟糕的。pleasant stroll（愉悅的漫步）。"},{"number":10,"stem":"It gave grandfather immense ______ to sit on his porch rocking chair and listen to his grandchildren playing outside.","options":["fear","pleasure","feeling","emotion"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pleasure (樂趣；享受) 【全文中譯】坐在門廊的搖椅上，靜靜聽著屋外孫子們開心的嬉鬧玩耍聲，帶給了祖父無比深切的幸福樂趣。 【選項解析】(A) fear 恐懼  (B) pleasure 樂趣/幸福  (C) feeling 感受  (D) emotion 情緒。gave grandfather immense pleasure（帶給祖父無比樂趣）。"},{"number":11,"stem":"When the fire alarm unexpectedly shrieked in the hotel, several ______ guests ran out into the hallway in their pajamas.","options":["calm","pleasant","frightened","pleased"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: frightened (受驚嚇的) 【全文中譯】當飯店的火警警報器無預警在走廊尖叫大作時，好幾位受到驚嚇的房客穿著睡衣就倉皇逃到了走廊上。 【選項解析】(A) calm 冷靜的  (B) pleasant 愉快的  (C) frightened 受驚嚇的  (D) pleased 滿意的。frightened guests ran out（受驚的房客跑了出來）。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Swimming alone far past the buoy line at night is an irresponsible and ______ idea that could easily cost your life.","options":["pleasant","pleased","calm","terrible"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: terrible (極為糟糕危險的) 【全文中譯】夜間獨自一人游出浮標警戒線外遠處，是一件極其不負責任且極度糟糕的主意，隨時可能葬送性命。 【選項解析】(A) pleasant 愉快的  (B) pleased 欣慰的  (C) calm 平靜的  (D) terrible 糟糕差勁的。terrible idea（糟糕危險的念頭）。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The chef created a savory pasta dish that was an absolute ______ to eat, combining truffle oil with wild mushrooms.","options":["pleasure","fear","sense","emotion"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pleasure (樂事；享受) 【全文中譯】大廚精心烹調出一道美味無比的義大利麵，將松露油與野菇絕妙融合，品嚐起來完全是一大享受樂事。 【選項解析】(A) pleasure 享受/樂事  (B) fear 恐懼  (C) sense 感覺  (D) emotion 情緒。absolute pleasure to eat（吃起來真是人間樂事）。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Despite the turbulent rocking of the sailboat in rough waters, the veteran sailor maintained an impressively ______ demeanor.","options":["scared","calm","frightened","horrible"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: calm (冷靜沉著的) 【全文中譯】儘管帆船在洶湧波濤中劇烈顛簸晃動，這位老練的水手依然保持著令人肅然起敬的沉著冷靜風範。 【選項解析】(A) scared 害怕的  (B) calm 沉著冷靜的  (C) frightened 受驚的  (D) horrible 可怕的。calm demeanor（冷靜風度）。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Many people harbor an irrational ______ of dental appointments, avoiding checkups until they suffer from excruciating toothaches.","options":["pleasure","emotion","fear","sense"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: fear (恐懼症；害怕) 【全文中譯】許多人對看牙醫懷有一種莫名非理性的恐懼，往往逃避檢查直到牙痛到了難以忍受的地步才肯就醫。 【選項解析】(A) pleasure 樂事  (B) emotion 情緒  (C) fear 恐懼  (D) sense 感官。irrational fear of dental appointments（對看牙醫非理性的恐懼）。"},{"number":16,"stem":"The nightmare was so vivid and ______ that the young boy woke up covered in sweat and called out for his father.","options":["calm","pleased","pleasant","horrible"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: horrible (可怕恐懼的) 【全文中譯】這場惡夢是如此逼真與可怕驚悚，小男孩滿身大汗地驚醒過來並大聲呼喊著爸爸前來。 【選項解析】(A) calm 平靜的  (B) pleased 滿意的  (C) pleasant 愉快的  (D) horrible 可怕驚悚的。nightmare was vivid and horrible（逼真可怕的惡夢）。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Little children often feel ______ during their first week of kindergarten until they make friendly classroom playmates.","options":["scared","pleased","pleasant","calm"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: scared (害怕膽小的) 【全文中譯】剛上幼稚園的第一週幼童往往容易感到膽怯害怕，直到在班上結交到友善的小玩伴為止。 【選項解析】(A) scared 害怕膽小的  (B) pleased 滿意的  (C) pleasant 愉悅的  (D) calm 冷靜的。feel scared during first week（第一週感到害怕不安）。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Although public speaking can make anyone feel ______, consistent daily rehearsal builds enduring personal confidence.","options":["pleased","nervous","calm","pleasant"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: nervous (緊張的) 【全文中譯】雖然在大眾面前公開演講會讓任何人都難免感到緊張，但堅持每天演練能建立長久穩固的自信心。 【選項解析】(A) pleased 欣慰的  (B) nervous 緊張焦慮的  (C) calm 鎮定的  (D) pleasant 宜人的。public speaking makes people nervous（公開演講令人緊張）。"},{"number":19,"stem":"My parents were extremely ______ to hear that our school football team won first place in the county tournament.","options":["frightened","scared","pleased","terrible"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: pleased (高興欣慰的) 【全文中譯】當聽說我們學校的足球隊榮獲全縣冠軍錦標賽第一名殊榮時，我的雙親感到極為高興與欣慰。 【選項解析】(A) frightened 害怕的  (B) scared 驚恐的  (C) pleased 高興欣慰的  (D) terrible 糟糕的。extremely pleased to hear news（聽到好消息非常高興）。"},{"number":20,"stem":"Sitting by the tranquil lake watching swans glide across the water was a deeply relaxing and ______ experience.","options":["frightened","scared","horrible","pleasant"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: pleasant (令人愉快的；舒暢的) 【全文中譯】坐在寧靜秀麗的湖畔看著天鵝在水面優雅滑行，是一次令人身心極度放鬆且心曠神怡的愉快體驗。 【選項解析】(A) frightened 害怕的  (B) scared 受驚的  (C) horrible 糟糕的  (D) pleasant 愉快舒暢的。relaxing and pleasant experience（放鬆愉快的體驗）。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The lost hiker was so cold and ______ after being trapped in the dark woods overnight that she wept when rescuers arrived.","options":["frightened","calm","pleasant","pleased"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: frightened (受驚嚇害怕的) 【全文中譯】迷路的登山客在漆黑森林中受困一整夜之後，又冷又驚恐害怕，當搜救人員趕到時她忍不住痛哭流涕。 【選項解析】(A) frightened 受驚恐害怕的  (B) calm 冷靜的  (C) pleasant 愉悅的  (D) pleased 欣慰的。cold and frightened in dark woods（又冷又害怕）。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The medical examiner confirmed that the victim had suffered a ______ head injury from the falling construction scaffolding.","options":["calm","terrible","pleased","pleasant"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: terrible (嚴重的；可怕的) 【全文中譯】法醫相驗證實，傷者遭受了自工地鷹架墜落重物所造成的致命且可怕嚴重的頭部重創創傷。 【選項解析】(A) calm 平靜的  (B) terrible 嚴重的/可怕的  (C) pleased 滿意的  (D) pleasant 愉悅的。terrible head injury（可怕嚴重的頭部傷害）。"},{"number":23,"stem":"When asked to lead the national anthem at the stadium, the choir singer felt momentarily ______ before hitting the first note.","options":["calm","pleased","nervous","pleasant"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: nervous (緊張的) 【全文中譯】當被要求在擠滿全場的體育場領唱國歌時，合唱團主唱在唱出第一個音符前短暫地感到了一陣緊張。 【選項解析】(A) calm 平靜的  (B) pleased 欣慰的  (C) nervous 緊張的  (D) pleasant 宜人的。felt momentarily nervous（短暫感到緊張）。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The old historic library offers a wonderfully quiet and ______ environment for scholars conducting deep historical research.","options":["frightened","scared","horrible","pleasant"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: pleasant (舒適宜人的) 【全文中譯】這座歷史悠久的古老圖書館，為致力於進行深入歷史考證研究的學者提供了無比安靜而舒適宜人的環境。 【選項解析】(A) frightened 害怕的  (B) scared 受驚的  (C) horrible 糟糕的  (D) pleasant 舒適宜人的。quiet and pleasant environment（安靜愉快的環境）。"},{"number":25,"stem":"It would give us great ______ if you and your esteemed family could attend our upcoming golden anniversary banquet.","options":["pleasure","fear","sense","emotion"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pleasure (榮幸；樂事) 【全文中譯】如果您與您尊貴的家人能夠撥冗出席我們即將舉辦的金婚紀念盛宴，將帶給我們全體莫大的榮幸與欣喜。 【選項解析】(A) pleasure 榮幸/樂事  (B) fear 恐懼  (C) sense 感覺  (D) emotion 情緒。give us great pleasure（帶給我們莫大榮幸/高興）。"}]},{"unit":40,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 40 (040.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Personal Character, Temperament & Moral Traits | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"jealous","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"feeling envious of someone's achievements or possessions","chinese":"嫉妒的；吃醋的","sentence":"The spoiled child was intensely ______ when his classmate received a brand new bicycle for his birthday.","translation":"當同學在生日那天收到一輛全新腳踏車時，那個被寵壞的孩子內心極度嫉妒眼紅。"},{"word":"envy","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a feeling of discontented longing aroused by someone else's possessions","chinese":"羨慕；嫉妒","sentence":"I truly ______ my best friend because she can speak four foreign languages fluently without any difficulty.","translation":"我由衷羨慕我的摯友，因為她能夠毫不費力、流利地說四種外國語言。"},{"word":"curious","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"eager to know or learn something new","chinese":"好奇的","sentence":"The ______ kitten poked its nose into the open shopping bag, sniffing every strange item inside inquisitively.","translation":"好奇的小貓把鼻子探進敞開的購物袋裡，好奇地聞著裡面每一件陌生的物品。"},{"word":"generous","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"showing a readiness to give more of something than is strictly necessary","chinese":"慷慨的；大方的","sentence":"Uncle Robert is a very ______ philanthropist who donates substantial funds to orphanages every winter.","translation":"羅伯特叔叔是一位非常慷慨的慈善家，每年冬天都會向孤兒院捐贈大筆資金善款。"},{"word":"humorous","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"causing lighthearted laughter and amusement; comical","chinese":"幽默的；詼諧的","sentence":"Our English teacher always tells ______ stories about his college days, making everyone in class laugh out loud.","translation":"我們的英語老師總是講述他大學時代的幽默詼諧故事，逗得全班同學大笑不止。"},{"word":"humor","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the quality of being amusing or comic","chinese":"幽默；幽默感","sentence":"Having a healthy sense of ______ helps people cope with daily stress and maintain a sunny positive attitude.","translation":"擁有健康的幽默感有助於人們應對日常壓力，並保持陽光正向的生活態度。"},{"word":"confident","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"feeling or showing certainty about something or one's own ability","chinese":"有信心的；自信的","sentence":"After practicing his violin solo every day for three months, Lucas felt completely ______ on stage.","translation":"在連續三個月每天苦練小提琴獨奏之後，盧卡斯在舞台上顯得完全充滿自信。"},{"word":"independent","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"free from outside control; not depending on another's authority","chinese":"獨立的；自主的","sentence":"Living alone in a foreign city taught Rachel how to cook, manage finances, and become truly ______.","translation":"獨自生活在異國城市教會了瑞秋如何烹飪、打理財務，並成為一個真正獨立自主的人。"},{"word":"cruel","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"willfully causing pain or suffering to others without feeling mercy","chinese":"殘忍的；殘暴的","sentence":"Leaving a pet locked inside a hot car during summer is an unimaginably ______ and dangerous act.","translation":"在炎熱夏天把寵物反鎖在悶熱的汽車裡，是一種難以想像的殘忍且極度危險的行為。"},{"word":"naughty","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"badly behaved; disobedient, especially of children","chinese":"頑皮的；淘氣的","sentence":"The ______ little boy hid his sister's favorite doll on top of the high refrigerator just to tease her.","translation":"那個淘氣頑皮的小男孩把他妹妹最愛的洋娃娃藏在高高的冰箱頂上，只為了捉弄嘲弄她。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Some students felt secretly ______ of Marcus because he consistently won first prize in every math contest.","options":["jealous","generous","confident","independent"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: jealous (嫉妒的；眼紅的) 【全文中譯】有些學生暗自嫉妒馬可斯，因為他總是能在每場數學競賽中輕鬆斬獲第一名頭獎。 【選項解析】(A) jealous 嫉妒的  (B) generous 慷慨的  (C) confident 自信的  (D) independent 獨立的。jealous of achievements（嫉妒成就）。"},{"number":2,"stem":"It is completely natural to look with admiration and mild ______ upon someone who has achieved immense career success.","options":["humor","envy","sense","feeling"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: envy (羨慕；眼紅) 【全文中譯】對於在事業上取得巨大成功的優秀人士，抱持著欽佩與些許輕微的羨慕之情是完全人之常情。 【選項解析】(A) humor 幽默  (B) envy 羨慕  (C) sense 感官  (D) feeling 感覺。look with admiration and envy（帶著欽佩與羨慕看待）。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The science teacher encouraged students to remain ______ about the universe and ask questions constantly.","options":["cruel","naughty","curious","jealous"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: curious (好奇的) 【全文中譯】自然科學老師鼓勵全體同學對這個浩瀚宇宙永遠保持好奇心，並持之以恆地提出深刻問題。 【選項解析】(A) cruel 殘忍的  (B) naughty 淘氣的  (C) curious 好奇的  (D) jealous 嫉妒的。remain curious about universe（對宇宙保持好奇）。"},{"number":4,"stem":"The local business tycoon was extraordinarily ______ and provided scholarships to cover tuition for fifty needy students.","options":["cruel","jealous","naughty","generous"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: generous (慷慨的；大方的) 【全文中譯】當地的商業巨擘極為慷慨大方，資助設立了全額獎學金，為五十位清寒學子支付學雜費。 【選項解析】(A) cruel 殘忍的  (B) jealous 嫉妒的  (C) naughty 頑皮的  (D) generous 慷慨大方的。extraordinarily generous with scholarships（在獎學金上極為大方慷慨）。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Mark Twain was famous for writing ______ essays that used wit and satire to critique human follies amusingly.","options":["humorous","cruel","naughty","jealous"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: humorous (幽默的；詼諧的) 【全文中譯】馬克·吐溫以撰寫幽默詼諧的散文著稱，善用過人機智與諷刺手法風趣調侃人類的愚行。 【選項解析】(A) humorous 幽默詼諧的  (B) cruel 殘忍的  (C) naughty 淘氣的  (D) jealous 嫉妒的。humorous essays（幽默散文）。"},{"number":6,"stem":"A dry, self-deprecating sense of ______ allowed the wounded soldier to keep his spirits high during physical therapy.","options":["envy","humor","fear","pleasure"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: humor (幽默；幽默感) 【全文中譯】一種冷面自嘲的健全幽默感，讓這位受傷的軍人在漫長的物理復健療程中始終保持高昂士氣。 【選項解析】(A) envy 羨慕  (B) humor 幽默  (C) fear 恐懼  (D) pleasure 樂趣。sense of humor（幽默感）。"},{"number":7,"stem":"Having mastered every single grammar concept, Angela was entirely ______ that she would pass the English proficiency test.","options":["cruel","naughty","confident","jealous"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: confident (有信心的；充滿自信的) 【全文中譯】在熟練掌握了每一個核心文法觀念之後，安潔拉對自己能夠通過英語檢定測驗充滿了完全的信心。 【選項解析】(A) cruel 殘忍的  (B) naughty 淘氣的  (C) confident 充滿信心的  (D) jealous 嫉妒的。entirely confident of passing（完全有信心通過）。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Leaving home to attend university in Taipei made David learn practical life skills and become genuinely ______.","options":["cruel","naughty","jealous","independent"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: independent (獨立自主的) 【全文中譯】離家前往台北就讀大學，教會了戴維實用的生活自理技能，並蛻變成為一個真正獨立自主的人。 【選項解析】(A) cruel 殘忍的  (B) naughty 淘氣的  (C) jealous 嫉妒的  (D) independent 獨立自主的。become genuinely independent（變得真正獨立）。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Laws against animal abuse impose severe prison sentences on individuals who commit ______ acts against domestic pets.","options":["cruel","generous","confident","humorous"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: cruel (殘忍的；殘暴的) 【全文中譯】防止虐待動物法案對那些對寵物家禽犯下殘忍殘暴罪行的人士，處以極為嚴厲的刑期制裁。 【選項解析】(A) cruel 殘忍的  (B) generous 慷慨的  (C) confident 自信的  (D) humorous 幽默的。cruel acts against pets（虐待寵物的殘忍行徑）。"},{"number":10,"stem":"The ______ puppy chewed through three pairs of leather shoes while its owners were away at work yesterday.","options":["generous","naughty","confident","independent"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: naughty (頑皮的；調皮搗蛋的) 【全文中譯】昨天主人外出上班時，那隻調皮搗蛋的幼犬一口氣咬爛撕毀了三雙名貴的皮鞋。 【選項解析】(A) generous 慷慨的  (B) naughty 頑皮搗蛋的  (C) confident 自信的  (D) independent 獨立的。naughty puppy chewed shoes（搗蛋小狗咬鞋）。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Don't be so petty and ______; celebrate your sister's graduation with joy rather than grumbling about her honors.","options":["generous","confident","jealous","humorous"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: jealous (嫉妒的；吃醋的) 【全文中譯】別那麼心胸狹窄且愛嫉妒；帶著由衷的喜悅為你姐姐的畢業喝采，而不是對她的榮譽嘀咕抱怨。 【選項解析】(A) generous 慷慨的  (B) confident 自信的  (C) jealous 嫉妒心重的  (D) humorous 幽默的。petty and jealous（小氣且愛嫉妒）。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Many young artists secretly ______ the prodigy's effortless painting technique and natural sense of color harmony.","options":["rock","plant","desert","envy"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: envy (羨慕；眼紅) 【全文中譯】許多青年藝術家暗地裡十分羨慕這位神童毫不費力的作畫技巧，以及與生俱來的色彩和諧敏銳度。 【選項解析】(A) rock 搖晃  (B) plant 種植  (C) desert 拋棄  (D) envy 羨慕。envy painting technique（羨慕繪畫技巧）。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The detective was intensely ______ about the mysterious locked drawer and searched everywhere for its brass key.","options":["curious","cruel","naughty","jealous"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: curious (好奇的) 【全文中譯】偵探對那個神秘上鎖的抽屜感到強烈好奇，四處搜尋希望能找到能開啟它的黃銅鑰匙。 【選項解析】(A) curious 好奇的  (B) cruel 殘忍的  (C) naughty 頑皮的  (D) jealous 嫉妒的。intensely curious about drawer（對抽屜強烈好奇）。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Our grandmother was notoriously ______ with her time and affection, always baking sweet treats for all neighborhood children.","options":["cruel","generous","naughty","jealous"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: generous (大方的；慷慨的) 【全文中譯】我們的祖母在付出時間與關愛上一向以慷慨大方出名，總是為鄰里所有孩子烘烤甜美點心。 【選項解析】(A) cruel 殘忍的  (B) generous 慷慨大方的  (C) naughty 淘氣的  (D) jealous 嫉妒的。generous with time and affection（慷慨給予時間與關愛）。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The comedian delivered a ______ monologue highlighting the funny awkwardness of modern romantic dating.","options":["cruel","naughty","humorous","jealous"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: humorous (幽默風趣的) 【全文中譯】這位喜劇脫口秀演員發表了一段幽默風趣的獨白，惟妙惟肖地點出當代男女約會的滑稽尷尬。 【選項解析】(A) cruel 殘忍的  (B) naughty 淘氣的  (C) humorous 幽默詼諧的  (D) jealous 嫉妒的。humorous monologue（幽默獨白）。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Good comedy writers must have keen observational skills and a razor-sharp understanding of human ______.","options":["fear","envy","pleasure","humor"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: humor (幽默；喜劇魅力) 【全文中譯】優秀的喜劇編劇家必須具備敏銳深邃的觀察力，並對人性的幽默機制擁有如剃刀般鋒利的理解。 【選項解析】(A) fear 恐懼  (B) envy 嫉妒  (C) pleasure 樂趣  (D) humor 幽默。understanding of human humor（對人性幽默的理解）。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Standing tall with shoulders back and maintaining steady eye contact makes a speaker project a ______ presence.","options":["confident","cruel","naughty","jealous"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: confident (自信沉著的) 【全文中譯】挺直腰桿、雙肩展開並保持穩定的眼神接觸，能讓一位講者在台上散發出自信從容的強大氣場。 【選項解析】(A) confident 自信沉著的  (B) cruel 殘暴的  (C) naughty 淘氣的  (D) jealous 嫉妒的。confident presence（自信風采）。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Taiwan's judicial court system operates as an ______ branch of government, free from political pressure or bias.","options":["jealous","independent","cruel","naughty"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: independent (獨立的；超然獨立的) 【全文中譯】台灣的司法法院審判體系作為政府中獨立自主運作的權力分支，免受任何政治壓力或偏見干涉。 【選項解析】(A) jealous 嫉妒的  (B) independent 獨立超然的  (C) cruel 殘暴的  (D) naughty 頑皮的。independent branch of government（獨立政府分支）。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Ancient Roman emperors were infamous for their ______ gladiatorial games, where enslaved combatants fought to the death.","options":["generous","confident","cruel","humorous"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: cruel (殘暴的；殘忍的) 【全文中譯】古羅馬帝國統治者以舉辦殘忍嗜血的角鬥士競賽惡名昭彰，強迫被奴役的戰士們互相殘殺至死。 【選項解析】(A) generous 慷慨的  (B) confident 自信的  (C) cruel 殘忍嗜血的  (D) humorous 幽默的。cruel gladiatorial games（殘忍的角鬥士競賽）。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The teacher scolded the ______ students who threw wet paper wads at the blackboard when she turned around.","options":["generous","confident","independent","naughty"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: naughty (頑皮的；搗蛋的) 【全文中譯】老師厲聲訓斥了那些頑皮淘氣的學生，他們趁著老師一轉身就在黑板上扔擲濕紙團搗亂。 【選項解析】(A) generous 慷慨的  (B) confident 自信的  (C) independent 獨立的  (D) naughty 頑皮搗蛋的。scolded naughty students（訓斥調皮學生）。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Beware of toxic friends who act sweet to your face but harbor green-eyed ______ behind your back whenever you succeed.","options":["jealousy","humor","pleasure","sense"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: jealousy (嫉妒；眼紅心態) 【全文中譯】當心那些當面甜言蜜語，但每當你獲得成功時卻在背後暗懷眼紅嫉妒的有毒心態不良朋友。 【選項解析】(A) jealousy 嫉妒  (B) humor 幽默  (C) pleasure 樂趣  (D) sense 感覺。green-eyed jealousy（眼紅嫉妒）。"},{"number":22,"stem":"I can't help but ______ his ability to remain totally calm and articulate even during the most chaotic press conferences.","options":["plant","envy","desert","pollute"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: envy (羨慕；嫉妒) 【全文中譯】我忍不住由衷羨慕他在最混亂失序的記者會場合中，依然能夠保持完全冷靜且條理分明的過人能力。 【選項解析】(A) plant 種植  (B) envy 羨慕  (C) desert 拋棄  (D) pollute 污染。envy his ability（羨慕他的能力）。"},{"number":23,"stem":"An inquisitive mind that is genuinely ______ about diverse world cultures is the greatest asset for an international diplomat.","options":["cruel","naughty","curious","jealous"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: curious (好奇的；求知若渴的) 【全文中譯】一顆真正對世界多元文化充滿好奇探求的求知心態，是國際外交官最無可替代的寶貴資產。 【選項解析】(A) cruel 殘忍的  (B) naughty 頑皮的  (C) curious 好奇求知的  (D) jealous 嫉妒的。curious about diverse cultures（對多元文化好奇）。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The foundation made a tremendously ______ endowment to fund cancer research facilities at the teaching hospital.","options":["cruel","naughty","jealous","generous"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: generous (慷慨的；巨額的) 【全文中譯】該基金會捐贈了一筆極為慷慨龐大的基金，用以資助教學醫院興建癌症醫學研究實驗大樓。 【選項解析】(A) cruel 殘忍的  (B) naughty 淘氣的  (C) jealous 嫉妒的  (D) generous 慷慨龐大的。generous endowment（慷慨大筆的捐贈）。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Although her sharp criticism sounded harsh, there was absolutely no ______ intent behind her honest professional feedback.","options":["cruel","generous","confident","humorous"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: cruel (殘忍刻薄的) 【全文中譯】雖然她的針砭批評聽起來直白嚴厲，但她誠懇專業的意見回饋背後絕無絲毫刻薄殘忍的惡意。 【選項解析】(A) cruel 殘忍刻薄的  (B) generous 慷慨的  (C) confident 自信的  (D) humorous 幽默的。no cruel intent（毫無刻薄惡意）。"}]},{"unit":41,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 41 (041.mp3) Topic: Personal Character, Intelligence & Negative Traits","topic":"Topic: Personal Character, Intelligence & Negative Traits | Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"rude","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"not polite; having bad manners toward others","chinese":"無禮的；粗魯的","sentence":"When the waiter dropped the tray, the angry customer shouted ______ words, but everyone else remained calm and polite.","translation":"當服務生打翻托盤時，憤怒的顧客大聲說出無禮的話語，但其他人都保持冷靜與禮貌。"},{"word":"unique","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"being the only one of its kind; very special","chinese":"獨特的；獨一無二的","sentence":"The small island has its own ______ wildlife and culture, so thousands of scientists travel there to study each year.","translation":"這座小島擁有其獨特的野生動植物與文化，因此每年都有成千上萬的科學家前往研究。"},{"word":"selfish","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"caring only about oneself and not about other people","chinese":"自私的","sentence":"The greedy boy refused to share his toys with his cousins, and his ______ behavior made everyone at the party feel unhappy.","translation":"那個貪婪的男孩拒絕與他的表兄弟分享玩具，他的自私行為讓派對上的每個人都不開心。"},{"word":"stingy","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"unwilling to spend money or share things; mean","chinese":"小氣的；吝嗇的","sentence":"Although Mr. Davis earned a high salary at the bank, he was so ______ that he never bought gifts for his children.","translation":"雖然戴維斯先生在銀行領取高薪，但他非常小氣，從不給他的孩子們買禮物。"},{"word":"greedy","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"wanting more money, food, or power than one needs","chinese":"貪婪的；貪心的","sentence":"The businessman was so ______ for wealth that he took illegal shortcuts, and he eventually lost everything he had owned.","translation":"那位商人對財富如此貪婪，以至於採取非法捷徑，最終失去了他所擁有的一切。"},{"word":"clever","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"quick at learning and understanding things; skillful","chinese":"聰明的；機敏的","sentence":"The young detective found several clues in the quiet room, and her ______ analysis helped the police catch the thief quickly.","translation":"年輕女偵探在安靜的房間裡發現了幾條線索，她機敏的分析幫助警方迅速抓獲了小偷。"},{"word":"intelligent","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"having a high ability to learn, think, and understand","chinese":"有聰明才智的；有靈性的","sentence":"Dolphins are known to be highly ______ marine animals, and they can easily communicate with one another using special sounds.","translation":"海豚被公認為極富聰明才智的海洋動物，牠們能使用特殊的聲音輕鬆地相互交流。"},{"word":"diligent","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"showing care and steady effort in work or studies","chinese":"勤勉的；用功的","sentence":"Mary was a ______ student throughout high school, so she always reviewed her lessons every night and passed all exams.","translation":"瑪麗在整個高中階段都是一名勤勉的學生，因此她每晚總是複習功課並通過了所有考試。"},{"word":"fool","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a person without good sense; to trick someone","chinese":"傻瓜；愚人；愚弄","sentence":"Kevin pretended that he was completely sick to avoid the test, but he could not ______ his experienced teacher for a minute.","translation":"凱文假裝自己完全生病以逃避考試，但他連一分鐘都無法愚弄他經驗豐富的老師。"},{"word":"foolish","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"lacking good sense or judgment; silly","chinese":"愚蠢的；不明智的","sentence":"It was very ______ of Tom to drive in such heavy snow, and his car slid off the road into a ditch.","translation":"湯姆在如此大雪中開車是非常愚蠢的，他的車子滑出了道路衝進了水溝。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The wealthy landlord refused to donate even a single dollar to the local school, so many residents considered him very ______.","options":["diligent","stingy","clever","intelligent"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: stingy (小氣的) 【全文中譯】富有的房東拒絕向當地學校捐贈哪怕是一美元，所以許多居民認為他非常吝嗇。 【選項解析】(A) diligent 勤勉的 (B) stingy 吝嗇的 (C) clever 聰明的 (D) intelligent 有智慧的。由 refused to donate even a single dollar 可知選 stingy。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Because the new phone software incorporates a completely ______ interface, it quickly attracted millions of young users worldwide.","options":["unique","rude","selfish","foolish"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: unique (獨特的) 【全文中譯】因為這款新手機軟體融合了完全獨特的介面，它迅速吸引了全球數百萬年輕用戶。 【選項解析】(A) unique 獨特的 (B) rude 無禮的 (C) selfish 自私的 (D) foolish 愚蠢的。由 completely... interface 吸引用戶可知選 unique。"},{"number":3,"stem":"When asking for directions in a foreign country, you should speak politely because it is ______ to interrupt people abruptly.","options":["diligent","clever","rude","intelligent"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: rude (無禮的) 【全文中譯】在國外問路時你應該禮貌地說話，因為突然打斷別人是非常無禮的。 【選項解析】(A) diligent 勤勉的 (B) clever 聰明的 (C) rude 無禮的 (D) intelligent 聰穎的。abruptly interrupt people（突然打斷人）屬於 rude。"},{"number":4,"stem":"The little girl spent all her pocket money on delicious candies and ate them alone, which was considered quite ______ by her brother.","options":["selfish","unique","diligent","clever"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: selfish (自私的) 【全文中譯】小女孩把所有零用錢都花在美味糖果上並獨自吃掉，這被她哥哥認為相當自私。 【選項解析】(A) selfish 自私的 (B) unique 獨特的 (C) diligent 勤奮的 (D) clever 機靈的。獨吞糖果不分享為 selfish。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Elephants have remarkable memories and complex social bonds, proving that they are among the most ______ creatures on Earth.","options":["stingy","rude","intelligent","foolish"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: intelligent (有靈性的；聰明的) 【全文中譯】大象擁有非凡的記憶力與複雜的社交紐帶，證明牠們是地球上最具智慧的生物之一。 【選項解析】(A) stingy 吝嗇的 (B) rude 粗暴的 (C) intelligent 聰穎的 (D) foolish 愚昧的。記憶與社交結構證明其 intelligent。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Samuel studied ten hours every weekend to prepare for the medical entrance exam, and his ______ attitude impressed all his tutors.","options":["selfish","diligent","greedy","rude"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: diligent (勤勉的) 【全文中譯】塞繆爾每個週末學習十個小時來準備醫學入學考試，他的勤勉態度給所有導師留下了深刻印象。 【選項解析】(A) selfish 自私的 (B) diligent 勤奮的 (C) greedy 貪心的 (D) rude 無禮的。每週末讀書十小時為 diligent。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The king in the old fairy tale collected tons of gold in his palace, but his ______ nature made him unhappy and lonely.","options":["greedy","clever","unique","diligent"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: greedy (貪婪的) 【全文中譯】古老童話中的國王在宮殿裡收集了成噸的黃金，但他貪婪的天性使他痛苦而孤獨。 【選項解析】(A) greedy 貪婪的 (B) clever 聰敏的 (C) unique 獨特的 (D) diligent 勤奮的。囤積黃金無法滿足為 greedy。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Leaving your front door completely unlocked overnight in a busy city is a very ______ decision that invites serious danger.","options":["intelligent","foolish","diligent","unique"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: foolish (愚蠢的) 【全文中譯】在繁忙的城市中夜間完全不鎖大門是一個非常愚蠢的決定，會招來嚴重的危險。 【選項解析】(A) intelligent 聰明的 (B) foolish 愚蠢的 (C) diligent 勤勉的 (D) unique 特殊的。夜不閉戶招致危險是 foolish。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The monkey used a long slender stick to retrieve food from the narrow box, showing how ______ it was at solving problems.","options":["clever","stingy","selfish","rude"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: clever (聰明的；機敏的) 【全文中譯】猴子用一根細長的樹枝從狹窄的盒子裡取回食物，展示了它在解決問題方面是多麼機靈。 【選項解析】(A) clever 機敏的 (B) stingy 小氣的 (C) selfish 自私的 (D) rude 粗野的。使用工具取食展現 clever。"},{"number":10,"stem":"You should never try to ______ your parents by telling lies, because they will easily discover the real truth sooner or later.","options":["fool","praise","harm","touch"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: fool (愚弄；欺騙) 【全文中譯】你絕不應該試圖透過說謊來愚弄你的父母，因為他們遲早會輕易發現真正的真相。 【選項解析】(A) fool 愚弄 (B) praise 稱讚 (C) harm 傷害 (D) touch 感動。fool sb. by telling lies（藉由說謊愚弄某人）。"},{"number":11,"stem":"It was very ______ of the young driver to race through the crowded street, and police officers immediately pulled him over.","options":["intelligent","foolish","clever","unique"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: foolish (愚蠢的) 【全文中譯】年輕司機在擁擠的街道上狂飆是非常愚蠢的，警官們立刻將他攔了下來。 【選項解析】(A) intelligent 有智慧的 (B) foolish 愚蠢的 (C) clever 聰穎的 (D) unique 獨特的。鬧區飆車為 foolish 行為。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The artist combined traditional Chinese painting with modern Western oil techniques, creating a wonderfully ______ artistic style.","options":["unique","stingy","selfish","rude"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: unique (獨特的) 【全文中譯】這位藝術家將傳統國畫與現代西方油畫技法相結合，創造出一種極其獨特的藝術風格。 【選項解析】(A) unique 獨特的 (B) stingy 吝嗇的 (C) selfish 自私的 (D) rude 粗鄙的。融合中西技法形成 unique 風格。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The manager reprimanded the sales clerk because she gave a ______ response when an elderly customer asked a simple question.","options":["diligent","rude","clever","unique"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: rude (無禮的) 【全文中譯】經理訓斥了那名女售貨員，因為當一位年長顧客提出一個簡單問題時，她給出了粗魯的回答。 【選項解析】(A) diligent 勤奮的 (B) rude 無禮的 (C) clever 聰穎的 (D) unique 獨樹一幟的。服務態度不佳為 rude。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Jack always takes the largest portion of the cake and leaves nothing for others, displaying his ______ and inconsiderate personality.","options":["selfish","intelligent","clever","diligent"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: selfish (自私的) 【全文中譯】傑克總是拿走最大份的蛋糕而不給別人留任何東西，展現了他自私且不體貼的性格。 【選項解析】(A) selfish 自私的 (B) intelligent 聰明的 (C) clever 伶俐的 (D) diligent 勤勉的。佔據最多不顧他人為 selfish。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The dishonest trader hoarded all the rice during the drought to sell it at high prices, demonstrating his ______ greed for profit.","options":["intelligent","greedy","unique","polite"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: greedy (貪婪的) 【全文中譯】不誠實的商人在旱災期間囤積所有大米以高價出售，展現了他對利潤貪婪的欲望。 【選項解析】(A) intelligent 有才智的 (B) greedy 貪心的 (C) unique 獨有的 (D) polite 禮貌的。囤積居奇為 greedy。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Although he had plenty of warm blankets in the closet, the ______ man would not lend any to the shivering neighbors.","options":["stingy","clever","intelligent","unique"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: stingy (吝嗇的) 【全文中譯】雖然衣櫥裡有許多保暖毯子，但那個小氣的男人不願借給發抖的鄰居任何一條。 【選項解析】(A) stingy 吝嗇的 (B) clever 聰明的 (C) intelligent 聰穎的 (D) unique 奇特的。有富餘卻不願借人為 stingy。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Solving complex mathematical equations requires high logical ability, and the ______ professor solved them within minutes.","options":["rude","intelligent","foolish","stingy"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: intelligent (聰明的；有才智的) 【全文中譯】解決複雜的數學方程式需要高度的邏輯能力，而聰明的教授在幾分鐘內就解開了它們。 【選項解析】(A) rude 粗魯的 (B) intelligent 聰穎的 (C) foolish 愚昧的 (D) stingy 吝嗇的。快速解複雜難題展現 intelligent。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The young mechanic worked late into the night checking every bolt on the airplane, proving that he was an exceptionally ______ worker.","options":["diligent","selfish","foolish","rude"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: diligent (勤勉的) 【全文中譯】年輕技工工作到深夜檢查飛機上的每一個螺栓，證明他是一位特別勤勉的工人。 【選項解析】(A) diligent 勤奮的 (B) selfish 自私的 (C) foolish 愚笨的 (D) rude 粗暴的。徹夜認真檢查展示 diligent。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Using a hairpin to unlock the jammed drawer was a very ______ trick, and it allowed us to retrieve the passport quickly.","options":["clever","stingy","greedy","rude"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: clever (機敏的；巧妙的) 【全文中譯】用髮夾打開卡住的抽屜是一個非常巧妙的技巧，它讓我們迅速取回了護照。 【選項解析】(A) clever 巧妙的 (B) stingy 小氣的 (C) greedy 貪婪的 (D) rude 無禮的。善用手邊工具開鎖為 clever。"},{"number":20,"stem":"He felt like an absolute ______ when he realized that he had worn two completely different socks to the job interview.","options":["fool","hero","prince","judge"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: fool (傻瓜) 【全文中譯】當他意識到自己穿了兩隻完全不同的襪子去參加求職面試時，他觉得自己簡直像個十足的傻瓜。 【選項解析】(A) fool 傻瓜 (B) hero 英雄 (C) prince 王子 (D) judge 法官。felt like an absolute fool（覺得自己像個大傻瓜）。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Snatching toys away from younger toddlers without asking permission is extremely ______ and unacceptable on the playground.","options":["clever","rude","diligent","intelligent"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: rude (粗魯無禮的) 【全文中譯】在操場上未經允許就從幼兒手裡搶奪玩具是非常粗魯且不可接受的。 【選項解析】(A) clever 聰明的 (B) rude 無禮的 (C) diligent 勤勉的 (D) intelligent 聰穎的。搶幼童玩具屬於 rude。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Each person's fingerprint has a pattern that is completely ______, which makes it an ideal method for personal identification.","options":["unique","selfish","foolish","stingy"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: unique (獨一無二的) 【全文中譯】每個人的指紋都具有完全獨一無二的紋路，這使它成為個人身分識別的理想方法。 【選項解析】(A) unique 獨特的 (B) selfish 自私的 (C) foolish 愚蠢的 (D) stingy 吝嗇的。指紋為 unique 特徵。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The farmer was so ______ that he planted extra crops on his neighbor's land without permission, causing a fierce legal dispute.","options":["intelligent","greedy","diligent","polite"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: greedy (貪心的) 【全文中譯】那名農夫太過貪心，未經允許就在鄰居的土地上種植額外作物，引發了激烈的法律糾紛。 【選項解析】(A) intelligent 聰明的 (B) greedy 貪婪的 (C) diligent 勤懇的 (D) polite 有禮的。侵佔土地種植為 greedy。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The scientist designed a very ______ experiment that tested three hypotheses simultaneously while saving time and resources.","options":["clever","rude","stingy","foolish"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: clever (巧妙的；機敏的) 【全文中譯】科學家設計了一個非常巧妙的實驗，同時測試了三個假設並節省了時間和資源。 【選項解析】(A) clever 巧妙的 (B) rude 無禮的 (C) stingy 小氣的 (D) foolish 愚笨的。設計高效率實驗為 clever。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Spending your entire monthly paycheck on video games during the first week is a ______ habit that causes serious financial distress.","options":["unique","foolish","clever","diligent"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: foolish (愚蠢的) 【全文中譯】在第一週就把整個月薪水花在電玩遊戲上是一種會導致嚴重財務困境的愚蠢習慣。 【選項解析】(A) unique 獨特的 (B) foolish 愚蠢的 (C) clever 機敏的 (D) diligent 勤奮的。揮霍薪水為 foolish 行為。"}]},{"unit":42,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 42 (042.mp3) Topic: Moral Character, Politeness & Sense of Responsibility","topic":"Topic: Moral Character, Politeness & Sense of Responsibility | Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"stupid","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"showing a lack of good judgment, sense, or thought","chinese":"愚蠢的；笨拙的","sentence":"Don't do such a ______ thing again, and always think carefully about the consequences before you act.","translation":"別再做這種愚蠢的事情了，在行動之前一定要仔細考慮後果。"},{"word":"silly","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"foolish, childish, or not serious","chinese":"傻氣的；糊塗的","sentence":"The two sisters had a ______ argument over who should wear the pink dress, but they made up after five minutes.","translation":"兩姐妹為了誰該穿那件粉色連衣裙發生了糊塗的爭吵，但五分鐘後她們就和好了。"},{"word":"royal","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"relating to or belonging to a king, queen, or royal family","chinese":"皇室的；國王的","sentence":"Thousands of enthusiastic citizens gathered outside the palace to watch the spectacular ______ parade pass by.","translation":"成千上萬熱情的市民聚集在宮殿外，觀看壯觀的皇室遊行隊伍經過。"},{"word":"honesty","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the quality of being truthful, trustworthy, and fair","chinese":"誠實；正直","sentence":"My grandfather taught me that ______ is the best policy in life, and you will always earn respect by telling the truth.","translation":"我的祖父教導我誠實是人生上策，而你說實話總能贏得別人的尊重。"},{"word":"dishonest","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"not honest; intending to trick or lie to people","chinese":"不誠實的；欺騙的","sentence":"The company fired the ______ accountant immediately, because he stole money from the firm's bank account for months.","translation":"公司立刻解雇了那名不誠實的會計師，因為他數月來一直從公司銀行帳戶盜取資金。"},{"word":"sincere","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"honest, genuine, and not pretending","chinese":"真誠的；由衷的","sentence":"He wrote a very ______ apology letter to his best friend, and she happily forgave him for his thoughtless mistake.","translation":"他給最好的朋友寫了一封非常真誠的道歉信，她高興地原諒了他輕率的錯誤。"},{"word":"impolite","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"rude; not showing good manners toward others","chinese":"不禮貌的；粗魯的","sentence":"Leaving the dinner party without saying goodbye to the host is considered very ______, so please stay until the dessert is served.","translation":"未向主人告別就離開晚宴被認為是非常不禮貌的，所以請留下來直到甜點端上來。"},{"word":"humble","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"not proud or boastful; modest about one's abilities","chinese":"謙虛的；不起眼的","sentence":"Even after winning the Nobel Prize in physics, the elderly professor remained very ______ and continued to mentor young students.","translation":"即使在獲得諾貝爾物理學獎之後，那位年邁的教授依然非常謙虛，並繼續指導年輕學生。"},{"word":"responsible","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"having the obligation to take care of something; reliable","chinese":"負責任的；承擔責任的","sentence":"Every driver is personally ______ for following traffic regulations, so you must always stop when the traffic light turns red.","translation":"每位駕駛人都有責任遵守交通法規，因此當交通號誌變紅時，你必須隨時停車。"},{"word":"duty","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a moral or legal obligation; something one must do","chinese":"職責；責任；義務","sentence":"It is the primary ______ of police officers to protect citizens from harm and maintain peace throughout the city.","translation":"警官的首要職責是保護市民免受傷害，並維持全城的安寧。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The sales clerk gave back the extra hundred dollars to the customer, demonstrating remarkable ______ and professional ethics.","options":["duty","honesty","crime","danger"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: honesty (誠實) 【全文中譯】店員將多出的一百美元歸還給顧客，展現了非凡的誠實與職業道德。 【選項解析】(A) duty 職責 (B) honesty 誠實 (C) crime 犯罪 (D) danger 危險。退還多找的錢展現 honesty。"},{"number":2,"stem":"It was quite ______ of Peter to leave his wet raincoat on the classroom sofa, soaking everyone's books and papers.","options":["royal","humble","stupid","responsible"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: stupid (愚蠢的) 【全文中譯】彼得把濕雨衣丟在教室沙發上把大家的書本紙張都弄濕了，這實在相當愚蠢。 【選項解析】(A) royal 皇家的 (B) humble 謙遜的 (C) stupid 愚笨的 (D) responsible 負責任的。浸濕眾人物品為 stupid 行為。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Princess Victoria wore an exquisite crown and attended the ______ wedding ceremony held in the historic cathedral.","options":["silly","royal","dishonest","impolite"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: royal (皇室的) 【全文中譯】維多利亞公主頭戴精美王冠，出席了在歷史大教堂舉行的盛大皇室婚禮儀式。 【選項解析】(A) silly 糊塗的 (B) royal 皇室的 (C) dishonest 不誠實的 (D) impolite 無禮的。公主與皇室典禮選 royal。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Talking loudly on your mobile phone inside the quiet public library is extremely ______, so please switch it to silent mode.","options":["impolite","humble","royal","sincere"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: impolite (不禮貌的) 【全文中譯】在安靜的公共圖書館裡大聲講手機極其不禮貌，所以請將手機調成靜音模式。 【選項解析】(A) impolite 不禮貌的 (B) humble 謙遜的 (C) royal 皇家的 (D) sincere 真誠的。圖書館大聲講電話為 impolite。"},{"number":5,"stem":"When the project failed to meet the deadline, Kevin stood up and admitted that he was entirely ______ for the delays.","options":["royal","responsible","silly","dishonest"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: responsible (負責任的) 【全文中譯】當專案未能在截止日期前完成時，凱文站了出來並承認他對延誤負有全部責任。 【選項解析】(A) royal 皇家的 (B) responsible 負責任的 (C) silly 糊塗的 (D) dishonest 不誠實的。be responsible for 為承擔責任。"},{"number":6,"stem":"The politician lost public support after journalists revealed that he made many ______ statements during the election.","options":["sincere","dishonest","humble","royal"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: dishonest (不誠實的) 【全文中譯】在記者揭露該政客在選舉期間發表了許多不誠實的言論後，他失去了公眾支持。 【選項解析】(A) sincere 真誠的 (B) dishonest 欺瞞的 (C) humble 謙卑的 (D) royal 皇家的。發表虛假言論為 dishonest。"},{"number":7,"stem":"A dedicated doctor believes that saving human lives under any condition is her most important professional ______.","options":["honesty","duty","injury","illness"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: duty (職責) 【全文中譯】一位敬業的醫生認為，在任何情況下拯救生命都是她最重要的職業職責。 【選項解析】(A) honesty 誠實 (B) duty 職責 (C) injury 傷害 (D) illness 疾病。救死扶傷為 professional duty。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Although she came from a very wealthy family, Amanda remained ______ and always treated everyone with equal respect.","options":["impolite","humble","dishonest","stupid"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: humble (謙遜的) 【全文中譯】雖然阿曼達出身於非常富有的家庭，但她依然謙遜，並總是平等尊重地對待每個人。 【選項解析】(A) impolite 粗魯的 (B) humble 謙遜的 (C) dishonest 虛偽的 (D) stupid 愚笨的。富而不驕為 humble。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Please accept my ______ gratitude for your generous support during my family's difficult financial situation.","options":["sincere","silly","stupid","dishonest"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: sincere (真誠的) 【全文中譯】在我家面臨經濟困難的時期，請接受我對您慷慨支持由衷的真誠謝意。 【選項解析】(A) sincere 真誠的 (B) silly 傻氣的 (C) stupid 愚笨的 (D) dishonest 虛偽的。sincere gratitude（由衷的感謝）。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Stop laughing at that ______ joke and concentrate on your English grammar homework before dinner begins.","options":["royal","silly","sincere","humble"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: silly (傻氣的) 【全文中譯】別再對那個傻氣的笑話發笑了，晚餐開始前請專注於你的英語文法作業。 【選項解析】(A) royal 皇家的 (B) silly 傻氣的 (C) sincere 誠懇的 (D) humble 謙遜的。silly joke 為無聊傻氣的玩笑。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Cheating on school examinations by copying another student's test paper is a ______ act that will result in severe punishment.","options":["humble","dishonest","royal","sincere"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: dishonest (不誠實的) 【全文中譯】在學校考試中透過抄襲別人的試卷來作弊是一種不誠實的行為，將受到嚴厲懲罰。 【選項解析】(A) humble 謙虛的 (B) dishonest 不誠實的 (C) royal 皇家的 (D) sincere 真誠的。作弊屬於 dishonest 行為。"},{"number":12,"stem":"As a pet owner, you are ______ for feeding your puppy daily and taking it for regular outdoor exercise.","options":["responsible","silly","impolite","royal"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: responsible (負責任的) 【全文中譯】作為寵物主人，你有責任每天餵養你的幼犬並帶它進行定期的戶外運動。 【選項解析】(A) responsible 負責任的 (B) silly 糊塗的 (C) impolite 粗暴的 (D) royal 皇室的。be responsible for doing sth.（對...負責）。"},{"number":13,"stem":"It is your legal ______ as a citizen to pay taxes on time and respect the laws of the country.","options":["duty","honesty","error","accident"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: duty (義務) 【全文中譯】按時納稅並遵守國家法律是身為公民的法定責任與義務。 【選項解析】(A) duty 義務 (B) honesty 誠實 (C) error 錯誤 (D) accident 意外。公民責任義務為 legal duty。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The teacher thanked the young boy for his ______, because he admitted breaking the window without hesitation.","options":["honesty","duty","wound","crime"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: honesty (誠實) 【全文中譯】老師感謝那個小男孩的誠實，因為他毫不猶豫地承認打碎了窗戶。 【選項解析】(A) honesty 誠實 (B) duty 職責 (C) wound 傷口 (D) crime 罪行。坦白認錯為 honesty。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Burping loudly at the dining table without apologizing is considered very ______ in most Western and Asian cultures.","options":["sincere","impolite","humble","royal"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: impolite (不禮貌的) 【全文中譯】在餐桌上大聲打嗝而不道歉，在大多數西方與亞洲文化中都被認為是非常不禮貌的。 【選項解析】(A) sincere 真誠的 (B) impolite 無禮的 (C) humble 謙和的 (D) royal 皇室的。餐桌失禮為 impolite。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Forgetting your own passport on the dining table on the day of an international flight is an incredibly ______ mistake.","options":["stupid","royal","humble","sincere"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: stupid (愚蠢的) 【全文中譯】在出國旅行搭機當天把護照忘在餐桌上，是一個極其愚蠢的錯誤。 【選項解析】(A) stupid 愚笨的 (B) royal 皇家的 (C) humble 謙卑的 (D) sincere 誠摯的。stupid mistake（愚蠢的疏失）。"},{"number":17,"stem":"In traditional British history, the ______ navy guarded the sea trade routes across the world for centuries.","options":["royal","silly","dishonest","impolite"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: royal (皇家的) 【全文中譯】在傳統英國歷史上，皇家海軍幾個世紀以來一直守衛著世界各地的海上貿易航線。 【選項解析】(A) royal 皇家的 (B) silly 傻里傻氣的 (C) dishonest 欺詐的 (D) impolite 粗野的。Royal Navy（皇家海軍）。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The world-famous architect lived in a ______ cottage by the woods, preferring quiet nature to bustling city life.","options":["humble","dishonest","stupid","impolite"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: humble (簡樸的；不起眼的) 【全文中譯】這位舉世聞名的建築師住在樹林邊的一座簡樸小屋裡，比起熱鬧的城市生活更喜歡安靜的大自然。 【選項解析】(A) humble 簡樸的 (B) dishonest 不實的 (C) stupid 愚笨的 (D) impolite 無禮的。humble cottage（簡樸小屋）。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Her eyes were filled with tears as she delivered a ______ speech thanking her parents for their endless sacrifice.","options":["sincere","dishonest","silly","stupid"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: sincere (真誠的) 【全文中譯】當她發表真誠的演講感謝父母無盡的犧牲時，她的眼中充滿了淚水。 【選項解析】(A) sincere 真誠的 (B) dishonest 虛假的 (C) silly 幼稚的 (D) stupid 笨拙的。sincere speech（真摯的演說）。"},{"number":20,"stem":"Making ______ faces in class to distract your classmates from listening to the lecture is immature behavior.","options":["silly","royal","sincere","responsible"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: silly (鬼臉；傻氣的) 【全文中譯】在課堂上做鬼臉分散同學聽課的注意力是一種不成熟的幼稚行為。 【選項解析】(A) silly 鬼臉；傻氣的 (B) royal 皇室的 (C) sincere 誠懇的 (D) responsible 負責任的。silly faces（搞怪鬼臉）。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Parents have a sacred ______ to nurture and protect their children until they grow into independent adults.","options":["duty","honesty","fault","damage"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: duty (職責) 【全文中譯】父母有神聖的職責撫養和保護他們的孩子，直到他們長大成為獨立的成年人。 【選項解析】(A) duty 職責 (B) honesty 誠信 (C) fault 缺點 (D) damage 損害。sacred duty（神聖職責）。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Selling expired medicine to sick patients is not only ______ but also constitutes a serious criminal violation.","options":["dishonest","humble","sincere","royal"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: dishonest (不誠實的；奸詐的) 【全文中譯】將過期藥品賣給生病的病人不僅是不誠實的，而且構成嚴重的刑事違法行為。 【選項解析】(A) dishonest 欺詐的 (B) humble 謙遜的 (C) sincere 誠摯的 (D) royal 皇室的。販售過期藥品為 dishonest。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Taking an umbrella on a bright sunny day without a cloud in the sky might seem ______ to passersby.","options":["silly","sincere","royal","responsible"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: silly (傻氣的) 【全文中譯】在晴空萬里萬里無雲的日子裡帶著一把雨傘，對路人來說似乎顯得有些傻氣。 【選項解析】(A) silly 傻氣的 (B) sincere 真切的 (C) royal 皇家的 (D) responsible 負責任的。豔陽天拿傘看似 silly。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The bus driver was praised by the police for acting in a very ______ manner during the stormy highway emergency.","options":["responsible","stupid","dishonest","impolite"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: responsible (負責任的) 【全文中譯】公車司機在暴風雨高速公路緊急情況下表現得非常負責任，受到了警方的表揚。 【選項解析】(A) responsible 負責任的 (B) stupid 愚蠢的 (C) dishonest 虛偽的 (D) impolite 粗魯的。responsible manner（負責任的態度）。"},{"number":25,"stem":"When answering questions from the judge in court, you must swear to speak with absolute ______.","options":["honesty","duty","pain","trouble"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: honesty (誠實) 【全文中譯】在法庭上回答法官提問時，你必須發誓以絕對的誠實陳述。 【選項解析】(A) honesty 誠實 (B) duty 義務 (C) pain 痛苦 (D) trouble 麻煩。speak with absolute honesty（絕對誠實作供）。"}]},{"unit":43,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 43 (043.mp3) Topic: Physical Appearance, Temperament & Behavior","topic":"Topic: Physical Appearance, Temperament & Behavior | Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"sneaky","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"doing things in a secret and often dishonest way","chinese":"鬼鬼祟祟的；狡猾的","sentence":"The cat made a ______ approach across the kitchen floor, but the clever mouse escaped into its hole just in time.","translation":"那隻貓在廚房地板上鬼鬼祟祟地靠近，但那隻聰明的老鼠及時逃進了洞裡。"},{"word":"evil","pos":"(adj.) / (n.)","definition":"morally bad, cruel, or causing harm; wickedness","chinese":"邪惡的；罪惡","sentence":"In many classic fairy tales, a brave knight fights against an ______ dragon to protect innocent villagers.","translation":"在許多經典童話故事中，英勇的騎士與邪惡的巨龍搏鬥，以保護無辜的村民。"},{"word":"wild","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"living in natural conditions; not tamed; uncontrolled","chinese":"野生的；狂野的","sentence":"When we walked deep into the mountain national park, we saw several ______ horses grazing peacefully on the green slope.","translation":"當我們深入走進高山國家公園時，我們看見幾匹野馬在綠色山坡上平靜地吃草。"},{"word":"gentle","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"calm, kind, and soft; not rough or violent","chinese":"溫和的；溫柔的","sentence":"The nurse had a very ______ touch when she cleaned the little baby's wound, so the child never cried at all.","translation":"護士在清理小嬰兒的傷口時動作非常溫柔，所以孩子一點也沒有哭泣。"},{"word":"gentleman","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a polite, gracious, and honorable man","chinese":"紳士；有教養的男士","sentence":"Mr. White is a true ______ who always holds the elevator door open for elderly neighbors and speaks respectfully.","translation":"懷特先生是一位真正的紳士，他總是為年長的鄰居按住電梯門並恭敬地說話。"},{"word":"talkative","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"tending to talk a lot in social situations","chinese":"健談的；愛說話的","sentence":"My cousin is extremely ______ whenever we meet at family reunions, and she can talk about fashion for hours.","translation":"每當我們在家族聚會上見面時，我的表妹都極其健談，她可以聊時尚聊上好幾個小時。"},{"word":"chubby","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"pleasantly fat and rounded, especially of children","chinese":"圓胖的；豐滿可愛的","sentence":"The six-month-old baby had ______ cheeks and bright sparkling eyes, so everyone in the room wanted to hug him.","translation":"那個六個月大的嬰兒有著胖嘟嘟的臉頰和明亮的大眼睛，所以房間裡的每個人都想抱他。"},{"word":"skinny","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"very thin, often too thin or bony","chinese":"消瘦的；骨瘦如柴的","sentence":"After suffering from a high fever for two whole weeks, the poor boy looked pale and remarkably ______.","translation":"在連續發高燒整整兩週之後，那個可憐的男孩看起來臉色蒼白且非常消瘦。"},{"word":"slender","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"gracefully thin, slim, and attractive","chinese":"修長的；苗條優雅的","sentence":"The talented pianist has long, ______ fingers that glide smoothly across the black and white piano keys.","translation":"那位天才鋼琴家具備修長而優雅的手指，在黑白琴鍵上流暢地滑動。"},{"word":"slim","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"attractively thin; slender in build; slight","chinese":"苗條的；纖細的","sentence":"By exercising regularly and following a balanced diet, Amanda managed to maintain a healthy and ______ figure.","translation":"透過定期運動與均衡飲食，阿曼達成功保持了健康且苗條的身材。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The handsome prince bowed gracefully and offered his coat to the shivering lady, acting like a perfect ______.","options":["gentleman","monster","loser","enemy"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: gentleman (紳士) 【全文中譯】英俊的王子優雅地鞠躬並將外套給了發抖的女士，舉止就像一位完美的紳士。 【選項解析】(A) gentleman 紳士 (B) monster 怪物 (C) loser 失敗者 (D) enemy 敵人。彬彬有禮的男士為 gentleman。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The stray puppy had been starving on the streets for weeks, so its legs were painfully ______ when rescuers found it.","options":["chubby","talkative","skinny","gentle"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: skinny (消瘦的；皮包骨的) 【全文中譯】那隻流浪小狗在街上挨餓了好幾個星期，救援人員發現它時，它的雙腿瘦得令人心痛。 【選項解析】(A) chubby 胖嘟嘟的 (B) talkative 健談的 (C) skinny 消瘦的 (D) gentle 溫柔的。長期挨餓導致 skinny。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The mother used a soft towel and a ______ voice to soothe her frightened toddler back to sleep.","options":["sneaky","gentle","wild","chubby"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: gentle (溫和的；溫柔的) 【全文中譯】母親用柔軟的毛巾與溫柔的聲音安撫受驚嚇的幼童重新入睡。 【選項解析】(A) sneaky 鬼祟的 (B) gentle 溫和的 (C) wild 狂野的 (D) chubby 豐滿的。安撫孩子用 gentle voice。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Taking money secretly out of your mother's purse while she is cooking dinner is a very ______ and unacceptable deed.","options":["slender","sneaky","chubby","gentle"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: sneaky (鬼鬼祟祟的；狡猾的) 【全文中譯】趁母親在煮晚餐時偷偷從她皮包裡拿錢，是一種非常狡猾且不可接受的行為。 【選項解析】(A) slender 苗條的 (B) sneaky 狡詐鬼祟的 (C) chubby 圓胖的 (D) gentle 溫和的。偷竊摸索屬於 sneaky。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The baby smiled happily at his grandmother and waved his cute, ______ little hands in the air.","options":["chubby","talkative","sneaky","wild"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: chubby (圓胖的；胖嘟嘟的) 【全文中譯】小嬰兒對祖母開心地微笑，並在空中揮舞著他可愛、胖嘟嘟的小手。 【選項解析】(A) chubby 胖乎乎的 (B) talkative 愛說話的 (C) sneaky 鬼祟的 (D) wild 野性的。嬰兒可愛肉嘟嘟為 chubby。"},{"number":6,"stem":"In the dramatic comic book, the superhero spent years trying to stop the ______ villain from destroying the metropolis.","options":["gentle","evil","slender","chubby"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: evil (邪惡的) 【全文中譯】在扣人心弦的漫畫中，超級英雄耗費數年試圖阻止邪惡的反派毀滅這座大都會。 【選項解析】(A) gentle 溫柔的 (B) evil 邪惡的 (C) slender 修長的 (D) chubby 圓胖的。毀滅城市的大反派為 evil villain。"},{"number":7,"stem":"Maria was so ______ during the bus ride that she told three funny stories before we even arrived at the station.","options":["talkative","skinny","sneaky","evil"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: talkative (健談的) 【全文中譯】瑪麗亞在搭公車期間非常健談，我們甚至還沒到站她就講了三個有趣的故事。 【選項解析】(A) talkative 健談的 (B) skinny 瘦弱的 (C) sneaky 狡猾的 (D) evil 邪惡的。滔滔不絕講故事為 talkative。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The professional fashion model kept herself in excellent shape and wore a gorgeous dress that accentuated her ______ waist.","options":["wild","slim","chubby","talkative"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: slim (苗條的) 【全文中譯】專業時裝模特兒保持著絕佳的身材，身穿一襲凸顯她苗條腰身的華美禮服。 【選項解析】(A) wild 狂野的 (B) slim 苗條的 (C) chubby 圓潤的 (D) talkative 健談的。身材勻稱窈窕為 slim。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The violinist possessed extraordinarily long and ______ fingers, allowing her to reach difficult musical notes effortlessly.","options":["evil","slender","chubby","sneaky"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: slender (修長的) 【全文中譯】小提琴家擁有特別修長的手指，使她能夠毫不費力地按到難度極高的音符。 【選項解析】(A) evil 邪惡的 (B) slender 修長的 (C) chubby 圓胖的 (D) sneaky 鬼祟的。鋼琴家/提琴家的手指常形容為 slender。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Kangaroos and koalas are famous ______ animals that roam freely across vast Australian grasslands and forests.","options":["wild","talkative","chubby","gentle"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: wild (野生的) 【全文中譯】袋鼠與無尾熊是著名的野生動物，在澳洲廣袤的草原與森林中自由漫步。 【選項解析】(A) wild 野生的 (B) talkative 健談的 (C) chubby 肥胖的 (D) gentle 溫順的。野生動物為 wild animals。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Don't be so ______; if you want to borrow my camera, just ask me directly instead of taking it quietly.","options":["slender","sneaky","chubby","gentle"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: sneaky (鬼鬼祟祟的) 【全文中譯】別那麼鬼鬼祟祟；如果你想借我的相機，直接開口問我就好，不要悄悄拿走。 【選項解析】(A) slender 苗條的 (B) sneaky 鬼祟的 (C) chubby 圓胖的 (D) gentle 溫柔的。偷拿東西的行徑為 sneaky。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Everyone loves spending time with Uncle Ben because he is a courteous ______ who treats all guests with great dignity.","options":["gentleman","monster","loser","soldier"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: gentleman (紳士) 【全文中譯】大家都喜歡與班叔叔相處，因為他是一位謙恭有禮的紳士，非常尊重地對待所有客人。 【選項解析】(A) gentleman 紳士 (B) monster 怪物 (C) loser 失敗者 (D) soldier 士兵。禮遇客人的男士為 gentleman。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The summer storm blew through the valley with ______ winds that knocked down several trees along the road.","options":["wild","chubby","talkative","slender"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: wild (狂暴的；猛烈的) 【全文中譯】夏日風暴夾帶著狂暴的強風掠過山谷，吹倒了沿路的好幾棵大樹。 【選項解析】(A) wild 狂野狂暴的 (B) chubby 圓潤的 (C) talkative 多話的 (D) slender 纖細的。強勁風暴為 wild winds。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The kindergarten teacher spoke in a ______ tone so that the nervous children would not feel frightened on their first day.","options":["gentle","sneaky","wild","skinny"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: gentle (溫和的) 【全文中譯】幼兒園老師用溫和的語調說話，好讓緊張的孩子們在第一天上學時不會感到害怕。 【選項解析】(A) gentle 溫和的 (B) sneaky 鬼祟的 (C) wild 狂野的 (D) skinny 瘦削的。安撫幼兒的語氣為 gentle tone。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Little Tommy ate hearty meals every single day, so his smiling face and ______ cheeks made him look adorable.","options":["chubby","sneaky","evil","talkative"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: chubby (圓胖可愛的) 【全文中譯】小湯米每天都吃豐盛的正餐，所以他笑嘻嘻的臉龐與胖嘟嘟的臉頰讓他看起來十分可愛。 【選項解析】(A) chubby 胖嘟嘟的 (B) sneaky 狡猾的 (C) evil 邪惡的 (D) talkative 健談的。可愛肉臉頰為 chubby cheeks。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Although he eats large bowls of noodles three times a day, Kevin remains quite ______ because he plays soccer daily.","options":["talkative","chubby","skinny","evil"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: skinny (瘦弱的) 【全文中譯】雖然凱文每天吃三大碗麵，但他依然相當瘦，因為他每天都在踢足球。 【選項解析】(A) talkative 健談的 (B) chubby 胖的 (C) skinny 骨瘦的 (D) evil 壞的。怎麼吃都不長肉為 skinny。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Ballet dancers usually maintain a ______ body through strict training, enabling them to leap gracefully across the stage.","options":["slim","chubby","sneaky","talkative"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: slim (苗條纖細的) 【全文中譯】芭蕾舞者通常透過嚴格的訓練保持苗條的身形，使她們能夠在舞台上優雅地躍起。 【選項解析】(A) slim 苗條的 (B) chubby 圓胖的 (C) sneaky 鬼祟的 (D) talkative 多話的。維持舞者體態為 slim body。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The tall young woman walked with graceful posture, and her ______ silhouette caught the attention of everyone in the hall.","options":["slender","chubby","talkative","sneaky"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: slender (修長苗條的) 【全文中譯】身材高挑的年輕女子步態優雅，她修長的剪影吸引了大廳裡所有人的目光。 【選項解析】(A) slender 修長的 (B) chubby 圓胖的 (C) talkative 多話的 (D) sneaky 偷偷摸摸的。婀娜修長身形為 slender silhouette。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Ancient legends tell stories of an ______ witch who lived in the dark woods and turned greedy travelers into frogs.","options":["evil","gentle","chubby","talkative"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: evil (邪惡的) 【全文中譯】古老傳說講述了一位住在黑森林裡的邪惡巫婆的故事，她把貪婪的旅人變成了青蛙。 【選項解析】(A) evil 邪惡的 (B) gentle 溫柔的 (C) chubby 胖乎乎的 (D) talkative 健談的。童話巫婆為 evil witch。"},{"number":20,"stem":"My seatmate on the long train trip was very ______, telling me all about his university life in Canada.","options":["talkative","chubby","skinny","wild"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: talkative (健談的) 【全文中譯】我在漫長火車旅途中的鄰座非常健談，跟我聊了許多他在加拿大的大學生活。 【選項解析】(A) talkative 健談的 (B) chubby 胖的 (C) skinny 骨瘦的 (D) wild 野蠻的。旅途中愛聊天的伴侶為 talkative。"},{"number":21,"stem":"A polite ______ will always offer his seat to pregnant women or elderly citizens on a crowded bus.","options":["gentleman","monster","thief","enemy"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: gentleman (紳士) 【全文中譯】一位有禮貌的紳士在擁擠的公車上總是會主動給孕婦或年長市民讓座。 【選項解析】(A) gentleman 紳士 (B) monster 怪物 (C) thief 竊賊 (D) enemy 敵人。主動讓座之男士為 gentleman。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The fox made a ______ maneuver through the tall grass, attempting to snatch a chicken from the coop.","options":["sneaky","chubby","gentle","talkative"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: sneaky (狡猾鬼祟的) 【全文中譯】狐狸在茂密的草叢中進行了一次鬼鬼祟祟的走位，試圖從雞舍裡抓走一隻雞。 【選項解析】(A) sneaky 鬼祟狡詐的 (B) chubby 圓胖的 (C) gentle 溫柔的 (D) talkative 健談的。捕獵隱匿動作為 sneaky maneuver。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The wild rose that grew near the river had small pink blossoms and gave off a light, ______ scent in the evening.","options":["gentle","sneaky","chubby","evil"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: gentle (柔和的；淡雅的) 【全文中譯】生長在河邊的野玫瑰開著粉紅色的花朵，在傍晚散發出淡淡柔和的清香。 【選項解析】(A) gentle 柔和清淡的 (B) sneaky 鬼祟的 (C) chubby 圓胖的 (D) evil 罪惡的。淡雅清香為 gentle scent。"},{"number":24,"stem":"After months of intense running practice, David's body became remarkably ______ and fit for the marathon.","options":["slim","chubby","talkative","sneaky"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: slim (苗條勻稱的) 【全文中譯】經過數月高強度的跑步訓練後，戴維的身材變得非常苗條勻稱且適合跑馬拉松。 【選項解析】(A) slim 苗條健康的 (B) chubby 胖胖的 (C) talkative 愛說話的 (D) sneaky 狡猾的。長跑訓練打造 slim figure。"},{"number":25,"stem":"The medical doctor warned the teenager that being dangerously ______ could harm her immune system.","options":["skinny","talkative","gentle","wild"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: skinny (過度消瘦的) 【全文中譯】醫生警告這名年輕女孩，危險的過度消瘦可能會損害她的免疫系統機能。 【選項解析】(A) skinny 皮包骨的 (B) talkative 健談的 (C) gentle 溫順的 (D) wild 野蠻的。dangerously skinny 指病態消瘦。"}]},{"unit":44,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 44 (044.mp3) Topic: Human Beings, Aesthetics, Competition & Conflict","topic":"Topic: Human Beings, Aesthetics, Competition & Conflict | Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"lovely","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"attractive, delightful, or very pleasant","chinese":"可愛的；美好的","sentence":"The small mountain town looked very ______ in the autumn morning, and many tourists took wonderful pictures of the scenery.","translation":"這座山區小鎮在秋天早晨看起來非常美好，許多遊客拍攝了絕妙的風景照片。"},{"word":"ugly","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"unpleasant to look at; not attractive","chinese":"醜陋的；難看的","sentence":"The old factory building was dirty and ______, so the city council decided to rebuild it into a modern art center.","translation":"那棟舊工廠建築又髒又醜陋，因此市議會決定將其改建為一座現代藝術中心。"},{"word":"winner","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person or team that wins a game or competition","chinese":"贏家；勝利者","sentence":"When the final whistle blew, the captain of the football team stepped forward to receive the gold trophy as the proud ______.","translation":"當終場哨聲響起時，足球隊隊長走上前去，作為自豪的贏家接過黃金獎盃。"},{"word":"loser","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person or team that is defeated in a competition","chinese":"輸家；失敗者","sentence":"Nobody enjoys being the ______ in a competitive match, but good sportsmanship teaches us to respect our opponents.","translation":"在激烈的比賽中沒有人喜歡當失敗者，但良好的運動家精神教會我們要尊重對手。"},{"word":"race","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a running contest of speed; ethnic group; to compete","chinese":"賽跑；競賽；種族；狂奔","sentence":"Hundreds of athletic students gathered on the school track to participate in the exciting annual relay ______.","translation":"數百名熱愛運動的學生聚集在學校跑道上，參加令人興奮的年度接力賽跑。"},{"word":"human","pos":"(n.) / (adj.)","definition":"a person; characteristic of people","chinese":"人類；人；人類的","sentence":"Unlike most animals, ______ beings have the unique ability to create complex languages and record history.","translation":"與大多數動物不同，人類具備創造複雜語言並記錄歷史的獨特能力。"},{"word":"soul","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the spiritual or immaterial part of a human being","chinese":"靈魂；精神；心靈","sentence":"Listening to classical piano music late at night brought peaceful comfort to her tired ______ after a long workday.","translation":"深夜聆聽古典鋼琴音樂，為她漫長工作日後疲憊的心靈帶來了平靜的安慰。"},{"word":"monster","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a cruel, frightening, or imaginary creature","chinese":"怪獸；怪物","sentence":"The scary movie featured a giant green ______ that rose from the deep ocean and terrified the peaceful city.","translation":"那部恐怖電影描繪了一隻從深海中爬出並驚嚇寧靜城市的巨大綠色怪獸。"},{"word":"war","pos":"(n.)","definition":"armed fighting between countries or groups","chinese":"戰爭","sentence":"Peaceful negotiations were held between leaders, because nobody wanted a destructive ______ to ruin both nations.","translation":"各國領袖之間舉行了和平談判，因為沒有人希望一場具毀滅性的戰爭摧毀兩個國家。"},{"word":"army","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a large, organized military force for fighting on land","chinese":"陸軍；軍隊","sentence":"After completing his university degree, Samuel decided to join the national ______ and serve his country proudly.","translation":"完成大學學業後，塞繆爾決定加入國家陸軍並自豪地為國效力。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"During the intense marathon ______, runners from thirty different countries competed fiercely under the scorching sun.","options":["race","war","army","soul"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: race (比賽；競賽) 【全文中譯】在激烈的馬拉松賽跑中，來自三十個不同國家的跑者在烈日下激烈競爭。 【選項解析】(A) race 賽跑 (B) war 戰爭 (C) army 軍隊 (D) soul 靈魂。marathon race（馬拉松賽跑）。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The fairy tale tells the story of an ______ duckling that eventually grew up into a magnificent white swan.","options":["lovely","ugly","human","gentle"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: ugly (醜陋的) 【全文中譯】這則童話故事講述了一隻醜小鴨最終長成一隻美麗壯觀的白天鵝的故事。 【選項解析】(A) lovely 可愛美好的 (B) ugly 醜陋的 (C) human 人類的 (D) gentle 溫柔的。ugly duckling（醜小鴨）。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The proud ______ of the English speech contest was awarded a shiny medal and a trip to London.","options":["winner","loser","monster","human"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: winner (贏家；優勝者) 【全文中譯】英語演講比賽自豪的優勝者被授予了一枚閃亮的獎牌與一次倫敦之旅。 【選項解析】(A) winner 贏家 (B) loser 輸家 (C) monster 怪物 (D) human 人類。獲得金牌與旅遊獎勵者為 winner。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Millions of soldiers and civilians lost their lives during World ______ II, causing unprecedented global sorrow.","options":["War","Race","Soul","Army"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: war (戰爭) 【全文中譯】在第二次世界大戰期間，數百萬士兵和平民喪生，造成了空前的全球悲痛。 【選項解析】(A) War 戰爭 (B) Race 競賽 (C) Soul 靈魂 (D) Army 軍隊。World War II（第二次世界大戰）。"},{"number":5,"stem":"We spent a truly ______ afternoon sitting on the sunlit terrace, enjoying warm tea and chocolate cookies.","options":["lovely","ugly","sneaky","evil"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: lovely (美好的；令人愉快的) 【全文中譯】我們坐在陽光灑落的露台上度過了一個非常美好的下午，享用著熱茶與巧克力餅乾。 【選項解析】(A) lovely 美好的 (B) ugly 難看的 (C) sneaky 鬼祟的 (D) evil 罪惡的。愉快下午為 lovely afternoon。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Scientists are still studying whether ______ beings can safely establish permanent colonies on planet Mars.","options":["human","monster","winner","loser"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: human (人類) 【全文中譯】科學家仍在研究人類是否能夠在火星上安全建立永久殖民地。 【選項解析】(A) human 人類的 (B) monster 怪物的 (C) winner 贏家的 (D) loser 失敗者的。human beings（人類）。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The young novelist believed that poetry is the ultimate expression of the human ______ and its deep emotions.","options":["soul","race","army","war"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: soul (心靈；靈魂) 【全文中譯】那位年輕小說家認為詩歌是人類心靈及其深層情感的極致表達。 【選項解析】(A) soul 心靈 (B) race 種族 (C) army 軍隊 (D) war 戰爭。human soul（人類心靈）。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The government deployed the ______ to assist rescue teams and build temporary shelters after the massive earthquake.","options":["army","soul","race","monster"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: army (陸軍；軍隊) 【全文中譯】強震發生後，政府調動軍隊協助救援隊伍並搭建臨時避難所。 【選項解析】(A) army 軍隊 (B) soul 靈魂 (C) race 競賽 (D) monster 怪物。調派軍隊救災為 deploy the army。"},{"number":9,"stem":"In the frightening legend, a horrible sea ______ attacked wooden fishing vessels whenever thunder echoed across the bay.","options":["monster","winner","human","gentleman"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: monster (海怪；怪獸) 【全文中譯】在令人毛骨悚然的傳說中，每當雷聲在海灣迴響，可怕的海怪就會襲擊木製漁船。 【選項解析】(A) monster 怪物 (B) winner 贏家 (C) human 人類 (D) gentleman 紳士。傳說中的海中巨獸為 sea monster。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Even though our basketball team was the ______ in the final championship game, the coach commended our brave effort.","options":["loser","winner","monster","gentleman"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: loser (輸家；失敗者) 【全文中譯】即使我們的籃球隊在總決賽中落敗成為輸家，教練依然讚揚了我們英勇的努力。 【選項解析】(A) loser 輸家 (B) winner 贏家 (C) monster 怪物 (D) gentleman 紳士。決賽落敗的一方為 loser。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Discrimination based on ______ or skin color is strictly prohibited by human rights declarations worldwide.","options":["race","soul","war","army"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: race (種族) 【全文中譯】全球人權宣言嚴格禁止基於種族或膚色的任何歧視行為。 【選項解析】(A) race 種族 (B) soul 靈魂 (C) war 戰爭 (D) army 軍隊。基於種族的歧視為 discrimination based on race。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The historical museum exhibits military uniforms, heavy guns, and weapons used by the continental ______.","options":["army","soul","race","winner"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: army (陸軍；軍隊) 【全文中譯】歷史博物館展出了大陸軍部隊曾使用過的軍服、重型槍枝與各類武器。 【選項解析】(A) army 軍隊 (B) soul 靈魂 (C) race 賽跑 (D) winner 獲勝者。continental army（大陸軍）。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The grandmother planted fragrant roses and sweet lavender, turning her front yard into a ______ floral garden.","options":["lovely","ugly","sneaky","wild"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: lovely (美麗美好的) 【全文中譯】祖母種植了芬芳的玫瑰與香甜的薰衣草，將她的前院變成了一座美麗的花卉花園。 【選項解析】(A) lovely 令人愉悅美麗的 (B) ugly 醜陋的 (C) sneaky 鬼祟的 (D) wild 野蠻的。美麗庭園為 lovely floral garden。"},{"number":14,"stem":"It is essential for democratic nations to avoid useless ______ and solve international conflicts through diplomatic talks.","options":["war","race","soul","army"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: war (戰爭) 【全文中譯】民主國家必須避免無謂的戰爭，並透過外交對話解決國際衝突。 【選項解析】(A) war 戰爭 (B) race 競賽 (C) soul 靈魂 (D) army 軍隊。avoid useless war（避免無謂戰爭）。"},{"number":15,"stem":"True champions show great modesty in victory and treat the defeated ______ with kindness and sympathy.","options":["loser","winner","monster","human"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: loser (失敗者；輸家) 【全文中譯】真正的冠軍在獲勝時表現謙遜，並以友善與同理心對待落敗的輸家。 【選項解析】(A) loser 輸家 (B) winner 贏家 (C) monster 怪物 (D) human 人類。defeat the loser（擊敗對手/輸家）。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Leaving piles of plastic trash and broken bottles on the scenic beach makes the coastline look terribly ______.","options":["ugly","lovely","slender","gentle"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: ugly (醜陋難看的) 【全文中譯】在風景優美的海灘上遺留成堆塑膠垃圾和碎玻璃瓶，會讓海岸線看起來難看至極。 【選項解析】(A) ugly 難看醜陋的 (B) lovely 美麗的 (C) slender 苗條的 (D) gentle 溫柔的。垃圾破壞景觀顯得 ugly。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Compassion and kindness toward weaker members of society are fundamental virtues of any civilized ______ society.","options":["human","monster","winner","loser"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: human (人類的) 【全文中譯】對社會中弱勢成員的同情與善良，是任何文明人類社會的基本美德。 【選項解析】(A) human 人類的 (B) monster 怪獸的 (C) winner 贏家的 (D) loser 輸家的。human society（人類社會）。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Listening to the quiet rain falling against the window seemed to refresh her spirit and calm her troubled ______.","options":["soul","race","army","war"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: soul (心靈；靈魂) 【全文中譯】聆聽窗外靜靜落下的雨聲，似乎能撫平並提振她煩亂的心靈。 【選項解析】(A) soul 心靈 (B) race 種族 (C) army 軍隊 (D) war 戰爭。calm her troubled soul（撫平不安的心靈）。"},{"number":19,"stem":"The children screamed with excitement when a person dressed as a fluffy blue ______ entered the birthday party.","options":["monster","winner","loser","human"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: monster (怪獸) 【全文中譯】當一個打扮成蓬鬆藍色怪獸的人走進生日派對時，孩子們興奮地尖叫起來。 【選項解析】(A) monster 怪獸 (B) winner 贏家 (C) loser 輸家 (D) human 人類。裝扮成絨毛怪獸為 fluffy monster。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The first runner to cross the finish line in the hundred-meter sprint was celebrated as the undisputed ______.","options":["winner","loser","monster","human"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: winner (贏家；冠軍) 【全文中譯】在百米短跑中第一個衝過終點線的選手，被譽為無可爭議的獲勝者。 【選項解析】(A) winner 贏家 (B) loser 輸家 (C) monster 怪物 (D) human 人類。短跑奪冠者為 undisputed winner。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Thousands of spectators cheered loudly as the cars sped down the track during the Grand Prix motor ______.","options":["race","war","soul","army"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: race (賽車；競賽) 【全文中譯】在大獎賽賽車比賽期間，當賽車在賽道上飛馳時，數千名觀眾大聲歡呼。 【選項解析】(A) race 競賽；賽車 (B) war 戰爭 (C) soul 靈魂 (D) army 軍隊。motor race（賽車競賽）。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The elderly woman possessed a gentle smile and a warm personality, making her a ______ companion to everyone.","options":["lovely","ugly","evil","sneaky"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: lovely (可愛親切的) 【全文中譯】那位年長女士擁有溫柔的笑容和熱情的個性，這讓她成為每個人身邊親切可愛的伴侶。 【選項解析】(A) lovely 令人喜愛的 (B) ugly 醜陋的 (C) evil 邪惡的 (D) sneaky 鬼祟的。lovely companion（討人喜歡的同伴）。"},{"number":23,"stem":"To prevent unnecessary bloodshed, the general ordered his entire ______ to withdraw from the border immediately.","options":["army","race","soul","monster"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: army (軍隊) 【全文中譯】為了防止不必要的流血衝突，將軍命令他的整個軍隊立刻從邊界撤退。 【選項解析】(A) army 軍隊 (B) race 競賽 (C) soul 靈魂 (D) monster 怪物。將軍統領軍隊為 army。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The terrifying roar of the mythical cave ______ made all the adventurous treasure hunters freeze in terror.","options":["monster","human","winner","gentleman"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: monster (怪獸) 【全文中譯】神話中洞穴怪獸可怕的咆哮聲，讓所有冒險尋寶者嚇得動彈不得。 【選項解析】(A) monster 怪獸 (B) human 人類 (C) winner 贏家 (D) gentleman 紳士。洞穴巨怪為 cave monster。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Civil ______ tore the country apart for decades, destroying historic towns and displacing millions of families.","options":["war","race","soul","army"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: war (內戰；戰爭) 【全文中譯】內戰摧毀了這個國家數十年，破壞了歷史古鎮並使數百萬家庭流離失所。 【選項解析】(A) war 戰爭 (B) race 種族 (C) soul 靈魂 (D) army 軍隊。Civil war（內戰）。"}]},{"unit":45,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 45 (045.mp3) Topic: Armed Forces, Warfare & National Defense","topic":"Topic: Armed Forces, Warfare & National Defense | Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"military","pos":"(adj.) / (n.)","definition":"relating to the armed forces; soldiers collectively","chinese":"軍事的；軍隊","sentence":"All young citizens in that country must complete one year of compulsory ______ service after high school.","translation":"該國的所有年輕公民在高中畢業後都必須完成一年的義務軍事服役。"},{"word":"soldier","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person who serves in an army","chinese":"軍人；士兵","sentence":"The brave young ______ guarded the mountain post all night despite the freezing blizzard and strong wind.","translation":"儘管遭遇嚴寒的暴風雪與強風，那位英勇的年輕士兵依然整夜守衛著哨所。"},{"word":"enemy","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person, group, or country that fights against another","chinese":"敵人；敵軍","sentence":"The patrol unit moved quietly through the dense forest, making sure that no ______ forces were hiding nearby.","translation":"巡邏隊在茂密的森林中悄悄行進，確保附近沒有隱藏任何敵軍部隊。"},{"word":"bomb","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"an explosive weapon; to attack with explosives","chinese":"炸彈；轟炸","sentence":"The police evacuated the busy train station immediately after finding a suspicious package suspected of being a ______.","translation":"在發現一個疑似炸彈的可疑包裹後，警方立即疏散了繁忙的火車站。"},{"word":"gun","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a weapon that shoots bullets or shells","chinese":"槍；手槍；步槍","sentence":"Strict firearm laws prevent ordinary citizens from carrying a concealed ______ in crowded public shopping centers.","translation":"嚴格的槍枝法律防止普通公民在擁擠的公共購物中心攜帶隱蔽手槍。"},{"word":"weapon","pos":"(n.)","definition":"any object used for fighting, attacking, or defense","chinese":"武器；兵器","sentence":"Security officers at the international airport use modern scanners to detect any dangerous concealed ______.","translation":"國際機場的安檢人員使用現代掃描器檢測任何隱藏的危險武器。"},{"word":"attack","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to try to hurt or defeat using force; an assault","chinese":"攻擊；襲擊；進攻","sentence":"The enemy troops launched a sudden air ______ on the harbor before dawn, damaging several transport ships.","translation":"敵軍在黎明前對港口發動了突然的空中襲擊，損壞了數艘運輸船。"},{"word":"fight","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to use force against an opponent (fight / fought / fought)","chinese":"作戰；打鬥；奮鬥","sentence":"Civil rights leaders ______ tirelessly for racial equality, inspiring millions of people across the continent.","translation":"民權領袖們為種族平等不知疲倦地奮鬥，激勵了整個大陸的數百萬人。"},{"word":"victory","pos":"(n.)","definition":"success in winning a contest, war, or struggle","chinese":"勝利；獲勝","sentence":"After months of intense political campaigning, the candidate celebrated her decisive ______ in the election.","translation":"經過數月激烈的政治競選，該候選人慶祝了她在選舉中的決定性勝利。"},{"word":"freedom","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the power or right to act, speak, or think without hindrance","chinese":"自由；獨立","sentence":"Democratic societies value ______ of speech as one of the most fundamental constitutional principles.","translation":"民主社會將言論自由視為最基本的憲法原則之一。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Security guards at the concert entrance thoroughly searched every backpack to ensure nobody brought a dangerous ______ inside.","options":["weapon","victory","freedom","soldier"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: weapon (武器) 【全文中譯】演唱會入口處的保全人員徹底搜查了每個背包，以確保無人將危險武器帶入內部。 【選項解析】(A) weapon 武器 (B) victory 勝利 (C) freedom 自由 (D) soldier 士兵。dangerous weapon（危險武器）。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The air force fighter jets dropped precision-guided ______ on the enemy's ammunition warehouse during the raid.","options":["bombs","soldiers","enemies","victories"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: bombs (炸彈) 【全文中譯】空軍戰鬥機在空襲期間向敵方的彈藥庫投下了精確導引炸彈。 【選項解析】(A) bombs 炸彈 (B) soldiers 士兵 (C) enemies 敵人 (D) victories 勝利。投擲炸彈為 drop bombs。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Many brave ______ from our hometown received medals of honor for defending the country with great courage.","options":["soldiers","weapons","bombs","attacks"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: soldiers (士兵；軍人) 【全文中譯】來自我們家鄉的許多英勇軍人因以莫大的勇氣保衛國家而榮獲榮譽勳章。 【選項解析】(A) soldiers 士兵 (B) weapons 武器 (C) bombs 炸彈 (D) attacks 攻擊。保衛國家的戰士為 soldiers。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Nelson Mandela dedicated his entire life to the noble struggle for personal and political ______ in South Africa.","options":["freedom","weapon","bomb","attack"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: freedom (自由) 【全文中譯】納爾遜·曼德拉將他的一生奉獻給南非人民爭取個人與政治自由的崇高奮鬥。 【選項解析】(A) freedom 自由 (B) weapon 武器 (C) bomb 炸彈 (D) attack 襲擊。struggle for freedom（爭取自由）。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The army launched an unexpected ground ______ against the fortress, catching the defending forces completely by surprise.","options":["attack","freedom","weapon","victory"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: attack (攻擊；突襲) 【全文中譯】陸軍對該堡壘發動了意想不到的地面進攻，令守軍措手不及。 【選項解析】(A) attack 進攻 (B) freedom 自由 (C) weapon 武器 (D) victory 勝利。launch ground attack（發動地面進攻）。"},{"number":6,"stem":"After years of military conflict, both governments signed a historic peace agreement to end the destructive ______.","options":["fight","weapon","freedom","bomb"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: fight (作戰；戰鬥) 【全文中譯】歷經多年的軍事衝突後，兩國政府簽署了一項歷史性的和平協議，以結束具毀滅性的戰鬥。 【選項解析】(A) fight 戰鬥 (B) weapon 武器 (C) freedom 自由 (D) bomb 炸彈。end the fight（終結戰鬥）。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The national team's stunning ______ against the reigning world champions caused wild celebrations in the capital.","options":["victory","weapon","bomb","attack"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: victory (勝利) 【全文中譯】國家隊擊敗衛冕世界冠軍的驚人勝利，在首都引發了狂歡慶祝。 【選項解析】(A) victory 勝利 (B) weapon 武器 (C) bomb 炸彈 (D) attack 襲擊。stunning victory（令人驚嘆的勝利）。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The patrol spotted a group of armed ______ soldiers creeping across the northern border under cover of night.","options":["enemy","freedom","victory","weapon"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: enemy (敵軍的；敵人的) 【全文中譯】巡邏隊發現一隊全副武裝的敵軍士兵在夜色掩護下潛越北部邊界。 【選項解析】(A) enemy 敵人的 (B) freedom 自由的 (C) victory 勝利的 (D) weapon 武器的。enemy soldiers（敵軍士兵）。"},{"number":9,"stem":"In some countries, high school graduates must complete two years of mandatory ______ training before entering college.","options":["military","lovely","unique","selfish"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: military (軍事的) 【全文中譯】在某些國家，高中畢業生在進入大學之前必須完成兩年的義務軍事訓練。 【選項解析】(A) military 軍事的 (B) lovely 可愛的 (C) unique 獨特的 (D) selfish 自私的。military training（軍事訓練）。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Police officers are required to keep their service ______ securely holstered whenever they patrol urban streets.","options":["guns","bombs","victories","attacks"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: guns (槍枝；警槍) 【全文中譯】警官在市區街道巡邏時，必須將值勤配槍牢固地放在槍套中。 【選項解析】(A) guns 槍枝 (B) bombs 炸彈 (C) victories 勝利 (D) attacks 攻擊。service guns（值勤配槍）。"},{"number":11,"stem":"International humanitarian organizations condemned the brutal chemical ______ carried out on helpless civilian neighborhoods.","options":["attack","freedom","victory","soldier"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: attack (襲擊；攻擊) 【全文中譯】國際人道組織譴責了針對無助平民社區進行的殘酷化學武器襲擊。 【選項解析】(A) attack 襲擊 (B) freedom 自由 (C) victory 勝利 (D) soldier 士兵。chemical attack（化學武器攻擊）。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The courageous ______ risked his own life to carry his injured comrade back to the field hospital safely.","options":["soldier","weapon","bomb","victory"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: soldier (士兵) 【全文中譯】英勇的士兵冒著生命危險，將受傷的戰友安全帶回野戰醫院。 【選項解析】(A) soldier 士兵 (B) weapon 武器 (C) bomb 炸彈 (D) victory 勝利。courageous soldier（英勇士兵）。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Winning independence allowed the newly established republic to enjoy religious and economic ______.","options":["freedom","weapon","bomb","enemy"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: freedom (自由) 【全文中譯】贏得獨立使這個新建立的共和國得以享有宗教與經濟自由。 【選項解析】(A) freedom 自由 (B) weapon 武器 (C) bomb 炸彈 (D) enemy 敵人。religious and economic freedom（宗教與經濟自由）。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Ancient Roman warriors fought bravely in battle using bronze swords and heavy iron shields as their primary ______.","options":["weapons","freedoms","victories","soldiers"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: weapons (兵器；武器) 【全文中譯】古羅馬戰士在戰鬥中英勇作戰，使用青銅劍和沉重的鐵盾作為他們的主要武器。 【選項解析】(A) weapons 武器 (B) freedoms 自由 (C) victories 勝利 (D) soldiers 士兵。primary weapons（主要武器）。"},{"number":15,"stem":"An unexploded World War II ______ was discovered beneath the construction site, forcing thousands of residents to evacuate.","options":["bomb","soldier","victory","freedom"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: bomb (未爆彈；炸彈) 【全文中譯】在建築工地地下發現了一枚二戰未爆彈，迫使數千名居民緊急疏散。 【選項解析】(A) bomb 炸彈 (B) soldier 士兵 (C) victory 勝利 (D) freedom 自由。unexploded bomb（未爆彈）。"},{"number":16,"stem":"The naval fleet scored a glorious ______ over the pirates, securing the vital international trade shipping lane.","options":["victory","weapon","bomb","attack"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: victory (勝利) 【全文中譯】海軍艦隊取得了對抗海盜的光榮勝利，保障了重要國際貿易航道的安全。 【選項解析】(A) victory 勝利 (B) weapon 武器 (C) bomb 炸彈 (D) attack 襲擊。glorious victory（光榮勝利）。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Both boxers agreed to ______ fairly according to international sports regulations without any illegal moves.","options":["fight","attack","shoot","bomb"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: fight (搏擊；作戰) 【全文中譯】兩名拳擊手同意根據國際體育規則公平搏擊，不採取任何非法動作。 【選項解析】(A) fight 格鬥 (B) attack 襲擊 (C) shoot 射擊 (D) bomb 轟炸。boxers fight fairly（拳擊手公平競技）。"},{"number":18,"stem":"During the covert operation, the intelligence unit intercepted secret messages sent by the ______ commander.","options":["enemy","lovely","unique","diligent"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: enemy (敵軍的；敵人的) 【全文中譯】在秘密行動中，情報部隊截獲了敵方指揮官發送的機密訊息。 【選項解析】(A) enemy 敵方的 (B) lovely 美好的 (C) unique 獨特的 (D) diligent 勤奮的。enemy commander（敵方指揮官）。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Modern ______ technology includes advanced radar satellites, unmanned drones, and supersonic fighter jets.","options":["military","talkative","slender","polite"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: military (軍事的) 【全文中譯】現代軍事科技包括先進的雷達衛星、無人偵察機以及超音速戰鬥機。 【選項解析】(A) military 軍事的 (B) talkative 健談的 (C) slender 苗條的 (D) polite 有禮貌的。military technology（軍事科技）。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The bank robber pulled out a loaded ______ and ordered the terrified tellers to hand over all the cash.","options":["gun","victory","freedom","attack"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: gun (手槍) 【全文中譯】銀行搶匪拔出一把裝滿子彈的手槍，命令嚇壞的出納員交出所有現金。 【選項解析】(A) gun 槍枝 (B) victory 勝利 (C) freedom 自由 (D) attack 襲擊。loaded gun（裝滿子彈的槍）。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Defending our homeland against foreign ______ is the constitutional duty of every armed forces division.","options":["attack","freedom","victory","soldier"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: attack (進攻；侵襲) 【全文中譯】保衛家園抵禦外來襲擊與侵犯，是各武裝部隊憲法賦予的職責。 【選項解析】(A) attack 攻擊 (B) freedom 自由 (C) victory 勝利 (D) soldier 士兵。foreign attack（外國侵犯）。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Without basic press ______, citizens cannot receive objective news about governmental affairs and decisions.","options":["freedom","weapon","bomb","soldier"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: freedom (自由) 【全文中譯】沒有基本的新聞自由，公民就無法接收到有關政府事務和決策的客觀新聞。 【選項解析】(A) freedom 自由 (B) weapon 武器 (C) bomb 炸彈 (D) soldier 士兵。press freedom（新聞自由）。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The military general was convinced that superior strategy rather than sheer numbers would guarantee their ultimate ______.","options":["victory","weapon","bomb","enemy"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: victory (勝利) 【全文中譯】這位陸軍將領深信，高超的戰略而非單純的人數才是確保最終勝利的關鍵。 【選項解析】(A) victory 勝利 (B) weapon 武器 (C) bomb 炸彈 (D) enemy 敵人。ultimate victory（最終勝利）。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The police officer noticed that the suspect was attempting to draw a concealed ______ from his jacket pocket.","options":["weapon","freedom","victory","soldier"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: weapon (武器) 【全文中譯】警官注意到該嫌疑人正試圖從夾克口袋中拔出一件隱蔽的危險武器。 【選項解析】(A) weapon 武器 (B) freedom 自由 (C) victory 勝利 (D) soldier 士兵。concealed weapon（隱蔽武器）。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Every injured ______ was treated with great care by dedicated nurses in the temporary medical tent.","options":["soldier","weapon","bomb","attack"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: soldier (軍人；傷兵) 【全文中譯】每一位受傷的士兵都在臨時醫療帳篷中受到了敬業護士的悉心照料。 【選項解析】(A) soldier 士兵 (B) weapon 武器 (C) bomb 炸彈 (D) attack 攻擊。injured soldier（傷兵）。"}]},{"unit":46,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 46 (046.mp3) Topic: Success, Failure, Peace & Moral Courage","topic":"Topic: Success, Failure, Peace & Moral Courage | Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"succeed","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to achieve a desired aim or result; to follow","chinese":"成功；達到目的","sentence":"If you work diligently every day and never give up, you will definitely ______ in reaching your career goals.","translation":"如果你每天勤勉工作且永不放棄，你一定會成功實現你的職業目標。"},{"word":"success","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the accomplishment of an aim; favorable outcome","chinese":"成功；成就","sentence":"Her new English novel was a tremendous commercial ______, selling over one million copies in just three months.","translation":"她的新英文小說獲得了巨大的商業成功，在短短三個月內就售出了超過一百萬冊。"},{"word":"fail","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to be unsuccessful in achieving a goal or passing a test","chinese":"失敗；不及格","sentence":"Peter didn't study for the driving test, so he was not surprised to ______ the examination on his first attempt.","translation":"彼得沒有為駕照考試讀書，所以他在第一次嘗試中沒有通過考試並不感到驚訝。"},{"word":"failure","pos":"(n.)","definition":"lack of success; an unsuccessful person or thing","chinese":"失敗；挫折","sentence":"Wise teachers remind students that ______ is the mother of success, teaching us valuable lessons for future attempts.","translation":"有智慧的老師提醒學生失敗是成功之母，為我們未來的嘗試提供了寶貴的教訓。"},{"word":"peace","pos":"(n.)","definition":"freedom from disturbance; tranquility; state of no war","chinese":"和平；平靜；安寧","sentence":"After decades of violent border conflict, both nations finally signed a treaty and achieved lasting ______.","translation":"在經歷了數十年的激烈邊界衝突後，兩國終於簽署了條約並實現了持久和平。"},{"word":"peaceful","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"free from disturbance; calm and quiet; not involving war","chinese":"和平的；安詳寧靜的","sentence":"We rented a wooden cottage beside a ______ mountain lake, where we spent relaxing mornings watching the birds.","translation":"我們在一座寧靜的高山湖泊旁租了一間木屋，在那裡我們度過了放鬆的早晨並觀賞鳥類。"},{"word":"courage","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the ability to do something that frightens one; bravery","chinese":"勇氣；膽識","sentence":"It took immense personal ______ for the whistleblower to step forward and expose corruption within the firm.","translation":"舉報人鼓起了巨大的個人勇氣挺身而出，揭露了公司內部的腐敗。"},{"word":"encourage","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to give support, confidence, or hope to someone","chinese":"鼓勵；激勵","sentence":"Good parents always ______ their children to try new hobbies and express their creative ideas freely.","translation":"優秀的父母總是鼓勵他們的孩子嘗試新的嗜好並自由表達創造性的想法。"},{"word":"hero","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person admired for courage, outstanding achievements, or noble qualities","chinese":"英雄；受景仰的人物","sentence":"The brave firefighter who entered the burning apartment to rescue the trapped baby was hailed as a local ______.","translation":"進入燃燒公寓營救受困嬰兒的英勇消防員被譽為當地的英雄。"},{"word":"protect","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to keep safe from harm, injury, or damage","chinese":"保護；守護","sentence":"Wearing a strong safety helmet while riding a motorcycle will effectively ______ your head during an unexpected fall.","translation":"騎摩托車時配戴牢固的安全帽，將在發生意外摔倒時有效保護你的頭部。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"With persistent effort and support from her mentors, Linda managed to ______ in launching her own business.","options":["succeed","fail","protect","encourage"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: succeed (成功) 【全文中譯】在導師的持續努力與支持下，琳達成功創立了自己的企業。 【選項解析】(A) succeed 成功 (B) fail 失敗 (C) protect 保護 (D) encourage 鼓勵。succeed in doing sth.（成功做某事）。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The local government built high sea walls along the coast to ______ the low-lying fishing village from storm surges.","options":["protect","fail","succeed","encourage"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: protect (保護) 【全文中譯】地方政府沿海岸修建了高大的海堤，以保護地勢低窪的漁村免受風暴潮的侵襲。 【選項解析】(A) protect 保護 (B) fail 失敗 (C) succeed 成功 (D) encourage 激勵。protect A from B（保護A免受B危害）。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The high school teacher tried to ______ all his students to ask questions whenever they encountered difficulties.","options":["encourage","succeed","fail","protect"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: encourage (鼓勵) 【全文中譯】高中老師試圖鼓勵他所有的學生在遇到困難時隨時發問。 【選項解析】(A) encourage 鼓勵 (B) succeed 成功 (C) fail 失敗 (D) protect 保護。encourage sb. to do sth.（鼓勵某人做某事）。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Many entrepreneurs consider an initial business ______ not as an end, but rather as an essential stepping stone.","options":["failure","success","peace","courage"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: failure (失敗) 【全文中譯】許多創業家不將最初的商業失敗視為終點，而是將其視為必不可少的跳板墊腳石。 【選項解析】(A) failure 失敗 (B) success 成功 (C) peace 和平 (D) courage 勇氣。商業初期的挫敗為 initial business failure。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The international peacekeeper was awarded the medal of honor and celebrated by millions as a true national ______.","options":["hero","failure","loser","monster"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: hero (英雄) 【全文中譯】這位國際維和人員榮獲榮譽勳章，並被數百萬人慶祝為真正的國家英雄。 【選項解析】(A) hero 英雄 (B) failure 失敗者 (C) loser 輸家 (D) monster 怪物。受到大眾景仰表彰的人為 hero。"},{"number":6,"stem":"After months of tireless practice, the school orchestra's annual charity concert was an extraordinary ______.","options":["success","failure","war","enemy"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: success (成功；盛事) 【全文中譯】經過數月不懈的排練，學校管弦樂隊的年度慈善音樂會取得了非凡的成功。 【選項解析】(A) success 成功 (B) failure 失敗 (C) war 戰爭 (D) enemy 敵人。活動圓滿成功為 extraordinary success。"},{"number":7,"stem":"If you do not review these vocabulary words regularly before the test, you might easily ______ the quiz.","options":["fail","succeed","encourage","protect"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: fail (失敗；不及格) 【全文中譯】如果你在考前不及時規律複習這些單字，你在測驗中可能會很容易不及格。 【選項解析】(A) fail 不及格 (B) succeed 成功 (C) encourage 鼓勵 (D) protect 防護。測驗未能通過為 fail the quiz。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Taking a deep breath and standing up against an arrogant bully requires a tremendous amount of moral ______.","options":["courage","failure","peace","success"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: courage (勇氣) 【全文中譯】深吸一口氣並挺身反抗傲慢的霸凌者，需要巨大的道德勇氣。 【選項解析】(A) courage 勇氣 (B) failure 失敗 (C) peace 和平 (D) success 成功。moral courage（道德勇氣）。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The treaty brought decades of stability and economic growth, allowing both nations to live in harmonious ______.","options":["peace","failure","war","enemy"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: peace (和平) 【全文中譯】這項條約帶來了數十年的穩定與經濟增長，使兩國能夠和睦共處於和平之中。 【選項解析】(A) peace 和平 (B) failure 失敗 (C) war 戰爭 (D) enemy 敵人。live in harmonious peace（生活在和睦平靜中）。"},{"number":10,"stem":"We spent a very relaxing weekend in a ______ mountain valley, far away from noisy traffic and busy city crowds.","options":["peaceful","lovely","unique","greedy"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: peaceful (寧靜安詳的) 【全文中譯】我們在遠離嘈雜交通與繁忙市區人群的寧靜山谷中度過了一個非常放鬆的週末。 【選項解析】(A) peaceful 寧靜的 (B) lovely 美好的 (C) unique 獨特的 (D) greedy 貪婪的。寧靜山谷為 peaceful mountain valley。"},{"number":11,"stem":"You must wear heavy leather gloves to ______ your hands while handling sharp metal tools and hot engines.","options":["protect","encourage","succeed","fail"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: protect (保護) 【全文中譯】在操作鋒利金屬工具和高溫引擎時，你必須戴上厚皮手套來保護雙手。 【選項解析】(A) protect 保護 (B) encourage 鼓勵 (C) succeed 成功 (D) fail 失敗。protect your hands（保護雙手）。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The young scientist had the ______ to challenge traditional theories, which eventually led to groundbreaking discoveries.","options":["courage","failure","peace","success"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: courage (勇氣) 【全文中譯】年輕科學家擁有挑戰傳統理論的勇氣，這最終促成了開創性的重大發現。 【選項解析】(A) courage 勇氣 (B) failure 失敗 (C) peace 平靜 (D) success 成功。have the courage to challenge（有勇氣去挑戰）。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Even if your first attempt results in unexpected ______, analyze your mistakes and try again with renewed determination.","options":["failure","success","hero","courage"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: failure (失敗) 【全文中譯】即使你的第一次嘗試帶來意想不到的失敗，分析你的錯誤並重振旗鼓再試一次。 【選項解析】(A) failure 失敗 (B) success 成功 (C) hero 英雄 (D) courage 勇氣。result in unexpected failure（導致意外失敗）。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The coach gathered the exhausted team during halftime to ______ them with inspiring words of advice.","options":["encourage","fail","protect","succeed"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: encourage (鼓勵) 【全文中譯】教練在中場休息時召集疲憊的隊員，用激勵人心的建議話語鼓勵大家。 【選項解析】(A) encourage 鼓勵 (B) fail 失敗 (C) protect 保護 (D) succeed 成功。激勵球員士氣為 encourage them。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Many people dream about achieving professional ______ in their youth, but it requires patience and continuous learning.","options":["success","failure","enemy","war"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: success (成功) 【全文中譯】許多人夢想在年輕時取得職業成功，但這需要耐心與持續學習。 【選項解析】(A) success 成功 (B) failure 失敗 (C) enemy 仇敵 (D) war 戰禍。achieve professional success（取得職業成就）。"},{"number":16,"stem":"The doctor cautioned that if the patient refuses to take his prescribed pills, the therapy will completely ______.","options":["fail","succeed","protect","encourage"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: fail (失敗；失效) 【全文中譯】醫生警告說，如果病人拒絕按醫囑服藥，治療將會完全失敗。 【選項解析】(A) fail 失敗 (B) succeed 成功 (C) protect 保護 (D) encourage 鼓勵。therapy will fail（療法將失效失敗）。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Citizens organized a massive candlelight vigil in the central square to pray for world ______ and mutual understanding.","options":["peace","failure","war","army"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: peace (和平) 【全文中譯】市民在中央廣場舉行了大規模的燭光守夜活動，為世界和平與相互理解祈禱。 【選項解析】(A) peace 和平 (B) failure 失敗 (C) war 戰爭 (D) army 軍隊。pray for world peace（祈禱世界和平）。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Listening to the gentle murmur of the river created a calm and ______ atmosphere in the outdoor campsite.","options":["peaceful","unique","diligent","selfish"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: peaceful (安詳寧靜的) 【全文中譯】聆聽河流輕柔的潺潺水聲，在戶外營地營造出一種平靜而祥和的氛圍。 【選項解析】(A) peaceful 寧靜安詳的 (B) unique 獨特的 (C) diligent 勤奮的 (D) selfish 自私的。calm and peaceful atmosphere（平靜安詳的氣氛）。"},{"number":19,"stem":"To ______ in the international market, export companies must maintain the highest standards of product quality.","options":["succeed","fail","protect","encourage"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: succeed (成功) 【全文中譯】為了在國際市場上獲得成功，出口公司必須維持最高的產品品質標準。 【選項解析】(A) succeed 成功 (B) fail 失敗 (C) protect 守護 (D) encourage 勉勵。succeed in the market（在市場上取得成功）。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The pilot who skillfully landed the damaged plane on the river and saved all passengers was praised as a modern ______.","options":["hero","failure","monster","winner"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: hero (英雄) 【全文中譯】巧妙地將受損飛機迫降在河面上並拯救所有乘客的飛行員，被譽為現代英雄。 【選項解析】(A) hero 英雄 (B) failure 失敗者 (C) monster 怪物 (D) winner 贏家。拯救眾人性命者為 modern hero。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Sunglasses with ultraviolet filters help ______ your eyes from severe damage caused by intense sunlight.","options":["protect","encourage","succeed","fail"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: protect (保護) 【全文中譯】具有紫外線過濾功能的太陽眼鏡有助於保護你的眼睛免受強烈陽光的嚴重傷害。 【選項解析】(A) protect 保護 (B) encourage 激勵 (C) succeed 成功 (D) fail 失敗。protect eyes from damage（保護眼睛免受傷害）。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Facing an audience of five hundred people takes considerable ______, especially when speaking in a foreign language.","options":["courage","failure","peace","success"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: courage (勇氣) 【全文中譯】面對五百名觀眾需要相當大的勇氣，尤其是當使用外語演講時。 【選項解析】(A) courage 勇氣 (B) failure 失敗 (C) peace 平和 (D) success 勝利。takes considerable courage（需要莫大的勇氣）。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Despite their hard work and dedication, the experiment ended in total ______ due to a sudden power outage.","options":["failure","success","hero","peace"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: failure (失敗) 【全文中譯】儘管他們付出了辛勤工作與奉獻，由於突然停電，實驗最終以徹底失敗告終。 【選項解析】(A) failure 失敗 (B) success 成功 (C) hero 英雄 (D) peace 和平。ended in total failure（以徹底失敗收場）。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The grandfather always loved to ______ his grandson whenever the boy practiced playing the violin.","options":["encourage","fail","protect","succeed"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: encourage (鼓勵) 【全文中譯】每當小男孩練習拉小提琴時，祖父總是喜歡鼓勵他的孫子。 【選項解析】(A) encourage 鼓勵 (B) fail 失敗 (C) protect 保護 (D) succeed 成功。長輩支持激勵晚輩為 encourage。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Finding inner ______ through quiet meditation can help reduce daily anxiety and improve emotional wellbeing.","options":["peace","failure","war","enemy"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: peace (心靈平靜) 【全文中譯】透過安靜的冥想尋找內心的平靜，有助於減少日常焦慮並增進身心健康。 【選項解析】(A) peace 平靜 (B) failure 失敗 (C) war 戰爭 (D) enemy 仇家。inner peace（內心平靜）。"}]},{"unit":47,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 47 (047.mp3) Topic: Urban Architecture, Legal Facilities & Social Survival","topic":"Topic: Urban Architecture, Legal Facilities & Social Survival | Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"arrest","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to seize by legal authority; legal custody","chinese":"逮捕；拘捕","sentence":"The police managed to ______ the dangerous suspect near the airport before he could board the international flight.","translation":"警方在危險嫌疑人登上國際航班之前，設法在機場附近將其逮捕。"},{"word":"struggle","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to make forceful efforts against difficulties; contest","chinese":"掙扎；奮鬥；努力","sentence":"The poor family had to ______ against hunger during the winter, but they supported each other through all hardship.","translation":"貧困的家庭在冬天必須與飢餓作鬥爭，但他們在所有艱辛中互相支持。"},{"word":"survive","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to continue to live or exist, especially after danger","chinese":"倖存；存活","sentence":"Miraculously, all passengers managed to ______ the train derailment with only minor scratches and bruises.","translation":"奇蹟般地，所有乘客都在火車出軌事故中倖存下來，僅受了輕微的擦傷與瘀傷。"},{"word":"building","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a structure with a roof and walls, such as a house or factory","chinese":"建築物；大樓","sentence":"Taipei 101 is an iconic skyscraper ______ that incorporates advanced engineering to withstand strong typhoons and earthquakes.","translation":"台北101是一座標誌性的摩天大樓建築，融合了先進工程技術以抵禦強烈颱風和地震。"},{"word":"court","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a place where legal justice is administered; playing area","chinese":"法院；法庭；球場","sentence":"The witnesses testified truthfully before the judge in ______, helping the jury deliver a fair verdict.","translation":"證人在法庭上面對法官如實作證，幫助陪審團做出了公正的裁決。"},{"word":"castle","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a large fortified historic building with thick walls","chinese":"城堡","sentence":"The ancient stone ______ stood majestically on top of the green hill, overlooking the beautiful blue river below.","translation":"古老的石頭城堡雄偉地矗立在綠色山丘頂上，俯瞰著下方美麗的藍色河流。"},{"word":"tower","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a tall, narrow building or part of a building","chinese":"塔；高樓；信號塔","sentence":"Visitors can take the high-speed glass elevator to the observation deck of the television ______ to enjoy panoramic views.","translation":"遊客可以搭乘高速玻璃電梯前往電視塔的觀景台，飽覽全景風光。"},{"word":"temple","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a building devoted to religious worship","chinese":"寺廟；神殿","sentence":"Devout worshipers burn fragrant incense and bow respectfully inside the historic Buddhist ______ every morning.","translation":"虔誠的信徒每天早晨在歷史悠久的佛教寺廟內燃燒芬芳的香火並恭敬鞠躬。"},{"word":"mall","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a large enclosed shopping area with many stores","chinese":"購物中心；商場","sentence":"Many local teenagers love to gather at the air-conditioned shopping ______ on hot summer weekends to watch movies.","translation":"許多當地的青少年喜歡在炎熱的夏日週末聚集在有冷氣的購物中心看電影。"},{"word":"downtown","pos":"(n.) / (adj.) / (adv.)","definition":"the central part or business center of a city","chinese":"市中心；鬧區","sentence":"Because street parking is extremely limited ______, taking the rapid transit train is the most convenient choice.","translation":"由於市中心的街邊停車位極其有限，因此搭乘捷運列車是最方便的選擇。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The judge ordered the bailiff to maintain order inside the crowded ______ during the controversial trial.","options":["court","castle","tower","temple"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: court (法庭) 【全文中譯】在爭議激烈的審判期間，法官命令法警在擁擠的法庭內維持秩序。 【選項解析】(A) court 法庭 (B) castle 城堡 (C) tower 塔樓 (D) temple 寺廟。法官開庭之所為 court。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The historic medieval ______ attracted thousands of tourists who marveled at its stone drawbridge and tall towers.","options":["castle","court","mall","temple"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: castle (城堡) 【全文中譯】這座歷史悠久的中世紀城堡吸引了成千上萬的遊客，大家對其石造吊橋與高塔讚嘆不已。 【選項解析】(A) castle 城堡 (B) court 法院 (C) mall 購物中心 (D) temple 寺廟。中世紀石造吊橋建物為 medieval castle。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Police officers arrived at the warehouse within minutes to ______ the burglary suspects before they could escape.","options":["arrest","struggle","survive","protect"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: arrest (逮捕) 【全文中譯】警官在數分鐘內趕到倉庫，在入室盜竊嫌疑人逃跑前將他們逮捕。 【選項解析】(A) arrest 逮捕 (B) struggle 掙扎 (C) survive 倖存 (D) protect 保護。警方捉拿嫌犯為 arrest。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Rescuers worked through the freezing night, hoping that trapped survivors would manage to ______ under the rubble.","options":["survive","arrest","struggle","protect"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: survive (倖存；存活) 【全文中譯】救援人員在嚴寒的夜裡奮戰，希望受困的倖存者能夠在瓦礫堆下活下來。 【選項解析】(A) survive 倖存 (B) arrest 逮捕 (C) struggle 掙扎 (D) protect 保護。災難存活為 survive。"},{"number":5,"stem":"You can buy clothes, dine in fancy restaurants, and watch movies all in one place at the newly built shopping ______.","options":["mall","castle","temple","tower"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: mall (購物中心) 【全文中譯】在新建的購物中心裡，你可以在同一地點買衣服、在精緻餐廳用餐以及看電影。 【選項解析】(A) mall 購物商場 (B) castle 城堡 (C) temple 寺廟 (D) tower 塔。集購物餐飲電影於一體為 shopping mall。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Many elderly residents visit the neighborhood ______ on the first day of the lunar month to pray for good health.","options":["temple","mall","castle","court"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: temple (寺廟) 【全文中譯】許多長者在農曆初一造訪社區寺廟，祈求身體健康。 【選項解析】(A) temple 寺廟 (B) mall 商場 (C) castle 城堡 (D) court 法院。燒香祈福之處為 temple。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The architect designed an eco-friendly office ______ with solar panels on the roof and natural ventilation.","options":["building","castle","court","temple"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: building (建築物；大樓) 【全文中譯】建築師設計了一座環保辦公大樓，屋頂裝有太陽能板並具備自然通風設計。 【選項解析】(A) building 建築 (B) castle 城堡 (C) court 法院 (D) temple 寺廟。辦公大樓為 office building。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Taking the subway to ______ during rush hour saves a lot of time compared to driving on congested streets.","options":["downtown","castle","temple","court"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: downtown (市中心) 【全文中譯】在尖峰時段搭地鐵前往市中心，比起在擁堵的街道上開車節省了大量時間。 【選項解析】(A) downtown 市中心 (B) castle 城堡 (C) temple 寺廟 (D) court 法院。商业核心鬧區為 downtown。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The Eiffel ______ in Paris was constructed for the 1889 World's Fair and remains one of the world's most famous landmarks.","options":["Tower","Castle","Temple","Court"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Tower (艾菲爾鐵塔) 【全文中譯】巴黎艾菲爾鐵塔建於1889年世界博覽會，至今仍是全球最著名的地標之一。 【選項解析】(A) Tower 鐵塔 (B) Castle 城堡 (C) Temple 神殿 (D) Court 法庭。Eiffel Tower（艾菲爾鐵塔）。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Small independent bookstores often ______ to remain profitable when competing against giant online retailers.","options":["struggle","arrest","survive","protect"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: struggle (苦苦掙扎；艱難奮鬥) 【全文中譯】小型獨立書店在與大型網路零售商競爭時，往往苦苦掙扎以維持盈利。 【選項解析】(A) struggle 奮力掙扎 (B) arrest 逮捕 (C) survive 存活 (D) protect 保護。經營困難掙扎為 struggle to remain profitable。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Two heavily armed detectives executed a warrant to ______ the corrupt official at his private villa.","options":["arrest","struggle","survive","succeed"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: arrest (逮捕) 【全文中譯】兩名全副武裝的便衣警探執行了搜捕令，在貪腐官員的私人別墅將其逮捕。 【選項解析】(A) arrest 逮捕 (B) struggle 搏鬥 (C) survive 存活 (D) succeed 成功。執行逮捕為 execute warrant to arrest。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The ancient clock ______ in the city square chimes loudly every hour to remind citizens of the time.","options":["tower","court","castle","temple"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: tower (鐘塔；鐘樓) 【全文中譯】城市廣場上的古老鐘樓每小時都會大聲鳴響，提醒市民時間。 【選項解析】(A) tower 鐘樓 (B) court 法院 (C) castle 城堡 (D) temple 寺廟。鐘塔為 clock tower。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The jury delivered a verdict of not guilty, bringing tears of relief to the defendant's family in the ______.","options":["court","temple","mall","castle"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: court (法庭) 【全文中譯】陪審團做出了無罪裁決，給法庭上被告的家屬帶來了欣慰的淚水。 【選項解析】(A) court 法庭 (B) temple 寺廟 (C) mall 商場 (D) castle 城堡。法庭宣判之所為 court。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Plants in the desert have developed deep root systems that help them ______ through extreme heat and severe drought.","options":["survive","arrest","struggle","fail"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: survive (存活) 【全文中譯】沙漠中的植物進化出深根系統，幫助它們在極端高溫與嚴重乾旱中存活下來。 【選項解析】(A) survive 存活 (B) arrest 逮捕 (C) struggle 掙扎 (D) fail 枯萎。乾旱中生存為 survive。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The royal family hosted an extravagant ball in the great hall of their country ______.","options":["castle","mall","court","temple"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: castle (城堡) 【全文中譯】皇室家族在他們的鄉村城堡大廳舉辦了一場盛大的舞會。 【選項解析】(A) castle 城堡 (B) mall 商場 (C) court 法院 (D) temple 寺廟。貴族鄉村城堡為 country castle。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Hundreds of families flocked to the suburban shopping ______ on Black Friday to purchase discounted electronic appliances.","options":["mall","temple","castle","court"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: mall (商場；購物中心) 【全文中譯】數百個家庭在黑色星期五湧向郊區購物中心購買折扣家電。 【選項解析】(A) mall 購物中心 (B) temple 寺廟 (C) castle 城堡 (D) court 法庭。shopping mall（購物中心）。"},{"number":17,"stem":"In traditional Asian culture, people remove their hats and maintain respectful silence upon entering a Buddhist ______.","options":["temple","mall","court","castle"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: temple (寺廟) 【全文中譯】在傳統亞洲文化中，人們進入佛寺時會脫帽並保持恭敬肅靜。 【選項解析】(A) temple 寺廟 (B) mall 購物中心 (C) court 法庭 (D) castle 城堡。佛教寺院為 Buddhist temple。"},{"number":18,"stem":"During the hurricane, several windows of the tall commercial ______ were shattered by flying debris.","options":["building","castle","court","temple"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: building (大樓；大廈) 【全文中譯】在颶風襲擊期間，這棟高層商業大樓的好幾扇窗戶被飛來的碎片震碎。 【選項解析】(A) building 大樓 (B) castle 城堡 (C) court 法院 (D) temple 寺廟。commercial building（商業大樓）。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Working parents often ______ to balance demanding careers with raising young children at home.","options":["struggle","arrest","survive","protect"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: struggle (努力；辛苦奮鬥) 【全文中譯】雙薪父母常常在平衡繁重的職業工作與在家撫養幼童之間艱難奮鬥。 【選項解析】(A) struggle 奮力掙扎 (B) arrest 拘留 (C) survive 倖存 (D) protect 保護。struggle to balance（努力取得平衡）。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The famous department store located in ______ offers a wide range of luxury cosmetics and imported apparel.","options":["downtown","castle","temple","court"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: downtown (市中心) 【全文中譯】這家位於市中心的著名百貨公司提供各式各樣的高檔化妝品與進口服飾。 【選項解析】(A) downtown 市中心 (B) castle 城堡 (C) temple 寺廟 (D) court 法庭。located in downtown（座落於市中心）。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The lighthouse ______ flashed its bright guiding light across the stormy waters to warn ships away from dangerous rocks.","options":["tower","court","castle","temple"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: tower (燈塔) 【全文中譯】燈塔塔樓穿過暴風雨的海面閃爍著明亮的導航光芒，警告船隻避開危險岩石。 【選項解析】(A) tower 塔樓 (B) court 法庭 (C) castle 城堡 (D) temple 寺廟。lighthouse tower（燈塔塔樓）。"},{"number":22,"stem":"If you fail to repay the debt, the creditor has the legal right to take you to ______.","options":["court","castle","temple","mall"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: court (法院) 【全文中譯】如果你不及時償還債務，債權人有法定權利將你告上法庭。 【選項解析】(A) court 法院 (B) castle 城堡 (C) temple 寺廟 (D) mall 商場。take sb. to court（將某人告上法庭）。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The courageous explorer managed to ______ alone in the harsh Arctic wilderness for three months.","options":["survive","arrest","struggle","fail"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: survive (倖存；生存) 【全文中譯】那位英勇的探險家設法在嚴酷的北極荒野中獨自生存了三個月。 【選項解析】(A) survive 生存 (B) arrest 逮捕 (C) struggle 掙扎 (D) fail 失敗。荒野求生為 survive in the wilderness。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Security guards at the shopping ______ monitored the surveillance cameras to prevent shoplifting.","options":["mall","castle","temple","court"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: mall (購物中心) 【全文中譯】購物中心的保全人員監控監視攝影機以防止店鋪盜竊。 【選項解析】(A) mall 購物中心 (B) castle 城堡 (C) temple 寺院 (D) court 法院。shopping mall（購物中心）。"},{"number":25,"stem":"The criminal was placed under ______ immediately after stepping off the passenger ferry.","options":["arrest","struggle","survive","success"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: arrest (逮捕) 【全文中譯】那名罪犯在走下客運渡輪後立即被警方拘捕。 【選項解析】(A) arrest 逮捕 (B) struggle 奮鬥 (C) survive 存活 (D) success 成功。under arrest（被逮捕）。"}]},{"unit":48,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 48 (048.mp3) Topic: Settlements, Domestic Layout & East Asian Geography","topic":"Topic: Settlements, Domestic Layout & East Asian Geography | Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"village","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a small community or group of houses in a rural area","chinese":"村莊；鄉村","sentence":"My grandparents live in a peaceful fishing ______ where fresh seafood is sold by the dock every morning.","translation":"我的祖父母住在一個寧靜的漁村，每天早晨碼頭旁都會出售新鮮的海鮮。"},{"word":"stair","pos":"(n.)","definition":"one step in a flight of steps from one level to another","chinese":"樓梯的階梯；樓梯","sentence":"Be careful not to trip over the loose carpet on the wooden ______, especially when carrying heavy groceries.","translation":"搬運沉重雜貨時要小心，別被木樓梯上鬆動的地毯絆倒。"},{"word":"downstairs","pos":"(adv.) / (adj.) / (n.)","definition":"down the stairs; on a lower floor","chinese":"樓下；在樓下","sentence":"The doorbell rang while she was reading in bed, so she quickly ran ______ to see who was at the door.","translation":"當她在床上看書時門鈴響了，所以她迅速跑到樓下看看是誰在門口。"},{"word":"upstairs","pos":"(adv.) / (adj.) / (n.)","definition":"up the stairs; on an upper floor","chinese":"樓上；在樓上","sentence":"All the quiet study bedrooms are located ______, while the kitchen and living room are on the ground floor.","translation":"所有安靜的書房臥室都位於樓上，而廚房和客廳則位於一樓。"},{"word":"Asia","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the largest continent in the world","chinese":"亞洲","sentence":"Many diverse languages, cultures, and ancient civilizations have developed across the vast continent of ______.","translation":"許多多元的語言、文化與古老文明在廣袤的亞洲大陸上孕育發展。"},{"word":"Asian","pos":"(adj.) / (n.)","definition":"belonging to Asia; a person of Asian descent","chinese":"亞洲的；亞洲人","sentence":"Students from various ______ countries gathered at the university to celebrate Lunar New Year traditions.","translation":"來自多個亞洲國家的學生齊聚大學，共同慶祝農曆新年的傳統習俗。"},{"word":"Japan","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an island nation in East Asia famous for its culture and technology","chinese":"日本","sentence":"Thousands of travelers visit ______ every spring to admire the breathtaking pink cherry blossoms in Kyoto.","translation":"每年春天，成千上萬的旅客造訪日本，欣賞京都令人屏息的粉紅櫻花。"},{"word":"Japanese","pos":"(adj.) / (n.)","definition":"relating to Japan, its people, or its language","chinese":"日本的；日本人；日語","sentence":"We enjoyed authentic ______ ramen with tender pork slices and savory broth at the newly opened restaurant.","translation":"我們在新開的餐廳享用了道地的日式拉麵，搭配鮮嫩的叉燒肉片與濃郁湯頭。"},{"word":"Korea","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a peninsula in East Asia divided into North and South","chinese":"韓國；朝鮮","sentence":"South ______ has become internationally celebrated for its energetic pop music, television dramas, and cosmetics.","translation":"韓國因其充滿活力的流行音樂、電視劇和化妝品而享譽國際。"},{"word":"Korean","pos":"(adj.) / (n.)","definition":"relating to Korea, its people, or its language","chinese":"韓國的；韓國人；韓語","sentence":"Many young Taiwanese students are actively learning the ______ language so they can understand dramas without subtitles.","translation":"許多台灣年輕學生正在積極學習韓語，以便能夠在沒有字幕的情況下看懂電視劇。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"During our vacation in Kyoto, we visited historic wooden shrines and practiced speaking basic ______ phrases.","options":["Japanese","Korean","Asian","gentle"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Japanese (日語的；日本的) 【全文中譯】在京都度假期間，我們參觀了歷史悠久的木造神社，並練習說基礎日語短語。 【選項解析】(A) Japanese 日本的 (B) Korean 韓國的 (C) Asian 亞洲的 (D) gentle 溫和的。Kyoto（京都）使用 Japanese。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The historic tea ceremony is an essential part of traditional culture practiced across ______ for centuries.","options":["Japan","Asia","Korea","village"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Japan (日本) 【全文中譯】歷史悠久的茶道是日本數個世紀以來廣泛實踐的傳統文化重要組成部分。 【選項解析】(A) Japan 日本 (B) Asia 亞洲 (C) Korea 韓國 (D) village 村莊。以傳統茶道聞名的國家為 Japan。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The loud noise from the party on the floor below kept the residents living ______ awake all night.","options":["upstairs","downstairs","Asian","Japanese"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: upstairs (樓上) 【全文中譯】樓下派對傳來的巨大噪音讓住在樓上的居民整夜無法入眠。 【選項解析】(A) upstairs 樓上 (B) downstairs 樓下 (C) Asian 亞洲的 (D) Japanese 日本的。樓下的吵鬧影響樓上（upstairs）。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Grandmother slipped while walking down the slippery marble ______, but luckily she grabbed the handrail in time.","options":["stairs","villages","castles","courts"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: stairs (樓梯；階梯) 【全文中譯】祖母走下濕滑的大理石樓梯時滑倒了，但幸運的是她及時抓住了扶手。 【選項解析】(A) stairs 樓梯 (B) villages 村莊 (C) castles 城堡 (D) courts 法院。走下大理石階梯為 marble stairs。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The delicious fermented cabbage dish known as kimchi is an indispensable element of ______ cuisine.","options":["Korean","Japanese","Asian","unique"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Korean (韓國的) 【全文中譯】被稱為泡菜（kimchi）的美味發酵白菜菜餚，是韓式料理不可或缺的元素。 【選項解析】(A) Korean 韓國的 (B) Japanese 日本的 (C) Asian 亞洲的 (D) unique 獨特的。kimchi 為韓式料理（Korean cuisine）。"},{"number":6,"stem":"After dinner, dad went ______ to the basement workshop to repair the broken wooden bicycle frame.","options":["downstairs","upstairs","Asian","Korean"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: downstairs (樓下) 【全文中譯】晚餐後，爸爸下樓去地下室工作間修理損壞的木製自行車車架。 【選項解析】(A) downstairs 到樓下 (B) upstairs 到樓上 (C) Asian 亞洲的 (D) Korean 韓國的。去地下室需 down stairs（走下樓）。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The sleepy mountain ______ was completely surrounded by misty green hills and fresh vegetable terraces.","options":["village","stair","castle","tower"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: village (村莊) 【全文中譯】這座沉睡的山村完全被薄霧籠罩的青山和新鮮的蔬菜梯田所環繞。 【選項解析】(A) village 村莊 (B) stair 階梯 (C) castle 城堡 (D) tower 塔。被梯田與青山環繞之處為 mountain village。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Covering more than thirty percent of the Earth's total land area, ______ is the globe's largest continent.","options":["Asia","Japan","Korea","village"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Asia (亞洲) 【全文中譯】亞洲佔地球陸地總面積的百分之三十以上，是全球最大的大陸。 【選項解析】(A) Asia 亞洲 (B) Japan 日本 (C) Korea 韓國 (D) village 村莊。全球最大大陸為 Asia。"},{"number":9,"stem":"International tourists love visiting Seoul in ______ to experience lively street markets and historic palaces.","options":["Korea","Japan","Asia","village"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Korea (韓國) 【全文中譯】國際旅客喜歡造訪韓國首爾，體驗熱鬧的街頭市場與歷史宮殿。 【選項解析】(A) Korea 韓國 (B) Japan 日本 (C) Asia 亞洲 (D) village 村莊。首爾（Seoul）位於 Korea。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Rice, noodles, and soy sauce are widely consumed dietary staples among many ______ populations.","options":["Asian","Japanese","Korean","lovely"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Asian (亞洲的) 【全文中譯】米飯、麵條和醬油是許多亞洲人口中廣泛消費的主食飲食原料。 【選項解析】(A) Asian 亞洲的 (B) Japanese 日本的 (C) Korean 韓國的 (D) lovely 可愛的。泛指亞洲族群飲食為 Asian populations。"},{"number":11,"stem":"We stayed in an authentic ______ ryokan inn where we slept on traditional tatami mats and enjoyed hot springs.","options":["Japanese","Korean","Asian","gentle"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Japanese (日式的) 【全文中譯】我們住在一家道地的日式溫泉旅館，睡在傳統榻榻米上並享受溫泉。 【選項解析】(A) Japanese 日本的 (B) Korean 韓國的 (C) Asian 亞洲的 (D) gentle 溫柔的。日式榻榻米旅館為 Japanese ryokan。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Please wait here for a moment while I run ______ to my bedroom to grab my wallet and passport.","options":["upstairs","downstairs","Korean","Japanese"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: upstairs (樓上) 【全文中譯】請在這裡稍等片刻，我跑上樓回臥室去拿皮夾和護照。 【選項解析】(A) upstairs 樓上 (B) downstairs 樓下 (C) Korean 韓國的 (D) Japanese 日本的。上樓回臥室為 run upstairs。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Modern high-speed bullet trains connect major metropolitan cities across ______ with incredible punctuality.","options":["Japan","Korea","Asia","village"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Japan (日本) 【全文中譯】現代高速子彈列車以令人難以置信的準點率連接日本各大都會城市。 【選項解析】(A) Japan 日本 (B) Korea 韓國 (C) Asia 亞洲 (D) village 村莊。新幹線子彈列車系統為 Japan 的特色。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The elderly man sat outside his cottage in the rural ______ and chatted warmly with passing neighbors.","options":["village","stair","castle","court"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: village (鄉村；村落) 【全文中譯】老人坐在鄉村小屋外面，與路過的鄰居熱情攀談。 【選項解析】(A) village 村莊 (B) stair 樓梯 (C) castle 城堡 (D) court 法庭。鄉間村莊為 rural village。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Many popular pop idols and drama series produced in ______ enjoy massive followings across the globe.","options":["Korea","Japan","Asia","village"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Korea (韓國) 【全文中譯】韓國製作的許多流行偶像與電視影集在全球享有龐大的粉絲追隨。 【選項解析】(A) Korea 韓國 (B) Japan 日本 (C) Asia 亞洲 (D) village 村落。流行韓流產地為 Korea。"},{"number":16,"stem":"The kitchen is located ______, so delicious aromas of freshly baked bread drifted up to our bedrooms.","options":["downstairs","upstairs","Japanese","Korean"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: downstairs (在樓下) 【全文中譯】廚房位於樓下，所以剛出爐麵包的美味香氣飄到了我們樓上的臥室。 【選項解析】(A) downstairs 在樓下 (B) upstairs 在樓上 (C) Japanese 日本的 (D) Korean 韓國的。由香氣往上飄可知廚房位於 downstairs。"},{"number":17,"stem":"He climbed forty wooden ______ to reach the observation platform at the top of the lighthouse.","options":["stairs","villages","towers","castles"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: stairs (階梯；樓梯) 【全文中譯】他攀爬了四十級木階梯，到達燈塔頂部的觀景平台。 【選項解析】(A) stairs 階梯 (B) villages 村莊 (C) towers 塔 (D) castles 城堡。攀爬的級數為 stairs。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Economic cooperation among ______ nations has fostered rapid trade expansion and technological innovation.","options":["Asian","Japanese","Korean","unique"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Asian (亞洲的) 【全文中譯】亞洲各國之間的經濟合作促進了貿易的迅速擴張與技術創新。 【選項解析】(A) Asian 亞洲的 (B) Japanese 日本的 (C) Korean 韓國的 (D) unique 獨特的。亞洲國家為 Asian nations。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Barbecue beef cooked over charcoal grills at the table is a hallmark of authentic ______ dining.","options":["Korean","Japanese","Asian","lovely"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Korean (韓式的) 【全文中譯】在餐桌上的炭火烤爐上烹飪烤牛肉是道地韓式餐飲的標誌特徵。 【選項解析】(A) Korean 韓式的 (B) Japanese 日式的 (C) Asian 亞洲的 (D) lovely 美好的。桌邊炭火烤肉為 Korean dining。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The great silk trade route historically connected the markets of Europe with ancient civilizations across ______.","options":["Asia","Japan","Korea","village"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Asia (亞洲) 【全文中譯】偉大的絲綢貿易之路在歷史上連接了歐洲市場與橫跨亞洲的古老文明。 【選項解析】(A) Asia 亞洲 (B) Japan 日本 (C) Korea 韓國 (D) village 村莊。絲路橫貫大陸為 Asia。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Mount Fuji is an internationally recognized natural symbol of ______, attracting millions of mountain hikers.","options":["Japan","Korea","Asia","village"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Japan (日本) 【全文中譯】富士山是國際公認的日本自然象徵，吸引著數百萬登山者。 【選項解析】(A) Japan 日本 (B) Korea 韓國 (C) Asia 亞洲 (D) village 村莊。Mount Fuji 位於 Japan。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The family gathered in the living room ______ to watch the New Year countdown on television.","options":["downstairs","upstairs","Asian","Korean"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: downstairs (樓下) 【全文中譯】全家人聚集在樓下的客廳，透過電視觀看新年倒數計時。 【選項解析】(A) downstairs 樓下 (B) upstairs 樓上 (C) Asian 亞洲的 (D) Korean 韓國的。聚集於客廳為 living room downstairs。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Taking the ______ instead of the elevator every morning provides healthy physical exercise for office workers.","options":["stairs","villages","castles","temples"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: stairs (走樓梯) 【全文中譯】每天早晨走樓梯而不是搭電梯，為上班族提供了健康的身體鍛鍊。 【選項解析】(A) stairs 樓梯 (B) villages 村落 (C) castles 城堡 (D) temples 寺廟。take the stairs（走樓梯）。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The traditional harvest festival celebrated in ______ brings extended families together to share rice cakes.","options":["Korea","Japan","Asia","village"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Korea (韓國) 【全文中譯】在韓國慶祝的傳統秋收節日（秋夕）讓大家庭團聚在一起分享年糕。 【選項解析】(A) Korea 韓國 (B) Japan 日本 (C) Asia 亞洲 (D) village 村莊。秋夕節慶於 Korea。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Traditional art forms from various ______ societies share a profound reverence for harmony with nature.","options":["Asian","Japanese","Korean","lovely"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Asian (亞洲的) 【全文中譯】來自各個亞洲社會的傳統藝術形式都對與自然和諧相處懷有深刻的敬畏。 【選項解析】(A) Asian 亞洲的 (B) Japanese 日本的 (C) Korean 韓國的 (D) lovely 討喜的。Asian societies（亞洲社會）。"}]},{"unit":49,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 49 (049.mp3) Topic: Global Geography, European & Eurasian Nations","topic":"Topic: Global Geography, European & Eurasian Nations | Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"Philippines","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an archipelago country in Southeast Asia","chinese":"菲律賓","sentence":"The ______ is famous for its crystal-clear waters and hundreds of beautiful tropical islands that attract divers.","translation":"菲律賓因其清澈見底的海水和數百個吸引潛水愛好者的美麗熱帶島嶼而聞名。"},{"word":"Taiwan","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an island nation in East Asia known for technology and cuisine","chinese":"台灣","sentence":"People in ______ are world-renowned for their hospitality, delicious night market snacks, and stunning mountain landscapes.","translation":"台灣人以其熱情好客、美味的夜市小吃和壯麗的高山景觀聞名於世。"},{"word":"Taiwanese","pos":"(adj.) / (n.)","definition":"relating to Taiwan, its people, or its local culture","chinese":"台灣的；台灣人；台語","sentence":"Many foreign exchange students fall in love with traditional ______ bubble tea and fried chicken cutlets.","translation":"許多外國交換學生愛上了傳統的台灣珍珠奶茶與炸雞排。"},{"word":"Singapore","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an island city-state in Southeast Asia known for cleanliness","chinese":"新加坡","sentence":"Strict municipal laws and efficient public urban planning have made ______ one of the cleanest green cities in the world.","translation":"嚴格的市政法規與高效的公共城市規劃，使新加坡成為全球最乾淨的綠色城市之一。"},{"word":"Russia","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the largest country in the world, spanning Eastern Europe and Northern Asia","chinese":"俄羅斯","sentence":"Covering eleven distinct time zones across Eurasia, ______ features vast snowy pine forests and rich historic architecture.","translation":"俄羅斯橫跨歐亞大陸的十一個不同時區，擁有廣袤的雪白松樹林與豐富的歷史建築。"},{"word":"Russian","pos":"(adj.) / (n.)","definition":"relating to Russia, its people, or its language","chinese":"俄羅斯的；俄羅斯人；俄語","sentence":"Tchaikovsky was a brilliant ______ composer whose classical ballet music continues to be performed across the globe.","translation":"柴可夫斯基是一位才華洋溢的俄羅斯作曲家，他的古典芭蕾舞音樂繼續在全球各地演出。"},{"word":"Europe","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a continent situated entirely in the Northern Hemisphere","chinese":"歐洲","sentence":"Traveling across ______ by passenger train allows tourists to explore multiple historic nations in a single summer trip.","translation":"搭乘客運火車橫穿歐洲旅行，讓遊客能夠在一次暑期旅行中探索多個歷史悠久的國家。"},{"word":"European","pos":"(adj.) / (n.)","definition":"relating to Europe, its people, or its languages","chinese":"歐洲的；歐洲人","sentence":"The ______ Union facilitates international trade, environmental cooperation, and peaceful travel among member nations.","translation":"歐洲聯盟促進了成員國之間的國際貿易、環保合作與和平旅行。"},{"word":"Britain","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the island comprising England, Scotland, and Wales","chinese":"英國；大不列顛","sentence":"Great ______ played a major role in the global Industrial Revolution during the eighteenth and nineteenth centuries.","translation":"大不列顛在十八和十九世紀的全球工業革命中發揮了重大作用。"},{"word":"British","pos":"(adj.) / (n.)","definition":"relating to Great Britain or the United Kingdom","chinese":"英國的；英國人","sentence":"Enjoying afternoon tea with freshly baked scones and strawberry jam is a quintessential ______ cultural tradition.","translation":"享用帶有剛出爐司康餅與草莓果醬的下午茶，是一項典型的英國文化傳統。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"During their round-the-world vacation, the family spent three weeks traveling through France, Italy, and Germany in ______.","options":["Europe","Russia","Singapore","Taiwan"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Europe (歐洲) 【全文中譯】在環球假期期間，這家人花了三週時間穿行於歐洲的法國、義大利和德國。 【選項解析】(A) Europe 歐洲 (B) Russia 俄羅斯 (C) Singapore 新加坡 (D) Taiwan 台灣。法義德屬於 Europe。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The island of ______ is famous worldwide for producing advanced semiconductor computer chips and electronic hardware.","options":["Taiwan","Russia","Britain","Europe"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Taiwan (台灣) 【全文中譯】台灣這座島嶼因生產先進的半導體電腦晶片與電子硬體而舉世聞名。 【選項解析】(A) Taiwan 台灣 (B) Russia 俄羅斯 (C) Britain 英國 (D) Europe 歐洲。半導體重鎮為 Taiwan。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Many international financial corporations have regional headquarters established in the modern city-state of ______.","options":["Singapore","Russia","Europe","Taiwan"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Singapore (新加坡) 【全文中譯】許多國際金融機構在新加坡這座現代城市國家設立了區域總部。 【選項解析】(A) Singapore 新加坡 (B) Russia 俄羅斯 (C) Europe 歐洲 (D) Taiwan 台灣。現代城市島國為 Singapore。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Winter temperatures in northern regions of ______ can drop below minus forty degrees Celsius for months.","options":["Russia","Singapore","Taiwan","Europe"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Russia (俄羅斯) 【全文中譯】俄羅斯北部地區冬季氣溫可能會連續數月降至攝氏零下四十度以下。 【選項解析】(A) Russia 俄羅斯 (B) Singapore 新加坡 (C) Taiwan 台灣 (D) Europe 歐洲。酷寒廣袤地區為 northern Russia。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Tropical storms often pass through the island archipelago of the ______ during the annual summer monsoon season.","options":["Philippines","Russia","Britain","Europe"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Philippines (菲律賓) 【全文中譯】在每年的夏季季風季節期間，熱帶風暴經常掠過菲律賓這個島嶼群島國家。 【選項解析】(A) Philippines 菲律賓 (B) Russia 俄羅斯 (C) Britain 英國 (D) Europe 歐洲。熱帶群島為 Philippines。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Many travelers admire the historic red double-decker buses and black taxicabs that drive on ______ streets.","options":["British","Taiwanese","Russian","European"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: British (英國的) 【全文中譯】許多旅客讚賞在英國街道上行駛的歷史悠久紅色雙層巴士與黑色計程車。 【選項解析】(A) British 英國的 (B) Taiwanese 台灣的 (C) Russian 俄羅斯的 (D) European 歐洲的。紅色雙層巴士是 British streets 的標誌。"},{"number":7,"stem":"Several ______ nations use the Euro as their shared official currency to simplify cross-border commerce.","options":["European","Taiwanese","Russian","British"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: European (歐洲的) 【全文中譯】好幾個歐洲國家使用歐元作為其共同官方貨幣，以簡化跨境商業貿易。 【選項解析】(A) European 歐洲的 (B) Taiwanese 台灣的 (C) Russian 俄國的 (D) British 英國的。使用歐元的國家為 European nations。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Visitors love walking through night markets to sample authentic ______ street foods such as stinky tofu.","options":["Taiwanese","British","Russian","European"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Taiwanese (台灣的) 【全文中譯】遊客喜歡逛夜市品嚐道地的台灣街頭小吃，例如臭豆腐。 【選項解析】(A) Taiwanese 台灣的 (B) British 英國的 (C) Russian 俄國的 (D) European 歐洲的。臭豆腐與夜市為 Taiwanese street foods。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Leo Tolstoy was a master of nineteenth-century ______ literature whose epic novels are read across the world.","options":["Russian","British","Taiwanese","European"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Russian (俄羅斯的) 【全文中譯】列夫·托爾斯泰是十九世紀俄羅斯文學大師，其史詩級小說在全世界廣為流傳。 【選項解析】(A) Russian 俄羅斯的 (B) British 英國的 (C) Taiwanese 台灣的 (D) European 歐洲的。托爾斯泰為 Russian literature 大師。"},{"number":10,"stem":"The government of Great ______ consists of an elected Parliament and a historic constitutional monarchy.","options":["Britain","Europe","Russia","Singapore"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Britain (大不列顛；英國) 【全文中譯】大不列顛政府由民選議會與歷史悠久的君主立憲制所組成。 【選項解析】(A) Britain 英國 (B) Europe 歐洲 (C) Russia 俄羅斯 (D) Singapore 新加坡。Great Britain（大不列顛）。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Pristine white sandy beaches and colorful coral reefs make the ______ a top vacation destination for scuba divers.","options":["Philippines","Russia","Europe","Britain"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Philippines (菲律賓) 【全文中譯】原始的白色沙灘與多彩的珊瑚礁使菲律賓成為水肺潛水員的首選度假勝地。 【選項解析】(A) Philippines 菲律賓 (B) Russia 俄國 (C) Europe 歐洲 (D) Britain 英國。潛水勝地為 Philippines。"},{"number":12,"stem":"High-speed rail lines run down the entire western coast of ______, connecting major urban hubs in under two hours.","options":["Taiwan","Russia","Britain","Europe"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Taiwan (台灣) 【全文中譯】高鐵線路貫穿台灣整個西海岸，在不到兩小時內連接主要城市樞紐。 【選項解析】(A) Taiwan 台灣 (B) Russia 俄羅斯 (C) Britain 英國 (D) Europe 歐洲。高鐵西海岸貫通為 Taiwan。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Changi Airport in ______ is consistently voted by travelers as one of the best international transit hubs.","options":["Singapore","Russia","Europe","Taiwan"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Singapore (新加坡) 【全文中譯】新加坡樟宜機場一直被旅客評為最佳國際過境轉運樞紐之一。 【選項解析】(A) Singapore 新加坡 (B) Russia 俄羅斯 (C) Europe 歐洲 (D) Taiwan 台灣。Changi Airport 位於 Singapore。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Trans-Siberian trains take nearly a week to cross the vast geographical expanse of ______ from Moscow to Vladivostok.","options":["Russia","Singapore","Taiwan","Britain"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Russia (俄羅斯) 【全文中譯】西伯利亞大鐵路列車需要近一週時間才能橫穿從莫斯科到符拉迪沃斯托克的俄羅斯廣大疆域。 【選項解析】(A) Russia 俄羅斯 (B) Singapore 新加坡 (C) Taiwan 台灣 (D) Britain 英國。西伯利亞橫跨 Russia。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The historical ties between the English language and Great ______ trace back over more than a thousand years.","options":["Britain","Russia","Singapore","Taiwan"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Britain (大不列顛) 【全文中譯】英語與大不列顛之間的歷史紐帶可以追溯到一千多年前。 【選項解析】(A) Britain 大不列顛 (B) Russia 俄國 (C) Singapore 新加坡 (D) Taiwan 台灣。Great Britain 與英語源流。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Shakespeare was an English playwright who is considered the greatest writer in the history of ______ drama.","options":["British","Taiwanese","Russian","European"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: British (英國的) 【全文中譯】莎士比亞是英國劇作家，被認為是英國戲劇史上最偉大的作家。 【選項解析】(A) British 英國的 (B) Taiwanese 台灣的 (C) Russian 俄羅斯的 (D) European 歐洲的。莎士比亞開創 British drama。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Many prominent classical music composers were born and worked across the culturally rich cities of central ______.","options":["Europe","Russia","Singapore","Taiwan"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Europe (歐洲) 【全文中譯】許多傑出的古典音樂作曲家誕生並工作於文化底蘊豐富的中歐各城市。 【選項解析】(A) Europe 歐洲 (B) Russia 俄羅斯 (C) Singapore 新加坡 (D) Taiwan 台灣。中歐城市為 central Europe。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Over twenty-seven democratic countries are officially united under the legal umbrella of the ______ Union.","options":["European","Taiwanese","Russian","British"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: European (歐洲的) 【全文中譯】超過二十七個民主國家正式聯合在歐洲聯盟的法律架構之下。 【選項解析】(A) European 歐洲的 (B) Taiwanese 台灣的 (C) Russian 俄羅斯的 (D) British 英國的。European Union（歐洲聯盟）。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Traditional ______ puppet theater combines elaborate hand-carved wooden figures with dramatic storytelling.","options":["Taiwanese","British","Russian","European"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Taiwanese (台灣的) 【全文中譯】傳統台灣布袋戲將精緻的手雕木偶與戲劇性故事講述融為一體。 【選項解析】(A) Taiwanese 台灣的 (B) British 英國的 (C) Russian 俄國的 (D) European 歐洲的。布袋戲為 Taiwanese puppet theater。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The famous Moscow ballet company is recognized as one of the premier institutions of traditional ______ dance.","options":["Russian","British","Taiwanese","European"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Russian (俄羅斯的) 【全文中譯】著名的莫斯科芭蕾舞團被公認為傳統俄羅斯舞蹈的頂級機構之一。 【選項解析】(A) Russian 俄羅斯的 (B) British 英國的 (C) Taiwanese 台灣的 (D) European 歐洲的。莫斯科芭蕾代表 Russian dance。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Thousands of workers commute daily across the causeway between Malaysia and the bustling island of ______.","options":["Singapore","Russia","Britain","Europe"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Singapore (新加坡) 【全文中譯】數以千計的上班族每天穿過新柔長堤往返於馬來西亞與熱鬧的新加坡島之間。 【選項解析】(A) Singapore 新加坡 (B) Russia 俄羅斯 (C) Britain 英國 (D) Europe 歐洲。新柔長堤連接馬來西亞與 Singapore。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Mango shaved ice is a wildly popular sweet dessert enjoyed by tourists during hot summers in ______.","options":["Taiwan","Russia","Britain","Europe"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Taiwan (台灣) 【全文中譯】芒果刨冰是遊客在炎熱夏天造訪台灣時非常喜愛的甜點。 【選項解析】(A) Taiwan 台灣 (B) Russia 俄羅斯 (C) Britain 英國 (D) Europe 歐洲。芒果冰代表性地區為 Taiwan。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The tropical climate of the ______ allows local farmers to cultivate vast plantations of coconuts and sweet mangoes.","options":["Philippines","Russia","Britain","Europe"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Philippines (菲律賓) 【全文中譯】菲律賓的熱帶氣候使當地農民能夠種植廣闊的椰子與甜芒果種植園。 【選項解析】(A) Philippines 菲律賓 (B) Russia 俄羅斯 (C) Britain 英國 (D) Europe 歐洲。盛產椰子芒果之熱帶島國為 Philippines。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The Industrial Revolution began in ______ before spreading to manufacturing centers across the European continent.","options":["Britain","Russia","Singapore","Taiwan"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Britain (英國) 【全文中譯】工業革命始於英國，隨後蔓延至整個歐洲大陸的製造業中心。 【選項解析】(A) Britain 英國 (B) Russia 俄羅斯 (C) Singapore 新加坡 (D) Taiwan 台灣。工業革命起源於 Britain。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Learning a foreign ______ language like French or German opens up numerous career opportunities across international trade.","options":["European","Taiwanese","Russian","British"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: European (歐洲的) 【全文中譯】學習法語或德語等歐洲外語，為國際貿易開啟了許多職業機會。 【選項解析】(A) European 歐洲的 (B) Taiwanese 台灣的 (C) Russian 俄國的 (D) British 英國的。法德等語種為 European language。"}]},{"unit":50,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 50 (050.mp3) Topic: Western Nations, Nationalities & Commonwealth Countries","topic":"Topic: Western Nations, Nationalities & Commonwealth Countries | Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"England","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the largest and most populous constituent country of the United Kingdom","chinese":"英格蘭","sentence":"London is the historic capital of ______, known for big red buses, the River Thames, and historic palaces.","translation":"倫敦是英格蘭的歷史首都，以紅色大巴士、泰晤士河與歷史宮殿聞名。"},{"word":"Englishman","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a man who was born in or comes from England","chinese":"英格蘭人；英國男士","sentence":"The polite ______ drank his morning tea with a dash of milk and read the daily broadsheet newspaper quietly.","translation":"那位彬彬有禮的英格蘭人喝著加了一點牛奶的早茶，安靜地閱讀每日大報。"},{"word":"France","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a country in Western Europe celebrated for wine, food, and culture","chinese":"法國","sentence":"Millions of art lovers travel to ______ each year to admire famous masterpieces housed within the Louvre Museum.","translation":"每年數百萬藝術愛好者前往法國，欣賞羅浮宮博物館收藏的著名傳世傑作。"},{"word":"French","pos":"(adj.) / (n.)","definition":"relating to France, its people, or its language","chinese":"法國的；法國人；法語","sentence":"Freshly baked ______ baguettes and buttery croissants are staple morning delicacies enjoyed worldwide.","translation":"新鮮出爐的法國長棍麵包與奶油可頌是享譽全球的早晨代表性美食。"},{"word":"Germany","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a country in Central Europe renowned for engineering and industry","chinese":"德國","sentence":"Automotive factories across ______ produce world-famous, reliable cars known for high precision and performance.","translation":"遍布德國的汽車工廠生產舉世聞名且可靠的汽車，以高精度與卓越性能著稱。"},{"word":"German","pos":"(adj.) / (n.)","definition":"relating to Germany, its people, or its language","chinese":"德國的；德國人；德語","sentence":"He studied the ______ language for three semesters because he plans to study mechanical engineering in Munich.","translation":"他學習了三個學期的德語，因為他計劃前往慕尼黑攻讀機械工程。"},{"word":"Australia","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a continent and sovereign country surrounded by the Indian and Pacific oceans","chinese":"澳洲；澳大利亞","sentence":"Unique native wildlife such as kangaroos, wombats, and koalas flourish across the vast landscapes of ______.","translation":"袋鼠、袋熊與無尾熊等獨特的本土野生動物在澳洲廣袤的土地上繁衍生息。"},{"word":"Australian","pos":"(adj.) / (n.)","definition":"relating to Australia or its people","chinese":"澳洲的；澳洲人","sentence":"Surfers from around the world gather along the sunlit ______ coastline to ride giant waves during the summer.","translation":"來自世界各地的衝浪愛好者在夏季聚集在陽光普照的澳洲海岸線挑戰巨浪。"},{"word":"Canada","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the second-largest country in the world by total area, located in North America","chinese":"加拿大","sentence":"Known for vast wilderness and natural beauty, ______ produces the vast majority of the world's sweet maple syrup.","translation":"以廣闊荒野與自然美景聞名的加拿大，生產了全球絕大多數香甜的楓糖漿。"},{"word":"Canadian","pos":"(adj.) / (n.)","definition":"relating to Canada or its people","chinese":"加拿大的；加拿大人","sentence":"Ice hockey is deeply ingrained in ______ culture, and millions of passionate fans watch games every winter.","translation":"冰上曲棍球在加拿大文化中根深蒂固，數百萬熱情的球迷每年冬天都會觀看比賽。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The Eiffel Tower and the Notre-Dame Cathedral are iconic landmarks located in Paris, the capital of ______.","options":["France","Germany","Canada","Australia"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: France (法國) 【全文中譯】艾菲爾鐵塔和巴黎聖母院是座落於法國首都巴黎的標誌性地標建築。 【選項解析】(A) France 法國 (B) Germany 德國 (C) Canada 加拿大 (D) Australia 澳洲。Paris 是 France 的首都。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The Sydney Opera House with its white sail-like roof is an internationally recognized symbol of ______.","options":["Australia","Canada","Germany","England"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Australia (澳洲) 【全文中譯】雪梨歌劇院擁有白色風帆般的屋頂，是國際公認的澳洲象徵地標。 【選項解析】(A) Australia 澳洲 (B) Canada 加拿大 (C) Germany 德國 (D) England 英格蘭。Sydney 位於 Australia。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The red maple leaf is proudly displayed in the center of the official national flag of ______.","options":["Canada","Australia","France","Germany"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Canada (加拿大) 【全文中譯】紅色的楓葉自豪地展示在加拿大官方國旗的正中央。 【選項解析】(A) Canada 加拿大 (B) Australia 澳洲 (C) France 法國 (D) Germany 德國。國旗中心為楓葉的國家為 Canada。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Precision mechanical engineering and famous beer brewing traditions are hallmarks of ______ culture.","options":["German","French","Australian","Canadian"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: German (德國的) 【全文中譯】精密的機械工程與著名的啤酒釀造傳統是德國文化的重要特徵。 【選項解析】(A) German 德國的 (B) French 法國的 (C) Australian 澳洲的 (D) Canadian 加拿大的。精密工程與啤酒文化代表 German culture。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Ordering food in fluent ______ while dining at a sidewalk Parisian café made her trip memorable.","options":["French","German","Australian","Canadian"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: French (法語) 【全文中譯】在巴黎路邊咖啡館用餐時用流利的法語點餐，讓她的旅行難以忘懷。 【選項解析】(A) French 法語 (B) German 德語 (C) Australian 澳洲的 (D) Canadian 加拿大的。在巴黎使用法語（French）。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Many travelers enjoy visiting the historic university cities of Oxford and Cambridge in ______.","options":["England","France","Canada","Australia"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: England (英格蘭) 【全文中譯】許多旅客喜歡參觀位於英格蘭境內牛津與劍橋這兩座歷史悠久的大學城。 【選項解析】(A) England 英格蘭 (B) France 法國 (C) Canada 加拿大 (D) Australia 澳洲。Oxford 與 Cambridge 位於 England。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The elderly ______ always carried a neat black umbrella whenever he walked down London's streets.","options":["Englishman","Australian","Canadian","German"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Englishman (英格蘭男士) 【全文中譯】那位彬彬有禮的英格蘭紳士每當走在倫敦街頭時，總是帶著一把整潔的黑雨傘。 【選項解析】(A) Englishman 英國男士 (B) Australian 澳洲人 (C) Canadian 加拿大人 (D) German 德國人。倫敦紳士為 Englishman。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The Great Barrier Reef stretching along the northeastern coast of ______ contains thousands of colorful coral reefs.","options":["Australia","Canada","Germany","France"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Australia (澳洲) 【全文中譯】沿著澳洲東北海岸延伸的大堡礁擁有成千上萬個色彩繽紛的珊瑚礁。 【選項解析】(A) Australia 澳洲 (B) Canada 加拿大 (C) Germany 德國 (D) France 法國。Great Barrier Reef 位於 Australia。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Berlin is the vibrant, historic capital of ______, known for art museums and the remnants of the famous wall.","options":["Germany","France","England","Canada"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Germany (德國) 【全文中譯】柏林是德國充滿活力且歷史悠久的首都，以藝術博物館與著名的圍牆遺跡而聞名。 【選項解析】(A) Germany 德國 (B) France 法國 (C) England 英格蘭 (D) Canada 加拿大。Berlin 是 Germany 的首都。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Many ______ families spend winter weekends ice skating on frozen rivers or playing friendly hockey games.","options":["Canadian","Australian","French","German"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Canadian (加拿大的) 【全文中譯】許多加拿大球家庭在結冰的河流上溜冰或進行友好的曲棍球比賽來度過冬季週末。 【選項解析】(A) Canadian 加拿大的 (B) Australian 澳洲的 (C) French 法國的 (D) German 德國的。曲棍球為 Canadian families 的代表運動。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Breathtaking national parks like Banff and Jasper with turquoise glacial lakes are located in western ______.","options":["Canada","Australia","France","England"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Canada (加拿大) 【全文中譯】像班夫和賈斯珀這樣擁有綠松石般冰川湖泊的壯麗國家公園位於加拿大西部。 【選項解析】(A) Canada 加拿大 (B) Australia 澳洲 (C) France 法國 (D) England 英格蘭。Banff 國家公園位於 Canada。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Many delicious varieties of red and white wine are produced in the sun-drenched vineyards of southern ______.","options":["France","Canada","Australia","Germany"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: France (法國) 【全文中譯】在法國南部陽光普照的葡萄園裡生產了許多美味的紅葡萄酒與白葡萄酒。 【選項解析】(A) France 法國 (B) Canada 加拿大 (C) Australia 澳洲 (D) Germany 德國。葡萄酒著名產地為 southern France。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The ______ kangaroo is an animal that carries its young baby joey inside an abdominal pouch.","options":["Australian","Canadian","French","German"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Australian (澳洲的) 【全文中譯】澳洲袋鼠是一種將幼獸裝在腹部育兒袋中撫育的代表性動物。 【選項解析】(A) Australian 澳洲的 (B) Canadian 加拿大的 (C) French 法國的 (D) German 德國的。袋鼠為 Australian kangaroo。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The palace of Versailles near Paris was built by the royal monarchs of historic ______.","options":["France","Germany","Australia","Canada"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: France (法國) 【全文中譯】巴黎附近的凡爾賽宮是由歷史悠久的法國君主所興建建造的。 【選項解析】(A) France 法國 (B) Germany 德國 (C) Australia 澳洲 (D) Canada 加拿大。Versailles 宮殿位於 France。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The famous Autobahn highway system across ______ is internationally celebrated for having sections without speed limits.","options":["Germany","England","Canada","Australia"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Germany (德國) 【全文中譯】橫貫德國著名的無限速高速公路系統以擁有不設限速的路段而享譽國際。 【選項解析】(A) Germany 德國 (B) England 英格蘭 (C) Canada 加拿大 (D) Australia 澳洲。Autobahn 為 Germany 著名高速公路。"},{"number":16,"stem":"The young ______ traveler greeted fellow backpackers with a cheerful 'G'day, mate!' at the hostel.","options":["Australian","French","German","Canadian"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Australian (澳洲的) 【全文中譯】那位年輕的澳洲旅人在青旅裡用一聲歡快的「G'day, mate!」向背包客打招呼。 【選項解析】(A) Australian 澳洲的 (B) French 法國的 (C) German 德國的 (D) Canadian 加拿大的。G'day, mate 為經典 Australian 問候語。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Both English and French hold equal status as the two official languages recognized nationwide in ______.","options":["Canada","England","Australia","Germany"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Canada (加拿大) 【全文中譯】英語和法語在加拿大全國範圍內享有同等地位的雙官方語言待遇。 【選項解析】(A) Canada 加拿大 (B) England 英格蘭 (C) Australia 澳洲 (D) Germany 德國。英法雙語官方國家為 Canada。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The classic novel Oliver Twist reflects the social conditions of nineteenth-century industrial ______.","options":["England","France","Canada","Australia"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: England (英格蘭) 【全文中譯】經典小說《孤雛淚》反映了十九世紀工業時代英格蘭的真實社會狀況。 【選項解析】(A) England 英格蘭 (B) France 法國 (C) Canada 加拿大 (D) Australia 澳洲。狄更斯筆下的倫敦社會為 England。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Beethoven was a legendary ______ composer whose symphonies revolutionized the world of classical music.","options":["German","French","Australian","Canadian"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: German (德國的) 【全文中譯】貝多芬是一位傳奇的德國作曲家，他的交響曲徹底革新了古典音樂界。 【選項解析】(A) German 德國的 (B) French 法國的 (C) Australian 澳洲的 (D) Canadian 加拿大的。貝多芬為 German composer。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The famous dish of poutine, featuring French fries topped with cheese curds and gravy, is a hearty ______ snack.","options":["Canadian","Australian","German","English"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Canadian (加拿大的) 【全文中譯】著名的肉汁乳酪薯條（poutine）是一道深具特色的加拿大道地暖胃小吃。 【選項解析】(A) Canadian 加拿大的 (B) Australian 澳洲的 (C) German 德國的 (D) English 英國的。Poutine 為代表性 Canadian snack。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The royal guards standing outside Buckingham Palace in ______ wear distinctive tall black bearskin hats.","options":["England","France","Germany","Australia"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: England (英格蘭) 【全文中譯】駐守在英格蘭白金漢宮外的皇家衛兵戴著獨特的黑色高頂熊皮帽。 【選項解析】(A) England 英格蘭 (B) France 法國 (C) Germany 德國 (D) Australia 澳洲。Buckingham Palace 位於 England。"},{"number":22,"stem":"High-speed TGV passenger trains whisk commuters between Paris, Lyon, and Marseille across ______.","options":["France","Australia","Canada","England"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: France (法國) 【全文中譯】法國高速列車（TGV）穿梭於全法國的巴黎、里昂與馬賽之間。 【選項解析】(A) France 法國 (B) Australia 澳洲 (C) Canada 加拿大 (D) England 英格蘭。TGV 高鐵服務於 France。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The Outback is a vast, remote, arid desert region located in the inland territory of ______.","options":["Australia","England","France","Germany"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Australia (澳洲) 【全文中譯】內陸荒野地區（Outback）是位於澳洲內陸地區的廣大、偏遠且乾旱的沙漠地帶。 【選項解析】(A) Australia 澳洲 (B) England 英格蘭 (C) France 法國 (D) Germany 德國。Outback 指 Australia 內陸荒漠。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The traditional Octoberfest autumn folk festival celebrated in Munich, ______ attracts millions of visitors annually.","options":["Germany","Canada","England","Australia"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Germany (德國) 【全文中譯】在德國慕尼黑慶祝的傳統十月啤酒節，每年吸引數百萬遊客造訪。 【選項解析】(A) Germany 德國 (B) Canada 加拿大 (C) England 英格蘭 (D) Australia 澳洲。慕尼黑十月啤酒節位於 Germany。"},{"number":25,"stem":"When the polite ______ took his seat at the theater, he graciously tipped his hat to the usher.","options":["Englishman","Canadian","Australian","German"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Englishman (英格蘭紳士) 【全文中譯】當那位有禮的英格蘭紳士在劇院就座時，他親切地向帶位員脫帽致意。 【選項解析】(A) Englishman 英國男士 (B) Canadian 加拿大人 (C) Australian 澳洲人 (D) German 德國人。紳士脫帽致意為 polite Englishman。"}]},{"unit":51,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 51 (051.mp3) Topic Focus: Global Metropolises, International Commerce & Mechanical Tools","topic":"Topic Focus: Global Metropolises, International Commerce & Mechanical Tools | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"Hong Kong","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a major international financial center and city in southern China","chinese":"香港","sentence":"Many international banking companies set up their regional headquarters in ______ because of its active harbor and free trade.","translation":"許多國際銀行公司因為其繁忙的港口和自由貿易而在______設立了區域總部。"},{"word":"New York","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the most populous city and financial center in the United States","chinese":"紐約","sentence":"The Broadway theater district in ______ attracts millions of tourists every year, and people come from everywhere to watch musical shows.","translation":"______的百老匯劇院區每年吸引數百萬遊客，人們從各地前來觀賞音樂劇。"},{"word":"Paris","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the capital city of France, famous for fashion and art","chinese":"巴黎","sentence":"We enjoyed drinking hot coffee at an outdoor cafe in ______, and later in the afternoon we walked toward the famous Eiffel Tower.","translation":"我們在______的一家戶外咖啡館享用熱咖啡，隨後在下午走向著名的艾菲爾鐵塔。"},{"word":"London","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the capital city of the United Kingdom, located on the River Thames","chinese":"倫敦","sentence":"Tourists gathered along the River Thames in ______ to take photographs of Big Ben, but a sudden fog covered the historic bridge.","translation":"遊客聚集在______泰晤士河畔拍攝大笨鐘的照片，但一陣突如其來的濃霧籠罩了這座歷史悠久的大橋。"},{"word":"international","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"relating to, involving, or between two or more nations","chinese":"國際的","sentence":"The foreign trade fair was an important ______ event for local exporters, and business leaders signed multiple trade agreements there.","translation":"這場對外貿易展覽會對本地出口商而言是一次重要的______盛事，商業領袖在會上簽署了多項貿易協議。"},{"word":"tool","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a handheld device used to carry out a particular mechanical function","chinese":"工具","sentence":"The clever mechanic selected the correct repair ______ from his heavy toolbox, and he tightened the loose metal screw on the engine.","translation":"這位熟練的技工從他沉重的工具箱中挑選出正確的維修______，並鎖緊了引擎上鬆動的金屬螺絲。"},{"word":"instrument","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a tool or device used for delicate scientific, medical, or musical work","chinese":"儀器；樂器","sentence":"The hospital laboratory installed a precise scientific ______ yesterday, and doctors can now test medical samples much faster.","translation":"這家醫院實驗室昨天安裝了一台精密的科學______，醫生們現在可以更快地檢測醫療樣本。"},{"word":"hammer","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a heavy hand tool with a metal head used for pounding nails","chinese":"鐵鎚；鎚打","sentence":"The carpenter used a steel ______ to drive several long nails into the wooden frame, and the bookshelf became very steady.","translation":"木匠使用一把鋼______將幾根長釘敲進木框中，書架頓時變得非常穩固。"},{"word":"rope","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a strong, thick cord made by twisting together strands of hemp or wire","chinese":"繩索","sentence":"The brave mountain climbers tied a strong nylon ______ around their waists, so they could safely cross the dangerous snowy ridge.","translation":"勇敢的登山客在腰間繫上堅韌的尼龍______，這樣他們就能安全地穿越危險的積雪山脊。"},{"word":"pump","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a mechanical machine used to move liquids or gases; to move fluid","chinese":"幫浦；抽水機；充氣","sentence":"My bicycle tire was completely flat this morning, so my brother used a hand ______ to fill it with air before school.","translation":"我的腳踏車輪胎今天早上完全沒氣了，所以我哥哥在上學前用一把手動______幫它充飽氣。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The mechanic carefully stored each steel ______ inside the garage cabinet so that he could easily find what he needed.","options":["tool","rope","pump","hammer"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: tool (工具) 【全文中譯】技工將每件鋼製工具整齊存放在車庫櫥櫃中，以便隨時找到所需物品。 【選項解析】(A) tool 工具 (B) rope 繩索 (C) pump 幫浦 (D) hammer 鐵鎚。由 stored in garage cabinet 可知廣義指 tool。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Thousands of travelers visited Big Ben in ______ during their summer holiday, but continuous afternoon rain forced them indoors.","options":["Paris","London","Hong Kong","New York"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: London (倫敦) 【全文中譯】數千名遊客在暑假期間造訪了倫敦的大笨鐘，但午後持續的大雨迫使他們回到室內。 【選項解析】(A) Paris 巴黎 (B) London 倫敦 (C) Hong Kong 香港 (D) New York 紐約。Big Ben 位於倫敦 London。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The carpenter picked up a heavy iron ______ from the workbench, and he pounded the sharp nail into the wooden plank.","options":["pump","rope","hammer","tool"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: hammer (鐵鎚) 【全文中譯】木匠從工作台上拿起一把沉重的鐵鎚，將鋒利的釘子敲進了木板。 【選項解析】(A) pump 幫浦 (B) rope 繩索 (C) hammer 鐵鎚 (D) tool 工具。pounded the nail（釘釘子）使用 hammer。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Many multinational companies established financial offices in ______ because of its low tax rates and busy trading harbor.","options":["Hong Kong","London","Paris","New York"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Hong Kong (香港) 【全文中譯】許多跨國企業因為低稅率與繁榮的貿易港口而在香港設立了財務辦公室。 【選項解析】(A) Hong Kong 香港 (B) London 倫敦 (C) Paris 巴黎 (D) New York 紐約。由港口貿易與國際金融港可知選 Hong Kong。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The sailor quickly threw a thick coil of ______ to the dock workers so that they could secure the ship to the pier.","options":["tool","hammer","rope","pump"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: rope (繩索) 【全文中譯】水手迅速將一捆厚重的繩索拋給碼頭工人，以便他們將船隻固定在碼頭邊。 【選項解析】(A) tool 工具 (B) hammer 鐵鎚 (C) rope 繩索 (D) pump 幫浦。繫船固定用的是 rope。"},{"number":6,"stem":"The United Nations organized an ______ conference on climate change, and representatives from fifty nations attended the opening ceremony.","options":["international","ancient","ordinary","natural"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: international (國際的) 【全文中譯】聯合國組織了一場關於氣候變遷的國際會議，來自五十個國家的代表出席了開幕式。 【選項解析】(A) international 國際的 (B) ancient 古老的 (C) ordinary 普通的 (D) natural 自然的。五十國代表出席屬 international。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The bicycle shop owner lent me an air ______ to inflate my tires, and he reminded me to check the tire pressure regularly.","options":["rope","tool","hammer","pump"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: pump (充氣筒；幫浦) 【全文中譯】腳踏車店老闆借給我一個打氣筒來幫輪胎充氣，並提醒我定期檢查胎壓。 【選項解析】(A) rope 繩索 (B) tool 工具 (C) hammer 鐵鎚 (D) pump 幫浦。inflate tires 需用 air pump。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The Louvre Museum in ______ houses famous works of classical art, and art students flock there from all over the world.","options":["London","Paris","New York","Hong Kong"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: Paris (巴黎) 【全文中譯】巴黎的羅浮宮博物館收藏了古典藝術名作，來自世界各地的藝術系學生紛紛湧向那裡。 【選項解析】(A) London 倫敦 (B) Paris 巴黎 (C) New York 紐約 (D) Hong Kong 香港。Louvre 位於巴黎 Paris。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The medical research team utilized a delicate electronic ______ to monitor brain activity while the volunteer patient slept peacefully.","options":["instrument","rope","hammer","pump"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: instrument (精密儀器) 【全文中譯】醫療研究團隊使用精密的電子儀器監測大腦活動，此時志願病患正在安詳入睡。 【選項解析】(A) instrument 儀器 (B) rope 繩索 (C) hammer 鐵鎚 (D) pump 幫浦。監測大腦需精密儀器 instrument。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Wall Street in ______ serves as the vibrant financial center of America, and stock prices fluctuate dramatically throughout the business day.","options":["Paris","Hong Kong","New York","London"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: New York (紐約) 【全文中譯】紐約的華爾街是美國充滿活力的金融中心，整個營業日期間股票價格波動劇烈。 【選項解析】(A) Paris 巴黎 (B) Hong Kong 香港 (C) New York 紐約 (D) London 倫敦。Wall Street 位於紐約 New York。"},{"number":11,"stem":"You should always use the right gardening ______ when digging holes for flowers, or you may easily damage your garden trowel.","options":["pump","tool","hammer","rope"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: tool (工具) 【全文中譯】為花朵挖坑時應當使用正確的園藝工具，否則可能會損壞你的花園泥鏟。 【選項解析】(A) pump 幫浦 (B) tool 工具 (C) hammer 鐵鎚 (D) rope 繩索。gardening tool 指園藝工具。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The rock climbers secured their safety harness to a sturdy mountain ______ before descending the steep rocky cliff.","options":["rope","tool","hammer","pump"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: rope (繩索) 【全文中譯】攀岩者在沿著陡峭岩壁垂降之前，先將安全帶固定在堅固的登山繩索上。 【選項解析】(A) rope 繩索 (B) tool 工具 (C) hammer 鐵鎚 (D) pump 幫浦。攀岩垂降依賴 mountain rope。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Before hanging the heavy family picture on the living room wall, father used a small ______ to drive a brass nail into the plaster.","options":["pump","hammer","tool","rope"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: hammer (鐵鎚) 【全文中譯】在把沉重的全家福掛上客廳牆壁前，父親用小鐵鎚將銅釘敲進石膏牆。 【選項解析】(A) pump 幫浦 (B) hammer 鐵鎚 (C) tool 工具 (D) rope 繩索。敲釘子動作 drive a brass nail 需用 hammer。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The underground subway system in ______ is famous for its circular underground logo and carries millions of commuters each day.","options":["London","Hong Kong","Paris","New York"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: London (倫敦) 【全文中譯】倫敦的地下地鐵系統以其圓形標誌聞名，每天運送數百萬名通勤乘客。 【選項解析】(A) London 倫敦 (B) Hong Kong 香港 (C) Paris 巴黎 (D) New York 紐約。Underground（地鐵）為倫敦 London 特色。"},{"number":15,"stem":"To prevent the basement from flooding during torrential rainstorms, the building manager installed an automatic water ______.","options":["tool","rope","hammer","pump"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: pump (抽水機；幫浦) 【全文中譯】為了防止暴雨期間地下室淹水，大樓管理員安裝了一台自動抽水機。 【選項解析】(A) tool 工具 (B) rope 繩索 (C) hammer 鐵鎚 (D) pump 抽水機。排水防澇用 water pump。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Students who participate in the ______ student exchange program can study abroad for one full semester in Europe.","options":["international","daily","silent","rapid"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: international (國際的) 【全文中譯】參加國際學生交換計畫的學生可以在歐洲留學整整一個學期。 【選項解析】(A) international 國際的 (B) daily 每日的 (C) silent 沉默的 (D) rapid 迅速的。海外留學交換為 international exchange。"},{"number":17,"stem":"The doctor sterilized each surgical ______ before entering the operating room to ensure the safety of the patient.","options":["instrument","pump","hammer","rope"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: instrument (器械；儀器) 【全文中譯】醫生在進入手術室之前對每件手術器械進行了消毒，以確保病人的安全。 【選項解析】(A) instrument 器械 (B) pump 幫浦 (C) hammer 鐵鎚 (D) rope 繩索。外科手術器械為 surgical instrument。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Visitors to ______ often take a scenic ride on the historic Star Ferry to admire the illuminated city skyline across Victoria Harbour.","options":["Paris","London","Hong Kong","New York"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: Hong Kong (香港) 【全文中譯】造訪香港的遊客常乘坐歷史悠久的天星小輪，欣賞維多利亞港對岸璀璨的天際線。 【選項解析】(A) Paris 巴黎 (B) London 倫敦 (C) Hong Kong 香港 (D) New York 紐約。Victoria Harbour 與天星小輪位於 Hong Kong。"},{"number":19,"stem":"When the tire pressure warning light appeared on the dashboard, Henry pulled into a service station to borrow a tire ______.","options":["rope","hammer","pump","tool"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: pump (充氣機；打氣筒) 【全文中譯】當儀表板上的胎壓警示燈亮起時，亨利將車開進保養廠借了一台輪胎充氣筒。 【選項解析】(A) rope 繩索 (B) hammer 鐵鎚 (C) pump 幫浦 (D) tool 工具。為輪胎補氣需用 pump。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The famous statue of Liberty stands proudly in the harbor of ______, welcoming immigrants and travelers from across the ocean.","options":["London","New York","Paris","Hong Kong"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: New York (紐約) 【全文中譯】著名的自由女神像驕傲地矗立在紐約港，歡迎來自大洋彼岸的移民與旅客。 【選項解析】(A) London 倫敦 (B) New York 紐約 (C) Paris 巴黎 (D) Hong Kong 香港。Statue of Liberty 位於紐約 New York。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The construction company purchased an electric power ______ to accelerate drilling through the thick concrete foundation.","options":["tool","rope","hammer","pump"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: tool (工具) 【全文中譯】這家營造公司購買了一台電動工具，以加快鑽透厚實混凝土基礎的速度。 【選項解析】(A) tool 工具 (B) rope 繩索 (C) hammer 鐵鎚 (D) pump 幫浦。電動工具統稱為 electric power tool。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Walking along the historic riverbanks of the Seine in ______ offers romantic views of Notre-Dame Cathedral and local artists.","options":["Paris","London","Hong Kong","New York"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Paris (巴黎) 【全文中譯】沿著巴黎塞納河的歷史河岸漫步，可以欣賞聖母院大教堂和街頭藝術家的浪漫景色。 【選項解析】(A) Paris 巴黎 (B) London 倫敦 (C) Hong Kong 香港 (D) New York 紐約。塞納河與聖母院位於巴黎 Paris。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The rescue team tied a knot in the rescue ______ and lowered it down the deep cave to pull the trapped explorer to safety.","options":["hammer","pump","rope","tool"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: rope (繩索) 【全文中譯】搜救隊在救援繩索上打了個結，並將它垂入深洞中，將受困的探險家拉至安全處。 【選項解析】(A) hammer 鐵鎚 (B) pump 幫浦 (C) rope 繩索 (D) tool 工具。垂入洞穴救人使用 rescue rope。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The violinist treated her musical ______ with exceptional care because it was handcrafted over two hundred years ago.","options":["rope","instrument","hammer","pump"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: instrument (樂器) 【全文中譯】小提琴家對她的樂器格外珍惜，因為它是兩百多年前純手工打造的。 【選項解析】(A) rope 繩索 (B) instrument 樂器 (C) hammer 鐵鎚 (D) pump 幫浦。musical instrument 指樂器。"},{"number":25,"stem":"With a single strike of the heavy sledge ______, the demolition worker cracked the old brick wall into several pieces.","options":["pump","tool","rope","hammer"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: hammer (鐵鎚；大鎚) 【全文中譯】隨著重型大鐵鎚的一記重擊，拆除工人將那座老舊磚牆砸碎成了數塊。 【選項解析】(A) pump 幫浦 (B) tool 工具 (C) rope 繩索 (D) hammer 鐵鎚。sledge hammer 指大鐵鎚。"}]},{"unit":52,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 52 (052.mp3) Topic Focus: Engines, Industrial Materials, Metals & Mechanical Power","topic":"Topic Focus: Engines, Industrial Materials, Metals & Mechanical Power | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"engine","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a machine with moving parts that converts power into motion","chinese":"引擎；發動機","sentence":"The driver turned the key to start the car ______, and the vehicle moved smoothly onto the highway toward Taipei.","translation":"司機轉動鑰匙發動了汽車______，車輛便平穩地駛上前往台北的公路。"},{"word":"rubber","pos":"(n.) / (adj.)","definition":"a tough, elastic substance made from the sap of tropical trees","chinese":"橡膠；橡膠的","sentence":"Waterproof boots are usually made of thick ______, so factory workers can keep their feet dry when working in wet areas.","translation":"防水靴通常由厚______製成，因此工廠工人在潮濕區域工作時能保持雙腳乾燥。"},{"word":"wheel","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a circular object that revolves on an axle to allow movement","chinese":"車輪；方向盤","sentence":"The bicycle mechanic quickly replaced the damaged front ______ so that the boy could ride safely around the neighborhood.","translation":"自行車技工迅速更換了損壞的前______，好讓小男孩可以在社區附近安全騎車。"},{"word":"iron","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a strong, hard magnetic silver-gray metal; to smooth clothes","chinese":"鐵；熨斗；熨燙","sentence":"My grandmother asked me to ______ my school uniform shirts before Monday morning so they would look neat and clean.","translation":"我祖母要求我在星期一早上之前先______好學校制服襯衫，這樣看起來才會整潔乾淨。"},{"word":"metal","pos":"(n.) / (adj.)","definition":"a solid material that is hard, shiny, and good at conducting heat","chinese":"金屬；金屬製的","sentence":"Heavy cooking pots are usually made of strong ______, and they conduct heat quickly over an open kitchen fire.","translation":"厚重的烹飪鍋通常由堅固的______製成，它們在開放的廚房爐火上能快速導熱。"},{"word":"force","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"physical strength or power; to compel someone to do something","chinese":"力量；武力；強迫","sentence":"The fierce typhoon wind struck the coastal town with enormous ______, and several old trees were blown down onto the street.","translation":"猛烈的颱風以巨大的______襲擊了沿海小鎮，幾棵老樹被吹倒在街道上。"},{"word":"power","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the ability to do something or act in a particular way; energy","chinese":"力量；電力；權力","sentence":"The sudden summer thunderstorm knocked down electrical wires, and the whole neighborhood lost electrical ______ for two hours.","translation":"突如其來的夏日雷陣雨擊斷了電線，整個社區失去了電______長達兩小時。"},{"word":"powerful","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"having great power, strength, influence, or physical force","chinese":"強大的；強而有力的","sentence":"The cargo truck has a very ______ diesel engine, so it can easily carry tons of heavy building supplies up steep mountain roads.","translation":"這輛貨車配備了非常______的柴油引擎，因此能輕鬆運載數噸沉重的建築材料攀登陡峭山路。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The train mechanic inspected the diesel ______ carefully because strange knocking sounds came from the front compartment.","options":["engine","wheel","metal","rubber"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: engine (引擎) 【全文中譯】火車技工仔細檢查了柴油引擎，因為前車廂傳來了奇怪的敲擊聲。 【選項解析】(A) engine 引擎 (B) wheel 車輪 (C) metal 金屬 (D) rubber 橡膠。柴油發動機為 diesel engine。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Modern car tires are manufactured from synthetic ______ to provide strong traction during heavy rainfall.","options":["iron","rubber","engine","wheel"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: rubber (橡膠) 【全文中譯】現代汽車輪胎由合成橡膠製成，以在大雨中提供強大的抓地力。 【選項解析】(A) iron 鐵 (B) rubber 橡膠 (C) engine 引擎 (D) wheel 車輪。輪胎主要成分為 rubber。"},{"number":3,"stem":"When the car got a flat tire on the freeway, Mr. Brown stopped at the shoulder to change the rear ______.","options":["force","power","engine","wheel"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: wheel (車輪) 【全文中譯】當汽車在高速公路上爆胎時，布朗先生停在路肩更換後輪。 【選項解析】(A) force 力量 (B) power 電力 (C) engine 引擎 (D) wheel 車輪。換輪胎為 change rear wheel。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Before attending the formal job interview, Kevin used a hot electric ______ to smooth the wrinkles from his dress shirt.","options":["iron","wheel","rubber","engine"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: iron (熨斗) 【全文中譯】在參加正式工作面試前，凱文用發熱的電熨斗燙平了襯衫上的褶皺。 【選項解析】(A) iron 熨斗 (B) wheel 車輪 (C) rubber 橡膠 (D) engine 引擎。燙衣服用 electric iron。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Gold and silver are valuable types of ______, and craftsmen have shaped them into exquisite jewelry for centuries.","options":["power","metal","force","wheel"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: metal (金屬) 【全文中譯】金和銀是珍貴的金屬，工匠們幾個世紀以來一直將它們塑造成精美的珠寶。 【選項解析】(A) power 力量 (B) metal 金屬 (C) force 武力 (D) wheel 車輪。金銀屬於 metal。"},{"number":6,"stem":"The ocean waves crashed against the rocky seawall with incredible ______, spraying seawater high into the air.","options":["metal","wheel","force","rubber"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: force (力量；威力) 【全文中譯】海浪以驚人的力量衝擊岩石防波堤，將海水高高噴向空中。 【選項解析】(A) metal 金屬 (B) wheel 車輪 (C) force 力量 (D) rubber 橡膠。衝擊威力為 force。"},{"number":7,"stem":"Solar panels installed on the school roof generate clean electrical ______ to operate all the classroom air conditioners.","options":["power","wheel","iron","engine"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: power (電力；能源) 【全文中譯】學校屋頂安裝的太陽能板產生清潔的電力，以運轉教室內所有的冷氣機。 【選項解析】(A) power 電力 (B) wheel 車輪 (C) iron 鐵 (D) engine 引擎。產生電能為 generate electrical power。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The sports car is equipped with a ______ V8 motor that accelerates from zero to sixty miles per hour in seconds.","options":["powerful","natural","silent","daily"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: powerful (強大的) 【全文中譯】這輛跑車配備了強大的V8發動機，在幾秒鐘內就能從零加速到每小時六十英里。 【選項解析】(A) powerful 強大的 (B) natural 自然的 (C) silent 沉默的 (D) daily 每日的。修飾高效能引擎用 powerful。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The airplane captain started the jet ______ and waited for the control tower to clear the runway for takeoff.","options":["engine","rubber","iron","force"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: engine (引擎) 【全文中譯】飛機機長啟動了噴射引擎，等待控制塔台批准跑道起飛。 【選項解析】(A) engine 引擎 (B) rubber 橡膠 (C) iron 鐵 (D) force 力量。啟動噴射發動機為 start jet engine。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Children love playing with bouncy ______ balls in the park, but they must be careful not to let them roll onto the street.","options":["metal","rubber","engine","power"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: rubber (橡膠) 【全文中譯】孩子們喜歡在公園裡玩彈力橡膠球，但他們必須小心不要讓球滾到街上。 【選項解析】(A) metal 金屬 (B) rubber 橡膠 (C) engine 引擎 (D) power 力量。彈力球為 bouncy rubber ball。"},{"number":11,"stem":"The heavy wagon had four large wooden ______ banded with iron to withstand traveling over rugged dirt trails.","options":["engines","wheels","metals","forces"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: wheels (車輪) 【全文中譯】沉重的馬車有四個用鐵圈加固的大木輪，以承受在崎嶇泥濘小徑上的行駛。 【選項解析】(A) engines 引擎 (B) wheels 車輪 (C) metals 金屬 (D) forces 力量。馬車的輪子為 wooden wheels。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Magnetite is a natural mineral that contains large amounts of ______, and it attracts small metal objects easily.","options":["rubber","wheel","iron","engine"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: iron (鐵) 【全文中譯】磁鐵礦是一種含有大量鐵的天然礦物，它很容易吸引小型金屬物體。 【選項解析】(A) rubber 橡膠 (B) wheel 車輪 (C) iron 鐵 (D) engine 引擎。磁鐵礦富含鐵 iron。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Construction workers erected strong scaffolding made of galvanized ______ to support the exterior renovation of the tall museum.","options":["metal","power","force","rubber"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: metal (金屬) 【全文中譯】建築工人搭建了由鍍鋅金屬製成的堅固鷹架，以支撐高大博物館的外觀翻修。 【選項解析】(A) metal 金屬 (B) power 力量 (C) force 武力 (D) rubber 橡膠。鍍鋅金屬鷹架為 galvanized metal scaffolding。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The police officer did not want to use physical ______ against the suspect, but the man refused to put his hands up.","options":["metal","force","wheel","iron"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: force (武力；力量) 【全文中譯】警察不想對嫌犯使用武力，但該名男子拒絕舉起雙手。 【選項解析】(A) metal 金屬 (B) force 武力 (C) wheel 車輪 (D) iron 鐵。動用武力為 use physical force。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Nuclear reactors produce substantial amounts of electrical ______, yet governments must enforce strict safety protocols.","options":["power","rubber","engine","wheel"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: power (電力) 【全文中譯】核反應爐產生大量的電力，但政府必須執行嚴格的安全規範。 【選項解析】(A) power 電力 (B) rubber 橡膠 (C) engine 引擎 (D) wheel 車輪。發電為 produce electrical power。"},{"number":16,"stem":"With a ______ kick from the striker, the soccer ball flew straight past the goalkeeper into the top corner of the net.","options":["powerful","weekly","rapid","rare"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: powerful (強而有力的) 【全文中譯】隨著前鋒一記有力的射門，足球直接越過守門員飛入球網頂角。 【選項解析】(A) powerful 有力的 (B) weekly 每週的 (C) rapid 快速的 (D) rare 罕見的。強勁射門為 powerful kick。"},{"number":17,"stem":"If you hear a loud hissing noise from under the hood, turn off the automobile ______ immediately to prevent overheating.","options":["wheel","engine","rubber","iron"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: engine (引擎) 【全文中譯】如果你聽到引擎蓋下傳來很大的嘶嘶聲，請立即關閉汽車發動機以防止過熱。 【選項解析】(A) wheel 車輪 (B) engine 引擎 (C) rubber 橡膠 (D) iron 鐵。關閉發動機為 turn off engine。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The sole of my running shoe is made of durable ______, which protects my feet from shock when jogging on asphalt roads.","options":["iron","power","rubber","metal"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: rubber (橡膠) 【全文中譯】我慢跑鞋的鞋底由耐用的橡膠製成，在瀝青路上慢跑時能保護我的雙腳免受衝擊。 【選項解析】(A) iron 鐵 (B) power 力量 (C) rubber 橡膠 (D) metal 金屬。鞋底為 rubber sole。"},{"number":19,"stem":"When the bus driver turned the steering ______ sharply to the left, all the standing passengers grabbed the handrails.","options":["wheel","engine","metal","force"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: wheel (方向盤) 【全文中譯】當公車司機將方向盤猛地向左打時，所有站著的乘客都抓緊了扶手。 【選項解析】(A) wheel 方向盤 (B) engine 引擎 (C) metal 金屬 (D) force 力量。steering wheel 指方向盤。"},{"number":20,"stem":"You should never leave a heated clothes ______ facedown on a garment, or the intense heat will burn a hole through the fabric.","options":["metal","iron","rubber","power"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: iron (熨斗) 【全文中譯】你絕不能把加熱的熨斗正面朝下放在衣物上，否則高溫會在布料上燙出一個洞。 【選項解析】(A) metal 金屬 (B) iron 熨斗 (C) rubber 橡膠 (D) power 力量。加熱熨斗為 heated clothes iron。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Cans used for preserving canned vegetables are typically made of thin sheets of ______ coated with protective tin.","options":["force","wheel","metal","rubber"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: metal (金屬) 【全文中譯】用於保存蔬菜的罐頭通常由塗有保護性錫的薄金屬片製成。 【選項解析】(A) force 力量 (B) wheel 車輪 (C) metal 金屬 (D) rubber 橡膠。罐頭為 thin sheets of metal。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Gravitational ______ keeps all the planets orbiting around the sun in predictable elliptical paths throughout the universe.","options":["force","iron","rubber","wheel"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: force (引力；力量) 【全文中譯】萬有引力讓所有行星在整個宇宙中沿著可預測的橢圓軌道繞太陽運行。 【選項解析】(A) force 力量 (B) iron 鐵 (C) rubber 橡膠 (D) wheel 車輪。重力為 gravitational force。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The ancient king held absolute political ______ over his empire, but he listened to the wise counsel of his trusted advisors.","options":["metal","power","wheel","rubber"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: power (權力) 【全文中譯】這位古代國王對其帝國擁有絕對的政治權力，但他聽取了他信任的顧問們的明智建議。 【選項解析】(A) metal 金屬 (B) power 權力 (C) wheel 車輪 (D) rubber 橡膠。政治權力為 political power。"},{"number":24,"stem":"A ______ magnet was used at the recycling center to separate discarded iron cans from piles of plastic trash.","options":["powerful","single","ordinary","classic"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: powerful (強力的) 【全文中譯】回收中心使用了一塊強力磁鐵，從成堆的塑膠垃圾中分選出廢棄鐵罐。 【選項解析】(A) powerful 強力的 (B) single 單一的 (C) ordinary 普通的 (D) classic 經典的。強力磁鐵為 powerful magnet。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Modern electric vehicles rely on an electric motor rather than a traditional gasoline ______ to propel the vehicle forward.","options":["wheel","engine","rubber","iron"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: engine (引擎) 【全文中譯】現代電動車依靠電動馬達而不是傳統的汽油引擎來驅動車輛前進。 【選項解析】(A) wheel 車輪 (B) engine 引擎 (C) rubber 橡膠 (D) iron 鐵。汽油引擎為 gasoline engine。"}]},{"unit":53,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 53 (053.mp3) Topic Focus: Manufacturing, Operations, Technology Maintenance & Historical Periods","topic":"Topic Focus: Manufacturing, Operations, Technology Maintenance & Historical Periods | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"operation","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the action of functioning; a medical surgery or organized process","chinese":"操作；運作；手術","sentence":"The surgical team performed a difficult heart ______ yesterday morning, and the patient is now resting quietly in the hospital.","translation":"手術團隊昨天早上執行了一場難度很高的心臟______，病人現在正在醫院裡安靜休養。"},{"word":"robot","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a machine capable of carrying out a complex series of actions automatically","chinese":"機器人","sentence":"The modern electronics factory uses an intelligent industrial ______ to assemble delicate computer parts with high precision.","translation":"這座現代電子工廠使用一台智慧型工業______，以極高的精確度組裝精密的電腦零件。"},{"word":"maintain","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to cause or enable a condition or state of affairs to continue; service","chinese":"維持；保養；維修","sentence":"Building owners must regularly ______ their fire alarm systems, so everyone inside the high-rise can evacuate quickly in an emergency.","translation":"大樓業主必須定期______他們的火警系統，以便高樓內的所有人在緊急情況下能迅速疏散。"},{"word":"produce","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to make or manufacture from components or raw materials; fresh food","chinese":"生產；製造；農產品","sentence":"The fertile agricultural valley can ______ tons of fresh sweet melons each summer, which are shipped to supermarkets nationwide.","translation":"這座肥沃的農業山谷每年夏天都能______數噸新鮮甜瓜，並運往全國各地的超市。"},{"word":"production","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the action of manufacturing from raw materials, or a theatrical work","chinese":"生產；製造；產量","sentence":"The local car factory temporarily stopped automobile ______ because of a severe worldwide shortage of essential computer chips.","translation":"這家本地汽車工廠暫時停止了汽車______，因為全球嚴重短缺關鍵電腦晶片。"},{"word":"repair","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to restore something damaged, faulty, or worn to a good condition","chinese":"修理；修復","sentence":"The experienced mechanic needed three hours to ______ the cracked water pipe, and clean water flowed into our house again.","translation":"經驗豐富的技工花了三個小時才______好破裂的水管，乾淨的水隨後又流進了我們家。"},{"word":"ancient","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"belonging to the very distant past and no longer in existence","chinese":"古代的；古老的","sentence":"Archaeologists discovered an ______ stone tomb buried deep beneath the desert sand, which contained valuable gold artifacts.","translation":"考古學家在沙漠深處發現了一座埋藏很深的______石墓，裡面藏有珍貴的黃金文物。"},{"word":"recent","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"having happened, begun, or been done not long ago or lately","chinese":"最近的；近來的","sentence":"A ______ medical study indicates that walking for thirty minutes every day greatly reduces the risk of heart disease.","translation":"一項______醫學研究指出，每天散步三十分鐘可顯著降低罹患心臟病的風險。"},{"word":"calendar","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a chart or series of pages showing the days, weeks, and months of a year","chinese":"日曆；行事曆","sentence":"Teacher Linda marked the upcoming school sports day on her desk ______, reminding all the students to practice running.","translation":"琳達老師在她桌上的______上標記了即將到來的學校運動會，提醒所有學生練習跑步。"},{"word":"period","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a length or portion of time; a punctuation mark","chinese":"期間；時代；句點","sentence":"The famous artist lived in Paris for a brief ______ during his youth, where he created his finest oil paintings.","translation":"這位著名藝術家在青年時期曾在巴黎度過了一段短暫的______，在那裡他創作了他最好的油畫。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The doctor assured the anxious family that the surgical ______ had gone smoothly without any medical complications.","options":["operation","calendar","robot","period"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: operation (手術) 【全文中譯】醫生向焦急的家屬保證，外科手術進行得很順利，沒有任何醫療併發症。 【選項解析】(A) operation 手術 (B) calendar 日曆 (C) robot 機器人 (D) period 期間。surgical operation 為外科手術。"},{"number":2,"stem":"In the automated car assembly plant, each robotic ______ welds metal sheets together faster than human workers.","options":["calendar","robot","period","production"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: robot (機器人) 【全文中譯】在自動化汽車裝配廠中，每個機械人手臂焊接金屬板的速度都比人類工人更快。 【選項解析】(A) calendar 日曆 (B) robot 機器人 (C) period 期間 (D) production 生產。robotic robot 指機器人。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Homeowners should hire a certified technician to ______ their air conditioning units before the hot summer arrives.","options":["repair","maintain","produce","quit"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: maintain (保養；維持) 【全文中譯】屋主在炎熱的夏天到來前，應該聘請合格的技師來保養他們的冷氣機。 【選項解析】(A) repair 修理 (B) maintain 保養 (C) produce 製造 (D) quit 放棄。定期保養為 maintain。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Taiwan's warm climate and rich soil allow local farmers to ______ delicious tropical fruits throughout the entire year.","options":["hire","quit","maintain","produce"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: produce (生產；出產) 【全文中譯】台灣溫暖的氣候與肥沃的土壤使本地農民整年都能生產美味的熱帶水果。 【選項解析】(A) hire 雇用 (B) quit 停止 (C) maintain 維持 (D) produce 生產。出產農作物用 produce。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Due to an unexpected machinery breakdown, factory ______ was halted for two days while technicians inspected the assembly line.","options":["operation","production","robot","calendar"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: production (生產；製造) 【全文中譯】由於突發的機械故障，工廠生產暫停了兩天，期間技術人員檢查了裝配線。 【選項解析】(A) operation 操作 (B) production 生產 (C) robot 機器人 (D) calendar 日曆。工廠產能暫停為 factory production halted。"},{"number":6,"stem":"After our old television screen suddenly turned black, grandfather called a local shop to ______ the broken circuit board.","options":["maintain","repair","produce","trade"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: repair (修理) 【全文中譯】在我們的老電視螢幕突然變黑之後，祖父打電話給當地店家來修理損壞的電路板。 【選項解析】(A) maintain 保養 (B) repair 修理 (C) produce 生產 (D) trade 交易。修復壞掉的物品用 repair。"},{"number":7,"stem":"Historians study ______ Roman architecture to understand how those early builders constructed durable stone aqueducts.","options":["ancient","recent","daily","single"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: ancient (古老的；古代的) 【全文中譯】歷史學家研究古代羅馬建築，以了解那些早期建築師如何建造耐用的石造引水道。 【選項解析】(A) ancient 古代的 (B) recent 最近的 (C) daily 每日的 (D) single 單一的。羅馬帝國時期屬 ancient。"},{"number":8,"stem":"According to a ______ consumer survey, more teenagers prefer shopping on online platforms rather than visiting department stores.","options":["daily","recent","silent","violent"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: recent (最近的) 【全文中譯】根據最近的一項消費者調查，更多青少年更喜歡在線上平台購物，而不是逛百貨公司。 【選項解析】(A) daily 每日的 (B) recent 最近的 (C) silent 沉默的 (D) violent 暴力的。近期的調查為 recent survey。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Mark wrote down the dates of his mid-term exams on the wall ______ hanging beside his bedroom study desk.","options":["robot","period","operation","calendar"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: calendar (日曆；行事曆) 【全文中譯】馬克將期中考的日期記在掛在臥室書桌旁的牆上日曆上。 【選項解析】(A) robot 機器人 (B) period 期間 (C) operation 手術 (D) calendar 日曆。記錄考試日期使用 calendar。"},{"number":10,"stem":"During the peaceful ______ following the war, the damaged economy recovered quickly and international trade flourished.","options":["calendar","robot","period","operation"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: period (時期；期間) 【全文中譯】在戰後那段和平的時期裡，受損的經濟迅速復甦，國際貿易也蓬勃發展。 【選項解析】(A) calendar 日曆 (B) robot 機器人 (C) period 時期 (D) operation 運作。一段時期為 peaceful period。"},{"number":11,"stem":"The emergency search-and-rescue ______ continued throughout the stormy night until the lost hiker was found safe.","options":["operation","period","robot","calendar"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: operation (行動；運作) 【全文中譯】緊急搜救行動在暴風雨的夜裡持續進行，直到迷路的登山客安全獲救為止。 【選項解析】(A) operation 行動 (B) period 期間 (C) robot 機器人 (D) calendar 日曆。search-and-rescue operation 搜救行動。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Japanese engineers designed a humanoid ______ that can assist elderly nursing home residents with daily tasks.","options":["calendar","period","robot","production"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: robot (機器人) 【全文中譯】日本工程師設計了一款人形機器人，可以協助養老院的年長住民處理日常事務。 【選項解析】(A) calendar 日曆 (B) period 期間 (C) robot 機器人 (D) production 生產。人形機器人為 humanoid robot。"},{"number":13,"stem":"To ______ good physical health, young people should eat balanced meals and get at least eight hours of sleep.","options":["produce","maintain","repair","hire"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: maintain (維持) 【全文中譯】為了保持良好的身體健康，年輕人應當飲食均衡，並且至少睡滿八個小時。 【選項解析】(A) produce 生產 (B) maintain 維持 (C) repair 修理 (D) hire 雇用。維持健康為 maintain good health。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The textile factory can ______ hundreds of cotton shirts every hour using automated computerized knitting machines.","options":["repair","trade","produce","maintain"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: produce (生產) 【全文中譯】這家紡織廠使用全自動電腦針織機，每小時能生產數百件純棉襯衫。 【選項解析】(A) repair 修理 (B) trade 交易 (C) produce 生產 (D) maintain 維持。工廠製造商品為 produce。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Increased grain ______ in eastern Europe helped prevent food shortages in several developing countries this past winter.","options":["period","production","robot","calendar"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: production (產量；生產) 【全文中譯】東歐糧食產量的增加，幫助過去這個冬天幾個開發中國家避免了糧食短缺危機。 【選項解析】(A) period 期間 (B) production 產量 (C) robot 機器人 (D) calendar 日曆。糧食產量為 grain production。"},{"number":16,"stem":"The bicycle mechanic used a small wrench to ______ the slipped chain and tighten the loose pedals on my bike.","options":["maintain","repair","produce","quit"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: repair (修理) 【全文中譯】自行車技工用一把小板手修理掉了的鏈條，並鎖緊了我車上鬆動的腳踏板。 【選項解析】(A) maintain 保養 (B) repair 修理 (C) produce 生產 (D) quit 放棄。修好脫落的鏈條為 repair slipped chain。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Tourists marvel at the ______ stone pyramids of Egypt, wondering how workers moved such enormous granite blocks.","options":["ancient","recent","normal","weekly"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: ancient (古代的) 【全文中譯】遊客驚嘆於埃及古老的石金字塔，好奇當年的工人們是如何搬動如此巨大的花崗岩塊。 【選項解析】(A) ancient 古代的 (B) recent 最近的 (C) normal 正常的 (D) weekly 每週的。金字塔為 ancient pyramids。"},{"number":18,"stem":"In ______ years, electric scooters have become widely popular in cities because they produce zero harmful exhaust emissions.","options":["ancient","recent","sudden","rapid"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: recent (近年來的) 【全文中譯】近年來，電動機車在城市中變得廣受歡迎，因為它們不會排放任何有害廢氣。 【選項解析】(A) ancient 古代的 (B) recent 近年的 (C) sudden 突然的 (D) rapid 快速的。in recent years 為常見時間片語「近年來」。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Please check your desk ______ and tell me if you are free for our quarterly marketing meeting on Friday.","options":["robot","calendar","period","operation"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: calendar (行事曆；日曆) 【全文中譯】請看一下你桌上的行事曆，告訴我你週五是否有空參加我們的季度行銷會議。 【選項解析】(A) robot 機器人 (B) calendar 行事曆 (C) period 期間 (D) operation 手術。查閱行程用 desk calendar。"},{"number":20,"stem":"Dinosaurs dominated the earth for a long geological ______ before a catastrophic asteroid impact led to their extinction.","options":["period","calendar","robot","production"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: period (時期；時代) 【全文中譯】在災難性的小行星撞擊導致恐龍滅絕之前，恐龍曾在漫長的地質時期統治著地球。 【選項解析】(A) period 時期 (B) calendar 日曆 (C) robot 機器人 (D) production 生產。地質時期為 geological period。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The military launched a joint rescue ______ to deliver emergency medical supplies to isolated island villagers.","options":["robot","operation","calendar","period"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: operation (行動) 【全文中譯】軍方展開了一場聯合救援行動，向與世隔絕的島嶼村民運送緊急醫療物資。 【選項解析】(A) robot 機器人 (B) operation 行動 (C) calendar 日曆 (D) period 期間。救援行動為 rescue operation。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The automated vacuum ______ navigates across the living room carpet, cleaning dust particles without any human supervision.","options":["robot","period","calendar","operation"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: robot (機器人) 【全文中譯】全自動掃地機器人在客廳地毯上自動導航，完全不需要任何人為監督即可清理灰塵。 【選項解析】(A) robot 機器人 (B) period 期間 (C) calendar 日曆 (D) operation 手術。自動吸塵機器人為 vacuum robot。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The school custodian works hard to ______ clean classrooms and well-trimmed lawns throughout the school campus.","options":["repair","maintain","produce","quit"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: maintain (維持；維護) 【全文中譯】學校工友辛勤工作，在全校園內維持整潔的教室與修剪整齊的草坪。 【選項解析】(A) repair 修理 (B) maintain 維護 (C) produce 生產 (D) quit 放棄。維持整潔環境為 maintain clean classrooms。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Solar power stations ______ clean electricity by absorbing radiant sunlight with large fields of photovoltaic panels.","options":["produce","repair","maintain","hire"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: produce (生產；發電) 【全文中譯】太陽能發電廠利用廣大的太陽能光電板吸收輻射陽光，藉此產生乾淨的電力。 【選項解析】(A) produce 產生 (B) repair 修理 (C) maintain 維持 (D) hire 雇用。發電產能為 produce electricity。"},{"number":25,"stem":"After months of painstaking work, art restorers managed to ______ the water-damaged Renaissance painting to its former glory.","options":["maintain","produce","repair","trade"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: repair (修復) 【全文中譯】經過數月艱苦的努力，藝術修復師成功修復了受水損壞的文藝復興時期畫作，重現其昔日光芒。 【選項解析】(A) maintain 保養 (B) produce 製造 (C) repair 修復 (D) trade 交易。修復受損畫作為 repair damaged painting。"}]},{"unit":54,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 54 (054.mp3) Topic Focus: Time Units, Academic Scheduling & Educational Subjects","topic":"Topic Focus: Time Units, Academic Scheduling & Educational Subjects | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"daily","pos":"(adj.) / (adv.)","definition":"done, produced, or occurring every day or every weekday","chinese":"每日的；日常的","sentence":"The city newspaper publishes a ______ evening edition, providing commuters with the latest traffic and economic news.","translation":"這家市立報社發行______晚報，為通勤族提供最新的交通與經濟新聞。"},{"word":"weekly","pos":"(adj.) / (adv.)","definition":"done, produced, or occurring once every week","chinese":"每週的；週報","sentence":"Our English teacher assigned a ______ reading journal, and each student must summarize a storybook every Friday.","translation":"我們的英語老師指派了一份______閱讀日誌，每位學生每週五都必須總結一本故事書。"},{"word":"weekday","pos":"(n.)","definition":"any day of the week except Sunday and Saturday","chinese":"平日；工作日","sentence":"The public library is usually very quiet on a ______, but on weekends it fills with noisy children and readers.","translation":"公共圖書館在______通常非常安靜，但一到週末就擠滿了喧鬧的孩子和讀者。"},{"word":"monthly","pos":"(adj.) / (adv.)","definition":"done, produced, or occurring once every month","chinese":"每月的；月刊","sentence":"My family pays a fixed ______ rent for our downtown apartment, which is due on the first day of each calendar month.","translation":"我的家人為我們市中心的公寓支付固定的______租金，該租金在每個曆月的第一天到期。"},{"word":"yearly","pos":"(adj.) / (adv.)","definition":"done, produced, or occurring once every year; annual","chinese":"每年的；一年一度的","sentence":"The international tech company holds its ______ sales convention in Tokyo, inviting top regional branch managers.","translation":"這家跨國科技公司在東京舉辦其______銷售大會，邀請各地的優秀分公司經理。"},{"word":"century","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a period of one hundred years","chinese":"世紀；一百年","sentence":"This majestic Gothic cathedral was built in the twelfth ______, and its stone towers have stood firm for hundreds of years.","translation":"這座宏偉的哥德式大教堂建於十二______，其石塔數百年來一直屹立不搖。"},{"word":"midnight","pos":"(n.)","definition":"twelve o'clock in the middle of the night","chinese":"午夜；半夜十二點","sentence":"The diligent university student stayed up until ______ studying chemistry, but she still woke up early the next morning.","translation":"那位勤奮的大學生熬夜研讀化學直到______，但第二天早晨她依然很早就醒來了。"},{"word":"dawn","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"the first appearance of light in the sky before sunrise","chinese":"黎明；拂曉；破曉","sentence":"Fishermen launched their wooden boats into the bay at ______, hoping to catch fresh tuna before the morning sun rose high.","translation":"漁民們在______將木船駛入海灣，希望能趕在清晨太陽升起之前捕獲新鮮的鮪魚。"},{"word":"course","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a series of lessons or lectures; path or trajectory","chinese":"課程；路線；進程","sentence":"Mary enrolled in an intensive conversation ______ this winter, and her spoken English improved significantly in eight weeks.","translation":"瑪麗今年冬天報名了一門密集會話______，她的英語口說能力在八週內有了顯著進步。"},{"word":"subject","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a branch of knowledge studied in a school or college; topic","chinese":"學科；科目；主題","sentence":"Mathematics is my brother's favorite academic ______, because he loves solving challenging number puzzles and geometry problems.","translation":"數學是我弟弟最喜歡的學術______，因為他熱愛解答具有挑戰性的數字謎題和幾何題目。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Brushing your teeth twice a day should be part of your ______ hygiene routine to keep your teeth healthy.","options":["daily","monthly","yearly","weekly"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: daily (每日的) 【全文中譯】每天刷牙兩次應該成為你日常衛生習慣的一部分，以保持牙齒健康。 【選項解析】(A) daily 每日的 (B) monthly 每月的 (C) yearly 每年的 (D) weekly 每週的。每天刷牙為 daily routine。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The popular cooking magazine is released on a ______ basis, arriving in mailboxes every Tuesday afternoon.","options":["yearly","weekly","daily","monthly"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: weekly (每週的) 【全文中譯】這本受歡迎的烹飪雜誌每週發行一次，每週二下午寄送到住家信箱。 【選項解析】(A) yearly 每年的 (B) weekly 每週的 (C) daily 每日的 (D) monthly 每月的。週二送達為 weekly basis。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Highway traffic is extremely congested during morning rush hour on every ______, but roads are quiet on Sunday.","options":["century","weekday","midnight","dawn"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: weekday (平日；工作日) 【全文中譯】每個工作日的早晨尖峰時段高速公路交通都極度壅塞，但週日路上很安靜。 【選項解析】(A) century 世紀 (B) weekday 平日 (C) midnight 午夜 (D) dawn 黎明。與週日對比為 weekday。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Many workers receive a ______ salary at the end of the month, which allows them to budget for rent and groceries.","options":["weekly","daily","monthly","yearly"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: monthly (每月的) 【全文中譯】許多上班族在月底領取每月薪水，這讓他們能妥善規劃房租與伙食預算。 【選項解析】(A) weekly 每週的 (B) daily 每日的 (C) monthly 每月的 (D) yearly 每年的。月底領薪為 monthly salary。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The school holds a ______ sports day every autumn, where classes compete against each other in track and field.","options":["yearly","monthly","daily","weekly"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: yearly (每年的；一年一度的) 【全文中譯】學校每年秋天都會舉辦一年一度的運動會，各班級在田徑項目上一較高下。 【選項解析】(A) yearly 每年的 (B) monthly 每月的 (C) daily 每日的 (D) weekly 每週的。秋季舉辦為 yearly sports day。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Great advancements in medical science occurred during the twentieth ______, dramatically extending human life expectancy.","options":["dawn","midnight","century","weekday"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: century (世紀；一百年) 【全文中譯】二十世紀醫學領域取得了巨大的進步，顯著延長了人類的預期壽命。 【選項解析】(A) dawn 黎明 (B) midnight 午夜 (C) century 世紀 (D) weekday 工作日。二十世紀為 twentieth century。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The Cinderella fairytale tells the story of a girl whose carriage turned back into a pumpkin at ______.","options":["dawn","weekday","midnight","century"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: midnight (午夜) 【全文中譯】灰姑娘的童話故事講述了一個女孩的馬車在午夜變回南瓜的故事。 【選項解析】(A) dawn 黎明 (B) weekday 平日 (C) midnight 午夜 (D) century 世紀。童話中十二點變回南瓜為 midnight。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The roosters began crowing loudly just before ______, signaling that the sun was about to rise over the eastern hills.","options":["midnight","dawn","century","weekday"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: dawn (黎明；拂曉) 【全文中譯】公雞就在黎明前大聲啼叫，示意著太陽即將從東邊的山頭升起。 【選項解析】(A) midnight 午夜 (B) dawn 黎明 (C) century 世紀 (D) weekday 工作日。日出前為 dawn。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Our university professor designed a new elective ______ covering the history of international relations in Asia.","options":["course","century","dawn","midnight"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: course (課程) 【全文中譯】我們的大學教授設計了一門新的選修課程，涵蓋亞洲國際關係史。 【選項解析】(A) course 課程 (B) century 世紀 (C) dawn 黎明 (D) midnight 午夜。選修課為 elective course。"},{"number":10,"stem":"History has always been David's strongest school ______, and he consistently earns top grades on every exam.","options":["course","subject","century","weekday"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: subject (學科；科目) 【全文中譯】歷史一直是戴維最強的學校學科，他每次考試都持續取得最高分。 【選項解析】(A) course 課程 (B) subject 科目 (C) century 世紀 (D) weekday 平日。school subject 指學校學科。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Drinking sufficient water and taking a brisk walk are healthy ______ habits that will boost your energy levels.","options":["weekly","daily","monthly","yearly"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: daily (每日的) 【全文中譯】多喝水和快步走是健康的日常習慣，能夠提升你的精神活力。 【選項解析】(A) weekly 每週的 (B) daily 每日的 (C) monthly 每月的 (D) yearly 每年的。日常習慣為 daily habits。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The local community center publishes a ______ newsletter detailing upcoming weekend activities and volunteer opportunities.","options":["weekly","daily","yearly","monthly"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: weekly (每週的) 【全文中譯】當地社區中心發行了一份每週通訊，詳細介紹即將到來的週末活動與志工機會。 【選項解析】(A) weekly 每週的 (B) daily 每日的 (C) yearly 每年的 (D) monthly 每月的。介紹週末活動的週刊為 weekly newsletter。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The bank is open for customer transactions from nine to five on every ______, but closed on public holidays.","options":["midnight","dawn","weekday","century"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: weekday (平日；工作天) 【全文中譯】銀行在每個平日的上午九點至下午五點對外營業，但國定假日休息。 【選項解析】(A) midnight 午夜 (B) dawn 黎明 (C) weekday 平日 (D) century 世紀。工作日營業為 on every weekday。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Our landlord asked us to transfer the ______ apartment maintenance fee directly to his bank account every month.","options":["daily","weekly","yearly","monthly"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: monthly (每月的) 【全文中譯】房東要求我們每個月將每月的公寓管理費直接轉帳到他的銀行帳戶。 【選項解析】(A) daily 每日的 (B) weekly 每週的 (C) yearly 每年的 (D) monthly 每月的。每月管理費為 monthly fee。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Shareholders gathered at the corporate headquarters for the ______ general meeting to review financial performance.","options":["yearly","daily","monthly","weekly"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: yearly (年度的；每年的) 【全文中譯】股東們聚集在公司總部參加年度股東大會，檢討財務營運表現。 【選項解析】(A) yearly 年度的 (B) daily 每日的 (C) monthly 每月的 (D) weekly 每週的。年度大會為 yearly general meeting。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Shakespeare wrote his famous tragedies during the late sixteenth and early seventeenth ______ in England.","options":["dawn","century","midnight","weekday"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: century (世紀) 【全文中譯】莎士比亞於十六世紀末至十七世紀初在英格蘭創作了他的著名悲劇。 【選項解析】(A) dawn 黎明 (B) century 世紀 (C) midnight 午夜 (D) weekday 平日。十六、十七世紀為 century。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Loud fireworks lit up the dark sky exactly at ______ to welcome the beginning of the New Year.","options":["midnight","dawn","weekday","century"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: midnight (午夜) 【全文中譯】響亮的煙火在午夜整點點亮了漆黑的夜空，迎接新年的到來。 【選項解析】(A) midnight 午夜 (B) dawn 黎明 (C) weekday 平日 (D) century 世紀。跨年倒數整點為 at midnight。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Hiking groups usually start climbing mountain peaks before ______ so that they can witness the sunrise from the summit.","options":["midnight","century","dawn","weekday"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: dawn (黎明；拂曉) 【全文中譯】登山隊通常在拂曉前開始攀登高峰，這樣他們才能在山頂見證日出。 【選項解析】(A) midnight 午夜 (B) century 世紀 (C) dawn 黎明 (D) weekday 工作日。日出破曉為 dawn。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Before you can obtain a valid driver's license, you must complete a formal traffic safety ______ at driving school.","options":["course","subject","century","dawn"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: course (課程) 【全文中譯】在取得正式駕照之前，你必須在駕訓班完成一門正式的交通安全課程。 【選項解析】(A) course 課程 (B) subject 科目 (C) century 世紀 (D) dawn 黎明。安全講習課程為 safety course。"},{"number":20,"stem":"Physics is considered a difficult science ______ by many students because it requires both abstract thinking and calculus.","options":["course","subject","midnight","weekday"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: subject (學科；科目) 【全文中譯】物理被許多學生認為是一門困難的科學學科，因為它需要抽象思維和微積分運算。 【選項解析】(A) course 課程 (B) subject 學科 (C) midnight 午夜 (D) weekday 平日。科學領域科目為 science subject。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Eating fresh green salad can be part of your ______ lunch to ensure you get sufficient fiber and vitamins.","options":["yearly","daily","weekly","monthly"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: daily (每日的) 【全文中譯】吃新鮮綠色沙拉可以成為你每日午餐的一部分，確保你攝取足夠的纖維與維生素。 【選項解析】(A) yearly 每年的 (B) daily 每日的 (C) weekly 每週的 (D) monthly 每月的。每天午餐為 daily lunch。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The supermarket chain offers special ______ discounts on dairy products, changing the sale items every Thursday.","options":["weekly","yearly","daily","monthly"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: weekly (每週的) 【全文中譯】這家連鎖超市提供乳製品的每週特價，每週四更換促銷商品品項。 【選項解析】(A) weekly 每週的 (B) yearly 每年的 (C) daily 每日的 (D) monthly 每月的。每週優惠為 weekly discounts。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Parking fees in the downtown commercial district are higher on a ______ than during the quiet weekend.","options":["century","midnight","weekday","dawn"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: weekday (平日；工作日) 【全文中譯】市中心商業區工作日的停車費比清閒的週末還要昂貴。 【選項解析】(A) century 世紀 (B) midnight 午夜 (C) weekday 工作日 (D) dawn 黎明。工作日為 on a weekday。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The mobile telephone company sends a detailed ______ invoice listing all long-distance calls and data usage.","options":["monthly","yearly","daily","weekly"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: monthly (每月的) 【全文中譯】行動電話公司發送了一份詳細的每月帳單，列出所有長途電話與網路傳輸量。 【選項解析】(A) monthly 每月的 (B) yearly 每年的 (C) daily 每日的 (D) weekly 每週的。電信帳單為 monthly invoice。"},{"number":25,"stem":"In biology class, our teacher introduced the interesting ______ of marine ecosystems and coral reef conservation.","options":["course","subject","century","dawn"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: subject (主題；學科) 【全文中譯】在生物課上，我們的老師介紹了海洋生態系統與珊瑚礁保育的有趣主題。 【選項解析】(A) course 課程 (B) subject 主題 (C) century 世紀 (D) dawn 黎明。探討主題為 subject of marine ecosystems。"}]},{"unit":55,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 55 (055.mp3) Topic Focus: Academic Disciplines, Languages, Linguistics & Literary Forms","topic":"Topic Focus: Academic Disciplines, Languages, Linguistics & Literary Forms | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"biology","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the scientific study of living organisms and life processes","chinese":"生物學","sentence":"Students in the advanced ______ class dissected a frog yesterday to examine how its internal organs function.","translation":"進階______課的學生昨天解剖了一隻青蛙，以檢視其內部器官如何運作。"},{"word":"geography","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the study of the physical features of the earth and its atmosphere","chinese":"地理學","sentence":"Our teacher used a colorful globe during our ______ lesson to explain how ocean currents affect global weather patterns.","translation":"我們的老師在______課上使用彩色地球儀，向大家解釋洋流如何影響全球天氣型態。"},{"word":"physics","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the scientific study of matter, energy, motion, and force","chinese":"物理學","sentence":"Albert Einstein made revolutionary contributions to modern ______, altering how scientists understand time and gravity.","translation":"愛因斯坦對現代______做出了革命性的貢獻，改變了科學家對時間和引力的理解。"},{"word":"PE","pos":"(n.)","definition":"physical education; instruction in physical exercise and sports at school","chinese":"體育；體育課","sentence":"The boys played basketball during their afternoon ______ class, while the girls practiced volleyball on the court.","translation":"男生們在下午的______課上打籃球，而女生們則在球場上練習排球。"},{"word":"science","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the systematic study of the physical and natural world through observation","chinese":"科學","sentence":"Medical ______ has developed effective vaccines that protect millions of children from dangerous infectious diseases.","translation":"醫學______已經研發出有效的疫苗，保護數百萬兒童免受危險傳染病的侵害。"},{"word":"Mandarin","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the official standard form of Chinese spoken across Taiwan and China","chinese":"國語；華語；普通話","sentence":"The foreign exchange student practiced speaking ______ every day, and she can now order food fluently at night markets.","translation":"那位外籍交換學生每天練習講______，她現在在夜市點餐已經非常流利了。"},{"word":"alphabet","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a set of letters used for writing a language","chinese":"字母表","sentence":"Kindergarten children sing a cheerful song to memorize the twenty-six letters of the English ______.","translation":"幼兒園的孩子們唱著歡快的歌曲，以背熟英語______的二十六個字母。"},{"word":"vocabulary","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the body of words known and used by a particular person or group","chinese":"字彙；單字","sentence":"Reading English novels every week helps students expand their active ______, making writing essays much easier.","translation":"每週閱讀英文小說有助於學生擴充他們的積極______，讓撰寫作文變得容易許多。"},{"word":"poem","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a piece of writing that expresses feelings and ideas using rhythm and metaphor","chinese":"詩歌；韻文","sentence":"Emily wrote a romantic ______ about the golden autumn sunset and recited it aloud in front of her classmates.","translation":"艾蜜莉寫了一首關於金黃秋日落日的浪漫______，並在同學們面前大聲朗誦出來。"},{"word":"novel","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a fictitious prose narrative of book length, typically representing characters","chinese":"小說","sentence":"The young writer spent two years writing an exciting mystery ______, which quickly became a national bestseller.","translation":"這位年輕作家花了兩年時間撰寫了一本刺激的懸疑______，該書很快便成為全國暢銷書。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"In high school ______, we examined plant cells under a microscope to observe their green chloroplasts.","options":["biology","poem","alphabet","Mandarin"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: biology (生物學) 【全文中譯】在高中生物課上，我們在顯微鏡下觀察植物細胞，以觀察其綠色的葉綠體。 【選項解析】(A) biology 生物學 (B) poem 詩歌 (C) alphabet 字母 (D) Mandarin 華語。觀察植物細胞屬 biology。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The teacher asked the class to identify the capital cities of South American nations on the ______ map.","options":["physics","geography","novel","PE"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: geography (地理學) 【全文中譯】老師請全班在地理地圖上指認出南美洲國家的首都名稱。 【選項解析】(A) physics 物理 (B) geography 地理 (C) novel 小說 (D) PE 體育。地圖與首都屬於 geography。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Understanding Isaac Newton's laws of motion is fundamental to mastering high school ______.","options":["Mandarin","geography","physics","poem"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: physics (物理學) 【全文中譯】理解牛頓運動定律是掌握高中物理學的基礎基石。 【選項解析】(A) Mandarin 華語 (B) geography 地理 (C) physics 物理 (D) poem 詩歌。牛頓運動定律屬於 physics。"},{"number":4,"stem":"All students changed into their tracksuits before heading out to the playground for ______ class.","options":["alphabet","novel","biology","PE"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: PE (體育課) 【全文中譯】所有學生在前往操場上體育課之前，都換上了運動服裝。 【選項解析】(A) alphabet 字母 (B) novel 小說 (C) biology 生物 (D) PE 體育。換運動服上操場為 PE class。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Modern environmental ______ uses satellite data to monitor the melting of polar glaciers.","options":["science","poem","Mandarin","alphabet"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: science (科學) 【全文中譯】現代環境科學利用衛星數據來監測極地冰川的融化情形。 【選項解析】(A) science 科學 (B) poem 詩歌 (C) Mandarin 華語 (D) alphabet 字母。環境科學為 environmental science。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Many international business executives take evening lessons to learn spoken ______ for trade in Asia.","options":["biology","Mandarin","physics","geography"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: Mandarin (華語；中文) 【全文中譯】許多國際商務主管在晚間上課學習中文口語，以便在亞洲進行商業貿易。 【選項解析】(A) biology 生物 (B) Mandarin 華語 (C) physics 物理 (D) geography 地理。學習語言進行貿易為 learn spoken Mandarin。"},{"number":7,"stem":"Greek letters are arranged in a distinct ______ that differs from the Latin letters used in English.","options":["novel","poem","alphabet","vocabulary"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: alphabet (字母表) 【全文中譯】希臘字母排列成獨特的字母表，與英語中使用的拉丁字母有所不同。 【選項解析】(A) novel 小說 (B) poem 詩歌 (C) alphabet 字母表 (D) vocabulary 字彙。Greek alphabet 指希臘字母系統。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Memorizing flashcards is an effective strategy to build your English ______ before taking the GEPT exam.","options":["geography","vocabulary","physics","Mandarin"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: vocabulary (單字；字彙) 【全文中譯】背誦單字卡是在參加全民英檢之前累積英語詞彙的有效策略。 【選項解析】(A) geography 地理 (B) vocabulary 字彙 (C) physics 物理 (D) Mandarin 華語。build English vocabulary 累積詞彙。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The literature teacher read a classic ______ by Robert Frost that explored choices in human life.","options":["poem","PE","alphabet","biology"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: poem (詩歌) 【全文中譯】文學老師朗讀了羅伯特·佛洛斯特的一首經典詩作，該詩探討了人生的抉擇。 【選項解析】(A) poem 詩歌 (B) PE 體育 (C) alphabet 字母 (D) biology 生物。經典詩篇為 classic poem。"},{"number":10,"stem":"J.K. Rowling gained worldwide fame after publishing her fantasy ______ about a boy wizard.","options":["alphabet","science","novel","geography"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: novel (小說) 【全文中譯】J.K.羅琳在出版了關於一名小巫師的奇幻小說後，贏得了世界級的聲譽。 【選項解析】(A) alphabet 字母 (B) science 科學 (C) novel 小說 (D) geography 地理。長篇奇幻小說為 fantasy novel。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Marine ______ researchers dive deep into coral reefs to study the feeding behaviors of tropical fish.","options":["biology","alphabet","poem","Mandarin"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: biology (生物學) 【全文中譯】海洋生物學研究人員潛入珊瑚礁深處，研究熱帶魚類的覓食行為。 【選項解析】(A) biology 生物學 (B) alphabet 字母 (C) poem 詩歌 (D) Mandarin 華語。海洋生物學為 marine biology。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Learning about volcanic mountains and tectonic plates is an essential unit in our physical ______ syllabus.","options":["physics","PE","geography","novel"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: geography (地理學) 【全文中譯】了解火山與構造板塊是我們自然地理學教學大綱中不可或缺的單元。 【選項解析】(A) physics 物理 (B) PE 體育 (C) geography 地理 (D) novel 小說。火山板塊屬 physical geography。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Mechanics, thermodynamics, and electromagnetism are the three primary branches of classical ______.","options":["poem","physics","Mandarin","alphabet"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: physics (物理學) 【全文中譯】力學、熱力學與電磁學是古典物理學的三大主要分支學科。 【選項解析】(A) poem 詩歌 (B) physics 物理 (C) Mandarin 華語 (D) alphabet 字母。力學熱學屬 physics。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Our coach made us run five laps around the athletics track during yesterday's rigorous ______ lesson.","options":["PE","novel","science","biology"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: PE (體育課) 【全文中譯】在昨天嚴格的體育課上，我們的教練要求我們繞著田徑跑道跑五圈。 【選項解析】(A) PE 體育 (B) novel 小說 (C) science 科學 (D) biology 生物。跑步訓練為 PE lesson。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Forensic ______ specialists analyze fingerprints and DNA samples found at crime scenes to assist the police.","options":["poem","science","alphabet","Mandarin"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: science (科學) 【全文中譯】鑑識科學專家分析在犯罪現場發現的指紋與DNA樣本，以協助警方辦案。 【選項解析】(A) poem 詩歌 (B) science 科學 (C) alphabet 字母 (D) Mandarin 華語。鑑識科學為 forensic science。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Although my roommate grew up in Canada, his parents spoke fluent ______ at home, so he is bilingual.","options":["geography","physics","Mandarin","novel"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: Mandarin (華語) 【全文中譯】雖然我的室友在加拿大長大，但他父母在家說一口流利的國語，因此他是雙語人士。 【選項解析】(A) geography 地理 (B) physics 物理 (C) Mandarin 華語 (D) novel 小說。在家講中文為 spoke fluent Mandarin。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Young children first learn to recognize the capital letters of the ______ before they practice lowercase letters.","options":["alphabet","poem","novel","biology"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: alphabet (字母表) 【全文中譯】幼童在練習小寫字母之前，會先學習辨認英文字母表中的大寫字母。 【選項解析】(A) alphabet 字母表 (B) poem 詩歌 (C) novel 小說 (D) biology 生物。letters of the alphabet 字母表。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Having a rich descriptive ______ allows novelists to paint vivid pictures in the minds of their readers.","options":["PE","physics","geography","vocabulary"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: vocabulary (詞彙量) 【全文中譯】擁有豐富的描繪性詞彙，能讓小說家在讀者的腦海中描繪出栩栩如生的畫面。 【選項解析】(A) PE 體育 (B) physics 物理 (C) geography 地理 (D) vocabulary 詞彙。descriptive vocabulary 描述性詞彙。"},{"number":19,"stem":"The romantic poet expressed his profound sorrow in an emotional ______ dedicated to his departed love.","options":["poem","alphabet","science","Mandarin"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: poem (詩歌) 【全文中譯】這位浪漫派詩人在一首獻給已故愛人的感人詩作中，表達了他深切的悲傷。 【選項解析】(A) poem 詩歌 (B) alphabet 字母 (C) science 科學 (D) Mandarin 華語。抒情詩為 emotional poem。"},{"number":20,"stem":"He sat by the warm fireplace every evening, reading a thrilling historical ______ set in medieval England.","options":["PE","geography","novel","biology"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: novel (小說) 【全文中譯】他每天傍晚坐在溫暖的壁爐旁，閱讀一本以中世紀英格蘭為背景的驚險歷史小說。 【選項解析】(A) PE 體育 (B) geography 地理 (C) novel 小說 (D) biology 生物。歷史小說為 historical novel。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The university ______ laboratory is equipped with incubators for cultivating bacterial cell cultures.","options":["biology","poem","alphabet","Mandarin"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: biology (生物學) 【全文中譯】大學的生物實驗室配備了培養箱，用於培養細菌細胞菌落。 【選項解析】(A) biology 生物 (B) poem 詩歌 (C) alphabet 字母 (D) Mandarin 華語。生物實驗室為 biology laboratory。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Travelers who understand world ______ can easily appreciate the cultural and environmental diversity of different continents.","options":["physics","geography","PE","novel"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: geography (地理學) 【全文中譯】懂得世界地理的旅行者能輕易欣賞不同大洲的文化與環境多樣性。 【選項解析】(A) physics 物理 (B) geography 地理 (C) PE 體育 (D) novel 小說。world geography 世界地理。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The law of conservation of energy states that energy cannot be created or destroyed in ______.","options":["Mandarin","poem","physics","alphabet"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: physics (物理學) 【全文中譯】能量守恆定律指出，在物理學中，能量既不能被創造也不能被消滅。 【選項解析】(A) Mandarin 華語 (B) poem 詩歌 (C) physics 物理 (D) alphabet 字母。能量守恆是 physics 的基本定律。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Daily practice and wide reading will naturally increase the breadth of your active written ______.","options":["vocabulary","PE","biology","geography"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: vocabulary (字彙) 【全文中譯】每日的練習與廣泛的閱讀將自然而然地擴展你主動寫作詞彙的廣度。 【選項解析】(A) vocabulary 字彙 (B) PE 體育 (C) biology 生物 (D) geography 地理。active vocabulary 主動詞彙。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Writing a thoughtful ______ requires careful attention to word choice, imagery, and rhythmic cadence.","options":["alphabet","novel","poem","science"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: poem (詩歌) 【全文中譯】創作一首意境深遠的詩歌，需要對選詞、意象與節奏韻律有著細緻的推敲。 【選項解析】(A) alphabet 字母 (B) novel 小說 (C) poem 詩歌 (D) science 科學。重視意象與節奏者為 poem。"}]},{"unit":56,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 56 (056.mp3) Topic Focus: Public Discourse, Media Publications, Reports & Textbook Sections","topic":"Topic Focus: Public Discourse, Media Publications, Reports & Textbook Sections | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"speech","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a formal address or discourse delivered to an audience","chinese":"演講；演說","sentence":"The brave student president delivered an inspiring ______ at the graduation ceremony, encouraging everyone to pursue their dreams.","translation":"勇敢的學生會長在畢業典禮上發表了一場振奮人心的______，鼓勵大家勇敢追求夢想。"},{"word":"discuss","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to talk about something with another person or in a group","chinese":"討論；商討","sentence":"The marketing team will gather in the conference room to ______ new promotional strategies for our summer campaign.","translation":"行銷團隊將在會議室集合，以______我們夏季活動的新宣傳策略。"},{"word":"discussion","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the action or process of talking about something to reach a decision","chinese":"討論；研討","sentence":"After two hours of lively class ______, students finally reached a consensus on the topic of their science project.","translation":"經過兩小時熱烈的課堂______後，學生們終於就他們的科學專案主題達成了共識。"},{"word":"debate","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a formal discussion on a particular matter in a public meeting","chinese":"辯論；爭辯","sentence":"The two political candidates participated in a televised presidential ______, exchanging opinions on education and taxation.","translation":"兩位政治候選人參加了一場電視轉播的總統大選______，就教育與稅收問題交換意見。"},{"word":"newspaper","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a printed publication containing news, feature articles, and advertisements","chinese":"報紙","sentence":"My grandfather enjoys reading the morning ______ over hot tea, checking local sports scores and economic editorials.","translation":"我祖父喜歡邊喝熱茶邊看早______，查看本地體育比分與經濟社論。"},{"word":"magazine","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a periodical publication containing articles and illustrations","chinese":"雜誌；期刊","sentence":"Sarah subscribed to a popular fashion ______, and she eagerly waits for the glossy issue to arrive in the mail every month.","translation":"莎拉訂閱了一本受歡迎的時尚______，每個月都熱切期盼精裝期號寄到信箱。"},{"word":"report","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a formal account or statement of the results of an investigation; to state","chinese":"報告；報導","sentence":"The environmental agency published an alarming ______ on river pollution, urging the government to shut down illegal factories.","translation":"環保局發布了一份關於河流污染的令人警惕的______，敦促政府關閉非法工廠。"},{"word":"article","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a piece of writing included with others in a newspaper or magazine","chinese":"文章；報導；冠詞","sentence":"David wrote an insightful ______ about artificial intelligence, which was featured prominently on the front page of the journal.","translation":"戴維寫了一篇關於人工智慧的深刻______，該文顯著地刊登在期刊的頭版上。"},{"word":"unit","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an individual thing or person regarded as single and complete; book division","chinese":"單元；單位","sentence":"Our English textbook is divided into twelve thematic ______s, each focusing on practical everyday conversational skills.","translation":"我們的英文教科書分為十二個主題______，每個單元都著重於實用的日常會話技能。"},{"word":"chapter","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a main division of a book, typically with a number or title","chinese":"章節；篇章","sentence":"Before going to sleep, I read the final dramatic ______ of the adventure novel to find out if the hero survived.","translation":"在睡覺之前，我讀完了這本冒險小說最後一個引人入勝的______，以查明主人公是否生還。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The guest speaker gave an eloquent ______ about wildlife preservation that received a standing ovation from the crowd.","options":["speech","newspaper","unit","chapter"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: speech (演講) 【全文中譯】特邀演講者發表了一場關於野生動物保育的精彩演講，獲得全場起立鼓掌。 【選項解析】(A) speech 演講 (B) newspaper 報紙 (C) unit 單元 (D) chapter 章節。發表精彩演說為 eloquent speech。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The committee met yesterday to ______ whether the city should invest more tax funds into building public parks.","options":["discuss","repair","report","maintain"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: discuss (討論) 【全文中譯】委員會昨天召開會議，討論市府是否應當投入更多稅收資金來建設公共公園。 【選項解析】(A) discuss 討論 (B) repair 修理 (C) report 報導 (D) maintain 維護。商討議題用 discuss。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Following an open panel ______, university professors answered questions from curious students about their career options.","options":["debate","discussion","magazine","newspaper"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: discussion (討論) 【全文中譯】在公開小組討論結束後，大學教授回答了好奇學生關於其職涯選擇的提問。 【選項解析】(A) debate 辯論 (B) discussion 討論 (C) magazine 雜誌 (D) newspaper 報紙。小組研討為 panel discussion。"},{"number":4,"stem":"High school students joined the inter-school parliamentary ______ to argue whether nuclear energy should be expanded.","options":["magazine","chapter","debate","speech"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: debate (辯論) 【全文中譯】高中生參加了校際議會制辯論賽，辯論核能是否應當予以擴大發展。 【選項解析】(A) magazine 雜誌 (B) chapter 章節 (C) debate 辯論 (D) speech 演講。辯論正反論點為 parliamentary debate。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Dad reads the daily financial ______ while commuting on the subway, keeping track of fluctuations in international stock markets.","options":["newspaper","debate","chapter","speech"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: newspaper (報紙) 【全文中譯】爸爸在搭地鐵通勤時閱讀每日財經報紙，掌握國際股市的波動動態。 【選項解析】(A) newspaper 報紙 (B) debate 辯論 (C) chapter 章節 (D) speech 演講。財經日報為 financial newspaper。"},{"number":6,"stem":"She bought a monthly design ______ at the airport newsstand to read during her four-hour international flight.","options":["unit","debate","magazine","speech"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: magazine (雜誌) 【全文中譯】她在機場書報攤買了一本月刊設計雜誌，打算在四小時的國際航班中閱讀。 【選項解析】(A) unit 單元 (B) debate 辯論 (C) magazine 雜誌 (D) speech 演講。機場書報攤販售的月刊為 monthly magazine。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The police chief issued a detailed ______ explaining the measures taken to capture the bank robbery suspects.","options":["magazine","report","chapter","unit"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: report (報告) 【全文中譯】警長發布了一份詳細的報告，說明抓捕銀行搶劫嫌犯所採取的各項措施。 【選項解析】(A) magazine 雜誌 (B) report 報告 (C) chapter 章節 (D) unit 單元。警方調查報告為 detailed report。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The health journalist published a warning ______ regarding the dangers of excessive sugar consumption in soft drinks.","options":["speech","article","debate","chapter"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: article (文章；報導) 【全文中譯】這位健康線記者發表了一篇警告性報導，闡述汽水中過量糖分攝取的危險性。 【選項解析】(A) speech 演講 (B) article 文章 (C) debate 辯論 (D) chapter 章節。發表專題報導為 published an article。"},{"number":9,"stem":"In our math workbook, each study ______ begins with clear diagnostic questions followed by realistic practice problems.","options":["unit","speech","newspaper","debate"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: unit (單元) 【全文中譯】在我們的數學練習本中，每個學習單元都以清晰的診斷測驗題開始，隨後是實用的練習題。 【選項解析】(A) unit 單元 (B) speech 演講 (C) newspaper 報紙 (D) debate 辯論。課本章節單元為 study unit。"},{"number":10,"stem":"The suspenseful mystery story ended on a surprising cliffhanger at the very conclusion of the fourth ______.","options":["unit","debate","speech","chapter"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: chapter (章節) 【全文中譯】這本引人入勝的懸疑故事在第四章的結尾處以令人意想不到的懸念告終。 【選項解析】(A) unit 單元 (B) debate 辯論 (C) speech 演講 (D) chapter 章節。小說章節為 chapter。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Winning first place in the citywide English ______ contest gave Emily the confidence to speak comfortably in public.","options":["speech","magazine","chapter","unit"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: speech (演講) 【全文中譯】在全市英語演講比賽中贏得第一名，賦予了艾蜜莉在公眾面前自在表達的信心。 【選項解析】(A) speech 演講 (B) magazine 雜誌 (C) chapter 章節 (D) unit 單元。英語演講比賽為 English speech contest。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Parents and teachers gathered in the auditorium to ______ practical solutions for reducing bullying at school.","options":["discuss","maintain","repair","produce"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: discuss (討論) 【全文中譯】家長與老師聚集在禮堂，共同商討減少校園霸凌的具體實用對策。 【選項解析】(A) discuss 討論 (B) maintain 維持 (C) repair 修理 (D) produce 生產。商討解決之道為 discuss solutions。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The animated round-table ______ between economists lasted two hours and was broadcast live on national radio.","options":["magazine","discussion","unit","newspaper"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: discussion (研討；討論) 【全文中譯】經濟學家之間熱烈的圓桌研討持續了兩個小時，並在國家廣播電台上現場直播。 【選項解析】(A) magazine 雜誌 (B) discussion 討論 (C) unit 單元 (D) newspaper 報紙。圓桌研討為 round-table discussion。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The presidential candidates held a fierce public ______ over government healthcare reform and social welfare spending.","options":["chapter","unit","debate","speech"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: debate (辯論) 【全文中譯】總統候選人就政府醫療改革與社會福利支出展開了激烈的公開辯論。 【選項解析】(A) chapter 章節 (B) unit 單元 (C) debate 辯論 (D) speech 演講。候選人辯論為 public debate。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Many elderly residents still prefer the feel of a printed ______ over scrolling through brief digital news on smartphones.","options":["newspaper","chapter","unit","speech"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: newspaper (報紙) 【全文中譯】許多長者依然喜歡實體印刷報紙的手感，而不是在智慧型手機上滑閱簡短的數位新聞。 【選項解析】(A) newspaper 報紙 (B) chapter 章節 (C) unit 單元 (D) speech 演講。印刷報紙為 printed newspaper。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Photography enthusiasts love flipping through the glossy pages of this monthly wildlife ______.","options":["unit","magazine","speech","debate"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: magazine (雜誌) 【全文中譯】攝影愛好者熱愛翻閱這本月刊野生動物雜誌光鮮亮麗的銅版紙頁。 【選項解析】(A) unit 單元 (B) magazine 雜誌 (C) speech 演講 (D) debate 辯論。月刊雜誌為 monthly magazine。"},{"number":17,"stem":"According to the meteorological bureau's latest weather ______, a tropical depression is rapidly forming in the Pacific.","options":["report","unit","debate","chapter"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: report (報告；預報) 【全文中譯】根據氣象局最新的天氣預報，一個熱帶低氣壓正在太平洋上迅速形成。 【選項解析】(A) report 預報 (B) unit 單元 (C) debate 辯論 (D) chapter 章節。天氣報告為 weather report。"},{"number":18,"stem":"I clipped an interesting opinion ______ from the Sunday paper and pinned it to my bedroom bulletin board.","options":["speech","unit","article","debate"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: article (專欄文章) 【全文中譯】我從週日報紙上剪下了一篇有趣的評論文章，並用圖釘釘在臥室的布告欄上。 【選項解析】(A) speech 演講 (B) unit 單元 (C) article 文章 (D) debate 辯論。評論文章為 opinion article。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Before our final semester review, we must complete all the grammar exercises in ______ five of our English coursebook.","options":["unit","newspaper","debate","speech"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: unit (單元) 【全文中譯】在期末複習之前，我們必須完成英語課本第五單元中所有的文法練習。 【選項解析】(A) unit 單元 (B) newspaper 報紙 (C) debate 辯論 (D) speech 演講。課本第幾單元為 unit five。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The history teacher asked everyone to read ______ seven tonight, which covers the causes of the American Revolution.","options":["speech","chapter","debate","newspaper"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: chapter (章節) 【全文中譯】歷史老師請大家今晚閱讀第七章，該章節涵蓋了美國獨立革命的起因。 【選項解析】(A) speech 演講 (B) chapter 章節 (C) debate 辯論 (D) newspaper 報紙。教科書章節為 chapter seven。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The United Nations Secretary delivered an impassioned ______ calling for immediate international humanitarian aid in the famine zone.","options":["speech","unit","magazine","newspaper"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: speech (演說) 【全文中譯】聯合國秘書長發表了一場慷慨激昂的演說，呼籲國際社會立即向饑荒災區提供人道援助。 【選項解析】(A) speech 演說 (B) unit 單元 (C) magazine 雜誌 (D) newspaper 報紙。發表正式演說為 deliver a speech。"},{"number":22,"stem":"During the staff meeting, the department managers will ______ budget allocations for the upcoming fiscal quarter.","options":["discuss","maintain","produce","repair"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: discuss (討論) 【全文中譯】在員工大會上，部門經理們將商討即將到來的財政季度的預算分配問題。 【選項解析】(A) discuss 討論 (B) maintain 維護 (C) produce 製造 (D) repair 修復。討論預算為 discuss budget allocations。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The editorial board engaged in a serious ______ regarding which front-page photograph would best capture public attention.","options":["discussion","unit","chapter","newspaper"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: discussion (討論) 【全文中譯】編輯委員會進行了認真的討論，探討哪一張頭版照片最能抓住公眾的眼球。 【選項解析】(A) discussion 討論 (B) unit 單元 (C) chapter 章節 (D) newspaper 報紙。進行認真討論為 serious discussion。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The university team won the national collegiate ______ championship after effectively refuting their opponents' legal arguments.","options":["unit","chapter","debate","magazine"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: debate (辯論) 【全文中譯】這支大學隊伍在有力駁斥對手的法律論點後，贏得了全國大專辯論賽冠軍。 【選項解析】(A) unit 單元 (B) chapter 章節 (C) debate 辯論 (D) magazine 雜誌。大專辯論賽為 collegiate debate championship。"},{"number":25,"stem":"A well-researched ______ on renewable solar energy was published in the quarterly scientific journal last week.","options":["article","debate","unit","chapter"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: article (文章；論文) 【全文中譯】一篇關於可再生太陽能的經過詳盡調研的專題文章，上週刊登在季刊科學期刊上。 【選項解析】(A) article 文章 (B) debate 辯論 (C) unit 單元 (D) chapter 章節。期刊文章為 well-researched article。"}]},{"unit":57,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 57 (057.mp3) Topic Focus: Information Organization, Documents, Diagrams & Semantics","topic":"Topic Focus: Information Organization, Documents, Diagrams & Semantics | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"volume","pos":"(n.)","definition":"amount of sound; a single book in a set; quantity of space","chinese":"音量；卷；冊；容量","sentence":"The library was very quiet, so the librarian asked the student to turn down the ______ on his headphones.","translation":"圖書館裡非常安靜，因此圖書館員要求那位學生將耳機上的______調小。"},{"word":"chart","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a sheet of information in the form of a table, graph, or diagram","chinese":"圖表；排行榜","sentence":"The economics teacher projected a detailed bar ______ on the screen, showing the steady rise in inflation over ten years.","translation":"經濟學老師在螢幕上投影了一張詳細的長條______，顯示過去十年來通貨膨脹的持續上升。"},{"word":"title","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the name of a book, composition, or other artistic work; formal rank","chinese":"標題；書名；頭銜","sentence":"The mystery novel had an intriguing book ______, which immediately caught my attention at the university bookstore.","translation":"這本懸疑小說有一個引人入勝的書______，在大學書店裡立刻吸引了我的注意。"},{"word":"topic","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a matter dealt with in a text, discourse, or conversation; subject","chinese":"主題；話題","sentence":"Renewable solar energy was the chosen ______ for our debate, and each student presented evidence regarding installation costs.","translation":"可再生太陽能是我們這次辯論所選定的______，每位學生都提出了有關安裝成本的證據。"},{"word":"note","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a brief record of points written down; a short informal letter","chinese":"筆記；便條；注意","sentence":"During the lecture, diligent students took careful ______s on key vocabulary, reviewing them thoroughly before the exam.","translation":"在演講期間，勤奮的學生們認真記下了重點單字的______，並在考試前徹底複習。"},{"word":"document","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a piece of written, printed, or electronic matter providing information","chinese":"文件；公文；證件","sentence":"The lawyer asked his client to sign the legal ______ before submitting the property contract to the city court.","translation":"律師要求其客戶在將不動產合約提交給地方法院之前，先簽署這份法律______。"},{"word":"symbol","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a mark or character used as a conventional representation of an object","chinese":"象徵；符號","sentence":"The white dove is recognized worldwide as a gentle ______ of peace, often released at international sporting events.","translation":"白鴿在全世界都被公認為和平的溫柔______，經常在國際體育賽事中被放飛。"},{"word":"meaning","pos":"(n.)","definition":"what is meant by a word, text, concept, or action; significance","chinese":"意思；含義；意義","sentence":"When you encounter an unfamiliar English word while reading, you should look up its exact ______ in a dictionary.","translation":"當你在閱讀時遇到不熟悉的英文字詞時，你應該在字典裡查閱其確切的______。"},{"word":"opinion","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a view or judgment formed about something, not necessarily based on fact","chinese":"意見；看法","sentence":"Everyone in the seminar was encouraged to express an honest ______ about the new school dress code policy.","translation":"研討會上的每個人都被鼓勵針對學校的新制服政策發表坦率的______。"},{"word":"information","pos":"(n.)","definition":"facts provided or learned about something or someone; data","chinese":"資訊；消息；資料","sentence":"The tourist visitor center provides travelers with free map brochures and useful ______ about scenic local mountain trails.","translation":"遊客服務中心為旅客提供免費的地圖手冊以及關於本地風景優美的山徑的實用______。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Please lower the speaker ______ on your television set, because our newborn baby is sleeping soundly in the adjacent room.","options":["volume","chart","topic","title"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: volume (音量) 【全文中譯】請將電視機上的喇叭音量調小，因為我們的新生嬰兒正在隔壁房間熟睡。 【選項解析】(A) volume 音量 (B) chart 圖表 (C) topic 話題 (D) title 標題。調整聲音大小為 speaker volume。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The sales manager examined the monthly performance ______ to determine which branch sold the greatest number of cars.","options":["title","chart","volume","symbol"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: chart (圖表) 【全文中譯】業務經理檢視了每月業績圖表，以確定哪家分店銷售的汽車數量最多。 【選項解析】(A) title 標題 (B) chart 圖表 (C) volume 音量 (D) symbol 象徵。業績統計圖為 performance chart。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The author selected a memorable ______ for her autobiography that reflected her lifelong journey as an explorer.","options":["volume","topic","title","symbol"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: title (書名；標題) 【全文中譯】這位作者為她的自傳挑選了一個令人難忘的書名，反映了她作為探險家的終身旅程。 【選項解析】(A) volume 冊數 (B) topic 主題 (C) title 標題 (D) symbol 符號。書籍名稱為 book title。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Global warming has become a heated ______ of discussion among international scientists and environmental policymakers.","options":["topic","volume","chart","title"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: topic (主題；話題) 【全文中譯】全球暖化已成為國際科學家與環境決策官員之間熱烈討論的話題。 【選項解析】(A) topic 話題 (B) volume 音量 (C) chart 圖表 (D) title 標題。討論題目為 topic of discussion。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Sarah wrote a brief reminder ______ and stuck it onto the kitchen refrigerator so she would not forget her appointment.","options":["chart","note","volume","symbol"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: note (便條；筆記) 【全文中譯】莎拉寫了一張簡短的提醒便條貼在廚房冰箱上，這樣她就不會忘記她的預約。 【選項解析】(A) chart 圖表 (B) note 便條 (C) volume 音量 (D) symbol 符號。備忘便條為 reminder note。"},{"number":6,"stem":"The immigration officer inspected every official ______ presented by the traveler before stamping his entrance visa.","options":["document","volume","topic","chart"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: document (公文；證件) 【全文中譯】移民官員在蓋上入境簽證印章前，仔細檢查了旅客出示的每一份官方文件證件。 【選項解析】(A) document 文件 (B) volume 卷冊 (C) topic 話題 (D) chart 圖表。官方文件為 official document。"},{"number":7,"stem":"In ancient Egyptian hieroglyphics, each decorative carving served as a visual ______ representing an idea or sound.","options":["title","volume","symbol","chart"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: symbol (符號；象徵) 【全文中譯】在古埃及象形文字中，每件裝飾性雕刻都是代表某種概念或聲音的視覺符號。 【選項解析】(A) title 標題 (B) volume 容量 (C) symbol 符號 (D) chart 圖表。象徵性圖案為 visual symbol。"},{"number":8,"stem":"If you cannot deduce the true ______ of a phrase from the context, consulting a good bilingual dictionary is wise.","options":["chart","title","topic","meaning"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: meaning (含義；意思) 【全文中譯】如果你無法從上下文中推斷出某個片語的真實含義，查閱一本優質雙語字典是明智的做法。 【選項解析】(A) chart 圖表 (B) title 標題 (C) topic 主題 (D) meaning 意思。字詞含義為 true meaning。"},{"number":9,"stem":"In my personal ______, investing in renewable wind power will bring greater long-term benefits to our island economy.","options":["chart","opinion","volume","symbol"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: opinion (意見；看法) 【全文中譯】依我個人之見，投資可再生風力發電將為我們這座海島經濟帶來更大的長期效益。 【選項解析】(A) chart 圖表 (B) opinion 意見 (C) volume 音量 (D) symbol 象徵。依我之見為 in my personal opinion。"},{"number":10,"stem":"The internet enables researchers to access vast amounts of medical ______ within seconds of clicking a mouse.","options":["information","symbol","title","volume"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: information (資訊；資料) 【全文中譯】網際網路使研究人員在點擊滑鼠的數秒之內即可獲取海量的醫療資訊。 【選項解析】(A) information 資訊 (B) symbol 符號 (C) title 頭銜 (D) volume 卷冊。醫療資訊為 medical information。"},{"number":11,"stem":"When the fire alarm began ringing at maximum ______, all building occupants immediately evacuated toward the emergency stairs.","options":["chart","volume","topic","note"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: volume (音量) 【全文中譯】當火災警報器以最大音量響起時，所有大樓人員立即朝著緊急逃生梯疏散。 【選項解析】(A) chart 圖表 (B) volume 音量 (C) topic 話題 (D) note 便條。最大音量為 maximum volume。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The doctor showed the patient an anatomical ______ illustrating how blood circulates through the human heart valves.","options":["title","volume","chart","topic"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: chart (圖表；解剖圖) 【全文中譯】醫生向病人展示了一張人體解剖圖表，說明血液如何流經人體心臟瓣膜。 【選項解析】(A) title 標題 (B) volume 卷冊 (C) chart 圖表 (D) topic 主題。醫用解剖圖為 anatomical chart。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The professor earned the academic ______ of department chair after publishing twenty acclaimed research papers.","options":["title","chart","volume","symbol"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: title (頭銜；職稱) 【全文中譯】該教授在發表了二十篇備受讚譽的研究論文後，獲得了系主任的學術頭銜職稱。 【選項解析】(A) title 頭銜 (B) chart 圖表 (C) volume 音量 (D) symbol 象徵。學術職稱頭銜為 academic title。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The teacher announced that the essay ______ for this semester would center on cultural traditions in modern Taiwan.","options":["symbol","volume","chart","topic"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: topic (題目；主題) 【全文中譯】老師宣布本學期的作文主題將聚焦在現代台灣的文化傳統上。 【選項解析】(A) symbol 象徵 (B) volume 音量 (C) chart 圖表 (D) topic 主題。論文作文題目為 essay topic。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The student left a thank-you ______ on the teacher's podium, expressing gratitude for her dedicated academic guidance.","options":["note","chart","volume","topic"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: note (便條；短箋) 【全文中譯】學生在老師講台上留了一張感謝小卡便條，對她悉心的學術指導表達謝意。 【選項解析】(A) note 便條 (B) chart 圖表 (C) volume 音量 (D) topic 主題。感謝短籤為 thank-you note。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Before securing a bank loan for your small business, you must assemble every financial ______ required by the lender.","options":["document","symbol","title","volume"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: document (文件) 【全文中譯】在為你的小型企業申請銀行貸款之前，你必須備齊貸方所要求的每一份財務文件。 【選項解析】(A) document 文件 (B) symbol 象徵 (C) title 標題 (D) volume 卷冊。財務資料文件為 financial document。"},{"number":17,"stem":"A red cross on a white background is an internationally protected ______ indicating medical assistance and neutrality.","options":["chart","symbol","title","volume"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: symbol (標誌；符號) 【全文中譯】白底紅十字是國際保護的標誌符號，代表著醫療援助與中立立場。 【選項解析】(A) chart 圖表 (B) symbol 標誌 (C) title 標題 (D) volume 卷冊。國際識別標誌為 protected symbol。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Poetry often carries multiple layers of philosophical ______, allowing each reader to interpret the verses uniquely.","options":["meaning","chart","volume","symbol"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: meaning (意涵；意義) 【全文中譯】詩歌往往承載著多層哲學意涵，讓每位讀者都能有獨特體悟與解讀。 【選項解析】(A) meaning 意涵 (B) chart 圖表 (C) volume 音量 (D) symbol 象徵。深層意義為 philosophical meaning。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Public ______ polls showed that most citizens favored increasing government subsidies for public electric transit.","options":["chart","title","opinion","volume"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: opinion (民意；輿論) 【全文中譯】民意民意調查顯示，大多數公民贊成政府增加對公共電動交通工具的補貼。 【選項解析】(A) chart 圖表 (B) title 標題 (C) opinion 意見 (D) volume 卷冊。民意民調為 public opinion polls。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The police detective gathered crucial ______ from nearby surveillance cameras to identify the getaway vehicle.","options":["information","title","symbol","chart"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: information (情報；資料) 【全文中譯】刑警從附近的監視器中蒐集了關鍵情報資訊，以查明逃逸車輛的特徵。 【選項解析】(A) information 資訊 (B) title 頭銜 (C) symbol 符號 (D) chart 圖表。關鍵情報為 crucial information。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Turn up the radio ______, please, so that everyone in the backyard can hear the live broadcast of the baseball game.","options":["chart","volume","topic","note"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: volume (音量) 【全文中譯】請把收音機的音量調大一點，這樣後院的每個人都能聽到棒球比賽的現場直播。 【選項解析】(A) chart 圖表 (B) volume 音量 (C) topic 主題 (D) note 便條。調大音量為 turn up volume。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The medical chart recorded the patient's daily temperature fluctuations throughout her weeklong hospital stay.","options":["title","topic","chart","symbol"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: chart (病歷表；圖表) 【全文中譯】在病人住院一週期間，醫用病歷圖表記錄了她每日的體溫波動變化。 【選項解析】(A) title 標題 (B) topic 主題 (C) chart 圖表 (D) symbol 符號。病歷體溫表為 medical chart。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The official job ______ of the executive was Vice President of Global Operations, overseeing five foreign branch offices.","options":["title","volume","symbol","chart"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: title (職稱；頭銜) 【全文中譯】該高階主管的正式工作職稱是全球營運副總裁，負責監督五個海外分公司。 【選項解析】(A) title 職稱 (B) volume 卷冊 (C) symbol 象徵 (D) chart 圖表。正式職銜為 official job title。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The university seminar invited guest lecturers to debate the complex ______ of artificial intelligence ethics.","options":["volume","chart","topic","symbol"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: topic (課題；主題) 【全文中譯】大學研討會邀請客座講師深入辯論人工智慧倫理這一複雜課題。 【選項解析】(A) volume 音量 (B) chart 圖表 (C) topic 主題 (D) symbol 符號。探討複雜課題為 complex topic。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Keep your passport and confidential travel ______s securely locked inside the hotel safe whenever you explore the city.","options":["document","symbol","title","chart"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: documents (證件；文件) 【全文中譯】當你在市區觀光遊覽時，請將護照和機密旅行證件安全鎖在飯店保險箱內。 【選項解析】(A) documents 證件 (B) symbols 象徵 (C) titles 標題 (D) charts 圖表。旅行證件為 travel documents。"}]},{"unit":58,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 58 (058.mp3) Topic Focus: Early Childhood Education, Exams, Playground Equipment & Scoring","topic":"Topic Focus: Early Childhood Education, Exams, Playground Equipment & Scoring | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"instance","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an example or single occurrence of something","chinese":"例子；實例","sentence":"The science teacher cited several clear ______s of global warming melting polar ice sheets, convincing the entire class.","translation":"自然老師舉出了全球暖化融化極地冰原的幾個明確______，使全班同學心服口服。"},{"word":"quiz","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a quick or informal test of knowledge or comprehension; to test","chinese":"隨堂測驗；小考","sentence":"Our geography teacher gave us an unannounced pop ______ on world capitals, but most students answered all questions correctly.","translation":"我們的地理老師對世界各國首都進行了一次突擊隨堂______，但大多數學生都正確回答了所有問題。"},{"word":"exam","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a formal test of a person's knowledge or proficiency in a subject","chinese":"考試；測驗","sentence":"University students spent two weeks in the quiet library preparing for their final chemistry ______, studying late into the night.","translation":"大學生們在安靜的圖書館度過了兩週時間，準備期末化學______，每天都讀書研習到深夜。"},{"word":"score","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"the number of points, goals, or runs achieved in a game; to gain points","chinese":"分數；得分；成績","sentence":"Kevin achieved a perfect ______ on his mathematics midterm, earning praise from both his proud parents and his teacher.","translation":"凱文在數學期中考中獲得了滿分______，贏得了自豪的父母和老師的一致讚揚。"},{"word":"record","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"the best performance achieved; an account kept in writing; audio","chinese":"紀錄；記錄；唱片","sentence":"The Jamaican sprinter broke the world 100-meter running ______ yesterday, crossing the finish line in under ten seconds.","translation":"牙買加短跑選手昨天打破了世界百公尺賽跑______，在十秒以內衝過了終點線。"},{"word":"kindergarten","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a school or class for young children, usually aged five to six","chinese":"幼兒園","sentence":"The excited five-year-old boy carried his colorful lunchbox into ______ this morning, meeting his new classmates cheerfully.","translation":"興奮的五歲小男孩今天早上帶著色彩繽紛的便當盒走進______，開心地與新同學們見面。"},{"word":"seesaw","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a long wooden plank balanced on a central point for children to play on","chinese":"翹翹板","sentence":"Two happy little girls sat on opposite ends of the park ______, giggling loudly as they pushed themselves up and down.","translation":"兩個快樂的小女孩坐在公園______的兩端，一邊上下擺動一邊大聲咯咯笑著。"},{"word":"swing","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a seat suspended by ropes or chains for swinging back and forth","chinese":"鞦韆；擺動","sentence":"Children rushed toward the playground ______ as soon as the afternoon school bell rang, eager to soar high into the air.","translation":"下午放學鐘聲一響，孩子們便奔向操場上的______，渴望高高盪向空中。"},{"word":"balloon","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a small rubber bag filled with air or helium, used as a child's toy","chinese":"氣球","sentence":"The birthday clown handed each cheerful child a colorful helium ______ shaped like a funny cartoon animal.","translation":"生日派對上的小丑遞給每個開心的小孩一個形狀像搞笑卡通動物的彩色氦氣______。"},{"word":"education","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the process of receiving or giving systematic instruction, especially at school","chinese":"教育","sentence":"The government invested millions of tax dollars into public ______, ensuring that every rural school has modern computers.","translation":"政府在公共______方面投入了數百萬稅收，確保每所偏鄉學校都能擁有現代化的電腦。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"For ______, eating excessive amounts of fast food can easily lead to serious long-term cardiovascular health issues.","options":["instance","exam","quiz","score"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: instance (例子；實例) 【全文中譯】例如，食用過量的速食很容易引發嚴重的長期心血管健康問題。 【選項解析】(A) instance 例子 (B) exam 考試 (C) quiz 小考 (D) score 分數。for instance 為固定片語「例如」。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Every Friday afternoon, our English teacher gives us a short vocabulary ______ to review spelling and word definitions.","options":["record","quiz","education","seesaw"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: quiz (隨堂小考) 【全文中譯】每週五下午，我們的英文老師都會給我們做一次簡短的單字小考，以複習拼字與字義。 【選項解析】(A) record 紀錄 (B) quiz 小考 (C) education 教育 (D) seesaw 翹翹板。短測驗為 short vocabulary quiz。"},{"number":3,"stem":"High school seniors must study diligently every weekend if they want to pass the rigorous national college entrance ______.","options":["exam","balloon","seesaw","swing"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: exam (大考；測驗) 【全文中譯】高中三年級學生若想通過嚴格的全國大學入學測驗，每個週末都必須勤勉讀書。 【選項解析】(A) exam 考試 (B) balloon 氣球 (C) seesaw 翹翹板 (D) swing 鞦韆。升學大考為 college entrance exam。"},{"number":4,"stem":"The soccer match ended with an exciting final ______ of three to two, delighting the passionate hometown supporters.","options":["swing","score","balloon","kindergarten"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: score (比分；得分) 【全文中譯】足球比賽以三比二的刺激終場比分結束，讓主場熱情的支持者們欣喜若狂。 【選項解析】(A) swing 鞦韆 (B) score 比分 (C) balloon 氣球 (D) kindergarten 幼兒園。最終比分為 final score。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The hospital maintains a complete medical ______ of each patient's allergy history and previous surgical procedures.","options":["balloon","seesaw","record","swing"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: record (紀錄；病歷) 【全文中譯】醫院保存每位病患過敏史與先前手術程序的完整醫療紀錄。 【選項解析】(A) balloon 氣球 (B) seesaw 翹翹板 (C) record 紀錄 (D) swing 鞦韆。病歷紀錄為 medical record。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Children learn basic social interaction and creative finger-painting while attending morning classes at ______.","options":["exam","score","quiz","kindergarten"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: kindergarten (幼兒園) 【全文中譯】孩子們在幼兒園上晨間課程時，學習基本的人際社交互動與創意手指畫。 【選項解析】(A) exam 考試 (B) score 分數 (C) quiz 小考 (D) kindergarten 幼兒園。學齡前幼兒園為 kindergarten。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The brother and sister sat at opposite sides of the wooden ______ and took turns pushing their feet off the ground.","options":["seesaw","balloon","score","exam"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: seesaw (翹翹板) 【全文中譯】兄妹倆分別坐在木質翹翹板的兩端，輪流用雙腳蹬地上下起伏。 【選項解析】(A) seesaw 翹翹板 (B) balloon 氣球 (C) score 得分 (D) exam 考試。坐在兩端上下擺動為 seesaw。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The little boy laughed with joy as his older sister pushed him higher and higher on the park ______.","options":["exam","swing","score","record"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: swing (鞦韆) 【全文中譯】當姊姊在公園鞦韆上把小男孩推得越來越高時，他開心地大笑起來。 【選項解析】(A) exam 考試 (B) swing 鞦韆 (C) score 得分 (D) record 紀錄。推盪得更高是在 swing。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The little girl cried when her red helium ______ slipped from her tiny fingers and floated high up into the clouds.","options":["record","exam","balloon","score"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: balloon (氣球) 【全文中譯】當紅色氦氣球從小女孩小小的手指間滑脫並高高飄入雲霄時，她哭了起來。 【選項解析】(A) record 紀錄 (B) exam 考試 (C) balloon 氣球 (D) score 分數。飄上天空的玩具為 helium balloon。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Providing high-quality free public ______ to all citizens is considered an essential duty of modern democratic governments.","options":["education","seesaw","swing","balloon"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: education (教育) 【全文中譯】向所有公民提供優質的免費公共教育，被視為現代民主政府的基本職責。 【選項解析】(A) education 教育 (B) seesaw 翹翹板 (C) swing 鞦韆 (D) balloon 氣球。國民義務教育為 public education。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Can you give me a specific ______ where following your proposed business plan actually produced a financial profit?","options":["score","exam","instance","balloon"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: instance (實例) 【全文中譯】你能給我一個具體的例子，說明採納你提議的商業計畫確實帶來了財務利潤嗎？ 【選項解析】(A) score 分數 (B) exam 考試 (C) instance 實例 (D) balloon 氣球。具體例子為 specific instance。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Students who failed the pop ______ were required to write out the misspelled vocabulary words ten times each.","options":["quiz","seesaw","record","education"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: quiz (測驗；小考) 【全文中譯】突擊小考不及格的學生被罰將拼錯的單字每個抄寫十遍。 【選項解析】(A) quiz 小考 (B) seesaw 翹翹板 (C) record 紀錄 (D) education 教育。突擊測驗為 pop quiz。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Before receiving his medical license, the young doctor had to pass a comprehensive four-hour written ______.","options":["swing","balloon","exam","seesaw"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: exam (考試) 【全文中譯】在取得醫師執照之前，這位年輕醫生必須通過長達四小時的綜合筆試考試。 【選項解析】(A) swing 鞦韆 (B) balloon 氣球 (C) exam 考試 (D) seesaw 翹翹板。執照筆試為 written exam。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Despite missing the first basket, the basketball player managed to ______ twenty-five points in the second half.","options":["exam","score","swing","balloon"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: score (得分) 【全文中譯】儘管投丟了第一球，這位籃球選手還是在下半場成功獲得了二十五分。 【選項解析】(A) exam 考試 (B) score 得分 (C) swing 擺動 (D) balloon 氣球。比賽得二十五分為 score twenty-five points。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The athlete set a new Olympic ______ in the high jump, clearing the bar at an astounding height of two meters.","options":["seesaw","record","balloon","swing"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: record (紀錄) 【全文中譯】該運動員在跳高項目中創下了新的奧運紀錄，以兩公尺令人震驚的高度越過橫桿。 【選項解析】(A) seesaw 翹翹板 (B) record 紀錄 (C) balloon 氣球 (D) swing 鞦韆。締造奧運紀錄為 set a new Olympic record。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Young toddlers sing cheerful nursery rhymes and build wooden block castles throughout their fun day in ______.","options":["kindergarten","exam","score","quiz"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: kindergarten (幼兒園) 【全文中譯】幼童在幼兒園歡樂的一天中，唱著歡快的童謠，並搭建積木城堡。 【選項解析】(A) kindergarten 幼兒園 (B) exam 考試 (C) score 分數 (D) quiz 小考。幼兒唱歌玩積木的場所為 kindergarten。"},{"number":17,"stem":"A playground ______ requires two children of comparable weight in order to balance and move up and down smoothly.","options":["exam","balloon","seesaw","score"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: seesaw (翹翹板) 【全文中譯】遊樂場上的翹翹板需要兩個體重相仿的孩子才能維持平衡並平穩上下起伏。 【選項解析】(A) exam 考試 (B) balloon 氣球 (C) seesaw 翹翹板 (D) score 分數。需兩人平衡玩耍為 playground seesaw。"},{"number":18,"stem":"During recess, there was always a long line of elementary school students waiting for their turn on the tire ______.","options":["swing","record","exam","score"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: swing (鞦韆) 【全文中譯】在下課休息時間，輪候玩輪胎鞦韆的小學生總是排成一條長長的隊伍。 【選項解析】(A) swing 鞦韆 (B) record 紀錄 (C) exam 考試 (D) score 分數。輪胎鞦韆為 tire swing。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Party planners decorated the banquet hall with hundreds of shiny silver and gold ______s for the anniversary ball.","options":["record","exam","score","balloon"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: balloons (氣球) 【全文中譯】派對策劃人員用數百個閃亮的金銀氣球裝飾了宴會廳，以迎接週年舞會的到來。 【選項解析】(A) records 紀錄 (B) exams 考試 (C) scores 分數 (D) balloons 氣球。裝飾宴會用 balloons。"},{"number":20,"stem":"Higher ______ equips young adults with critical thinking skills and prepares them for competitive global employment markets.","options":["education","seesaw","swing","balloon"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: education (教育) 【全文中譯】高等教育賦予年輕人批判性思考能力，並使他們為競爭激烈的全球就業市場做好準備。 【選項解析】(A) education 教育 (B) seesaw 翹翹板 (C) swing 鞦韆 (D) balloon 氣球。高等教育為 higher education。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The researcher documented thirty ______s where the medication alleviated headaches within twenty minutes of ingestion.","options":["instances","exams","balloons","swings"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: instances (實例；案例) 【全文中譯】研究人員記錄了三十個案例，在這些案例中藥物在服用二十分鐘內緩解了頭痛。 【選項解析】(A) instances 案例 (B) exams 考試 (C) balloons 氣球 (D) swings 鞦韆。三十個實例為 thirty instances。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Tomorrow morning we have an online grammar ______ containing twenty multiple-choice questions on modal auxiliary verbs.","options":["seesaw","quiz","education","record"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: quiz (線上測驗) 【全文中譯】明天早上我們有一場線上文法小測驗，包含二十題關於情態助動詞的選擇題。 【選項解析】(A) seesaw 翹翹板 (B) quiz 測驗 (C) education 教育 (D) record 紀錄。線上測驗為 online grammar quiz。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The university library remains open twenty-four hours a day during final ______ week to accommodate cramming students.","options":["swing","exam","balloon","seesaw"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: exam (期末考) 【全文中譯】在期末考試週期間，大學圖書館全天二十四小時開放，以方便臨時抱佛腳的學生讀書。 【選項解析】(A) swing 鞦韆 (B) exam 考試 (C) balloon 氣球 (D) seesaw 翹翹板。期末考週為 final exam week。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The gymnast earned a near-perfect ______ on the uneven bars after executing a flawless dismount onto the mat.","options":["score","swing","balloon","record"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: score (分數) 【全文中譯】體操選手在高低槓項目中完成近乎完美的落地後，獲得了接近滿分的分數。 【選項解析】(A) score 分數 (B) swing 擺動 (C) balloon 氣球 (D) record 紀錄。獲得高分為 earned a near-perfect score。"},{"number":25,"stem":"The medical clinic keeps an electronic health ______ for every neighborhood resident who has received seasonal flu shots.","options":["seesaw","balloon","record","swing"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: record (紀錄；健康檔案) 【全文中譯】醫療診所為每位接種過季節性流感疫苗的社區居民保存著電子健康檔案紀錄。 【選項解析】(A) seesaw 翹翹板 (B) balloon 氣球 (C) record 紀錄 (D) swing 鞦韆。電子健康紀錄為 electronic health record。"}]},{"unit":59,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 59 (059.mp3) Topic Focus: Higher Education, University Facilities & Academic Terms","topic":"Topic Focus: Higher Education, University Facilities & Academic Terms | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"attend","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to be present at an event, meeting, or function; to go regularly","chinese":"出席；參加；就讀","sentence":"All international students must ______ the orientation seminar on Monday morning to learn about campus safety rules.","translation":"所有國際學生必須______星期一早上的新生說明會，以了解校園安全規定。"},{"word":"attention","pos":"(n.)","definition":"notice taken of someone or something; mental focus or awareness","chinese":"注意；專注力；注意力","sentence":"The chemistry professor raised her voice to capture the ______ of the noisy students sitting in the back row.","translation":"化學教授提高了說話的音量，以吸引坐在後排吵鬧學生的______。"},{"word":"college","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an educational institution offering higher education or professional training","chinese":"學院；大學","sentence":"After graduating from high school, my older sister decided to attend a prestigious medical ______ in Taipei.","translation":"高中畢業之後，我的姊姊決定前往台北一所著名的醫科______就讀。"},{"word":"university","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a high-level educational institution where students study for degrees","chinese":"大學；綜合大學","sentence":"National Taiwan ______ is renowned worldwide for its distinguished professors, advanced research, and historic library.","translation":"國立台灣______以其傑出的教授、尖端的研究和歷史悠久的圖書館而聞名全球。"},{"word":"department","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a specialized division of a large organization, university, or store","chinese":"學系；部門；科系","sentence":"Professor Lin has served as the chairperson of the English ______ for five years, designing creative literature courses.","translation":"林教授擔任英國語文______主任已有五年之久，期間設計了許多富創意的文學課程。"},{"word":"semester","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a half-year term in a school or college, typically lasting 15 to 18 weeks","chinese":"學期","sentence":"During the spring ______, students take five academic courses and participate in several extracurricular clubs.","translation":"在春季______期間，學生修讀五門學術課程，並參與數個課外社團。"},{"word":"term","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a fixed or limited period for which something lasts; word or phrase","chinese":"學期；任期；專門術語","sentence":"The mayor's four-year official ______ will conclude next December, and citizens will elect a new city leader.","translation":"市長為期四年的法定公職______將於明年十二月結束，市民屆時將選出新的城市領導人。"},{"word":"campus","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the grounds and buildings of a university, college, or school","chinese":"校園；校區","sentence":"Students love relaxing on the grassy lawns of the university ______ between afternoon classes when the weather is sunny.","translation":"天氣晴朗時，學生們喜歡在下午課堂空檔於大學______青翠的草坪上放鬆休息。"},{"word":"gym","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a gymnasium; a hall or building equipped for physical exercise and sports","chinese":"體育館；健身房","sentence":"Jason works out at the neighborhood fitness ______ three times a week, lifting weights and running on the treadmill.","translation":"傑森每週前往社區健身______運動三次，進行重量訓練並在跑步機上跑步。"},{"word":"hall","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a large room used for public gatherings, lectures, or concerts; corridor","chinese":"大廳；禮堂；走廊","sentence":"Hundreds of eager concertgoers filled the grand performance ______ to enjoy the philharmonic orchestra's symphony.","translation":"數百名熱切的音樂會觀眾擠滿了宏偉的演出______，欣賞愛樂樂團的交響樂。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"All team members are required to ______ the weekly progress meeting every Tuesday afternoon.","options":["attend","repair","maintain","produce"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: attend (出席；參加) 【全文中譯】所有團隊成員都被要求在每週二下午出席每週的進度會議。 【選項解析】(A) attend 出席 (B) repair 修理 (C) maintain 維持 (D) produce 生產。參加會議為 attend the meeting。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Please pay close ______ to the flight attendant while she demonstrates the emergency oxygen mask procedures.","options":["semester","attention","college","gym"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: attention (注意；專注) 【全文中譯】當空服員示範緊急氧氣面罩操作步驟時，請密切注意其解說。 【選項解析】(A) semester 學期 (B) attention 注意 (C) college 學院 (D) gym 健身房。密切注意為 pay close attention。"},{"number":3,"stem":"After finishing secondary school, Mark enrolled in an engineering ______ to specialize in software programming.","options":["gym","hall","college","term"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: college (學院；大學) 【全文中譯】中學畢業後，馬克報考了一所工程學院，專攻軟體程式設計領域。 【選項解析】(A) gym 體育館 (B) hall 大廳 (C) college 學院 (D) term 任期。工程學院為 engineering college。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Oxford is one of the oldest and most prestigious ______s in the world, with centuries of academic excellence.","options":["university","campus","semester","attention"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: universities (大學) 【全文中譯】牛津大學是世界上最古老且最負盛名的大學之一，享有數百年的學術卓越聲譽。 【選項解析】(A) university 大學 (B) campus 校園 (C) semester 學期 (D) attention 注意。國際名牌綜合大學為 university。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The human resources ______ conducted interviews throughout the morning to hire three qualified accountants.","options":["gym","term","department","hall"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: department (部門；學系) 【全文中譯】人力資源部門在整個上午進行了面試，以便聘請三位具備合格資歷的會計師。 【選項解析】(A) gym 健身房 (B) term 學期 (C) department 部門 (D) hall 走廊。人力資源部為 human resources department。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Final examination grades will be posted on the school website at the conclusion of the autumn ______.","options":["semester","gym","hall","attention"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: semester (學期) 【全文中譯】期末考試成績將在秋季學期結束時公布在學校官方網站上。 【選項解析】(A) semester 學期 (B) gym 體育館 (C) hall 大廳 (D) attention 注意。秋季學期為 autumn semester。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The president of the republic is legally limited to serving a maximum of two four-year ______s in office.","options":["gyms","terms","campuses","halls"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: terms (任期) 【全文中譯】共和國總統在法律上受到嚴格限制，公職任期最多只能連任兩屆四年。 【選項解析】(A) gyms 體育館 (B) terms 任期 (C) campuses 校區 (D) halls 大廳。法定任期為 four-year terms in office。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Bicycles are the most popular mode of student transportation across the sprawling suburban university ______.","options":["attention","term","campus","semester"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: campus (校園) 【全文中譯】在腹地廣大的郊區大學校園裡，自行車是學生最受歡迎的交通工具。 【選項解析】(A) attention 注意 (B) term 任期 (C) campus 校園 (D) semester 學期。大學校園為 university campus。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Our high school basketball team practices shooting free throws inside the indoor ______ every afternoon.","options":["semester","term","attention","gym"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: gym (體育館；健身房) 【全文中譯】我們的高中籃球隊每天下午都在室內體育館內練習罰球投籃。 【選項解析】(A) semester 學期 (B) term 術語 (C) attention 注意 (D) gym 體育館。室內體育館為 indoor gym。"},{"number":10,"stem":"The awards banquet was held in the university's main dining ______, where students received their honors.","options":["hall","semester","term","attention"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: hall (大廳；禮堂) 【全文中譯】頒獎晚宴在大學的大宴會廳舉行，學生們在那裡接受表揚榮譽。 【選項解析】(A) hall 禮堂大廳 (B) semester 學期 (C) term 任期 (D) attention 注意。大型宴會廳為 dining hall。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Will you ______ the charity fundraising dinner tonight, or do you have prior business engagements in Kaohsiung?","options":["produce","attend","maintain","repair"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: attend (出席；參加) 【全文中譯】你今晚會出席慈善募款晚宴嗎？還是你在高雄已有事先排定的商務行程？ 【選項解析】(A) produce 製造 (B) attend 出席 (C) maintain 保養 (D) repair 修理。出席晚宴為 attend the dinner。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The young boy had trouble focusing his mental ______ on long reading passages during the standardized exam.","options":["campus","attention","department","gym"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: attention (專注力；注意力) 【全文中譯】小男孩在標準化測驗中很難將心思專注力長時間集中在冗長閱讀篇章上。 【選項解析】(A) campus 校園 (B) attention 專注力 (C) department 部門 (D) gym 健身房。精神集中為 mental attention。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Community ______s offer practical vocational certificates and two-year associate degrees for working adults.","options":["college","gym","hall","term"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: colleges (專科學校；學院) 【全文中譯】社區學院為在職成人提供實用的職業證照課程與兩年制副學士學位。 【選項解析】(A) college 學院 (B) gym 體育館 (C) hall 大廳 (D) term 術語。社區專科大學為 community colleges。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Several Nobel laureates conduct cutting-edge biomedical research at the state ______, training postgraduates.","options":["university","semester","term","attention"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: university (大學) 【全文中譯】數位諾貝爾獎得主在這所國立大學進行尖端生醫研究，培育研究生。 【選項解析】(A) university 大學 (B) semester 學期 (C) term 任期 (D) attention 注意。州立綜合大學為 state university。"},{"number":15,"stem":"If you want to exchange that sweater for a larger size, take your receipt to the customer service ______ on the first floor.","options":["gym","hall","department","campus"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: department (專櫃；部門) 【全文中譯】如果你想將那件毛衣換成較大尺碼，請拿收據到一樓的顧客服務專櫃部門處理。 【選項解析】(A) gym 體育館 (B) hall 門廳 (C) department 部門 (D) campus 校園。顧客服務部門為 customer service department。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Students who earn a high grade point average throughout the ______ are placed on the dean's honor list.","options":["semester","hall","gym","attention"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: semester (學期) 【全文中譯】整個學期GPA成績優異的學生，名字將會被列入教務長榮譽榜單上。 【選項解析】(A) semester 學期 (B) hall 大廳 (C) gym 體育館 (D) attention 注意。一學期期間為 throughout the semester。"},{"number":17,"stem":"In medical terminology, the ______ 'hypertension' simply refers to abnormally high arterial blood pressure.","options":["campus","term","gym","hall"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: term (術語；詞彙) 【全文中譯】在醫學術語中，專有名詞「高血壓」僅是指動脈血壓異常偏高的生理狀態。 【選項解析】(A) campus 校園 (B) term 術語 (C) gym 體育館 (D) hall 走廊。專業名詞術語為 the term。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Security guards patrol the college ______ late at night to ensure the personal safety of all dormitory students.","options":["semester","term","campus","attention"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: campus (校園) 【全文中譯】警衛在深夜於大學校園內巡邏，以確保所有住宿學生的人身安全。 【選項解析】(A) semester 學期 (B) term 詞彙 (C) campus 校園 (D) attention 注意。巡邏大學校區為 patrol the college campus。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Membership at the commercial ______ includes full access to free weights, rowing machines, and an indoor heated pool.","options":["attention","term","semester","gym"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: gym (健身房) 【全文中譯】商業健身房的會員資格享有自由重量器材、划船機及室內溫水泳池的完整使用權。 【選項解析】(A) attention 注意 (B) term 術語 (C) semester 學期 (D) gym 健身房。運動健身會籍為 commercial gym。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The grand lecture ______ in the humanities building can accommodate up to five hundred students simultaneously.","options":["hall","semester","term","attention"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: hall (演講廳；大講堂) 【全文中譯】人文大樓的宏偉大階梯講堂可同時容納多達五百名學生聽課。 【選項解析】(A) hall 講堂 (B) semester 學期 (C) term 任期 (D) attention 專注。大階梯教室演講廳為 grand lecture hall。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Over three hundred delegates traveled to Geneva to ______ the global peace and nuclear disarmament convention.","options":["attend","repair","produce","maintain"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: attend (出席) 【全文中譯】三百多名代表前往日內瓦出席全球和平與核裁軍國際公約大會。 【選項解析】(A) attend 出席 (B) repair 修理 (C) produce 製造 (D) maintain 維護。出席公約大會為 attend convention。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The teacher clapped his hands loudly to regain the ______ of the distracted pupils playing near the window.","options":["campus","attention","department","gym"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: attention (注意力) 【全文中譯】老師大聲拍手，以重新吸引在窗戶旁分心玩耍的小學生的注意力。 【選項解析】(A) campus 校區 (B) attention 注意力 (C) department 科系 (D) gym 健身房。重新吸引注意為 regain attention。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Applying to an Ivy League ______ requires stellar high school grades, excellent recommendations, and leadership skills.","options":["college","gym","hall","term"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: college (名牌大學；學院) 【全文中譯】申請常春藤盟校大學需要亮眼的高中成績單、卓越的推薦信與領導能力。 【選項解析】(A) college 大學 (B) gym 體育館 (C) hall 大堂 (D) term 任期。常春藤盟校為 Ivy League college。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The ______ hospital is famous for its advanced pediatric surgery department and compassionate nursing staff.","options":["university","semester","term","attention"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: university (大學附設的) 【全文中譯】這家大學附設醫院以其先進的小兒外科與充滿愛心的護理團隊聞名遐邇。 【選項解析】(A) university 大學 (B) semester 學期 (C) term 術語 (D) attention 注意。大學附設醫院為 university hospital。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Please leave your wet umbrellas in the ceramic stand located in the entrance ______ before entering the art gallery.","options":["hall","semester","term","attention"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: hall (門廳；玄關) 【全文中譯】在進入美術館欣賞畫作前，請將濕雨傘放置在入口玄關大廳的陶瓷傘架內。 【選項解析】(A) hall 玄關大廳 (B) semester 學期 (C) term 術語 (D) attention 注意。入口大廳門廳為 entrance hall。"}]},{"unit":60,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 60 (060.mp3) Topic Focus: Visual Arts, Monetary Currency, Household Income & Commercial Fees","topic":"Topic Focus: Visual Arts, Monetary Currency, Household Income & Commercial Fees | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"photograph","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a picture made using a camera; to take a picture","chinese":"照片；相片；攝影","sentence":"The tourist asked a friendly passerby to take a ______ of his family standing in front of Taipei 101.","translation":"這位遊客請一位好心的路人幫他站在台北101前面的家人拍一張______。"},{"word":"picture","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a visual representation of something produced on a surface; photo","chinese":"圖片；畫像；照片","sentence":"The children drew a colorful ______ of a green dragon and pinned it proudly to the classroom art board.","translation":"孩子們畫了一張綠色飛龍的彩色______，並自豪地用圖釘釘在教室的藝術展示欄上。"},{"word":"painting","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the action or skill of using paint; a painted picture","chinese":"油畫；繪畫；畫作","sentence":"The national art gallery purchased an expensive oil ______ painted by a renowned eighteenth-century European master.","translation":"國家美術館購買了一幅由十八世紀著名的歐洲繪畫大師所創作的昂貴油畫______。"},{"word":"crayon","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a pencil or stick of colored chalk or wax, used for drawing","chinese":"蠟筆","sentence":"Little Emma opened her brand-new box of wax ______s and began coloring the sunshine bright golden yellow.","translation":"小艾瑪打開了她嶄新的蠟______盒，開始將陽光塗成鮮豔的金黃色。"},{"word":"bill","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a printed statement of the money owed for goods or services; paper money","chinese":"帳單；紙鈔；法案","sentence":"After finishing our delicious Italian dinner, father asked the polite waiter to bring our dinner ______.","translation":"在享用完美味的義大利晚餐後，父親請有禮貌的服務生送上我們的晚餐______。"},{"word":"cash","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"money in coins or notes, as distinct from checks, credit cards, or debt","chinese":"現金；兌現","sentence":"The night market stall only accepts payment in ______, so tourists should carry sufficient coins and paper notes.","translation":"夜市攤位只接受用______付款，因此遊客應該隨身攜帶足夠的硬幣與紙鈔。"},{"word":"coin","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a flat, typically round piece of metal with an official stamp, used as money","chinese":"硬幣；投幣","sentence":"I dropped a ten-dollar metal ______ into the vending machine, and a can of cold green tea dropped into the tray.","translation":"我將一枚十元金屬______投入販賣機，一罐冰綠茶隨即便掉進托盤中。"},{"word":"income","pos":"(n.)","definition":"money received, especially on a regular basis, for work or investments","chinese":"收入；所得","sentence":"A progressive tax system requires families with higher annual ______ to pay a larger proportion of their earnings in tax.","translation":"累進稅率制度要求每年有較高______的家庭繳納其薪資所得中較大比例的稅款。"},{"word":"charge","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a price asked for goods or services; to demand an amount","chinese":"費用；收費；控告；衝鋒","sentence":"The hotel provides free Wi-Fi internet access to all guests without any additional hourly ______.","translation":"這家飯店向所有住客提供免費無線網路連線服務，完全不收任何額外的每小時______。"},{"word":"fee","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a payment made to a professional person or institution for advice or services","chinese":"規費；手續費；學雜費","sentence":"University students must pay their tuition ______ at the bank before the first week of classes begins.","translation":"大學生必須在開學第一週上課開始前，至銀行繳清他們的學雜______。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"During our vacation in Rome, we took an unforgettable black-and-white ______ in front of the Colosseum.","options":["photograph","crayon","bill","coin"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: photograph (照片) 【全文中譯】在羅馬度假期間，我們在羅馬競技場前拍了一張難忘的黑白照片。 【選項解析】(A) photograph 照片 (B) crayon 蠟筆 (C) bill 帳單 (D) coin 硬幣。拍黑白照片為 black-and-white photograph。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The illustrated children's book contains a charming ______ on every page to accompany the simple fairy tale.","options":["fee","picture","cash","income"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: picture (插圖；圖片) 【全文中譯】這本有插畫的童書每一頁都配有一幅迷人的插圖，伴隨著簡單的童話故事。 【選項解析】(A) fee 規費 (B) picture 插圖 (C) cash 現金 (D) income 收入。書中插圖為 picture。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The museum security guards stood watch beside the priceless oil ______, ensuring that no visitors touched the canvas.","options":["bill","coin","painting","fee"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: painting (油畫；畫作) 【全文中譯】博物館警衛守在價值連城的油畫畫作旁，確保沒有任何遊客觸碰畫布。 【選項解析】(A) bill 帳單 (B) coin 硬幣 (C) painting 油畫 (D) fee 費用。畫布上的油畫為 oil painting。"},{"number":4,"stem":"The kindergarten teacher handed each child a box of colored ______s to draw self-portraits on craft paper.","options":["crayons","bills","coins","fees"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: crayons (蠟筆) 【全文中譯】幼兒園老師遞給每個孩子一盒彩色蠟筆，讓他們在手工紙上畫自畫像。 【選項解析】(A) crayons 蠟筆 (B) bills 鈔票 (C) coins 硬幣 (D) fees 規費。畫畫工具為 colored crayons。"},{"number":5,"stem":"When the electricity ______ arrived in the mailbox, father was pleased to see our power consumption had dropped.","options":["painting","coin","bill","photograph"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: bill (電費帳單) 【全文中譯】當電費帳單寄到信箱時，父親很高興地看到我們的用電量有所下降。 【選項解析】(A) painting 畫作 (B) coin 硬幣 (C) bill 帳單 (D) photograph 相片。電費帳單為 electricity bill。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Many small street vendors do not accept mobile payments, so it is always wise to carry some ______ in your wallet.","options":["picture","cash","painting","crayon"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: cash (現金) 【全文中譯】許多街頭小攤販不接受手機行動支付，因此皮夾裡放些現金總是明智的做法。 【選項解析】(A) picture 圖片 (B) cash 現金 (C) painting 繪畫 (D) crayon 蠟筆。不支援行動支付需用 cash。"},{"number":7,"stem":"He flipped a silver ______ into the air to decide which of the two soccer teams would kick off first.","options":["coin","bill","fee","painting"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: coin (硬幣) 【全文中譯】他將一枚銀色硬幣拋向空中，以決定兩支足球隊哪一方先開球。 【選項解析】(A) coin 硬幣 (B) bill 鈔票 (C) fee 費用 (D) painting 畫作。擲硬幣決定開球為 flip a coin。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The government introduced job training programs to help low-______ families improve their living standards.","options":["fee","crayon","income","photograph"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: income (收入；所得) 【全文中譯】政府推出了職業培訓計畫，以協助低收入家庭改善生活水平。 【選項解析】(A) fee 規費 (B) crayon 蠟筆 (C) income 收入 (D) photograph 相片。低收入家庭為 low-income families。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The boutique hotel offers complimentary shuttle bus service to the airport at no extra ______ to registered guests.","options":["charge","coin","painting","crayon"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: charge (費用；加價) 【全文中譯】這家精品飯店向登記住客提供前往機場的免費接駁車服務，不另加收費用。 【選項解析】(A) charge 費用 (B) coin 硬幣 (C) painting 畫作 (D) crayon 蠟筆。不另加收費用為 at no extra charge。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Before registering for the marathon, participants must submit an online application and pay an entry ______.","options":["photograph","fee","picture","coin"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: fee (報名費；規費) 【全文中譯】在報名參加馬拉松之前，參賽者必須提交線上申請並繳納報名費用。 【選項解析】(A) photograph 照片 (B) fee 規費 (C) picture 圖片 (D) coin 硬幣。參賽報名費為 entry fee。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Professional wedding photographers take hundreds of high-resolution digital ______s during the ceremony.","options":["photographs","coins","bills","crayons"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: photographs (照片) 【全文中譯】專業婚禮攝影師在儀式過程中拍攝了數百張高解析度的數位照片。 【選項解析】(A) photographs 照片 (B) coins 硬幣 (C) bills 帳單 (D) crayons 蠟筆。攝影作品為 digital photographs。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Can you help me hang this framed landscape ______ straight on the living room wall above the fireplace?","options":["fee","picture","cash","income"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: picture (畫像；圖片) 【全文中譯】你能幫我將這幅裝框的風景畫平整地掛在壁爐上方的客廳牆壁上嗎？ 【選項解析】(A) fee 規費 (B) picture 圖片 (C) cash 現金 (D) income 收入。裝框風景畫為 framed landscape picture。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The famous Impressionist ______ depicts water lilies floating peacefully upon a sunlit pond in rural France.","options":["coin","fee","painting","bill"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: painting (油畫；畫作) 【全文中譯】這幅著名的印象派油畫描繪了法國鄉村陽光照耀的池塘上靜靜漂浮的睡蓮。 【選項解析】(A) coin 硬幣 (B) fee 規費 (C) painting 油畫 (D) bill 帳單。莫內名畫為 Impressionist painting。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The toddler used a green wax ______ to scribble all over the bedroom wall before his parents could stop him.","options":["crayon","bill","coin","fee"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: crayon (蠟筆) 【全文中譯】那個蹣跚學步的幼童在父母阻止前，用綠色蠟筆在臥室牆上塗鴉亂畫。 【選項解析】(A) crayon 蠟筆 (B) bill 帳單 (C) coin 硬幣 (D) fee 費用。塗鴉用 wax crayon。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The waiter brought the restaurant ______ in a small leather folder after we finished our coffee and dessert.","options":["photograph","painting","bill","coin"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: bill (餐飲帳單) 【全文中譯】在我們喝完咖啡與甜點後，服務生將餐廳結帳單夾在一個小皮夾中送過來。 【選項解析】(A) photograph 相片 (B) painting 畫作 (C) bill 帳單 (D) coin 硬幣。餐廳帳單為 restaurant bill。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Automated teller machines allow bank customers to withdraw paper ______ at any hour of the day or night.","options":["cash","crayon","picture","painting"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: cash (現金) 【全文中譯】自動提款機讓銀行客戶在晝夜任何時刻都能提領紙幣現金。 【選項解析】(A) cash 現金 (B) crayon 蠟筆 (C) picture 圖片 (D) painting 畫作。領取現鈔為 withdraw cash。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Ancient Greek ______s were stamped with the proud image of an owl, the sacred bird of Athena.","options":["coins","bills","fees","paintings"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: coins (硬幣) 【全文中譯】古希臘硬幣上鑄壓著貓頭鷹的驕傲形象，貓頭鷹是雅典娜女神的聖鳥。 【選項解析】(A) coins 硬幣 (B) bills 鈔票 (C) fees 費用 (D) paintings 畫作。金屬錢幣為 ancient coins。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Highly educated professionals like surgeons and corporate lawyers generally command a very high annual ______.","options":["crayon","picture","income","photograph"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: income (所得；收入) 【全文中譯】外科醫生與企業律師等高學歷專業人士，通常享有非常高的年收入所得。 【選項解析】(A) crayon 蠟筆 (B) picture 圖片 (C) income 收入 (D) photograph 相片。年薪所得為 annual income。"},{"number":19,"stem":"There is a nominal delivery ______ of five dollars if your online grocery order totals less than thirty dollars.","options":["charge","coin","painting","crayon"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: charge (收費；外加運費) 【全文中譯】如果你的線上生鮮訂單總額少於三十美元，則需酌收五美元的運送費用。 【選項解析】(A) charge 費用 (B) coin 硬幣 (C) painting 畫作 (D) crayon 蠟筆。運送外加費用為 delivery charge。"},{"number":20,"stem":"Real estate agents typically receive a commission ______ equal to a percentage of the final home sale price.","options":["photograph","fee","picture","coin"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: fee (佣金；手續費) 【全文中譯】不動產房屋仲介通常會收取相當於最終房屋售價一定百分比的佣金服務費。 【選項解析】(A) photograph 照片 (B) fee 規費 (C) picture 圖片 (D) coin 硬幣。佣金服務費為 commission fee。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The family kept an old photo album filled with vintage ______s showing life in rural Taiwan during the 1960s.","options":["photographs","coins","bills","crayons"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: photographs (老照片) 【全文中譯】這個家庭保存了一本裝滿老照片的相簿，記錄了1960年代台灣農村的生活。 【選項解析】(A) photographs 照片 (B) coins 硬幣 (C) bills 帳單 (D) crayons 蠟筆。相簿中的相片為 vintage photographs。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The magazine article was accompanied by a colorful graphic ______ summarizing recent population growth trends.","options":["cash","fee","picture","income"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: picture (插圖；圖表) 【全文中譯】該雜誌文章配有一幅色彩斑斕的圖解圖畫，概括了近期的人口增長趨勢。 【選項解析】(A) cash 現金 (B) fee 規費 (C) picture 插圖 (D) income 收入。雜誌配圖為 graphic picture。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The art collector spent over a million dollars at the London auction to acquire the rare watercolor ______.","options":["coin","painting","fee","bill"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: painting (水彩畫作) 【全文中譯】該藝術收藏家在倫敦拍賣會上耗資逾百萬美元，購得了這幅罕見的水彩畫作。 【選項解析】(A) coin 硬幣 (B) painting 畫作 (C) fee 規費 (D) bill 帳單。水彩畫為 watercolor painting。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Would you prefer to settle your hotel bill using a credit card, or would you rather pay with paper ______?","options":["cash","crayon","picture","painting"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: cash (現金) 【全文中譯】您希望使用信用卡結清飯店帳單，還是您比較想用紙幣現金付款？ 【選項解析】(A) cash 現金 (B) crayon 蠟筆 (C) picture 圖片 (D) painting 畫作。以現金付款為 pay with cash。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Museum admission is free for children under six years old, but adult visitors must pay an entrance ______.","options":["fee","coin","picture","photograph"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: fee (門票費；入場規費) 【全文中譯】六歲以下兒童可免費進入博物館參觀，但成年參訪者必須繳納入場門票費。 【選項解析】(A) fee 門票 (B) coin 硬幣 (C) picture 圖片 (D) photograph 相片。入場門票為 entrance fee。"}]},{"unit":61,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 61 (061.mp3) Topic Focus: Units of Measurement, Numbers, Quantities & Addition","topic":"Topic Focus: Units of Measurement, Numbers, Quantities & Addition | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"meter","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a standard unit of length equal to 100 centimeters","chinese":"公尺；計量器","sentence":"The city built a new twenty-five ______ swimming pool in the sports park, so local students can practice there every weekend.","translation":"該市在體育公園新建了一座二十五公尺長的游泳池，因此當地學生每個週末都可以在那裡練習。"},{"word":"centimeter","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a metric unit of length equal to one hundredth of a meter","chinese":"公分","sentence":"The tailor carefully measured my sleeve length down to the last ______, and then he marked the fabric with yellow chalk.","translation":"裁縫師仔細測量了我的袖長精確至最後一公分，然後他用黃色粉筆在布料上做了記號。"},{"word":"kilometer","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a metric unit of length equal to 1,000 meters","chinese":"公里","sentence":"My uncle drives thirty ______ along the coastal highway every morning, but the fresh sea breeze always keeps him awake.","translation":"我叔叔每天早晨沿著濱海公路開車三十公里，但是清新的海風總是讓他保持清醒。"},{"word":"inch","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a unit of length equal to 2.54 centimeters","chinese":"英吋","sentence":"The carpenter trimmed one ______ off the wooden door, and then it finally fit into the old doorframe smoothly.","translation":"木匠把木門切掉了一英吋，然後這扇門終於順暢地嵌進了舊門框中。"},{"word":"liter","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a metric unit of volume equal to 1,000 cubic centimeters","chinese":"公升","sentence":"During the intense summer marathon, each runner was handed half a ______ of mineral water at every rest station.","translation":"在炎熱激烈的夏季馬拉松比賽中，每個休息站都會遞給每位跑者半公升的礦泉水。"},{"word":"item","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an individual article or unit in a list or collection","chinese":"項目；物品","sentence":"Mother carefully checked every single ______ on her grocery list, and then she walked toward the supermarket checkout counter.","translation":"母親仔細核對了採購清單上的每一個項目，然後她朝著超級市場的收銀櫃台走去。"},{"word":"double","pos":"(adj.) / (v.)","definition":"twice as much or as many; to become twice as great","chinese":"雙倍的；加倍","sentence":"The hotel receptionist politely offered us a comfortable ______ room with two large beds and a wonderful mountain view.","translation":"飯店櫃檯接待員禮貌地為我們提供了一間帶有兩張大床和美麗山景的舒適雙人房。"},{"word":"quarter","pos":"(n.)","definition":"one of four equal parts of something; fifteen minutes","chinese":"四分之一；一刻鐘","sentence":"David saves a ______ of his monthly allowance to buy English novels, and he puts the remaining coins into a ceramic bank.","translation":"戴維每月省下四分之一的零用錢來買英文小說，並將剩餘的硬幣存入陶瓷存錢筒。"},{"word":"zero","pos":"(n.) / (adj.)","definition":"the number or symbol 0; nil; nothing","chinese":"零；零度","sentence":"The temperature on the high mountain dropped to five degrees below ______ last night, so all the outdoor water pipes froze.","translation":"昨晚高山上的氣溫降到了零下五度，因此戶外所有的水管都結凍了。"},{"word":"add","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to put something with another thing to increase the size or amount","chinese":"添加；增加；相加","sentence":"If the tomato soup tastes slightly too plain, you can ______ a little sea salt and black pepper to improve the flavor.","translation":"如果番茄湯嚐起來稍微太淡，你可以添加少許海鹽和黑胡椒以增添風味。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The runner dashed across the track and set a new national record in the four-hundred-______ race yesterday afternoon.","options":["meter","liter","quarter","zero"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: meter (公尺) 【全文中譯】昨天下午跑者衝過跑道，並在四百公尺賽跑中創下了新的國家紀錄。 【選項解析】(A) meter 公尺 (B) liter 公升 (C) quarter 四分之一 (D) zero 零。由 race（賽跑）可知填長度單位 meter。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The nurse measured the little girl's height on the wall chart and recorded that she had grown three ______ this year.","options":["liters","items","centimeters","quarters"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: centimeter (公分) 【全文中譯】護士在牆壁身高表上測量了小女孩的身高，並記錄下她今年長高了三公分。 【選項解析】(A) liters 公升 (B) items 項目 (C) centimeters 公分 (D) quarters 四分之一。身高增長以 centimeters 計量。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The mountain village is located about fifteen ______ away from the nearest town, so villagers usually ride motorcycles to buy supplies.","options":["centimeters","kilometers","liters","inches"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: kilometer (公里) 【全文中譯】這座山村距離最近的城鎮大約十五公里遠，所以村民通常騎機車去採買物資。 【選項解析】(A) centimeters 公分 (B) kilometers 公里 (C) liters 公升 (D) inches 英吋。城鎮間長距離以 kilometers 計算。"},{"number":4,"stem":"My father noticed that the wooden bookshelf was just one ______ too wide to fit between the two bedroom closets.","options":["inch","liter","double","zero"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: inch (英吋) 【全文中譯】我父親注意到木書架寬了一英吋，因此無法塞進兩個臥室衣櫃之間。 【選項解析】(A) inch 英吋 (B) liter 公升 (C) double 雙倍的 (D) zero 零。家具微小寬度差距以 inch 描述。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The recipe instructed the chef to pour two ______ of chicken broth into the large stainless steel pot before boiling.","options":["inches","centimeters","meters","liters"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: liter (公升) 【全文中譯】食譜指示主廚在煮沸前，將兩公升的雞高湯倒入不銹鋼大鍋中。 【選項解析】(A) inches 英吋 (B) centimeters 公分 (C) meters 公尺 (D) liters 公升。液體容量單位為 liters。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Please review every single ______ on this packing list before leaving home, or you might forget your passport.","options":["liter","item","meter","kilometer"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: item (項目；物品) 【全文中譯】出門前請仔細檢查這份行李清單上的每一個項目，否則你可能會忘記帶護照。 【選項解析】(A) liter 公升 (B) item 項目 (C) meter 公尺 (D) kilometer 公里。packing list 上指各個 item。"},{"number":7,"stem":"Because the train was fully booked for the holiday weekend, the railway company decided to ______ the number of passenger cars.","options":["add","double","count","subtract"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: double (加倍；使…成雙倍) 【全文中譯】因為假週末期間火車票全數售罄，鐵路公司決定將客車車廂數量加倍。 【選項解析】(A) add 增加 (B) double 加倍 (C) count 計算 (D) subtract 減去。使數量增為兩倍用動詞 double。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The clock on the church tower struck a ______ past ten, and the wedding guests slowly walked into the chapel.","options":["quarter","centimeter","liter","zero"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: quarter (一刻鐘；15分鐘) 【全文中譯】教堂塔樓上的鐘敲響了十點一刻，婚禮賓客們緩步走進了禮拜堂。 【選項解析】(A) quarter 一刻鐘 (B) centimeter 公分 (C) liter 公升 (D) zero 零。a quarter past ten 表示「十點十五分」。"},{"number":9,"stem":"In extreme winter blizzards in northern Canada, temperatures frequently fall way below ______, freezing entire rivers solid.","options":["meter","inch","zero","item"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: zero (零；零度) 【全文中譯】在加拿大北部的極端冬季暴風雪中，氣溫經常降至零度以下，使整條河流徹底凍結。 【選項解析】(A) meter 公尺 (B) inch 英吋 (C) zero 零 (D) item 項目。below zero 表示「零度以下」。"},{"number":10,"stem":"You should ______ some extra garlic and olive oil to the pasta sauce, and it will taste much more delicious.","options":["multiply","double","add","measure"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: add (添加；加入) 【全文中譯】你應該在義大利麵醬裡加些大蒜與橄欖油，嚐起來會美味許多。 【選項解析】(A) multiply 乘 (B) double 加倍 (C) add 添加 (D) measure 測量。添加調味料使用動詞 add。"},{"number":11,"stem":"When the delivery truck arrived at our warehouse, the driver unloaded ten ______ of fresh cooking oil.","options":["liters","inches","meters","items"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: liter (公升) 【全文中譯】當送貨卡車抵達我們的倉庫時，司機卸下了十公升的新鮮食用油。 【選項解析】(A) liters 公升 (B) inches 英吋 (C) meters 公尺 (D) items 項目。液體食用油單位為 liters。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The construction worker measured the concrete wall and found that it was exactly three ______ high.","options":["quarters","meters","liters","zeroes"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: meter (公尺) 【全文中譯】建築工人測量了混凝土牆，發現其高度正好是三公尺。 【選項解析】(A) quarters 一刻鐘 (B) meters 公尺 (C) liters 公升 (D) zeroes 零。圍牆高度一般以 meters 計量。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Even an error of one single ______ on the blueprint can cause serious structural problems for modern skyscrapers.","options":["centimeter","liter","quarter","zero"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: centimeter (公分) 【全文中譯】即使在藍圖上僅有一公分的誤差，也可能對現代摩天大樓造成嚴重的結構問題。 【選項解析】(A) centimeter 公分 (B) liter 公升 (C) quarter 四分之一 (D) zero 零。藍圖精密測量單位為 centimeter。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The tourist walked nearly five ______ through the historic district, but his comfortable walking shoes kept his feet from aching.","options":["liters","inches","kilometers","items"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: kilometer (公里) 【全文中譯】觀光客徒步穿過歷史街區近五公里，但他舒適的健走鞋保護了他的雙腳免於痠痛。 【選項解析】(A) liters 公升 (B) inches 英吋 (C) kilometers 公里 (D) items 項目。步行長距離以 kilometers 計算。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The seamstress used a flexible measuring tape to check the waistline, which had expanded by half an ______.","options":["item","inch","liter","kilometer"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: inch (英吋) 【全文中譯】女裁縫師用軟捲尺檢查腰圍，該腰圍已經擴大了半英吋。 【選項解析】(A) item 項目 (B) inch 英吋 (C) liter 公升 (D) kilometer 公里。身體圍度變化常以 inch 測量。"},{"number":16,"stem":"The auction house listed a rare antique vase as the final ______ to be sold at the evening charity gala.","options":["quarter","meter","item","centimeter"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: item (物品；拍賣品) 【全文中譯】拍賣行將一只稀有的古董花瓶列為當晚慈善晚會上拍賣的最後一件物品。 【選項解析】(A) quarter 四分之一 (B) meter 公尺 (C) item 項目；物品 (D) centimeter 公分。拍賣品指 item。"},{"number":17,"stem":"To prepare for the unexpected winter storm, the local grocery store decided to ______ its emergency candle inventory.","options":["add","measure","reduce","double"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: double (加倍；使…成雙倍) 【全文中譯】為了防備意外的冬季暴風雪，當地雜貨店決定將緊急蠟燭的庫存加倍。 【選項解析】(A) add 增加 (B) measure 測量 (C) reduce 減少 (D) double 加倍。庫存量翻倍用動詞 double。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Nearly a ______ of the students in our class walk to school every morning, while the others take public buses.","options":["liter","quarter","meter","zero"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: quarter (四分之一) 【全文中譯】我們班近四分之一的學生每天步行上學，而其餘學生則搭乘公車。 【選項解析】(A) liter 公升 (B) quarter 四分之一 (C) meter 公尺 (D) zero 零。a quarter of the students 指「四分之一的學生」。"},{"number":19,"stem":"After answering all the tricky math questions incorrectly, the careless student received a painful score of ______ on his quiz.","options":["inch","item","zero","meter"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: zero (零；零分) 【全文中譯】在將所有棘手的數學問題全部答錯後，粗心的學生在測驗中得到了令人痛苦的零分。 【選項解析】(A) inch 英吋 (B) item 項目 (C) zero 零 (D) meter 公尺。a score of zero 指「零分」。"},{"number":20,"stem":"Don't forget to ______ a few spoonfuls of honey to your lemon tea, or it will taste too sour to drink.","options":["add","double","divide","count"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: add (添加；加入) 【全文中譯】別忘了在檸檬茶裡加幾匙蜂蜜，否則喝起來會太酸。 【選項解析】(A) add 添加 (B) double 加倍 (C) divide 分割 (D) count 計算。添加蜂蜜用 add。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The Olympic swimming pool is fifty ______ in length, allowing eight competitors to race side by side.","options":["liters","meters","quarters","zeroes"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: meter (公尺) 【全文中譯】奧運標準泳池長度為五十公尺，允許八名選手並肩競速。 【選項解析】(A) liters 公升 (B) meters 公尺 (C) quarters 一刻鐘 (D) zeroes 零。泳池長度單位為 meters。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The newborn kitten was so tiny that its entire body measured only ten ______ from nose to tail.","options":["liters","items","centimeters","kilometers"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: centimeter (公分) 【全文中譯】新生的小貓非常嬌小，從鼻子到尾巴的整體長度只有十公分。 【選項解析】(A) liters 公升 (B) items 項目 (C) centimeters 公分 (D) kilometers 公里。小動物尺寸以 centimeters 測量。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The flight captain announced that the aircraft was cruising at an altitude of ten ______ above the clouds.","options":["inches","kilometers","liters","quarters"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: kilometer (公里) 【全文中譯】機長宣布飛機正在雲層上方十公里的巡航高度飛行。 【選項解析】(A) inches 英吋 (B) kilometers 公里 (C) liters 公升 (D) quarters 四分之一。巡航飛行高度以 kilometers 計算。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The family ordered a ______ cheeseburger with two beef patties and crispy french fries at the drive-through window.","options":["single","narrow","double","broad"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: double (雙層的；雙倍的) 【全文中譯】這家人在得來速窗口點了一份帶有兩塊牛肉餅和脆薯條的雙層起司漢堡。 【選項解析】(A) single 單一的 (B) narrow 狹窄的 (C) double 雙層的 (D) broad 寬廣的。含有兩塊肉餅指 double cheeseburger。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Please ______ these two numbers together on your calculator, and tell the accountant the final sum immediately.","options":["add","double","measure","cancel"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: add (相加；加上) 【全文中譯】請用計算機把這兩個數字加在一起，並立即告訴會計師最終的總和。 【選項解析】(A) add 相加 (B) double 加倍 (C) measure 測量 (D) cancel 取消。add numbers together 表示「將數字加總」。"}]},{"unit":62,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 62 (062.mp3) Topic Focus: Mathematics, Geometric Shapes, Lines & Completeness","topic":"Topic Focus: Mathematics, Geometric Shapes, Lines & Completeness | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"equal","pos":"(adj.) / (v.)","definition":"the same in quantity, size, or value; to be the same as","chinese":"相等的；等於","sentence":"In a fair democracy, all citizens should enjoy ______ legal rights under the law regardless of their background.","translation":"在公平的民主制度下，無論背景為何，所有公民在法律面前都應享有平等的法律權利。"},{"word":"entire","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"whole or complete, with nothing missing","chinese":"整個的；完全的","sentence":"The dedicated scientist spent the ______ weekend in the university laboratory to complete her physics experiment.","translation":"這位敬業的科學家在大學實驗室度過了整個週末，以完成她的物理實驗。"},{"word":"maximum","pos":"(adj.) / (n.)","definition":"the greatest possible amount, degree, or number","chinese":"最大的；最高極限","sentence":"The highway patrol officer stated that the ______ speed limit on this bridge is eighty kilometers per hour.","translation":"公路巡警指出這座橋上的最高速限為每小時八十公里。"},{"word":"total","pos":"(adj.) / (n.)","definition":"complete; including everything; the whole amount","chinese":"總計的；總數","sentence":"After buying textbooks and school uniforms, the ______ cost came to over three thousand dollars.","translation":"在購買了教科書與學校制服後，總計費用超過了三千元。"},{"word":"amount","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a quantity of something, especially something that cannot be counted","chinese":"數量；總額","sentence":"Drinking a generous ______ of warm water each morning helps maintain digestion and promotes physical health.","translation":"每天早晨飲用足量的溫水有助於維持消化並促進身體健康。"},{"word":"curve","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a line or surface that bends smoothly without sharp angles","chinese":"曲線；彎曲","sentence":"The coastal mountain road has a dangerous sharp ______ near the cliff, so drivers must slow down considerably.","translation":"這條濱海山路在懸崖附近有一個危險的急轉彎曲線，因此駕駛人必須大幅減速。"},{"word":"straight","pos":"(adj.) / (adv.)","definition":"continuing in one direction without bending or turning","chinese":"筆直的；直接","sentence":"The art teacher asked the students to draw a ______ pencil line across the paper before painting the landscape.","translation":"美術老師要求學生在繪畫風景之前，先用鉛筆在紙上畫出一條筆直的線。"},{"word":"underline","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to draw a line under a word to give it emphasis","chinese":"畫底線；強調","sentence":"You should take a fluorescent highlighter and ______ the key grammatical rules while reviewing each chapter.","translation":"在複習每個章節時，你應該拿螢光筆在重點文法規則下方畫底線以加強記憶。"},{"word":"triangle","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a flat geometric shape with three straight sides and three angles","chinese":"三角形","sentence":"The primary school students learned how to calculate the area of a ______ by multiplying base times height and dividing by two.","translation":"小學生學會了如何藉由底乘以高除以二來計算三角形的面積。"},{"word":"rectangle","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a flat geometric shape with four straight sides and four right angles","chinese":"長方形；矩形","sentence":"The new living room rug is shaped like a large ______, and it fits neatly under the glass coffee table.","translation":"新客廳地毯的形狀像一個大長方形，它整齊地鋪在玻璃咖啡桌下方。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The math teacher wrote on the whiteboard that two plus two ______ four, which every student already knew.","options":["curves","equals","underlines","totals"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: equals (等於) 【全文中譯】數學老師在白板上寫著二加二等於四，這是每個學生早就知道的事實。 【選項解析】(A) curves 彎曲 (B) equals 等於 (C) underlines 畫底線 (D) totals 總計。數學算式二加二等於四用 equals。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Heavy rain flooded the valley, and the storm cut off electricity to the ______ town for nearly two days.","options":["entire","straight","equal","maximum"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: entire (整個的) 【全文中譯】豪雨淹沒了山谷，這場風暴使整個城鎮斷電了近兩天。 【選項解析】(A) entire 整個的 (B) straight 筆直的 (C) equal 平等的 (D) maximum 最大的。修飾全體 town 用 entire。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The elevator safety certificate indicates that the ______ capacity is twelve passengers or nine hundred kilograms.","options":["curve","triangle","maximum","total"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: maximum (最大的；最高極限) 【全文中譯】電梯安全證書標明最高承載量為十二名乘客或九百公斤。 【選項解析】(A) curve 曲線 (B) triangle 三角形 (C) maximum 最大限度 (D) total 總共。maximum capacity 為「最高乘載量」。"},{"number":4,"stem":"When the cashier scanned all the groceries, the ______ amount shown on the cash register was sixty dollars.","options":["straight","equal","total","entire"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: total (總計的；總額) 【全文中譯】當收銀員掃描完所有雜貨時，收銀機上顯示的總金額為六十美元。 【選項解析】(A) straight 筆直的 (B) equal 平等的 (C) total 總計的 (D) entire 整個的。total amount 指「總金額」。"},{"number":5,"stem":"A large ______ of dust had gathered on the bookshelves because nobody had cleaned the room for months.","options":["amount","triangle","rectangle","curve"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: amount (數量；大量) 【全文中譯】由於數月沒人清理房間，書架上積聚了大量的灰塵。 【選項解析】(A) amount 數量 (B) triangle 三角形 (C) rectangle 長方形 (D) curve 曲線。a large amount of + 不可數名詞（dust）。"},{"number":6,"stem":"The high-speed train tilted gently as it passed through a wide railway ______ around the base of the hill.","options":["rectangle","triangle","curve","amount"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: curve (彎道；曲線) 【全文中譯】當高鐵通過山腳下一處寬闊的鐵路彎道時，車身微微傾斜。 【選項解析】(A) rectangle 長方形 (B) triangle 三角形 (C) curve 彎道；曲線 (D) amount 數量。鐵路轉彎處稱為 curve。"},{"number":7,"stem":"Walk along this road in a ______ direction for three blocks, and you will see the post office on your left.","options":["maximum","curve","straight","equal"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: straight (筆直的；直的) 【全文中譯】沿著這條路筆直走三個街區，你就會在左手邊看到郵局。 【選項解析】(A) maximum 最大的 (B) curve 曲線 (C) straight 筆直的 (D) equal 平等的。straight direction 指「筆直的方向」。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The professor advised everyone to ______ the main thesis statement in their introductory essays.","options":["curve","underline","equal","divide"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: underline (畫底線；強調) 【全文中譯】教授建議大家在導論短文中給中心論點句子畫底線。 【選項解析】(A) curve 彎曲 (B) underline 畫底線 (C) equal 等於 (D) divide 分割。強調文字用 underline。"},{"number":9,"stem":"In geometry class, we used a plastic ruler to measure each side of the wooden ______ on the desk.","options":["curve","amount","triangle","maximum"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: triangle (三角形) 【全文中譯】在幾何學課堂上，我們用塑膠尺測量了桌上木製三角形的每個邊長。 【選項解析】(A) curve 曲線 (B) amount 數量 (C) triangle 三角形 (D) maximum 最大極限。有各個邊長測量之幾何形狀為 triangle。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Most classroom whiteboards are built in the shape of a large ______ so that teachers have plenty of writing space.","options":["rectangle","triangle","curve","total"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: rectangle (長方形；矩形) 【全文中譯】大多數教室白板都製成大長方形的形狀，以便教師有充足的書寫空間。 【選項解析】(A) rectangle 長方形 (B) triangle 三角形 (C) curve 曲線 (D) total 總額。白板形狀為 rectangle。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Men and women working in this international corporation receive ______ pay for doing identical engineering tasks.","options":["entire","straight","equal","maximum"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: equal (平等的；同等的) 【全文中譯】在這家跨國企業工作的男女同仁，從事相同的工程任務時享有同等報酬。 【選項解析】(A) entire 整個的 (B) straight 筆直的 (C) equal 同等的 (D) maximum 最大的。equal pay 指「同工同酬」。"},{"number":12,"stem":"It took the author an ______ year of continuous research and writing to finish his biographical novel.","options":["entire","equal","straight","curved"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: entire (整整的；一整年) 【全文中譯】作者花費了整整一年的持續研究與寫作，才完成了他的傳記小說。 【選項解析】(A) entire 整整的 (B) equal 平等的 (C) straight 筆直的 (D) curved 彎曲的。an entire year 指「整整一年」。"},{"number":13,"stem":"To prevent structural damage, the bridge has a ______ load weight limit that prohibits heavy transport trucks.","options":["rectangle","curve","maximum","total"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: maximum (最大極限的) 【全文中譯】為防止結構受損，該橋設有禁止重型運輸卡車通過的最大載重限制。 【選項解析】(A) rectangle 長方形 (B) curve 曲線 (C) maximum 最大限度的 (D) total 總計的。maximum weight limit 指「最高載重限制」。"},{"number":14,"stem":"A ______ of forty international exchange students enrolled in the advanced conversational Mandarin course.","options":["triangle","total","curve","rectangle"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: total (總數) 【全文中譯】總計有四十名國際交換學生註冊了這門進階華語會話課程。 【選項解析】(A) triangle 三角形 (B) total 總數 (C) curve 曲線 (D) rectangle 長方形。a total of + 數字表示「總計…」。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The doctor warned the patient that consuming an excessive ______ of refined sugar could worsen his health.","options":["amount","curve","triangle","maximum"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: amount (數量) 【全文中譯】醫生警告病人攝入過量的精製糖可能會惡化他的健康狀況。 【選項解析】(A) amount 數量 (B) curve 曲線 (C) triangle 三角形 (D) maximum 最大值。an excessive amount of 表示「過量的…」。"},{"number":16,"stem":"The baseball pitcher threw a fast ball that seemed to ______ suddenly right before reaching home plate.","options":["equal","underline","curve","total"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: curve (轉彎；拐彎) 【全文中譯】棒球投手投出了一記剛好在抵達本壘板前突然轉彎的快速球。 【選項解析】(A) equal 等於 (B) underline 畫底線 (C) curve 轉彎 (D) total 總計。球路變換方向用動詞 curve。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Draw a ______ pencil line connecting point A to point B, and then measure its distance in centimeters.","options":["maximum","straight","curved","equal"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: straight (筆直的) 【全文中譯】用鉛筆畫一條筆直的線將A點連接到B點，然後測量其公分距離。 【選項解析】(A) maximum 最大的 (B) straight 筆直的 (C) curved 彎曲的 (D) equal 平等的。straight line 為「直線」。"},{"number":18,"stem":"During the reading comprehension exam, please ______ the sentences that provide evidence for your answers.","options":["curve","underline","equal","design"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: underline (畫底線) 【全文中譯】在閱讀測驗考試中，請在為你的答案提供證據的句子下方畫底線。 【選項解析】(A) curve 彎曲 (B) underline 畫底線 (C) equal 等於 (D) design 設計。畫線標註用 underline。"},{"number":19,"stem":"An equilateral ______ has three sides that are exactly the same length and three sixty-degree angles.","options":["rectangle","triangle","curve","amount"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: triangle (三角形) 【全文中譯】正三角形的三條邊完全等長，且具有三個六十度的角。 【選項解析】(A) rectangle 長方形 (B) triangle 三角形 (C) curve 曲線 (D) amount 數量。等邊三角度幾何圖形為 triangle。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The carpenter cut a piece of plywood into a neat ______ to serve as the tabletop for our study desk.","options":["rectangle","curve","triangle","maximum"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: rectangle (長方形) 【全文中譯】木匠把一塊膠合板切成俐落的長方形，作為我們書桌的桌面。 【選項解析】(A) rectangle 長方形 (B) curve 曲線 (C) triangle 三角形 (D) maximum 最大。桌子常見面板形狀為 rectangle。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Both job candidates possess ______ educational qualifications, but Mark has three more years of management experience.","options":["entire","equal","straight","maximum"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: equal (同等的；相等的) 【全文中譯】兩位求職者都具備同等的學歷資格，但馬克多了三年的管理經驗。 【選項解析】(A) entire 整個的 (B) equal 同等的 (C) straight 筆直的 (D) maximum 最大的。equal qualifications 指「同等資格條件」。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The fire destroyed the ______ warehouse, but fortunately all employees evacuated safely without any injuries.","options":["entire","equal","straight","triangle"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: entire (整個的) 【全文中譯】大火燒毀了整座倉庫，但幸運的是所有員工安全疏散，無人受傷。 【選項解析】(A) entire 整個的 (B) equal 平等的 (C) straight 筆直的 (D) triangle 三角形。the entire warehouse 指「整座倉庫」。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The athlete exerted his ______ effort during the final lap of the race and won the championship trophy.","options":["curve","triangle","maximum","straight"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: maximum (最大的；竭盡的) 【全文中譯】運動員在比賽的最後一圈竭盡全力，贏得了冠軍獎盃。 【選項解析】(A) curve 曲線 (B) triangle 三角形 (C) maximum 最大的 (D) straight 筆直的。maximum effort 指「最大努力」。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The river follows a gentle ______ through the fertile farmland before emptying into the wide blue sea.","options":["triangle","rectangle","curve","total"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: curve (彎曲；曲線) 【全文中譯】河流在注入寬廣蔚藍的大海之前，沿著肥沃的農田形成優美的彎曲。 【選項解析】(A) triangle 三角形 (B) rectangle 長方形 (C) curve 曲線；彎流 (D) total 總數。河流彎流稱為 curve。"},{"number":25,"stem":"If you look ______ ahead down the long highway, you can see the snow-capped mountain peaks in the distance.","options":["straight","entire","maximum","equal"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: straight (直直地；正) 【全文中譯】如果你沿著漫長的高速公路筆直往前看，可以看到遠方白雪皚皚的山峰。 【選項解析】(A) straight 筆直地 (B) entire 整個的 (C) maximum 最大限度 (D) equal 平等的。look straight ahead 指「筆直往前看」。"}]},{"unit":63,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 63 (063.mp3) Topic Focus: Dimensions, Spatial Measurements, Broadcasting & Navigation","topic":"Topic Focus: Dimensions, Spatial Measurements, Broadcasting & Navigation | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"narrow","pos":"(adj.) / (v.)","definition":"limited in width; not wide; to become less wide","chinese":"狹窄的；使變窄","sentence":"The old mountain trail became extremely ______ near the rock cliff, so hikers had to walk in single file.","translation":"靠近岩石懸崖邊的老山徑變得極其狹窄，因此登山者不得不排成單行前進。"},{"word":"wide","pos":"(adj.) / (adv.)","definition":"measuring a lot from side to side; broad; fully","chinese":"寬闊的；廣泛地","sentence":"The city government built a ______ new boulevard with dedicated bicycle lanes and bright streetlights.","translation":"市政府建造了一條設有專用自行車道和明亮路燈的寬闊新林蔭大道。"},{"word":"width","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the distance or measurement from side to side","chinese":"寬度","sentence":"The interior designer measured the exact ______ of the living room window before ordering custom silk curtains.","translation":"室內設計師在訂製絲綢窗簾之前，測量了客廳窗戶的精確寬度。"},{"word":"length","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the measurement of something from end to end","chinese":"長度","sentence":"The luxury sailing yacht measures over twenty meters in ______, and it can accommodate twelve passengers comfortably.","translation":"這艘豪華帆船遊艇長度超過二十公尺，可舒適容納十二名乘客。"},{"word":"height","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the measurement of someone or something from base to top","chinese":"高度；身高","sentence":"My younger brother has grown so fast this year that he is now almost the same ______ as our father.","translation":"我的弟弟今年長得非常快，以至於他現在的身高幾乎和我們父親一樣高了。"},{"word":"scale","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a weighing device; relative size or extent; to climb","chinese":"磅秤；規模；比例尺","sentence":"The doctor asked the patient to step onto the medical ______ to record his body weight before the examination.","translation":"醫生請病人在檢查前站上醫療用磅秤，以便記錄他的體重。"},{"word":"broad","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"wide in extent from side to side; spacious","chinese":"寬廣的；廣泛的","sentence":"The professional swimmer has very ______ shoulders and muscular arms from years of rigorous daily training.","translation":"這位專業游泳選手由於多年嚴格的日常訓練，擁有非常寬廣的肩膀與肌肉發達的雙臂。"},{"word":"broadcast (broadcast / broadcast / broadcast)","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to transmit programs on television or radio","chinese":"廣播；播送","sentence":"The national television station will ______ the exciting international baseball championship live from Tokyo tonight.","translation":"國家電視台今晚將從東京現場實況轉播激動人心的國際棒球錦標賽。"},{"word":"address","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"the details of where someone lives; to speak formally to","chinese":"地址；致詞；處理","sentence":"Please write your permanent home ______ and contact telephone number clearly at the top of the registration form.","translation":"請在註冊表格頂端清楚寫下您的戶籍地址與聯絡電話號碼。"},{"word":"direct","pos":"(adj.) / (v.)","definition":"going in a straight line without stopping; to guide","chinese":"直達的；指引；引導","sentence":"Passengers traveling on business prefer to take a ______ flight to London because it saves several hours of layover time.","translation":"出差旅行的乘客偏好搭乘直飛倫敦的航班，因為這樣可以節省數小時的中途轉機時間。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The historic stone bridge is too ______ for two cars to pass each other at the same time, so drivers take turns.","options":["broad","narrow","wide","direct"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: narrow (狹窄的) 【全文中譯】這座歷史石橋太狹窄了，無法讓兩輛車同時會車通過，因此駕駛人必須輪流通行。 【選項解析】(A) broad 寬廣的 (B) narrow 狹窄的 (C) wide 寬闊的 (D) direct 直達的。無法兩車並行說明橋面 narrow。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The heavy wooden gate swung ______ open when the palace guards welcomed the foreign visitors inside.","options":["narrow","direct","wide","scale"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: wide (完全地；大開地) 【全文中譯】當皇宮衛兵歡迎外國訪客進入時，厚重的木門大開著。 【選項解析】(A) narrow 狹窄的 (B) direct 直達的 (C) wide 敞開地 (D) scale 磅秤。swung wide open 表示「大門敞開」。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The carpenter measured the ______ of the hallway to ensure that the refrigerator could pass through safely.","options":["width","broadcast","address","direct"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: width (寬度) 【全文中譯】木匠測量了走廊的寬度，以確保冰箱能夠安全通過。 【選項解析】(A) width 寬度 (B) broadcast 廣播 (C) address 地址 (D) direct 直達的。通道兩側間距指 width。"},{"number":4,"stem":"The suspension bridge extends across the river for a total ______ of nearly two kilometers.","options":["address","scale","length","broadcast"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: length (長度) 【全文中譯】這座懸索橋跨越河流，總長度接近兩公里。 【選項解析】(A) address 地址 (B) scale 規模 (C) length 長度 (D) broadcast 廣播。橋樑端到端距離為 length。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Due to his impressive ______, Samuel was selected as the starting center for the high school basketball team.","options":["width","scale","broadcast","height"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: height (高度；身高) 【全文中譯】由於他令人印象深刻的身高，塞繆爾被選為高中籃球隊的先發中鋒。 【選項解析】(A) width 寬度 (B) scale 磅秤 (C) broadcast 廣播 (D) height 身高。籃球員身材優勢為 height。"},{"number":6,"stem":"She stood nervously on the bathroom ______ every Monday morning to check whether her new fitness diet was working.","options":["length","scale","address","width"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: scale (磅秤) 【全文中譯】她每週一早上緊張地站在浴室磅秤上，檢查新健康飲食計畫是否見效。 【選項解析】(A) length 長度 (B) scale 磅秤 (C) address 地址 (D) width 寬度。浴室測體重器具為 scale。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The athlete smiled with a ______ grin when the principal presented him with the gold medal.","options":["narrow","direct","broad","scale"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: broad (燦爛的；寬闊的) 【全文中譯】當校長向運動員頒發金牌時，他臉上露出了燦爛的笑容。 【選項解析】(A) narrow 狹窄的 (B) direct 直達的 (C) broad 燦爛的；寬闊的 (D) scale 磅秤。a broad grin 表示「燦爛滿面的笑容」。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The sports network will ______ the final match of the World Cup to millions of viewers around the globe.","options":["address","broadcast","narrow","scale"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: broadcast (轉播；播送) 【全文中譯】體育電視網將向全球數百萬觀眾現場轉播世界盃決賽。 【選項解析】(A) address 致詞 (B) broadcast 轉播 (C) narrow 縮小 (D) scale 攀登。電視傳播賽事用 broadcast。"},{"number":9,"stem":"If you move to a new apartment, don't forget to update your mailing ______ with the post office and your bank.","options":["address","length","height","width"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: address (地址) 【全文中譯】如果你搬進新公寓，別忘了向郵局與銀行更新你的郵寄地址。 【選項解析】(A) address 地址 (B) length 長度 (C) height 身高 (D) width 寬度。收信郵寄資訊為 mailing address。"},{"number":10,"stem":"We decided to take a ______ train from Taipei to Kaohsiung so that we would arrive in time for lunch.","options":["narrow","broad","direct","wide"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: direct (直達的) 【全文中譯】我們決定搭乘從台北到高雄的直達火車，以便能及時趕上吃午餐。 【選項解析】(A) narrow 狹窄的 (B) broad 寬廣的 (C) direct 直達的 (D) wide 寬闊的。中途不轉車的班次為 direct train。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Be careful when driving down this ______ alley because parked scooters leave very little room for vehicles.","options":["broad","wide","direct","narrow"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: narrow (狹窄的) 【全文中譯】開車進這條狹窄巷弄時要小心，因為停放的機車給車輛留下的空間非常有限。 【選項解析】(A) broad 寬廣的 (B) wide 寬闊的 (C) direct 直達的 (D) narrow 狹窄的。巷弄空間小指 narrow alley。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The park features a ______ lawn where families can spread picnic blankets and play games on weekends.","options":["narrow","wide","height","direct"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: wide (寬闊的) 【全文中譯】該公園有一片寬闊的草坪，家庭可以在週末鋪上野餐墊玩遊戲。 【選項解析】(A) narrow 狹窄的 (B) wide 寬闊的 (C) height 高度 (D) direct 直達的。廣大平坦草坪為 wide lawn。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The fabric is sold by the meter, but you must specify both the ______ and the color you need.","options":["broadcast","address","width","scale"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: width (寬度) 【全文中譯】布料按公尺出售，但你必須同時註明所需的寬度與顏色。 【選項解析】(A) broadcast 廣播 (B) address 地址 (C) width 寬度 (D) scale 磅秤。布匹規格尺寸為 width。"},{"number":14,"stem":"A regular football field has a ______ of one hundred yards between the two goal lines.","options":["height","width","length","scale"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: length (長度) 【全文中譯】正規美式足球場在兩個達陣球門線之間具有一百碼的長度。 【選項解析】(A) height 高度 (B) width 寬度 (C) length 長度 (D) scale 比例尺。球場兩端長度為 length。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The skyscraper rose to an astounding ______ of five hundred meters, offering panoramic views of the entire valley.","options":["height","width","address","scale"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: height (高度) 【全文中譯】這座摩天大樓聳立達五百公尺的驚人高度，可俯瞰整個山谷的全景。 【選項解析】(A) height 高度 (B) width 寬度 (C) address 地址 (D) scale 規模。建築物垂直垂直尺寸為 height。"},{"number":16,"stem":"The government launched a relief project on a massive ______ to reconstruct homes destroyed by the earthquake.","options":["address","scale","length","broadcast"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: scale (規模) 【全文中譯】政府展開了一項大規模的救援重建計畫，以重建因地震被毀的家園。 【選項解析】(A) address 地址 (B) scale 規模 (C) length 長度 (D) broadcast 廣播。on a massive scale 為固定搭配「大規模地」。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Through the ______ window of the harbor lighthouse, the watchman could observe incoming cargo ships.","options":["narrow","direct","broad","scale"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: broad (寬闊的) 【全文中譯】透過港口燈塔的寬闊窗戶，值班員能夠觀察進港的貨船。 【選項解析】(A) narrow 狹窄的 (B) direct 直達的 (C) broad 寬闊的 (D) scale 磅秤。窗戶視野寬大為 broad window。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Several radio channels will ______ emergency weather warnings throughout the night as the typhoon approaches.","options":["address","broadcast","direct","scale"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: broadcast (廣播；播送) 【全文中譯】隨著颱風逼近，數個廣播頻道將整夜播送緊急天氣警報。 【選項解析】(A) address 致詞 (B) broadcast 廣播 (C) direct 引導 (D) scale 攀登。廣播播送警報為 broadcast warnings。"},{"number":19,"stem":"The letter was returned to the sender because the envelope had an incomplete and incorrect delivery ______.","options":["address","width","length","height"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: address (地址) 【全文中譯】信件被退回給寄件人，因為信封上的投遞地址不完整且錯誤。 【選項解析】(A) address 地址 (B) width 寬度 (C) length 長度 (D) height 高度。信件投遞目的地為 address。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The tour guide gave ______ instructions to the travelers so that nobody would get lost in the busy museum.","options":["narrow","broad","wide","direct"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: direct (直接明確的) 【全文中譯】導遊向旅客發出了直接明確的指示，以免有人在繁忙的博物館中迷路。 【選項解析】(A) narrow 狹隘的 (B) broad 廣泛的 (C) wide 寬泛的 (D) direct 直接明確的。direct instructions 指明確直截的指示。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The cat squeezed its flexible body through a ______ opening in the garden fence to catch a mouse.","options":["direct","narrow","broad","wide"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: narrow (狹窄的) 【全文中譯】貓咪擠過花園圍欄上的狹窄縫隙，去抓一隻老鼠。 【選項解析】(A) direct 直接的 (B) narrow 狹窄的 (C) broad 寬廣的 (D) wide 寬闊的。微小縫隙為 narrow opening。"},{"number":22,"stem":"He opened his arms ______ to hug his grandparents when they arrived at the airport terminal.","options":["wide","narrow","direct","scale"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: wide (張開地；完全地) 【全文中譯】當祖父母抵達機場航廈時，他張開雙臂熱情擁抱他們。 【選項解析】(A) wide 張開地 (B) narrow 狹窄的 (C) direct 直接的 (D) scale 磅秤。opened arms wide 為「張大雙臂」。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The architect doubled the ______ of the balcony so that residents could place outdoor tables and chairs comfortably.","options":["broadcast","address","width","scale"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: width (寬度) 【全文中譯】建築師將陽台的寬度增加了一倍，以便住戶可以舒適地放置戶外桌椅。 【選項解析】(A) broadcast 廣播 (B) address 地址 (C) width 寬度 (D) scale 磅秤。陽台側邊跨距為 width。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The mayor will ______ the city council tomorrow morning to discuss the annual education budget.","options":["broadcast","address","direct","scale"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: address (向…致詞；演說) 【全文中譯】市長明天上午將向市議會發表演說，討論年度教育預算。 【選項解析】(A) broadcast 廣播 (B) address 向…致詞 (C) direct 指導 (D) scale 攀登。address the council 表示「向議會發表演講」。"},{"number":25,"stem":"There is no ______ bus route connecting the two remote villages, so travelers have to change buses in the city.","options":["narrow","broad","direct","wide"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: direct (直達的) 【全文中譯】沒有直達公車路線連接這兩個偏遠村莊，因此旅客必須在城裡轉車。 【選項解析】(A) narrow 狹窄的 (B) broad 廣闊的 (C) direct 直達的 (D) wide 寬廣的。direct bus route 為「直達公車路線」。"}]},{"unit":64,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 64 (064.mp3) Topic Focus: Cardinal Directions, Entrances, Exits & Social Invitations","topic":"Topic Focus: Cardinal Directions, Entrances, Exits & Social Invitations | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"direction","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the course along which someone or something moves; instructions","chinese":"方向；指示","sentence":"The wind changed its ______ suddenly during the sailing race, so the crew had to adjust their main sail quickly.","translation":"在帆船比賽中風向突然改變，因此船員們必須迅速調整他們的主帆。"},{"word":"eastern","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"located in or facing toward the east","chinese":"東方的；東部的","sentence":"The ______ coast of Taiwan is renowned for its magnificent rocky cliffs and stunning Pacific Ocean sunrise views.","translation":"台灣東部海岸以其壯麗的岩石懸崖和令人驚嘆的太平洋日出景色而聞名遐邇。"},{"word":"western","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"located in or facing toward the west","chinese":"西方的；西部的","sentence":"In modern medicine, doctors often combine traditional herbal remedies with advanced ______ medical techniques.","translation":"在現代醫學中，醫生常將傳統草本療法與先進的西方醫療技術相互結合。"},{"word":"southern","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"located in or facing toward the south","chinese":"南方的；南部的","sentence":"Many retired couples choose to spend their winters in ______ California because the climate is warm and sunny.","translation":"許多退休夫婦選擇在加州南部度過冬天，因為當地的氣候溫暖而陽光明媚。"},{"word":"northern","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"located in or facing toward the north","chinese":"北方的；北部的","sentence":"The expedition team traveled across ______ Europe to study migratory arctic birds during their breeding season.","translation":"探險隊橫越北歐，以研究北極候鳥在繁殖季節期間的習性。"},{"word":"entrance","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an opening, such as a door or gate, through which one enters","chinese":"入口；門口","sentence":"Visitors must show their identification cards at the main ______ before entering the government building.","translation":"訪客在進入政府大樓之前，必須在主要入口處出示身分證件。"},{"word":"gate","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a hinged barrier used to close an opening in a wall or fence","chinese":"大門；出入口","sentence":"The school security guard locks the front iron ______ at seven in the evening, so late students must register.","translation":"學校警衛在晚上七點將前鐵大門鎖上，因此遲到的學生必須進行登記。"},{"word":"exit","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a passage or doorway by which one leaves; to depart","chinese":"出口；離開","sentence":"Every modern movie theater is equipped with clearly illuminated green ______ signs above all emergency doors.","translation":"每家現代電影院在所有緊急逃生門上方，都配備有清晰亮著的綠色出口標示。"},{"word":"invite","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to ask someone politely to come to an event or participate","chinese":"邀請","sentence":"Jenny plans to ______ all her close high school classmates to her eighteenth birthday dinner celebration.","translation":"珍妮計畫邀請她所有的高中摯友，參加她十八歲的生日晚餐慶祝活動。"},{"word":"invitation","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a written or verbal request inviting someone to attend an event","chinese":"邀請卡；請帖","sentence":"We received a formal printed wedding ______ in the mail yesterday, and we immediately sent our congratulations.","translation":"我們昨天在郵件中收到了正式印製的結婚請帖，並立即寄出了我們的祝賀。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"When driving through the thick fog, the lost driver was unable to determine the correct compass ______.","options":["entrance","gate","direction","exit"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: direction (方向) 【全文中譯】開車穿過濃霧時，迷路的司機無法確定正確的羅盤方向。 【選項解析】(A) entrance 入口 (B) gate 大門 (C) direction 方向 (D) exit 出口。羅盤指引的是 direction。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The train traveled along the ______ railway line, giving passengers spectacular views of the Pacific sun.","options":["western","eastern","southern","northern"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: eastern (東部的；東方的) 【全文中譯】火車沿著東部鐵路幹線行駛，讓乘客能夠欣賞太平洋日出的壯觀景色。 【選項解析】(A) western 西部的 (B) eastern 東部的 (C) southern 南部的 (D) northern 北部的。見到太平洋日出為台灣東部 eastern。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The university library preserves an extensive collection of ancient Chinese manuscripts and ______ philosophy books.","options":["eastern","western","northern","southern"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: western (西方的) 【全文中譯】大學圖書館保存了大量中國古代手稿與西方哲學書籍藏書。 【選項解析】(A) eastern 東方的 (B) western 西方的 (C) northern 北方的 (D) southern 南方的。與古代中國手稿對比者為西方哲學 western。"},{"number":4,"stem":"The agricultural valley in the ______ part of the country produces tropical fruits like bananas and mangoes.","options":["northern","eastern","southern","western"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: southern (南方的；南部的) 【全文中譯】該國南部的農業山谷生產香蕉和芒果等熱帶水果。 【選項解析】(A) northern 北部的 (B) eastern 東部的 (C) southern 南部的 (D) western 西部的。熱帶水果產地通常在南方 southern。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Winter temperatures in the ______ provinces frequently plummet below zero, bringing heavy snowstorms.","options":["southern","eastern","northern","western"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: northern (北方的；北部的) 【全文中譯】北部各省的冬季氣溫經常跌破零度，帶來嚴重的暴風雪。 【選項解析】(A) southern 南部的 (B) eastern 東部的 (C) northern 北部的 (D) western 西部的。嚴冬下暴雪位於北方 northern。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Security guards inspect all backpacks and handbags at the museum ______ to ensure public safety.","options":["entrance","direction","exit","invitation"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: entrance (入口；門口) 【全文中譯】警衛在博物館門口檢查所有背包和手提包，以確保公共安全。 【選項解析】(A) entrance 入口 (B) direction 方向 (C) exit 出口 (D) invitation 邀請。進館安檢設於 entrance。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The farmer closed the wooden ______ to prevent his cows and sheep from wandering onto the highway.","options":["direction","invitation","gate","entrance"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: gate (大門；柵欄門) 【全文中譯】農民關上了木大門，以防止他的牛羊漫遊到公路上。 【選項解析】(A) direction 方向 (B) invitation 邀請 (C) gate 大門 (D) entrance 入口。圍欄開關的柵門稱為 gate。"},{"number":8,"stem":"During the fire drill, teachers guided students to walk calmly toward the nearest emergency ______.","options":["direction","exit","gate","invitation"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: exit (出口) 【全文中譯】在消防演習期間，老師引導學生平靜地走向最近的緊急逃生出口。 【選項解析】(A) direction 方向 (B) exit 出口 (C) gate 大門 (D) invitation 請帖。緊急疏散門為 emergency exit。"},{"number":9,"stem":"We would like to ______ our neighbors over for a barbecue dinner in our backyard this Saturday evening.","options":["invite","direct","underline","address"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: invite (邀請) 【全文中譯】我們想邀請鄰居這個星期六晚上來我們後院享用烤肉晚餐。 【選項解析】(A) invite 邀請 (B) direct 引導 (C) underline 畫底線 (D) address 致詞。邀人共進晚餐用 invite。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Mother placed the gold-embossed ______ on the refrigerator door so that the family would not forget the anniversary party.","options":["direction","gate","entrance","invitation"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: invitation (請帖；邀請卡) 【全文中譯】母親將燙金請帖貼在冰箱門上，這樣全家人就不會忘記週年慶派對。 【選項解析】(A) direction 方向 (B) gate 大門 (C) entrance 入口 (D) invitation 邀請卡。宴會通知卡片為 invitation。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Always follow the medical ______ printed on the medicine bottle regarding daily dosage and meals.","options":["exits","directions","gates","invitations"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: directions (指示；說明書) 【全文中譯】請務必遵守藥瓶上印刷的關於每日劑量和進餐時間的用藥指示。 【選項解析】(A) exits 出口 (B) directions 指示 (C) gates 大門 (D) invitations 邀請。藥品使用說明為 directions。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The city of Hualien is located in ______ Taiwan, nestled peacefully between rugged mountains and the ocean.","options":["western","eastern","southern","northern"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: eastern (東部的) 【全文中譯】花蓮市位於台灣東部，寧靜地坐落在崎嶇群山與海洋之間。 【選項解析】(A) western 西部的 (B) eastern 東部的 (C) southern 南部的 (D) northern 北部的。花蓮地理位置為 eastern Taiwan。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Many international business executives have adopted ______ business etiquette when negotiating contracts.","options":["eastern","southern","western","northern"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: western (西方的) 【全文中譯】許多國際企業高階主管在洽談合約時，已經採納了西方商業禮儀。 【選項解析】(A) eastern 東方的 (B) southern 南方的 (C) western 西方的 (D) northern 北方的。國際商務禮儀常指 western etiquette。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The tropical typhoon moved rapidly across the ______ coastline, causing tidal surges in fishing harbors.","options":["northern","eastern","western","southern"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: southern (南部的) 【全文中譯】熱帶颱風迅速掠過南部海岸線，在各漁港引發了滔天巨浪。 【選項解析】(A) northern 北部的 (B) eastern 東部的 (C) western 西部的 (D) southern 南部的。南部海岸線為 southern coastline。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Polar bears roam across the freezing ______ regions of Canada and Norway in search of seals.","options":["southern","northern","eastern","western"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: northern (北方的；北極的) 【全文中譯】北極熊在加拿大和挪威寒冷的北部地區漫遊，尋找海豹充飢。 【選項解析】(A) southern 南部的 (B) northern 北部的 (C) eastern 東部的 (D) western 西部的。北極熊生活於 northern regions。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Ticket holders lined up early outside the stadium ______ before the rock concert began.","options":["direction","entrance","invitation","exit"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: entrance (入口) 【全文中譯】在搖滾演唱會開始前，持票者一大早就在體育場入口外排隊等候。 【選項解析】(A) direction 方向 (B) entrance 入口 (C) invitation 邀請 (D) exit 出口。進場排隊處為 stadium entrance。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Please wait for me outside the main school ______ after your afternoon English class finishes.","options":["gate","direction","invitation","exit"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: gate (校門；大門) 【全文中譯】下午英文課結束後，請在學校正門外等我。 【選項解析】(A) gate 大門 (B) direction 方向 (C) invitation 請帖 (D) exit 出口。學校門口為 school gate。"},{"number":18,"stem":"In case of an earthquake, stay calm and follow the illuminated green signs toward the building ______.","options":["direction","gate","entrance","exit"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: exit (安全出口) 【全文中譯】萬一發生地震，請保持冷靜並跟隨發光的綠色標誌走向建築物出口。 【選項解析】(A) direction 方向 (B) gate 大門 (C) entrance 入口 (D) exit 出口。逃生路線通往 building exit。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Did you ______ your homeroom teacher to attend the class graduation ceremony next week?","options":["direct","invite","broadcast","address"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: invite (邀請) 【全文中譯】你有邀請你們的班導師參加下週的班級畢業典禮嗎？ 【選項解析】(A) direct 指引 (B) invite 邀請 (C) broadcast 轉播 (D) address 致詞。邀人參加典禮用 invite。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The couple designed an elegant digital ______ and emailed it to all their friends around the world.","options":["entrance","exit","invitation","direction"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: invitation (電子請帖；邀請函) 【全文中譯】這對夫婦設計了一份精雅的電子請帖，並透過電子郵件寄給全球所有好友。 【選項解析】(A) entrance 入口 (B) exit 出口 (C) invitation 請帖 (D) direction 方向。寄發的電子請帖為 digital invitation。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The compass needle always points in a steady ______ toward magnetic north.","options":["direction","gate","exit","invitation"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: direction (方向) 【全文中譯】指南針的指針始終穩定地指向磁北方向。 【選項解析】(A) direction 方向 (B) gate 大門 (C) exit 出口 (D) invitation 請帖。針指著某個 direction。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The bullet train connects the busy cities along the ______ coast of the island within ninety minutes.","options":["northern","western","southern","eastern"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: western (西部的) 【全文中譯】高鐵在九十分鐘內串聯了這座島嶼西部海岸的繁華都市。 【選項解析】(A) northern 北部的 (B) western 西部的 (C) southern 南部的 (D) eastern 東部的。台灣高鐵貫穿西部 western coast。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The hotel provides a private ______ that leads hotel guests directly onto the white sandy beach.","options":["entrance","direction","invitation","exit"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: entrance (入口；通道) 【全文中譯】飯店提供了一處私人通道入口，引導房客直接通往白色沙灘。 【選項解析】(A) entrance 入口 (B) direction 方向 (C) invitation 請帖 (D) exit 出口。通往沙灘的入口為 private entrance。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The flight attendant announced that passengers seated near the emergency ______ should read the safety guide.","options":["invitation","direction","exit","gate"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: exit (出口) 【全文中譯】空服員宣布坐在緊急逃生出口附近的乘客應該詳細閱讀安全指南。 【選項解析】(A) invitation 請帖 (B) direction 方向 (C) exit 出口 (D) gate 大門。飛機逃生門為 emergency exit。"},{"number":25,"stem":"I received a warm ______ to speak at the international youth environmental conference in Singapore.","options":["direction","gate","exit","invitation"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: invitation (邀請) 【全文中譯】我收到了一份熱情的邀請，前往新加坡的國際青年環保大會上演講。 【選項解析】(A) direction 方向 (B) gate 大門 (C) exit 出口 (D) invitation 邀請。演講邀請為 warm invitation。"}]},{"unit":65,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 65 (065.mp3) Topic Focus: Law, Justice, Government Systems & Civil Society","topic":"Topic Focus: Law, Justice, Government Systems & Civil Society | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"far","pos":"(adj.) / (adv.)","definition":"at, to, or by a great distance in space or time","chinese":"遙遠的；遠地","sentence":"The isolated mountain cabin was situated on the ______ side of the wide valley, far away from city noise.","translation":"那座偏僻的山間小屋坐落在寬廣山谷遙遠的一側，遠離城市的喧囂。"},{"word":"distance","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the amount of space between two points or places","chinese":"距離","sentence":"When driving on the highway during heavy rain, drivers should always keep a safe ______ from the vehicle in front.","translation":"在大雨期間於高速公路上行駛時，駕駛人應始終與前車保持安全距離。"},{"word":"legal","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"permitted by law; relating to the law","chinese":"合法的；法律的","sentence":"Before signing any commercial contract, you should seek professional advice from an experienced ______ expert.","translation":"在簽署任何商業合約之前，你應該向經驗豐富的法律專家尋求專業建議。"},{"word":"crime","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an illegal action or activity for which a person can be punished","chinese":"罪行；犯罪","sentence":"The city police department launched an intensive public campaign to fight street ______ and protect local businesses.","translation":"市警局發起了一場密集的公眾宣傳運動，以打擊街頭犯罪並保護當地企業。"},{"word":"prison","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a building to which people are legally committed as a punishment for crimes","chinese":"監獄","sentence":"The convicted burglar was sentenced by the criminal court to five years in ______ for breaking into private residences.","translation":"這名被定罪的竊賊因闖入私人住宅，被刑事法院判處在監獄服刑五年。"},{"word":"democracy","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a system of government by the whole population, usually through elected representatives","chinese":"民主；民主政治","sentence":"In a healthy modern ______, citizens exercise their political power by participating freely in national elections.","translation":"在健全的現代民主制度中，公民藉由自由參與國家選舉來行使他們的政治權力。"},{"word":"government","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the governing body of a nation, state, or community","chinese":"政府","sentence":"President Lincoln once stated that true democracy is a ______ of the people, by the people, and for the people.","translation":"林肯總統曾表示，真正的民主乃是民有、民治、民享的政府。"},{"word":"kingdom","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a country, state, or territory ruled by a king or queen","chinese":"王國","sentence":"The ancient island ______ was ruled peacefully by a wise monarch who cared deeply about his people's welfare.","translation":"這個古老的島嶼王國由一位深切關懷人民福祉的賢明君主所和平統治。"},{"word":"organization","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an organized body of people with a particular purpose, such as a business or charity","chinese":"組織；機構","sentence":"Taiwan has been an active member of the World Trade ______ and continues to expand its international business partnerships.","translation":"台灣一直是世界貿易組織的活躍成員，並持續拓展其國際商業夥伴關係。"},{"word":"society","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the aggregate of people living together in a more or less ordered community","chinese":"社會","sentence":"Education plays a vital role in modern ______, helping young individuals become responsible and productive citizens.","translation":"教育在現代社會中扮演著至關重要的角色，幫助年輕個體成長為負責任且富有成效的公民。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"How ______ is it from your downtown office to the international airport by express subway?","options":["legal","far","social","crowded"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: far (遠的；遙遠地) 【全文中譯】從你市中心的辦公室搭捷運特快車到國際機場有多遠？ 【選項解析】(A) legal 合法的 (B) far 遠的 (C) social 社交的 (D) crowded 擁擠的。詢問距離用 How far。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The high-speed rail enables travelers to cross a ______ of three hundred kilometers in less than two hours.","options":["distance","kingdom","democracy","prison"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: distance (距離) 【全文中譯】高鐵使旅客能在不到兩小時內跨越三百公里的距離。 【選項解析】(A) distance 距離 (B) kingdom 王國 (C) democracy 民主 (D) prison 監獄。跨越三百公里指 a distance of 300 km。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Selling tobacco products or alcoholic drinks to minors under eighteen is strictly against the ______ regulations.","options":["far","legal","wide","broad"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: legal (合法的；法律的) 【全文中譯】向未滿十八歲的未成年人販售菸草製品或酒精飲料嚴格違反法律規定。 【選項解析】(A) far 遠的 (B) legal 法律的 (C) wide 寬的 (D) broad 寬廣的。legal regulations 為「法規」。"},{"number":4,"stem":"The newly elected mayor promised to increase police patrols in order to reduce violent ______ in the city center.","options":["society","organization","distance","crime"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: crime (犯罪；罪行) 【全文中譯】新當選的市長承諾增加警力巡邏，以減少市中心的街頭暴力犯罪。 【選項解析】(A) society 社會 (B) organization 組織 (C) distance 距離 (D) crime 犯罪。打擊暴力行為為 violent crime。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The dangerous robber was captured by armed police and sentenced to spend ten years in a maximum-security ______.","options":["democracy","prison","kingdom","government"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: prison (監獄) 【全文中譯】危險的強盜被武裝警察逮捕，並被判處在高度戒備的監獄中服刑十年。 【選項解析】(A) democracy 民主 (B) prison 監獄 (C) kingdom 王國 (D) government 政府。服刑收押場所為 prison。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Free speech and open public debate are considered the foundational pillars of any modern ______.","options":["distance","prison","democracy","crime"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: democracy (民主；民主政體) 【全文中譯】言論自由和公開的公眾辯論被認為是任何現代民主體制的立國基石。 【選項解析】(A) distance 距離 (B) prison 監獄 (C) democracy 民主政體 (D) crime 犯罪。言論自由體現於 democracy。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The central ______ approved a generous financial relief budget to help farmers affected by the typhoon.","options":["government","prison","distance","crime"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: government (政府) 【全文中譯】中央政府批准了慷慨的財政救濟預算，以幫助受颱風影響的農民。 【選項解析】(A) government 政府 (B) prison 監獄 (C) distance 距離 (D) crime 犯罪。中央執政機構為 central government。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The United Kingdom is a constitutional monarchy where the ruling monarch serves as the ceremonial head of the ______.","options":["democracy","distance","kingdom","crime"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: kingdom (王國) 【全文中譯】英國是一個君主立憲制國家，在位君主擔任該王國的禮儀性元首。 【選項解析】(A) democracy 民主 (B) distance 距離 (C) kingdom 王國 (D) crime 犯罪。United Kingdom 屬於王國 kingdom。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The United Nations is an international ______ dedicated to maintaining global peace and promoting human rights.","options":["prison","organization","distance","crime"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: organization (組織；機構) 【全文中譯】聯合國是一個致力於維護全球和平與促進人權的國際組織。 【選項解析】(A) prison 監獄 (B) organization 組織 (C) distance 距離 (D) crime 犯罪。國際機構稱為 international organization。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Rapid economic changes in modern ______ have created new employment opportunities as well as new social challenges.","options":["prison","distance","crime","society"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: society (社會) 【全文中譯】現代社會迅速的經濟變遷創造了新的就業機會，也帶來了新的社會挑戰。 【選項解析】(A) prison 監獄 (B) distance 距離 (C) crime 犯罪 (D) society 社會。人類共同生活群體為 modern society。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Although the historic temple looked near on the map, it was situated on the ______ side of the steep mountain.","options":["legal","far","direct","narrow"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: far (遠的；遠方的) 【全文中譯】雖然古老寺廟在地上看起來很近，但它坐落在陡峭高山遙遠的一側。 【選項解析】(A) legal 合法的 (B) far 遠方的 (C) direct 直達的 (D) narrow 狹窄的。the far side 表示「遠端那一側」。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Drivers should maintain an adequate stopping ______ on wet roads to avoid rear-end collisions.","options":["distance","crime","society","government"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: distance (距離) 【全文中譯】駕駛人應在濕滑路面上保持足夠的煞車距離，以避免追撞事故。 【選項解析】(A) distance 距離 (B) crime 犯罪 (C) society 社會 (D) government 政府。煞車安全間隔為 stopping distance。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The company hired a team of experienced ______ advisers to review the terms of the merger agreement.","options":["far","legal","equal","maximum"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: legal (法律的) 【全文中譯】該公司聘請了一支經驗豐富的法律顧問團隊，來審查合併協議條款。 【選項解析】(A) far 遠的 (B) legal 法律的 (C) equal 平等的 (D) maximum 最大的。法律顧問為 legal advisers。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Identity theft has become a widespread cyber ______ that affects millions of internet users every year.","options":["organization","kingdom","distance","crime"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: crime (犯罪) 【全文中譯】身分盜用已成為每年影響數百萬網路使用者的普遍網路犯罪。 【選項解析】(A) organization 組織 (B) kingdom 王國 (C) distance 距離 (D) crime 犯罪。違法侵害行為為 cyber crime。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Several non-violent offenders were released early from ______ after demonstrating good behavior during rehabilitation.","options":["democracy","prison","kingdom","distance"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: prison (監獄) 【全文中譯】幾名非暴力犯罪者在感化期間表現良好，因而獲得從監獄提前釋放。 【選項解析】(A) democracy 民主 (B) prison 監獄 (C) kingdom 王國 (D) distance 距離。獲釋出獄為 released from prison。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Without universal education and free press, it is difficult for a young nation to establish a stable ______.","options":["democracy","crime","prison","distance"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: democracy (民主政制) 【全文中譯】如果沒有普及教育和新聞自由，一個年輕的國家很難建立穩定的民主制度。 【選項解析】(A) democracy 民主 (B) crime 犯罪 (C) prison 監獄 (D) distance 距離。穩定政體指 stable democracy。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Local ______ agencies worked tirelessly overnight to restore electricity and clear debris from major avenues.","options":["government","distance","crime","kingdom"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: government (政府) 【全文中譯】地方政府機構徹夜不懈地工作，以恢復電力並清理主要幹道上的碎瓦雜物。 【選項解析】(A) government 政府 (B) distance 距離 (C) crime 犯罪 (D) kingdom 王國。公部門單位為 local government agencies。"},{"number":18,"stem":"In ancient fairy tales, the brave prince traveled across seven seas to rescue the enchanted ______.","options":["distance","kingdom","democracy","organization"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: kingdom (王國) 【全文中譯】在古代童話故事中，英勇的王子橫渡七大洋去拯救那個被施了魔法的王國。 【選項解析】(A) distance 距離 (B) kingdom 王國 (C) democracy 民主 (D) organization 組織。童話國度稱為 kingdom。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Red Cross is a humanitarian ______ that provides emergency medical relief during natural catastrophes.","options":["prison","organization","crime","distance"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: organization (機構；組織) 【全文中譯】紅十字會是一個在自然災害期間提供緊急醫療援助的人道組織。 【選項解析】(A) prison 監獄 (B) organization 組織 (C) crime 犯罪 (D) distance 距離。人道慈善團體為 humanitarian organization。"},{"number":20,"stem":"Every member of ______ shares a collective duty to protect natural ecosystems for future generations.","options":["distance","prison","crime","society"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: society (社會) 【全文中譯】社會的每位成員都肩負著共同的責任，為後代子孫保護自然生態系。 【選項解析】(A) distance 距離 (B) prison 監獄 (C) crime 犯罪 (D) society 社會。社會成員為 every member of society。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The lighthouse was located so ______ out at sea that we could only see its blinking light through binoculars.","options":["far","legal","direct","equal"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: far (遠地；遙遠) 【全文中譯】燈塔坐落在外海如此遙遠之處，以致於我們只能透過望遠鏡看到它閃爍的燈光。 【選項解析】(A) far 遙遠地 (B) legal 合法的 (C) direct 直接的 (D) equal 平等的。坐落遠方用 far out at sea。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The telescope allows astronomers to observe distant galaxies that are situated at an enormous ______ from Earth.","options":["crime","kingdom","distance","government"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: distance (距離) 【全文中譯】這架望遠鏡使天文學家能夠觀測距離地球極為遙遠的遙遠星系。 【選項解析】(A) crime 犯罪 (B) kingdom 王國 (C) distance 距離 (D) government 政府。巨大的距離為 an enormous distance。"},{"number":23,"stem":"You must obtain a ______ permit from the city planning department before building an extension to your house.","options":["far","legal","narrow","curved"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: legal (合法的；法定的) 【全文中譯】在擴建你的房屋之前，你必須先從市政府都市計畫部門取得合法許可證。 【選項解析】(A) far 遠的 (B) legal 合法的 (C) narrow 狹窄的 (D) curved 彎曲的。依法核准文件為 legal permit。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Neighborhood watch programs encourage residents to look out for suspicious behavior and prevent property ______.","options":["crime","distance","organization","kingdom"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: crime (犯罪) 【全文中譯】守望相助計畫鼓勵居民留意可疑行為，並預防財產犯罪。 【選項解析】(A) crime 犯罪 (B) distance 距離 (C) organization 組織 (D) kingdom 王國。侵犯財產之罪行為 property crime。"},{"number":25,"stem":"A charitable ______ was founded by local doctors to provide free medical checkups for low-income families.","options":["prison","democracy","kingdom","organization"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: organization (機構；組織) 【全文中譯】當地醫生創立了一個慈善機構，為低收入家庭提供免費健康檢查。 【選項解析】(A) prison 監獄 (B) democracy 民主 (C) kingdom 王國 (D) organization 組織。慈善機構為 charitable organization。"}]},{"unit":66,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 66 (066.mp3) Topic Focus: Civic Duties, Elections, Demographics & Public Crowds","topic":"Topic Focus: Civic Duties, Elections, Demographics & Public Crowds | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"social","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"relating to society, its organization, or companionship","chinese":"社會的；社交的","sentence":"Spending all day alone indoors is not healthy, so teenagers should participate in more outdoor ______ activities.","translation":"整天獨自待在室內對健康無益，因此青少年應該多參加戶外社交活動。"},{"word":"law","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the system of rules which a particular country or community recognizes","chinese":"法律；法規","sentence":"Citizens must obey the traffic ______ at all times, or they will face hefty fines and loss of driving licenses.","translation":"公民必須始終遵守交通法律，否則他們將面臨高額罰款與吊銷駕照的處分。"},{"word":"policy","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a course or principle of action adopted by a government or business","chinese":"政策；方針","sentence":"The ministry of education introduced a new bilingual education ______ to enhance high school students' global competence.","translation":"教育部推出了一項新的雙語教育政策，以提升高中學生的全球競爭力。"},{"word":"vote","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to express a choice in an election; a formal choice","chinese":"投票；選票","sentence":"Every eligible citizen over the age of twenty has the constitutional right to ______ in national presidential elections.","translation":"凡年滿二十歲的合格公民，均享有在國家總統大選中進行投票的憲法權利。"},{"word":"elect","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to choose someone for public office by voting","chinese":"選舉；推選","sentence":"The high school students will ______ their new student council president during the school assembly this Friday.","translation":"高中學生將於本週五的學校朝會上，推選出他們的新任學生會主席。"},{"word":"population","pos":"(n.)","definition":"all the inhabitants of a particular town, area, or country","chinese":"人口","sentence":"Tokyo has a massive metropolitan ______ of over fourteen million residents living within its urban borders.","translation":"東京擁有超過一千四百萬居民生活在其城市邊界內的龐大都市人口。"},{"word":"citizen","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a legally recognized subject or national of a state or commonwealth","chinese":"公民；市民","sentence":"As a responsible and proactive ______, Mr. Lin volunteers at the neighborhood community center every Saturday morning.","translation":"作為一名負責任且積極主動的公民，林先生每個星期六早晨都在鄰里社區中心擔任志工。"},{"word":"crowd","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a large number of people gathered together; to pack into","chinese":"人群；聚集","sentence":"A cheering ______ of thousands of enthusiastic music fans waited outside the concert stadium for their favorite band.","translation":"數千名熱情歡呼的音樂迷人群聚集在演唱會體育場外，等候著他們最喜愛的樂團。"},{"word":"crowded","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"full of people, leaving little or no room for movement","chinese":"擁擠的","sentence":"The downtown night market gets extremely ______ on holiday evenings, making it difficult to walk without bumping into people.","translation":"市中心的夜市在假日夜晚變得極為擁擠，使人難以行走而不撞到其他人。"},{"word":"jam","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a traffic blockage; a sweet fruit spread; to squeeze tightly","chinese":"交通堵塞；果醬；卡住","sentence":"We were stuck in a terrible highway traffic ______ for more than two hours due to an overturned delivery truck.","translation":"由於一輛翻覆的送貨卡車，我們在嚴重的高速公路交通堵塞中受困了兩個多小時。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Humans are naturally ______ animals that thrive when they share experiences with friends and families.","options":["crowded","social","straight","legal"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: social (社交的；群居的) 【全文中譯】人類本質上是群居社交動物，當與朋友和家人分享經歷時便能茁壯成長。 【選項解析】(A) crowded 擁擠的 (B) social 社交的；群居的 (C) straight 筆直的 (D) legal 合法的。social animals 指「群居動物」。"},{"number":2,"stem":"In order to maintain public safety, everyone in the community must respect and follow the ______.","options":["law","crowd","jam","vote"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: law (法律) 【全文中譯】為了維護公共安全，社區中的每個人都必須尊重並遵守法律。 【選項解析】(A) law 法律 (B) crowd 人群 (C) jam 阻塞 (D) vote 選票。遵守規範為 follow the law。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The airline announced a strict baggage ______ that limits carry-on luggage to one small backpack per passenger.","options":["crowd","policy","citizen","jam"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: policy (政策；規定) 【全文中譯】該航空公司宣布了一項嚴格的行李規定，限制每位乘客只能攜帶一個小型隨身背包。 【選項解析】(A) crowd 人群 (B) policy 政策；規定 (C) citizen 公民 (D) jam 果醬。規範條例為 baggage policy。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Millions of enthusiastic voters went to polling stations across the nation to cast their ______.","options":["crowd","vote","population","jam"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: vote (選票；投票) 【全文中譯】全國數百萬熱情的選民前往各投票站投下他們的選票。 【選項解析】(A) crowd 人群 (B) vote 選票 (C) population 人口 (D) jam 阻塞。cast their vote 表示「投下選票」。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The club members gathered in the auditorium to ______ a new chairperson for the upcoming academic year.","options":["vote","direct","elect","address"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: elect (選出；推選) 【全文中譯】社團成員聚集在禮堂裡，為即將到來的新學年選出一名新主席。 【選項解析】(A) vote 投票 (B) direct 引導 (C) elect 推選出 (D) address 致詞。推選人員出任職位用 elect。"},{"number":6,"stem":"With over twenty million people, this bustling metropolis has the largest ______ in the region.","options":["crowd","population","jam","law"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: population (人口) 【全文中譯】這座繁華的大都市擁有超過兩千萬人口，是該地區人口最多的城市。 【選項解析】(A) crowd 人群 (B) population 人口 (C) jam 阻塞 (D) law 法律。居民總數為 population。"},{"number":7,"stem":"After passing the comprehensive naturalization exam, Maria proudly became an official ______ of the nation.","options":["policy","crowd","citizen","jam"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: citizen (公民) 【全文中譯】在通過全面的入籍考試後，瑪麗亞自豪地成為該國的正式公民。 【選項解析】(A) policy 政策 (B) crowd 人群 (C) citizen 公民 (D) jam 交通堵塞。具法律地位身分者為 citizen。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The lead singer stepped onto the stage, and the enthusiastic ______ erupted in loud cheers and applause.","options":["law","crowd","jam","policy"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: crowd (人群) 【全文中譯】主唱走上舞台，熱情的人群爆發出響亮的歡呼與掌聲。 【選項解析】(A) law 法律 (B) crowd 人群 (C) jam 果醬 (D) policy 政策。聚集的熱情觀眾群為 crowd。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The subway train was so ______ during rush hour that passengers could hardly find space to stand comfortably.","options":["broad","crowded","direct","social"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: crowded (擁擠的) 【全文中譯】尖峰時間捷運列車非常擁擠，以至於乘客幾乎找不到可以舒適站立的空間。 【選項解析】(A) broad 寬廣的 (B) crowded 擁擠的 (C) direct 直達的 (D) social 社交的。車廂擠滿人為 crowded。"},{"number":10,"stem":"An unexpected construction project caused a massive traffic ______ along the main boulevard this morning.","options":["crowd","jam","citizen","policy"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: jam (交通堵塞) 【全文中譯】今天早上，一項意外的施工工程在主要林蔭大道上造成了嚴重的交通堵塞。 【選項解析】(A) crowd 人群 (B) jam 阻塞 (C) citizen 公民 (D) policy 政策。traffic jam 指「交通堵塞」。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Participating in team sports helps teenagers develop essential interpersonal and ______ communication skills.","options":["crowded","legal","social","narrow"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: social (社交的) 【全文中譯】參加團隊運動有助於青少年培養必要的人際關係與社交溝通技巧。 【選項解析】(A) crowded 擁擠的 (B) legal 法律的 (C) social 社交的 (D) narrow 狹窄的。人際往來為 social skills。"},{"number":12,"stem":"It is strictly against the ______ to park your vehicle in front of a fire hydrant at any time.","options":["law","crowd","jam","vote"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: law (法律) 【全文中譯】任何時候將車輛停在消防栓前都是嚴格違法的行為。 【選項解析】(A) law 法律 (B) crowd 人群 (C) jam 阻塞 (D) vote 選票。against the law 為「違法」。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The company introduced an environmentally friendly ______ aimed at reducing plastic waste across all branch offices.","options":["crowd","policy","citizen","jam"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: policy (政策) 【全文中譯】該公司推出了一項環保政策，旨在減少所有分公司辦公室的塑膠垃圾。 【選項解析】(A) crowd 人群 (B) policy 政策 (C) citizen 公民 (D) jam 果醬。企業方針為 environmentally friendly policy。"},{"number":14,"stem":"If you don't ______ on election day, you lose your opportunity to voice your opinion regarding public issues.","options":["elect","vote","direct","underline"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: vote (投票) 【全文中譯】如果你在選舉日不去投票，你就失去了就公共議題表達意見的機會。 【選項解析】(A) elect 推選 (B) vote 投票 (C) direct 引導 (D) underline 畫底線。行使表決權為 vote。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The citizens organized an assembly to ______ five community representatives to attend the town hall hearing.","options":["elect","vote","broadcast","address"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: elect (選出) 【全文中譯】市民組織了一次集會，選出五位社區代表參加市政廳公聽會。 【選項解析】(A) elect 選出 (B) vote 投票 (C) broadcast 廣播 (D) address 致詞。選拔代表為 elect representatives。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Because of improved healthcare and sanitation, the island's total ______ has doubled over the past fifty years.","options":["crowd","population","policy","jam"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: population (人口) 【全文中譯】由於醫療保健和環境衛生的改善，該島的總人口在過去五十年中增加了一倍。 【選項解析】(A) crowd 人群 (B) population 人口 (C) policy 政策 (D) jam 阻塞。總住民數量為 total population。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Every law-abiding ______ should pay taxes honestly and contribute positively to local community welfare.","options":["jam","policy","crowd","citizen"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: citizen (公民) 【全文中譯】每位守法的公民都應誠實納稅，並對當地社區福祉做出積極貢獻。 【選項解析】(A) jam 阻塞 (B) policy 政策 (C) crowd 人群 (D) citizen 公民。守法國民為 law-abiding citizen。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Security staff stepped forward to prevent the eager ______ from rushing onto the soccer field after the match.","options":["law","policy","crowd","jam"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: crowd (人群) 【全文中譯】維安人員上前阻止急切的人群在賽後衝進足球場。 【選項解析】(A) law 法律 (B) policy 政策 (C) crowd 人群 (D) jam 交通堵塞。激動的群眾為 eager crowd。"},{"number":19,"stem":"On Saturday afternoon, the shopping mall was completely ______ with families buying back-to-school supplies.","options":["narrow","crowded","social","legal"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: crowded (擠滿人的；擁擠的) 【全文中譯】週六下午，購物中心裡擠滿了採買開學用品的家庭。 【選項解析】(A) narrow 狹窄的 (B) crowded 擁擠的 (C) social 社交的 (D) legal 合法的。crowded with families 指擠滿家庭。"},{"number":20,"stem":"My mother spread homemade strawberry ______ over toasted bread slices and served them with hot black tea.","options":["jam","crowd","policy","law"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: jam (果醬) 【全文中譯】我母親將自製草莓果醬塗在烤麵包片上，並配上熱紅茶端給我們享用。 【選項解析】(A) jam 果醬 (B) crowd 人群 (C) policy 政策 (D) law 法律。strawberry jam 指草莓果醬。"},{"number":21,"stem":"In sociology class, we discussed how modern digital networks have transformed traditional ______ relationships.","options":["crowded","social","direct","equal"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: social (社交的；社會的) 【全文中譯】在社會學課上，我們討論了現代數位網路如何改變了傳統的社交關係。 【選項解析】(A) crowded 擁擠的 (B) social 社交的 (C) direct 直達的 (D) equal 平等的。人與人間關係為 social relationships。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Environmental protection ______ requires factories to install advanced filtration systems to clean toxic emissions.","options":["crowd","jam","law","citizen"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: law (法律) 【全文中譯】環境保護法要求工廠安裝先進的過濾系統，以淨化有毒排放物。 【選項解析】(A) crowd 人群 (B) jam 阻塞 (C) law 法律 (D) citizen 公民。法規為 environmental protection law。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The school board adopted a strict zero-tolerance ______ regarding bullying and harassment on campus.","options":["jam","crowd","policy","citizen"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: policy (政策；規定) 【全文中譯】學校董事會通過了一項針對校園霸凌和騷擾的嚴格零容忍政策。 【選項解析】(A) jam 阻塞 (B) crowd 人群 (C) policy 政策 (D) citizen 公民。零容忍規定為 zero-tolerance policy。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The legislative committee took a formal roll-call ______ before passing the historic healthcare reform bill.","options":["crowd","vote","jam","population"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: vote (表決；投票) 【全文中譯】立法委員會在通過具有歷史意義的醫療改革法案之前進行了正式唱名表決。 【選項解析】(A) crowd 人群 (B) vote 表決；投票 (C) jam 阻塞 (D) population 人口。唱名表決為 roll-call vote。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Rush hour commuting often turns the city center into a giant parking lot due to severe traffic ______.","options":["crowd","jams","policies","laws"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: jams (阻塞；塞車) 【全文中譯】尖峰時段的通勤往往由於嚴重的交通堵塞，使市中心變成一個巨大的停車場。 【選項解析】(A) crowd 人群 (B) jams 阻塞 (C) policies 政策 (D) laws 法律。traffic jams 指交通塞車。"}]},{"unit":67,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 67 (067.mp3) Topic Focus: Academic Review, Revision, Decision-Making & Interpersonal Attitudes","topic":"Topic Focus: Academic Review, Revision, Decision-Making & Interpersonal Attitudes | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"review","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to examine or study again; a formal assessment","chinese":"複習；審查；評論","sentence":"The teacher advised students to ______ chapter five thoroughly before taking the monthly English examination.","translation":"老師建議學生在參加每月英文測驗之前，徹底複習第五章。"},{"word":"revise","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to alter or edit something to make it better","chinese":"修訂；校訂","sentence":"The author spent two weeks to ______ her short story, making the ending much more dramatic and touching.","translation":"作者花了兩週時間修改她的小說，使結局更加戲劇化且感人。"},{"word":"improve","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to make or become better in quality or performance","chinese":"改進；提高","sentence":"If you practice writing short essays every evening, your English vocabulary and grammatical accuracy will certainly ______.","translation":"如果你每天晚上練習寫短文，你的英文詞彙量與文法準確性肯定會有所提升。"},{"word":"progress","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"forward movement toward a destination or goal","chinese":"進步；進展","sentence":"With patient guidance from his violin tutor, the young musician has made remarkable ______ this semester.","translation":"在小提琴家教的耐心指導下，這位年輕音樂家本學期取得了顯著的進步。"},{"word":"refuse","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to indicate that one is not willing to do something","chinese":"拒絕","sentence":"Although the salary was very attractive, Mr. Huang had to ______ the foreign job offer because his parents were sick.","translation":"儘管薪水非常誘人，黃先生不得不拒絕國外的工作邀請，因為他的雙親生病了。"},{"word":"reject","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to dismiss or refuse to agree to a proposal or idea","chinese":"駁回；摒棄","sentence":"The city planning board voted to ______ the controversial highway expansion proposal due to strong environmental concerns.","translation":"由於強烈的環境顧慮，城市規劃委員會投票否決了那項有爭議的公路擴建提案。"},{"word":"accept","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to consent to receive a thing offered; to agree to","chinese":"接受；贊同","sentence":"After considering all possible alternatives, the research committee decided to ______ the professor's innovative proposal.","translation":"在考量了所有可能的替代方案後，研究委員會決定採納教授創新的提案。"},{"word":"doubt","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a feeling of uncertainty or lack of conviction","chinese":"懷疑；不確定","sentence":"Because she has practiced rigorously every day, I have no ______ that she will pass the difficult piano certification.","translation":"因為她每天嚴格練習，我毫不懷疑她一定會通過那場難度極高的小提琴認證考試。"},{"word":"trust","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"firm belief in the reliability, truth, or ability of someone","chinese":"信任；信賴","sentence":"A lasting friendship must be built on mutual ______, honest communication, and deep shared respect.","translation":"持久的友誼必須建立在相互信任、坦誠溝通和深厚共同尊重的基礎之上。"},{"word":"respect","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a feeling of deep admiration for someone elicited by their abilities","chinese":"尊重；敬重","sentence":"Students should always show sincere ______ for their teachers and listen attentively during class discussions.","translation":"學生應始終對老師表示由衷的敬意，並在課堂討論中全神貫注地傾聽。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"You should ______ all your lecture notes tonight, for the midterm history exam will begin tomorrow morning.","options":["review","refuse","reject","doubt"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: review (複習；溫習) 【全文中譯】你今晚應該複習所有的課堂筆記，因為歷史期中考試將在明天早晨開始。 【選項解析】(A) review 複習 (B) refuse 拒絕 (C) reject 駁回 (D) doubt 懷疑。考前重溫知識用 review。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The editor asked the journalist to ______ the second paragraph to clarify the timeline of the accident.","options":["doubt","revise","refuse","trust"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: revise (修訂；修改) 【全文中譯】編輯請記者修改第二段，以釐清意外事故發生的時間表。 【選項解析】(A) doubt 懷疑 (B) revise 修改 (C) refuse 拒絕 (D) trust 信任。修改文章用 revise。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Regular physical exercise and healthy eating habits will greatly ______ your immune system and overall stamina.","options":["doubt","refuse","improve","reject"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: improve (增進；改善) 【全文中譯】規律的體能鍛鍊和健康的飲食習慣將極大改善你的免疫系統與整體耐力。 【選項解析】(A) doubt 懷疑 (B) refuse 拒絕 (C) improve 改善 (D) reject 摒棄。增強體質為 improve。"},{"number":4,"stem":"The construction company has made steady ______ on building the new library, and it will open next spring.","options":["review","progress","doubt","trust"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: progress (進展；進度) 【全文中譯】這家建築公司在建造新圖書館方面取得了穩步進展，新館將於明年春天開放。 【選項解析】(A) review 複習 (B) progress 進展 (C) doubt 懷疑 (D) trust 信任。make steady progress 指「取得穩定進展」。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The honest bank teller chose to ______ the illegal bribe offered by the corrupt businessman.","options":["review","revise","accept","refuse"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: refuse (拒絕) 【全文中譯】誠實的銀行行員選擇拒絕不良商人所提供的非法賄賂。 【選項解析】(A) review 審查 (B) revise 修訂 (C) accept 接受 (D) refuse 拒絕。不收賄賂為 refuse the bribe。"},{"number":6,"stem":"The editorial board decided to ______ the poorly written article because it contained multiple factual errors.","options":["accept","reject","improve","trust"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: reject (退件；駁回) 【全文中譯】編輯委員會決定退回這篇劣質文章，因為它包含多處事實錯誤。 【選項解析】(A) accept 接受 (B) reject 退件；駁回 (C) improve 改善 (D) trust 信任。退稿用 reject。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The young graduate was thrilled to ______ an internship position at the prestigious international technology firm.","options":["reject","refuse","accept","doubt"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: accept (接受) 【全文中譯】這位年輕畢業生興奮地接受了著名國際科技公司的實習職位。 【選項解析】(A) reject 駁回 (B) refuse 拒絕 (C) accept 接受 (D) doubt 懷疑。同意就職為 accept an internship。"},{"number":8,"stem":"There is little ______ that renewable clean energy will play a dominant role in our future power supply.","options":["review","doubt","progress","respect"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: doubt (懷疑) 【全文中譯】毫無疑問，再生清潔能源將在我們未來的電力供應中扮演主導角色。 【選項解析】(A) review 審查 (B) doubt 懷疑 (C) progress 進展 (D) respect 敬重。there is little doubt that 指「毫無疑問」。"},{"number":9,"stem":"In order to lead a successful project team, a manager must earn the ______ and confidence of all members.","options":["doubt","trust","progress","review"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: trust (信任) 【全文中譯】為了領導成功的專案團隊，經理必須贏得所有成員的信任與信心。 【選項解析】(A) doubt 懷疑 (B) trust 信任 (C) progress 進步 (D) review 審核。贏得信賴為 earn the trust。"},{"number":10,"stem":"We have great ______ for Dr. Wilson because he has dedicated his life to treating underprivileged patients.","options":["doubt","progress","respect","review"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: respect (敬重；敬佩) 【全文中譯】我們對威爾遜醫生懷有崇高敬意，因為他畢生致力於醫治弱勢病患。 【選項解析】(A) doubt 懷疑 (B) progress 進展 (C) respect 敬重 (D) review 複習。have great respect for 指「對…深感敬佩」。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Our class scheduled a group study session to ______ key mathematics formulas before the final test.","options":["refuse","reject","doubt","review"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: review (溫習；複習) 【全文中譯】我們班安排了一次小組研習會，以便在期末考前複習重點數學公式。 【選項解析】(A) refuse 拒絕 (B) reject 駁回 (C) doubt 懷疑 (D) review 溫習。考前看公式為 review formulas。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The committee asked the architect to ______ the blueprint to include wider wheelchair access ramps.","options":["revise","doubt","refuse","reject"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: revise (修改) 【全文中譯】委員會要求建築師修改藍圖，以納入更寬的輪椅無障礙坡道。 【選項解析】(A) revise 修改 (B) doubt 懷疑 (C) refuse 拒絕 (D) reject 否決。改動圖紙為 revise the blueprint。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Taking part in extracurricular club activities can help shy students ______ their public speaking skills.","options":["reject","improve","refuse","doubt"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: improve (增進；提昇) 【全文中譯】參加課外社團活動可以幫助害羞的學生提昇他們的公開演講技巧。 【選項解析】(A) reject 駁回 (B) improve 提昇 (C) refuse 拒絕 (D) doubt 懷疑。增長能力為 improve skills。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The doctor examined the recovering patient and noted that his health had made significant ______ over the week.","options":["review","doubt","progress","respect"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: progress (進步；好轉) 【全文中譯】醫生檢查了康復中的病人，並指出他這一週的健康狀況有了顯著進步。 【選項解析】(A) review 審核 (B) doubt 懷疑 (C) progress 進步 (D) respect 尊重。病情好轉為 made significant progress。"},{"number":15,"stem":"David had to ______ the invitation to the concert because he had already promised to babysit his nephew.","options":["accept","refuse","improve","revise"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: refuse (謝絕；拒絕) 【全文中譯】戴維不得不謝絕參加音樂會的邀請，因為他已經答應照顧他的姪子。 【選項解析】(A) accept 接受 (B) refuse 謝絕 (C) improve 改善 (D) revise 修訂。推辭邀約為 refuse the invitation。"},{"number":16,"stem":"The university admissions office will unfortunately ______ applications that arrive after the strict deadline.","options":["reject","accept","revise","improve"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: reject (拒絕受理；退回) 【全文中譯】大學招生辦公室將遺憾地拒絕受理在嚴格截止日期之後寄達的申請件。 【選項解析】(A) reject 拒絕受理 (B) accept 接受 (C) revise 修改 (D) improve 改善。逾期不收為 reject applications。"},{"number":17,"stem":"After careful deliberation, the employee decided to ______ the promotion, even though it required relocating abroad.","options":["refuse","reject","accept","doubt"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: accept (接受) 【全文中譯】經過深思熟慮，該員工決定接受晉升，即使這需要調動至國外。 【選項解析】(A) refuse 拒絕 (B) reject 駁回 (C) accept 接受 (D) doubt 懷疑。同意升遷為 accept the promotion。"},{"number":18,"stem":"I have serious ______ about whether the old wooden bridge can withstand the weight of loaded logging trucks.","options":["progress","respect","review","doubts"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: doubts (疑慮；懷疑) 【全文中譯】我對那座老舊木橋是否能承受滿載伐木卡車的重量存有嚴重的疑慮。 【選項解析】(A) progress 進步 (B) respect 敬重 (C) review 複習 (D) doubts 疑慮。存有懷疑為 have serious doubts。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Once you break someone's ______, it takes months or even years of consistent honesty to rebuild it.","options":["progress","trust","review","doubt"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: trust (信任) 【全文中譯】一旦你打破了某人的信任，需要長達數月甚至數年持續的誠實才能重建。 【選項解析】(A) progress 進步 (B) trust 信任 (C) review 審核 (D) doubt 懷疑。破壞信賴為 break someone's trust。"},{"number":20,"stem":"Professional athletes should always treat their opponents and game referees with sincere ______.","options":["respect","doubt","review","progress"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: respect (尊重) 【全文中譯】職業運動員應始終以由衷的敬意對待他們的對手和比賽裁判。 【選項解析】(A) respect 尊重 (B) doubt 懷疑 (C) review 複習 (D) progress 進步。體育精神尊重他人為 treat with sincere respect。"},{"number":21,"stem":"At the end of every semester, the principal holds a meeting to ______ the school's academic achievements.","options":["refuse","reject","review","doubt"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: review (檢討；審視) 【全文中譯】每學期末，校長都會召開會議檢視學校的各項學術成就。 【選項解析】(A) refuse 拒絕 (B) reject 駁回 (C) review 檢討；檢視 (D) doubt 懷疑。回顧成效為 review achievements。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The author was requested to ______ the draft of the textbook according to updated educational standards.","options":["doubt","revise","refuse","reject"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: revise (修訂) 【全文中譯】作者被要求根據最新的教育標準修訂教科書初稿。 【選項解析】(A) doubt 懷疑 (B) revise 修訂 (C) refuse 拒絕 (D) reject 駁回。修訂草稿為 revise the draft。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Investing in public transportation will drastically ______ urban air quality and reduce highway congestion.","options":["doubt","improve","refuse","reject"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: improve (改善) 【全文中譯】投資大眾運輸將大幅改善都市空氣品質並減少公路壅塞。 【選項解析】(A) doubt 懷疑 (B) improve 改善 (C) refuse 拒絕 (D) reject 否決。提升空氣品質為 improve air quality。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The town council expressed strong ______ regarding the chemical company's safety record near the drinking water reservoir.","options":["progress","review","respect","doubts"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: doubts (疑慮) 【全文中譯】鎮議會對這家化學公司在飲用水水庫附近的安全記錄表達了強烈疑慮。 【選項解析】(A) progress 進展 (B) review 複習 (C) respect 敬重 (D) doubts 疑慮。express strong doubts 表示「表達強烈疑慮」。"},{"number":25,"stem":"True friends always ______ each other's opinions, even when they disagree on certain political matters.","options":["respect","doubt","refuse","reject"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: respect (尊重) 【全文中譯】真正的朋友總是尊重彼此的觀點，即使他們在某些政治議題上意見相左。 【選項解析】(A) respect 尊重 (B) doubt 懷疑 (C) refuse 拒絕 (D) reject 駁回。尊重觀點為 respect each other's opinions。"}]},{"unit":68,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 68 (068.mp3) Topic Focus: Vocal Expressions, Regret, Apologies, Crimes & Harmful Actions","topic":"Topic Focus: Vocal Expressions, Regret, Apologies, Crimes & Harmful Actions | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"bark","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"the loud harsh cry of a dog; to make this sound","chinese":"狗叫；吠叫","sentence":"The guard dog began to ______ fiercely at the front gate when an unfamiliar stranger approached the yard.","translation":"當一位陌生的外人走近院子時，警衛犬開始在前門兇猛地吠叫。"},{"word":"shout","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to utter a loud cry or call; a loud cry","chinese":"大喊；呼喊","sentence":"When the fire broke out in the basement, the neighbors began to ______ loudly to warn everyone inside.","translation":"當地下室起火時，鄰居們開始大聲呼喊以警告裡面的所有人。"},{"word":"blame","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to hold responsible for a fault or wrong; responsibility","chinese":"責怪；歸咎","sentence":"You should not ______ your little sister for breaking the ceramic cup, because it was an accident.","translation":"你不應該責怪你年幼的妹妹打破了陶瓷杯，因為那純粹是一場意外。"},{"word":"regret (regret / regretted / regretted)","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to feel sorry about something that occurred","chinese":"後悔；遺憾","sentence":"If you spend all your money on video games now, you will definitely ______ it when you need to buy textbooks.","translation":"如果你現在把所有的錢都花在電玩遊戲上，當你需要買教科書時你肯定會後悔。"},{"word":"apologize","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to express regret for something that one has done wrong","chinese":"道歉","sentence":"The polite young gentleman walked over to ______ sincerely to the lady for spilling cold tea on her coat.","translation":"這位有禮貌的年輕紳士走上前去，真誠地向那位女士道歉，因為他不小心把冰茶潑到了她的外套上。"},{"word":"satisfy","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to meet the expectations, needs, or desires of someone","chinese":"使滿意；滿足","sentence":"It is almost impossible to ______ greedy individuals because they always demand more than they actually need.","translation":"要滿足貪婪的人幾乎是不可能的，因為他們索取的總是遠多於他們實際所需。"},{"word":"rob (rob / robbed / robbed)","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to take property unlawfully from a person or place by force","chinese":"搶劫","sentence":"Two masked criminals attempted to ______ the neighborhood convenience store late at night, but the police arrived quickly.","translation":"兩名戴面具的罪犯企圖在深夜搶劫社區便利商店，但警察迅速趕到了現場。"},{"word":"steal (steal / stole / stolen)","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to take another person's property without permission","chinese":"偷竊","sentence":"The cunning thief managed to ______ a diamond necklace from the jewelry shop without setting off the alarm.","translation":"這名狡猾的竊賊設法從珠寶店偷走了一條鑽石項鍊，而沒有觸動警報器。"},{"word":"waste","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to use or expend carelessly or to no purpose","chinese":"浪費；廢棄物","sentence":"Please turn off the water faucet while brushing your teeth, and do not ______ precious drinking water.","translation":"刷牙時請關閉水龍頭，不要浪費寶貴的飲用水資源。"},{"word":"ruin","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to destroy, damage severely, or spoil something completely","chinese":"毀滅；毀壞","sentence":"The unexpected heavy downpour threatened to ______ our outdoor wedding ceremony, so we moved all the chairs inside.","translation":"這場突如其來的傾盆大雨險些毀了我們的戶外婚禮儀式，所以我們把所有椅子都搬到了室內。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Whenever the mail carrier rides his motorcycle near our gate, our brown puppy runs outside and begins to ______.","options":["bark","rob","steal","ruin"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: bark (狗叫；吠叫) 【全文中譯】每當郵差騎機車靠近我們大門時，我們的棕色小狗就會跑出去並開始吠叫。 【選項解析】(A) bark 吠叫 (B) rob 搶劫 (C) steal 偷竊 (D) ruin 毀壞。小狗叫用 bark。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The music in the nightclub was so deafening that customers had to ______ at each other to be heard.","options":["waste","shout","blame","satisfy"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: shout (大喊；大叫) 【全文中譯】夜店裡的音樂震耳欲聾，顧客們不得不對著彼此大喊才能被聽見。 【選項解析】(A) waste 浪費 (B) shout 大喊 (C) blame 責怪 (D) satisfy 滿足。噪音環境中說話用 shout。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Instead of trying to ______ others for the business failure, the manager took full responsibility for the mistake.","options":["satisfy","regret","blame","ruin"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: blame (責怪；歸咎) 【全文中譯】這位經理沒有把商業失敗歸咎於他人，而是對該錯誤承擔了全部責任。 【選項解析】(A) satisfy 滿足 (B) regret 後悔 (C) blame 歸咎 (D) ruin 毀掉。blame others 指「責怪他人」。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Many elderly people look back on their youth and deeply ______ not studying foreign languages while in school.","options":["rob","regret","bark","steal"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: regret (後悔；遺憾) 【全文中譯】許多長者回顧他們的青春歲月，深感遺憾在校期間沒有好好學習外語。 【選項解析】(A) rob 搶劫 (B) regret 後悔 (C) bark 吠叫 (D) steal 偷竊。regret not doing 表示「後悔沒做某事」。"},{"number":5,"stem":"If you accidentally step on someone's foot on a crowded subway, you should immediately ______.","options":["apologize","shout","steal","rob"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: apologize (道歉) 【全文中譯】如果你在擁擠的捷運上不小心踩到了別人的腳，你應該立即道歉。 【選項解析】(A) apologize 道歉 (B) shout 大喊 (C) steal 偷竊 (D) rob 搶劫。失禮時應 apologize。"},{"number":6,"stem":"The luxury resort offers delicious buffets and spacious swimming pools designed to ______ every holiday guest.","options":["ruin","waste","satisfy","bark"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: satisfy (滿足；使滿意) 【全文中譯】這家豪華度假村提供美味的自助餐和寬敞的泳池，旨在滿足每位度假賓客的需求。 【選項解析】(A) ruin 毀滅 (B) waste 浪費 (C) satisfy 滿足 (D) bark 叫。satisfy guests 指「使賓客滿意」。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The armed bandits planned to ______ the gold delivery van as it drove through the lonely mountain tunnel.","options":["apologize","regret","rob","shout"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: rob (搶劫) 【全文中譯】這夥持械強盜企圖在運金貨車駛過僻靜的山間隧道時實施搶劫。 【選項解析】(A) apologize 道歉 (B) regret 後悔 (C) rob 搶劫 (D) shout 呼喊。強行掠奪車輛為 rob the van。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The security guard saw a suspicious teenager try to ______ a leather wallet from a customer's open backpack.","options":["bark","steal","blame","satisfy"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: steal (偷竊) 【全文中譯】警衛看到一名可疑的青少年企圖從顧客敞開的背包中偷走一個皮夾。 【選項解析】(A) bark 吠叫 (B) steal 偷竊 (C) blame 責怪 (D) satisfy 滿足。暗中竊取財物用 steal。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Spending hours browsing social media on your smartphone without studying is an unfortunate ______ of precious time.","options":["shout","bark","waste","blame"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: waste (浪費) 【全文中譯】花好幾個小時在智慧型手機上瀏覽社群媒體而不讀書，是對寶貴時間的一種遺憾浪費。 【選項解析】(A) shout 大喊 (B) bark 吠叫 (C) waste 浪費 (D) blame 責備。a waste of time 指「浪費時間」。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Spilling black coffee across the official contract will completely ______ the document, so be very careful.","options":["apologize","satisfy","regret","ruin"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: ruin (毀壞；弄糟) 【全文中譯】把黑咖啡潑在正式合約上會徹底毀了這份文件，所以要非常小心。 【選項解析】(A) apologize 道歉 (B) satisfy 滿足 (C) regret 遺憾 (D) ruin 毀壞。破壞物品完整用 ruin。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Hearing the stray dog ______ aggressively in the alley made the little children stop and turn around.","options":["bark","steal","waste","rob"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: bark (狂吠；叫) 【全文中譯】聽到巷子裡流浪狗攻擊性地狂吠，讓小孩子們停下腳步並轉身折返。 【選項解析】(A) bark 吠叫 (B) steal 偷竊 (C) waste 浪費 (D) rob 搶劫。狗叫用 bark。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The coach had to ______ across the soccer field because the strong wind carried his voice away.","options":["blame","shout","regret","ruin"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: shout (大喊) 【全文中譯】教練不得不對著整個足球場大喊，因為強風把他的聲音吹散了。 【選項解析】(A) blame 責備 (B) shout 大喊 (C) regret 遺憾 (D) ruin 毀壞。遠距離傳話用 shout。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Don't ______ the weather for your poor grades when you didn't spend enough time reading your textbooks.","options":["satisfy","rob","blame","apologize"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: blame (歸咎；責怪) 【全文中譯】當你沒有花足夠的時間閱讀教科書時，不要把成績差歸咎於天氣。 【選項解析】(A) satisfy 滿足 (B) rob 搶劫 (C) blame 歸咎 (D) apologize 道歉。推卸責任用 blame。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Mr. Davis has lived an honest life and stated that he had no major ______ about his career choices.","options":["shouts","barks","regrets","wastes"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: regrets (遺憾；後悔) 【全文中譯】戴維斯先生過著光明磊落的生活，並表示他對自己的職業選擇沒有重大遺憾。 【選項解析】(A) shouts 叫喊 (B) barks 吠叫 (C) regrets 遺憾 (D) wastes 浪費。have no regrets 指「沒有遺憾」。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The airline representative stepped forward to ______ for the four-hour flight delay caused by mechanical issues.","options":["apologize","steal","rob","ruin"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: apologize (道歉) 【全文中譯】航空公司代表上前為機械問題導致的四小時航班延誤致歉。 【選項解析】(A) apologize 致歉 (B) steal 偷 (C) rob 搶劫 (D) ruin 毀滅。向旅客致歉為 apologize。"},{"number":16,"stem":"A cold glass of fresh watermelon juice on a scorching summer afternoon will certainly ______ your thirst.","options":["waste","blame","satisfy","shout"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: satisfy (消除；滿足) 【全文中譯】在炎炎夏日午後喝上一杯冰涼的新鮮西瓜汁，肯定能消除你的乾渴。 【選項解析】(A) waste 浪費 (B) blame 責備 (C) satisfy 解渴；滿足 (D) shout 呼叫。satisfy one's thirst 指「解渴」。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Two masked suspects were arrested by detectives after attempting to ______ a downtown jewelry store.","options":["apologize","rob","regret","bark"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: rob (搶劫) 【全文中譯】兩名蒙面嫌犯在企圖搶劫市中心一家珠寶店後，被刑警逮捕。 【選項解析】(A) apologize 道歉 (B) rob 搶劫 (C) regret 後悔 (D) bark 叫。暴力搶劫商店為 rob a store。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Somebody managed to ______ my bicycle from outside the library while I was studying in the reading room.","options":["steal","bark","blame","satisfy"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: steal (偷走) 【全文中譯】當我在閱覽室讀書時，有人設法從圖書館外偷走了我的自行車。 【選項解析】(A) steal 偷走 (B) bark 吠叫 (C) blame 責怪 (D) satisfy 滿足。竊取腳踏車為 steal my bicycle。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Leaving the air conditioner running when nobody is at home will ______ an enormous amount of electricity.","options":["shout","waste","apologize","rob"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: waste (浪費) 【全文中譯】家裡沒人時開著冷氣會浪費大量的電力。 【選項解析】(A) shout 叫喊 (B) waste 浪費 (C) apologize 道歉 (D) rob 搶劫。虛耗能源為 waste electricity。"},{"number":20,"stem":"Careless rumors and untrue gossip can easily ______ an innocent person's reputation within the community.","options":["satisfy","apologize","ruin","bark"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: ruin (毀掉；破壞) 【全文中譯】粗心的謠言和不真實的八卦很容易毀掉一個無辜者在社區中的名譽。 【選項解析】(A) satisfy 滿足 (B) apologize 道歉 (C) ruin 毀掉 (D) bark 吠叫。敗壞名譽為 ruin reputation。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The watchdog started to ______ the moment the delivery worker stepped onto the front driveway.","options":["bark","rob","steal","waste"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: bark (吠叫) 【全文中譯】送貨員踏上前車道的那一刻，看門狗就開始吠叫了。 【選項解析】(A) bark 吠叫 (B) rob 搶劫 (C) steal 偷 (D) waste 浪費。看門犬鳴吠為 bark。"},{"number":22,"stem":"When Tommy got separated from his mother in the supermarket, he began to cry and ______ her name.","options":["shout","blame","regret","satisfy"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: shout (呼喊) 【全文中譯】湯米在超市與母親走散時，他開始哭泣並大聲呼喊母親的名字。 【選項解析】(A) shout 呼喊 (B) blame 責備 (C) regret 遺憾 (D) satisfy 滿足。大聲叫名字為 shout her name。"},{"number":23,"stem":"It is unfair to place all the ______ on the goalkeeper when the whole team played poorly during the game.","options":["shout","blame","waste","bark"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: blame (責難；責任) 【全文中譯】當整支球隊在比賽中表現都很差時，把所有的責難都推到守門員身上是不公平的。 【選項解析】(A) shout 叫喊 (B) blame 責難 (C) waste 浪費 (D) bark 狗叫。承擔過錯為 place the blame on。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The bank cashier pressed the silent panic button when the criminal threatened to ______ the teller counter.","options":["apologize","regret","satisfy","rob"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: rob (搶劫) 【全文中譯】當歹徒威脅要搶劫出納櫃台時，銀行出納員按下了無聲緊急報警按鈕。 【選項解析】(A) apologize 道歉 (B) regret 後悔 (C) satisfy 滿足 (D) rob 搶劫。搶劫銀行櫃台為 rob the counter。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Moisture and mold will ______ the antique paper manuscripts if they are not stored in a dry room.","options":["ruin","apologize","blame","shout"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: ruin (毀損；破壞) 【全文中譯】如果不將古董紙質手稿保存在乾燥的房間裡，潮氣和黴菌將會毀了它們。 【選項解析】(A) ruin 毀損 (B) apologize 道歉 (C) blame 責怪 (D) shout 叫喊。損壞文物為 ruin manuscripts。"}]},{"unit":69,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 69 (069.mp3) Topic Focus: Theatrical Performance, Social Behavior, Damage & Story Structure","topic":"Topic Focus: Theatrical Performance, Social Behavior, Damage & Story Structure | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"damage","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"physical harm caused to something; to inflict harm","chinese":"損害；毀壞","sentence":"The severe summer typhoon caused extensive ______ to local fruit orchards, destroying thousands of mango trees.","translation":"這場強烈的夏季颱風對當地的果園造成了廣泛的損害，摧毀了數千棵芒果樹。"},{"word":"behave","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to act or conduct oneself in a specified way","chinese":"表現；守規矩","sentence":"The teacher reminded the primary school students to ______ politely during their annual field trip to the science museum.","translation":"老師提醒小學生在參觀科學博物館的年度校外教學期間，要表現得彬彬有禮。"},{"word":"act","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to take action; to perform in a play; a deed","chinese":"行動；演戲；行為","sentence":"The young firefighter was awarded a medal for his selfless ______ of courage in rescuing children from the blazing building.","translation":"這位年輕消防員因其從燃燒的大樓中救出兒童的無私英勇行為，被授予了一枚勳章。"},{"word":"action","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the process of doing something, typically to achieve an aim","chinese":"行動；動作","sentence":"A popular English proverb wisely states that ______ speaks louder than words when demonstrating genuine commitment.","translation":"一則著名的英語諺語明智地指出，在展現真正的承諾時，行動勝於空談。"},{"word":"role","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an actor's part in a play; the function assumed by someone","chinese":"角色；作用","sentence":"Parents play an essential ______ in shaping their children's moral character, personal values, and study habits.","translation":"父母在塑造子女的道德品格、個人價值觀與學習習慣方面，扮演著至關重要的角色。"},{"word":"stage","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a raised floor or platform on which actors perform","chinese":"舞台；階段","sentence":"The talented young pianist walked confidently across the wooden ______ and bowed politely to the waiting audience.","translation":"這位才華洋溢的年輕鋼琴家自信地走過木製舞台，並禮貌地向等待的觀眾鞠躬致意。"},{"word":"audience","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the assembled spectators or listeners at a public event","chinese":"觀眾；聽眾","sentence":"At the conclusion of the thrilling theatrical drama, the entire ______ stood up and gave the actors a standing ovation.","translation":"在這齣扣人心弦的話劇結尾，全體觀眾起立為演員們起立鼓掌。"},{"word":"beginning","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the point in time or space at which something starts","chinese":"開始；起初","sentence":"For the young university graduate, moving to this new city marked the exciting ______ of an independent career.","translation":"對這位年輕的大學畢業生而言，搬到這座新城市標誌著一段獨立職業生涯的令人興奮的開始。"},{"word":"end","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"the final part of something; to terminate","chinese":"結束；末端","sentence":"The championship soccer match remained scoreless until the very ______ of the second half, when a striker scored.","translation":"這場足球冠軍賽一直未分勝負，直到下半場即將結束之際，一名前鋒攻進了一球。"},{"word":"pause","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"a temporary stop in action or speech; to stop briefly","chinese":"暫停；停頓","sentence":"The eloquent speaker made a dramatic ______ before revealing the final conclusion of his environmental research.","translation":"這位雄辯的演講者在透露其環境研究的最終結論之前，戲劇性地停頓了一下。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The earthquake shook the old brick building violently, but fortunately it caused no structural ______.","options":["damage","stage","audience","beginning"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: damage (損害；破壞) 【全文中譯】地震劇烈搖晃了老磚房，但幸運的是並未造成任何結構性損壞。 【選項解析】(A) damage 損害 (B) stage 舞台 (C) audience 觀眾 (D) beginning 開始。structural damage 指結構性損害。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Parents always expect their teenagers to ______ maturely and responsibly when attending social gatherings.","options":["damage","act","behave","pause"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: behave (表現；舉止得體) 【全文中譯】父母總是期望青少年在參加社交聚會時能表現得成熟且負責任。 【選項解析】(A) damage 損害 (B) act 行動 (C) behave 舉止得體 (D) pause 停頓。舉止合宜為 behave maturely。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The police officer received a commendation for his heroic ______ of jumping into the freezing river to save a child.","options":["act","stage","audience","beginning"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: act (行為；舉動) 【全文中譯】這名警官因跳入冰冷的河中救出孩童的無私英勇舉動而受到嘉獎。 【選項解析】(A) act 行為 (B) stage 舞台 (C) audience 觀眾 (D) beginning 開始。英勇行為為 heroic act。"},{"number":4,"stem":"If we want to reduce global plastic pollution, governments and corporations must take immediate ______.","options":["stage","role","action","beginning"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: action (行動) 【全文中譯】如果我們想要減少全球塑膠污染，各國政府與企業必須採取立即行動。 【選項解析】(A) stage 舞台 (B) role 角色 (C) action 行動 (D) beginning 開始。take immediate action 為固定搭配「採取立即行動」。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Mr. Harrison was chosen to play the leading ______ of the wise king in the community theater production.","options":["audience","role","beginning","damage"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: role (角色) 【全文中譯】哈里森先生被選中在社區劇團的演出中飾演賢明君王的主角角色。 【選項解析】(A) audience 觀眾 (B) role 角色 (C) beginning 開始 (D) damage 損害。戲劇角色為 leading role。"},{"number":6,"stem":"When the curtain rose, the lighting technicians illuminated the center of the dark theater ______.","options":["audience","damage","stage","action"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: stage (舞台) 【全文中譯】當布幕升起時，燈光技術人員照亮了黑暗劇院舞台的中央。 【選項解析】(A) audience 觀眾 (B) damage 損害 (C) stage 舞台 (D) action 行動。表演場地為 theater stage。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The comedian told a hilarious joke about air travel, causing the entire ______ to burst into loud laughter.","options":["damage","stage","role","audience"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: audience (觀眾；聽眾) 【全文中譯】這位喜劇演員講了一個關於空中旅行的搞笑笑話，逗得全場觀眾哈哈大笑。 【選項解析】(A) damage 損害 (B) stage 舞台 (C) role 角色 (D) audience 觀眾。欣賞喜劇表演的群體為 audience。"},{"number":8,"stem":"In the very ______ of the mystery novel, a wealthy businessman is found missing from his locked bedroom.","options":["stage","damage","audience","beginning"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: beginning (開端；起初) 【全文中譯】在這本懸疑小說的一開始，一名富有商人就被發現從反鎖的臥室中失蹤了。 【選項解析】(A) stage 舞台 (B) damage 損害 (C) audience 觀眾 (D) beginning 開端。小說起始部分為 in the very beginning。"},{"number":9,"stem":"We stayed in the cinema until the very ______ of the movie to watch all the behind-the-scenes clips.","options":["end","damage","role","stage"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: end (結尾；結束) 【全文中譯】我們一直留在電影院裡直到影片結束，觀看所有的幕後花絮片段。 【選項解析】(A) end 結束 (B) damage 損害 (C) role 角色 (D) stage 舞台。電影結束為 the very end of the movie。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Before answering the tricky legal question, the lawyer decided to ______ and organize his thoughts.","options":["act","behave","pause","damage"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: pause (暫停；停頓) 【全文中譯】在回答這個棘手的法律問題之前，律師決定停頓一下以整理思緒。 【選項解析】(A) act 行動 (B) behave 表現 (C) pause 停頓 (D) damage 損害。說話片刻停頓用 pause。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Strong ocean waves can inflict serious ______ on coastal seawalls during intense tropical storms.","options":["damage","audience","role","stage"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: damage (破壞；損害) 【全文中譯】強烈海浪在強烈熱帶風暴期間會對沿海海堤造成嚴重破壞。 【選項解析】(A) damage 損害 (B) audience 觀眾 (C) role 角色 (D) stage 舞台。造成破壞為 inflict serious damage。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The mother praised her little son because he ______ so politely while visiting his grandmother.","options":["damaged","paused","behaved","acted"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: behaved (守規矩；表現良好) 【全文中譯】母親稱讚她的小兒子，因為他在拜訪祖母時表現得非常有禮貌。 【選項解析】(A) damaged 損壞 (B) paused 暫停 (C) behaved 表現得體 (D) acted 行為。孩子乖巧有禮為 behaved politely。"},{"number":13,"stem":"It was an inspiring ______ of generosity when the anonymous donor provided computers to rural schools.","options":["audience","stage","role","act"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: act (行為；義舉) 【全文中譯】當這位匿名捐贈者為偏遠學校提供電腦時，這是一項令人感動的慷慨義舉。 【選項解析】(A) audience 觀眾 (B) stage 舞台 (C) role 角色 (D) act 行為；義舉。慷慨行為為 act of generosity。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Effective environmental policies require collective civic ______ rather than empty promises from politicians.","options":["action","stage","role","beginning"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: action (行動) 【全文中譯】有效的環境政策需要公眾集體的實際行動，而非政客空洞的承諾。 【選項解析】(A) action 行動 (B) stage 舞台 (C) role 角色 (D) beginning 開始。集體行動為 collective civic action。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Technology continues to play an increasingly important ______ in modern agricultural production and distribution.","options":["damage","role","audience","stage"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: role (作用；角色) 【全文中譯】科技在現代農業生產與配送中持續扮演著日益重要的角色。 【選項解析】(A) damage 損害 (B) role 角色；作用 (C) audience 觀眾 (D) stage 舞台。play an important role 指「扮演重要角色」。"},{"number":16,"stem":"The rock band walked out onto the floodlit ______ and greeted twenty thousand cheering fans.","options":["role","audience","stage","action"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: stage (舞台) 【全文中譯】搖滾樂團走上燈火輝煌的舞台，向兩萬名歡呼的歌迷致意。 【選項解析】(A) role 角色 (B) audience 觀眾 (C) stage 舞台 (D) action 行動。表演舞台為 stage。"},{"number":17,"stem":"A captivated ______ of parents and teachers listened attentively to the children's choir performance.","options":["damage","audience","stage","role"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: audience (聽眾；觀眾) 【全文中譯】一群全神貫注的家長與老師聽眾，專注地聆聽兒童合唱團的演出。 【選項解析】(A) damage 損害 (B) audience 聽眾 (C) stage 舞台 (D) role 角色。聆聽音樂會者為 audience。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Learning basic vocabulary is just the ______ of your exciting journey toward mastering the English language.","options":["beginning","damage","stage","audience"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: beginning (開端；起步) 【全文中譯】學習基礎單字只是你精通英語這段令人興奮旅程的開始而已。 【選項解析】(A) beginning 開端 (B) damage 損害 (C) stage 舞台 (D) audience 觀眾。旅程起點為 beginning。"},{"number":19,"stem":"At the ______ of the long presentation, the speaker invited questions from everyone in the meeting room.","options":["role","damage","end","audience"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: end (尾聲；末了) 【全文中譯】在漫長演報的尾聲，主講人邀請會議室裡的每個人提問。 【選項解析】(A) role 角色 (B) damage 損害 (C) end 末了 (D) audience 觀眾。簡報結束時為 at the end of the presentation。"},{"number":20,"stem":"While reading the poem aloud, you should ______ slightly after every comma to create a pleasant rhythm.","options":["behave","pause","damage","act"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pause (停頓) 【全文中譯】朗讀這首詩時，你應該在每個逗號後稍作停頓，以創造優美的節奏。 【選項解析】(A) behave 表現 (B) pause 停頓 (C) damage 損害 (D) act 行動。朗讀時短暫歇止為 pause。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The flood caused severe property ______ throughout the lower parts of the river valley.","options":["damage","audience","stage","role"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: damage (損失；損壞) 【全文中譯】洪水在河谷下游地區造成了嚴重的財產損失。 【選項解析】(A) damage 損害 (B) audience 觀眾 (C) stage 舞台 (D) role 角色。property damage 指財產損失。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The kindergarten teacher taught the toddlers how to ______ kindly toward one another during playtime.","options":["damage","act","pause","behave"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: behave (舉止；待人相處) 【全文中譯】幼稚園老師教導幼童在遊戲時間要友善地對待彼此。 【選項解析】(A) damage 損壞 (B) act 行動 (C) pause 暫停 (D) behave 舉止得體。友善相處為 behave kindly。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Taking an umbrella on a cloudy afternoon is a prudent ______ of preparation that prevents getting soaked.","options":["audience","act","stage","damage"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: act (行為；舉措) 【全文中譯】在陰天的下午帶一把傘是一項謹慎的防備舉措，可以防止全身被淋濕。 【選項解析】(A) audience 觀眾 (B) act 舉措 (C) stage 舞台 (D) damage 損害。預防行動為 a prudent act。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The director gathered all actors behind the ______ for a brief pep talk before the opening night curtain opened.","options":["role","stage","damage","audience"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: stage (舞台) 【全文中譯】首演當晚布幕拉開之前，導演將所有演員召集在後台進行簡短打氣講話。 【選項解析】(A) role 角色 (B) stage 舞台 (C) damage 損害 (D) audience 觀眾。behind the stage 指「在後台」。"},{"number":25,"stem":"There was an uncomfortable ______ in the conversation after David accidentally mentioned the family secret.","options":["pause","role","stage","audience"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pause (停頓；尷尬的中斷) 【全文中譯】在戴維不小心提及家族秘密後，對話中出現了令人尷尬的停頓。 【選項解析】(A) pause 停頓 (B) role 角色 (C) stage 舞台 (D) audience 觀眾。對話暫歇為 an uncomfortable pause。"}]},{"unit":70,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 70 (070.mp3) Topic Focus: Perseverance, Completion, Invention, Design & Creative Excellence","topic":"Topic Focus: Perseverance, Completion, Invention, Design & Creative Excellence | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"continue","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to keep happening or existing without stopping","chinese":"繼續；持續","sentence":"Although heavy snow fell across the highway, the rescue team decided to ______ their search for the missing hikers.","translation":"儘管大雪降在公路上，搜救隊仍決定繼續搜尋失蹤的登山客。"},{"word":"complete","pos":"(v.) / (adj.)","definition":"to finish making or doing; having all parts","chinese":"完成；完整的","sentence":"The architect expects the engineering team to ______ the construction of the new community center before December.","translation":"建築師期望工程團隊在十二月前完成新社區中心的建設。"},{"word":"obey","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to submit to the authority of someone or comply with rules","chinese":"服從；遵守","sentence":"Soldiers in military training are taught to ______ their commander's orders immediately and without hesitation.","translation":"接受軍事訓練的士兵被教導要毫不猶豫且立即服從指揮官的命令。"},{"word":"bother","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to take the trouble to do something; to annoy; trouble","chinese":"打擾；麻煩；費心","sentence":"I am very sorry to ______ you while you are reading, but could you please lend me your English dictionary?","translation":"非常抱歉在你閱讀時打擾你，但能否請你把你的英文詞典借給我？"},{"word":"imagine","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to form a mental image or concept of something","chinese":"想像","sentence":"Can you ______ living on a tropical island with turquoise ocean waters, gentle breezes, and no internet access?","translation":"你能想像生活在一個擁有青綠色海水、柔和微風且沒有網路的熱帶島嶼上嗎？"},{"word":"invent","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to create or design something that has not existed before","chinese":"發明；創造","sentence":"Alexander Graham Bell worked for years in his workshop to ______ the first practical electrical telephone.","translation":"亞歷山大·格拉漢姆·貝爾在他的工作室中鑽研了多年，發明了第一部實用的電動電話。"},{"word":"create","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to bring something into existence through skill or imagination","chinese":"創造；建立","sentence":"The innovative graphic artist used digital software to ______ a series of breathtaking animations for the video game.","translation":"這位極具創新精神的平面藝術家利用數位軟體，為這款電玩遊戲創造了一系列令人驚嘆的動畫。"},{"word":"design","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to plan and make artistic drawings for a product; a plan","chinese":"設計；構思","sentence":"A famous Italian architect was hired to ______ the modern glass facade of the international art museum.","translation":"一位著名的義大利建築師受聘為這座國際藝術博物館設計現代化的玻璃外牆。"},{"word":"single","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"only one; not accompanied by others; unmarried","chinese":"單一的；單身的","sentence":"The hotel receptionist politely asked the business traveler whether he needed a ______ room or a double suite.","translation":"飯店櫃檯接待員禮貌地詢問這位出差旅客，他是需要單人房還是雙人套房。"},{"word":"perfect","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"having all the desirable elements, qualities, or characteristics","chinese":"完美的；極佳的","sentence":"With a clear blue sky, warm sunshine, and mild breeze, this afternoon is the ______ weather for an outdoor picnic.","translation":"藍天晴朗、陽光溫暖、微風輕和，今天下午是進行戶外野餐的完美天氣。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Despite encountering numerous financial challenges, the young scientist vowed to ______ her cancer research.","options":["obey","continue","bother","invent"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: continue (繼續；持續) 【全文中譯】儘管遇到了無數的財務挑戰，這位年輕的科學家誓言要繼續她的癌症研究。 【選項解析】(A) obey 服從 (B) continue 繼續 (C) bother 打擾 (D) invent 發明。不放棄研究為 continue research。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Students have forty minutes to ______ the reading comprehension section of the English proficiency exam.","options":["complete","bother","imagine","obey"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: complete (完成) 【全文中譯】學生有四十分鐘的時間完成英語能力測驗的閱讀測驗部分。 【選項解析】(A) complete 完成 (B) bother 打擾 (C) imagine 想像 (D) obey 遵守。做完試題用 complete。"},{"number":3,"stem":"For your own safety, you must strictly ______ the warning signs posted around the deep swimming pool.","options":["create","obey","design","bother"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: obey (遵守；服從) 【全文中譯】為了您自身的安全，您必須嚴格遵守深水泳池周圍張貼的警告標誌。 【選項解析】(A) create 創造 (B) obey 遵守 (C) design 設計 (D) bother 打擾。遵守標示為 obey signs。"},{"number":4,"stem":"I hate to ______ you during your lunch break, but there is an urgent phone call for you from headquarters.","options":["invent","create","bother","complete"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: bother (打擾；打擾別人) 【全文中譯】我不想在你的午休時間打擾你，但總部有一通緊急電話找你。 【選項解析】(A) invent 發明 (B) create 創造 (C) bother 打擾 (D) complete 完成。打擾別人用 bother。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Close your eyes and try to ______ that you are floating peacefully on a calm lake under a starry night sky.","options":["obey","imagine","continue","complete"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: imagine (想像) 【全文中譯】閉上雙眼，試著想像你平靜地漂浮在繁星夜空下一片平靜的湖面上。 【選項解析】(A) obey 服從 (B) imagine 想像 (C) continue 繼續 (D) complete 完成。腦海勾勒畫面為 imagine。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Thomas Edison is widely celebrated for his tireless efforts to ______ the commercial incandescent electric light bulb.","options":["bother","obey","invent","continue"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: invent (發明) 【全文中譯】湯瑪斯·愛迪生因其為發明商業白熾電燈泡所付出的不懈努力而廣受讚譽。 【選項解析】(A) bother 打擾 (B) obey 服從 (C) invent 發明 (D) continue 繼續。研發新裝置為 invent。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The author's vivid descriptions ______ a magical fantasy world that completely fascinates young readers.","options":["create","obey","bother","continue"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: create (創造) 【全文中譯】作者生動的描繪創造了一個深深吸引年輕讀者的神奇奇幻世界。 【選項解析】(A) create 創造 (B) obey 遵守 (C) bother 打擾 (D) continue 繼續。構建虛構世界為 create a fantasy world。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The talented engineering firm was commissioned to ______ an earthquake-resistant suspension bridge across the bay.","options":["obey","bother","design","continue"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: design (設計) 【全文中譯】這家才華洋溢的工程公司受託設計一座跨越海灣的抗震懸索橋。 【選項解析】(A) obey 服從 (B) bother 麻煩 (C) design 設計 (D) continue 繼續。規劃繪製橋樑圖紙為 design a bridge。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Not a ______ student in the classroom was able to solve the extraordinarily complicated calculus equation.","options":["single","perfect","broad","direct"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: single (單一的；任何一個) 【全文中譯】教室裡沒有任何一位學生能夠解出這道極其複雜的微積分方程式。 【選項解析】(A) single 單一的 (B) perfect 完美的 (C) broad 寬廣的 (D) direct 直接的。not a single student 指「連一個學生都沒有」。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Her English pronunciation and grammatical fluency were so ______ that listeners assumed she grew up in London.","options":["single","narrow","wide","perfect"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: perfect (完美的；無懈可擊的) 【全文中譯】她的英語發音和文法流暢度是如此完美，以至於聽眾以為她是在倫敦長大的。 【選項解析】(A) single 單一的 (B) narrow 狹窄的 (C) wide 寬闊的 (D) perfect 完美的。發音無暇為 perfect。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Even after the bell rang, the enthusiastic debate team requested permission to ______ their discussion.","options":["bother","continue","invent","obey"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: continue (繼續) 【全文中譯】即使下課鐘聲敲響，熱情的辯論隊仍請求允許繼續他們的討論。 【選項解析】(A) bother 打擾 (B) continue 繼續 (C) invent 發明 (D) obey 服從。持續討論用 continue。"},{"number":12,"stem":"It took the construction workers eighteen months of hard labor to ______ the subway line extension.","options":["complete","obey","bother","imagine"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: complete (完成) 【全文中譯】建築工人花費了十八個月的辛勤勞動才完成了捷運延伸線的工程。 【選項解析】(A) complete 完成 (B) obey 遵守 (C) bother 費心 (D) imagine 想像。完工為 complete the extension。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Well-trained police dogs are taught to ______ every hand gesture and verbal signal given by their handlers.","options":["invent","design","create","obey"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: obey (服從；聽從) 【全文中譯】訓練有素的警犬被教導要服從領犬員給予的每一個手勢和口令訊號。 【選項解析】(A) invent 發明 (B) design 設計 (C) create 創造 (D) obey 服從。聽從指令為 obey signals。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Please do not ______ your father while he is preparing the annual tax reports in his private study.","options":["bother","continue","invent","complete"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: bother (打擾) 【全文中譯】當你父親在私人書房裡準備年度稅務申報表時，請不要打擾他。 【選項解析】(A) bother 打擾 (B) continue 繼續 (C) invent 發明 (D) complete 完成。煩擾他人為 bother。"},{"number":15,"stem":"It is difficult to ______ what human life was like thousands of years ago without modern technology.","options":["obey","bother","imagine","complete"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: imagine (想像) 【全文中譯】很難想像在沒有現代科技的數千年前，人類的生活是什麼樣子。 【選項解析】(A) obey 服從 (B) bother 打擾 (C) imagine 想像 (D) complete 完成。設想過去為 imagine life。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Scientists are working together globally to ______ new medical treatments for rare genetic diseases.","options":["invent","obey","bother","continue"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: invent (發明；研發) 【全文中譯】全球科學家正攜手合作研發針對罕見遺傳疾病的新療法。 【選項解析】(A) invent 發明 (B) obey 服從 (C) bother 麻煩 (D) continue 繼續。創製新藥物為 invent new treatments。"},{"number":17,"stem":"A team of creative graphic artists gathered in the studio to ______ an eye-catching logo for the brand.","options":["obey","bother","create","continue"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: create (創造；製作) 【全文中譯】一組創意平面藝術家聚集在工作室中，為該品牌打造一個吸睛的商標。 【選項解析】(A) obey 遵守 (B) bother 打擾 (C) create 創造；打造 (D) continue 繼續。設計標誌為 create a logo。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The fashion studio will ______ an exclusive collection of evening dresses for the Paris fashion festival.","options":["design","obey","bother","continue"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: design (設計) 【全文中譯】這家時裝工作室將為巴黎時裝節設計一系列獨家晚禮服。 【選項解析】(A) design 設計 (B) obey 服從 (C) bother 費心 (D) continue 繼續。設計服飾為 design a collection。"},{"number":19,"stem":"My uncle prefers to live as a ______ man because he enjoys traveling the globe without domestic ties.","options":["broad","single","perfect","wide"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: single (單身的) 【全文中譯】我叔叔偏好過著單身漢的生活，因為他喜歡毫無家庭牽絆地周遊世界。 【選項解析】(A) broad 寬廣的 (B) single 單身的 (C) perfect 完美的 (D) wide 寬闊的。single man 指單身男子。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The pianist performed Beethoven's Moonlight Sonata with such ______ technique that the audience was mesmerized.","options":["single","narrow","perfect","crowded"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: perfect (完美的；精準的) 【全文中譯】鋼琴家以如此完美的技巧演奏貝多芬的《月光奏鳴曲》，讓觀眾聽得如癡如醉。 【選項解析】(A) single 單一的 (B) narrow 狹隘的 (C) perfect 完美的 (D) crowded 擁擠的。perfect technique 指無暇技巧。"},{"number":21,"stem":"We will ______ to support this local charity until every underprivileged child receives adequate school meals.","options":["continue","bother","invent","obey"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: continue (繼續) 【全文中譯】我們將繼續支持這個地方慈善機構，直到每位弱勢兒童都能獲得足夠的學校營養午餐。 【選項解析】(A) continue 繼續 (B) bother 打擾 (C) invent 發明 (D) obey 服從。持續支持為 continue to support。"},{"number":22,"stem":"You must ______ the online registration form and submit your personal portfolio before next Friday.","options":["obey","bother","complete","imagine"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: complete (填寫完整；完成) 【全文中譯】你必須填妥線上報名表，並在下週五之前繳交你的個人作品集。 【選項解析】(A) obey 遵守 (B) bother 打擾 (C) complete 填妥 (D) imagine 想像。填寫表格為 complete the form。"},{"number":23,"stem":"All vehicle operators on the highway must ______ speed limits to prevent dangerous highway accidents.","options":["create","design","obey","invent"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: obey (遵守) 【全文中譯】公路上所有的車輛駕駛人必須遵守速限，以防止危險公路事故。 【選項解析】(A) create 創造 (B) design 設計 (C) obey 遵守 (D) invent 發明。遵守速限為 obey speed limits。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The industrial team managed to ______ a lightweight solar-powered vehicle capable of traveling long distances.","options":["bother","invent","obey","continue"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: invent (發明) 【全文中譯】工業團隊成功發明了一款能夠進行長途行駛的輕型太陽能汽車。 【選項解析】(A) bother 打擾 (B) invent 發明 (C) obey 遵守 (D) continue 繼續。發明車輛為 invent a vehicle。"},{"number":25,"stem":"This scenic mountain lake is a ______ destination for travelers who want to escape the stressful city life.","options":["single","narrow","direct","perfect"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: perfect (極佳的；完美的) 【全文中譯】這座風景如畫的高山湖泊是想逃離緊張城市生活的旅客的完美目的地。 【選項解析】(A) single 單一的 (B) narrow 狹窄的 (C) direct 直達的 (D) perfect 完美的。perfect destination 為「極佳目的地」。"}]},{"unit":71,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 71 (071.mp3) Topic Focus: Social Etiquette, Greetings, Body Language & Marriage","topic":"Topic Focus: Social Etiquette, Greetings, Body Language & Marriage | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"partner","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person who takes part in an undertaking with another","chinese":"夥伴；搭檔；伴侶","sentence":"David and his business ______ established an online software company together, and their profits grew rapidly in the first year.","translation":"大衛和他的商業【夥伴】一起創立了一家線上軟體公司，他們的利潤在第一年迅速增長。"},{"word":"friendship","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the state of being friends; a close relationship","chinese":"友誼；交情","sentence":"True ______ is built upon trust and mutual respect, and it often grows stronger whenever friends overcome difficulties together.","translation":"真正的【友誼】建立在信任與相互尊重之上，而且每當朋友們一起克服困難時，它往往會變得更加深厚。"},{"word":"marry","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to become the husband or wife of someone in a legal ceremony","chinese":"結婚；嫁；娶","sentence":"After dating happily for six years, Michael decided to ______ Sarah, and they planned a beautiful garden ceremony for next spring.","translation":"在愉快交往了六年之後，麥可決定與莎拉【結婚】，他們計畫在明年春天舉行一場美麗的花園典禮。"},{"word":"marriage","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the formal state of being married as husband and wife","chinese":"婚姻；婚姻生活","sentence":"A long and happy ______ requires patience and honest communication, so both partners must work together through life challenges.","translation":"一段長久而幸福的【婚姻】需要耐心與坦誠的溝通，因此雙方伴侶都必須共同面對生活中的各項挑戰。"},{"word":"congratulations","pos":"(n.)","definition":"words expressing praise or good wishes on a special occasion","chinese":"祝賀；恭喜","sentence":"The principal offered warm ______ to all the graduating students, and the proud parents took memorable photographs outside the auditorium.","translation":"校長向所有畢業生致以熱烈的【祝賀】，驕傲的家長們在大禮堂外拍下了值得留念的照片。"},{"word":"clap (clapped / clapped)","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to strike the palms of the hands together with a sudden sharp sound","chinese":"鼓掌；拍手","sentence":"When the young pianist finished her difficult musical performance, the entire audience stood up to ______ enthusiastically.","translation":"當那位年輕的鋼琴家結束她難度極高的音樂演奏時，全體觀眾紛紛起立熱情地【鼓掌】。"},{"word":"bow","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to bend the body or head forwards as a sign of respect","chinese":"鞠躬；鞠躬致敬","sentence":"Before beginning their traditional Japanese tea ceremony, the hosts and their honored guests exchanged a formal polite ______.","translation":"在開始傳統的日本茶道之前，主人與他們尊貴的賓客互相行了一個正式且有禮的【鞠躬】。"},{"word":"shake (shook / shaken)","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to move with quick, short movements from side to side or up and down","chinese":"搖動；握手","sentence":"When meeting the foreign business executive for the first time, you should smile politely and ______ hands firmly.","translation":"第一次與外國企業高層主管見面時，你應該禮貌地微笑並堅定地【握手】。"},{"word":"greet","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to welcome or say hello to someone with words or actions","chinese":"問候；迎接；打招呼","sentence":"Every weekday morning, the friendly hotel manager stands near the front entrance to ______ all the international guests with a warm smile.","translation":"每個工作日早晨，這位友善的飯店經理都會站在正門附近，帶著溫暖的微笑【問候】所有國際賓客。"},{"word":"hey","pos":"(interj.)","definition":"an informal exclamation used to attract attention or express greeting","chinese":"嘿（打招呼或引起注意）","sentence":"\"______, look across the street right now, because your favorite movie star is signing autographs for waiting fans!\" whispered Jerry excitedly.","translation":"「【嘿】，現在快看街道對面，因為你最喜歡的電影明星正在為等候的粉絲簽名！」傑瑞興奮地低語道。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"During the international conference, the company president stood by the door to ______ each foreign representative warmly.","options":["marry","greet","clap","shake"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: greet (問候；迎接) 【全文中譯】國際會議期間，公司總裁站在門口熱情地問候每位外國代表。 【選項解析】(A) marry 結婚 (B) greet 問候 (C) clap 鼓掌 (D) shake 搖晃。站在門口迎接代表，動詞用 greet。"},{"number":2,"stem":"David and his business ______ established an online software company together, and their profits grew rapidly in the first year.","options":["partner","marriage","friendship","congratulations"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: partner (夥伴；搭檔) 【全文中譯】大衛和他的商業夥伴一起創立了一家線上軟體公司，利潤在第一年迅速增長。 【選項解析】(A) partner 夥伴 (B) marriage 婚姻 (C) friendship 友誼 (D) congratulations 祝賀。business partner 為「商業夥伴」。"},{"number":3,"stem":"When the famous singer walked onto the stage, thousands of excited fans began to ______ their hands loudly.","options":["greet","marry","clap","bow"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: clap (拍手；鼓掌) 【全文中譯】當著名歌手走上舞台時，成千上萬興奮的粉絲開始大聲鼓掌。 【選項解析】(A) greet 問候 (B) marry 結婚 (C) clap 鼓掌 (D) bow 鞠躬。clap one's hands 表「鼓掌拍手」。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Before starting their traditional martial arts match, both competitors paused to ______ deeply to show mutual respect.","options":["bow","shake","marry","greet"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: bow (鞠躬；行禮) 【全文中譯】在開始傳統武術比賽之前，兩名選手都停下來深深鞠躬以示互相尊重。 【選項解析】(A) bow 鞠躬 (B) shake 搖晃 (C) marry 結婚 (D) greet 問候。武術賽前深深鞠躬行禮，用 bow deeply。"},{"number":5,"stem":"True ______ cannot be bought with money, but it is built on mutual honesty, loyalty, and caring through difficult times.","options":["partner","friendship","marriage","congratulations"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: friendship (友誼) 【全文中譯】真正的友誼無法用金錢買到，它是建立在患難時期的誠實與相互關懷之上。 【選項解析】(A) partner 夥伴 (B) friendship 友誼 (C) marriage 婚姻 (D) congratulations 祝賀。無法用金錢購買且經得起患難考驗的是 friendship。"},{"number":6,"stem":"After dating happily for seven years, Michael finally asked Jennifer to ______ him during their romantic trip to Paris.","options":["greet","clap","marry","bow"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: marry (結婚；嫁娶) 【全文中譯】交往了七年之後，麥可終於在他們浪漫的巴黎之旅中向珍妮佛求婚並希望能娶她。 【選項解析】(A) greet 問候 (B) clap 鼓掌 (C) marry 結婚 (D) bow 鞠躬。ask someone to marry him 指「向某人求婚/請對方嫁給他」。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The elderly couple recently celebrated their fiftieth wedding anniversary, and their long ______ remained full of love.","options":["partner","marriage","friendship","congratulations"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: marriage (婚姻) 【全文中譯】這對年邁的夫婦最近慶祝了他們的五十週年金婚，他們長久的婚姻依舊充滿愛意。 【選項解析】(A) partner 夥伴 (B) marriage 婚姻 (C) friendship 友誼 (D) congratulations 祝賀。wedding anniversary 慶祝長久的 marriage。"},{"number":8,"stem":"When entering a professional business meeting, it is customary to ______ hands with the client and maintain eye contact.","options":["marry","bow","clap","shake"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: shake (握手；搖動) 【全文中譯】進入專業商務會議時，與客戶握手並保持眼神接觸是合乎禮節的做法。 【選項解析】(A) marry 結婚 (B) bow 鞠躬 (C) clap 鼓掌 (D) shake 搖動。shake hands with 为固定片語「與…握手」。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The teacher sent sincere ______ to the student council president after she won first place in the national speech contest.","options":["congratulations","partner","marriage","friendship"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: congratulations (祝賀；恭喜) 【全文中譯】在學生會長獲得全國演講比賽第一名後，老師向她表達了由衷的祝賀。 【選項解析】(A) congratulations 祝賀 (B) partner 夥伴 (C) marriage 婚姻 (D) friendship 友誼。獲獎時給予的表達是 congratulations。"},{"number":10,"stem":"\"______, don't leave your umbrella behind on the restaurant chair, because dark rain clouds are gathering outside!\"","options":["Hey","Partner","Marriage","Friendship"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Hey (嘿，引起注意) 【全文中譯】「嘿，別把雨傘落在餐廳椅子上了，外面正在凝聚烏雲呢！」 【選項解析】(A) Hey 嘿 (B) Partner 夥伴 (C) Marriage 婚姻 (D) Friendship 友誼。感嘆詞引起對方注意，用 Hey。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Although they often argue about minor domestic matters, both partners are committed to protecting their stable ______.","options":["partner","congratulations","marriage","friendship"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: marriage (婚姻) 【全文中譯】儘管他們常為瑣事爭吵，但雙方伴侶都致力於維護他們穩定的婚姻生活。 【選項解析】(A) partner 夥伴 (B) congratulations 祝賀 (C) marriage 婚姻 (D) friendship 友誼。由 both partners 可知守護的是 marriage。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Whenever new exchange students arrive on campus, senior volunteers gather at the school gate to ______ them cheerfully.","options":["greet","marry","clap","shake"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: greet (迎接；問候) 【全文中譯】每當新的交換生抵達校園，高年級志工就會聚集在校門口熱情地迎接他們。 【選項解析】(A) greet 迎接 (B) marry 結婚 (C) clap 鼓掌 (D) shake 搖晃。志工在門口熱情迎接新生，動詞用 greet。"},{"number":13,"stem":"At the end of the magic show, all the children in the audience jumped from their seats to ______ enthusiastically.","options":["marry","clap","greet","bow"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: clap (拍手；鼓掌) 【全文中譯】在魔術表演結束時，觀眾席中的所有孩子都從座位上跳起來熱情地鼓掌。 【選項解析】(A) marry 結婚 (B) clap 鼓掌 (C) greet 迎接 (D) bow 鞠躬。表演精采讓孩子起立鼓掌，選 clap。"},{"number":14,"stem":"If you decide to dance in the school talent competition, you will definitely need a skilled and reliable dance ______.","options":["marriage","friendship","partner","congratulations"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: partner (舞伴；搭檔) 【全文中譯】如果你決定參加學校的才藝競賽跳舞，你肯定需要一位技術純熟且可靠的舞伴。 【選項解析】(A) marriage 婚姻 (B) friendship 友誼 (C) partner 搭檔 (D) congratulations 祝賀。dance partner 表「舞伴」。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Traditional cultural customs in East Asia often require younger people to ______ respectfully when greeting family elders.","options":["bow","marry","clap","shake"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: bow (鞠躬) 【全文中譯】東亞的傳統文化習俗通常要求年輕人在向家族長輩問好時必須恭敬地鞠躬。 【選項解析】(A) bow 鞠躬 (B) marry 結婚 (C) clap 鼓掌 (D) shake 搖動。bow respectfully 表「恭敬地鞠躬」。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Because of the strong earthquake, the tall glass vase on the bookshelf started to ______ violently and almost fell.","options":["greet","marry","bow","shake"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: shake (搖晃；晃動) 【全文中譯】由於強烈地震，書架上的高玻璃花瓶開始劇烈搖晃，差點摔落下來。 【選項解析】(A) greet 問候 (B) marry 結婚 (C) bow 鞠躬 (D) shake 搖晃。地震導致物品劇烈晃動，用 shake。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Sharing your personal secrets and supporting each other during difficult moments can help strengthen genuine lifelong ______.","options":["partner","marriage","congratulations","friendship"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: friendship (友誼) 【全文中譯】在困難時刻分享秘密並互相扶持，有助於鞏固真正長久的終生友誼。 【選項解析】(A) partner 夥伴 (B) marriage 婚姻 (C) congratulations 祝賀 (D) friendship 友誼。lifelong friendship 表「終生友誼」。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The prince announced that he was ready to ______ the kind doctor from the village, which delighted the entire kingdom.","options":["marry","greet","clap","shake"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: marry (結婚；娶) 【全文中譯】王子宣布他準備迎娶村裡那位善良的醫生，這讓整個王國欣喜若狂。 【選項解析】(A) marry 迎娶 (B) greet 迎接 (C) clap 鼓掌 (D) shake 搖動。marry the kind doctor 指迎娶醫生。"},{"number":19,"stem":"After hearing that his cousin had successfully passed the difficult medical entrance exam, Peter immediately texted his ______.","options":["marriage","partner","congratulations","friendship"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: congratulations (祝賀) 【全文中譯】得知堂弟順利通過難度極高的醫學入學考試後，彼得立刻發簡訊表達祝賀。 【選項解析】(A) marriage 婚姻 (B) partner 夥伴 (C) congratulations 祝賀 (D) friendship 友誼。考試通過送出祝賀，用 congratulations。"},{"number":20,"stem":"\"______, be careful with that boiling pot of soup, or you might burn your hands!\" warned grandmother from the dining table.","options":["Hey","Partner","Marriage","Friendship"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Hey (嘿) 【全文中譯】「嘿，小心那鍋滾燙的湯，不然可能會燙傷手！」祖母從餐桌旁提醒道。 【選項解析】(A) Hey 嘿 (B) Partner 夥伴 (C) Marriage 婚姻 (D) Friendship 友誼。語氣詞 Hey 引起他人警戒。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The two laboratory scientists acted as research ______ on the biology project and shared the scientific award equally.","options":["congratulations","partners","friendships","marriages"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: partners (合作夥伴) 【全文中譯】這兩位實驗室科學家在生物專案中擔任研究夥伴，並平分了該項科學獎。 【選項解析】(A) congratulations 祝賀 (B) partners 夥伴 (C) friendships 友誼 (D) marriages 婚姻。research partners 指「研究夥伴」。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Flight attendants stood near the aircraft door to ______ boarding passengers and assist them with finding their assigned seats.","options":["marry","bow","greet","clap"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: greet (問候；迎接) 【全文中譯】空服員站在機艙門口問候登機的乘客，並協助他們找到指定的座位。 【選項解析】(A) marry 結婚 (B) bow 鞠躬 (C) greet 問候 (D) clap 鼓掌。greet boarding passengers 指「迎接入座乘客」。"},{"number":23,"stem":"When the orchestra conductor finished leading the symphony, the concert hall erupted into thunderous cheers and ______.","options":["partner","clapping","marriage","friendship"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: clapping (拍手；鼓掌) 【全文中譯】當交響樂團指揮結束演出時，音樂廳裡爆發出雷鳴般的歡呼聲與掌聲。 【選項解析】(A) partner 夥伴 (B) clapping 掌聲 (C) marriage 婚姻 (D) friendship 友誼。thunderous cheers and clapping 表「雷鳴般的掌聲與歡呼」。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The theater actors held hands and took a final synchronized ______ before the heavy red curtains closed slowly.","options":["bow","partner","marriage","friendship"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: bow (鞠躬謝幕) 【全文中譯】在厚重的紅色帷幕緩緩拉上前，話劇演員們牽著手進行最後一次齊步鞠躬謝幕。 【選項解析】(A) bow 鞠躬 (B) partner 夥伴 (C) marriage 婚姻 (D) friendship 友誼。take a bow 表「鞠躬謝幕」。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Both international diplomats smiled warmly, posed for news cameras, and proceeded to ______ hands across the conference table.","options":["marry","greet","clap","shake"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: shake (握手) 【全文中譯】兩國外交官親切微笑、面對新聞鏡頭擺姿勢，接著隔著會議桌互相握手。 【選項解析】(A) marry 結婚 (B) greet 問候 (C) clap 鼓掌 (D) shake 握手。shake hands 表「握手」。"}]},{"unit":72,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 72 (072.mp3) Topic Focus: Actions, Financial Earnings, Loss & Discovery","topic":"Topic Focus: Actions, Financial Earnings, Loss & Discovery | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"roll","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to move along by turning over and over; a small bread roll","chinese":"滾動；捲；麵包捲","sentence":"The cheerful children ran up the grassy green hill, and then they giggled happily as they began to ______ down together.","translation":"活潑的孩子們跑上長滿青草的山丘，然後當他們開始一起往下【滾動】時開心地咯咯笑了起來。"},{"word":"earn","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to obtain money in return for labor or services","chinese":"賺取；賺得；贏得","sentence":"Although Brian is only a university student, he works hard at night to ______ enough money for his living expenses.","translation":"雖然布萊恩只是一名大學生，但他晚上努力工作以【賺取】足夠的生活費用。"},{"word":"gain","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to obtain or acquire something desirable; an increase","chinese":"獲得；增加；獲利","sentence":"Working on the international volunteer team helped Linda ______ valuable life experience and improved her spoken English significantly.","translation":"在國際志工團隊工作幫助琳達【獲得】了寶貴的人生經驗，並顯著提升了她的英語口說能力。"},{"word":"provide","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to make available for use; to supply","chinese":"提供；供應","sentence":"The local community center decided to ______ free warm meals and temporary blankets for homeless people during the cold winter.","translation":"當地社區中心決定在寒冬期間為無家可歸者【提供】免費熱食與臨時保暖毛毯。"},{"word":"offer","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to present something for acceptance or refusal; a proposal","chinese":"提議；提供；出價","sentence":"The tech company was deeply impressed by Kevin's computer skills, so the manager decided to ______ him a high-paying job.","translation":"這家科技公司對凱文的電腦技術留下了深刻印象，因此經理決定向他【提供】一份高薪工作。"},{"word":"missing","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"not present or unable to be found; lost","chinese":"失蹤的；找不到的","sentence":"The worried family searched everywhere across the neighborhood, but their ______ pet dog was nowhere to be found until morning.","translation":"焦急的家人在社區裡四處尋找，但直到早晨他們那隻【失蹤的】寵物狗依然無影無蹤。"},{"word":"disappear","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to cease to be visible; to vanish from sight","chinese":"消失；不見","sentence":"The huge ship sailed slowly toward the distant horizon, and it finally seemed to ______ completely into the thick coastal fog.","translation":"那艘巨大的輪船緩緩駛向遠方的地平線，最後似乎完全【消失】在濃厚的沿海霧氣之中。"},{"word":"discover","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to find or learn something unexpectedly or in the course of a search","chinese":"發現；發掘","sentence":"Archaeologists traveled deep into the jungle last summer, and they were amazed to ______ an ancient stone temple hidden by vines.","translation":"考古學家去年夏天深入叢林，驚訝地【發現】了一座被藤蔓掩蓋的古代石造神廟。"},{"word":"raise","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to lift or move to a higher position; an increase in salary","chinese":"舉起；提高；加薪","sentence":"If any student knows the correct answer to this grammar question, please ______ your right hand and speak clearly.","translation":"如果任何學生知道這個文法題目的正確答案，請【舉起】你的右手並清晰發言。"},{"word":"lift","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to raise to a higher position; a ride in a car","chinese":"舉起；抬起；搭便車","sentence":"The wooden carton was packed with heavy science textbooks, so Jonathan asked his brother to help him ______ it into the truck.","translation":"木箱裡裝滿了沉重的科學教科書，因此強納森請他弟弟幫忙一起將它【抬起】搬上卡車。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Although Brian is only a university student, he works hard at night to ______ enough money for his living expenses.","options":["roll","earn","disappear","discover"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: earn (賺取) 【全文中譯】雖然布萊恩只是一名大學生，但他晚上努力工作以賺取足夠的生活費用。 【選項解析】(A) roll 滾動 (B) earn 賺取 (C) disappear 消失 (D) discover 發現。earn money 為「賺錢」。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Working on the volunteer project allowed Samuel to ______ valuable leadership skills and make many wonderful new friends.","options":["gain","roll","disappear","lift"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: gain (獲得；增進) 【全文中譯】參與志工專案讓塞繆爾獲得了寶貴的領導技能，並結識了許多美好的新朋友。 【選項解析】(A) gain 獲得 (B) roll 滾動 (C) disappear 消失 (D) lift 抬起。gain skills 表「獲得技能」。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The humanitarian charity aims to ______ clean drinking water and medical supplies to villages affected by the storm.","options":["disappear","roll","provide","discover"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: provide (提供；供應) 【全文中譯】這家人道慈善機構旨在為受風暴影響的村莊提供乾淨的飲用水與醫療物資。 【選項解析】(A) disappear 消失 (B) roll 滾動 (C) provide 提供 (D) discover 發現。provide something to/for 指「提供某物給…」。"},{"number":4,"stem":"The IT manager was very satisfied with Susan's interview, so he decided to ______ her a full-time engineering position.","options":["offer","disappear","roll","gain"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: offer (提供；給予) 【全文中譯】資訊主管對蘇珊的面試非常滿意，因此決定向她提供一份全職工程師工作。 【選項解析】(A) offer 提供 (B) disappear 消失 (C) roll 滾動 (D) gain 獲得。offer a job 指「提供工作」。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The police posted photographs around the downtown train station in order to locate the ______ nine-year-old child.","options":["missing","heavy","ancient","recent"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: missing (失蹤的) 【全文中譯】警方在市中心火車站周圍張貼照片，以尋找失蹤的九歲孩童。 【選項解析】(A) missing 失蹤的 (B) heavy 沉重的 (C) ancient 古代的 (D) recent 最近的。missing child 表「失蹤兒童」。"},{"number":6,"stem":"As the morning sun climbed above the green mountain peak, the thick white clouds began to ______ rapidly.","options":["earn","provide","disappear","raise"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: disappear (消散；消失) 【全文中譯】當晨陽升上綠色山峰時，濃密的白雲開始迅速消散。 【選項解析】(A) earn 賺取 (B) provide 提供 (C) disappear 消失 (D) raise 舉起。雲霧散去用 disappear。"},{"number":7,"stem":"Scientists were thrilled when they managed to ______ a completely new species of deep-sea fish in the Pacific Ocean.","options":["discover","disappear","roll","earn"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: discover (發現) 【全文中譯】當科學家們在太平洋成功發現一種全新的深海魚類物種時，感到無比興奮。 【選項解析】(A) discover 發現 (B) disappear 消失 (C) roll 滾動 (D) earn 賺取。discover a new species 指「發現新物種」。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Whenever the school principal asks a question during assembly, students should politely ______ their hands before speaking.","options":["roll","disappear","earn","raise"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: raise (舉起；抬起) 【全文中譯】每當校長在集會上提問時，學生發言前應該有禮貌地舉手。 【選項解析】(A) roll 滾動 (B) disappear 消失 (C) earn 賺取 (D) raise 舉起。raise your hand 表「舉手」。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The heavy metal safe was far too heavy for one person to move, so two strong movers had to ______ it together.","options":["disappear","lift","earn","gain"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: lift (抬起；搬起) 【全文中譯】沉重的金屬保險箱太重了一個人搬不動，所以兩名強壯的搬運工必須一起將它抬起。 【選項解析】(A) disappear 消失 (B) lift 抬起 (C) earn 賺取 (D) gain 獲得。抬起重物用 lift。"},{"number":10,"stem":"The energetic puppy loved to ______ across the grass in the backyard until its white fur was covered with mud.","options":["roll","earn","gain","disappear"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: roll (打滾；滾動) 【全文中譯】充滿活力的幼犬喜歡在後院草地上打滾，直到白色毛皮沾滿了泥巴。 【選項解析】(A) roll 打滾 (B) earn 賺取 (C) gain 獲得 (D) disappear 消失。roll across the grass 指「在草地上打滾」。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Hardworking employees who consistently meet their sales targets hope that the company will ______ their monthly wages soon.","options":["disappear","roll","raise","discover"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: raise (提高；調升) 【全文中譯】持續達到銷售目標的勤奮員工希望公司能盡快調升他們的每月薪資。 【選項解析】(A) disappear 消失 (B) roll 滾動 (C) raise 提高 (D) discover 發現。raise wages 指「調薪」。"},{"number":12,"stem":"If you miss the final evening bus to the village, my father can easily give you a free ______ in his car.","options":["roll","lift","gain","offer"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: lift (搭便車) 【全文中譯】如果你錯過了開往村莊的末班公車，我父親可以順便開車免費載你一程。 【選項解析】(A) roll 滾動 (B) lift 便車 (C) gain 利益 (D) offer 提議。give someone a lift 為「讓某人搭便車」。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Travelers who visit foreign countries often ______ a deeper understanding of diverse cultural customs and international traditions.","options":["gain","disappear","roll","lift"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: gain (獲得) 【全文中譯】造訪外國的旅客往往能對多元文化習俗與國際傳統獲得更深入的了解。 【選項解析】(A) gain 獲得 (B) disappear 消失 (C) roll 滾動 (D) lift 抬起。gain an understanding 表「獲得理解」。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The university website states clearly that the dormitories will ______ free high-speed wireless internet for every resident student.","options":["disappear","provide","roll","earn"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: provide (提供) 【全文中譯】大學網站明確指出，宿舍將為每位住宿生提供免費的高速無線網路。 【選項解析】(A) disappear 消失 (B) provide 提供 (C) roll 滾動 (D) earn 賺取。provide internet 表「提供網路」。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Mr. Davis received a very attractive job ______ from a rival law firm, but he chose to stay with his current team.","options":["roll","lift","offer","gain"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: offer (工作機會；提議) 【全文中譯】戴維斯先生收到了競爭對手律師事務所極具吸引力的工作邀約，但他選擇留在目前的團隊。 【選項解析】(A) roll 麵包捲 (B) lift 電梯 (C) offer 邀約 (D) gain 利益。job offer 指「工作錄取邀約」。"},{"number":16,"stem":"After walking through the busy night market, Emily was horrified to realize that her leather purse was ______.","options":["missing","ancient","recent","heavy"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: missing (不見的；失竊的) 【全文中譯】逛完繁忙的夜市後，艾莉驚恐地發現她的皮夾不見了。 【選項解析】(A) missing 不見的 (B) ancient 古代的 (C) recent 最近的 (D) heavy 沉重的。purse is missing 表「錢包不見了」。"},{"number":17,"stem":"The magician covered the shiny gold coin with a black cloth, and within seconds, it seemed to ______ into thin air.","options":["disappear","earn","provide","raise"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: disappear (憑空消失) 【全文中譯】魔術師用黑布蓋住閃亮的金幣，幾秒鐘之內它似乎憑空消失了。 【選項解析】(A) disappear 消失 (B) earn 賺取 (C) provide 提供 (D) raise 舉起。disappear into thin air 表「憑空消失」。"},{"number":18,"stem":"While cleaning the dusty attic yesterday afternoon, the grandfather was surprised to ______ his grandfather's old military diary.","options":["earn","discover","disappear","roll"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: discover (意外發現) 【全文中譯】昨天下午打掃滿是灰塵的閣樓時，祖父驚喜地發現了他祖父的舊軍事日記。 【選項解析】(A) earn 賺取 (B) discover 發現 (C) disappear 消失 (D) roll 滾動。意外找到古物用 discover。"},{"number":19,"stem":"To pay for his expensive tuition and textbooks, young David had to ______ wages by delivering morning newspapers.","options":["earn","disappear","roll","lift"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: earn (賺取) 【全文中譯】為了支付昂貴的學費與教科書，年輕的大衛必須靠送早報來賺取薪資。 【選項解析】(A) earn 賺取 (B) disappear 消失 (C) roll 滾動 (D) lift 抬起。earn wages 表「賺取工資」。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The tennis coach instructed the young players to bend their knees properly whenever they prepare to ______ the heavy equipment.","options":["disappear","roll","earn","lift"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: lift (搬起；抬起) 【全文中譯】網球教練指導年輕球員在準備搬起沉重的設備時要適當彎曲膝蓋以防受傷。 【選項解析】(A) disappear 消失 (B) roll 滾動 (C) earn 賺取 (D) lift 抬起。搬起重物用 lift。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The heavy round basketball began to ______ down the steep driveway, and Tommy chased after it before it reached the street.","options":["roll","earn","gain","disappear"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: roll (滾下) 【全文中譯】沉重圓滾的籃球開始沿著陡峭的車道滾下去，湯米在它滾到馬路前追了上去。 【選項解析】(A) roll 滾動 (B) earn 賺取 (C) gain 獲得 (D) disappear 消失。球類滾動用 roll down。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Public schools must ______ equal learning opportunities and supportive environments for children of all cultural backgrounds.","options":["disappear","provide","roll","earn"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: provide (提供) 【全文中譯】公立學校必須為各種文化背景的孩子提供平等的學習機會與支持性環境。 【選項解析】(A) disappear 消失 (B) provide 提供 (C) roll 滾動 (D) earn 賺取。provide opportunities 表「提供機會」。"},{"number":23,"stem":"If you want to ______ the respect of your coworkers, you must demonstrate consistent responsibility and honest teamwork.","options":["earn","disappear","roll","lift"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: earn (贏得；博得) 【全文中譯】如果你想贏得同事的尊敬，你必須展現出始終如一的責任感與坦誠的團隊合作。 【選項解析】(A) earn 贏得 (B) disappear 消失 (C) roll 滾動 (D) lift 抬起。earn respect 指「贏得尊敬」。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Due to rising inflation and higher costs of living, the workers organized a peaceful protest to demand a significant pay ______.","options":["roll","raise","disappear","lift"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: raise (加薪) 【全文中譯】由於通膨上升與生活成本提高，工人們發起和平抗議以要求顯著加薪。 【選項解析】(A) roll 滾動 (B) raise 加薪 (C) disappear 消失 (D) lift 便車。pay raise 表「加薪」。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Through years of rigorous scientific practice, the young medical researcher began to ______ international recognition.","options":["gain","disappear","roll","lift"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: gain (獲得；贏得) 【全文中譯】經過多年嚴謹的科學實踐，這位年輕的醫學研究員開始贏得國際認可。 【選項解析】(A) gain 獲得 (B) disappear 消失 (C) roll 滾動 (D) lift 抬起。gain recognition 表「獲得認可」。"}]},{"unit":73,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 73 (073.mp3) Topic Focus: Physical Actions, Travel, Tourism & Guidance","topic":"Topic Focus: Physical Actions, Travel, Tourism & Guidance | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"lay (laid / laid)","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to put something down gently or flat in a particular place","chinese":"放置；鋪設；產卵","sentence":"The caring mother gently began to ______ the sleeping baby in the crib, and then she quietly closed the bedroom door.","translation":"關懷備至的母親輕輕地開始將熟睡的嬰兒【放置】在嬰兒床上，然後她悄悄關上了臥室的門。"},{"word":"throw (threw / thrown)","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to send something through the air with force by the hand","chinese":"投擲；丟；扔","sentence":"When the baseball coach signaled from the bench, the young pitcher prepared to ______ the ball across the plate.","translation":"當棒球教練從長凳上給予信號時，年輕的投手準備將球【投擲】穿過本壘板。"},{"word":"slide (slid / slid)","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to move smoothly along a surface; a playground apparatus","chinese":"滑動；滑行；溜滑梯","sentence":"Because the mountain highway was covered with slippery ice, the red car began to ______ dangerously toward the roadside.","translation":"因為山區公路覆蓋著濕滑的冰，那輛紅色轎車開始危險地朝路邊【滑行】。"},{"word":"shut (shut / shut)","pos":"(v.) / (adj.)","definition":"to close something so that it is not open","chinese":"關閉；闔上；關閉的","sentence":"Before the cold winter storm arrived, the farmer remembered to ______ all the wooden barn windows securely.","translation":"在寒冷的冬季暴風雨抵達之前，農夫記得將所有木質穀倉的窗戶牢牢【關閉】。"},{"word":"treat","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to behave towards someone; to buy food for someone; a pleasant event","chinese":"對待；請客；款待","sentence":"Since it was Peter's twenty-first birthday, his generous uncle offered to ______ the entire family to a luxurious seafood feast.","translation":"因為今天是彼得的二十一歲生日，他慷慨的叔叔主動提出要【請客】招待全家人享用一頓豪華海鮮大餐。"},{"word":"travel","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to make a journey, typically of some length","chinese":"旅行；行進；遊歷","sentence":"After graduating from college with honors, Lisa decided to ______ across Europe for three months to experience new cultures.","translation":"在以優異成績從大學畢業後，麗莎決定橫跨歐洲【旅行】三個月以體驗新的文化。"},{"word":"tour","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a journey for pleasure in which several places are visited","chinese":"導覽；巡迴；觀光","sentence":"The friendly foreign student signed up for a guided walking ______ of the historic district, and he took many photographs.","translation":"那位友善的外國學生報名參加了歷史街區的有導遊步行的【導覽】，並且拍了許多照片。"},{"word":"sail","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to travel in a boat or ship using wind power or an engine","chinese":"航行；揚帆行駛；帆","sentence":"The courageous captain prepared to ______ across the wide ocean, although heavy storm warnings were announced on the radio.","translation":"儘管廣播中發布了嚴重的暴風雨警報，英勇的船長依然準備好【航行】橫跨遼闊的海洋。"},{"word":"guide","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to direct or show the way; a person who shows the way","chinese":"引導；指引；導遊","sentence":"The experienced mountain volunteer agreed to ______ the foreign hikers safely through the foggy canyon trails.","translation":"那位經驗豐富的登山志工同意【指引】外國登山客安全穿過多霧的峽谷步道。"},{"word":"chase","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to pursue in order to catch or catch up with","chinese":"追逐；追趕；追捕","sentence":"The clever farm dog started to ______ the stray fox away from the chicken coop, barking loudly across the orchard.","translation":"那隻聰明的農場牧羊犬開始將流浪狐狸從雞舍旁【追趕】開來，在果園裡大聲吠叫。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The caring mother gently began to ______ the sleeping baby in the crib, and then she quietly closed the bedroom door.","options":["throw","lay","shut","chase"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: lay (放置；安放) 【全文中譯】關懷備至的母親輕輕地將熟睡的嬰兒放在嬰兒床上，然後悄悄關上臥室門。 【選項解析】(A) throw 丟 (B) lay 放置 (C) shut 關閉 (D) chase 追趕。lay the baby in the crib 指將嬰兒輕放在嬰兒床。"},{"number":2,"stem":"When the coach waved from the dugout, the star pitcher prepared to ______ a fast strike across the plate.","options":["slide","shut","throw","sail"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: throw (投擲；投球) 【全文中譯】當教練從休息區揮手示意時，王牌投手準備投出一記快速好球穿過本壘板。 【選項解析】(A) slide 滑行 (B) shut 關閉 (C) throw 投擲 (D) sail 航行。投手投球用 throw。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Children love to visit the park on sunny afternoons so they can happily play on the tall playground ______.","options":["tour","treat","guide","slide"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: slide (溜滑梯) 【全文中譯】孩子們喜歡在陽光明媚的下午造訪公園，這樣他們就能在操場的高溜滑梯上開心玩耍。 【選項解析】(A) tour 導覽 (B) treat 請客 (C) guide 導遊 (D) slide 溜滑梯。遊樂設施溜滑梯為 slide。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Before you leave the chemistry laboratory for the weekend, please make sure to ______ all windows firmly.","options":["shut","lay","sail","travel"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: shut (關閉) 【全文中譯】在週末離開化學實驗室之前，請務必把所有窗戶關牢。 【選項解析】(A) shut 關閉 (B) lay 放置 (C) sail 航行 (D) travel 旅行。shut windows securely 表關閉窗戶。"},{"number":5,"stem":"You do not need to take out your wallet at the restaurant today because dinner is my ______.","options":["slide","tour","treat","guide"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: treat (請客；款待) 【全文中譯】今天在餐廳你不需要拿出皮夾，因為這頓晚餐由我請客。 【選項解析】(A) slide 滑梯 (B) tour 導覽 (C) treat 請客 (D) guide 指南。It's my treat 為習慣用語「我請客」。"},{"number":6,"stem":"After saving money for two years, the young couple plans to ______ through Southeast Asia for their honeymoon.","options":["shut","lay","travel","chase"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: travel (旅行) 【全文中譯】存了兩年錢之後，這對年輕夫婦計畫在蜜月期間遊歷東南亞。 【選項解析】(A) shut 關閉 (B) lay 放置 (C) travel 旅行 (D) chase 追趕。travel through 表遊歷各地。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The museum offers an informative audio ______ that explains ancient Egyptian artifacts in five different languages.","options":["tour","treat","slide","chase"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: tour (導覽行程) 【全文中譯】博物館提供內容豐富的語音導覽，用五種不同語言解說古埃及文物。 【選項解析】(A) tour 導覽 (B) treat 請客 (C) slide 滑行 (D) chase 追捕。audio tour 表語音導覽。"},{"number":8,"stem":"During the breezy autumn afternoon, the sailors raised their white canvas to ______ across the peaceful lake.","options":["shut","sail","lay","throw"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: sail (航行；揚帆) 【全文中譯】在涼爽的秋日午後，水手們升起白帆在平靜的湖面上航行。 【選項解析】(A) shut 關閉 (B) sail 航行 (C) lay 放置 (D) throw 投擲。揚帆航行用 sail。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The experienced wilderness ranger volunteered to ______ the tourists through the dense tropical forest.","options":["chase","slide","shut","guide"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: guide (指引；引導) 【全文中譯】經驗豐富的荒野巡邏員志願帶領遊客穿過茂密的熱帶森林。 【選項解析】(A) chase 追趕 (B) slide 滑動 (C) shut 關閉 (D) guide 引導。帶領遊客穿過森林用 guide。"},{"number":10,"stem":"The hungry cat saw a small gray mouse in the kitchen and immediately began to ______ it under the stove.","options":["chase","lay","sail","travel"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: chase (追逐；追趕) 【全文中譯】飢餓的貓在廚房看到一隻灰色小老鼠，立刻開始在爐子底下追趕它。 【選項解析】(A) chase 追趕 (B) lay 放置 (C) sail 航行 (D) travel 旅行。貓抓老鼠為 chase。"},{"number":11,"stem":"When entering the library, please remember to ______ the door softly so you do not disturb studying students.","options":["sail","throw","shut","travel"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: shut (輕輕關上) 【全文中譯】進入圖書館時，請記得輕輕關門，以免打擾正在用功的學生。 【選項解析】(A) sail 航行 (B) throw 丟 (C) shut 關閉 (D) travel 旅行。shut the door 表關門。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The tennis player was so angry with his mistakes that he wanted to ______ his racket against the court.","options":["throw","lay","guide","tour"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: throw (砸；摔；扔) 【全文中譯】網球選手因自己的失誤非常憤怒，甚至想把球拍狠狠砸向球場地面。 【選項解析】(A) throw 扔擲 (B) lay 放置 (C) guide 引導 (D) tour 觀光。摔擲球拍用 throw。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Because the marble floor was wet from cleaning, several customers began to ______ and almost fell down.","options":["tour","treat","slide","guide"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: slide (滑動；滑倒) 【全文中譯】因為大理石地板剛打掃完很濕，好幾位顧客腳底打滑差點摔倒。 【選項解析】(A) tour 觀光 (B) treat 請客 (C) slide 滑動 (D) guide 引導。濕滑地板打滑用 slide。"},{"number":14,"stem":"If you work hard throughout the week, you deserve to ______ yourself to a nice movie and dinner on Friday.","options":["chase","treat","sail","lay"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: treat (犒賞；請客) 【全文中譯】如果你一整週都辛苦工作，星期五理應犒賞自己看一場好電影並享用美食。 【選項解析】(A) chase 追逐 (B) treat 犒賞 (C) sail 航行 (D) lay 放置。treat oneself to 表犒賞自己。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The documentary team followed migratory birds as they ______ thousands of miles south for the winter.","options":["travel","shut","lay","chase"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: travel (遷徙行進) 【全文中譯】紀錄片團隊追蹤候鳥，記錄牠們在冬季往南行進數千英里的過程。 【選項解析】(A) travel 行進 (B) shut 關閉 (C) lay 產卵 (D) chase 追捕。長途遷徙行進用 travel。"},{"number":16,"stem":"The historical walking ______ included visits to ancient temples, colonial buildings, and the old city harbor.","options":["slide","treat","tour","guide"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: tour (巡迴參觀行程) 【全文中譯】歷史步行導覽包含了參觀古老神廟、殖民時期建築與舊城碼頭。 【選項解析】(A) slide 滑梯 (B) treat 請客 (C) tour 導覽 (D) guide 指南。walking tour 表徒步導覽行程。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Explorers in ancient times used the stars in the night sky to ______ their wooden ships safely across the ocean.","options":["throw","shut","guide","chase"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: guide (指引航向) 【全文中譯】古代探險家利用夜空中的星辰來指引木船安全橫渡大洋。 【選項解析】(A) throw 投擲 (B) shut 關閉 (C) guide 指引 (D) chase 追捕。指引船隻方向用 guide。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Two playful police dogs continued to ______ each other around the green training park during their morning exercise.","options":["shut","chase","lay","sail"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: chase (追逐玩耍) 【全文中譯】兩隻頑皮的警犬在晨練期間繼續在綠色訓練場上互相追逐玩耍。 【選項解析】(A) shut 關閉 (B) chase 追逐 (C) lay 放置 (D) sail 航行。犬隻追逐用 chase each other。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Before serving the delicate birthday cake, grandmother asked Tommy to ______ the clean plates on the dining table.","options":["lay","throw","shut","chase"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: lay (鋪放；擺放) 【全文中譯】在端出精緻的生日蛋糕之前，祖母請湯米把乾淨的盤子擺放在餐桌上。 【選項解析】(A) lay 擺放 (B) throw 投擲 (C) shut 關閉 (D) chase 追逐。擺放碗盤用 lay the plates。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The wealthy businessman bought a luxury yacht so he could ______ around tropical islands during his retirement.","options":["shut","throw","lay","sail"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: sail (駕船航行) 【全文中譯】那位富商買了一艘豪華遊艇，以便在退休期間能駕船環遊熱帶島嶼。 【選項解析】(A) shut 關閉 (B) throw 投擲 (C) lay 放置 (D) sail 航行。乘遊艇航行用 sail。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Be careful when hiking down the steep muddy slope, or you might ______ and twist your ankle.","options":["slide","shut","tour","sail"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: slide (滑落；滑倒) 【全文中譯】沿著陡峭泥濘的斜坡往下走時要小心，否則你可能會滑倒並扭傷腳踝。 【選項解析】(A) slide 滑倒 (B) shut 關閉 (C) tour 觀光 (D) sail 航行。泥濘地滑倒用 slide。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The kind doctor insisted on giving the wounded stray cat special medical ______ without asking for any payment.","options":["tour","treat","slide","guide"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: treat (特別照顧；款待) 【全文中譯】善良的醫生堅持給受傷的流浪貓特別的醫療照料，而不收取任何費用。 【選項解析】(A) tour 導覽 (B) treat 照料/招待 (C) slide 滑行 (D) guide 指引。特意款待或照顧用 special treat。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The school handbook provides an excellent step-by-step ______ for new students navigating their first semester.","options":["guide","slide","tour","treat"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: guide (指南；手冊) 【全文中譯】學校手冊為新生度過第一個學期提供了極佳的逐步指引指南。 【選項解析】(A) guide 指南 (B) slide 滑梯 (C) tour 導覽 (D) treat 請客。提供指導的文件為 guide。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The angry homeowner shouted at the noisy teenager to ______ his loud car engine and leave the street.","options":["shut","sail","lay","travel"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: shut (關掉；熄火) 【全文中譯】憤怒的屋主對著吵鬧的青少年大喊，叫他關掉吵鬧的汽車引擎並離開這條街。 【選項解析】(A) shut 關閉 (B) sail 航行 (C) lay 放置 (D) travel 旅行。shut engine 表關閉引擎。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Please do not ______ waste paper on the park lawn, but place it inside the green recycling bins.","options":["throw","shut","guide","travel"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: throw (丟棄；亂扔) 【全文中譯】請不要在公園草坪上亂扔廢紙，而應將其放入綠色回收桶內。 【選項解析】(A) throw 扔擲 (B) shut 關閉 (C) guide 指引 (D) travel 旅行。throw paper 表亂扔廢紙。"}]},{"unit":74,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 74 (074.mp3) Topic Focus: Pursuit, Movement, Physical Actions & Consequences","topic":"Topic Focus: Pursuit, Movement, Physical Actions & Consequences | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"trap (trapped / trapped)","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to catch an animal in a trap; a device for catching animals","chinese":"設陷阱捕捉；陷阱；使受困","sentence":"When the old apartment building caught fire, thick smoke began to ______ several terrified residents on the top floor.","translation":"當這棟老舊公寓大樓失火時，濃煙開始將幾名驚恐的住戶【受困】在頂樓。"},{"word":"hunt","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to pursue and kill a wild animal for food or sport","chinese":"打獵；搜尋；狩獵","sentence":"In ancient times, forest tribes used handmade bows and arrows to ______ wild deer and boars for winter survival.","translation":"在古代，森林部落使用手工製作的弓箭【打獵】野鹿和野豬以在冬季生存。"},{"word":"search","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to look through carefully in order to find something or someone","chinese":"搜尋；搜查；尋找","sentence":"Police officers and rescue volunteers organized a wide line to ______ the snowy mountain slope for the missing climbers.","translation":"警員與搜救志工排成寬闊的一字隊形，在白雪覆蓋的山坡上【搜尋】失蹤的登山客。"},{"word":"seek (sought / sought)","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to attempt to find or obtain something","chinese":"尋找；尋求；謀求","sentence":"If high school students feel overwhelmed by academic stress, they should always ______ advice from counselors or teachers.","translation":"如果高中生感到學業壓力過大難以承受，他們應該隨時向輔導老師或教師【尋求】建議。"},{"word":"object","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a material thing that can be seen and touched; to express disapproval","chinese":"物體；物件；反對","sentence":"The science teacher brought a mysterious metal ______ into the classroom to demonstrate how magnetic forces work.","translation":"理化老師把一個神秘的金屬【物件】帶進教室，以展示磁力是如何運作的。"},{"word":"hop (hopped / hopped)","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to move by jumping on one foot or all feet together","chinese":"單腳跳；跳躍","sentence":"The fluffy white rabbit began to ______ across the vegetable garden, searching eagerly for fresh green lettuce.","translation":"那隻毛茸茸的白兔開始在菜園裡一跳一跳地【跳躍】，急切地尋找新鮮翠綠的萵苣。"},{"word":"slip (slipped / slipped)","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to slide accidentally, causing a fall; a small piece of paper","chinese":"滑倒；滑落；紙條","sentence":"The elderly man happened to ______ on the wet kitchen tiles this morning, and he unfortunately bruised his left knee.","translation":"那位年邁的先生今天早上碰巧在濕滑的廚房磁磚上【滑倒】，不幸挫傷了他的左膝蓋。"},{"word":"surf","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to ride on waves; to browse information on the internet","chinese":"衝浪；在網路瀏覽","sentence":"Young people who live near Kenting love to ______ big waves on sunny summer weekends with their colorful boards.","translation":"住在墾丁附近的年輕人喜歡在陽光明媚的夏季週末帶著鮮豔的衝浪板去大浪中【衝浪】。"},{"word":"beat (beat / beaten)","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to strike repeatedly; to defeat someone; the rhythm of the heart","chinese":"敲打；擊敗；心跳跳動","sentence":"Our school basketball team played with tremendous determination and managed to ______ their rivals in the final seconds.","translation":"我們學校的籃球隊展現了無比的決心，並在最後幾秒鐘成功【擊敗】了他們的對手。"},{"word":"punish","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to inflict a penalty or sanction on someone for an offense","chinese":"處罰；懲戒","sentence":"Parents should teach their children with patience rather than ______ them harshly whenever they make honest mistakes.","translation":"每當孩子犯了無心之過時，父母應該耐心教導孩子，而不是嚴厲地【處罰】他們。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"When the old apartment building caught fire, thick smoke began to ______ several terrified residents on the top floor.","options":["hunt","trap","surf","hop"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: trap (使困住；設陷阱) 【全文中譯】當老舊公寓失火時，濃煙開始將幾名驚恐的住戶困在頂樓。 【選項解析】(A) hunt 打獵 (B) trap 使困住 (C) surf 衝浪 (D) hop 跳躍。火災受困用 trap。"},{"number":2,"stem":"In ancient times, forest tribes used handmade bows and arrows to ______ wild animals for their winter survival.","options":["hunt","hop","slip","punish"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: hunt (打獵；獵捕) 【全文中譯】在古代，森林部落使用手工弓箭獵捕野生動物以供度過寒冬。 【選項解析】(A) hunt 獵捕 (B) hop 跳躍 (C) slip 滑倒 (D) punish 處罰。用弓箭打獵為 hunt wild animals。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Police officers and rescue dogs worked through the night to ______ the dense forest for the lost child.","options":["punish","hop","search","surf"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: search (搜查；搜尋) 【全文中譯】警員與搜救犬整夜工作，在茂密的森林中搜尋失蹤的孩童。 【選項解析】(A) punish 處罰 (B) hop 跳躍 (C) search 搜尋 (D) surf 衝浪。搜救失蹤兒童用 search the forest。"},{"number":4,"stem":"If you encounter difficult legal problems during business contracts, you should always ______ professional advice.","options":["slip","hop","hunt","seek"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: seek (尋求；謀求) 【全文中譯】如果你在商業合約中遇到困難的法律問題，應該隨時尋求專業建議。 【選項解析】(A) slip 滑落 (B) hop 單腳跳 (C) hunt 打獵 (D) seek 尋求。seek advice 為固定搭配「尋求建議」。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The teacher placed a strange wooden ______ on the table and asked the students to guess its historical function.","options":["object","hunt","search","slip"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: object (物體；物件) 【全文中譯】老師在桌上放了一個奇怪的木製物件，並請學生猜測其歷史用途。 【選項解析】(A) object 物件 (B) hunt 狩獵 (C) search 搜尋 (D) slip 紙條。實體東西為 object。"},{"number":6,"stem":"A tiny brown frog managed to ______ across the garden stones and quickly disappeared into the cool pond water.","options":["punish","hunt","hop","surf"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: hop (單腳跳；跳躍) 【全文中譯】一隻小褐蛙一跳一跳地跳過花園石塊，迅速消失在涼爽的池塘水中。 【選項解析】(A) punish 處罰 (B) hunt 打獵 (C) hop 跳躍 (D) surf 衝浪。青蛙跳躍用 hop。"},{"number":7,"stem":"Be extremely careful when walking down the icy stairs, or you might ______ and break your wrist.","options":["hunt","slip","seek","beat"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: slip (滑倒) 【全文中譯】走在結冰的樓梯時要格外小心，否則你可能會滑倒並折斷手腕。 【選項解析】(A) hunt 打獵 (B) slip 滑倒 (C) seek 尋找 (D) beat 擊打。在結冰路面滑倒用 slip。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Many water sports enthusiasts travel to Taitung every autumn because coastal waves are perfect to ______ on.","options":["punish","hunt","hop","surf"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: surf (衝浪) 【全文中譯】許多水上運動愛好者每年秋季都前往台東，因為沿海的海浪非常適合衝浪。 【選項解析】(A) punish 處罰 (B) hunt 狩獵 (C) hop 跳躍 (D) surf 衝浪。在海浪上衝浪為 surf on waves。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Our high school soccer team worked hard together and managed to ______ the defending champion in the finals.","options":["hunt","hop","beat","slip"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: beat (擊敗；戰勝) 【全文中譯】我們高中足球隊團結奮戰，成功在決賽中擊敗了衛冕冠軍隊。 【選項解析】(A) hunt 打獵 (B) hop 跳躍 (C) beat 擊敗 (D) slip 滑落。比賽擊敗對手用 beat。"},{"number":10,"stem":"School rules clearly state that teachers must not ______ students with physical violence under any circumstances.","options":["punish","hunt","hop","surf"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: punish (處罰；懲戒) 【全文中譯】學校規定明確指出，任何情況下教師都不得以肢體暴力懲戒學生。 【選項解析】(A) punish 懲處 (B) hunt 打獵 (C) hop 跳躍 (D) surf 衝浪。處罰學生用 punish students。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Firefighters quickly arrived at the collapsed factory to rescue workers who were ______ inside the underground basement.","options":["trapped","hopped","surfed","hunted"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: trapped (受困的) 【全文中譯】消防隊員迅速抵達倒塌的工廠，營救受困在地下室的工人。 【選項解析】(A) trapped 受困 (B) hopped 跳躍 (C) surfed 衝浪 (D) hunted 狩獵。工人受困用 were trapped。"},{"number":12,"stem":"During the cold winter months, wild wolves form packs to ______ for deer across the snowy plains.","options":["hop","slip","hunt","punish"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: hunt (獵食；打獵) 【全文中譯】在寒冬月份，野狼會組成狼群在雪原上獵捕鹿隻。 【選項解析】(A) hop 跳躍 (B) slip 滑倒 (C) hunt 獵捕 (D) punish 處罰。動物獵捕為 hunt for deer。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Detectives obtained a legal warrant to ______ the suspect's apartment for stolen diamond jewelry.","options":["surf","search","hop","punish"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: search (搜查；搜查住所) 【全文中譯】刑警取得合法搜查令，搜查嫌犯的公寓以尋找被盜的鑽石首飾。 【選項解析】(A) surf 瀏覽 (B) search 搜查 (C) hop 跳躍 (D) punish 處罰。搜查公寓用 search the apartment。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Young graduates who wish to start their own tech companies actively ______ financial funding from venture investors.","options":["seek","slip","hop","beat"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: seek (尋求資金) 【全文中譯】想創辦科技公司的年輕畢業生，積極向創業投資人尋求財務資金。 【選項解析】(A) seek 尋求 (B) slip 滑落 (C) hop 跳躍 (D) beat 敲打。seek funding 表尋求資金。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The astronomer observed a bright moving ______ through his telescope, which turned out to be a passing comet.","options":["object","slip","hunt","search"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: object (天體；飛行物) 【全文中譯】天文學家透過望遠鏡觀察到一個明亮的移動天體，結果是一顆路過的彗星。 【選項解析】(A) object 物體/天體 (B) slip 紙條 (C) hunt 狩獵 (D) search 搜尋。moving object 表移動物體。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Because of his injured ankle, the little boy had to ______ on one foot all the way to the nurse's office.","options":["hunt","surf","punish","hop"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: hop (單腳跳行) 【全文中譯】因為腳踝受傷，小男孩只得單腳一路跳向保健室。 【選項解析】(A) hunt 打獵 (B) surf 衝浪 (C) punish 處罰 (D) hop 單腳跳。hop on one foot 表單腳跳。"},{"number":17,"stem":"The waiter accidentally let the heavy tray ______ from his wet hands, and dishes smashed on the dining floor.","options":["slip","hunt","seek","hop"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: slip (滑脫；滑落) 【全文中譯】服務生不小心讓沉重的托盤從濕潤的手中滑落，碗盤砸在餐廳地板上。 【選項解析】(A) slip 滑脫 (B) hunt 狩獵 (C) seek 尋求 (D) hop 跳躍。物品滑脫用 slip from hands。"},{"number":18,"stem":"During boring rainy afternoons at home, teenagers often prefer to ______ the internet and watch funny videos.","options":["hunt","surf","punish","hop"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: surf (上網瀏覽) 【全文中譯】在無聊的雨天午後待在家裡，青少年通常更喜歡上網瀏覽看搞笑影片。 【選項解析】(A) hunt 狩獵 (B) surf 瀏覽 (C) punish 處罰 (D) hop 跳躍。surf the internet 表上網瀏覽。"},{"number":19,"stem":"When you exercise intensely on a treadmill, your heart will naturally ______ faster to supply oxygen to muscles.","options":["hunt","slip","beat","hop"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: beat (心跳跳動) 【全文中譯】在跑步機上進行劇烈運動時，你的心臟自然會跳動得更快以提供氧氣給肌肉。 【選項解析】(A) hunt 狩獵 (B) slip 滑倒 (C) beat 跳動 (D) hop 跳躍。heart beats 表心臟跳動。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The strict judge decided to ______ the reckless driver by revoking his driver's license for two full years.","options":["punish","hop","hunt","surf"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: punish (懲處；處罰) 【全文中譯】嚴厲的法官決定吊銷該魯莽駕駛的駕照整整兩年，以此予以懲戒。 【選項解析】(A) punish 懲處 (B) hop 跳躍 (C) hunt 狩獵 (D) surf 衝浪。法律懲處違法者用 punish。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The hunter set a steel ______ hidden beneath dried leaves, hoping to catch the wild boar that damaged crops.","options":["trap","object","search","slip"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: trap (捕獸夾；陷阱) 【全文中譯】獵人在落葉下設了一個隱蔽的鋼製捕獸夾，希望能捉到破壞農作物的野豬。 【選項解析】(A) trap 陷阱 (B) object 物件 (C) search 搜尋 (D) slip 紙條。鋼製陷阱為 steel trap。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Job hunters should carefully ______ out reputable recruitment agencies rather than responding to suspicious online ads.","options":["seek","hop","slip","punish"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: seek (尋找；謀求) 【全文中譯】求職者應該謹慎物色聲譽良好的招聘機構，而非隨意回應可疑的網路廣告。 【選項解析】(A) seek 尋找 (B) hop 跳躍 (C) slip 滑落 (D) punish 處罰。seek out 表物色尋找。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The doctor left a brief reminder note on a small ______ of paper before leaving the hospital ward.","options":["slip","object","search","trap"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: slip (紙條) 【全文中譯】醫生在離開病房前，在一張小紙條上寫下了簡短的提醒事項。 【選項解析】(A) slip 紙條 (B) object 物件 (C) search 搜尋 (D) trap 陷阱。a small slip of paper 表小紙條。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The rhythmic drumming began to ______ loudly in the stadium, pumping up the excitement of the spectators.","options":["hunt","beat","slip","hop"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: beat (敲擊鼓聲) 【全文中譯】有節奏的鼓聲在體育場內響亮地敲擊起來，激發了觀眾的興奮熱情。 【選項解析】(A) hunt 狩獵 (B) beat 敲擊 (C) slip 滑落 (D) hop 跳躍。drumming beats 表鼓點敲擊。"},{"number":25,"stem":"If students cheat on the final examination, the principal will severely ______ them according to school policy.","options":["punish","surf","hop","hunt"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: punish (嚴懲) 【全文中譯】如果學生在期末考作弊，校長將依照校規對他們進行嚴厲懲處。 【選項解析】(A) punish 懲處 (B) surf 衝浪 (C) hop 跳躍 (D) hunt 狩獵。處罰作弊學生用 punish them。"}]},{"unit":75,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 75 (075.mp3) Topic Focus: Interpersonal Communication, Secrets, Humor & Decision Making","topic":"Topic Focus: Interpersonal Communication, Secrets, Humor & Decision Making | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"rush","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to move or act with urgent haste; a sudden rapid movement","chinese":"匆忙；急速前進；匆促","sentence":"Because the airport express train was departing in ten minutes, the travelers had to ______ through the busy station hall.","translation":"因為機場快線列車在十分鐘內就要發車，旅客們不得不【匆忙】穿過繁忙的車站大廳。"},{"word":"interrupt","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to stop the continuous progress of an activity or speaker","chinese":"打斷；中斷；打擾","sentence":"It is considered very impolite to ______ the teacher while she is explaining an important math concept to the class.","translation":"在老師向全班講解重要數學觀念時【打斷】她，被認為是非常不禮貌的行為。"},{"word":"conversation","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a talk, especially an informal one, between two or more people","chinese":"談話；對話；交談","sentence":"While waiting for their flight at the departure gate, the two tourists had an enjoyable ______ about cultural traditions.","translation":"在登機門等候班機時，兩位遊客就文化傳統進行了一場愉快的【交談】。"},{"word":"joke","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a thing that someone says to cause amusement or laughter","chinese":"笑話；開玩笑","sentence":"The cheerful uncle loved to tell a funny ______ at the dinner table, making all his young nephews laugh out loud.","translation":"那位開朗的叔叔喜歡在餐桌上講有趣的【笑話】，把他所有的小侄子們逗得哈哈大笑。"},{"word":"trick","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a cunning act intended to deceive; to deceive someone","chinese":"把戲；惡作劇；騙局；欺騙","sentence":"The clever street magician performed an amazing coin ______, and none of the spectators could figure out how he did it.","translation":"那位聰明的街頭魔術師表演了一套神奇的硬幣【把戲】，現場沒有任何觀眾能看穿他是如何辦到的。"},{"word":"secret","pos":"(n.) / (adj.)","definition":"something that is kept unknown or unseen by others","chinese":"秘密；保密的","sentence":"Emma promised her best friend that she would keep the surprise party a strict ______ until Saturday evening arrived.","translation":"艾瑪向她最好的朋友保證，在週六傍晚到來之前，她一定會對這場驚喜派對嚴加【保密】。"},{"word":"silence","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"complete absence of sound; to make someone stop speaking","chinese":"寂靜；沉默；使安靜","sentence":"When the stern judge entered the courtroom and sat down, a sudden respectful ______ fell over the entire audience.","translation":"當神情嚴肅的法官走進法庭並坐下時，全場旁聽群眾頓時陷入一片恭敬的【寂靜】。"},{"word":"message","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a verbal, written, or recorded communication sent to someone","chinese":"訊息；留言","sentence":"Since Dr. Lin was performing surgery in the operating room, his assistant asked the caller to leave a brief ______.","translation":"由於林醫生正在手術室進行手術，他的助理請打電話的人留下一則簡短的【留言】。"},{"word":"choose (chose / chosen)","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to pick out or select as being the best or most appropriate","chinese":"選擇；挑選","sentence":"Students in the language department are allowed to ______ between French, German, and Spanish for their second foreign language.","translation":"語言學系的學生被允許在法語、德語和西班牙語之間【選擇】作為他們的第二外語。"},{"word":"choice","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an act of selecting or making a decision when faced with possibilities","chinese":"選擇；抉擇","sentence":"Having a diverse menu with vegetarian options gives restaurant customers a much wider ______ for their daily lunch.","translation":"擁有包含素食選項的豐富菜單，為餐廳顧客的每日午餐提供了更廣泛的【選擇】。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Because the airport express train was departing in ten minutes, the travelers had to ______ through the busy station hall.","options":["interrupt","rush","choose","silence"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: rush (匆忙趕往) 【全文中譯】因為機場快線十分鐘後發車，旅客們只得匆忙穿過繁忙的車站大廳。 【選項解析】(A) interrupt 打斷 (B) rush 匆忙 (C) choose 選擇 (D) silence 使安靜。趕車匆忙用 rush through。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Polite children are taught never to ______ adults whenever they are discussing serious family matters.","options":["interrupt","rush","joke","choose"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: interrupt (打斷；打擾) 【全文中譯】有禮貌的孩子從小被教育，在大人討論嚴肅家族事務時絕不能打斷他們。 【選項解析】(A) interrupt 打斷 (B) rush 匆忙 (C) joke 開玩笑 (D) choose 挑選。打斷別人說話用 interrupt adults。"},{"number":3,"stem":"During the long train ride to Hualien, Samuel and his seatmate had a fascinating ______ about mountain climbing.","options":["message","silence","conversation","secret"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: conversation (談話；交談) 【全文中譯】在開往花蓮的長途火車上，塞繆爾和他的鄰座進行了一場有關登山的精彩交談。 【選項解析】(A) message 訊息 (B) silence 寂靜 (C) conversation 對話 (D) secret 秘密。進行談話為 have a conversation。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Grandfather told such a humorous ______ at dinner that everyone burst into uncontrollable laughter.","options":["secret","joke","silence","message"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: joke (笑話) 【全文中譯】祖父在晚餐時講了一個非常幽默的笑話，逗得大家忍不住大笑起來。 【選項解析】(A) secret 秘密 (B) joke 笑話 (C) silence 寂靜 (D) message 訊息。tell a humorous joke 表講笑話。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The clever street performer demonstrated a fascinating card ______ that completely baffled the watching crowd.","options":["choice","trick","message","silence"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: trick (把戲；魔術) 【全文中譯】聰明的街頭藝人展示了一套神奇的紙牌把戲，把圍觀人群完全迷住了。 【選項解析】(A) choice 選擇 (B) trick 把戲 (C) message 訊息 (D) silence 寂靜。card trick 表紙牌魔術把戲。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Sophia promised her sister that she would never reveal her personal ______ to any classmates at school.","options":["secret","joke","silence","message"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: secret (秘密) 【全文中譯】蘇菲亞向妹妹保證，她絕不會把她的個人秘密透露給學校裡的任何同學。 【選項解析】(A) secret 秘密 (B) joke 笑話 (C) silence 沉默 (D) message 訊息。personal secret 表個人秘密。"},{"number":7,"stem":"When the music stopped and the lights dimmed, an uneasy ______ enveloped the entire auditorium.","options":["message","joke","trick","silence"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: silence (寂靜；沉寂) 【全文中譯】當音樂停止且燈光變暗時，一陣令人不安的寂靜籠罩了整個大禮堂。 【選項解析】(A) message 訊息 (B) joke 笑話 (C) trick 把戲 (D) silence 寂靜。全場寂靜用 silence enveloped the auditorium。"},{"number":8,"stem":"If the doctor is busy consulting with another patient, you can simply leave a written ______ with the receptionist.","options":["joke","message","silence","secret"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: message (留言；口信) 【全文中譯】如果醫生正忙著為其他病人看診，你可以直接向櫃檯接待員留下一張書面留言。 【選項解析】(A) joke 笑話 (B) message 留言 (C) silence 寂靜 (D) secret 秘密。leave a message 為固定搭配「留言」。"},{"number":9,"stem":"In tomorrow's voting session, university students will ______ their new student council president for the coming year.","options":["rush","interrupt","choose","silence"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: choose (選舉；挑選) 【全文中譯】在明天的投票會議上，大學生們將選出他們下一年度的新學生會會長。 【選項解析】(A) rush 匆忙 (B) interrupt 打斷 (C) choose 選拔/挑選 (D) silence 使安靜。投票選出代表用 choose。"},{"number":10,"stem":"When dining at this Italian restaurant, you have an excellent ______ between homemade pasta and wood-fired pizza.","options":["choice","trick","silence","message"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: choice (選擇；多樣選擇) 【全文中譯】在這家義大利餐廳用餐時，你在手工義大利麵與窯烤披薩之間擁有極佳的選擇。 【選項解析】(A) choice 選擇 (B) trick 詭計 (C) silence 寂靜 (D) message 訊息。have an excellent choice 表有良好選擇。"},{"number":11,"stem":"You should plan your schedule carefully so you do not have to ______ through breakfast every morning.","options":["choose","interrupt","rush","joke"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: rush (狼吞虎嚥；匆忙吃完) 【全文中譯】你應該仔細規劃行程，這樣每天早晨就不必匆忙吞完早餐了。 【選項解析】(A) choose 挑選 (B) interrupt 打擾 (C) rush 匆忙 (D) joke 玩笑。rush through breakfast 指匆忙吃早餐。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Please do not ______ the speaker during the presentation, but save your questions for the discussion period.","options":["rush","interrupt","choose","silence"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: interrupt (打斷發言) 【全文中譯】演講進行期間請不要打斷講者，請把問題留到討論時間提出。 【選項解析】(A) rush 匆忙 (B) interrupt 打斷 (C) choose 選擇 (D) silence 使沉默。打斷演講者用 interrupt the speaker。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The diplomat engaged in a confidential diplomatic ______ with foreign officials regarding international trade agreements.","options":["conversation","silence","trick","joke"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: conversation (外交對話) 【全文中譯】這位外交官與外國官員就國際貿易協議進行了機密的對話。 【選項解析】(A) conversation 對話 (B) silence 沉默 (C) trick 把戲 (D) joke 笑話。外交對話為 diplomatic conversation。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Although Tom likes to play the clown, this serious medical situation is certainly no time to ______.","options":["rush","joke","interrupt","choose"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: joke (開玩笑) 【全文中譯】雖然湯姆喜歡扮小丑搞笑，但這個嚴肅的醫療狀況絕非開玩笑的時刻。 【選項解析】(A) rush 匆忙 (B) joke 開玩笑 (C) interrupt 打斷 (D) choose 選擇。no time to joke 表「不是開玩笑的時候」。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Fraudulent telephone scammers often use an elaborate psychological ______ to steal money from unsuspecting seniors.","options":["message","trick","silence","choice"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: trick (騙局；伎倆) 【全文中譯】電話詐騙犯經常使用精密的心理騙局，從毫無戒備的長輩手中詐取金錢。 【選項解析】(A) message 訊息 (B) trick 騙術 (C) silence 沉默 (D) choice 選擇。psychological trick 表心理騙術。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Military officers are legally sworn to protect government ______ from foreign spies and unauthorized leaks.","options":["secrets","jokes","choices","silences"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: secrets (國家機密) 【全文中譯】軍官宣誓依法保守政府機密，防止外國間諜刺探與未經授權的洩漏。 【選項解析】(A) secrets 機密 (B) jokes 笑話 (C) choices 選擇 (D) silences 沉默。protect government secrets 表保守政府機密。"},{"number":17,"stem":"After the explosive announcement, the stunned room sat in complete ______ for several long seconds.","options":["message","silence","trick","joke"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: silence (全場肅靜；沉寂) 【全文中譯】在震撼性的公告發表後，震驚的會議室陷入了長達數秒鐘的完全沉寂。 【選項解析】(A) message 訊息 (B) silence 沉寂 (C) trick 騙局 (D) joke 笑話。sat in complete silence 指陷入完全肅靜。"},{"number":18,"stem":"An urgent text ______ arrived on my mobile phone, warning all citizens about the approaching tropical typhoon.","options":["message","silence","joke","trick"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: message (簡訊；通知) 【全文中譯】手機上收到了一則緊急簡訊，警告所有市民防範即將來襲的熱帶颱風。 【選項解析】(A) message 訊息 (B) silence 寂靜 (C) joke 笑話 (D) trick 伎倆。text message 表手機簡訊。"},{"number":19,"stem":"High school seniors must carefully ______ which university major aligns best with their future career interests.","options":["choose","rush","interrupt","silence"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: choose (慎選科系) 【全文中譯】高三學生必須謹慎挑選哪一個大學主修最符合自己未來的職業志向。 【選項解析】(A) choose 挑選 (B) rush 匆忙 (C) interrupt 打斷 (D) silence 壓制。choose major 表挑選主修。"},{"number":20,"stem":"Making a wise career ______ during youth can pave the way for long-term personal happiness and stability.","options":["joke","choice","trick","silence"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: choice (生涯抉擇) 【全文中譯】年輕時做出明智的職業抉擇，能為長期的個人幸福與穩定鋪平道路。 【選項解析】(A) joke 笑話 (B) choice 抉擇 (C) trick 詭計 (D) silence 沉默。career choice 表生涯抉擇。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Morning commuters often have to ______ onto crowded subway cars to avoid arriving late for corporate meetings.","options":["rush","interrupt","choose","silence"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: rush (湧入；擠上) 【全文中譯】早晨通勤族經常不得不擠上擁擠的地鐵車廂，以避免在公司會議上遲到。 【選項解析】(A) rush 湧入/奔趕 (B) interrupt 打斷 (C) choose 選擇 (D) silence 使安靜。rush onto subway 表匆忙擠上地鐵。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The telephone operator stated that Dr. Harrison received your urgent ______ and will return your call soon.","options":["message","silence","joke","trick"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: message (緊急留言) 【全文中譯】電話總機表示哈里森醫生已收到您的緊急留言，並將很快給您回電。 【選項解析】(A) message 留言 (B) silence 寂靜 (C) joke 笑話 (D) trick 把戲。receive urgent message 表收到緊急留言。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The naughty child tried to play a mischievous April Fools' ______ on his elder sister, but she was not fooled.","options":["choice","trick","message","silence"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: trick (愚人節惡作劇) 【全文中譯】那個淘氣的孩子試圖在他姐姐身上玩愚人節惡作劇，但姐姐並未上當。 【選項解析】(A) choice 選擇 (B) trick 惡作劇 (C) message 訊息 (D) silence 沉默。April Fools' trick 表愚人節惡作劇。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The forest at midnight was peaceful, and the profound ______ was interrupted only by the distant call of an owl.","options":["silence","message","joke","choice"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: silence (深沉的寂靜) 【全文中譯】午夜的森林一片安詳，深沉的寂靜只被遠處貓頭鷹的叫聲所打破。 【選項解析】(A) silence 寂靜 (B) message 訊息 (C) joke 笑話 (D) choice 選擇。profound silence 表深沉的寂靜。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Between attending Harvard University and Oxford University, the brilliant scholar faced an enviable difficult ______.","options":["choice","joke","trick","silence"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: choice (令人羨慕的抉擇) 【全文中譯】在就讀哈佛大學與牛津大學之間，這位優秀的學者面臨著令人羨慕的艱難抉擇。 【選項解析】(A) choice 抉擇 (B) joke 笑話 (C) trick 詭計 (D) silence 沉默。difficult choice 表艱難抉擇。"}]},{"unit":76,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 76 (076.mp3) Topic Focus: Selection, Advice, Military Commands & Medical Care","topic":"Topic Focus: Selection, Advice, Military Commands & Medical Care | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"select","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to carefully choose as being the best or most suitable","chinese":"挑選；選拔；精選","sentence":"The panel of music professors convened yesterday morning to ______ the three most talented pianists for the scholarship.","translation":"音樂教授評審團昨天上午召開會議，以【選拔】三位最具才華的鋼琴家獲頒獎學金。"},{"word":"avoid","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to keep away from or stop oneself from doing something","chinese":"避開；避免；預防","sentence":"Drivers should reduce their speed on icy roads to ______ dangerous accidents during severe winter weather.","translation":"駕駛在結冰路面上應降低車速，以【避免】在惡劣冬天天氣下發生危險事故。"},{"word":"omit (omitted / omitted)","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to leave out or exclude someone or something either intentionally or forgetfully","chinese":"省略；遺漏；略去","sentence":"When filling out this formal visa application, be very careful not to ______ any required personal information.","translation":"填寫這份正式簽證申請表時，請格外小心，千萬不要【遺漏】任何必要的個人資訊。"},{"word":"command","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"an authoritative order; to give an authoritative order to","chinese":"命令；指揮；控制","sentence":"The brave military officer issued a clear ______ to his soldiers to retreat to safe positions behind the hill.","translation":"英勇的軍官向部下士兵下達了明確的【命令】，要求撤退到山丘後方的安全陣地。"},{"word":"comment","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a verbal or written remark expressing an opinion or reaction","chinese":"評論；意見；發表評論","sentence":"The government spokesperson declined to make any official ______ regarding ongoing sensitive diplomatic negotiations.","translation":"政府發言人拒絕對正在進行中的敏感外交談判發表任何官方【評論】。"},{"word":"advise","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to offer suggestions about the best course of action to someone","chinese":"建議；勸告；忠告","sentence":"Because of high cholesterol levels, the doctor had to ______ my father to eat less red meat and exercise daily.","translation":"因為膽固醇過高，醫生不得不【建議】我父親少吃紅肉並每天運動。"},{"word":"advice","pos":"(n.)","definition":"guidance or recommendations offered with regard to prudent future action","chinese":"建議；忠告；勸告","sentence":"My experienced elder sister gave me valuable ______ on how to prepare effectively for competitive university entrance exams.","translation":"經驗豐富的姐姐給了我寶貴的【建議】，指導我如何有效準備具競爭力的大學入學考試。"},{"word":"truth","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the quality or state of being in accordance with fact or reality","chinese":"真相；事實；真實","sentence":"In a court of law, every witness is sworn to speak the honest ______ before testifying about the crime.","translation":"在法庭上，每位證人在就罪行作證之前，都必須宣誓陳述坦率的【真相】。"},{"word":"cure","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a substance or treatment that ends a disease; to relieve a person of symptoms","chinese":"治癒方法；特效藥；治癒","sentence":"Medical researchers around the globe are working tirelessly to discover an effective ______ for Alzheimer's disease.","translation":"全球各地的醫學研究人員正不知疲倦地工作，希望能發現阿茲海默症的有效【治癒方法】。"},{"word":"treatment","pos":"(n.)","definition":"medical care given to a patient for an illness or injury","chinese":"治療；療程；處置","sentence":"The patient responded remarkably well to the physical therapy ______, and she was able to walk without crutches in a month.","translation":"這位病患對物理治療【療程】反應極佳，不到一個月她就能不用拐杖行走了。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The panel of music professors convened yesterday morning to ______ the three most talented pianists for the scholarship.","options":["avoid","select","omit","cure"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: select (選拔；挑選) 【全文中譯】音樂教授評審團昨天召開會議，以選拔三位最具才華的鋼琴家獲頒獎學金。 【選項解析】(A) avoid 避免 (B) select 選拔 (C) omit 省略 (D) cure 治癒。評選獲獎者用 select。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Drivers should slow down during heavy rainstorms to ______ dangerous skidding on the slippery highway.","options":["avoid","select","advise","command"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: avoid (避免；防止) 【全文中譯】駕駛在暴風雨期間應減速，以避免在濕滑公路上發生危險打滑。 【選項解析】(A) avoid 避免 (B) select 選拔 (C) advise 建議 (D) command 命令。防止意外發生用 avoid accidents。"},{"number":3,"stem":"When you write your final academic essay, make sure not to ______ citations for borrowed research data.","options":["avoid","select","omit","cure"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: omit (遺漏；省略) 【全文中譯】撰寫學術論文時，請確保不要遺漏引用借鑑的研究數據。 【選項解析】(A) avoid 避免 (B) select 挑選 (C) omit 遺漏 (D) cure 治癒。遺漏引註用 omit citations。"},{"number":4,"stem":"The army general stood proudly before his troops and gave a strict ______ to hold the defensive line.","options":["advice","command","truth","cure"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: command (命令；軍令) 【全文中譯】陸軍將軍驕傲地站在部隊前，下達堅守防線的嚴格命令。 【選項解析】(A) advice 建議 (B) command 命令 (C) truth 真相 (D) cure 療法。下達軍事命令為 give a command。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The foreign minister refused to provide any public ______ on the controversial news article until investigations concluded.","options":["command","advice","comment","truth"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: comment (評論；聲明) 【全文中譯】外交部長拒絕在調查結束前對爭議性新聞報導發表任何公開評論。 【選項解析】(A) command 命令 (B) advice 建議 (C) comment 評論 (D) truth 真相。發表評論用 make a comment。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Healthcare professionals strongly ______ elderly patients to receive influenza vaccinations before winter begins.","options":["advise","avoid","omit","select"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: advise (建議；勸告) 【全文中譯】醫護專業人員強烈建議老年病患在入冬前接種流感疫苗。 【選項解析】(A) advise 建議 (B) avoid 避免 (C) omit 省略 (D) select 挑選。advise someone to do something 為「建議某人做某事」。"},{"number":7,"stem":"If you are having trouble budgeting your monthly expenses, financial experts can provide excellent ______.","options":["command","advice","truth","cure"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: advice (建議；指導) 【全文中譯】如果你在編列每月開銷預算時遇到困難，理財專家能提供極佳的建議。 【選項解析】(A) command 命令 (B) advice 建議 (C) truth 真相 (D) cure 療法。提供寶貴建議用 provide advice。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Although the facts were painful to hear, the loyal assistant chose to tell his boss the absolute ______.","options":["command","truth","comment","advice"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: truth (事實真相) 【全文中譯】儘管事實聽起來令人難受，忠誠的特助仍選擇向老闆陳述絕對的事實真相。 【選項解析】(A) command 命令 (B) truth 真相 (C) comment 評論 (D) advice 建議。tell the truth 為固定搭配「說實話」。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Scientists have spent decades searching for a permanent ______ for common viral infections like the cold.","options":["command","comment","cure","advice"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: cure (治癒法；特效藥) 【全文中譯】科學家花了數十年尋找針對感冒等常見病毒感染的永久治癒法。 【選項解析】(A) command 命令 (B) comment 評論 (C) cure 治癒法 (D) advice 建議。a cure for a disease 表疾病的治癒法。"},{"number":10,"stem":"After suffering third-degree burns in the kitchen accident, Kevin was admitted to the hospital for intensive ______.","options":["command","comment","advice","treatment"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: treatment (治療；療程) 【全文中譯】在廚房意外中遭受三度灼傷後，凱文被送入醫院接受加護治療。 【選項解析】(A) command 命令 (B) comment 評論 (C) advice 建議 (D) treatment 治療。intensive treatment 指加護治療。"},{"number":11,"stem":"The Olympic selection committee will ______ the top sixteen runners to represent our nation in the summer games.","options":["select","omit","avoid","cure"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: select (選拔選手) 【全文中譯】奧運選拔委員會將選拔出前十六名跑者代表我國參加夏季奧運會。 【選項解析】(A) select 選拔 (B) omit 遺漏 (C) avoid 避免 (D) cure 治癒。挑選代表用 select runners。"},{"number":12,"stem":"People with sensitive skin should ______ using scented soaps that contain artificial coloring chemicals.","options":["select","avoid","advise","command"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: avoid (避免接觸) 【全文中譯】皮膚敏感的人應避免使用含有化學人工色素的芳香肥皂。 【選項解析】(A) select 挑選 (B) avoid 避免 (C) advise 建議 (D) command 命令。avoid using 表避免使用。"},{"number":13,"stem":"In order to save space on the printed brochure, the editor decided to ______ several minor background details.","options":["omit","select","avoid","cure"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: omit (刪減；略去) 【全文中譯】為了節省印刷手冊的版面，編輯決定略去幾項次要的背景細節。 【選項解析】(A) omit 略去 (B) select 挑選 (C) avoid 避免 (D) cure 治癒。刪略細節用 omit details。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The police dog was trained to obey every verbal ______ issued by its professional handler immediately.","options":["command","comment","advice","truth"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: command (口令；指令) 【全文中譯】警犬受過專業訓練，能立即服從訓犬員發出的每一道口語指令。 【選項解析】(A) command 口令 (B) comment 評論 (C) advice 建議 (D) truth 真相。obey a command 表服從命令。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Many internet users left an encouraging ______ under the hospital's video praising hardworking medical nurses.","options":["command","comment","truth","cure"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: comment (網路留言；評論) 【全文中譯】許多網友在醫院讚揚辛苦護理師的影片下方留下了溫暖的鼓勵留言。 【選項解析】(A) command 命令 (B) comment 留言 (C) truth 真相 (D) cure 療法。leave a comment 表留言。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Career counselors ______ high school graduates to explore internships before making long-term career commitments.","options":["advise","avoid","select","omit"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: advise (輔導；建議) 【全文中譯】生涯輔導員建議高中畢業生在做出長期職業承諾前多探索實習機會。 【選項解析】(A) advise 建議 (B) avoid 避免 (C) select 挑選 (D) omit 省略。輔導員給予忠告用 advise graduates。"},{"number":17,"stem":"A piece of good ______ passed down from grandfather is to save at least ten percent of every paycheck.","options":["command","advice","comment","truth"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: advice (一條忠告) 【全文中譯】祖父傳承下來的一條極佳忠告是：把每筆薪水的至少百分之十存起來。 【選項解析】(A) command 命令 (B) advice 忠告 (C) comment 評論 (D) truth 真相。a piece of advice 為不可數名詞 advice 的量詞。"},{"number":18,"stem":"During the police investigation, the detective demanded nothing less than the whole ______ from all witnesses.","options":["command","comment","truth","cure"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: truth (全部事實) 【全文中譯】在警方調查期間，刑警要求所有目擊證人必須全盤托出完整事實真相。 【選項解析】(A) command 命令 (B) comment 評論 (C) truth 真相 (D) cure 療法。the whole truth 表完整真相。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Modern doctors believe that early medical diagnosis is the best way to ______ certain types of illnesses.","options":["cure","omit","avoid","select"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: cure (治癒疾病) 【全文中譯】現代醫生相信早期醫療診斷是徹底治癒某些特定疾病的最佳方式。 【選項解析】(A) cure 治癒 (B) omit 略去 (C) avoid 避免 (D) select 挑選。治癒疾病動詞用 cure illnesses。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The specialized cancer clinic offers advanced radiation ______ that targets tumors without harming surrounding tissues.","options":["command","comment","advice","treatment"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: treatment (放射治療) 【全文中譯】該專門癌症診所提供先進的放射線治療，能在不傷及周邊組織下對抗腫瘤。 【選項解析】(A) command 命令 (B) comment 評論 (C) advice 建議 (D) treatment 治療。radiation treatment 表放射線治療。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The university admissions board will ______ applicants based on both academic grades and community service.","options":["select","avoid","omit","cure"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: select (審核錄取) 【全文中譯】大學招生委員會將根據學業成績與社區服務兩方面來選拔錄取申請者。 【選項解析】(A) select 挑選 (B) avoid 避免 (C) omit 省略 (D) cure 治癒。挑選錄取者用 select applicants。"},{"number":22,"stem":"To maintain dental health, dentists remind teenagers to ______ drinking sugary soda drinks between meals.","options":["select","avoid","advise","command"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: avoid (避免飲用) 【全文中譯】為了維護牙齒健康，牙醫提醒青少年在兩餐之間避免飲用含糖汽水。 【選項解析】(A) select 挑選 (B) avoid 避免 (C) advise 建議 (D) command 指揮。avoid drinking 表避免飲用。"},{"number":23,"stem":"If you accidentally ______ your signature on the official contract, the document will become completely invalid.","options":["omit","select","avoid","cure"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: omit (漏簽；遺漏) 【全文中譯】如果你不小心在正式合約上遺漏了簽名，這份文件將完全失去效力。 【選項解析】(A) omit 遺漏 (B) select 挑選 (C) avoid 避免 (D) cure 治癒。omit signature 表漏簽名。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The captain had full ______ of the naval vessel and guided it safely through treacherous stormy waters.","options":["command","comment","truth","advice"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: command (統率指揮權) 【全文中譯】船長擁有軍艦的完全指揮權，並帶領它安全穿過危險的暴風雨水域。 【選項解析】(A) command 指揮權 (B) comment 評論 (C) truth 真相 (D) advice 建議。have full command of 表完全掌控指揮。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Receiving prompt emergency ______ after a venomous snakebite is critical for saving a patient's life.","options":["treatment","comment","command","advice"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: treatment (緊急救治) 【全文中譯】在被毒蛇咬傷後迅速獲得即時緊急救治，對挽救病患生命至關重要。 【選項解析】(A) treatment 治療 (B) comment 評論 (C) command 命令 (D) advice 建議。emergency treatment 表緊急醫療救治。"}]},{"unit":77,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 77 (077.mp3) Topic Focus: Goals, Focus, Categories, Investigation & Realization","topic":"Topic Focus: Goals, Focus, Categories, Investigation & Realization | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"focus","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to adapt to see clearly; the center of interest or activity","chinese":"集中；聚焦；焦點","sentence":"During final exam week, diligent students must ______ their attention entirely on their textbooks and avoid social media distractions.","translation":"在期末考週期間，勤奮的學生必須將注意力完全【集中】在課本上，並避開社交媒體的干擾。"},{"word":"goal","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the object of a person's ambition or effort; an aim or desired result","chinese":"目標；球門；得分","sentence":"Setting a clear long-term ______ at the beginning of the semester helps learners organize their daily study schedules effectively.","translation":"在學期初設定明確的長期【目標】，有助於學習者有效地安排他們的日常讀書計畫。"},{"word":"aim","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to point or direct a weapon or effort; a purpose or intention","chinese":"瞄準；旨在；目標；目的","sentence":"This community health program is designed to ______ at improving physical fitness and dietary nutrition among local senior citizens.","translation":"這項社區健康計畫旨在【致力於】提升當地年長者的身體體能與飲食營養。"},{"word":"target","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a person or thing aimed at; an objective or result towards which efforts are directed","chinese":"靶子；目標；針對","sentence":"The experienced archer drew his wooden bow smoothly and released the arrow directly toward the center of the paper ______.","translation":"經驗豐富的射手流暢地拉開木弓，將箭矢直接射向紙製【靶子】的中心。"},{"word":"type","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a category of people or things having common characteristics; to write with a keyboard","chinese":"類型；種類；打字","sentence":"Our school library categorizes books according to their specific literary ______, making it easier for students to find research materials.","translation":"我們學校的圖書館根據書籍特定的文學【類型】進行分類，使學生更容易找到研究資料。"},{"word":"case","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an instance of a particular situation; a legal lawsuit; a container","chinese":"實例；案件；情況；箱子","sentence":"The police detective reviewed every detail of the mysterious theft ______, searching for clues that previous officers had missed.","translation":"刑警仔細審查了這起神秘竊盜【案件】的每個細節，尋找先前警官遺漏的線索。"},{"word":"dot","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a small round mark or spot; to mark with a small spot","chinese":"小圓點；點綴","sentence":"Linda wore a fashionable vintage blue dress covered with tiny white ______ patterns to her best friend's birthday party.","translation":"琳達穿著一件點綴著微小白【點】圖案的時尚復古藍色連身裙，去參加她最好朋友的生日派對。"},{"word":"row","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a number of people or things in a straight line; to propel a boat with oars","chinese":"一排；一行；划船","sentence":"The excited students stood quietly in a neat ______ outside the museum entrance, waiting patiently for the doors to open.","translation":"興奮的學生們在博物館門口安靜地排成整齊的【一排】，耐心等候大門開啟。"},{"word":"trace","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to find or discover by investigation; a mark or sign left by something","chinese":"追蹤；查出；微量；痕跡","sentence":"Rescue officers used tracking dogs to ______ the missing hikers through the snowy canyon, following footprints along the riverbank.","translation":"搜救人員使用搜救犬沿著河岸的腳印，在白雪覆蓋的峽谷中【追蹤】失蹤登山客的行蹤。"},{"word":"realize","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to become fully aware of something as a fact; to fulfill a dream","chinese":"意識到；發覺；實現（夢想）","sentence":"After reviewing his monthly budget statement, Kevin began to ______ how much unnecessary money he had spent on restaurant takeout.","translation":"在審查了每月預算報表後，凱文開始【意識到】自己在餐廳外賣上花費了多少不必要的金錢。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"During exam week, diligent students must ______ their attention entirely on study materials rather than smartphones.","options":["aim","focus","trace","realize"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: focus (集中焦點) 【全文中譯】在考試週期間，勤奮的學生必須將注意力完全集中在學習資料上，而非智慧型手機。 【選項解析】(A) aim 瞄準 (B) focus 集中 (C) trace 追蹤 (D) realize 意識到。focus attention on 為固定搭配「集中注意力於…」。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Setting a measurable academic ______ at the start of the year helps high school students track their progress.","options":["goal","dot","row","case"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: goal (目標) 【全文中譯】在年初設定一個可衡量的學業目標，有助於高中生追蹤他們的進步情況。 【選項解析】(A) goal 目標 (B) dot 小圓點 (C) row 一排 (D) case 案件。academic goal 表學業目標。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The environmental campaign will ______ at reducing single-use plastic waste across all metropolitan subway stations.","options":["focus","aim","realize","trace"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: aim (旨在；致力於) 【全文中譯】這項環保活動旨在減少各大都會捷運站內一次性塑膠廢棄物的產生。 【選項解析】(A) focus 聚焦 (B) aim 旨在 (C) realize 實現 (D) trace 追蹤。aim at doing something 表「旨在做某事」。"},{"number":4,"stem":"The talented hunter fired his rifle with great precision and hit the bullseye of the distant wooden ______.","options":["target","case","dot","row"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: target (靶子；靶心) 【全文中譯】才華洋溢的獵人精準開槍，擊中了遠處木靶的靶心中心。 【選項解析】(A) target 靶子 (B) case 箱子 (C) dot 圓點 (D) row 一排。hit the target 表擊中靶子。"},{"number":5,"stem":"What specific ______ of computer software does your design firm use to create three-dimensional architectural models?","options":["row","type","dot","goal"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: type (類型；種類) 【全文中譯】你們的設計事務所使用哪種特定類型的電腦軟體來建立三維建築模型？ 【選項解析】(A) row 一行 (B) type 類型 (C) dot 點 (D) goal 目標。type of software 表軟體類型。"},{"number":6,"stem":"The experienced lawyer spent the entire weekend examining the criminal defense ______ before presenting it in court.","options":["dot","case","row","goal"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: case (訴訟案件；案情) 【全文中譯】經驗豐富的律師在出庭陳述之前，花費了整個週末審閱這起刑事辯護案件。 【選項解析】(A) dot 圓點 (B) case 案件 (C) row 一排 (D) goal 目標。defense case 指辯護案件。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The map showed capital cities marked with a large red ______ surrounded by a thin circular border.","options":["case","row","dot","goal"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: dot (小圓點) 【全文中譯】地圖上顯示首都城市均標記著一個被細圓圈包圍的大紅點。 【選項解析】(A) case 盒子 (B) row 一列 (C) dot 小圓點 (D) goal 目標。red dot 表紅色圓點。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The theater audience sat politely in the third ______ from the front stage to enjoy the opera performance.","options":["dot","row","case","target"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: row (一排座位) 【全文中譯】劇院觀眾有禮貌地坐在離前舞台第三排的座位上欣賞歌劇演出。 【選項解析】(A) dot 圓點 (B) row 一排 (C) case 案件 (D) target 目標。third row 表第三排。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Detectives worked with computer engineers to ______ the illegal email messages back to their foreign origin.","options":["trace","focus","aim","realize"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: trace (追蹤查出) 【全文中譯】刑警與電腦工程師聯手合作，追查非法電子郵件的源頭回到其外國發源地。 【選項解析】(A) trace 追蹤 (B) focus 集中 (C) aim 瞄準 (D) realize 實現。trace emails back to 表追查郵件來源。"},{"number":10,"stem":"It took several painful months for the injured athlete to ______ that his professional playing career was over.","options":["trace","aim","focus","realize"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: realize (意識到；認清事實) 【全文中譯】受傷的運動員經歷了幾個月痛苦的心理調適，才認清自己的職業選手生涯已經結束的事實。 【選項解析】(A) trace 追溯 (B) aim 瞄準 (C) focus 集中 (D) realize 意識到。realize the fact 表認清事實。"},{"number":11,"stem":"If you wish to take crisp photographs of flying birds, you must adjust the camera lens to ______ properly.","options":["focus","trace","realize","aim"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: focus (對焦) 【全文中譯】如果你想拍攝清晰的飛鳥照片，必須正確調節相機鏡頭以進行對焦。 【選項解析】(A) focus 對焦 (B) trace 追蹤 (C) realize 實現 (D) aim 瞄準。adjust lens to focus 表鏡頭對焦。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Scoring the winning ______ in the last thirty seconds of the soccer championship brought tears of joy to the coach.","options":["goal","dot","case","row"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: goal (進球得分) 【全文中譯】在足球冠軍錦標賽最後三十秒攻入致勝一球，讓教練流下了喜悅的眼淚。 【選項解析】(A) goal 進球得分 (B) dot 圓點 (C) case 案件 (D) row 一排。winning goal 表致勝球。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The new government tax policy will directly ______ luxury goods imported from international fashion houses.","options":["target","dot","row","case"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: target (鎖定；針對) 【全文中譯】政府的新稅收政策將直接鎖定針對從國際時尚精品店進口的奢華商品。 【選項解析】(A) target 鎖定/針對 (B) dot 點綴 (C) row 划船 (D) case 裝箱。target luxury goods 表鎖定奢華品徵稅。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Many elderly people prefer a traditional mechanical ______ of wristwatch over modern digital touchscreens.","options":["type","row","dot","case"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: type (款式；類型) 【全文中譯】許多長者相較於現代數位觸控螢幕，更偏愛傳統機械款式的腕錶。 【選項解析】(A) type 類型/款式 (B) row 一排 (C) dot 小點 (D) case 外殼。type of wristwatch 表腕錶款式。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The medical doctor reported an unusual ______ of tropical fever that had never been documented in this country.","options":["case","dot","row","goal"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: case (病例；病案) 【全文中譯】醫師報告了一起該國從未記載過的熱帶熱病罕見病例。 【選項解析】(A) case 病例 (B) dot 圓點 (C) row 一行 (D) goal 目標。unusual case of fever 表罕見發燒病例。"},{"number":16,"stem":"The ladybug displayed bright red wings adorned with several distinctive black ______ markings on its back.","options":["cases","dots","rows","goals"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: dots (斑點) 【全文中譯】瓢蟲展現出鮮紅色的翅膀，其背部點綴著幾顆醒目的黑色斑點斑紋。 【選項解析】(A) cases 箱子 (B) dots 斑點 (C) rows 排列 (D) goals 目標。black dot markings 表黑點斑紋。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Farmers planted corn in an orderly long ______ to allow modern harvesting tractors to navigate easily.","options":["case","row","dot","target"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: row (一壟一壟；成排) 【全文中譯】農夫將玉米種植成整齊的長排，以便現代收割拖拉機輕鬆穿行。 【選項解析】(A) case 盒子 (B) row 一排/一壟 (C) dot 點 (D) target 靶子。orderly long row 表整齊長排。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Forensics experts were able to ______ tiny microscopic fibers on the broken window back to the thief's jacket.","options":["trace","focus","aim","realize"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: trace (比對追溯) 【全文中譯】鑑識專家能夠追溯破窗上的微量纖維，比對查出其來自於竊賊的夾克。 【選項解析】(A) trace 追溯/查出 (B) focus 集中 (C) aim 瞄準 (D) realize 領會。trace fibers back to 表追查纖維源頭。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Working tirelessly for a decade allowed the young entrepreneur to ______ her dream of building an animal shelter.","options":["realize","trace","focus","aim"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: realize (實現夢想) 【全文中譯】十年不懈的奮鬥，使這位年輕創業家得以實現建造動物庇護所的夢想。 【選項解析】(A) realize 實現 (B) trace 追蹤 (C) focus 聚焦 (D) aim 旨在。realize one's dream 表實現某人夢想。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The charity organization will ______ its fundraising efforts towards building clean water wells in remote villages.","options":["focus","trace","realize","aim"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: focus (聚焦於) 【全文中譯】該慈善組織將把募款工作聚焦於為偏遠村莊建造乾淨的水井。 【選項解析】(A) focus 聚焦 (B) trace 追蹤 (C) realize 實現 (D) aim 瞄準。focus efforts towards 表將努力聚焦於。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Having a clear personal ______ in life provides motivation during difficult moments and gives direction to our choices.","options":["dot","goal","row","case"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: goal (人生目標) 【全文中譯】在人生中擁有明確的個人目標，能在艱難時刻給予我們前進的動力與抉擇的方向。 【選項解析】(A) dot 圓點 (B) goal 目標 (C) row 行列 (D) case 案件。personal goal 表個人目標。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Marketing surveys help companies identify which demographic ______ of consumers is most likely to buy their products.","options":["type","row","case","dot"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: type (客群類型) 【全文中譯】市場行銷調查協助企業找出哪種類型的消費者最有購買其產品的可能性。 【選項解析】(A) type 類型 (B) row 排列 (C) case 案例 (D) dot 點。demographic type of consumers 表消費者人口類型。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The judge ruled that the prosecutor had not presented enough evidence to prove the criminal ______ beyond reasonable doubt.","options":["case","row","dot","target"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: case (刑事案件) 【全文中譯】法官裁定檢察官未能提出充分證據以排除合理懷疑來證明這起刑事案件。 【選項解析】(A) case 案件 (B) row 一列 (C) dot 圓點 (D) target 靶標。criminal case 表刑事案件。"},{"number":24,"stem":"On the printed music sheet, each musical note is represented by a small black ______ placed upon horizontal lines.","options":["dot","row","case","goal"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: dot (音符圓點) 【全文中譯】在印刷五線譜上，每個音符均以放置在水平線上的小黑點來表示。 【選項解析】(A) dot 圓點 (B) row 一排 (C) case 盒子 (D) goal 得分。small black dot 表小黑點。"},{"number":25,"stem":"On weekends, tourists love to rent wooden boats and ______ lazily across the scenic surface of Sun Moon Lake.","options":["row","trace","focus","realize"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: row (划船) 【全文中譯】週末時，遊客喜歡租借木舟，在風景優美的日月潭湖面上悠閒划船。 【選項解析】(A) row 划船 (B) trace 追蹤 (C) focus 集中 (D) realize 意識到。row across the lake 表在湖面上划船。"}]},{"unit":78,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 78 (078.mp3) Topic Focus: Mental Perceptions, Cognitive Thought & Expressive Speech","topic":"Topic Focus: Mental Perceptions, Cognitive Thought & Expressive Speech | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"forgive (forgave / forgiven)","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to stop feeling angry or resentful towards someone for an offense","chinese":"原諒；寬恕","sentence":"Although Jack felt deeply hurt by his brother's harsh words, he chose to ______ him and restore their family harmony.","translation":"雖然傑克被哥哥嚴厲的話語深深傷害，但他選擇【原諒】他並恢復家庭和睦。"},{"word":"seem","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to give the impression of being something; to appear","chinese":"似乎；看起來好像","sentence":"The difficult math problems ______ very complicated at first glance, but they become much easier once you understand the formula.","translation":"這些數學難題乍看之下【似乎】非常複雜，但一旦你理解了公式，它們就會變得簡單許多。"},{"word":"assume","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to suppose to be the case without proof","chinese":"假定；設想；以為","sentence":"You should never ______ that a quiet person lacks opinions, because many thoughtful people simply prefer to listen carefully.","translation":"你絕不應該【以為】沉默的人沒有主見，因為許多有思想的人只是更喜歡仔細傾聽。"},{"word":"consider","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to think carefully about something, typically before making a decision","chinese":"考慮；斟酌；認為","sentence":"Before purchasing that expensive sports car, you must carefully ______ whether you can afford the monthly maintenance costs.","translation":"在購買那輛昂貴的跑車之前，你必須仔細【考慮】自己是否負擔得起每月的維護保養費用。"},{"word":"expect","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to regard something as likely to happen; to anticipate","chinese":"預期；期待；指望","sentence":"Meteorologists report that cold mountain winds are moving south, so residents should ______ heavy snowfall throughout the weekend.","translation":"氣象學家報告指出寒冷的山風正往南移動，因此居民們應【預期】整個週末都會降下大雪。"},{"word":"express","pos":"(v.) / (adj.) / (adv.)","definition":"to convey a thought or feeling in words or gestures; rapid","chinese":"表達；表示；快速的；特快","sentence":"Art classes in junior high school provide creative students with an ideal medium to ______ their complex inner emotions.","translation":"國中的美術課程為富有創造力的學生提供了一個理想的媒介，以【表達】他們複雜的內心感受。"},{"word":"inspire","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to fill someone with the urge or ability to do or feel something creative","chinese":"鼓舞；啟發；激勵","sentence":"The brave Paralympic athlete's triumphant life story continues to ______ millions of young people around the world.","translation":"那位殘奧勇敢運動員輝煌的人生故事，持續在全世界【激勵】著數百萬名年輕人。"},{"word":"promise","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to assure someone that one will definitely do something; an assurance","chinese":"承諾；答應；保證","sentence":"Before leaving for boarding school, the young boy made a sincere ______ to write letters to his parents every Sunday.","translation":"在啟程前往寄宿學校之前，那名小男孩鄭重地許下了【承諾】，保證每週日都會寫信給父母。"},{"word":"remind","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to cause someone to remember someone or something","chinese":"提醒；使想起","sentence":"Please set an alarm on your digital phone to ______ you to take your heart medication after eating dinner.","translation":"請在你的智慧型手機上設定鬧鐘，以【提醒】你在吃完晚餐後服用心臟藥物。"},{"word":"emphasize","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to give special importance or prominence to something in speaking or writing","chinese":"強調；著重","sentence":"Our English teacher repeatedly uses red markers on the whiteboard to ______ the importance of mastering irregular verbs.","translation":"我們的英文老師反覆在白板上使用紅色白板筆，以【強調】掌握不規則動詞的重要性。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Although Jack felt deeply hurt by his brother's harsh words, he chose to ______ him and restore their family harmony.","options":["seem","forgive","assume","expect"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: forgive (原諒；寬恕) 【全文中譯】雖然傑克被哥哥嚴厲的話語深深傷害，但他選擇原諒他並恢復家庭和睦。 【選項解析】(A) seem 似乎 (B) forgive 原諒 (C) assume 假設 (D) expect 期望。原諒傷人者用 forgive him。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The dark storm clouds gathered over the city, and the weather ______ to turn colder by the hour.","options":["seemed","forgave","assumed","inspired"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: seemed (看起來好像；似乎) 【全文中譯】烏黑的暴風雲籠罩著城市，天氣看起來似乎一小時比一小時更加寒冷。 【選項解析】(A) seemed 似乎 (B) forgave 原諒 (C) assumed 假定 (D) inspired 鼓舞。seemed to turn colder 表似乎變冷。"},{"number":3,"stem":"You should never ______ that everyone understands the project rules without checking with them directly.","options":["forgive","assume","seem","inspire"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: assume (未經查證便設想/以為) 【全文中譯】在未直接向大家確認前，你絕不應該主觀以為每個人都理解專案規則。 【選項解析】(A) forgive 原諒 (B) assume 假設/自以為 (C) seem 似乎 (D) inspire 激勵。自作主張假定用 assume that。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Before signing the long-term commercial lease, business owners must carefully ______ all potential financial risks.","options":["consider","forgive","seem","remind"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: consider (仔細考慮；審慎評估) 【全文中譯】在簽訂長期商業租約前，企業主必須仔細考慮評估所有潛在的財務風險。 【選項解析】(A) consider 考慮 (B) forgive 原諒 (C) seem 似乎 (D) remind 提醒。評估風險動詞用 consider risks。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Because of severe airport traffic delays during holidays, travelers should ______ longer waiting lines at security checkpoints.","options":["forgive","expect","seem","assume"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: expect (預期；料想) 【全文中譯】由於假期的嚴重航班延誤，旅客應該預期安檢處會有更長的等候隊伍。 【選項解析】(A) forgive 原諒 (B) expect 預料 (C) seem 似乎 (D) assume 假設。預期有排隊人潮用 expect waiting lines。"},{"number":6,"stem":"The shy poet found it much easier to ______ her deepest personal feelings through writing verses than through speaking.","options":["seem","assume","express","expect"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: express (表達感受) 【全文中譯】害羞的詩人發現，透過寫詩來表達自己深層的個人感受，比開口說話容易得多。 【選項解析】(A) seem 似乎 (B) assume 設想 (C) express 表達 (D) expect 期待。express feelings 表表達感情。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The teacher's passionate dedication to science managed to ______ generations of students to pursue medical careers.","options":["forgive","inspire","assume","seem"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: inspire (激勵；啟發) 【全文中譯】老師對科學的熱情奉獻，成功激勵了數代學生走上行醫之路。 【選項解析】(A) forgive 原諒 (B) inspire 激勵 (C) assume 假定 (D) seem 似乎。激勵學生用 inspire students。"},{"number":8,"stem":"If you give your word to a trusted friend, you must always keep your sacred ______ no matter what happens.","options":["promise","express","consider","remind"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: promise (諾言；保證) 【全文中譯】如果你向值得信賴的朋友許下承諾，無論發生什麼事都必須信守諾言。 【選項解析】(A) promise 承諾 (B) express 表達 (C) consider 考慮 (D) remind 提醒。keep one's promise 為固定搭配「信守承諾」。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The secretary sent an email to all department heads to ______ them about the emergency board meeting tomorrow.","options":["forgive","remind","seem","assume"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: remind (提醒) 【全文中譯】秘書寄電子郵件給所有部門主管，提醒他們明天召開緊急董事會會議。 【選項解析】(A) forgive 原諒 (B) remind 提醒 (C) seem 似乎 (D) assume 假定。remind someone about 表提醒某人某事。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Health guidelines consistently ______ that washing hands regularly with soap is the most effective defense against viruses.","options":["emphasize","forgive","seem","assume"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: emphasize (強調) 【全文中譯】健康指引始終強調，經常用肥皂洗手是對抗病毒最有效的防禦手段。 【選項解析】(A) emphasize 強調 (B) forgive 原諒 (C) seem 似乎 (D) assume 假定。強調某項事實用 emphasize that。"},{"number":11,"stem":"True spiritual peace comes when a person learns to ______ past wrongs and let go of bitter resentment.","options":["forgive","seem","assume","expect"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: forgive (原諒過去的錯誤) 【全文中譯】當一個人學會寬恕過去的錯誤並放下心中的痛苦怨恨時，真正的平靜才會降臨。 【選項解析】(A) forgive 寬恕 (B) seem 似乎 (C) assume 假設 (D) expect 期望。寬恕過錯用 forgive past wrongs。"},{"number":12,"stem":"To outside observers, the grand Victorian mansion ______ completely abandoned, yet a gentle light shone in the attic.","options":["assumed","seemed","forgave","expected"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: seemed (在外人看來似乎) 【全文中譯】對外來觀察者而言，這棟宏偉的維多利亞式宅邸看似完全荒廢，但閣樓裡卻亮著微光。 【選項解析】(A) assumed 假設 (B) seemed 似乎 (C) forgave 原諒 (D) expected 預期。外表看似用 seemed abandoned。"},{"number":13,"stem":"It is dangerous to ______ that a medication is safe simply because you can purchase it without a prescription.","options":["assume","forgive","seem","inspire"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: assume (貿然以為) 【全文中譯】僅僅因為無須處方箋就能買到，就貿然以為某種藥物是安全的，這是非常危險的。 【選項解析】(A) assume 貿然假定 (B) forgive 原諒 (C) seem 似乎 (D) inspire 激發。assume that a medication is safe 表貿然以為藥物安全。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The university admissions board will ______ applicants who demonstrate unique leadership outside of classroom studies.","options":["consider","forgive","seem","remind"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: consider (考量錄取) 【全文中譯】大學招生委員會將優先考量那些在課堂之外展現出獨特領導才能的申請者。 【選項解析】(A) consider 考量 (B) forgive 寬恕 (C) seem 似乎 (D) remind 提醒。審核考量候選人用 consider applicants。"},{"number":15,"stem":"With the economy growing steadily, financial analysts ______ consumer spending to rise during the fourth quarter.","options":["forgive","expect","seem","assume"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: expect (預期增長) 【全文中譯】隨著經濟穩定增長，金融分析師預期消費者支出將在第四季攀升。 【選項解析】(A) forgive 原諒 (B) expect 預期 (C) seem 似乎 (D) assume 假定。expect spending to rise 表預期支出增加。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Protesters gathered peacefully in front of city hall to ______ their dissatisfaction with rising public transit fares.","options":["express","seem","assume","forgive"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: express (表達不滿) 【全文中譯】抗議民眾和平地聚集在市政府大樓前，表達他們對大眾運輸票價調漲的不滿。 【選項解析】(A) express 表達 (B) seem 似乎 (C) assume 假設 (D) forgive 寬恕。express dissatisfaction 表表達不滿。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Visiting the ancient historical temples of Kyoto never fails to ______ artists with creative architectural ideas.","options":["forgive","inspire","seem","assume"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: inspire (啟發靈感) 【全文中譯】參觀京都古老的歷史寺廟，總能為藝術家帶來豐富的創意建築靈感。 【選項解析】(A) forgive 寬恕 (B) inspire 啟發 (C) seem 似乎 (D) assume 假定。啟發藝術家靈感用 inspire artists。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The politician made a public ______ to lower middle-class taxes if his political party won the majority vote.","options":["promise","remind","consider","express"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: promise (公開承諾) 【全文中譯】這位政客公開許下承諾，如果他的政黨贏得多數選票，將降低中產階級的稅收。 【選項解析】(A) promise 承諾 (B) remind 提醒 (C) consider 考慮 (D) express 表達。make a public promise 表做出公開承諾。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Looking at the yellowed photograph on the mantelpiece never failed to ______ grandfather of his youthful days.","options":["remind","forgive","seem","assume"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: remind (使想起；喚起記憶) 【全文中譯】看著壁爐架上泛黃的老照片，總會讓祖父想起自己年輕時的歲月。 【選項解析】(A) remind 使想起 (B) forgive 原諒 (C) seem 似乎 (D) assume 假定。remind someone of 表使某人想起。"},{"number":20,"stem":"Speech coaches repeatedly ______ that maintaining consistent eye contact with listeners builds immediate credibility.","options":["emphasize","forgive","seem","assume"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: emphasize (再三強調) 【全文中譯】演說教練再三強調，與聽眾保持持續的眼神接觸能迅速建立公信力。 【選項解析】(A) emphasize 強調 (B) forgive 原諒 (C) seem 似乎 (D) assume 假定。強調重點用 emphasize that。"},{"number":21,"stem":"It took immense emotional courage for the victim to ______ the reckless driver who caused the car accident.","options":["forgive","seem","assume","expect"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: forgive (寬恕肇事者) 【全文中譯】受害者展現了極大的心理勇氣，才原諒了造成這場車禍的魯莽駕駛。 【選項解析】(A) forgive 寬恕 (B) seem 似乎 (C) assume 假設 (D) expect 預料。寬恕過失者用 forgive the driver。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The complex computer coding problem ______ nearly impossible to solve until the programmer noticed a tiny syntax error.","options":["assumed","seemed","forgave","reminded"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: seemed (看似不可能) 【全文中譯】這個複雜的電腦程式問題看似幾乎不可能解決，直到程式設計師發現了一個微小的語法錯誤。 【選項解析】(A) assumed 假設 (B) seemed 似乎 (C) forgave 原諒 (D) reminded 提醒。seemed nearly impossible 表看似近乎不可能。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Never ______ that someone is angry just because their text message was short and did not include emojis.","options":["assume","forgive","seem","inspire"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: assume (臆測；妄斷) 【全文中譯】千萬不要僅因別人的簡訊很短且沒加表情符號，就武斷地以為對方在生氣。 【選項解析】(A) assume 妄斷/臆測 (B) forgive 原諒 (C) seem 似乎 (D) inspire 激發。assume someone is angry 表妄斷某人生氣。"},{"number":24,"stem":"We must ______ the environmental impact of industrial development before approving the new chemical refinery.","options":["consider","forgive","seem","remind"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: consider (審慎評估衝擊) 【全文中譯】在核准新的化學煉油廠之前，我們必須審慎評估工業發展對環境的衝擊。 【選項解析】(A) consider 審慎考慮 (B) forgive 寬恕 (C) seem 似乎 (D) remind 提醒。consider the impact 表評估衝擊。"},{"number":25,"stem":"School principals always ______ teachers to dress professionally and maintain high moral standards in the community.","options":["expect","forgive","seem","assume"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: expect (期望；要求) 【全文中譯】校長總是期望老師們穿著得體專業，並在社區中維持崇高的道德標準。 【選項解析】(A) expect 期望 (B) forgive 原諒 (C) seem 似乎 (D) assume 假定。expect someone to do something 表期望某人做到某事。"}]},{"unit":79,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 79 (079.mp3) Topic Focus: Psychological Reactions, Physical Strikes, Communication & Handling","topic":"Topic Focus: Psychological Reactions, Physical Strikes, Communication & Handling | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"compare","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to estimate, measure, or note the similarity or dissimilarity between","chinese":"比較；對照；比擬","sentence":"Consumer advocacy groups advise shoppers to ______ prices across several online platforms before making big purchases.","translation":"消費者權益倡導團體建議購物者在進行大宗消費之前，應先在數個網路平台之間【比較】價格。"},{"word":"confuse","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to make someone bewildered, perplexed, or unable to think clearly","chinese":"使困惑；使混亂；弄錯","sentence":"The twin brothers looked remarkably alike in their blue school uniforms, which continued to ______ their new math teacher.","translation":"這對雙胞胎兄弟穿著藍色校服時模樣驚人地相似，這讓他們的新數學老師持續感到【困惑】。"},{"word":"excite","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to cause strong feelings of enthusiasm, eagerness, or excitement","chinese":"使興奮；激起；刺激","sentence":"News of the upcoming musical concert featuring famous rock singers will definitely ______ thousands of teenagers across the city.","translation":"即將舉辦由著名搖滾歌手主演的音樂演唱會的消息，肯定會【使】全城數千名青少年【興奮】不已。"},{"word":"strike (struck / struck)","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to hit forcibly; an organized refusal to work by employees","chinese":"打擊；罷工；襲擊","sentence":"Railway workers decided to go on ______ this Monday morning to demand safer working environments and better compensation.","translation":"鐵路工人決定在週一上午發動【罷工】，以爭取更安全的工作環境與更佳的報酬。"},{"word":"effect","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a change which is a result or consequence of an action or other cause","chinese":"效果；影響；產生","sentence":"Scientists warn that excessive screen time before bedtime can have a very negative ______ on children's natural sleep cycles.","translation":"科學家警告，睡前過度使用螢幕會對兒童的自然睡眠週期產生極為負面的【影響】。"},{"word":"desire","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a strong feeling of wanting to have something or wishing for something","chinese":"渴望；慾望；期望","sentence":"From a very young age, Maria harbored a passionate ______ to become a medical doctor and serve impoverished rural communities.","translation":"從很小的時候起，瑪麗亞就懷著成為一名醫生並為貧困鄉村社區服務的熱切【渴望】。"},{"word":"cancel","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to decide or announce that a planned event will not take place","chinese":"取消；廢止","sentence":"Because an unexpected super typhoon was approaching the island, the airline was forced to ______ all domestic flights.","translation":"由於一場出乎意料的強烈颱風正逼近該島，航空公司不得不【取消】所有國內航班。"},{"word":"dial","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to call a telephone number; a face of a clock or gauge","chinese":"撥電話；刻度盤；儀表盤","sentence":"In cases of severe fire emergencies, citizens in Taiwan should immediately ______ 119 for immediate rescue assistance.","translation":"在發生嚴重火災緊急情況時，台灣民眾應立即【撥打】119 以尋求即刻的救援協助。"},{"word":"comb","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a toothed strip of plastic or metal used for styling hair; to search","chinese":"梳子；梳理頭髮；仔細搜查","sentence":"Before stepping onto the stage for his graduation speech, Kevin used a wooden ______ to arrange his messy hair neatly.","translation":"在步上舞台發表畢業演講之前，凱文用一把木【梳子】將凌亂的頭髮梳理整齊。"},{"word":"handle","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to manage or deal with; the part by which a thing is held","chinese":"處理；應對；把手；柄","sentence":"Experienced hotel managers know how to ______ angry customer complaints with calmness, patience, and professional diplomacy.","translation":"經驗豐富的飯店經理懂得如何以冷靜、耐心與專業圓融來【處理】憤怒顧客的抱怨。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Consumer advocacy groups advise shoppers to ______ prices across several online platforms before making big purchases.","options":["confuse","compare","cancel","excite"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: compare (比較比價) 【全文中譯】消保團體建議購物者在大額消費前，應先在數個網路平台之間比較價格。 【選項解析】(A) confuse 困惑 (B) compare 比較 (C) cancel 取消 (D) excite 興奮。compare prices 表比價。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The complex scientific terminology in the medical report only served to ______ the anxious patient even more.","options":["compare","confuse","cancel","dial"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: confuse (使困惑混亂) 【全文中譯】醫療報告中複雜的科學術語，只會讓焦慮的病患更加困惑不解。 【選項解析】(A) compare 比較 (B) confuse 使困惑 (C) cancel 取消 (D) dial 撥號。專業術語讓人混淆用 confuse the patient。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The announcement that tomorrow would be a snow holiday will surely ______ every student in the elementary school.","options":["cancel","dial","excite","compare"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: excite (使興奮雀躍) 【全文中譯】宣布明天放雪假的公告，肯定會讓小學裡的每位學生都興奮雀躍。 【選項解析】(A) cancel 取消 (B) dial 撥號 (C) excite 使興奮 (D) compare 比較。excite students 表讓學生感到興奮。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Union members voted overwhelmingly to go on ______ until factory management agreed to negotiate fair wages.","options":["strike","effect","desire","handle"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: strike (罷工行動) 【全文中譯】工會成員以壓倒性多數投票決定發動罷工，直到工廠資方同意協商公平工資為止。 【選項解析】(A) strike 罷工 (B) effect 效果 (C) desire 渴望 (D) handle 把手。go on strike 為固定搭配「舉行罷工」。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Regular cardiovascular exercise produces a noticeable positive ______ on long-term heart health and stamina.","options":["handle","effect","strike","desire"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: effect (正向效果；影響) 【全文中譯】規律的有氧運動對長期的心臟健康與體能耐力產生顯著的正向影響。 【選項解析】(A) handle 把手 (B) effect 效果 (C) strike 罷工 (D) desire 渴望。positive effect on 表對…的良好效果。"},{"number":6,"stem":"The passionate young musician felt an overwhelming ______ to compose symphonies that would touch listeners' souls.","options":["desire","effect","strike","handle"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: desire (內心渴望) 【全文中譯】充滿熱忱的年輕音樂家內心湧起強烈的渴望，想創作觸動聽眾心靈的交響樂。 【選項解析】(A) desire 渴望 (B) effect 影響 (C) strike 罷工 (D) handle 處置。an overwhelming desire 表強烈渴望。"},{"number":7,"stem":"Due to heavy thunderstorms and dangerous lightning, the athletic committee had to ______ the outdoor track meet.","options":["compare","dial","cancel","excite"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: cancel (取消賽事) 【全文中譯】由於強烈雷陣雨與危險閃電，體育委員會不得不取消戶外田徑比賽。 【選項解析】(A) compare 比較 (B) dial 撥號 (C) cancel 取消 (D) excite 激勵。取消戶外活動用 cancel meet。"},{"number":8,"stem":"If you suspect an intruder is trying to enter your home, you must immediately ______ the local emergency police number.","options":["dial","compare","cancel","confuse"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: dial (撥打電話) 【全文中譯】如果你懷疑有闖入者試圖進入家門，必須立即撥打當地緊急報警電話。 【選項解析】(A) dial 撥號 (B) compare 比較 (C) cancel 取消 (D) confuse 使困惑。撥打電話動詞用 dial。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The little girl reached into her backpack to retrieve a small plastic ______ so she could fix her ponytail.","options":["effect","comb","desire","strike"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: comb (梳子) 【全文中譯】小女孩把手伸進背包拿出一把小塑膠梳子，以便重新整理她的馬尾辮。 【選項解析】(A) effect 效果 (B) comb 梳子 (C) desire 慾望 (D) strike 罷工。整理頭髮的工具為 comb。"},{"number":10,"stem":"It takes extraordinary emotional maturity and tact to ______ intense diplomatic conflicts between foreign nations.","options":["cancel","dial","handle","confuse"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: handle (處理衝突；應對) 【全文中譯】妥善處理外國之間的激烈外交衝突，需要極高的情緒成熟度與圓融手腕。 【選項解析】(A) cancel 取消 (B) dial 撥號 (C) handle 處理 (D) confuse 困惑。處理衝突危機用 handle conflicts。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Financial advisors suggest that investors ______ the historical performance of various mutual funds before investing.","options":["compare","cancel","excite","dial"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: compare (比較績效) 【全文中譯】理財顧問建議投資人在投資前，應先比較各檔共同基金的歷史績效。 【選項解析】(A) compare 比較 (B) cancel 取消 (C) excite 興奮 (D) dial 撥號。compare performance 表比較表現。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Using two completely different names for the same software feature will easily ______ new users.","options":["compare","confuse","cancel","dial"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: confuse (使新手混淆) 【全文中譯】對同一個軟體功能使用兩種截然不同的名稱，很容易讓新用戶感到混淆。 【選項解析】(A) compare 比較 (B) confuse 混淆 (C) cancel 取消 (D) dial 撥打。confuse new users 表使新用戶混淆。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The thrilling soccer match in the international tournament will undoubtedly ______ sports fans across the nation.","options":["cancel","excite","compare","dial"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: excite (點燃熱情) 【全文中譯】這場國際錦標賽中的刺激足球對決，無疑將點燃全國體育迷的熱情。 【選項解析】(A) cancel 取消 (B) excite 激發 (C) compare 比較 (D) dial 撥號。excite sports fans 表讓球迷熱血沸騰。"},{"number":14,"stem":"A sudden lightning ______ struck the ancient oak tree in the town square, splitting its heavy trunk in half.","options":["strike","effect","handle","desire"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: strike (雷擊；襲擊) 【全文中譯】城鎮廣場上的古老橡樹遭到突如其來的雷擊，將粗壯的樹幹劈成兩半。 【選項解析】(A) strike 雷擊 (B) effect 效果 (C) handle 把手 (D) desire 慾望。lightning strike 表雷擊。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The immediate side ______ of the allergy medication made the patient feel unusually drowsy during afternoon classes.","options":["strike","effect","handle","desire"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: effect (藥物副作用) 【全文中譯】過敏藥物的即時副作用，使病患在下午的課堂上感到異常昏昏欲睡。 【選項解析】(A) strike 罷工 (B) effect 效果/副作用 (C) handle 把手 (D) desire 渴望。side effect 表副作用。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Having lived in a cold climate all his life, Robert had a strong ______ to relocate to a warm tropical beach town.","options":["desire","effect","strike","handle"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: desire (移居渴望) 【全文中譯】一生都住在寒冷氣候地區的羅伯特，強烈渴望能搬到溫暖的熱帶海濱小鎮。 【選項解析】(A) desire 渴望 (B) effect 效果 (C) strike 襲擊 (D) handle 握柄。strong desire 表強烈渴望。"},{"number":17,"stem":"If your business meeting is delayed, please notify the hotel front desk immediately so they can ______ your reservation.","options":["cancel","excite","compare","confuse"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: cancel (取消訂房) 【全文中譯】如果你的商務會議延期，請立即通知飯店櫃檯以便取消你的訂房預約。 【選項解析】(A) cancel 取消 (B) excite 興奮 (C) compare 比較 (D) confuse 混淆。cancel reservation 表取消預約。"},{"number":18,"stem":"In the 1980s, people had to turn a circular mechanical wheel to ______ telephone numbers on landline phones.","options":["dial","cancel","compare","excite"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: dial (轉盤撥號) 【全文中譯】在1980年代，人們在室內電話上必須轉動機械旋轉盤來撥打電話號碼。 【選項解析】(A) dial 撥打 (B) cancel 取消 (C) compare 比較 (D) excite 興奮。撥號電話為 dial telephone numbers。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Grandfather took a tortoiseshell ______ from his vest pocket and smoothed his gray mustache before taking the family photo.","options":["comb","handle","strike","effect"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: comb (玳瑁梳) 【全文中譯】祖父從背心口袋拿出一把玳瑁梳子，在拍全家福前理了理花白的鬍子。 【選項解析】(A) comb 梳子 (B) handle 把手 (C) strike 罷工 (D) effect 效果。梳理鬍鬚的梳子為 comb。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The airline customer service agent was praised for her ability to ______ difficult flight delays with exceptional grace.","options":["handle","cancel","compare","dial"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: handle (應對處理延誤危機) 【全文中譯】航空公司客服人員因以非凡的優雅應對處理棘手的航班延誤而受到稱讚。 【選項解析】(A) handle 處置 (B) cancel 取消 (C) compare 比較 (D) dial 撥號。應對處理延誤用 handle delays。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Scientists ______ satellite images from five years ago with current maps to measure the alarming rate of polar ice melting.","options":["compare","cancel","confuse","dial"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: compare (對比衛星圖) 【全文中譯】科學家將五年前的衛星影像與現行地圖進行比對，以衡量極地冰川融化的驚人速度。 【選項解析】(A) compare 比對 (B) cancel 取消 (C) confuse 弄亂 (D) dial 撥號。比對圖像用 compare images。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Don't ______ me with conflicting directions when I am already nervous driving through unfamiliar city traffic.","options":["confuse","compare","cancel","excite"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: confuse (混淆方向指示) 【全文中譯】當我開車穿過陌生的城市交通本已緊張時，別再用互相矛盾的方向指示搞得我一頭霧水了。 【選項解析】(A) confuse 使混亂 (B) compare 比較 (C) cancel 取消 (D) excite 激動。搞得人混淆用 confuse me。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The brass door ______ was polished to a bright shine and felt cold to the touch on winter mornings.","options":["handle","strike","effect","desire"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: handle (門把手) 【全文中譯】黃銅門把手被擦得閃閃發亮，在冬天的早晨摸起來冰涼刺骨。 【選項解析】(A) handle 門把 (B) strike 罷工 (C) effect 效果 (D) desire 渴望。door handle 表門把手。"},{"number":24,"stem":"A devastating clock tower ______ damaged the historic building during the midnight aerial bombardment.","options":["strike","handle","effect","desire"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: strike (空中空襲；打擊) 【全文中譯】午夜空襲轟炸期間，鐘樓遭遇了毀滅性的空襲打擊，損壞了這座歷史古蹟。 【選項解析】(A) strike 空襲/打擊 (B) handle 把手 (C) effect 效果 (D) desire 渴望。aerial strike 表空中襲擊。"},{"number":25,"stem":"The positive psychological ______ of volunteer community service on adolescent self-confidence is well documented.","options":["effect","handle","strike","desire"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: effect (心理效果) 【全文中譯】志工社區服務對青少年自信心產生的正面心理效果，在文獻中已有充分記載。 【選項解析】(A) effect 效果 (B) handle 把手 (C) strike 罷工 (D) desire 渴望。psychological effect 表心理效果。"}]},{"unit":80,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 80 (080.mp3) Topic Focus: Daily Tasks, Clothing, Speech, Delivery & Problem Solving","topic":"Topic Focus: Daily Tasks, Clothing, Speech, Delivery & Problem Solving | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"button","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a small disc used to fasten clothes; to fasten clothes","chinese":"鈕扣；按鈕；扣上鈕扣","sentence":"Before stepping out into the chilly winter wind, remember to securely ______ your wool coat up to your neck.","translation":"在踏入刺骨的冬風之前，請記得將你的羊毛大衣【扣上鈕扣】一路扣到脖子。"},{"word":"fit (fit / fit)","pos":"(v.) / (adj.)","definition":"to be of the right size or shape for; in good physical health","chinese":"合身；合適；健康的","sentence":"The stylish leather jacket was too small to ______ Jason comfortably, so he had to exchange it for a larger size.","translation":"那件時尚的皮夾克太小了不【合身】，傑森穿起來不舒服，所以他只得換成更大的尺寸。"},{"word":"pronounce","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to make the sound of a word or letter in a particular way","chinese":"發音；讀音；宣判","sentence":"Foreign language students often find it challenging to correctly ______ French words with silent final consonants.","translation":"外語學生經常發現在遇到結尾有不發音子音的法語單字時，要正確地【發音】是相當具有挑戰性的。"},{"word":"deliver","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to bring and hand over a letter, parcel, or goods to the proper recipient","chinese":"遞送；運送；發表（演說）","sentence":"The friendly courier promised to ______ the urgent legal documents directly to the client's office before noon.","translation":"親切的快遞員保證會在中午之前將這份緊急法律文件直接【遞送】到客戶的辦公室。"},{"word":"receive","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to be given, presented with, or paid something","chinese":"收到；接收；得到","sentence":"Every registered participant in the academic conference will ______ an official certificate of completion and study materials.","translation":"學術研討會的每位註冊與會者都將【收到】一份正式的結業證書與學習教材。"},{"word":"depend","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to be determined or decided by something else; to rely on","chinese":"取決於；依賴；依靠","sentence":"Whether our high school baseball team can practice outdoors this afternoon will completely ______ on the weather conditions.","translation":"我們高中棒球隊今天下午能否在室外進行練球，將完全【取決於】天氣狀況。"},{"word":"guard","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to watch over in order to protect or control; a protector","chinese":"守衛；保衛；警衛","sentence":"Two armed security officers were hired by the national museum to ______ the priceless diamond exhibition day and night.","translation":"國家博物館聘請了兩名武裝警衛人員，日夜【守衛】這場價值連城的鑽石展覽。"},{"word":"rent","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to pay someone for the use of something; a regular payment","chinese":"租用；出租；租金","sentence":"During their summer road trip along the Pacific coast, the college students decided to ______ a camper van.","translation":"在沿著太平洋海岸進行夏季公路旅行期間，大學生們決定【租用】一輛露營車。"},{"word":"solve","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to find an answer to, explanation for, or means of dealing with a problem","chinese":"解決；解答；解開","sentence":"Dedicated environmental engineers are working hard to ______ the serious groundwater pollution problem in this industrial town.","translation":"敬業的環境工程師們正努力工作，以【解決】這個工業城鎮嚴重的地下水污染問題。"},{"word":"solution","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a means of solving a problem or dealing with a difficult situation","chinese":"解決方法；解答；溶液","sentence":"Installing solar panels on the school roof provided an eco-friendly and cost-effective ______ for high electricity bills.","translation":"在學校屋頂安裝太陽能電池板，為高昂的電費帳單提供了一個環保且具成本效益的【解決方法】。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Before stepping out into the chilly winter wind, remember to securely ______ your wool coat up to your neck.","options":["deliver","button","solve","pronounce"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: button (扣上鈕扣) 【全文中譯】在踏入刺骨冬風前，請記得把羊毛大衣一路扣到脖子。 【選項解析】(A) deliver 運送 (B) button 扣上 (C) solve 解決 (D) pronounce 發音。扣上大衣扣子用 button your coat。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The vintage jeans were tailored perfectly and managed to ______ grandfather just as they did thirty years ago.","options":["button","deliver","fit","rent"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: fit (合身；合適尺寸) 【全文中譯】這條復古牛仔褲裁剪得非常完美，穿在祖父身上依然像三十年前那樣合身。 【選項解析】(A) button 扣上 (B) deliver 遞送 (C) fit 合身 (D) rent 租用。衣服尺寸合身用 fit。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The English teacher spent twenty minutes demonstrating how to ______ difficult vowel sounds in the phonetic alphabet.","options":["pronounce","button","deliver","rent"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pronounce (發音；讀音) 【全文中譯】英語老師花了二十分鐘示範如何正確發出音標中困難的母音音素。 【選項解析】(A) pronounce 發音 (B) button 扣上 (C) deliver 發表 (D) rent 租賃。發出單字讀音用 pronounce vowel sounds。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Online grocery services allow customers to order fresh organic vegetables and have them ______ right to their doorstep.","options":["fit","delivered","solved","guarded"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: delivered (宅配運送) 【全文中譯】線上生鮮雜貨服務讓顧客能訂購新鮮有機蔬菜，並直接宅配運送到家門口。 【選項解析】(A) fit 合身 (B) delivered 運送 (C) solved 解決 (D) guarded 看守。物品宅配到府用 have them delivered。"},{"number":5,"stem":"If you submit your university application before the deadline, you will ______ a confirmation email from admissions.","options":["guard","receive","rent","deliver"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: receive (收到；接收) 【全文中譯】如果你在截止日期前提交大學申請，將會收到來自招生處的確認電子郵件。 【選項解析】(A) guard 守衛 (B) receive 收到 (C) rent 租用 (D) deliver 遞送。收到信件用 receive email。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Successful career advancement will greatly ______ upon your continuous dedication to learning modern technical skills.","options":["pronounce","depend","button","solve"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: depend (取決於；依賴) 【全文中譯】職場上的成功晉升，將極大程度取決於你對學習現代技術技能的持續投入。 【選項解析】(A) pronounce 發音 (B) depend 取決於 (C) button 扣上 (D) solve 解決。depend upon 為固定搭配「取決於…」。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The royal palace has trained bodyguards who ______ the king and queen whenever they appear at public events.","options":["guard","rent","fit","deliver"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: guard (守衛；保護) 【全文中譯】皇宮配備了訓練有素的保鑣，每當國王和王后出席公開活動時便貼身護衛。 【選項解析】(A) guard 保護 (B) rent 租用 (C) fit 合身 (D) deliver 遞送。保護皇室安全用 guard the king。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Instead of purchasing an expensive formal tuxedo for prom night, Samuel chose to ______ one from a local tailor.","options":["pronounce","guard","rent","solve"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: rent (租用禮服) 【全文中譯】塞繆爾沒有為畢業舞會購買昂貴的正式燕尾服，而是選擇向當地裁縫店租了一套。 【選項解析】(A) pronounce 發音 (B) guard 守衛 (C) rent 租用 (D) solve 解決。租借衣服動詞用 rent。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The brilliant detective gathered all forensic clues together in order to ______ the mysterious bank robbery.","options":["solve","button","rent","pronounce"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: solve (偵破；解開謎團) 【全文中譯】才華出眾的刑警匯集了所有鑑識線索，以偵破這起神秘的銀行搶案。 【選項解析】(A) solve 偵破 (B) button 扣上 (C) rent 租賃 (D) pronounce 宣判。偵破刑案用 solve the robbery。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Investing heavily in public transit infrastructure offers a sustainable ______ to chronic urban traffic congestion.","options":["button","guard","rent","solution"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: solution (解決之道；解方) 【全文中譯】大舉投資大眾運輸基礎設施，為長期的都市交通壅塞提供了永續的解決方案。 【選項解析】(A) button 鈕扣 (B) guard 警衛 (C) rent 租金 (D) solution 解方。sustainable solution 表永續解方。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Press the flashing red ______ on the kitchen blender to stop the spinning blades immediately.","options":["button","guard","solution","rent"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: button (按鈕) 【全文中譯】按下廚房果汁機上閃爍的紅鈕，即可立即停止旋轉刀片。 【選項解析】(A) button 按鈕 (B) guard 警衛 (C) solution 溶液 (D) rent 租金。機器開關按鈕為 button。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Regular cardiovascular exercise keeps athletes ______ and prepared for rigorous athletic tournaments.","options":["fit","rented","guarded","solved"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: fit (健壯體魄；健康) 【全文中譯】規律的有氧運動讓運動員保持體魄健壯，並為嚴格的體育錦標賽做好準備。 【選項解析】(A) fit 健美的 (B) rented 租賃的 (C) guarded 受防範的 (D) solved 已解決的。keep fit 表保持身體健康健美。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Can you please help me ______ the name of this traditional Polish dish written on the menu?","options":["pronounce","rent","button","guard"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pronounce (唸出；讀出發音) 【全文中譯】你能幫我唸出菜單上寫的這個傳統波蘭菜的名稱嗎？ 【選項解析】(A) pronounce 發音 (B) rent 租用 (C) button 扣上 (D) guard 守護。唸出單字用 pronounce the name。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The post office postal truck arrives at our neighborhood every afternoon to ______ incoming letters.","options":["pronounce","deliver","guard","solve"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: deliver (投遞信件) 【全文中譯】郵局郵務車每天下午抵達我們社區以投遞送達信件。 【選項解析】(A) pronounce 宣判 (B) deliver 投遞 (C) guard 看守 (D) solve 解決。郵差送信為 deliver letters。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The charity was overjoyed to ______ a generous million-dollar donation from an anonymous community benefactor.","options":["receive","button","guard","deliver"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: receive (接收捐款) 【全文中譯】該慈善機構欣喜地收到了來自一位匿名社區善心人士的百萬美元慷慨捐款。 【選項解析】(A) receive 接受/收到 (B) button 扣上 (C) guard 保衛 (D) deliver 運送。接受捐款用 receive donation。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Young children ______ heavily upon their parents for emotional comfort, nourishing food, and safe shelter.","options":["depend","pronounce","solve","button"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: depend (仰賴父母) 【全文中譯】幼童在情感安慰、營養食物與安全庇護方面均高度依賴父母。 【選項解析】(A) depend 依賴 (B) pronounce 發音 (C) solve 解決 (D) button 扣上。depend heavily upon 表高度仰賴。"},{"number":17,"stem":"A fierce German shepherd stood behind the iron gate to ______ the industrial warehouse against unauthorized intruders.","options":["guard","deliver","rent","fit"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: guard (看守倉庫) 【全文中譯】一隻兇猛的德國牧羊犬站在鐵門後，看守工業倉庫防止未經授權的闖入者進入。 【選項解析】(A) guard 看守 (B) deliver 送達 (C) rent 租賃 (D) fit 合身。看守倉庫動詞用 guard the warehouse。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The monthly ______ for a two-bedroom apartment in Taipei has risen noticeably over the past three years.","options":["rent","button","guard","solution"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: rent (房屋租金) 【全文中譯】在過去三年中，台北兩房公寓的每月租金顯著上漲。 【選項解析】(A) rent 租金 (B) button 鈕扣 (C) guard 警衛 (D) solution 溶液。monthly rent 表每月租金。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Working cooperatively in small study groups helps high school students ______ complicated algebra equations.","options":["solve","rent","guard","button"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: solve (解題；解答方程式) 【全文中譯】在小讀書會中合作學習，有助於高中生解答複雜的代數方程式。 【選項解析】(A) solve 解答 (B) rent 租用 (C) guard 守望 (D) button 扣上。解答方程式用 solve equations。"},{"number":20,"stem":"Scientists around the world are collaborating to discover an innovative ______ for plastic ocean waste.","options":["solution","button","guard","rent"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: solution (創新解決方案) 【全文中譯】全球各國科學家攜手合作，致力於找出解決海洋塑膠廢棄物的創新解方。 【選項解析】(A) solution 解方 (B) button 按鈕 (C) guard 警衛 (D) rent 租金。innovative solution 表創新解方。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The formal dress shirt lost a pearl ______ from its sleeve, so Amanda sewed on a matching replacement.","options":["button","guard","solution","rent"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: button (衣服珍珠鈕扣) 【全文中譯】這件正式襯衫的袖口掉了一顆珍珠鈕扣，因此阿曼達縫上了一顆相配的備用扣。 【選項解析】(A) button 鈕扣 (B) guard 警衛 (C) solution 解方 (D) rent 租金。pearl button 表珍珠鈕扣。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Because that large sofa will not ______ through the narrow living room doorway, we must disassemble its legs.","options":["fit","deliver","guard","pronounce"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: fit (穿過；放得進) 【全文中譯】因為那張大沙發過不去客廳狹窄的門口，我們只得把沙發腳拆卸下來。 【選項解析】(A) fit 穿過/容得下 (B) deliver 送達 (C) guard 防範 (D) pronounce 發音。fit through doorway 表穿得過門口。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The judge took the stand to formally ______ the legal verdict in the highly publicized corporate fraud case.","options":["pronounce","rent","button","solve"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pronounce (法庭正式宣判判決) 【全文中譯】法官走上法官席，在這起備受矚目的企業詐欺案件中正式宣讀法律判決。 【選項解析】(A) pronounce 宣判 (B) rent 出租 (C) button 扣緊 (D) solve 破解。pronounce verdict 表宣讀判決。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The university professor was invited to ______ the keynote speech at the annual international literature symposium.","options":["deliver","rent","guard","fit"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: deliver (發表專題演講) 【全文中譯】這位大學教授受邀在年度國際文學研討會上發表專題演講。 【選項解析】(A) deliver 發表演講 (B) rent 租賃 (C) guard 看守 (D) fit 合身。deliver a keynote speech 表發表專題演講。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Finding a permanent ______ to global climate change requires international treaties and renewable energy adoption.","options":["solution","button","guard","rent"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: solution (全球氣候問題的長久解方) 【全文中譯】為全球氣候變遷找出長久解決方案，需要簽署國際條約並採用再生能源。 【選項解析】(A) solution 解法 (B) button 紐扣 (C) guard 衛兵 (D) rent 租金。permanent solution 表長久解決方案。"}]},{"unit":81,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 81 (081.mp3) Topic Focus: Physical Actions, Movement Dynamics & Natural Phenomena","topic":"Topic Focus: Physical Actions, Movement Dynamics & Natural Phenomena | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"include","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to contain or make someone or something part of a group","chinese":"包含；包括","sentence":"The full registration fee will ______ all seminar materials and warm buffet lunches, but hotel rooms must be booked separately.","translation":"全額註冊費將會包含所有研討會資料和熱騰騰的自助午餐，但飯店房間必須分開預訂。"},{"word":"mix","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to combine different things together; a combination","chinese":"混合；混合物","sentence":"You should gently ______ the fresh flour and eggs in a large glass bowl before you add milk to bake the cake.","translation":"在加入牛奶烘烤蛋糕之前，你應該先在一個大玻璃碗中輕輕混合新鮮麵粉和雞蛋。"},{"word":"rise (rise / rose / risen)","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to move upwards; to increase in level or amount","chinese":"上升；升起","sentence":"When morning comes over the eastern hills, the bright sun begins to ______ slowly, and songbirds start singing loudly in the forest.","translation":"當清晨降臨在東方山丘上時，明亮的太陽開始緩緩升起，而鳴鳥也開始在森林中大聲歌唱。"},{"word":"rub (rub / rubbed / rubbed)","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to move your hand or an object back and forth across a surface","chinese":"摩擦；搓揉","sentence":"Because the cold winter wind made his hands freeze, Jimmy had to ______ his palms together quickly to produce some warmth.","translation":"因為寒冷的冬風讓他的雙手凍僵，吉米不得不迅速搓揉手掌以產生些許溫暖。"},{"word":"shoot (shoot / shot / shot)","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to fire a bullet or arrow; to kick or hit a ball toward a goal","chinese":"射擊；發射；射門","sentence":"The brave soldier received a strict military command not to ______ his rifle unless the enemy forces entered the border zone.","translation":"這位英勇的士兵接到了嚴格的軍事命令，除非敵軍進入邊境地帶，否則不得發射步槍。"},{"word":"shock","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a sudden violent shaking; a state of extreme surprise","chinese":"震驚；使震驚","sentence":"The tragic news of the plane crash came as a terrible ______ to everyone in town, and neighbors gathered in tears to support the family.","translation":"空難的悲慘消息給鎮上的每個人帶來極大的震驚，鄰居們含著淚水聚集在一起支持家屬。"},{"word":"shine (shine / shone / shone)","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to produce or reflect light; brightness","chinese":"發光；照耀","sentence":"After three rainy days on the island, the afternoon sun began to ______ through the clouds, and children ran outside happily.","translation":"在島上下了三天的雨之後，午後的陽光開始穿透雲層照耀，孩子們高興地跑到戶外玩耍。"},{"word":"print","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to produce words or pictures on paper using a machine","chinese":"印刷；列印","sentence":"Before the board meeting begins tomorrow morning, our office secretary needs to ______ thirty copies of the annual financial report.","translation":"在明天早上的董事會開始之前，我們的辦公室秘書需要列印三十份年度財務報告。"},{"word":"printer","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a machine connected to a computer for producing text or pictures","chinese":"印表機","sentence":"Our department purchased a high-speed laser ______ yesterday, and it works quietly and saves lots of valuable time for our staff.","translation":"我們部門昨天採購了一台高速雷射印表機，它運作安靜且為我們的員工節省了許多寶貴的時間。"},{"word":"burst (burst / burst / burst)","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to break open suddenly and violently; a sudden display","chinese":"爆裂；突然爆發","sentence":"The red party balloon was blown up too large by the careless boy, and it suddenly ______ with a very loud noise.","translation":"那個粗心的小男孩把紅色的派對氣球吹得太大了，結果它突然爆裂並發出很大的聲響。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The travel package to Tokyo will ______ round-trip flight tickets and four nights at a downtown hotel, so travelers don't need to worry.","options":["include","mix","rise","rub"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: include (包含；包括) 【全文中譯】前往東京的旅遊套裝行程將會包含來回機票和市區飯店四晚住宿，因此旅客無需擔心。 【選項解析】(A) include 包含 (B) mix 混合 (C) rise 上升 (D) rub 摩擦。行程包含機票住宿，選 include。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The young basketball player tried to ______ the ball from behind the three-point line, and the whole crowd cheered when it went in.","options":["print","shoot","burst","include"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: shoot (投籃；射門) 【全文中譯】那位年輕的籃球員試圖在三分線外投籃，當球投進時全場觀眾都歡呼雀躍。 【選項解析】(A) print 列印 (B) shoot 投籃/射擊 (C) burst 爆裂 (D) include 包含。三分線外出手投籃，選 shoot。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The loud explosion of the factory tire ______ with a sharp bang, and several nearby window panes were completely shattered.","options":["rubbed","mixed","burst","shone"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: burst (爆裂) 【全文中譯】工廠輪胎的劇烈爆裂發出尖銳巨響，附近幾扇玻璃窗被徹底震碎。 【選項解析】(A) rubbed 搓揉 (B) mixed 混合 (C) burst 爆裂 (D) shone 照耀。輪胎突然爆裂發出巨響，選 burst。"},{"number":4,"stem":"If you want to make delicious vegetable soup, you should ______ fresh carrots, sweet corn, and chicken broth in a large boiling pot.","options":["rub","mix","rise","shoot"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: mix (混合) 【全文中譯】如果你想煮美味的蔬菜湯，你應該在一個大湯鍋裡將新鮮胡蘿蔔、甜玉米和雞湯混合在一起。 【選項解析】(A) rub 摩擦 (B) mix 混合 (C) rise 上升 (D) shoot 射擊。烹飪時混合食材，選 mix。"},{"number":5,"stem":"When the temperature drops below zero on high mountains, the morning mist will disappear as the bright sun begins to ______.","options":["rise","print","burst","rub"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: rise (升起) 【全文中譯】當高山上的氣溫降至零度以下時，晨霧會隨著明亮的太陽開始升起而漸漸消散。 【選項解析】(A) rise 升起 (B) print 列印 (C) burst 爆裂 (D) rub 搓揉。太陽升起用 rise。"},{"number":6,"stem":"His shoes were covered with dry dust after hiking along the dirt path, so he used a soft cloth to ______ them thoroughly.","options":["shoot","mix","rub","include"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: rub (擦拭；搓揉) 【全文中譯】沿著泥土小徑健行後他的鞋子沾滿了乾灰塵，所以他用一塊軟布徹底擦拭乾淨。 【選項解析】(A) shoot 射擊 (B) mix 混合 (C) rub 擦拭 (D) include 包含。用布擦拭鞋子，選 rub。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The teacher asked the class assistant to ______ fifty copies of the reading worksheet so that every student could practice today.","options":["include","burst","mix","print"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: print (列印；印刷) 【全文中譯】老師請課堂助教列印五十份閱讀學習單，以便每位學生今天都能練習。 【選項解析】(A) include 包含 (B) burst 爆裂 (C) mix 混合 (D) print 列印。印學習單副本，選 print。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The stars in the dark country night began to ______ brightly like tiny diamonds across the vast open sky.","options":["shoot","shine","rub","rise"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: shine (照耀；發光) 【全文中譯】鄉村黑夜裡的繁星開始像微小的鑽石般在廣闊的夜空中閃閃發光。 【選項解析】(A) shoot 發射 (B) shine 發光 (C) rub 摩擦 (D) rise 升起。星星閃爍發光，選 shine。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The sudden death of the talented young singer came as a tremendous ______ to millions of loyal fans around the world.","options":["shock","printer","mix","burst"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: shock (震驚) 【全文中譯】這位才華橫溢的年輕歌手突然去世，給全世界數百萬忠實歌迷帶來了巨大的震驚。 【選項解析】(A) shock 震驚 (B) printer 印表機 (C) mix 混合物 (D) burst 爆發。噩耗帶來極大震驚，選 shock。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Our company bought a brand-new color ______ this morning because the old machine kept jamming paper during important print jobs.","options":["shock","printer","mix","burst"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: printer (印表機) 【全文中譯】我們公司今天早上買了一台全新的彩色印表機，因為舊機器在重要列印作業中老是卡紙。 【選項解析】(A) shock 震驚 (B) printer 印表機 (C) mix 混合物 (D) burst 爆破。由 print jobs 與 jamming paper 可知是印表機 printer。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Don't ______ oil and water together in that glass jar because they will naturally separate into two distinct layers.","options":["include","mix","rub","shoot"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: mix (混合) 【全文中譯】不要把油和水在那個玻璃罐裡混合在一起，因為它們會自然分成兩個不同的層次。 【選項解析】(A) include 包含 (B) mix 混合 (C) rub 摩擦 (D) shoot 射擊。油水不相溶，不可 mix。"},{"number":12,"stem":"As economic development continues rapidly in the city, housing prices are expected to ______ significantly over the next two years.","options":["print","mix","rise","burst"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: rise (上漲；上升) 【全文中譯】隨著該市經濟持續快速發展，預計未來兩年房價將大幅上漲。 【選項解析】(A) print 列印 (B) mix 混合 (C) rise 上漲 (D) burst 爆裂。房價上漲用 rise。"},{"number":13,"stem":"When you wash your hands before dinner, you should ______ soap onto your skin for at least twenty seconds to kill harmful germs.","options":["rub","shoot","shine","include"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: rub (搓揉) 【全文中譯】晚餐前洗手時，你應該在皮膚上搓揉肥皂至少二十秒以殺死有害細菌。 【選項解析】(A) rub 搓揉 (B) shoot 射擊 (C) shine 發光 (D) include 包含。洗手搓揉肥皂用 rub。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The hunter decided not to ______ the deer because it was walking peacefully with its two newborn fawns in the meadow.","options":["include","shoot","mix","print"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: shoot (射擊) 【全文中譯】獵人決定不射殺那隻鹿，因為牠正帶著兩隻剛出生的小鹿在草地上平靜地漫步。 【選項解析】(A) include 包含 (B) shoot 射擊 (C) mix 混合 (D) print 列印。獵人不開槍射擊，選 shoot。"},{"number":15,"stem":"When the cheerful comedian entered the stage in a funny costume, the entire audience ______ into continuous laughter.","options":["rubbed","printed","mixed","burst"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: burst (突然爆發) 【全文中譯】當滑稽的喜劇演員穿著搞笑服裝登場時，全場觀眾頓時爆發出連綿不斷的笑聲。 【選項解析】(A) rubbed 摩擦 (B) printed 列印 (C) mixed 混合 (D) burst 突然爆發。burst into laughter 為常見片語。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Does this university summer course ______ practical laboratory experiments, or does it only consist of classroom lectures?","options":["mix","rub","include","shoot"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: include (包含) 【全文中譯】這門大學暑期課程是否包含實際的實驗室實驗，還是僅由課堂講授組成？ 【選項解析】(A) mix 混合 (B) rub 搓揉 (C) include 包含 (D) shoot 拍攝。課程內容是否包含，選 include。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Her diamond necklace caught the stage lighting and seemed to ______ with dazzling brilliance throughout the whole musical concert.","options":["shine","burst","rub","print"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: shine (閃耀) 【全文中譯】她的鑽石項鍊捕捉到了舞台燈光，在整場音樂會中似乎都散發著耀眼的光芒。 【選項解析】(A) shine 閃耀 (B) burst 爆裂 (C) rub 摩擦 (D) print 列印。珠寶閃耀發光，選 shine。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The sudden power outage caused by the lightning storm gave our computer system a huge ______ and damaged several files.","options":["mix","shock","printer","burst"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: shock (衝擊；震動) 【全文中譯】雷雨引起的突然停電給我們的電腦系統帶來了巨大的衝擊並損壞了幾個檔案。 【選項解析】(A) mix 混合物 (B) shock 衝擊/震驚 (C) printer 印表機 (D) burst 爆發。系統受電力衝擊，選 shock。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Before you send the final draft to our chief editor, please check whether the wireless ______ has enough ink and paper loaded.","options":["printer","shock","burst","mix"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: printer (印表機) 【全文中譯】在把最終稿件寄給我們的主編之前，請檢查無線印表機是否已裝入足夠的墨水和紙張。 【選項解析】(A) printer 印表機 (B) shock 震驚 (C) burst 爆裂 (D) mix 混合物。裝墨水與紙張的設備是 printer。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The local government decided to ______ a small handbook containing emergency contact numbers and distribute it to all residents.","options":["mix","rub","print","burst"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: print (印製；列印) 【全文中譯】地方政府決定印製一本包含緊急聯絡電話的小手冊，並發放給所有居民。 【選項解析】(A) mix 混合 (B) rub 摩擦 (C) print 印製 (D) burst 爆裂。印製手冊用 print。"},{"number":21,"stem":"In ancient times, people had to ______ two dry wooden sticks together with great effort to create sparks and start a campfire.","options":["rub","shoot","include","shine"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: rub (摩擦) 【全文中譯】在古代人們必須非常費力地將兩根乾燥的木棍相互摩擦以產生火花並升起營火。 【選項解析】(A) rub 摩擦 (B) shoot 射擊 (C) include 包含 (D) shine 發光。鑽木取火摩擦木棍，選 rub。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Because of heavy traffic congestion during the rush hour, the travel time to the airport began to ______ from thirty minutes to one hour.","options":["burst","mix","rise","print"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: rise (攀升；增加) 【全文中譯】由於尖峰時段交通嚴重壅塞，前往機場的行車時間開始從三十分鐘攀升到一小時。 【選項解析】(A) burst 爆裂 (B) mix 混合 (C) rise 攀升 (D) print 列印。時間數字上升攀升，選 rise。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The experienced director yelled action, and the camera crew prepared to ______ the opening scene of the romantic film on the beach.","options":["include","shoot","rub","mix"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: shoot (拍攝) 【全文中譯】經驗豐富的導演大喊開拍，攝影組準備在海灘上拍攝這部浪漫電影的開場戲。 【選項解析】(A) include 包含 (B) shoot 拍攝 (C) rub 摩擦 (D) mix 混合。電影拍攝鏡頭用 shoot。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The sudden car collision at the crossroad created a violent ______, and both drivers had to be examined by paramedics immediately.","options":["printer","mix","shock","burst"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: shock (衝擊；震盪) 【全文中譯】十字路口的突然撞車事故造成了劇烈的衝擊震盪，兩名司機都必須立即接受護理人員的檢查。 【選項解析】(A) printer 印表機 (B) mix 混合物 (C) shock 衝擊 (D) burst 爆裂。車禍碰撞衝擊，選 shock。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Even during the darkest winter storm, the lighthouse keeper kept the beacon lamp ready to ______ across the dangerous ocean rocks.","options":["shine","burst","mix","rub"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: shine (照耀) 【全文中譯】即使在最黑暗的冬季暴風雨中，燈塔看守人也隨時準備讓信標燈照耀在危險的海洋礁石上。 【選項解析】(A) shine 照耀 (B) burst 爆裂 (C) mix 混合 (D) rub 摩擦。燈塔發光照耀，選 shine。"}]},{"unit":82,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 82 (082.mp3) Topic Focus: Cultural Traditions, Customs, Social Etiquette & Household Safety","topic":"Topic Focus: Cultural Traditions, Customs, Social Etiquette & Household Safety | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"appreciate","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to recognize the good qualities of someone or something; to be grateful for","chinese":"感激；欣賞","sentence":"The foreign exchange student was very polite, and she wrote a heartfelt thank-you card to ______ the kindness of her host family.","translation":"這位外國交換學生非常懂禮貌，她寫了一張由衷的感謝卡以感激寄宿家庭的善意。"},{"word":"introduce","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to make someone known by name to another person","chinese":"介紹；引進","sentence":"When you arrive at the international business conference tomorrow, our team manager will gladly ______ you to our overseas clients.","translation":"當你明天到達國際商業會議時，我們的團隊經理會很高興將你介紹給我們的海外客戶。"},{"word":"decorate","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to make something more attractive by adding pretty things","chinese":"裝飾；佈置","sentence":"Before the festive holiday dinner begins on Christmas Eve, the children always gather in the living room to ______ the tall tree.","translation":"在平安夜節日晚餐開始之前，孩子們總是聚集在客廳裝飾那棵高大的樹。"},{"word":"mask","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a covering worn over all or part of the face; to hide something","chinese":"面具；口罩；遮掩","sentence":"To protect elderly family members from the seasonal influenza virus, everyone was advised to wear a protective medical ______ in public.","translation":"為了保護年長的家庭成員免受季節性流感病毒的侵害，建議大家在公共場合佩戴醫療防護口罩。"},{"word":"alarm","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a warning sound or device; a feeling of sudden fear","chinese":"警報；警鈴；使驚恐","sentence":"Every residential apartment in the modern building is equipped with a sensitive smoke ______ to detect dangerous fires quickly.","translation":"現代化大樓中的每間住宅公寓都配備了靈敏的煙霧警報器，以便快速發現危險火災。"},{"word":"culture","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the customs, beliefs, art, and way of life of a particular society","chinese":"文化","sentence":"Traveling to different countries allows students to learn about foreign ______ and understand diverse lifestyles with open minds.","translation":"到不同的國家旅行可以讓學生了解外國文化，並以開放的心態理解多樣的生活方式。"},{"word":"tradition","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a belief, principle, or way of acting that has continued for a long time","chinese":"傳統","sentence":"Eating mooncakes and watching the bright full moon with relatives is an ancient cultural ______ celebrated across Taiwan every autumn.","translation":"與親戚一起吃月餅和賞滿月是每年秋天全台灣都慶祝的古老文化傳統。"},{"word":"custom","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a way of behaving or a belief that has been established for a long time","chinese":"習俗；慣例","sentence":"Taking off shoes before entering someone's private home is an important local ______ that visitors must follow respectfully.","translation":"進入他人的私人住宅前脫鞋是一項重要的當地習俗，訪客必須恭敬遵守。"},{"word":"pattern","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a repeated decorative design; a particular way in which something is done","chinese":"圖案；花樣；模式","sentence":"The traditional silk dress had an intricate flower ______ woven with golden threads that caught everyone's admiration at the party.","translation":"這件傳統絲綢連衣裙織有用金線編織的複雜花朵圖案，在派對上贏得所有人的讚賞。"},{"word":"manner","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the way in which something is done; polite ways of behaving","chinese":"方式；禮貌；規矩","sentence":"Parents should teach their young children good table ______ so that they do not talk loudly with their mouths full of food.","translation":"父母應該教導幼童良好的餐桌禮貌，這樣他們就不會在嘴裡塞滿食物時大聲說話。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"We sincerely ______ all the valuable advice and patient guidance our school principal gave us before our college graduation.","options":["appreciate","decorate","introduce","mask"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: appreciate (感激；欣賞) 【全文中譯】在大學畢業前，我們由衷感激學校校長給予我們的一切寶貴建議與耐心指導。 【選項解析】(A) appreciate 感激 (B) decorate 裝飾 (C) introduce 介紹 (D) mask 掩蓋。感激師長建議指導，選 appreciate。"},{"number":2,"stem":"At the beginning of the English workshop, the friendly teacher asked each student to stand up and ______ himself or herself briefly.","options":["decorate","mask","introduce","appreciate"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: introduce (介紹) 【全文中譯】在英語工作坊開始時，和藹可親的老師請每位學生站起來簡短介紹自己。 【選項解析】(A) decorate 裝飾 (B) mask 掩飾 (C) introduce 介紹 (D) appreciate 欣賞。自我介紹用 introduce oneself。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The young couple decided to ______ their new living room with colorful paintings, potted plants, and soft yellow lamps.","options":["introduce","appreciate","mask","decorate"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: decorate (裝飾；佈置) 【全文中譯】這對年輕夫婦決定用色彩斑斕的畫作、盆栽和柔和的黃色檯燈來佈置他們的新客廳。 【選項解析】(A) introduce 介紹 (B) appreciate 欣賞 (C) mask 遮掩 (D) decorate 裝飾。用物品裝飾房間，選 decorate。"},{"number":4,"stem":"When visiting the hospital during winter, you should always wear a clean face ______ to protect yourself from spreading germs.","options":["mask","alarm","culture","pattern"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: mask (口罩；面具) 【全文中譯】冬天到醫院探病時，你應該隨時戴上乾淨的口罩以保護自己免於散播病菌。 【選項解析】(A) mask 口罩 (B) alarm 警報 (C) culture 文化 (D) pattern 圖案。face mask 表示口罩，選 mask。"},{"number":5,"stem":"When smoke began pouring out of the apartment kitchen, the loud ceiling ______ rang immediately to alert all residents.","options":["pattern","alarm","custom","manner"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: alarm (警報；警鈴) 【全文中譯】當公寓廚房開始冒出濃煙時，天花板上的響亮警報器立即響起以提醒所有住戶。 【選項解析】(A) pattern 圖案 (B) alarm 警報器 (C) custom 習俗 (D) manner 禮貌。煙霧警報器 smoke alarm，選 alarm。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Learning a foreign language is not just about memorizing words, but also about understanding the deep history and rich ______ of the nation.","options":["alarm","culture","mask","manner"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: culture (文化) 【全文中譯】學習外語不僅僅是背單字，更是為了理解該國深厚的歷史與豐富的文化。 【選項解析】(A) alarm 警報 (B) culture 文化 (C) mask 面具 (D) manner 禮節。國家深厚歷史與豐富文化，選 culture。"},{"number":7,"stem":"Giving red envelopes filled with lucky money to children during Chinese New Year is a treasured family ______ passed down for generations.","options":["mask","alarm","tradition","pattern"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: tradition (傳統) 【全文中譯】農曆新年發裝有壓歲錢的紅包給小孩子，是代代相傳的珍貴家庭傳統。 【選項解析】(A) mask 面具 (B) alarm 警報 (C) tradition 傳統 (D) pattern 圖樣。代代相傳之習慣為 tradition。"},{"number":8,"stem":"In many Asian countries, it is a polite social ______ to bow slightly when greeting someone older or of higher rank.","options":["custom","alarm","mask","pattern"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: custom (習俗；慣例) 【全文中譯】在許多亞洲國家，向年長者或地位較高的人問候時微微鞠躬是一種禮貌的社交習俗。 【選項解析】(A) custom 習俗 (B) alarm 警報 (C) mask 面具 (D) pattern 模式。社會通行的生活習俗為 custom。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The interior designer chose wallpaper with a geometric square ______ that made the small bedroom look wider and brighter.","options":["manner","alarm","culture","pattern"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: pattern (圖案；圖樣) 【全文中譯】室內設計師選擇了帶有幾何方格圖案的壁紙，讓狹小的臥室顯得更寬敞明亮。 【選項解析】(A) manner 禮貌 (B) alarm 警鈴 (C) culture 文化 (D) pattern 圖案。壁紙的花樣圖案為 pattern。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Speaking rudely to convenience store clerks shows a serious lack of good ______, and people should treat service workers with respect.","options":["pattern","manner","alarm","mask"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: manner (禮貌；舉止) 【全文中譯】對便利商店店員說話粗魯無禮表現出嚴重缺乏良好禮貌，人們應該尊重服務人員。 【選項解析】(A) pattern 圖樣 (B) manner 禮貌/方式 (C) alarm 警報 (D) mask 面具。good manners 表示良好禮貌規矩。"},{"number":11,"stem":"I really ______ your generous offer to drive me to the train station in the heavy rain, but my brother is already on his way.","options":["decorate","introduce","appreciate","mask"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: appreciate (感謝；感激) 【全文中譯】我非常感謝你好心提議在大雨中載我去火車站，但我哥哥已經在路上了。 【選項解析】(A) decorate 裝飾 (B) introduce 介紹 (C) appreciate 感激 (D) mask 遮掩。由衷感激他人的提議好意，選 appreciate。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Let me ______ my college roommate Kevin, who has just moved to Taipei to work as a software engineer for an international firm.","options":["introduce","decorate","appreciate","mask"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: introduce (介紹) 【全文中譯】讓我來介紹我的大學室友凱文，他剛搬到台北一家國際公司擔任軟體工程師。 【選項解析】(A) introduce 介紹 (B) decorate 裝飾 (C) appreciate 感謝 (D) mask 掩蓋。向他人介紹新朋友，選 introduce。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The students spent all Friday afternoon hanging paper lanterns and ribbons to ______ their classroom for the Halloween party.","options":["appreciate","decorate","introduce","mask"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: decorate (佈置；裝飾) 【全文中譯】學生們整個星期五下午都在掛紙燈籠和彩帶，為萬聖節派對佈置他們的教室。 【選項解析】(A) appreciate 感謝 (B) decorate 佈置 (C) introduce 介紹 (D) mask 遮蔽。掛燈籠裝飾教室，選 decorate。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The robber wore a black ski ______ to cover his face, but police officers were still able to identify him from street camera footage.","options":["mask","alarm","manner","tradition"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: mask (面具；面罩) 【全文中譯】搶匪戴著黑色滑雪面罩遮住臉部，但警官依然能夠從街道攝影機鏡頭辨認出他。 【選項解析】(A) mask 面罩/面具 (B) alarm 警報 (C) manner 禮貌 (D) tradition 傳統。遮擋面部之 ski mask，選 mask。"},{"number":15,"stem":"If anyone tries to open the bank vault after business hours without authorization, a silent ______ will alert the central police station.","options":["culture","alarm","pattern","custom"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: alarm (警報系統) 【全文中譯】如果有人未經授權在營業時間外試圖打開銀行保險庫，無聲警報將會通知中央警察局。 【選項解析】(A) culture 文化 (B) alarm 警報 (C) pattern 模式 (D) custom 習俗。安全防盜警報器為 alarm。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Food festivals provide wonderful opportunities for community members to taste international dishes and experience traditional ______.","options":["alarm","mask","culture","manner"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: culture (文化) 【全文中譯】美食節為社區居民提供了品嚐各國料理並體驗各國傳統文化的絕佳機會。 【選項解析】(A) alarm 警報 (B) mask 面具 (C) culture 文化 (D) manner 舉止。飲食與人文文化，選 culture。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Our school holds an annual sports day every November, and this athletic ______ has been maintained without interruption for thirty years.","options":["tradition","alarm","mask","pattern"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: tradition (傳統) 【全文中譯】我們學校每年十一月都會舉辦校運會，這項體育傳統已經保持了三十年未曾中斷。 【選項解析】(A) tradition 傳統 (B) alarm 警報 (C) mask 面具 (D) pattern 圖案。歷史悠久的活動傳統，選 tradition。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Shaking hands firmly with a confident smile is a widely accepted business ______ when meeting new business partners in Western countries.","options":["custom","alarm","mask","pattern"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: custom (習俗；慣例) 【全文中譯】在西方國家與新商業夥伴見面時，帶著自信微笑用力握手是普遍接受的商業慣例。 【選項解析】(A) custom 習俗 (B) alarm 警報 (C) mask 面具 (D) pattern 圖案。握手寒暄的商務習慣為 custom。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Meteorologists noticed an unusual weather ______ that brought continuous torrential rainfall to the southern region for an entire week.","options":["manner","pattern","alarm","culture"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pattern (模式；規律) 【全文中譯】氣象學家注意到一種不尋常的天氣模式，給南部地區帶來整整一週的連續暴雨。 【選項解析】(A) manner 方式 (B) pattern 模式/型態 (C) alarm 警報 (D) culture 文化。天氣型態 weather pattern，選 pattern。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The waiter served our meals in a very polite and attentive ______, so my father gladly left a generous ten percent tip on the table.","options":["pattern","manner","alarm","mask"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: manner (態度；方式) 【全文中譯】服務生以非常禮貌和周到的態度為我們上菜，因此我父親欣然在桌上留下了豐厚的百分之十小費。 【選項解析】(A) pattern 圖案 (B) manner 態度/舉止 (C) alarm 警報 (D) mask 面罩。in a polite manner 表示以禮貌的方式態度。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The museum tourists deeply ______ the rare historical artifacts because the tour guide explained the ancient stories behind each item.","options":["appreciated","decorated","introduced","masked"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: appreciated (欣賞；由衷讚賞) 【全文中譯】博物館的遊客非常欣賞這些珍貴的歷史文物，因為導遊為每件物品講解了背後的古老故事。 【選項解析】(A) appreciated 欣賞 (B) decorated 裝飾 (C) introduced 介紹 (D) masked 掩蓋。欣賞文物價值，選 appreciate。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Before beginning the official project presentation, please ______ the main objectives and team members to our board of directors.","options":["decorate","introduce","appreciate","mask"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: introduce (介紹) 【全文中譯】在開始正式的專案簡報之前，請先向我們的董事會介紹主要目標和團隊成員。 【選項解析】(A) decorate 佈置 (B) introduce 介紹 (C) appreciate 感激 (D) mask 掩蓋。介紹團隊與目標，選 introduce。"},{"number":23,"stem":"During spring festival, many families like to ______ their front doors with red couplets to welcome good fortune into their homes.","options":["introduce","appreciate","decorate","mask"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: decorate (裝飾) 【全文中譯】在春節期間，許多家庭喜歡在大門上裝飾紅色春聯，以迎接好運進入家中。 【選項解析】(A) introduce 介紹 (B) appreciate 感激 (C) decorate 裝飾 (D) mask 遮掩。貼春聯裝飾大門，選 decorate。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The actor wore an elaborate theatrical ______ representing an ancient dragon warrior during the opening scene of the play.","options":["mask","alarm","pattern","custom"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: mask (面具) 【全文中譯】在該劇的開場戲中，演員戴著代表古代神龍勇士的精美戲劇面具登場。 【選項解析】(A) mask 面具 (B) alarm 警鈴 (C) pattern 圖樣 (D) custom 習俗。舞台演戲佩戴之面具為 mask。"},{"number":25,"stem":"When the burglar broke the side window of the jewelry store at midnight, the security ______ sounded loudly and frightened him away.","options":["culture","pattern","manner","alarm"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: alarm (警報器) 【全文中譯】當竊賊在午夜打破珠寶店的側窗時，防盜警報器大聲響起並將他嚇跑了。 【選項解析】(A) culture 文化 (B) pattern 圖案 (C) manner 禮貌 (D) alarm 警報。防盜警報器 security alarm，選 alarm。"}]},{"unit":83,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 83 (083.mp3) Topic Focus: Architecture, Construction Materials, Scale & Mathematics","topic":"Topic Focus: Architecture, Construction Materials, Scale & Mathematics | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"style","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a particular way in which something is done, created, or performed","chinese":"風格；式樣","sentence":"The famous Taiwanese architect designed the library in a modern minimalist ______, with floor-to-ceiling glass windows and wooden walls.","translation":"這位著名的台灣建築師以現代極簡風格設計了這座圖書館，配有落地玻璃窗和木質牆壁。"},{"word":"plus","pos":"(prep.) / (n.)","definition":"added to; with the addition of; an advantage","chinese":"加；加上；優勢","sentence":"The total price of the set lunch is two hundred dollars ______ ten percent for the service charge, which is reasonable.","translation":"這份套餐的總價是兩百元加上百分之十的服務費，價格十分合理。"},{"word":"minus","pos":"(prep.) / (n.)","definition":"reduced by; subtracting; a disadvantage","chinese":"減；減去；缺點","sentence":"During freezing winter nights in high mountains, the outside temperature often drops to ______ five degrees Celsius.","translation":"在寒冷的冬夜裡，高山上的室外氣溫經常降至零下五度。"},{"word":"straw","pos":"(n.)","definition":"dried yellow stems of wheat; a thin plastic tube for drinking","chinese":"稻草；吸管","sentence":"Because the young child could not hold the cold glass steadily, the friendly waitress kindly brought her a flexible drinking ______.","translation":"因為那個幼童拿不穩冰涼的玻璃杯，和藹的女服務生好心地拿來了一根可彎曲的飲用吸管。"},{"word":"brick","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a rectangular block of hard clay used for building walls","chinese":"磚塊","sentence":"In the famous children's fairy tale, the third little pig worked hard and built a solid house made of red ______.","translation":"在著名的童話故事中，第三隻小豬辛勤工作，建造了一座用紅磚砌成的堅固房屋。"},{"word":"tiny","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"extremely small in size or amount","chinese":"極小的；微小的","sentence":"When the newborn kitten opened its round eyes for the first time, it made a ______ meow and snuggled next to its mother.","translation":"當剛出生的小貓第一次睜開圓圓的眼睛時，牠發出了一聲微弱的喵叫，並依偎在母親身邊。"},{"word":"grand","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"impressive and large or important; splendid","chinese":"雄偉的；宏大的","sentence":"The foreign president and his wife attended the ______ opening ceremony of the new national performing arts center last night.","translation":"外國總統和他的妻子昨晚出席了國家表演藝術中心落成啟用的宏大開幕典禮。"},{"word":"giant","pos":"(adj.) / (n.)","definition":"extremely large; a huge person, animal, or corporation","chinese":"巨大的；巨人；巨擘","sentence":"Visitors can see two ______ pandas eating fresh green bamboo leaves happily inside the spacious enclosure at Taipei Zoo.","translation":"遊客可以在台北動物園寬敞的圍欄內看到兩隻大貓熊高興地吃著新鮮的綠色竹葉。"},{"word":"allow","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to give permission for someone to do something","chinese":"允許；准許","sentence":"Strict safety regulations in the chemical factory do not ______ visitors to enter the testing area without safety goggles.","translation":"化學工廠嚴格的安全規定不允許訪客在未佩戴護目鏡的情況下進入測試區域。"},{"word":"arrange","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to plan, prepare, or organize something in advance","chinese":"安排；籌備；整理","sentence":"Our school counselor will gladly ______ a private face-to-face consultation for parents who need advice on university admissions.","translation":"我們的學校輔導老師會很樂意為需要大學入學建議的家長安排私人的面對面諮詢。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The clothing designer is widely recognized for her elegant teaching ______, which inspires young students across the country.","options":["style","straw","brick","giant"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: style (風格；式樣) 【全文中譯】這位服裝設計師以其優雅的教學風格聞名遐邇，激勵了全國無數的年輕學子。 【選項解析】(A) style 風格 (B) straw 稻草 (C) brick 磚塊 (D) giant 巨人。優雅的教學風格為 elegant teaching style。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The cost of renting the private seminar room is five thousand dollars ______ a five-hundred-dollar cleaning deposit.","options":["minus","tiny","plus","grand"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: plus (加上；加) 【全文中譯】租用私人研討室的費用是五千元加上五百元的清潔押金。 【選項解析】(A) minus 減去 (B) tiny 微小的 (C) plus 加上 (D) grand 宏大的。費用外再加上押金，選 plus。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Ten ______ three equals seven, which is one of the simplest subtraction problems taught in elementary school.","options":["plus","minus","tiny","grand"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: minus (減；減去) 【全文中譯】十減三等於七，這是小學教授的最簡單的減法運算之一。 【選項解析】(A) plus 加上 (B) minus 減去 (C) tiny 微小的 (D) grand 宏大的。10 減 3 等於 7，選 minus。"},{"number":4,"stem":"The little girl ordered a glass of iced lemon tea and asked the waiter for a plastic ______ so she could drink easily.","options":["straw","brick","style","giant"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: straw (吸管) 【全文中譯】小女孩點了一杯冰檸檬茶，並向服務生要了一根塑膠吸管以便飲用。 【選項解析】(A) straw 吸管 (B) brick 磚塊 (C) style 風格 (D) giant 巨人。喝飲料用吸管 straw。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Construction workers laid each heavy red ______ carefully along the foundation to build a sturdy protective garden wall.","options":["straw","style","brick","giant"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: brick (磚塊) 【全文中譯】建築工人們小心翼翼地沿著地基鋪設每塊沉重的紅磚，以砌成一堵堅固的花園防護牆。 【選項解析】(A) straw 稻草 (B) style 風格 (C) brick 磚塊 (D) giant 巨人。砌牆所用的紅磚為 red brick。"},{"number":6,"stem":"The baby sparrow was so ______ that it could rest comfortably inside the palm of grandfather's gentle hand.","options":["grand","giant","tiny","minus"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: tiny (微小的；極小的) 【全文中譯】小麻雀非常幼小，以至於可以舒適地蜷縮在祖父溫柔的手掌心中。 【選項解析】(A) grand 宏偉的 (B) giant 巨大的 (C) tiny 極小的 (D) minus 減去。體型極小能放在手心，選 tiny。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The royal family hosted a ______ banquet in the palace ballroom to celebrate the wedding of the prince and princess.","options":["grand","tiny","minus","straw"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: grand (盛大的；宏偉的) 【全文中譯】王室在宮殿宴會廳舉辦了一場盛大的國宴，以慶祝王子與公主的大婚。 【選項解析】(A) grand 盛大的 (B) tiny 微小的 (C) minus 減去 (D) straw 稻草。宮殿盛大宴會為 grand banquet。"},{"number":8,"stem":"A ______ crane was brought to the construction site this morning to lift heavy steel beams to the top floor of the skyscraper.","options":["tiny","minus","giant","style"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: giant (巨大的) 【全文中譯】今天早上工地上開來了一台巨大的起重機，將沉重的鋼樑吊裝到摩天大樓的頂樓。 【選項解析】(A) tiny 微小的 (B) minus 減去 (C) giant 巨大的 (D) style 風格。巨大的起重機為 giant crane。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Because of strict hospital rules, doctors do not ______ more than two visitors to enter the intensive care unit at the same time.","options":["allow","arrange","style","brick"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: allow (允許；准許) 【全文中譯】由於醫院的嚴格規定，醫生不允許超過兩名訪客同時進入加護病房。 【選項解析】(A) allow 允許 (B) arrange 安排 (C) style 風格 (D) brick 磚塊。允許某人做某事 allow sb to do sth。"},{"number":10,"stem":"The company secretary will ______ hotel reservations and flight tickets for our general manager before his business trip to London.","options":["allow","arrange","straw","giant"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: arrange (安排；籌備) 【全文中譯】公司秘書會在我們總經理啟程前往倫敦出差前，為他安排飯店預訂和機票。 【選項解析】(A) allow 允許 (B) arrange 安排 (C) straw 稻草 (D) giant 巨人。安排訂房與機票用 arrange。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Japanese restaurants often feature a minimalist interior ______ that uses light wood, sliding paper doors, and soft lighting.","options":["straw","brick","style","giant"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: style (風格) 【全文中譯】日本餐廳通常具有極簡主義的室內風格，採用淺色木材、紙拉門和柔和照明。 【選項解析】(A) straw 稻草 (B) brick 磚塊 (C) style 風格 (D) giant 巨人。室內設計風格為 interior style。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Having prior work experience in foreign trade is a definite ______ when applying for this prestigious international sales position.","options":["minus","plus","tiny","grand"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: plus (優勢；加分) 【全文中譯】在應聘這個著名的國際銷售職位時，具備外貿工作經驗絕對是一個加分優勢。 【選項解析】(A) minus 劣勢 (B) plus 優勢/加號 (C) tiny 微小的 (D) grand 宏偉的。優勢加分為 a definite plus。"},{"number":13,"stem":"If you take fifteen ______ seven, the mathematical remainder that you get is eight.","options":["plus","tiny","grand","minus"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: minus (減去) 【全文中譯】如果你用十五減去七，你得到的數學餘數就是八。 【選項解析】(A) plus 加上 (B) tiny 微小的 (C) grand 宏偉的 (D) minus 減去。15 減 7 等於 8，選 minus。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Farmers in the countryside often stack bundles of dry golden ______ in the barn to feed their cattle during winter.","options":["straw","brick","style","giant"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: straw (稻草) 【全文中譯】鄉下的農夫經常在穀倉裡堆放捆紮好的乾燥金黃稻草，以便在冬天餵養牛群。 【選項解析】(A) straw 稻草 (B) brick 磚塊 (C) style 風格 (D) giant 巨人。農村曬乾之稻草為 straw。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The ancient fortress was constructed with thick gray ______ that successfully withstood attacks by enemy armies for centuries.","options":["style","straw","giant","brick"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: brick (磚塊) 【全文中譯】這座古老的堡壘是用厚重的灰色磚塊砌成的，幾百年來成功抵禦了敵軍的攻擊。 【選項解析】(A) style 風格 (B) straw 稻草 (C) giant 巨人 (D) brick 磚塊。砌築古堡壘之磚塊為 brick。"},{"number":16,"stem":"A ______ insect crawled across the green cabbage leaf, and Billy used a magnifying glass to inspect its six tiny legs.","options":["tiny","grand","giant","minus"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: tiny (微小的) 【全文中譯】一隻微小的昆蟲爬過綠色的甘藍菜葉，比利拿著放大鏡仔細端詳牠六隻細小的腿。 【選項解析】(A) tiny 微小的 (B) grand 宏大的 (C) giant 巨大的 (D) minus 負的。微小昆蟲為 tiny insect。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Tourists from all over the world gathered to admire the ______ view of the snow-capped mountain peaks at sunrise.","options":["tiny","grand","minus","straw"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: grand (壯麗的；雄偉的) 【全文中譯】來自世界各地的遊客聚集在一起，欣賞日出時白雪皚皚的山峰之壯麗景色。 【選項解析】(A) tiny 微小的 (B) grand 壯麗的 (C) minus 減去 (D) straw 稻草。壯觀景色為 grand view。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The tech company grew from a small garage startup into a multinational technology ______ with offices in forty countries.","options":["giant","style","straw","brick"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: giant (巨擘；龐然大物) 【全文中譯】這家科技公司從車庫裡的初創企業發展成為在四十個國家設有辦事處的跨國科技巨擘。 【選項解析】(A) giant 巨擘 (B) style 風格 (C) straw 稻草 (D) brick 磚塊。商業巨頭跨國企業為 business giant。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Parents should not ______ their young teenagers to stay out past midnight without knowing who they are with.","options":["allow","arrange","style","brick"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: allow (准許；允許) 【全文中譯】父母不應該允許十幾歲的孩子在深夜未歸，除非清楚知道他們與誰在一起。 【選項解析】(A) allow 允許 (B) arrange 安排 (C) style 風格 (D) brick 磚塊。准許外出用 allow sb to stay out。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The travel agency helped us ______ an exciting five-day sightseeing tour around the scenic eastern coast of Taiwan.","options":["allow","arrange","straw","giant"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: arrange (安排；籌畫) 【全文中譯】旅行社幫我們安排了一次為期五天、環繞台灣風景優美的東海岸的精彩觀光之旅。 【選項解析】(A) allow 准許 (B) arrange 安排 (C) straw 稻草 (D) giant 巨人。規劃安排旅遊行程為 arrange a tour。"},{"number":21,"stem":"His casual fashion ______ of wearing graphic T-shirts and worn jeans made him stand out among the suited businessmen.","options":["style","straw","brick","giant"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: style (風格；穿著樣式) 【全文中譯】他穿著圖案T恤和舊牛仔褲的休閒穿搭風格，使他在西裝筆挺的商務人士中格外引人注目。 【選項解析】(A) style 風格 (B) straw 稻草 (C) brick 磚塊 (D) giant 巨人。休閒服飾風格為 fashion style。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The new apartment features two spacious bedrooms ______ a lovely balcony overlooking the tranquil botanical park.","options":["minus","tiny","plus","grand"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: plus (加上) 【全文中譯】這間新公寓設有兩間寬敞的臥室，外加一個俯瞰寧靜植物公園的可愛陽台。 【選項解析】(A) minus 減去 (B) tiny 微小的 (C) plus 加上 (D) grand 宏大的。臥室外加陽台，選 plus。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The farmer wore a wide-brimmed ______ hat to protect his face and neck from the scorching afternoon sunlight in the field.","options":["brick","style","giant","straw"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: straw (草製的；稻草) 【全文中譯】農夫在田間戴了一頂寬邊草帽，以保護面部和頸部免受午後灼熱陽光的照射。 【選項解析】(A) brick 磚塊 (B) style 風格 (C) giant 巨人 (D) straw 稻草/草帽。遮陽草帽為 straw hat。"},{"number":24,"stem":"That old red ______ warehouse by the river harbor was recently renovated into a trendy art museum and coffee shop.","options":["straw","brick","style","giant"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: brick (磚造的) 【全文中譯】河港邊的那座老舊紅磚倉庫最近被翻新成時尚的藝術博物館和咖啡館。 【選項解析】(A) straw 稻草 (B) brick 磚塊 (C) style 風格 (D) giant 巨人。紅磚倉庫為 red brick warehouse。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Even a ______ mistake in calculating the satellite trajectory could cause the billion-dollar space mission to fail completely.","options":["tiny","grand","giant","minus"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: tiny (微小的) 【全文中譯】即使在計算衛星軌道時出現極其微小的錯誤，也可能導致耗資數十億美元的太空任務徹底失敗。 【選項解析】(A) tiny 微小的 (B) grand 宏偉的 (C) giant 巨大的 (D) minus 減去。微小錯誤為 tiny mistake。"}]},{"unit":84,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 84 (084.mp3) Topic Focus: Limits, Value, Treasured Memories & Overseas Studies","topic":"Topic Focus: Limits, Value, Treasured Memories & Overseas Studies | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"limit","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"the greatest amount, number, or speed allowed; to restrict","chinese":"界限；限制","sentence":"Drivers must strictly obey the posted speed ______ when passing school zones, or they will be fined heavily by the traffic police.","translation":"駕駛人行經學校區域時必須嚴格遵守公告的速限，否則將會受到交通警察的重罰。"},{"word":"thought","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an idea, opinion, or mental consideration","chinese":"想法；思維；沉思","sentence":"After giving careful ______ to the job offer in Singapore, David decided to accept it to broaden his international horizons.","translation":"在對新加坡的工作錄取進行慎重考慮之後，戴維決定接受它以拓展自己的國際視野。"},{"word":"treasure","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"valuable things such as gold or gems; to cherish something deeply","chinese":"寶藏；珍寶；珍視","sentence":"The pirate captain buried his iron chest full of gold ______ on a remote desert island where no explorer could ever find it.","translation":"海盜船長將裝滿黃金寶藏的鐵箱埋在一個沒有探險家能找到的偏僻荒島上。"},{"word":"prize","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an award given to a winner of a competition or race","chinese":"獎品；獎項","sentence":"The talented Taiwanese violin student practiced for six hours every day and won first ______ in the international youth music contest.","translation":"這位才華橫溢的台灣小提琴學生每天練習六小時，並在國際青年音樂大賽中獲得了一等獎。"},{"word":"value","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"the worth of something in money or importance; to appreciate","chinese":"價值；重視；估價","sentence":"Real estate experts predict that the market ______ of commercial apartments near the new metro station will increase rapidly this year.","translation":"房地產專家預測，新地鐵站附近的商務公寓的市場價值今年將會快速增長。"},{"word":"worth","pos":"(prep.) / (adj.)","definition":"having a particular value in money or usefulness","chinese":"值……錢；值得的","sentence":"This rare historical stamp collection is ______ hundreds of thousands of dollars, but the elderly collector refuses to sell it.","translation":"這套稀有的歷史郵票收藏價值數十萬美元，但這位年邁的收藏家拒絕將其出售。"},{"word":"precious","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"of great value because of being rare, expensive, or important","chinese":"珍貴的；寶貴的","sentence":"Clean drinking water is the most ______ natural resource on earth, so everyone should avoid wasting water in daily life.","translation":"乾淨的飲用水是地球上最寶貴的自然資源，因此每個人在日常生活中都應避免浪費水資源。"},{"word":"positive","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"full of hope and confidence; certain; good","chinese":"正面的；積極的；確信的","sentence":"Maintaining an optimistic and ______ attitude helps patients recover faster from serious illnesses, according to medical researchers.","translation":"醫學研究人員指出，保持樂觀且積極的態度有助於病患更快地從嚴重疾病中康復。"},{"word":"negative","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"bad or harmful; expressing disagreement; pessimistic","chinese":"負面的；消極的；否定的","sentence":"Prolonged lack of proper sleep can have a very ______ impact on teenagers' physical health and their academic performance at school.","translation":"長期缺乏適當的睡眠會對青少年的身體健康和學校學業表現產生非常負面的影響。"},{"word":"abroad","pos":"(adv.)","definition":"in or to a foreign country","chinese":"在國外；到國外","sentence":"Many ambitious university graduates hope to study ______ in Europe or America to acquire advanced degrees and improve their language skills.","translation":"許多有抱負的大學畢業生希望去歐美留學，以取得進階學位並提升其外語能力。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The national highway has a maximum speed ______ of one hundred and ten kilometers per hour to ensure vehicular safety.","options":["limit","thought","prize","treasure"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: limit (限制；界限) 【全文中譯】國道設有每小時一百一十公里的最高速限，以確保車輛行駛安全。 【選項解析】(A) limit 限制 (B) thought 想法 (C) prize 獎品 (D) treasure 寶藏。speed limit 為固定用語「速限」。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The sudden ______ of moving to a completely new city frightened the young girl, but her parents assured her everything would be fine.","options":["limit","thought","prize","value"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: thought (想法；念頭) 【全文中譯】搬到一個全新城市的念頭讓小女孩感到害怕，但她的父母向她保證一切都會好起來。 【選項解析】(A) limit 限制 (B) thought 想法 (C) prize 獎品 (D) value 價值。搬家的念頭為 the thought of moving。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The ancient underwater shipwreck was discovered by divers, and it contained chests of gold and silver ______ from the seventeenth century.","options":["treasure","limit","thought","abroad"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: treasure (寶藏) 【全文中譯】潛水員發現了這艘古老的水下沉船，裡面裝有十七世紀的金銀寶藏箱。 【選項解析】(A) treasure 寶藏 (B) limit 限制 (C) thought 想法 (D) abroad 國外。沉船裡的寶藏為 treasure。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Samuel was thrilled when the principal announced that he had won the grand ______ for the best science project in the high school.","options":["thought","prize","limit","treasure"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: prize (獎項；獎品) 【全文中譯】當校長宣布塞繆爾的高中最佳科學專題獲得大獎時，他興奮不已。 【選項解析】(A) thought 想法 (B) prize 獎項 (C) limit 限制 (D) treasure 寶藏。獲得科學比賽大獎為 grand prize。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The historical ______ of these ancient stone carvings cannot be measured in money, for they reveal how ancient civilizations lived.","options":["prize","limit","value","thought"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: value (價值) 【全文中譯】這些古代石刻的歷史價值無法用金錢衡量，因為它們揭示了古代文明的生活方式。 【選項解析】(A) prize 獎品 (B) limit 限制 (C) value 價值 (D) thought 想法。歷史價值為 historical value。"},{"number":6,"stem":"The antique gold pocket watch was appraised by the jeweler, and he confirmed that it was ______ at least five thousand dollars.","options":["worth","precious","positive","negative"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: worth (值……錢) 【全文中譯】珠寶商對這只古董黃金懷錶進行了估價，證實它至少值五千美元。 【選項解析】(A) worth 值錢 (B) precious 珍貴的 (C) positive 正面的 (D) negative 負面的。be worth + 金額，表示值多少錢。"},{"number":7,"stem":"Time spent with loving family members is truly ______, and we should cherish every moment we share with our grandparents.","options":["negative","precious","worth","abroad"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: precious (珍貴的；寶貴的) 【全文中譯】與慈愛的家人共度的時光真正無比珍貴，我們應該珍惜與祖父母共處的每一刻。 【選項解析】(A) negative 負面的 (B) precious 珍貴的 (C) worth 值得的 (D) abroad 國外。寶貴的時光為 precious time。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Despite facing unexpected setbacks in the competition, the coach encouraged the team to remain ______ and never give up.","options":["negative","worth","positive","precious"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: positive (積極的；樂觀的) 【全文中譯】儘管在比賽中遇到了意想不到的挫折，教練依然鼓勵球隊保持積極心態，絕不放棄。 【選項解析】(A) negative 消極的 (B) worth 值得的 (C) positive 積極的 (D) precious 珍貴的。積極正向心態為 positive attitude。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Breathing polluted exhaust fumes every day can cause ______ health effects on children's respiratory systems and lung development.","options":["positive","precious","negative","worth"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: negative (負面的；不良的) 【全文中譯】每天吸入受污染的廢氣會對兒童的呼吸系統和肺部發育造成非常負面的健康影響。 【選項解析】(A) positive 正面的 (B) precious 珍貴的 (C) negative 負面的 (D) worth 值得的。不良影響為 negative impact。"},{"number":10,"stem":"After graduating from college next June, Linda plans to travel ______ for six months to experience diverse global cultures.","options":["abroad","positive","negative","precious"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: abroad (在國外；到國外) 【全文中譯】明年六月大學畢業後，琳達計劃出國旅行六個月，體驗多樣的世界文化。 【選項解析】(A) abroad 到國外 (B) positive 正面的 (C) negative 負面的 (D) precious 珍貴的。出國旅行為 travel abroad。"},{"number":11,"stem":"You should set a strict spending ______ for your monthly shopping budget so that you can save enough money to buy an apartment.","options":["limit","thought","prize","treasure"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: limit (上限；限制) 【全文中譯】你應該為每月的購物預算設定嚴格的支出上限，這樣你才能存足夠的錢買公寓。 【選項解析】(A) limit 上限 (B) thought 想法 (C) prize 獎品 (D) treasure 寶藏。設定支出上限為 spending limit。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Deep in ______, the elderly scholar sat quietly by the window with a cup of hot tea and watched the autumn rain fall.","options":["treasure","thought","limit","prize"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: thought (沉思；思考) 【全文中譯】年邁的學者陷入沉思，端著一杯熱茶靜靜地坐在窗前，看著秋雨落下。 【選項解析】(A) treasure 寶藏 (B) thought 沉思 (C) limit 限制 (D) prize 獎品。deep in thought 表示「陷入沉思」。"},{"number":13,"stem":"We should always ______ the genuine friendships that we built during our school days, for true friends are hard to find in adulthood.","options":["treasure","limit","prize","thought"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: treasure (珍視；珍惜) 【全文中譯】我們應該永遠珍惜學生時代建立的真摯友誼，因為在成年後很難找到真正的朋友。 【選項解析】(A) treasure 珍視 (B) limit 限制 (C) prize 獎項 (D) thought 想法。珍視友誼動詞為 treasure。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The lucky draw ticket holder walked up to the brightly lit stage to claim his first ______: a brand-new electric scooter.","options":["thought","limit","prize","treasure"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: prize (獎品；獎項) 【全文中譯】幸運抽獎券的持有人走上燈火輝煌的舞台，領取他的一等獎：一輛全新的電動機車。 【選項解析】(A) thought 想法 (B) limit 限制 (C) prize 獎品 (D) treasure 寶藏。抽獎一等獎為 first prize。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Many successful enterprises ______ integrity and customer satisfaction much more than short-term financial profits.","options":["prize","limit","value","thought"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: value (重視；看重) 【全文中譯】許多成功的企業看重誠信與客戶滿意度遠甚於短期的經濟利益。 【選項解析】(A) prize 獎勵 (B) limit 限制 (C) value 重視 (D) thought 想法。重視某事物動詞為 value。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Visiting the world-famous Louvre Museum in Paris is definitely ______ the long flight, for the artwork is breathtaking.","options":["precious","worth","positive","negative"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: worth (值得的) 【全文中譯】參觀巴黎舉世聞名的羅浮宮絕對值得長途飛行，因為那裡的藝術品令人嘆為觀止。 【選項解析】(A) precious 珍貴的 (B) worth 值得的 (C) positive 正面的 (D) negative 負面的。be worth + 名詞/V-ing，表示「值得……」。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Clean fresh water and clean air are ______ natural treasures that human beings must protect for future generations.","options":["precious","negative","worth","abroad"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: precious (珍貴的) 【全文中譯】潔淨的新鮮水源和清新空氣是人類必須為後代子孫守護的珍貴自然資源。 【選項解析】(A) precious 珍貴的 (B) negative 負面的 (C) worth 值得的 (D) abroad 國外。珍貴自然資源為 precious resources。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The doctor received ______ test results confirming that the patient was completely free from the harmful viral infection.","options":["negative","positive","precious","worth"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: positive (肯定的；令人欣慰的) 【全文中譯】醫生收到了良好的檢驗結果，證實該患者已完全擺脫有害的病毒感染。 【選項解析】(A) negative 陰性的 (B) positive 良好的/陽性的 (C) precious 珍貴的 (D) worth 值得的。此處 positive 指正面的好結果。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Constant criticism without helpful guidance can produce a ______ atmosphere in the classroom and discourage students from trying.","options":["positive","precious","negative","worth"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: negative (消極的；負面的) 【全文中譯】不斷的批評而缺乏有益的指導會在課堂上營造出一種負面氛圍，使學生不敢嘗試。 【選項解析】(A) positive 積極的 (B) precious 珍貴的 (C) negative 負面的 (D) worth 值得的。負面氛圍為 negative atmosphere。"},{"number":20,"stem":"My uncle has lived and worked ______ in Germany for over fifteen years, but he returns to Taiwan every year for Chinese New Year.","options":["abroad","positive","negative","precious"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: abroad (在國外) 【全文中譯】我叔叔在德國工作和生活了十五年，但他每年農曆新年都會回台灣團聚。 【選項解析】(A) abroad 在國外 (B) positive 正面的 (C) negative 負面的 (D) precious 珍貴的。在國外居住為 live abroad。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The city government placed a weight ______ on the old wooden suspension bridge to prevent heavy trucks from crossing it.","options":["limit","thought","prize","treasure"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: limit (限制) 【全文中譯】市政府在老舊木造吊橋上設定了重量限制，以防止重型卡車通行。 【選項解析】(A) limit 限制 (B) thought 想法 (C) prize 獎品 (D) treasure 寶藏。重量限制為 weight limit。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Without a second ______, the courageous lifeguard plunged straight into the rough ocean waves to rescue the drowning child.","options":["treasure","thought","limit","prize"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: thought (猶豫；思索) 【全文中譯】勇敢的救生員毫不猶豫，直接跳進洶湧的海浪中營救溺水兒童。 【選項解析】(A) treasure 寶藏 (B) thought 思索 (C) limit 限制 (D) prize 獎品。without a second thought 為常見片語「毫不猶豫」。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Deep in the underground tomb, archaeologists discovered a magnificent royal ______ of golden crowns and gemstone necklaces.","options":["treasure","limit","thought","prize"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: treasure (寶藏) 【全文中譯】在地下深處的陵墓裡，考古學家發現了宏偉的王室金冠與寶石項鍊寶藏。 【選項解析】(A) treasure 寶藏 (B) limit 限制 (C) thought 想法 (D) prize 獎項。王室寶藏為 royal treasure。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The outstanding young runner received a shiny gold medal and a cash ______ of ten thousand dollars for winning the marathon.","options":["limit","thought","prize","treasure"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: prize (獎金；獎項) 【全文中譯】這位優秀的年輕跑者贏得馬拉松比賽，獲得了一枚閃亮的金牌和一萬美元的現金獎金。 【選項解析】(A) limit 限制 (B) thought 想法 (C) prize 獎品/獎金 (D) treasure 寶藏。cash prize 為「現金獎金」。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Is that old painting really ______ so much money, or is the antique dealer exaggerating its historical rarity to the buyers?","options":["worth","precious","positive","negative"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: worth (值……錢) 【全文中譯】那幅老畫真的值那麼多錢嗎，還是古董商在向買家誇大其歷史稀有性？ 【選項解析】(A) worth 值得/值錢 (B) precious 珍貴的 (C) positive 正面的 (D) negative 負面的。be worth so much money 表示「值那麼多錢」。"}]},{"unit":85,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 85 (085.mp3) Topic Focus: Individual Identity, Personal Grooming & Supermarket Sections","topic":"Topic Focus: Individual Identity, Personal Grooming & Supermarket Sections | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"alone","pos":"(adj.) / (adv.)","definition":"without other people; by yourself","chinese":"單獨的；獨自地","sentence":"Although traveling ______ in a foreign country can be exciting, you should always stay alert and keep your phone charged.","translation":"雖然在國外獨自旅行可能令人興奮，但你應隨時保持警惕並確保手機電量充足。"},{"word":"personal","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"belonging to or relating to a particular person","chinese":"個人的；私人的","sentence":"You should never share your ______ bank passwords or national identification numbers with strangers on the telephone.","translation":"你絕不應該在電話中與陌生人分享你的個人銀行密碼或身分證字號。"},{"word":"individual","pos":"(n.) / (adj.)","definition":"a single person considered separately from a group; separate","chinese":"個人；個別的","sentence":"The dedicated teacher respected the ______ learning needs of each student and gave extra after-school tutoring patiently.","translation":"這位敬業的老師尊重每位學生的個別學習需求，並耐心地提供額外的課後輔導。"},{"word":"owner","pos":"(n.)","definition":"someone who possesses or legally owns something","chinese":"主人；業主；擁有人","sentence":"The friendly pet dog waited patiently beside the front gate every afternoon until its ______ returned home from office work.","translation":"這隻友善的寵物狗每天下午都在大門旁耐心等待，直到牠的主人下班回家。"},{"word":"haircut","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the act of cutting the hair, or the style in which it is cut","chinese":"理髮；髮型","sentence":"Before attending his sister's formal wedding banquet, Jason went to the local barber shop to get a neat ______.","translation":"在參加姊姊隆重的婚宴之前，傑森去當地的理髮店剪了一個俐落的髮型。"},{"word":"toothbrush","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a small brush used for cleaning teeth","chinese":"牙刷","sentence":"Dentists recommend replacing your manual ______ every three months, or the worn-out bristles will not clean your teeth properly.","translation":"牙醫建議每三個月更換一次手動牙刷，否則磨損的刷毛將無法適當清潔牙齒。"},{"word":"napkin","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a piece of cloth or paper used at meals to wipe fingers or lips","chinese":"餐巾；餐巾紙","sentence":"After finishing the juicy grilled steak, the dinner guest took a paper ______ to wipe sauce stains gently from his lips.","translation":"吃完多汁的烤牛排後，這位晚餐賓客拿了一張餐巾紙輕輕擦拭嘴唇上的醬汁污漬。"},{"word":"part","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"some but not all of a thing; to separate","chinese":"部分；零件；分開","sentence":"Reading English storybooks for thirty minutes before sleeping has become an essential ______ of Kevin's daily evening routine.","translation":"睡前閱讀三十分鐘英文故事書已經成為凱文每天晚間作息中不可或缺的一部分。"},{"word":"section","pos":"(n.)","definition":"one of the parts into which something is divided","chinese":"區塊；部門；專區","sentence":"Mother walked directly to the fresh seafood ______ of the supermarket to buy Atlantic salmon for our family dinner.","translation":"母親直接走到超市的新鮮海鮮專區，為我們的家庭晚餐採買大西洋鮭魚。"},{"word":"event","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an important happening or planned public occasion","chinese":"事件；大事；活動","sentence":"Winning the national science championship was a life-changing ______ that opened up many scholarship opportunities for Linda.","translation":"贏得全國科學大賽冠軍是一件改變人生的大事，為琳達開啟了許多獎學金機會。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Walking ______ in the dark forest after midnight can be dangerous, so tourists are advised to stay together in groups.","options":["alone","personal","individual","owner"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: alone (單獨的；獨自地) 【全文中譯】午夜過後在黑暗的森林裡獨自漫步可能很危險，因此建議遊客成群結伴同行。 【選項解析】(A) alone 獨自地 (B) personal 個人的 (C) individual 個別的 (D) owner 主人。獨自走路為 walk alone。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Please respect my ______ privacy and do not read through the private diary entries stored in my bedroom desk drawer.","options":["alone","personal","individual","owner"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: personal (個人的；私人的) 【全文中譯】請尊重我的個人隱私，不要翻看存放在我臥室書桌抽屜裡的私人日記。 【選項解析】(A) alone 單獨的 (B) personal 個人的 (C) individual 個別的 (D) owner 主人。個人隱私為 personal privacy。"},{"number":3,"stem":"In a democratic society, the basic human rights and legal freedoms of every single ______ must be protected by law.","options":["haircut","owner","individual","toothbrush"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: individual (個人) 【全文中譯】在民主社會中，每位個人的基本人權與法定自由都必須受到法律保障。 【選項解析】(A) haircut 理髮 (B) owner 主人 (C) individual 個人 (D) toothbrush 牙刷。每位單獨之個人為 every single individual。"},{"number":4,"stem":"The police officer verified the registration documents to confirm that Mr. Davis was the legal ______ of the stolen vehicle.","options":["owner","haircut","toothbrush","napkin"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: owner (擁有人；車主) 【全文中譯】警官核對了登記文件，以確認戴維斯先生是這輛被盜車輛的合法車主。 【選項解析】(A) owner 車主/主人 (B) haircut 理髮 (C) toothbrush 牙刷 (D) napkin 餐巾。合法車主為 legal owner。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Tommy's hair had grown much too long over the summer vacation, so his mother took him to the salon for a clean ______.","options":["napkin","owner","toothbrush","haircut"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: haircut (理髮；髮型) 【全文中譯】湯米的頭髮在暑假期間長得太長了，所以他媽媽帶他去沙龍理了一個俐落的髮型。 【選項解析】(A) napkin 餐巾 (B) owner 主人 (C) toothbrush 牙刷 (D) haircut 理髮。修剪頭髮髮型為 get a haircut。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Don't forget to pack your toothpaste and ______ in your travel bag before leaving for the school camping trip.","options":["toothbrush","haircut","owner","napkin"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: toothbrush (牙刷) 【全文中譯】出發參加學校露營旅行前，別忘了在旅行包裡裝上你的牙膏和牙刷。 【選項解析】(A) toothbrush 牙刷 (B) haircut 理髮 (C) owner 主人 (D) napkin 餐巾。個人清潔牙刷為 toothbrush。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The polite waiter placed a folded cloth ______ on my lap as soon as I sat down at the table in the French restaurant.","options":["toothbrush","napkin","haircut","owner"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: napkin (餐巾) 【全文中譯】在法國餐廳的餐桌旁一坐下，有禮貌的服務生就把一張摺疊好的布餐巾鋪在我的腿上。 【選項解析】(A) toothbrush 牙刷 (B) napkin 餐巾 (C) haircut 理髮 (D) owner 主人。用餐鋪在腿上的餐巾為 cloth napkin。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Regular physical exercise is a vital ______ of maintaining cardiovascular fitness and reducing daily mental stress.","options":["part","section","event","owner"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: part (部分) 【全文中譯】規律的體能鍛鍊是保持心血管健康和減輕日常精神壓力的重要部分。 【選項解析】(A) part 部分 (B) section 專區 (C) event 事件 (D) owner 主人。重要組成部分為 vital part。"},{"number":9,"stem":"You can find canned peaches, strawberry jam, and tomato paste in the packaged food ______ on the second floor.","options":["event","part","section","owner"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: section (區域；專區) 【全文中譯】你可以在二樓的包裝食品專區找到桃子罐頭、草莓醬和番茄醬。 【選項解析】(A) event 事件 (B) part 部分 (C) section 專區 (D) owner 主人。超市特定商品陳列區為 section。"},{"number":10,"stem":"The international sports competition was a grand community ______ that brought together athletic teams from twenty countries.","options":["part","event","section","toothbrush"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: event (盛事；大活動) 【全文中譯】這場國際體育賽事是一場盛大的社區盛事，匯集了來自二十個國家的運動團隊。 【選項解析】(A) part 部分 (B) event 盛事 (C) section 專區 (D) toothbrush 牙刷。重大公共活動為 grand event。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Living ______ in a tiny studio apartment taught the young college student how to cook meals and manage her monthly budget.","options":["personal","individual","alone","owner"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: alone (單獨地；獨自) 【全文中譯】獨自住在狹小的套房裡教會了這位年輕的大學生如何做飯和管理她的每月預算。 【選項解析】(A) personal 個人的 (B) individual 個別的 (C) alone 獨自 (D) owner 主人。獨自一人居住為 live alone。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Writing down your ______ feelings in a journal every evening is an effective way to reflect on daily personal experiences.","options":["alone","personal","individual","owner"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: personal (個人的；私人的) 【全文中譯】每天晚上在日記裡寫下你的個人感受，是反思日常個人經歷的有效方式。 【選項解析】(A) alone 單獨的 (B) personal 個人的 (C) individual 個別的 (D) owner 主人。個人內在感受為 personal feelings。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The sports coach praised the remarkable ______ performance of each basketball player after their hard-fought tournament victory.","options":["alone","personal","individual","owner"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: individual (個別的；個人的) 【全文中譯】體育教練在籃球隊歷經艱苦奮戰贏得錦標賽勝利後，讚揚了每位球員卓越的個人表現。 【選項解析】(A) alone 單獨的 (B) personal 私人的 (C) individual 個人的 (D) owner 主人。個人技術發揮為 individual performance。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The shop ______ unlocked the glass front doors at nine o'clock sharp and warmly welcomed the waiting shoppers.","options":["owner","haircut","napkin","toothbrush"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: owner (店主；老闆) 【全文中譯】店老闆在九點整準時打開玻璃前門，熱情地歡迎等候的購物民眾。 【選項解析】(A) owner 店主 (B) haircut 理髮 (C) napkin 餐巾 (D) toothbrush 牙刷。店家老闆為 shop owner。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Uncle George looks much younger and more energetic after getting a stylish short ______ from the downtown barber.","options":["napkin","toothbrush","haircut","owner"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: haircut (髮型；理髮) 【全文中譯】喬治叔叔在市中心的理髮店剪了一個時尚的短髮後，看起來年輕且更有活力多了。 【選項解析】(A) napkin 餐巾 (B) toothbrush 牙刷 (C) haircut 髮型 (D) owner 主人。俐落短髮為 short haircut。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Brushing with a soft-bristled ______ twice daily is essential to prevent tooth decay and maintain healthy gums.","options":["toothbrush","haircut","napkin","owner"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: toothbrush (牙刷) 【全文中譯】每天用軟毛牙刷刷牙兩次，對於預防蛀牙和保持牙齦健康至關重要。 【選項解析】(A) toothbrush 牙刷 (B) haircut 理髮 (C) napkin 餐巾 (D) owner 主人。軟毛牙刷為 soft-bristled toothbrush。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Little Betty accidentally spilled milk onto the table and quickly reached for a paper ______ to wipe up the puddle.","options":["toothbrush","haircut","napkin","owner"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: napkin (餐巾紙) 【全文中譯】小貝蒂不小心把牛奶灑在桌上，連忙伸手抓起一張餐巾紙把水漬擦乾淨。 【選項解析】(A) toothbrush 牙刷 (B) haircut 理髮 (C) napkin 餐巾紙 (D) owner 主人。擦桌子之紙巾為 paper napkin。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Overcoming severe financial hardship was an unforgettable ______ of my grandfather's life story during his early twenties.","options":["section","part","event","owner"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: part (一部分) 【全文中譯】克服嚴重的經濟困難是我祖父二十歲出頭人生故事中難忘的一部分。 【選項解析】(A) section 專區 (B) part 一部分 (C) event 事件 (D) owner 主人。人生難忘的部分為 an unforgettable part。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Let's meet outside the frozen food ______ of the department store after you finish picking up your groceries.","options":["event","part","section","owner"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: section (專區) 【全文中譯】等你在百貨公司買完日常用品後，我們在冷凍食品專區外面碰面吧。 【選項解析】(A) event 事件 (B) part 部分 (C) section 專區 (D) owner 主人。冷凍食品區為 frozen food section。"},{"number":20,"stem":"Hosting the annual cultural festival was an exciting ______ that attracted thousands of local residents and foreign tourists.","options":["part","section","event","toothbrush"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: event (活動；盛會) 【全文中譯】舉辦一年一度的文化節是一項令人興奮的盛事，吸引了數千名當地居民和外國遊客。 【選項解析】(A) part 部分 (B) section 專區 (C) event 盛事 (D) toothbrush 牙刷。令人興奮的大活動為 an exciting event。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The elderly lady sat peacefully ______ on the wooden park bench, feeding small breadcrumbs to the gentle pigeons.","options":["alone","personal","individual","owner"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: alone (單獨地；獨自) 【全文中譯】年邁的女士平靜地獨自坐在木製公園長椅上，向溫順的鴿子投餵小麵包屑。 【選項解析】(A) alone 獨自地 (B) personal 個人的 (C) individual 個別的 (D) owner 主人。獨自坐在長椅上為 sit alone。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Job applicants should highlight their relevant work qualifications rather than focusing on irrelevant ______ matters.","options":["alone","personal","individual","owner"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: personal (個人的；私事的) 【全文中譯】求職者應著重強調自己相關的工作資格，而不是專注於無關緊要的私人事務。 【選項解析】(A) alone 單獨的 (B) personal 私人的 (C) individual 個別的 (D) owner 主人。私人事務為 personal matters。"},{"number":23,"stem":"When working on a collaborative group project, the ______ contributions of every team member are equally important.","options":["alone","personal","individual","owner"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: individual (個別的；個人的) 【全文中譯】在進行合作團隊專案時，每位團隊成員的個人貢獻都同樣重要。 【選項解析】(A) alone 單獨的 (B) personal 私人的 (C) individual 個人的 (D) owner 主人。個人貢獻為 individual contributions。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The proud ______ of the champion racehorse smiled happily as photographers took pictures of him holding the gold trophy.","options":["owner","haircut","napkin","toothbrush"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: owner (馬主；擁有人) 【全文中譯】當攝影師給手捧金盃的冠軍賽馬主人拍照時，他露出了燦爛的笑容。 【選項解析】(A) owner 馬主/主人 (B) haircut 理髮 (C) napkin 餐巾 (D) toothbrush 牙刷。賽馬的所有者為 racehorse owner。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Which ______ of the morning newspaper do you usually read first: the international business news or the entertainment headlines?","options":["event","part","section","toothbrush"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: section (版面；版塊) 【全文中譯】你通常先閱讀早報的哪一個版塊：國際商業新聞還是娛樂頭條？ 【選項解析】(A) event 事件 (B) part 部分 (C) section 版塊/專區 (D) toothbrush 牙刷。報紙版面為 newspaper section。"}]},{"unit":86,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 86 (086.mp3) Topic Focus: Daily Records, Cable Communications, Science & Humanitarian Aid","topic":"Topic Focus: Daily Records, Cable Communications, Science & Humanitarian Aid | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"accident","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an unexpected event that causes damage or injury","chinese":"意外；交通事故","sentence":"Because the mountain road was very slippery from the rain, a minor traffic ______ occurred between two delivery trucks yesterday.","translation":"由於山路因雨變得十分濕滑，昨天兩輛貨車之間發生了一起輕微的交通事故。"},{"word":"album","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a book for keeping photographs or stamps; a collection of audio tracks","chinese":"相簿；音樂專輯","sentence":"Grandmother opened the dusty photo ______ on her lap and showed the young children black-and-white pictures of their ancestors.","translation":"祖母在大腿上打開積滿灰塵的相簿，給小孩子們看他們祖先的黑白照片。"},{"word":"diary","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a book in which you record your daily thoughts and experiences","chinese":"日記","sentence":"Ever since she entered junior high school, Emily has kept a private ______ to record her personal feelings and daily school life.","translation":"自從進入初中以來，艾蜜莉一直寫私人日記來記錄她的個人感受和日常學校生活。"},{"word":"cable","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a strong, thick rope of wire; television signals sent through wires","chinese":"電纜；有線電視","sentence":"The technical worker carefully replaced the damaged underground telephone ______ to restore internet connections across the town.","translation":"技術工人小心地更換了受損的地下電話電纜，以恢復全鎮的網際網路連線。"},{"word":"primary","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"more important than anything else; basic or earliest","chinese":"主要的；首要的；初等的","sentence":"The ______ goal of the national environmental project is to reduce greenhouse gas emissions and protect natural water resources.","translation":"國家環境專案的首要目標是減少溫室氣體排放並保護自然水資源。"},{"word":"chemical","pos":"(adj.) / (n.)","definition":"relating to chemistry; a substance produced by or used in chemistry","chinese":"化學的；化學品","sentence":"Factory workers must wear thick protective rubber gloves when handling hazardous ______ liquids in the research laboratory.","translation":"工廠工人在研究實驗室處理危險化學液體時，必須戴上厚實的橡膠防護手套。"},{"word":"error","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a mistake, especially one that causes problems","chinese":"錯誤；失誤","sentence":"Because of a typographical ______ in the bank transaction system, the accountant spent three hours rechecking all the balances.","translation":"由於銀行交易系統中的排印錯誤，會計師花了三個小時重新檢查所有餘額。"},{"word":"fault","pos":"(n.)","definition":"responsibility for a mistake or bad situation; a weakness","chinese":"過錯；缺點；故障","sentence":"It was entirely my ______ that the front glass door was left unlocked overnight, and I sincerely apologize to my coworkers.","translation":"前玻璃門整夜未鎖完全是我的過錯，我由衷向我的同事們道歉。"},{"word":"false","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"not true or correct; artificial","chinese":"錯誤的；假的；虛偽的","sentence":"Spreading ______ rumors about other students on social media platforms is considered cyberbullying and will be punished by school rules.","translation":"在社群媒體平台上散佈關於其他學生的虛假謠言被視為網路霸凌，將受到校規懲處。"},{"word":"aid","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"help, support, or financial assistance; to help someone","chinese":"援助；救援；幫助","sentence":"International humanitarian organizations sent medical teams and emergency food ______ to the victims of the severe earthquake.","translation":"國際人道組織向強烈地震的災民派遣了醫療隊和緊急糧食援助。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Fortunately, nobody was seriously injured in the highway car ______ this morning, but both vehicles sustained heavy front-end damage.","options":["accident","album","diary","cable"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: accident (車禍；事故) 【全文中譯】幸運的是，在今天早上的國道車禍中沒有人受重傷，但兩輛車的前端都嚴重受損。 【選項解析】(A) accident 車禍 (B) album 相簿 (C) diary 日記 (D) cable 電纜。國道車禍為 highway car accident。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The famous Taiwanese pop band released their tenth studio ______ today, and thousands of fans queued overnight at the music store.","options":["accident","album","diary","cable"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: album (音樂專輯) 【全文中譯】這支著名的台灣流行樂團今天發行了他們的第十張錄音室專輯，數千名歌迷在唱片行連夜排隊。 【選項解析】(A) accident 意外 (B) album 專輯 (C) diary 日記 (D) cable 電纜。發行錄音室專輯為 studio album。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Writing in a personal ______ before going to sleep helps many people organize their thoughts and reduce stress after work.","options":["cable","accident","diary","album"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: diary (日記) 【全文中譯】在睡前寫私人日記有助於許多人整理思緒，並減輕下班後的壓力。 【選項解析】(A) cable 電纜 (B) accident 意外 (C) diary 日記 (D) album 相簿。寫日記為 write in a diary。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Underground fiber-optic ______ networks transmit vast amounts of digital data across the world in just milliseconds.","options":["diary","album","accident","cable"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: cable (電纜) 【全文中譯】地下光纖電纜網路僅在幾毫秒內就能在全世界傳輸大量的數位數據。 【選項解析】(A) diary 日記 (B) album 相簿 (C) accident 意外 (D) cable 電纜。光纖電纜為 fiber-optic cable。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Ensuring the physical safety of young school children is the ______ duty of all teachers and school security guards.","options":["primary","chemical","false","aid"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: primary (首要的；主要的) 【全文中譯】確保學童的人身安全是所有教師和學校警衛的首要職責。 【選項解析】(A) primary 首要的 (B) chemical 化學的 (C) false 虛假的 (D) aid 援助。首要職責為 primary duty。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Household cleaning products often contain strong ______ substances that should never be swallowed or splashed into eyes.","options":["primary","false","chemical","aid"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: chemical (化學的；化學品) 【全文中譯】家用清潔產品通常含有強烈化學物質，絕不可吞食或濺入眼睛。 【選項解析】(A) primary 首要的 (B) false 錯誤的 (C) chemical 化學的 (D) aid 援助。化學物質為 chemical substances。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The programmer spent the entire afternoon reviewing code lines to locate a minor mathematical ______ that crashed the application.","options":["error","fault","aid","cable"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: error (錯誤；失誤) 【全文中譯】程式設計師花了一整個下午檢查程式碼行，以找出導致應用程式崩潰的微小數學錯誤。 【選項解析】(A) error 錯誤 (B) fault 過錯 (C) aid 援助 (D) cable 電纜。系統運算錯誤為 mathematical error。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The driver admitted that the road collision was his own ______ because he was looking at his smartphone instead of watching traffic.","options":["error","fault","aid","album"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: fault (過錯；責任) 【全文中譯】司機承認這起道路碰撞是他自己的過錯，因為他在看智慧型手機而不是注意路況。 【選項解析】(A) error 錯誤 (B) fault 過錯 (C) aid 援助 (D) album 相簿。某人承擔的過錯責任為 one's own fault。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The dishonest merchant gave customers ______ information regarding the origin of the meat products, which led to a heavy government fine.","options":["primary","chemical","false","aid"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: false (虛假的；偽造的) 【全文中譯】不誠實的商家向顧客提供了有關肉類產品來源的虛假訊息，導致了政府的巨額罰款。 【選項解析】(A) primary 主要的 (B) chemical 化學的 (C) false 虛假的 (D) aid 援助。虛假不實訊息為 false information。"},{"number":10,"stem":"The government provided emergency financial ______ to small business owners who suffered heavy losses during the pandemic.","options":["aid","error","fault","accident"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: aid (援助；救助金) 【全文中譯】政府向在疫情期間遭受嚴重損失的小企業主提供了緊急財政援助。 【選項解析】(A) aid 援助 (B) error 錯誤 (C) fault 過錯 (D) accident 事故。緊急財政援助為 emergency financial aid。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Always wear your seatbelt when driving on the expressway, for it can save your life in the event of a sudden ______.","options":["accident","album","diary","cable"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: accident (事故；意外) 【全文中譯】在快速道路上行駛時務必繫好安全帶，因為在發生突發事故時它能挽救你的生命。 【選項解析】(A) accident 事故 (B) album 相簿 (C) diary 日記 (D) cable 電纜。突發交通事故為 sudden accident。"},{"number":12,"stem":"During my summer visit to grandfather's farm, he opened an old family ______ and showed me photos of my mother as a toddler.","options":["accident","album","diary","cable"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: album (相簿) 【全文中譯】在夏天拜訪祖父的農場時，他打開了一本舊家庭相簿，給我看了我母親蹣跚學步時的照片。 【選項解析】(A) accident 事故 (B) album 相簿 (C) diary 日記 (D) cable 電纜。家庭照片簿為 family album。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Anne Frank's wartime ______ has been translated into dozens of languages and read by millions of people across the globe.","options":["cable","accident","diary","album"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: diary (日記) 【全文中譯】安妮·法蘭克的戰時日記已被翻譯成數十種語言，並被全球數百萬人閱讀。 【選項解析】(A) cable 電纜 (B) accident 意外 (C) diary 日記 (D) album 相簿。戰時日記為 wartime diary。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Severe stormy winds knocked down several electrical ______ poles along the coast, cutting off electricity to hundreds of homes.","options":["diary","album","accident","cable"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: cable (電線；電纜) 【全文中譯】猛烈的狂風吹倒了沿海的幾根電線桿，導致數百戶家庭斷電。 【選項解析】(A) diary 日記 (B) album 相簿 (C) accident 意外 (D) cable 電纜。電纜電線為 electrical cable。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Learning foundational phonics and vocabulary forms the ______ foundation of foreign language acquisition in elementary education.","options":["primary","chemical","false","aid"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: primary (基礎的；初級的) 【全文中譯】學習基礎自然發音和單字構成了小學教育中外語習得的基礎基石。 【選項解析】(A) primary 初級的/主要的 (B) chemical 化學的 (C) false 虛假的 (D) aid 援助。主要基礎為 primary foundation。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Never mix bleach with other ______ cleaners in the bathroom, as the reaction can produce dangerous poisonous gases.","options":["primary","false","chemical","aid"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: chemical (化學的) 【全文中譯】絕不要在浴室將漂白水與其他化學清潔劑混合，因為化學反應會產生危險的有毒氣體。 【選項解析】(A) primary 主要的 (B) false 虛假的 (C) chemical 化學的 (D) aid 援助。化學清潔劑為 chemical cleaners。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Due to a small computer system ______, the flight departure time was displayed incorrectly on the airport information screens.","options":["error","fault","aid","cable"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: error (失誤；故障) 【全文中譯】由於電腦系統的一個小錯誤，機場資訊螢幕上的航班起飛時間顯示有誤。 【選項解析】(A) error 錯誤 (B) fault 過失 (C) aid 援助 (D) cable 電纜。系統出錯為 system error。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Although the machinery broke down suddenly during operation, the technician explained that it was not the worker's ______.","options":["error","fault","aid","album"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: fault (過錯；責任) 【全文中譯】儘管機械在運轉過程中突然發生故障，但技術人員解釋說這不是工人的過錯。 【選項解析】(A) error 錯誤 (B) fault 過失 (C) aid 援助 (D) album 相片簿。不是某人的錯用 not sb's fault。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Giving ______ statements to a police officer during a criminal investigation is considered a serious legal offense.","options":["primary","chemical","false","aid"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: false (虛假的；偽造的) 【全文中譯】在刑事調查期間向警官提供虛假口供被視為嚴重的違法行為。 【選項解析】(A) primary 主要的 (B) chemical 化學的 (C) false 虛假的 (D) aid 援助。虛假口供為 false statements。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The Red Cross delivered first ______ kits containing bandages, antiseptic creams, and pain relievers to the disaster shelters.","options":["aid","error","fault","accident"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: aid (急救；援助) 【全文中譯】紅十字會向災民安置所運送了裝有繃帶、消毒藥膏和止痛藥的急救箱。 【選項解析】(A) aid 急救/援助 (B) error 錯誤 (C) fault 過錯 (D) accident 事故。急救箱為 first aid kit。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The reckless driver ran a red light at the intersection and caused a serious traffic ______ that blocked the street for two hours.","options":["accident","album","diary","cable"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: accident (車禍) 【全文中譯】魯莽的司機在十字路口闖紅燈，引發了一場嚴重的交通事故，導致街道封閉了兩小時。 【選項解析】(A) accident 車禍 (B) album 相簿 (C) diary 日記 (D) cable 電纜。交通事故為 traffic accident。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The bride and groom designed a commemorative wedding ______ featuring color photographs taken during their European honeymoon trip.","options":["accident","album","diary","cable"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: album (相簿；影集) 【全文中譯】新郎和新娘設計了一本紀念婚禮相簿，收錄了他們歐洲蜜月旅行期間拍攝的彩色照片。 【選項解析】(A) accident 事故 (B) album 相簿 (C) diary 日記 (D) cable 電纜。紀念婚禮相簿為 wedding album。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The captain kept a detailed ship's ______ that recorded every ocean storm, navigation coordinate, and daily distance traveled.","options":["cable","accident","diary","album"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: diary (航海日誌；日記) 【全文中譯】船長保持著詳細的船隻日誌，記錄了每次海洋暴風雨、航海座標和每日航行里程。 【選項解析】(A) cable 電纜 (B) accident 意外 (C) diary 日記/日誌 (D) album 相簿。航海日誌記錄為 ship's diary。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The computer monitor was connected to the desktop computer tower by a heavy black video ______ under the desk.","options":["diary","album","accident","cable"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: cable (連接線；電纜) 【全文中譯】電腦螢幕通過書桌下一條粗粗的黑色視訊電纜與桌上型電腦主機相連。 【選項解析】(A) diary 日記 (B) album 相簿 (C) accident 意外 (D) cable 連接線。視訊傳輸線為 video cable。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Preventing teenage smoking and alcohol consumption is the ______ objective of our school health education program this semester.","options":["primary","chemical","false","aid"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: primary (首要的) 【全文中譯】預防青少年吸菸和飲酒是我們學校本學期健康教育計畫的首要目標。 【選項解析】(A) primary 首要的 (B) chemical 化學的 (C) false 虛假的 (D) aid 援助。首要目標為 primary objective。"}]},{"unit":87,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 87 (087.mp3) Topic Focus: Scientific Methods, Research Projects, Samples & Physical States","topic":"Topic Focus: Scientific Methods, Research Projects, Samples & Physical States | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"favor","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"an act of kindness beyond what is due; to prefer or support","chinese":"恩惠；幫忙；偏袒","sentence":"Could you please do me a small personal ______ and look after my pet cat while I travel to Tainan this weekend?","translation":"你能幫我一個小小的個人忙，在我這週末前往台南旅遊時照顧我的寵物貓嗎？"},{"word":"method","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a particular way of doing something, especially a systematic one","chinese":"方法；方式","sentence":"The science teacher taught the high school students a systematic ______ for testing the cleanliness of drinking water.","translation":"自然老師教授了高中生一套用來檢驗飲用水清潔度的系統性方法。"},{"word":"project","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a planned piece of work that has a specific purpose","chinese":"專案；計畫；研討題目","sentence":"Our environmental biology team worked hard for three months to complete the research ______ on river pollution.","translation":"我們的環境生物團隊辛勤工作了三個月，完成了關於河流污染的研究專案。"},{"word":"sample","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a small amount of a substance showing what the whole is like","chinese":"樣本；樣品；品嚐","sentence":"The department store cosmetic counter gave free skin lotion ______ to customers who filled out a short survey.","translation":"百貨公司化妝品專櫃向填寫簡短問卷的顧客發放了免費的護膚乳液樣品。"},{"word":"screen","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"the flat surface on a computer or television; to filter or test","chinese":"螢幕；紗窗；篩選","sentence":"Looking continuously at a bright smartphone ______ in the dark before sleeping can cause severe eyestrain.","translation":"睡前在黑暗中持續盯著明亮的手機螢幕會造成嚴重的眼睛疲勞。"},{"word":"steam","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"the hot gas that water turns into when boiled; to cook with steam","chinese":"水蒸氣；蒸煮","sentence":"Hot white ______ rose from the boiling kettle in the kitchen, signaling that the morning tea was ready.","translation":"熱騰騰的白色水蒸氣從廚房沸騰的水壺中升起，示意晨茶已經準備好了。"},{"word":"tank","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a large container for holding liquid or gas; an armored fighting vehicle","chinese":"儲水槽；油箱；坦克","sentence":"The apartment building maintenance team cleaned the large rooftop water ______ thoroughly yesterday morning.","translation":"公寓大樓維護團隊昨天早上徹底清洗了屋頂上的大型儲水槽。"},{"word":"pile","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a mass of things heaped together on top of one another","chinese":"一堆；堆疊","sentence":"A tall ______ of dirty clothing lay beside the washing machine waiting to be washed on Sunday afternoon.","translation":"一大堆髒衣服堆在洗衣機旁，等待著在星期天下午清洗。"},{"word":"bundle","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a number of things tied or wrapped together","chinese":"一捆；一束；包裹","sentence":"The volunteer workers tied a thick ______ of old newspapers with plastic ropes before sending them to the recycling center.","translation":"志工們在將大捆舊報紙送往回收中心之前，先用塑膠繩將它們捆綁整齊。"},{"word":"liquid","pos":"(n.) / (adj.)","definition":"a substance that flows freely, such as water or oil","chinese":"液體；液態的","sentence":"You should drink plenty of warm ______ such as honey water and chicken broth when you have a fever.","translation":"當你發燒時，你應該多喝溫熱的液體，例如蜂蜜水和雞湯。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Excuse me, Mr. Wang, could you do me a huge ______ and give me a ride to the nearest train station?","options":["favor","method","project","sample"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: favor (幫忙；恩惠) 【全文中譯】不好意思王先生，你能幫我一個大忙，載我去最近的火車站嗎？ 【選項解析】(A) favor 幫忙 (B) method 方法 (C) project 專案 (D) sample 樣品。do sb a favor 為常見片語「幫某人一個忙」。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Using flashcards with pictures is a very effective study ______ for elementary students to memorize English words.","options":["favor","method","project","screen"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: method (方法) 【全文中譯】使用帶有圖片的單字卡是小學生記憶英語單字的一種非常有效的學習方法。 【選項解析】(A) favor 幫忙 (B) method 方法 (C) project 專案 (D) screen 螢幕。有效的學習方法為 effective study method。"},{"number":3,"stem":"All tenth-grade students are required to submit an independent science ______ before the end of the school semester.","options":["sample","screen","project","favor"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: project (專題；專案) 【全文中譯】所有十年級學生都必須在學期結束前繳交一份獨立的科學研究專題。 【選項解析】(A) sample 樣本 (B) screen 螢幕 (C) project 專案/專題 (D) favor 恩惠。科學專題為 science project。"},{"number":4,"stem":"The laboratory technician tested a small blood ______ to determine whether the patient had contracted the virus.","options":["favor","method","tank","sample"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: sample (血液樣本) 【全文中譯】實驗室檢驗員化驗了一小份血液樣本，以確定該病患是否感染了病毒。 【選項解析】(A) favor 幫忙 (B) method 方法 (C) tank 水槽 (D) sample 樣本。血液樣本為 blood sample。"},{"number":5,"stem":"You can adjust the brightness settings on your computer ______ to make reading long documents more comfortable.","options":["screen","steam","tank","pile"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: screen (螢幕) 【全文中譯】你可以調整電腦螢幕上的亮度設定，讓閱讀長篇文件更加舒適。 【選項解析】(A) screen 螢幕 (B) steam 水蒸氣 (C) tank 水槽 (D) pile 一堆。電腦螢幕為 computer screen。"},{"number":6,"stem":"When my mother lifted the metal lid of the rice cooker, a hot cloud of white ______ filled the kitchen.","options":["screen","steam","pile","bundle"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: steam (水蒸氣) 【全文中譯】當我母親掀開電鍋的金屬蓋時，一團熱騰騰的白色水蒸氣瀰漫了廚房。 【選項解析】(A) screen 螢幕 (B) steam 水蒸氣 (C) pile 一堆 (D) bundle 一捆。熱蒸氣為 hot steam。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The driver pulled into the gas station because the fuel ______ in his car was almost completely empty.","options":["pile","bundle","tank","steam"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: tank (油箱；儲水槽) 【全文中譯】司機把車開進了加油站，因為他車裡的油箱幾乎完全空了。 【選項解析】(A) pile 一堆 (B) bundle 一捆 (C) tank 油箱 (D) steam 水蒸氣。汽車油箱為 fuel tank。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The librarian organized the messy ______ of returned storybooks into neat alphabetical order on the wooden cart.","options":["pile","bundle","tank","liquid"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pile (一堆) 【全文中譯】圖書管理員把木推車上雜亂的一堆歸還童書按照字母順序整理得整整齊齊。 【選項解析】(A) pile 一堆 (B) bundle 一捆 (C) tank 水槽 (D) liquid 液體。雜亂的一堆書為 messy pile of books。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The postman delivered a wrapped ______ of letters and magazines to our front doorstep this morning.","options":["pile","bundle","liquid","steam"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: bundle (一捆；包裹) 【全文中譯】今天早上郵差把一捆包紮好的信件和雜誌送到了我們的前門台階上。 【選項解析】(A) pile 一堆 (B) bundle 一捆 (C) liquid 液體 (D) steam 水蒸氣。捆綁好的信件為 bundle of letters。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Water, milk, and gasoline are common examples of ______ that take the shape of whatever container holds them.","options":["pile","steam","liquid","tank"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: liquid (液體) 【全文中譯】水、牛奶和汽油都是液體的常見例子，它們會呈現容納它們的任何容器的形狀。 【選項解析】(A) pile 一堆 (B) steam 水蒸氣 (C) liquid 液體 (D) tank 水槽。液態物質為 liquid。"},{"number":11,"stem":"I would consider it a great ______ if you could review my university application essay and offer suggestions.","options":["favor","method","project","sample"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: favor (幫忙；恩惠) 【全文中譯】如果你能幫忙審閱我的大學申請自傳並提供建議，我會認為這是一個莫大的幫忙。 【選項解析】(A) favor 幫忙 (B) method 方法 (C) project 計畫 (D) sample 樣品。重大幫助恩惠為 a great favor。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Scientists have developed a new recycling ______ that turns plastic waste into reusable building materials.","options":["favor","method","project","screen"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: method (方法) 【全文中譯】科學家開發了一種新的回收方法，可以將塑膠廢棄物轉化為可重複使用的建築材料。 【選項解析】(A) favor 幫忙 (B) method 方法 (C) project 專案 (D) screen 螢幕。回收處理方法為 recycling method。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The city council approved a multimillion-dollar transportation ______ to extend the metro line to the airport.","options":["sample","screen","project","favor"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: project (交通工程專案) 【全文中譯】市議會批准了一項耗資數百萬美元的交通建設專案，將地鐵路線延伸至機場。 【選項解析】(A) sample 樣本 (B) screen 螢幕 (C) project 專案 (D) favor 恩惠。交通重大建設計案為 transportation project。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The friendly food vendor gave every curious passerby a tasty free ______ of freshly baked apple pie.","options":["favor","method","tank","sample"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: sample (免費試吃樣品) 【全文中譯】和藹可親的食品小販給每位好奇的過路人提供了一份剛出爐的美味免費蘋果派試吃品。 【選項解析】(A) favor 幫忙 (B) method 方法 (C) tank 水槽 (D) sample 試吃品/樣品。免費樣品為 free sample。"},{"number":15,"stem":"To protect your eyes from digital fatigue, remember to take a twenty-second break from your computer ______ every twenty minutes.","options":["screen","steam","tank","pile"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: screen (電腦螢幕) 【全文中譯】為了保護眼睛免受數位疲勞的影響，請記得每二十分鐘讓眼睛離開電腦螢幕休息二十秒。 【選項解析】(A) screen 螢幕 (B) steam 水蒸氣 (C) tank 儲水槽 (D) pile 一堆。離開電腦螢幕為 break from computer screen。"},{"number":16,"stem":"In cold winter mornings, you can see white ______ rising from hot bowls of beef noodle soup in street night markets.","options":["screen","steam","pile","bundle"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: steam (蒸氣) 【全文中譯】在寒冷的冬日早晨，你可以在夜市街頭看到一碗碗熱氣騰騰的牛肉麵冒出陣陣白蒸氣。 【選項解析】(A) screen 螢幕 (B) steam 蒸氣 (C) pile 一堆 (D) bundle 一捆。冒出白色熱氣蒸氣為 white steam rising。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Our residential community has a backup water ______ on the roof to guarantee continuous water supply during pipeline repairs.","options":["pile","bundle","tank","steam"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: tank (儲水槽) 【全文中譯】我們社區在屋頂上設有備用儲水槽，以確保管線維修期間仍能持續供水。 【選項解析】(A) pile 一堆 (B) bundle 一捆 (C) tank 儲水槽 (D) steam 水蒸氣。屋頂備用水塔為 backup water tank。"},{"number":18,"stem":"An untidy ______ of dirty dishes sat in the kitchen sink waiting for someone to wash them after dinner.","options":["pile","bundle","tank","liquid"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pile (一堆) 【全文中譯】廚房水槽裡堆著一堆髒盤子，等待著有人在晚餐後把它們洗乾淨。 【選項解析】(A) pile 一堆 (B) bundle 一捆 (C) tank 水槽 (D) liquid 液體。一堆髒盤子為 pile of dirty dishes。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Grandfather carried a heavy ______ of dried firewood from the forest to keep the fireplace burning all night.","options":["pile","bundle","liquid","steam"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: bundle (一捆) 【全文中譯】祖父從森林裡搬來了一大捆乾燥的木柴，讓壁爐整夜燃燒取暖。 【選項解析】(A) pile 一堆 (B) bundle 一捆 (C) liquid 液體 (D) steam 蒸氣。一捆乾燥木柴為 bundle of dried firewood。"},{"number":20,"stem":"Dangerous corrosive ______ must be stored in labeled glass bottles with secure plastic caps in the chemical lab.","options":["pile","steam","liquid","tank"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: liquid (液體) 【全文中譯】危險的腐蝕性液體在化學實驗室中必須存放在帶有安全塑膠蓋的標記玻璃瓶中。 【選項解析】(A) pile 一堆 (B) steam 蒸氣 (C) liquid 液體 (D) tank 水槽。腐蝕性液體為 corrosive liquid。"},{"number":21,"stem":"May I ask you for a quick ______: could you help me carry these heavy cardboard boxes up to the third floor?","options":["favor","method","project","sample"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: favor (幫忙) 【全文中譯】我可以請你幫個小忙嗎：你能幫我把這些沉重的紙箱搬到三樓嗎？ 【選項解析】(A) favor 幫忙 (B) method 方法 (C) project 計畫 (D) sample 樣品。ask sb for a favor 表示請某人幫忙。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Following a regular exercise routine is an excellent ______ for improving cardiovascular fitness and mental alertness.","options":["favor","method","project","screen"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: method (方法) 【全文中譯】遵循規律的運動作息是增強心血管體能和保持精神敏銳的絕佳方法。 【選項解析】(A) favor 幫忙 (B) method 方法 (C) project 專題 (D) screen 螢幕。絕佳方法為 excellent method。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The school history ______ required students to interview their grandparents about daily life during the 1960s.","options":["sample","screen","project","favor"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: project (歷史作業專題) 【全文中譯】學校的歷史專題作業要求學生訪談他們的祖父母，了解1960年代的日常生活。 【選項解析】(A) sample 樣本 (B) screen 螢幕 (C) project 專題 (D) favor 恩惠。歷史研究作業為 history project。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The doctor examined a tissue ______ under the high-powered microscope to ensure the cells were completely healthy.","options":["favor","method","tank","sample"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: sample (組織切片樣本) 【全文中譯】醫生在高倍顯微鏡下檢查了一份組織樣本，以確保細胞完全健康。 【選項解析】(A) favor 幫忙 (B) method 方法 (C) tank 水槽 (D) sample 組織樣本。醫學切片樣本為 tissue sample。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Please turn down the brightness on your television ______ before the living room lights are completely turned off.","options":["screen","steam","tank","pile"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: screen (電視螢幕) 【全文中譯】在客廳燈光完全熄滅之前，請先把電視螢幕的亮度調低。 【選項解析】(A) screen 螢幕 (B) steam 蒸氣 (C) tank 水槽 (D) pile 一堆。電視螢幕為 television screen。"}]},{"unit":88,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 88 (088.mp3) Topic Focus: Depth, Totality, Safety Precautions, Differences & Book Fairs","topic":"Topic Focus: Depth, Totality, Safety Precautions, Differences & Book Fairs | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"deep","pos":"(adj.) / (adv.)","definition":"going far down from the top or surface; profound","chinese":"深的；深沉地","sentence":"The mountain river looks very calm on the surface, but it is actually ten meters ______ and dangerous for young swimmers.","translation":"這條山間河流表面看起來十分平靜，但實際上深達十公尺，對年幼的游泳者來說相當危險。"},{"word":"altogether","pos":"(adv.)","definition":"completely; considering everything; in total","chinese":"完全；總共；總而言之","sentence":"After adding up the cost of flight tickets, hotel rooms, and dining, our family vacation cost thirty thousand dollars ______.","translation":"在合計機票、飯店房間和餐飲費用後，我們的家庭度假總共花費了三萬元。"},{"word":"extra","pos":"(adj.) / (n.)","definition":"more than is usual, expected, or needed","chinese":"額外的；額外的事物","sentence":"Because the temperature dropped suddenly last night, the hotel receptionist provided an ______ woolen blanket for our bed.","translation":"因為昨晚氣溫驟降，飯店接待人員為我們的床鋪提供了一條額外的羊毛毯。"},{"word":"final","pos":"(adj.) / (n.)","definition":"coming at the end of a series; the last exam or game","chinese":"最後的；決賽；期末考","sentence":"Senior high school students are studying diligently in the school library to prepare for their ______ graduation exams next week.","translation":"高中高年級學生正在學校圖書館裡勤奮讀書，為下週的畢業期末考試做準備。"},{"word":"lack","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"the state of being without something; to not have enough","chinese":"缺乏；缺少","sentence":"The young job applicant had great enthusiasm for graphic design, but his ______ of practical experience made hiring difficult.","translation":"這位年輕的求職者對平面設計充滿熱情，但他缺乏實務經驗使得錄取變得困難。"},{"word":"safety","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the state of being protected from danger or harm","chinese":"安全；平安","sentence":"Construction workers are strictly required to wear yellow hard hats to ensure their personal ______ at the building site.","translation":"建築工人被嚴格要求戴上黃色安全帽，以確保他們在建築工地的個人安全。"},{"word":"similar","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"looking or being almost, but not exactly, the same","chinese":"相似的；類似的","sentence":"Although the two twin sisters wore ______ pink dresses to the party, their hairstyles and personalities were quite different.","translation":"雖然這對雙胞胎姊妹穿著相似的粉色洋裝去參加派對，但她們的髮型和性格卻大不相同。"},{"word":"difference","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the way in which two or more things are not like each other","chinese":"差異；不同處","sentence":"Can you explain the main grammatical ______ between the present perfect tense and the simple past tense in English?","translation":"你能解釋一下英語中現在完成式與簡單過去式之間的主要文法差異嗎？"},{"word":"branch","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a part of a tree that grows out from the trunk; a local office","chinese":"樹枝；分行；分部","sentence":"The international commercial bank decided to open a new customer service ______ in the busy financial district of Taichung.","translation":"這家國際商業銀行決定在台中繁華的金融區開設一家新的客戶服務分行。"},{"word":"fair","pos":"(adj.) / (n.)","definition":"treating people equally; a public event for trade or fun","chinese":"公平的；展覽會；市集","sentence":"Thousands of enthusiastic book lovers visited the Taipei International Book ______ to purchase newly published novels at a discount.","translation":"數千名熱情的愛書人參觀了台北國際書展，以折扣價格購買新出版的小說。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"You must not jump into that mountain lake because the water is extremely ______ and full of hidden rocks.","options":["deep","extra","final","similar"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: deep (深的) 【全文中譯】你絕不能跳進那個高山湖泊，因為湖水極深且布滿隱藏的暗礁。 【選項解析】(A) deep 深的 (B) extra 額外的 (C) final 最後的 (D) similar 相似的。水深用 deep。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The heavy rainfall stopped ______, the clouds cleared away, and a bright rainbow appeared across the eastern sky.","options":["altogether","deep","extra","similar"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: altogether (完全；徹底) 【全文中譯】大雨完全停了，雲層消散，東方天空中出現了一道絢麗的彩虹。 【選項解析】(A) altogether 完全地 (B) deep 深地 (C) extra 額外地 (D) similar 相似地。完全停止為 stop altogether。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The airline allows passengers to check one piece of luggage for free, but any ______ bag will incur an additional fee.","options":["deep","extra","final","similar"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: extra (額外的) 【全文中譯】航空公司允許乘客免費託運一件行李，但任何額外的行李都將收取額外費用。 【選項解析】(A) deep 深的 (B) extra 額外的 (C) final 最終的 (D) similar 相似的。額外行李為 extra bag。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Both teams played with great energy throughout the championship tournament, and our school team won the ______ match.","options":["extra","similar","final","deep"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: final (決賽；最後的) 【全文中譯】兩支球隊在整個錦標賽中都表現得充滿活力，而我們學校的球隊贏得了最後的決賽。 【選項解析】(A) extra 額外的 (B) similar 相似的 (C) final 決賽/最後的 (D) deep 深的。決賽為 final match。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Due to a severe ______ of clean drinking water in the drought-affected village, water trucks were sent daily.","options":["lack","safety","difference","branch"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: lack (缺乏；缺少) 【全文中譯】由於遭受乾旱影響的村莊嚴重缺乏潔淨飲用水，每天都派出送水車支援。 【選項解析】(A) lack 缺乏 (B) safety 安全 (C) difference 差異 (D) branch 分部。缺乏潔淨飲用水為 lack of clean water。"},{"number":6,"stem":"For your personal ______, please remain seated with your seatbelt fastened until the airplane comes to a complete stop.","options":["lack","safety","branch","difference"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: safety (安全) 【全文中譯】為了您的個人安全，在飛機完全停穩之前，請留在座位上並繫好安全帶。 【選項解析】(A) lack 缺乏 (B) safety 安全 (C) branch 分行 (D) difference 差異。個人安全為 personal safety。"},{"number":7,"stem":"My classmate and I bought ______ backpack styles from the same store, but mine is navy blue while hers is dark green.","options":["deep","final","similar","extra"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: similar (相似的) 【全文中譯】我和同學在同一家店買了相似款式的背包，但我的是深藍色，而她的是深綠色。 【選項解析】(A) deep 深的 (B) final 最後的 (C) similar 相似的 (D) extra 額外的。相似款式為 similar styles。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Even though the two laptops look identical on the outside, there is a substantial price ______ between the two models.","options":["difference","lack","safety","branch"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: difference (差異) 【全文中譯】儘管這兩台筆記型電腦外表看起來一模一樣，但兩種型號之間存在相當大的價格差異。 【選項解析】(A) difference 差異 (B) lack 缺乏 (C) safety 安全 (D) branch 分行。價格差異為 price difference。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The little squirrel ran swiftly along the wooden fence and leaped onto a tall pine ______ to hide its acorn.","options":["difference","branch","safety","lack"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: branch (樹枝) 【全文中譯】小松鼠敏捷地沿著木柵欄奔跑，跳上高高的松樹樹枝去藏牠的橡子。 【選項解析】(A) difference 差異 (B) branch 樹枝 (C) safety 安全 (D) lack 缺乏。樹枝為 tree branch。"},{"number":10,"stem":"It is not ______ to blame John for the broken window when three other children were also playing baseball in the garden.","options":["deep","extra","fair","similar"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: fair (公平的) 【全文中譯】當花園裡還有其他三個孩子也在打棒球時，把打破窗戶的責任全推給約翰是不公平的。 【選項解析】(A) deep 深的 (B) extra 額外的 (C) fair 公平的 (D) similar 相似的。不公平用 not fair。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Take a ______ breath of fresh country air, relax your shoulders, and enjoy the peaceful view of the green valley.","options":["deep","extra","similar","final"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: deep (深沉的；深的) 【全文中譯】深吸一口鄉村的新鮮空氣，放鬆肩膀，享受綠色山谷的寧靜景色。 【選項解析】(A) deep 深的 (B) extra 額外的 (C) similar 相似的 (D) final 最終的。深呼吸為 take a deep breath。"},{"number":12,"stem":"In the mathematics exam, there were ten questions in Section A and fifteen in Section B, making twenty-five questions ______.","options":["altogether","deep","extra","similar"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: altogether (總共；合計) 【全文中譯】在數學考試中，A部分有十題，B部分有十五題，總共有二十五題。 【選項解析】(A) altogether 總共 (B) deep 深地 (C) extra 額外地 (D) similar 相似地。合計總共用 altogether。"},{"number":13,"stem":"If you finish your homework early this evening, you will have ______ time to play video games before bedtime.","options":["deep","extra","final","similar"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: extra (額外的) 【全文中譯】如果你今天傍晚提早完成作業，在睡覺前你就會有額外的時間玩電玩。 【選項解析】(A) deep 深的 (B) extra 額外的 (C) final 最後的 (D) similar 相似的。額外時間為 extra time。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The teacher announced that Friday would be the ______ day for students to hand in their term history papers.","options":["deep","similar","final","extra"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: final (最後的) 【全文中譯】老師宣布星期五將是學生繳交學期歷史報告的最後截止日。 【選項解析】(A) deep 深的 (B) similar 相似的 (C) final 最後的 (D) extra 額外的。最後一天為 final day。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Many developing countries suffer from a serious ______ of qualified medical doctors in rural healthcare clinics.","options":["lack","safety","branch","difference"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: lack (缺乏) 【全文中譯】許多發展中國家的鄉村醫療診所面臨著合格醫師嚴重短缺的問題。 【選項解析】(A) lack 缺乏 (B) safety 安全 (C) branch 分院 (D) difference 差異。嚴重匱乏為 serious lack of...。"},{"number":16,"stem":"The factory manager conducted a thorough workplace ______ inspection to prevent industrial injuries among machine operators.","options":["lack","safety","branch","difference"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: safety (安全) 【全文中譯】工廠經理進行了徹底的工作場所安全檢查，以防止機器操作員發生工傷事故。 【選項解析】(A) lack 缺乏 (B) safety 安全 (C) branch 分行 (D) difference 差異。安全檢查為 safety inspection。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Indonesian and Malaysian languages have many ______ words because both nations share common historical and linguistic roots.","options":["deep","extra","similar","final"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: similar (相似的) 【全文中譯】印尼語和馬來語有許多相似的單字，因為兩國共享共同的歷史和語言淵源。 【選項解析】(A) deep 深的 (B) extra 額外的 (C) similar 相似的 (D) final 最終的。相似字詞為 similar words。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Learning to respect cultural ______ is the first step toward building international harmony and global understanding.","options":["differences","lacks","safeties","branches"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: differences (差異；多元) 【全文中譯】學會尊重文化差異是建立國際和諧與全球相互理解的第一步。 【選項解析】(A) differences 差異 (B) lacks 缺乏 (C) safeties 安全 (D) branches 分行。文化差異為 cultural differences。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Our university opened a new overseas research ______ in Tokyo to promote joint technology development with Japanese scientists.","options":["lack","branch","safety","difference"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: branch (分部；分支機構) 【全文中譯】我們的大學在東京設立了一個新的海外研究分部，以促進與日本科學家的聯合技術研發。 【選項解析】(A) lack 缺乏 (B) branch 分部 (C) safety 安全 (D) difference 差異。海外分部為 overseas research branch。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The referee made a completely ______ decision by awarding a penalty kick when the defender tripped the forward in the box.","options":["deep","extra","fair","similar"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: fair (公正的；公平的) 【全文中譯】當防守球員在禁區內絆倒前鋒時，裁判判罰十二碼球，做出了一個完全公正的判決。 【選項解析】(A) deep 深的 (B) extra 額外的 (C) fair 公正的 (D) similar 相似的。公正決定為 fair decision。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The ocean trench is over six thousand meters ______, where no sunlight can ever penetrate the cold black waters.","options":["deep","extra","final","similar"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: deep (深達……的) 【全文中譯】這條海溝深達六千多公尺，在那裡任何陽光都無法穿透冰冷漆黑的海水。 【選項解析】(A) deep 深的 (B) extra 額外的 (C) final 最終的 (D) similar 相似的。形容深達幾公尺用... meters deep。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The customer purchased a sandwich, an apple, and a soda, which came to two hundred dollars ______ at the counter.","options":["altogether","deep","extra","similar"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: altogether (總計；總共) 【全文中譯】顧客買了一個三明治、一顆蘋果和一瓶汽水，在櫃台結帳時總計兩百元。 【選項解析】(A) altogether 總共 (B) deep 深地 (C) extra 額外地 (D) similar 相似地。總共金額為... dollars altogether。"},{"number":23,"stem":"We ordered an ______ portion of crispy French fries to share among four friends at the hamburger restaurant.","options":["deep","extra","similar","final"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: extra (額外的；加點的) 【全文中譯】我們在漢堡店加點了一份酥脆的炸薯條，讓四位朋友一起分享享用。 【選項解析】(A) deep 深的 (B) extra 額外的 (C) similar 相似的 (D) final 最後的。加點額外一份為 extra portion。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The referee blew the whistle to signal the ______ score of the soccer game: three goals to one in our favor.","options":["deep","similar","final","extra"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: final (最終的) 【全文中譯】裁判吹響哨音示意足球賽的最終比分：三比一，由我們球隊獲勝。 【選項解析】(A) deep 深的 (B) similar 相似的 (C) final 最終的 (D) extra 額外的。最終比分為 final score。"},{"number":25,"stem":"A severe ______ of sleep can impair your concentration and memory when preparing for crucial school examinations.","options":["lack","safety","branch","difference"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: lack (缺乏) 【全文中譯】在為重要的學校考試做準備時，嚴重睡眠不足會損害你的專注力和記憶力。 【選項解析】(A) lack 缺乏 (B) safety 安全 (C) branch 分行 (D) difference 差異。睡眠不足為 lack of sleep。"}]},{"unit":89,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 89 (089.mp3) Topic Focus: Media Channels, Social Influence, Purpose & Personal Absences","topic":"Topic Focus: Media Channels, Social Influence, Purpose & Personal Absences | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"channel","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a television or radio station; a system for communication","chinese":"頻道；管道；途徑","sentence":"My grandfather picked up the remote control and switched to the news ______ to watch the weather forecast for tomorrow.","translation":"我祖父拿起遙控器切換到新聞頻道，觀看明天的天氣預報。"},{"word":"difficulty","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the state of being hard to do or understand; an obstacle","chinese":"困難；難題","sentence":"Because the foreign language textbook was full of advanced words, the beginner had great ______ understanding the chapter.","translation":"因為這本外語教科書充滿了進階單字，初學者在理解該章節時遇到了很大的困難。"},{"word":"influence","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"the power to have an effect on people or things","chinese":"影響；感化","sentence":"Dedicated teachers have a profound ______ on their students' future career choices and ethical character development.","translation":"敬業的教師對學生未來的職業選擇和品德塑造有著深遠的影響。"},{"word":"link","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a connection between two things; to connect together","chinese":"連結；關聯；繫結","sentence":"The high-speed rail line provides an essential transportation ______ connecting the major metropolitan cities of Taiwan.","translation":"高鐵提供了一條不可或缺的交通連結，聯繫著台灣各大都會城市。"},{"word":"pardon","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"forgiveness for an offense; an expression used to ask someone to repeat","chinese":"原諒；寬恕；請再說一遍","sentence":"I beg your ______, but could you please speak a little louder because the traffic noise outside is very loud?","translation":"請原諒我（請再說一遍），但你能否稍微說大聲一點，因為外面的車流噪音非常吵雜？"},{"word":"purpose","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the reason for which something is done or created","chinese":"目的；意圖","sentence":"The primary ______ of this community health seminar is to teach residents how to prepare balanced and nutritious meals.","translation":"本社區健康研討會的主要目的是教導居民如何準備均衡且營養的餐點。"},{"word":"reason","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a cause or explanation for an action or event; to think logically","chinese":"理由；原因；推理","sentence":"The school principal explained the main ______ why cell phone usage was prohibited inside classrooms during lecture hours.","translation":"校長解釋了在講課時間內教室禁止使用手機的主要原因。"},{"word":"shower","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a device that sprays water for washing; a brief fall of rain","chinese":"淋浴；陣雨；下陣雨","sentence":"Taking a warm relaxing ______ after a tiring day of physical labor helps soothe tense muscles and promotes deep sleep.","translation":"在經歷了一整天辛勞的體力勞動後，洗個舒適的溫水澡有助於舒緩緊繃的肌肉並促進深度睡眠。"},{"word":"absent","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"not present in a place, especially school or work","chinese":"缺席的；不在場的","sentence":"Three students were ______ from English class yesterday morning because they had caught a contagious seasonal flu virus.","translation":"昨天早上有三名學生在英語課上缺席，因為他們感染了傳染性極強的季節性流感病毒。"},{"word":"blank","pos":"(adj.) / (n.)","definition":"empty; without any writing, print, or marks","chinese":"空白的；空格","sentence":"Please fill in each numbered ______ on the test sheet with the most suitable English vocabulary word from the box.","translation":"請在測驗卷上的每個編號空格中填入方框中最合適的英語單字。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Dad switched the television ______ to watch the live international soccer championship match with his friends.","options":["channel","difficulty","purpose","reason"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: channel (電視頻道) 【全文中譯】爸爸切換電視頻道，和他的朋友們一起觀看國際足球錦標賽的現場直播。 【選項解析】(A) channel 頻道 (B) difficulty 困難 (C) purpose 目的 (D) reason 原因。電視頻道為 television channel。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Even six months after the serious skiing accident, David still experiences severe ______ walking down steep staircases.","options":["channel","difficulty","link","shower"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: difficulty (困難；障礙) 【全文中譯】即使在發生嚴重滑雪事故六個月後，戴維在走下陡峭樓梯時仍然遇到嚴重的困難。 【選項解析】(A) channel 頻道 (B) difficulty 困難 (C) link 連結 (D) shower 淋浴。遇到困難為 experience difficulty doing sth。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Parents' reading habits at home have a significant positive ______ on their children's language development and curiosity.","options":["difficulty","link","influence","shower"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: influence (影響) 【全文中譯】父母在家裡的閱讀習慣對孩子的語言發展和求知好奇心有著顯著的正面影響。 【選項解析】(A) difficulty 困難 (B) link 連結 (C) influence 影響 (D) shower 淋浴。正面影響為 positive influence。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Medical researchers have discovered a direct ______ between heavy daily sugar intake and the development of diabetes.","options":["shower","channel","pardon","link"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: link (關聯；連結) 【全文中譯】醫學研究人員發現了每天大量攝入糖分與罹患糖尿病之間的直接關聯。 【選項解析】(A) shower 陣雨 (B) channel 頻道 (C) pardon 原諒 (D) link 關聯。直接關聯為 direct link。"},{"number":5,"stem":"I beg your ______, sir, but did you say the train to Kaohsiung departs from platform two or platform four?","options":["pardon","channel","shower","link"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pardon (原諒；請再說一遍) 【全文中譯】先生，請原諒我（請您再說一次），您是說往高雄的火車是從第二月台還是第四月台開出？ 【選項解析】(A) pardon 原諒/請再說一遍 (B) channel 頻道 (C) shower 陣雨 (D) link 連結。I beg your pardon 為禮貌請求重述。"},{"number":6,"stem":"The main ______ of holding the charity bazaar is to raise money for orphanages and elderly nursing homes.","options":["shower","purpose","difficulty","channel"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: purpose (目的) 【全文中譯】舉辦慈善義賣的主要目的是為孤兒院和養老院籌集善款。 【選項解析】(A) shower 淋浴 (B) purpose 目的 (C) difficulty 困難 (D) channel 管道。主要目的為 primary purpose。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The teacher asked Henry for the specific ______ why his math homework was not handed in on time this morning.","options":["channel","difficulty","reason","link"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: reason (原因；理由) 【全文中譯】老師詢問亨利今天早上沒有按時交數學作業的具體原因是什麼。 【選項解析】(A) channel 頻道 (B) difficulty 困難 (C) reason 原因 (D) link 連結。具體原因為 specific reason。"},{"number":8,"stem":"We got caught in a sudden afternoon ______ while walking in the park and had to take shelter under a gazebo.","options":["shower","channel","difficulty","link"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: shower (陣雨) 【全文中譯】我們在公園散步時遭遇了一場突如其來的午後陣雨，不得不躲進涼亭避雨。 【選項解析】(A) shower 陣雨 (B) channel 頻道 (C) difficulty 困難 (D) link 連結。午後陣雨為 afternoon shower。"},{"number":9,"stem":"If a student is ______ from school for more than three consecutive days, a parent note or doctor certificate is required.","options":["blank","absent","deep","final"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: absent (缺席的) 【全文中譯】如果學生連續三天以上缺課，必須出具家長請假條或醫生證明。 【選項解析】(A) blank 空白的 (B) absent 缺席的 (C) deep 深的 (D) final 最終的。缺席不在場為 absent from school。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Write your full name and examination number clearly on the ______ sheet of paper before you begin answering questions.","options":["absent","blank","similar","extra"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: blank (空白的) 【全文中譯】在開始回答問題之前，請在空白試卷上清楚寫下您的全名和准考證號碼。 【選項解析】(A) absent 缺席的 (B) blank 空白的 (C) similar 相似的 (D) extra 額外的。空白紙張為 blank sheet of paper。"},{"number":11,"stem":"You can visit our official YouTube ______ to watch free English pronunciation lessons and grammar review videos.","options":["channel","difficulty","shower","reason"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: channel (頻道) 【全文中譯】您可以造訪我們的官方YouTube頻道，觀看免費的英語發音教學和文法複習影片。 【選項解析】(A) channel 頻道 (B) difficulty 困難 (C) shower 淋浴 (D) reason 原因。網路影音頻道為 YouTube channel。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The climber encountered great ______ during the blizzard on the mountain peak and called emergency rescue services.","options":["channel","difficulty","link","shower"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: difficulty (艱難；困境) 【全文中譯】登山者在山頂暴風雪中遭遇了巨大的困難，並撥打了緊急救援電話。 【選項解析】(A) channel 頻道 (B) difficulty 困難 (C) link 連結 (D) shower 淋浴。遭遇困難為 encounter difficulty。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Popular social media influencers often ______ teenagers' purchasing decisions and fashion tastes through short video clips.","options":["shower","channel","influence","link"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: influence (影響；左右) 【全文中譯】受歡迎的社群媒體網紅經常透過短影片左右青少年的購買決定和時尚品味。 【選項解析】(A) shower 淋浴 (B) channel 引導 (C) influence 影響 (D) link 連結。影響決策動詞為 influence。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The underground bridge provides a vital pedestrian ______ between the central subway station and the department store.","options":["difficulty","shower","pardon","link"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: link (通道；連結) 【全文中譯】地下行人通道提供了中央地鐵站與百貨公司之間至關重要的行人通行連結。 【選項解析】(A) difficulty 困難 (B) shower 陣雨 (C) pardon 原諒 (D) link 連結。交通連結為 vital pedestrian link。"},{"number":15,"stem":"I must ask for your ______ for being twenty minutes late to our dinner appointment due to heavy traffic on the expressway.","options":["pardon","channel","shower","reason"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pardon (原諒；寬恕) 【全文中譯】因為快速道路上塞車導致我們的晚餐約會遲到了二十分鐘，我必須請求您的原諒。 【選項解析】(A) pardon 原諒 (B) channel 途徑 (C) shower 陣雨 (D) reason 理由。請求原諒為 ask for one's pardon。"},{"number":16,"stem":"For what ______ did the company president call an emergency meeting of all departmental managers this morning?","options":["shower","purpose","difficulty","link"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: purpose (目的；用意) 【全文中譯】公司總裁今天早上召集所有部門主管召開緊急會議究竟是出於什麼目的？ 【選項解析】(A) shower 淋浴 (B) purpose 目的 (C) difficulty 難處 (D) link 關係。出於何種目的為 for what purpose。"},{"number":17,"stem":"There is no legitimate ______ to treat people unfairly simply because of their race, religion, or social background.","options":["channel","difficulty","reason","shower"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: reason (正當理由) 【全文中譯】僅僅因為他人的種族、宗教或社會背景就不公平地對待他人是沒有任何正當理由的。 【選項解析】(A) channel 頻道 (B) difficulty 困難 (C) reason 理由 (D) shower 淋浴。正當理由為 legitimate reason。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Before jumping into the public swimming pool, swimmers are strictly required to take a quick cleansing ______.","options":["shower","channel","difficulty","link"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: shower (淋浴沖洗) 【全文中譯】在跳入公共游泳池之前，泳客被嚴格要求先進行快速的淋浴沖洗。 【選項解析】(A) shower 淋浴 (B) channel 渠道 (C) difficulty 障礙 (D) link 連結。沖洗身體為 take a shower。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Why was Samuel ______ from yesterday's soccer practice when our team had an important strategy rehearsal?","options":["blank","absent","final","deep"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: absent (缺席的) 【全文中譯】在我們球隊進行重要戰術演練時，塞繆爾為什麼缺席了昨天的足球訓練？ 【選項解析】(A) blank 空白的 (B) absent 缺席的 (C) final 最後的 (D) deep 深的。缺席活動為 absent from practice。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The nervous speaker's mind went completely ______ on stage, but he took a deep breath and remembered his opening lines.","options":["absent","blank","similar","extra"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: blank (腦袋一片空白) 【全文中譯】這位緊張的演講者在台上腦袋突然一片空白，但他深吸了一口氣，想起了開場白。 【選項解析】(A) absent 缺席的 (B) blank 空白的 (C) similar 相似的 (D) extra 額外的。mind went blank 表示「腦中一片空白」。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Our company uses multiple marketing ______ such as social media, email newsletters, and billboards to reach new buyers.","options":["channels","difficulties","showers","reasons"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: channels (管道；通路) 【全文中譯】我們公司利用社群媒體、電子郵件通訊和廣告牌等多種行銷管道來吸引新買家。 【選項解析】(A) channels 管道/途徑 (B) difficulties 困難 (C) showers 陣雨 (D) reasons 原因。行銷管道為 marketing channels。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Foreign students often face considerable language ______ when first attending university lectures conducted entirely in English.","options":["channels","difficulties","links","showers"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: difficulties (困難；阻礙) 【全文中譯】外國學生在初次參加完全用英語講授的大學課程時，往往面臨相當大的語言困難。 【選項解析】(A) channels 頻道 (B) difficulties 困難 (C) links 連結 (D) showers 陣雨。語言困難為 language difficulties。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Climate scientists warn that global warming will exert a dangerous ______ on agricultural crop yields worldwide.","options":["shower","channel","influence","link"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: influence (影響；衝擊) 【全文中譯】氣候科學家警告說，全球暖化將對全世界的農作物產量產生危險的衝擊影響。 【選項解析】(A) shower 陣雨 (B) channel 頻道 (C) influence 影響 (D) link 關係。產生危險影響為 exert a dangerous influence。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The internet article included a convenient web ______ that redirected readers directly to the university application page.","options":["difficulty","shower","pardon","link"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: link (超連結) 【全文中譯】網路文章包含一個方便的網頁超連結，將讀者直接引導至大學入學申請頁面。 【選項解析】(A) difficulty 難處 (B) shower 淋浴 (C) pardon 原諒 (D) link 超連結。網路超連結為 web link。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Please leave that section ______ if you do not have any overseas traveling experience in the past twelve months.","options":["absent","blank","deep","extra"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: blank (留白；空白的) 【全文中譯】如果您在過去十二個月內沒有任何出國旅行經驗，請將該欄位留白。 【選項解析】(A) absent 缺席的 (B) blank 空白的 (C) deep 深的 (D) extra 額外的。保留空白為 leave... blank。"}]},{"unit":90,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 90 (090.mp3) Topic Focus: Classical Music, Risk Perception, Leadership & Academic Majors","topic":"Topic Focus: Classical Music, Risk Perception, Leadership & Academic Majors | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"classical","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"traditional in style or form; relating to serious orchestral music","chinese":"古典的；傳統的","sentence":"Listening to soothing ______ piano music by Mozart helps many students concentrate while preparing for exams.","translation":"聆聽莫札特舒緩的古典鋼琴音樂有助於許多學生在準備考試時集中注意力。"},{"word":"danger","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the possibility of suffering harm, injury, or death","chinese":"危險；威脅","sentence":"Tourists were warned not to hike near the active volcano because of the severe ______ of poisonous sulfur gas leaks.","translation":"遊客被警告不要在活火山附近健行，因為存在有毒硫磺氣體洩漏的嚴重危險。"},{"word":"former","pos":"(adj.) / (n.)","definition":"having previously been a particular thing; the first mentioned","chinese":"從前的；前者的；前任的","sentence":"The ______ prime minister delivered an inspiring speech on world peace at the international diplomatic summit yesterday.","translation":"前首相昨天在國際外交峰會上就世界和平發表了激勵人心的演講。"},{"word":"impossible","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"not able to occur, exist, or be done","chinese":"不可能的；辦不到的","sentence":"Without modern satellite GPS navigation, finding a safe path across the vast snowy wilderness would be completely ______.","translation":"如果沒有現代衛星 GPS 導航，要在廣袤的白雪荒原中找到安全的道路將是完全不可能的。"},{"word":"instant","pos":"(adj.) / (n.)","definition":"happening immediately; prepared quickly; a moment","chinese":"立即的；速食的；瞬間","sentence":"College dorm students often boil water to make ______ noodles when they study late at night and feel hungry.","translation":"大學宿舍學生深夜讀書感到飢餓時，經常燒開水煮泡麵吃。"},{"word":"mass","pos":"(n.) / (adj.)","definition":"a large amount of something; bulk; relating to large numbers","chinese":"大量；群眾；大眾的","sentence":"The metropolitan city launched a new ______ rapid transit network to ease chronic traffic congestion on the roads.","translation":"這座大都會城市啟動了新的大眾捷運系統網路，以緩解道路上長期的交通壅塞。"},{"word":"chief","pos":"(adj.) / (n.)","definition":"most important; the leader or head of an organization","chinese":"首要的；首領；長官","sentence":"Air pollution from industrial coal-burning plants is the ______ cause of chronic respiratory diseases in the region.","translation":"工業燃煤電廠排放的空氣污染是該地區慢性呼吸道疾病的首要病因。"},{"word":"main","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"most important, largest, or most significant","chinese":"主要的；最重要的","sentence":"The ______ entrance of the national library was decorated with vibrant floral banners for the cultural festival.","translation":"國家圖書館的正門入口處裝飾著充滿活力的花卉旗幟，迎接文化節的到來。"},{"word":"major","pos":"(adj.) / (n.) / (v.)","definition":"very large, serious, or important; academic focus; to specialize","chinese":"主要的；主修；主修學科","sentence":"David decided to ______ in computer software engineering at National Taiwan University because of his love for coding.","translation":"因為熱愛寫程式，戴維決定在國立台灣大學主修電腦軟體工程。"},{"word":"minor","pos":"(adj.) / (n.)","definition":"less important or serious; a person under legal age","chinese":"次要的；輕微的；未成年人","sentence":"The driver suffered only a few ______ scratches on his elbow and was discharged from the hospital after thirty minutes.","translation":"司機手肘僅受了幾處輕微擦傷，三十分鐘後便出院了。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"She enjoys listening to ______ orchestra concerts on Saturday evenings because the violin melodies calm her mind.","options":["classical","former","impossible","instant"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: classical (古典的) 【全文中譯】她喜歡在星期六晚上聆聽古典管弦樂團音樂會，因為小提琴的旋律能讓她心情平靜。 【選項解析】(A) classical 古典的 (B) former 從前的 (C) impossible 不可能的 (D) instant 立即的。古典管弦樂為 classical orchestra。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Warning signs were placed along the steep mountain cliff to alert hikers to the serious ______ of falling rocks.","options":["danger","mass","chief","major"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: danger (危險) 【全文中譯】陡峭的山崖沿線豎立了警告牌，提醒登山者落石的嚴重危險。 【選項解析】(A) danger 危險 (B) mass 大量 (C) chief 主要的 (D) major 重大的。嚴重的危險為 serious danger。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Mr. Harrison is a ______ high school chemistry teacher who now writes popular science books for children.","options":["classical","former","impossible","instant"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: former (前任的；以前的) 【全文中譯】哈里森先生曾任高中化學老師，現在為兒童撰寫通俗科普讀物。 【選項解析】(A) classical 古典的 (B) former 前任的 (C) impossible 不可能的 (D) instant 立即的。前任高中老師為 former teacher。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Without carrying adequate drinking water in the desert heat, walking twenty miles in a single day is nearly ______.","options":["classical","former","impossible","instant"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: impossible (不可能的) 【全文中譯】在酷熱的沙漠中不帶足夠的飲用水，一天之內徒步二十英里幾乎是不可能的。 【選項解析】(A) classical 古典的 (B) former 前任的 (C) impossible 不可能的 (D) instant 立即的。不可能的為 nearly impossible。"},{"number":5,"stem":"When you send an email on the internet, the message is delivered to the recipient across the world in an ______.","options":["instant","former","impossible","classical"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: instant (瞬間；頃刻) 【全文中譯】當你在網際網路上發送電子郵件時，訊息會在瞬間傳遞給世界各地的收件人。 【選項解析】(A) instant 瞬間 (B) former 前者 (C) impossible 不可能的 (D) classical 古典的。in an instant 表示「瞬間；立刻」。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Investing in public ______ transit such as electric subways and city buses helps cut down carbon emissions effectively.","options":["danger","mass","chief","major"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: mass (大眾的；大批的) 【全文中譯】投資興建大眾捷運系統（例如電聯地鐵和市區公車）有助於有效減少碳排放。 【選項解析】(A) danger 危險 (B) mass 大眾的 (C) chief 主要的 (D) major 重大的。大眾運輸捷運為 mass transit。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The ______ engineer examined the suspension bridge blueprints carefully before construction crews began pouring concrete.","options":["danger","mass","chief","minor"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: chief (總工；首席的) 【全文中譯】在施工人員開始澆築混凝土之前，總工程師仔細檢查了吊橋工程藍圖。 【選項解析】(A) danger 危險 (B) mass 大量 (C) chief 首席的/主管 (D) minor 次要的。總工程師為 chief engineer。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The ______ purpose of establishing the wildlife sanctuary was to protect endangered black bears from illegal hunting.","options":["main","former","impossible","instant"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: main (主要的；最重要的) 【全文中譯】建立野生動物保護區的主要目的是保護瀕臨滅絕的黑熊免遭非法捕獵。 【選項解析】(A) main 主要的 (B) former 前任的 (C) impossible 不可能的 (D) instant 立即的。主要目的為 main purpose。"},{"number":9,"stem":"In university, Angela chose to ______ in English literature, and she hopes to work as a professional literary translator.","options":["danger","mass","major","minor"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: major (主修) 【全文中譯】在大學裡，安琪拉選擇主修英國文學，她希望未來能成為一名專業的文學翻譯家。 【選項解析】(A) danger 危險 (B) mass 大眾 (C) major 主修 (D) minor 輔修/次要的。主修某學科為 major in sth。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Fortunately, the two cars collided at low speed in the parking lot, causing only ______ cosmetic damage to their bumpers.","options":["classical","former","impossible","minor"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: minor (輕微的；次要的) 【全文中譯】幸運的是，兩輛車在停車場低速相撞，保險桿僅受到輕微的外觀刮損。 【選項解析】(A) classical 古典的 (B) former 前者的 (C) impossible 不可能的 (D) minor 輕微的。輕微損壞為 minor damage。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Beethoven and Mozart are two of the most celebrated composers in the history of European ______ music.","options":["classical","former","impossible","instant"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: classical (古典的) 【全文中譯】貝多芬和莫札特是歐洲古典音樂歷史上最著名的兩位作曲家。 【選項解析】(A) classical 古典的 (B) former 前任的 (C) impossible 不可能的 (D) instant 立即的。古典音樂為 classical music。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Swimming in the ocean during a typhoon is strictly forbidden because the gigantic waves pose an extreme ______ to human life.","options":["danger","mass","chief","major"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: danger (危險；威脅) 【全文中譯】颱風期間嚴禁在海中游泳，因為滔天巨浪對人體生命構成了極大的危險。 【選項解析】(A) danger 危險 (B) mass 大量 (C) chief 主要的 (D) major 重大的。極端危險為 extreme danger。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The ______ president of the university returned to campus as a guest lecturer to talk about international education policies.","options":["classical","former","impossible","instant"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: former (前任的) 【全文中譯】該大學前校長重返校園擔任客座講師，探討國際教育政策方針。 【選項解析】(A) classical 古典的 (B) former 前任的 (C) impossible 不可能的 (D) instant 立即的。前任校長為 former president。"},{"number":14,"stem":"It is virtually ______ to master a foreign language without practicing speaking and listening regularly in real situations.","options":["classical","former","impossible","instant"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: impossible (不可能的) 【全文中譯】如果不在真實情境中定期練習說和聽，要精通一門外語實際上是不可能的。 【選項解析】(A) classical 古典的 (B) former 前任的 (C) impossible 不可能的 (D) instant 立即的。實質上不可能為 virtually impossible。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Many busy office workers prefer to drink ______ coffee in the morning because it takes only thirty seconds to prepare.","options":["instant","former","impossible","classical"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: instant (即溶的；即時的) 【全文中譯】許多忙碌的上班族喜歡在早晨喝即溶咖啡，因為沖泡只需三十秒。 【選項解析】(A) instant 即溶的 (B) former 從前的 (C) impossible 不可能的 (D) classical 古典的。即溶咖啡為 instant coffee。"},{"number":16,"stem":"The sudden earthquake generated a huge ______ of falling mud and boulders that temporarily blocked the railway tracks.","options":["danger","mass","chief","major"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: mass (大批；大量) 【全文中譯】突發地震引發了大量泥石和巨石滾落，暫時阻斷了鐵路軌道。 【選項解析】(A) danger 危險 (B) mass 大量/大塊 (C) chief 主要的 (D) major 重大的。大批巨石泥土為 huge mass of mud。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Lack of regular physical exercise is considered the ______ contributing factor to obesity among urban teenagers today.","options":["danger","mass","chief","minor"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: chief (首要的；最主要的) 【全文中譯】缺乏規律的體育鍛鍊被認為是當今都市青少年肥胖的首要誘因。 【選項解析】(A) danger 危險 (B) mass 大眾 (C) chief 首要的 (D) minor 次要的。主要促成因素為 chief contributing factor。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The ______ bedroom of the new house has a spacious balcony overlooking the peaceful community garden.","options":["main","former","impossible","instant"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: main (主；主要的) 【全文中譯】新房子的主臥室設有一個寬敞的陽台，可以俯瞰寧靜的社區花園。 【選項解析】(A) main 主/主要的 (B) former 前者的 (C) impossible 不可能的 (D) instant 立即的。主臥室為 main bedroom。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Climate change is one of the most ______ challenges confronting human civilization in the twenty-first century.","options":["danger","mass","major","minor"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: major (重大的；主要的) 【全文中譯】氣候變遷是二十一世紀人類文明所面臨的最重大的挑戰之一。 【選項解析】(A) danger 危險 (B) mass 大眾 (C) major 重大的 (D) minor 次要的。重大挑戰為 major challenge。"},{"number":20,"stem":"It is illegal in most countries to sell tobacco or alcoholic beverages to any ______ under eighteen years of age.","options":["classical","former","impossible","minor"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: minor (未成年人) 【全文中譯】在大多數國家，向十八歲以下的未成年人出售菸草或酒精飲料都是違法的。 【選項解析】(A) classical 古典的 (B) former 前任的 (C) impossible 不可能的 (D) minor 未成年人。十八歲以下未成年人為 minor。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The prestigious music academy offers intensive training programs in both ______ opera singing and modern pop performance.","options":["classical","former","impossible","instant"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: classical (古典的) 【全文中譯】這所負盛名的音樂學院提供古典歌劇演唱和現代流行表演的密集培訓課程。 【選項解析】(A) classical 古典的 (B) former 從前的 (C) impossible 不可能的 (D) instant 立即的。古典歌劇為 classical opera。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Firefighters bravely rushed into the burning apartment building, knowing that their lives were in immediate ______.","options":["danger","mass","chief","major"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: danger (危險) 【全文中譯】消防隊員英勇地衝進燃燒的公寓大樓，深知他們的生命正處於直接的危險之中。 【選項解析】(A) danger 危險 (B) mass 大量 (C) chief 首席的 (D) major 重大的。處於危險中為 in immediate danger。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The ______ champion returned to the boxing ring after three years of retirement to reclaim his heavyweight championship belt.","options":["classical","former","impossible","instant"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: former (前任的) 【全文中譯】前任拳王在退役三年後重返拳擊擂台，奪回了他的重量級冠軍金腰帶。 【選項解析】(A) classical 古典的 (B) former 前任的 (C) impossible 不可能的 (D) instant 立即的。前冠軍為 former champion。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Finishing this complex statistical report within thirty minutes is practically ______ without using computer spreadsheet software.","options":["classical","former","impossible","instant"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: impossible (不可能的) 【全文中譯】如果不用電腦試算表軟體，在三十分鐘內完成這份複雜的統計報告幾乎是不可能的。 【選項解析】(A) classical 古典的 (B) former 從前的 (C) impossible 不可能的 (D) instant 立即的。幾乎不可能為 practically impossible。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Fortunately, the electrical failure was only a ______ problem that our technician resolved in less than ten minutes.","options":["classical","former","impossible","minor"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: minor (輕微的；微不足道的) 【全文中譯】幸運的是，電氣故障只是一個輕微的小問題，我們的技術人員在不到十分鐘內就修好了。 【選項解析】(A) classical 古典的 (B) former 前任的 (C) impossible 不可能的 (D) minor 輕微的。輕微問題為 minor problem。"}]},{"unit":91,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 91 (091.mp3) Topic Focus: Everyday Attributes, Privacy, Frequency, Organization & Flavors","topic":"Topic Focus: Everyday Attributes, Privacy, Frequency, Organization & Flavors | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"necessary","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"needed in order to achieve a particular result","chinese":"必須的；必要的","sentence":"Having a valid passport is absolutely ______ before traveling abroad, and you must check its expiration date.","translation":"出國旅行前持有有效護照是絕對必要的，且你必須檢查其有效期限。"},{"word":"ordinary","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"normal or not special or different in any way","chinese":"普通的；平常的","sentence":"He looked like an ______ office worker on the street, but he was actually a famous detective.","translation":"他在街上看起來像個普通的上班族，但他實際上是一位著名的偵探。"},{"word":"private","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"only for one person or group and not for public use","chinese":"私人的；私密的","sentence":"The manager entered his ______ office to review confidential documents, and he asked not to be disturbed.","translation":"經理進入他的私人辦公室審閱機密文件，並要求不要被打擾。"},{"word":"rare","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"not common or not seen or happening very often","chinese":"罕見的；稀有的","sentence":"Snowfall is very ______ in this coastal city during winter, so all the children were thrilled to see it.","translation":"這座沿海城市冬天下雪非常罕見，所以所有的孩子看到雪都興奮不已。"},{"word":"sudden","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"happening or done quickly and without warning","chinese":"突然的；意外的","sentence":"A ______ thunderstorm hit the outdoor market in the afternoon, and shoppers rushed to find shelter.","translation":"午後一場突然的雷陣雨襲擊了戶外市集，購物者紛紛衝去尋找遮蔽處。"},{"word":"tidy (tidy / tidied / tidied)","pos":"(adj.) / (v.)","definition":"having everything in its right place; to make clean","chinese":"整潔的；整理","sentence":"The teacher asked students to keep their desks clean and ______, so the classroom looked very neat.","translation":"老師要求學生保持課桌乾淨且整潔，因此教室看起來非常整齊。"},{"word":"usual","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"normal or happening most of the time","chinese":"通常的；慣常的","sentence":"Mr. Lin ordered his ______ cup of black coffee without sugar, and he sat by the quiet window.","translation":"林先生點了他慣常喝的不加糖黑咖啡，並坐在安靜的窗邊。"},{"word":"whole","pos":"(adj.) / (n.)","definition":"complete, including all parts of something","chinese":"全部的；整個的","sentence":"The young boy was so hungry that he ate the ______ pizza alone, and he felt extremely full.","translation":"那個小男孩太餓了，以致於獨自吃掉了整個披薩，他感到非常飽足。"},{"word":"sour","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"having a sharp, acid taste like lemon or vinegar","chinese":"酸的；酸腐的","sentence":"The fresh lemonade tasted a bit too ______ for the little child, so her mother added some sweet honey.","translation":"新鮮檸檬水對小小孩來說嚐起來有點太酸了，所以她的母親加了一些香甜的蜂蜜。"},{"word":"bitter","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"having a strong, sharp, harsh taste like black coffee or medicine","chinese":"苦的；痛苦的","sentence":"Traditional herbal medicine usually tastes very ______, but it is considered very effective for curing colds.","translation":"傳統草藥嚐起來通常非常苦，但它被認為對治療感冒非常有效。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Wearing a heavy helmet is ______ for all scooter riders in Taiwan, or they will be fined by traffic police.","options":["rare","necessary","sour","bitter"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: necessary (必須的) 【全文中譯】在台灣騎乘機車戴安全帽是絕對必要的，否則會被交警罰款。 【選項解析】(A) rare 稀有的 (B) necessary 必須的 (C) sour 酸的 (D) bitter 苦的。騎車戴安全帽為法定「必須」規範。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Mrs. Davis keeps all her personal diary notebooks locked inside a ______ drawer that only she can open.","options":["private","sudden","sour","whole"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: private (私人的) 【全文中譯】戴維斯太太將個人日記本鎖在只有她能打開的私人抽屜裡。 【選項解析】(A) private 私人的 (B) sudden 突然的 (C) sour 酸的 (D) whole 全部的。日記屬於私人 personal 物件，放在 private 抽屜。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Because she forgot to put the carton of fresh milk back into the refrigerator, it quickly turned ______ overnight.","options":["bitter","necessary","ordinary","sour"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: sour (變酸的；酸腐的) 【全文中譯】因為她忘了將鮮奶盒放回冰箱，鮮奶隔夜迅速變酸了。 【選項解析】(A) bitter 苦的 (B) necessary 必要的 (C) ordinary 普通的 (D) sour 酸的。牛奶變質會 turn sour（發酸）。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Taking a strong dose of cough syrup can leave a very ______ taste in your mouth, so drink some water immediately.","options":["ordinary","bitter","rare","necessary"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: bitter (苦的) 【全文中譯】喝下一大劑止咳糖漿會在嘴裡留下非常苦的味道，因此請立刻喝些水。 【選項解析】(A) ordinary 普通的 (B) bitter 苦的 (C) rare 罕見的 (D) necessary 必要的。藥水味道通常是 bitter（苦澀的）。"},{"number":5,"stem":"It is extremely ______ to see giant sea turtles laying eggs on this public beach during daytime.","options":["private","sour","rare","tidy"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: rare (罕見的) 【全文中譯】在白天看到巨大海龜在這座公共海灘上產卵是極為罕見的現象。 【選項解析】(A) private 私人的 (B) sour 酸的 (C) rare 罕見的 (D) tidy 整潔的。白天海龜產卵極為 rare（罕見）。"},{"number":6,"stem":"After spending three hours cleaning the living room, Emily felt proud to see how neat and ______ it looked.","options":["tidy","bitter","sudden","necessary"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: tidy (整潔的) 【全文中譯】花了三個小時打掃客廳後，艾蜜莉看著客廳如此乾淨整潔感到很自豪。 【選項解析】(A) tidy 整潔的 (B) bitter 苦的 (C) sudden 突然的 (D) necessary 必要的。neat and tidy 為常見搭配詞「乾淨整潔」。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The chef prepared our meal with extraordinary skill, although he used very ______ ingredients found in local markets.","options":["private","ordinary","sour","sudden"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: ordinary (普通的) 【全文中譯】那位主廚以非凡技巧料理餐點，雖然他使用的是在地市場常見的普通食材。 【選項解析】(A) private 私人的 (B) ordinary 普通的 (C) sour 酸的 (D) sudden 突然的。與 extraordinary 相對的是 ordinary（普通的）。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The family spent the ______ weekend camping by the river, and they enjoyed barbecue under the starry sky.","options":["bitter","sour","rare","whole"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: whole (整個的) 【全文中譯】這家人在河邊露營度過了整個週末，並在星空下享受了烤肉。 【選項解析】(A) bitter 苦的 (B) sour 酸的 (C) rare 稀有的 (D) whole 整個的。whole weekend 表「整個週末」。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Grandpa walked into the neighborhood diner at his ______ time, and the waiter greeted him warmly.","options":["necessary","usual","bitter","sour"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: usual (慣常的) 【全文中譯】爺爺在慣常的時間走進社區小餐館，服務生熱情地向他打招呼。 【選項解析】(A) necessary 必要的 (B) usual 慣常的 (C) bitter 苦的 (D) sour 酸的。usual time 表「慣常的時間」。"},{"number":10,"stem":"The driver slammed on the brakes because of a ______ stop by the truck ahead of him on the road.","options":["sudden","tidy","sour","rare"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: sudden (突然的) 【全文中譯】司機因為前方卡車在路上突然煞停而猛踩煞車。 【選項解析】(A) sudden 突然的 (B) tidy 整潔的 (C) sour 酸的 (D) rare 罕見的。sudden stop 表「緊急突然煞車停下」。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Regular hand washing is ______ to prevent the spread of infectious diseases during winter.","options":["bitter","rare","necessary","sour"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: necessary (必要的) 【全文中譯】在冬季規律洗手是預防傳染病擴散所必需的手段。 【選項解析】(A) bitter 苦的 (B) rare 罕見的 (C) necessary 必要的 (D) sour 酸的。衛生習慣是 necessary（必需的）。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Celebrities often hire security guards because they value their ______ lives away from media cameras.","options":["sour","private","sudden","tidy"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: private (私人的) 【全文中譯】名人經常聘請保鏢，因為他們重視遠離媒體鏡頭的私生活。 【選項解析】(A) sour 酸的 (B) private 私人的 (C) sudden 突然的 (D) tidy 整潔的。private life 指「私生活」。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Adding fresh lemon slices gives the iced black tea a pleasantly ______ flavor on hot summer afternoons.","options":["sour","ordinary","necessary","bitter"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: sour (酸的) 【全文中譯】在炎熱夏日午後加入新鮮檸檬片給冰紅茶帶來了怡人的微酸風味。 【選項解析】(A) sour 酸的 (B) ordinary 普通的 (C) necessary 必要的 (D) bitter 苦的。lemon 帶來的是 sour（酸味）。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Drinking dark roast coffee without any milk can taste quite ______, but many adults prefer that rich flavor.","options":["rare","tidy","bitter","usual"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: bitter (苦的) 【全文中譯】喝不加牛奶的深焙黑咖啡嚐起來可能相當苦，但許多成年人偏愛那濃郁風味。 【選項解析】(A) rare 罕見的 (B) tidy 整潔的 (C) bitter 苦的 (D) usual 慣常的。黑咖啡無糖無奶味道偏 bitter（苦）。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Finding antique gold coins buried under the floorboards of an old house is a very ______ occurrence.","options":["necessary","sour","bitter","rare"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: rare (罕見的) 【全文中譯】在老屋的地板下發現埋藏的古代金幣是非常罕見的事件。 【選項解析】(A) necessary 必要的 (B) sour 酸的 (C) bitter 苦的 (D) rare 罕見的。rare occurrence 表「罕見的事」。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Please make sure your bedroom is neat and ______ before your cousins arrive to visit this afternoon.","options":["tidy","sudden","bitter","sour"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: tidy (整潔的) 【全文中譯】在今天下午表兄弟姐妹來訪之前，請確保你的臥室收拾乾淨整潔。 【選項解析】(A) tidy 整潔的 (B) sudden 突然的 (C) bitter 苦的 (D) sour 酸的。tidy 指「乾淨整齊的」。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Although the painting depicted an ______ street scene, art critics praised its magnificent use of light and color.","options":["private","ordinary","sour","necessary"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: ordinary (普通的) 【全文中譯】雖然那幅畫描繪的是平凡普通的街景，藝術評論家卻讚賞其光影與色彩運用。 【選項解析】(A) private 私人的 (B) ordinary 普通的 (C) sour 酸的 (D) necessary 必要的。ordinary street scene「平凡的街景」。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The heavy earthquake caused shaking across the ______ island, and emergency services responded immediately.","options":["bitter","rare","whole","sour"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: whole (整個的) 【全文中譯】強烈地震導致整個島嶼劇烈搖晃，緊急救援部門立刻出動應變。 【選項解析】(A) bitter 苦的 (B) rare 罕見的 (C) whole 整個的 (D) sour 酸的。whole island 表「全島」。"},{"number":19,"stem":"As was her ______ routine, grandma woke up at sunrise and walked around the community park.","options":["usual","bitter","sour","sudden"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: usual (慣常的) 【全文中譯】正如她一貫的生活作息，祖母在日出時醒來並在社區公園散步。 【選項解析】(A) usual 慣常的 (B) bitter 苦的 (C) sour 酸的 (D) sudden 突然的。usual routine「慣常作息」。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The passengers were terrified by a ______ drop in altitude when the airplane encountered severe atmospheric turbulence.","options":["tidy","sudden","rare","sour"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: sudden (突然的) 【全文中譯】當飛機遭遇強烈大氣亂流時，突然急速下降讓乘客們嚇壞了。 【選項解析】(A) tidy 整潔的 (B) sudden 突然的 (C) rare 罕見的 (D) sour 酸的。sudden drop 表「突然急降」。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Having sufficient sleep every night is ______ for maintaining a strong and healthy immune system.","options":["bitter","sour","rare","necessary"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: necessary (必要的) 【全文中譯】每晚維持充足睡眠對於保持強健健康的免疫系統是必要的。 【選項解析】(A) bitter 苦的 (B) sour 酸的 (C) rare 罕見的 (D) necessary 必要的。充足睡眠是 necessary（不可或缺的）。"},{"number":22,"stem":"You should not read other people's text messages without permission because they are strictly ______.","options":["sour","private","bitter","tidy"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: private (私人的) 【全文中譯】未經許可你不該閱讀他人的手機簡訊，因為那些純屬個人私密內容。 【選項解析】(A) sour 酸的 (B) private 私人的 (C) bitter 苦的 (D) tidy 整潔的。簡訊是 strictly private（完全私密的）。"},{"number":23,"stem":"If fresh green apples are picked too early from the orchard, their crunchy flesh will taste unpleasantly ______.","options":["sour","ordinary","tidy","sudden"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: sour (酸的) 【全文中譯】若太早從果園採摘新鮮青蘋果，其清脆果肉嚐起來會令人不悅地酸澀。 【選項解析】(A) sour 酸的 (B) ordinary 普通的 (C) tidy 整潔的 (D) sudden 突然的。未熟蘋果嚐起來酸 sour。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The old veteran still harbored ______ memories about the brutal wartime hardships he endured in his youth.","options":["rare","bitter","tidy","necessary"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: bitter (痛苦辛酸的) 【全文中譯】老兵對年輕時在戰火中經歷的殘酷艱辛歲月依然懷有辛酸記憶。 【選項解析】(A) rare 罕見的 (B) bitter 痛苦辛酸的 (C) tidy 整潔的 (D) necessary 必要的。bitter memories 表「痛苦辛酸的回憶」。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Seeing wild pandas roaming freely through bamboo forests in high mountains has become exceedingly ______.","options":["rare","ordinary","sour","bitter"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: rare (稀有的) 【全文中譯】親眼目睹野生大熊貓在高山竹林中自由漫步已變得極其罕見。 【選項解析】(A) rare 稀有的 (B) ordinary 普通的 (C) sour 酸的 (D) bitter 苦的。野生大熊貓數量極少，目睹極其 rare。"}]},{"unit":92,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 92 (092.mp3) Topic Focus: Spatial Positions, Locations, Frequency, Adverbs of Degree & Conjunctions","topic":"Topic Focus: Spatial Positions, Locations, Frequency, Adverbs of Degree & Conjunctions | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"ahead","pos":"(adv.)","definition":"further forward in space or time","chinese":"在前方；提前","sentence":"The bus driver noticed road construction two miles ______, so he slowed down to merge safely.","translation":"公車司機注意到兩英里前方有道路施工，所以他減速以便安全匯入車道。"},{"word":"alike","pos":"(adj.) / (adv.)","definition":"similar to each other; in the same way","chinese":"相似的；同樣地","sentence":"The identical twin sisters dress and speak so much ______, that even their close classmates confuse them.","translation":"這對同卵雙胞胎姊妹穿著和說話如此相似，以致於連她們親近的同學都會搞混。"},{"word":"anywhere","pos":"(adv.)","definition":"in, at, or to any place, especially in negative sentences or questions","chinese":"在任何地方","sentence":"I searched my backpack thoroughly, but I could not find my student ID card ______ in the classroom.","translation":"我徹底搜遍了背包，但在教室裡的任何地方我都找不到學生證。"},{"word":"everywhere","pos":"(adv.)","definition":"to, in, or at every place","chinese":"到處；各處","sentence":"Spring has arrived in the countryside, and colorful wildflowers are blooming ______ along the mountain paths.","translation":"鄉村迎來了春天，繽紛的野花在山徑各處隨處綻放。"},{"word":"somewhere","pos":"(adv.)","definition":"in, at, or to an unspecified or unknown place","chinese":"在某處；到某處","sentence":"David left his car keys ______ in the living room, but he could not remember the exact spot.","translation":"大衛把車鑰匙遺落在客廳的某個地方，但他記不得確切位置了。"},{"word":"especially","pos":"(adv.)","definition":"used to emphasize that something is more true about one thing","chinese":"尤其；特別是","sentence":"Taiwan experiences heavy rainfall during summer months, ______ when typhoons approach from the eastern ocean.","translation":"台灣在夏季月份降雨豐沛，特別是當颱風從東部海面逼近時。"},{"word":"hardly","pos":"(adv.)","definition":"almost not at all; scarcely","chinese":"幾乎不；簡直不","sentence":"The music was so deafening at the concert that we could ______ hear each other speak across the table.","translation":"音樂會在音樂聲震耳欲聾，以致於我們隔著桌子幾乎聽不見對方說話。"},{"word":"nearly","pos":"(adv.)","definition":"almost, not quite completely","chinese":"幾乎；接近","sentence":"Our high school basketball team played exceptionally well, and we ______ won the championship match yesterday.","translation":"我們高中籃球隊打得非常出色，我們昨天差一點就贏得冠軍賽了。"},{"word":"while","pos":"(conj.) / (n.)","definition":"during the time that; a period of time","chinese":"當…的時候；一段時間","sentence":"My father likes to listen to classical radio ______ he prepares breakfast for the whole family.","translation":"我父親喜歡在為全家人準備早餐時聆聽古典音樂電台廣播。"},{"word":"rather","pos":"(adv.)","definition":"quite, to some degree; more readily or willingly","chinese":"相當；頗為","sentence":"The math exam was ______ difficult for most students, but Kevin completed all questions with high confidence.","translation":"這場數學考試對多數學生而言頗為困難，但凱文充滿信心地答完了所有題目。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Keep driving straight on this highway, and you will see an international airport terminal three miles ______.","options":["hardly","ahead","rather","nearly"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: ahead (在前方) 【全文中譯】在這條公路上繼續直行，你會在三英里前方看見一座國際機場航廈。 【選項解析】(A) hardly 幾乎不 (B) ahead 在前方 (C) rather 相當 (D) nearly 幾乎。three miles ahead 表「前方三英里處」。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Although these two smartphone models look very ______ in design, their internal processors are completely different.","options":["alike","anywhere","while","hardly"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: alike (相似的) 【全文中譯】雖然這兩款智慧型手機在外觀設計上非常相似，但內部處理器完全不同。 【選項解析】(A) alike 相似的 (B) anywhere 任何地方 (C) while 當…時 (D) hardly 幾乎不。look alike 表「外觀看起來相似」。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Because my mobile phone battery died, I could not contact my parents from ______ during my hiking trip.","options":["rather","ahead","anywhere","alike"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: anywhere (任何地方) 【全文中譯】因為手機沒電了，在登山旅途中我在任何地方都無法聯絡父母。 【選項解析】(A) rather 相當 (B) ahead 在前方 (C) anywhere 任何地方 (D) alike 相似地。否定句中 not... anywhere 表「任何地方都不…」。"},{"number":4,"stem":"When festival season arrives in December, festive holiday lights and ornaments can be seen ______ downtown.","options":["hardly","everywhere","rather","while"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: everywhere (到處) 【全文中譯】當十二月節慶季節來臨時，市中心各處都可以看見節慶燈飾與裝飾品。 【選項解析】(A) hardly 幾乎不 (B) everywhere 各處 (C) rather 相當 (D) while 當…時。everywhere downtown 表「市中心各處」。"},{"number":5,"stem":"I am certain that I placed my leather wallet ______ on this wooden dining table before leaving for work.","options":["rather","ahead","somewhere","alike"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: somewhere (在某處) 【全文中譯】我確信出門上班前我把皮夾放在這張木質餐桌上的某個地方。 【選項解析】(A) rather 相當 (B) ahead 在前方 (C) somewhere 在某處 (D) alike 相似地。somewhere on the table 表「桌上某處」。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Healthy lifestyle choices are vital for everyone, ______ for elderly citizens who need to control blood pressure.","options":["especially","hardly","anywhere","alike"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: especially (特別是；尤其) 【全文中譯】健康的生活型態對每個人都很重要，特別是對需要控制血壓的長者。 【選項解析】(A) especially 尤其 (B) hardly 幾乎不 (C) anywhere 任何地方 (D) alike 相似地。especially for 表「特別是針對…」。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The lecture room was so dark and hazy that the students in back could ______ read the whiteboard notes.","options":["rather","hardly","everywhere","ahead"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: hardly (幾乎不) 【全文中譯】演講廳裡光線昏暗模糊，後排學生幾乎無法看清白板上的筆記。 【選項解析】(A) rather 相當 (B) hardly 幾乎不 (C) everywhere 各處 (D) ahead 在前方。could hardly read 表「幾乎無法閱讀」。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The marathon runner was exhausted after running forty kilometers, and he ______ collapsed before reaching the finish line.","options":["alike","anywhere","nearly","rather"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: nearly (幾乎；險些) 【全文中譯】馬拉松跑者跑了四十公里後筋疲力竭，在抵達終點前幾乎昏倒了。 【選項解析】(A) alike 相似地 (B) anywhere 任何地方 (C) nearly 幾乎 (D) rather 相當。nearly collapsed 表「差點昏倒」。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Please keep your voice down ______ grandma is taking an afternoon nap in the adjacent bedroom.","options":["while","rather","hardly","ahead"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: while (當…的時候) 【全文中譯】當祖母在隔壁臥室睡午覺時，請壓低你的說話音量。 【選項解析】(A) while 當…時 (B) rather 相當 (C) hardly 幾乎不 (D) ahead 在前方。while 連接兩件同時進行的動作。"},{"number":10,"stem":"The winter wind blowing from the ocean felt ______ chilly, so we zipped up our heavy coats tightly.","options":["anywhere","rather","alike","hardly"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: rather (相當；頗為) 【全文中譯】從海上吹來的冬風讓人感覺相當刺骨，所以我們把厚外套拉鍊緊緊拉上。 【選項解析】(A) anywhere 任何地方 (B) rather 相當 (C) alike 相似地 (D) hardly 幾乎不。rather chilly 表「頗為寒冷」。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Pay close attention to traffic signs ______, because highway construction will require all vehicles to slow down.","options":["ahead","hardly","rather","while"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: ahead (在前方) 【全文中譯】密切注意前方的交通標誌，因為公路施工將要求所有車輛減速。 【選項解析】(A) ahead 在前方 (B) hardly 幾乎不 (C) rather 相當 (D) while 當…時。signs ahead 表「前方的標誌」。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Great minds think ______, and our project team reached the exact same creative conclusion independently.","options":["anywhere","everywhere","rather","alike"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: alike (相同地) 【全文中譯】英雄所見略同，我們的專案團隊各自獨立得出了完全相同的創意結論。 【選項解析】(A) anywhere 任何地方 (B) everywhere 各處 (C) rather 相當 (D) alike 相同地。Great minds think alike 為經典諺語「英雄所見略同」。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The museum guards insisted that visitors are strictly forbidden from taking photographs ______ inside the gallery.","options":["rather","anywhere","ahead","alike"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: anywhere (任何地方) 【全文中譯】博物館警衛堅持訪客在展覽館內的任何地方都嚴格禁止拍照。 【選項解析】(A) rather 相當 (B) anywhere 任何地方 (C) ahead 在前方 (D) alike 相似地。forbidden anywhere 表「任何地方皆禁止」。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Plastic waste is unfortunately found ______ along the coastline, so environmental volunteers organized a cleanup.","options":["hardly","rather","everywhere","while"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: everywhere (到處) 【全文中譯】塑膠垃圾不幸地在海岸線到處被發現，因此環保志工組織了淨灘。 【選項解析】(A) hardly 幾乎不 (B) rather 相當 (C) everywhere 到處 (D) while 當…時。found everywhere 表「隨處可見」。"},{"number":15,"stem":"If you are feeling overwhelmed by work stress, let's take a weekend vacation ______ quiet in the countryside.","options":["somewhere","hardly","rather","alike"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: somewhere (某個地方) 【全文中譯】如果你感到工作壓力過大，我們去鄉村某個安靜的地方度週末假期吧。 【選項解析】(A) somewhere 某個地方 (B) hardly 幾乎不 (C) rather 相當 (D) alike 相似地。somewhere quiet 表「某個安靜之處」。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Fresh fruits and vegetables are beneficial for children, ______ green vegetables packed with essential vitamins.","options":["hardly","especially","rather","anywhere"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: especially (尤其是) 【全文中譯】新鮮蔬果對孩童有益，特別是富含必需維生素的綠色蔬菜。 【選項解析】(A) hardly 幾乎不 (B) especially 尤其 (C) rather 相當 (D) anywhere 任何地方。especially green vegetables 強調綠色蔬菜。"},{"number":17,"stem":"He was so shocked by the unexpected promotion news that he could ______ find the right words to reply.","options":["rather","ahead","hardly","everywhere"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: hardly (幾乎不) 【全文中譯】他對突如其來的升遷消息感到非常震驚，以致於幾乎找不出適當話語回答。 【選項解析】(A) rather 相當 (B) ahead 在前方 (C) hardly 幾乎不 (D) everywhere 各處。could hardly find 表「幾乎找不到」。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The delicious homemade apple pie was ______ finished by the children before dinner was even served.","options":["nearly","rather","alike","anywhere"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: nearly (幾乎) 【全文中譯】那份美味的自製蘋果派在晚餐還沒端上來前，就幾乎被孩子們吃光了。 【選項解析】(A) nearly 幾乎 (B) rather 相當 (C) alike 相似地 (D) anywhere 任何地方。nearly finished 表「快吃完了」。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Linda answered customer inquiries on her laptop ______ she waited for her delayed flight at the gate.","options":["while","rather","hardly","ahead"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: while (當…的時候) 【全文中譯】琳達在登機門等待延誤的班機時，在筆電上回覆客戶的諮詢。 【選項解析】(A) while 當…時 (B) rather 相當 (C) hardly 幾乎不 (D) ahead 在前方。while waiting 表「等待的同時」。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The documentary about deep sea exploration was ______ long, but it remained fascinating from start to finish.","options":["rather","anywhere","hardly","alike"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: rather (相當地) 【全文中譯】那部關於深海探索的紀錄片相當長，但從頭到尾都引人入勝。 【選項解析】(A) rather 相當 (B) anywhere 任何地方 (C) hardly 幾乎不 (D) alike 相似地。rather long 表「相當冗長」。"},{"number":21,"stem":"With determination and perseverance, bright opportunities will surely open up in the years ______.","options":["hardly","rather","ahead","while"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: ahead (在前方；未來的) 【全文中譯】只要擁有決心與毅力，光明美好的機會必定會在未來的歲月裡敞開。 【選項解析】(A) hardly 幾乎不 (B) rather 相當 (C) ahead 在前方 (D) while 當…時。years ahead 指「未來的歲月」。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Teachers and students ______ participated enthusiastically in the annual charity fundraising carnival.","options":["alike","anywhere","rather","hardly"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: alike (同樣地) 【全文中譯】師生雙方都同樣熱情地參與了一年一度的慈善募款園遊會。 【選項解析】(A) alike 同樣地 (B) anywhere 任何地方 (C) rather 相當 (D) hardly 幾乎不。Teachers and students alike 表「師生兩者皆然」。"},{"number":23,"stem":"I searched my pockets and desk drawers, but my apartment keys were simply not to be found ______.","options":["rather","ahead","anywhere","alike"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: anywhere (任何地方) 【全文中譯】我搜遍了口袋與書桌抽屜，但我的公寓鑰匙在任何地方都找不到。 【選項解析】(A) rather 相當 (B) ahead 在前方 (C) anywhere 任何地方 (D) alike 相似地。not found anywhere 表「到處都找不到」。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Fallen autumn leaves blew ______ across the park lawn when the chilly October wind started gusting.","options":["hardly","everywhere","rather","while"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: everywhere (到處) 【全文中譯】當十月的寒風開始呼嘯時，落下的秋葉在公園草坪上吹得到處都是。 【選項解析】(A) hardly 幾乎不 (B) everywhere 到處 (C) rather 相當 (D) while 當…時。blew everywhere 表「吹得漫天遍地」。"},{"number":25,"stem":"I am positive that we parked the family sedan ______ near the entrance of this underground garage.","options":["somewhere","hardly","rather","alike"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: somewhere (在某處) 【全文中譯】我確信我們把家裡的房車停在這座地下停車場入口附近的某個地方。 【選項解析】(A) somewhere 某個地方 (B) hardly 幾乎不 (C) rather 相當 (D) alike 相似地。somewhere near 表「附近的某處」。"}]},{"unit":93,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 93 (093.mp3) Topic Focus: Logical Connectors, Negations, Spatial Prepositions & Time Extent","topic":"Topic Focus: Logical Connectors, Negations, Spatial Prepositions & Time Extent | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"probably","pos":"(adv.)","definition":"used to mean that something is very likely to happen or be true","chinese":"可能；大概","sentence":"Because dark storm clouds are gathering in the afternoon sky, it will ______ rain within an hour.","translation":"因為午後天空烏雲密布，一小時之內大概會下雨。"},{"word":"such","pos":"(adj.) / (pron.)","definition":"of the type previously mentioned; to an extreme degree","chinese":"如此的；這樣的","sentence":"The charity concert was ______ a tremendous success that all the tickets were sold out in minutes.","translation":"這場慈善音樂會是如此巨大的成功，以致於所有門票在幾分鐘之內便售罄。"},{"word":"neither","pos":"(adv.) / (conj.) / (pron.)","definition":"not either of two things or people","chinese":"兩者皆不","sentence":"My brother does not eat raw seafood, and ______ do I, so we ordered cooked pasta instead.","translation":"我哥哥不吃生海鮮，我也不吃，所以我們改點了煮熟的義大利麵。"},{"word":"nor","pos":"(conj.)","definition":"used before the second of two negative possibilities","chinese":"也不；亦不","sentence":"The elderly man could not read the tiny letters, ______ could he find his reading glasses in the dark.","translation":"那位年長男士看不懂微小的字母，在黑暗中他也找不到老花眼鏡。"},{"word":"none","pos":"(pron.)","definition":"not one of a group of people or things","chinese":"毫無；全無；沒有一個","sentence":"The math teacher asked five challenging questions, but ______ of the students could solve the last one.","translation":"數學老師問了五道挑戰性題目，但沒有一個學生能解出最後一題。"},{"word":"across","pos":"(prep.) / (adv.)","definition":"from one side to the other of something","chinese":"穿過；橫越","sentence":"The government built a modern suspension bridge ______ the broad river to reduce morning traffic congestion.","translation":"政府在這條寬闊河流上方建造了一座現代吊橋，以紓解早晨的交通壅塞。"},{"word":"against","pos":"(prep.)","definition":"opposing or disagreeing with; touching or hitting","chinese":"反對；倚靠；碰撞","sentence":"Environmental groups voted strongly ______ the new factory proposal to protect the natural forest wetlands.","translation":"環保團體強烈投票反對新工廠提案，以保護天然森林濕地。"},{"word":"among","pos":"(prep.)","definition":"in the middle of or surrounded by other things or people","chinese":"在…之中；在…之間","sentence":"The traditional tea house was hidden peacefully ______ towering bamboo trees at the mountain base.","translation":"那間傳統茶館寧靜地隱匿在山腳下高聳的竹林之中。"},{"word":"through","pos":"(prep.) / (adv.)","definition":"from one end or side of something to the other","chinese":"穿過；通過；歷經","sentence":"The high-speed bullet train travels swiftly ______ several mountain tunnels to reach the southern city.","translation":"高速子彈列車飛快穿過幾座山間隧道以抵達南部城市。"},{"word":"till","pos":"(prep.) / (conj.)","definition":"up to the time of; until","chinese":"直到…為止","sentence":"The devoted university students stayed in the library ______ midnight to prepare for their final exams.","translation":"那些用功的大學生在圖書館待到午夜，為期末考做準備。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"If temperatures continue to drop rapidly tonight, frost will ______ form on the mountain farm vegetables.","options":["against","probably","across","among"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: probably (大概；很可能) 【全文中譯】如果今晚氣溫持續迅速下降，高山農場的蔬菜上很可能會結霜。 【選項解析】(A) against 反對 (B) probably 大概 (C) across 穿過 (D) among 在…之中。副詞 probably 修飾 will form。"},{"number":2,"stem":"It was ______ a thrilling detective movie that the audience sat silently on the edge of their seats.","options":["such","nor","till","none"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: such (如此的) 【全文中譯】那是一部如此扣人心弦的偵探電影，以致於觀眾屏息靜坐在座位邊緣。 【選項解析】(A) such 如此的 (B) nor 亦不 (C) till 直到 (D) none 沒有一個。such a + adj. + n. + that 表「如此…以致於」。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Jack does not know how to swim, and ______ does his younger cousin, so they stayed in the shallow pool.","options":["across","neither","through","among"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: neither (兩者皆不；也不) 【全文中譯】傑克不會游泳，他的小表弟也不會，所以他們待在淺水池裡。 【選項解析】(A) across 穿過 (B) neither 也不 (C) through 穿過 (D) among 在…之中。and neither does... 表「也不…」。"},{"number":4,"stem":"The frightened child would not speak to the strange visitors, ______ would she let go of her mother's hand.","options":["such","none","nor","across"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: nor (亦不) 【全文中譯】受驚嚇的孩子不肯對陌生的訪客說話，也不肯鬆開母親的手。 【選項解析】(A) such 如此的 (B) none 全無 (C) nor 亦不 (D) across 穿過。nor could she 表否定倒裝「也不…」。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The police officer interviewed ten witnesses on the street, but ______ of them had noticed the thief's license plate.","options":["none","such","nor","till"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: none (沒有一個) 【全文中譯】警官在街上詢問了十位目擊者，但沒有一個人注意到小偷的車牌。 【選項解析】(A) none 沒有一個 (B) such 如此的 (C) nor 亦不 (D) till 直到。none of them 表「他們當中沒有一人」。"},{"number":6,"stem":"A flock of wild geese flew gracefully ______ the autumn sky as the sunset painted the horizon in orange.","options":["against","among","across","till"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: across (橫越) 【全文中譯】當夕陽將地平線染成橘色時，一群野雁優雅地橫越秋季的天空飛翔。 【選項解析】(A) against 反對 (B) among 在…之中 (C) across 橫越 (D) till 直到。flew across the sky 表「飛越天空」。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The heavy wooden ladder was leaning securely ______ the brick wall while the worker painted the upper window.","options":["against","through","among","across"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: against (倚靠著) 【全文中譯】當工人粉刷上方窗戶時，沉重的木梯穩穩地倚靠在磚牆上。 【選項解析】(A) against 倚靠著 (B) through 穿過 (C) among 在…之中 (D) across 橫越。leaning against 表「倚靠在…上」。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The talented young violinist was chosen from ______ hundreds of eager competitors from across the country.","options":["across","through","against","among"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: among (在…之中) 【全文中譯】那位才華洋溢的年輕小提琴手是從來自全國的數百名熱切競爭者中挑選出來的。 【選項解析】(A) across 穿過 (B) through 穿過 (C) against 反對 (D) among 在…之中。chosen from among... 表「從…之中選出」。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Sunlight streamed brightly ______ the stained glass windows of the cathedral, filling the hall with colorful light.","options":["against","through","among","across"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: through (穿透；穿過) 【全文中譯】陽光穿透大教堂的彩色玻璃窗明亮地灑落，使大廳充滿了繽紛的光彩。 【選項解析】(A) against 倚靠 (B) through 穿透 (C) among 在…之中 (D) across 橫越。streamed through 表「穿透灑入」。"},{"number":10,"stem":"We decided to postpone our beach barbecue party and wait ______ the torrential morning downpour finally ceased.","options":["till","such","nor","none"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: till (直到…為止) 【全文中譯】我們決定延後海灘烤肉派對，直到早晨的傾盆大雨終於停止為止。 【選項解析】(A) till 直到 (B) such 如此的 (C) nor 亦不 (D) none 沒有一個。wait till 表「等到…為止」。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Because the factory machinery broke down, the production manager said shipments will ______ be delayed by two days.","options":["across","against","probably","among"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: probably (大概；很可能) 【全文中譯】因為工廠機械故障，生產經理表示出貨大概會延遲兩天。 【選項解析】(A) across 穿過 (B) against 反對 (C) probably 大概 (D) among 在…之中。will probably be delayed 表「大概會延遲」。"},{"number":12,"stem":"She showed ______ extraordinary patience while explaining the difficult math formula that every student understood it.","options":["such","nor","none","till"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: such (如此的) 【全文中譯】她在解釋困難的數學公式時展現了如此非凡的耐心，以致於每位學生都聽懂了。 【選項解析】(A) such 如此的 (B) nor 亦不 (C) none 全無 (D) till 直到。such + adj. + n. + that 表「如此…以致於」。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The museum is not open on Mondays, and ______ is the local public art gallery next door.","options":["across","neither","through","among"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: neither (也不) 【全文中譯】這家博物館星期一不開放，隔壁的當地公立市立美術館也是如此。 【選項解析】(A) across 穿過 (B) neither 也不 (C) through 穿過 (D) among 在…之中。and neither is... 表「…也不開放」。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Mr. White has no interest in modern jazz music, ______ does he enjoy attending crowded outdoor pop concerts.","options":["such","none","nor","across"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: nor (也不) 【全文中譯】懷特先生對現代爵士樂毫無興趣，他也不喜歡參加擁擠的戶外流行音樂會。 【選項解析】(A) such 如此的 (B) none 沒有一個 (C) nor 也不 (D) across 穿過。nor does he enjoy... 表否定對等「也不喜歡」。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Many applicants submitted resumes for the manager position, but ______ had the required five years of leadership experience.","options":["such","none","nor","till"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: none (沒有一個) 【全文中譯】許多應徵者提交了經理職位的履歷，但沒有一人具備規定的五年領導經驗。 【選項解析】(A) such 如此的 (B) none 沒有一個 (C) nor 也不 (D) till 直到。none had required experience 表「無人具備資格」。"},{"number":16,"stem":"The marathon runners sprinted eagerly ______ the wide suspension bridge toward the bustling city center.","options":["against","among","across","till"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: across (橫越) 【全文中譯】馬拉松跑者們奮力跑過寬闊的吊橋，朝著繁華的市中心前進。 【選項解析】(A) against 反對 (B) among 在…之中 (C) across 橫越 (D) till 直到。sprinted across the bridge 表「跑過橋樑」。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Citizens organized a peaceful protest on Sunday to speak out ______ the construction of a chemical waste facility.","options":["against","through","among","across"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: against (反對) 【全文中譯】市民們在星期日組織了和平抗議，發聲反對興建化學廢料處理設施。 【選項解析】(A) against 反對 (B) through 穿過 (C) among 在…之中 (D) across 橫越。speak out against 表「挺身反對」。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The lost hiker was delighted to spot a small campfire glowing ______ the dense pine trees in the valley.","options":["across","through","among","against"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: among (在…之中) 【全文中譯】迷路的登山客非常高興在山谷茂密的松樹叢中發現了一處營火微光。 【選項解析】(A) across 穿過 (B) through 穿過 (C) among 在…之中 (D) against 倚靠。glowing among the trees 表「在樹叢間閃耀」。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Water was leaking continuously ______ a narrow crack in the old pipe, causing dampness across the kitchen floor.","options":["against","through","among","across"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: through (透過；穿過) 【全文中譯】水不斷從老水管的一道狹窄裂縫中滲漏出來，導致廚房地板一片潮濕。 【選項解析】(A) against 倚靠 (B) through 穿過 (C) among 在…之中 (D) across 橫越。leaking through a crack 表「從裂縫穿透滲出」。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The hardworking store owner kept his grocery shop open ______ eleven o'clock every night to serve neighborhood residents.","options":["till","such","nor","none"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: till (直到…為止) 【全文中譯】勤奮的店主每晚都把雜貨店開到十一點，以便服務社區居民。 【選項解析】(A) till 直到 (B) such 如此的 (C) nor 也不 (D) none 全無。open till eleven o'clock 表「營業直到十一點」。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Our flight will ______ land thirty minutes earlier than scheduled because strong tailwinds pushed the aircraft forward.","options":["against","among","across","probably"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: probably (很可能) 【全文中譯】我們的班機很可能會比預定時間提前三十分鐘降落，因為強烈順風推動了飛機前行。 【選項解析】(A) against 反對 (B) among 在…之中 (C) across 橫越 (D) probably 很可能。will probably land 表「很有可能會降落」。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Having ______ loyal and caring friends in times of personal crisis is truly one of life's greatest blessings.","options":["such","nor","none","till"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: such (這樣的；如此的) 【全文中譯】在個人面臨危機時擁有這樣忠誠體貼的朋友，確實是人生最大的恩賜之一。 【選項解析】(A) such 這樣的 (B) nor 也不 (C) none 沒有一個 (D) till 直到。such + adj. + n. 表「如此忠實的朋友」。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The restaurant did not accept credit cards, and ______ did the small bakery down the street.","options":["across","neither","through","among"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: neither (也不) 【全文中譯】這家餐廳不接受信用卡，街角的那家小麵包店也是如此。 【選項解析】(A) across 穿過 (B) neither 也不 (C) through 穿過 (D) among 在…之中。and neither did the bakery 表「麵包店也不收」。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The lost tourist could speak no English, ______ could he understand the handwritten directions on the tourist map.","options":["such","none","nor","across"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: nor (亦不) 【全文中譯】迷路的觀光客不會說英語，他也看不懂觀光地圖上手寫的方向指引。 【選項解析】(A) such 如此的 (B) none 沒有一個 (C) nor 亦不 (D) across 橫越。nor could he understand 表「也無法理解」。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Several laptops were stolen from the office over the weekend, but ______ of the locked doors showed signs of damage.","options":["none","such","nor","till"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: none (沒有一個) 【全文中譯】週末期間辦公室被偷了幾台筆記型電腦，但上鎖的門沒有一道出現破損跡象。 【選項解析】(A) none 沒有一個 (B) such 如此的 (C) nor 也不 (D) till 直到。none of the locked doors 表「上鎖的門沒有一道受損」。"}]},{"unit":94,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 94 (094.mp3) Topic Focus: Spatial Movement, Gestures, Nutrition, Meals & Pharmaceuticals","topic":"Topic Focus: Spatial Movement, Gestures, Nutrition, Meals & Pharmaceuticals | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"forward","pos":"(adv.) / (adj.)","definition":"toward the direction that is in front of you; into the future","chinese":"向前；前進地","sentence":"The brave police officer took three steps ______ to speak with the frightened store owner.","translation":"英勇的警官向前邁出三步，與受驚嚇的店主交談。"},{"word":"toward","pos":"(prep.)","definition":"in the direction of somebody or something","chinese":"朝向；面對","sentence":"The lost kitten was terrified by traffic, so it ran ______ the warm embrace of the little girl.","translation":"迷路的小貓被車流嚇壞了，所以它朝著小女孩溫暖的懷抱跑去。"},{"word":"upon","pos":"(prep.)","definition":"more formal word for on; happening immediately after","chinese":"在…之上；在…之後","sentence":"The successful future of our modern democracy depends ______ the active participation of educated citizens.","translation":"我們現代民主制度的成功未來取決於受良好教育公民的積極參與。"},{"word":"degree","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a unit of measurement for temperature or angles; a university qualification","chinese":"度數；程度；大學學位","sentence":"After completing four years of medical study, Rachel proudly earned her bachelor's ______ from the university.","translation":"完成四年的醫學研讀後，瑞秋自豪地從這所大學獲得了學士學位。"},{"word":"gesture","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a movement of hands or body to express meaning; an action expressing feeling","chinese":"手勢；姿態；做手勢","sentence":"A warm smile and a polite handshake are widely recognized as a friendly ______ of welcome.","translation":"溫暖的微笑與禮貌的握手被廣泛視為表示歡迎的友善姿態（手勢）。"},{"word":"diet","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the food and drink that a person or animal usually consumes","chinese":"日常飲食；節食","sentence":"Eating a balanced ______ rich in fresh vegetables and whole grains helps lower the risk of heart disease.","translation":"攝取富含新鮮蔬菜與全穀物的均衡日常飲食有助於降低心臟病風險。"},{"word":"bar","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a solid piece of something; a counter where drinks are served","chinese":"條；塊；酒吧","sentence":"Before washing her hands in the bathroom, mother unwrapped a new ______ of fragrant soap.","translation":"在浴室洗手之前，母親拆開了一塊新的芳香肥皂。"},{"word":"barbecue","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a meal cooked outdoors on a metal frame over a fire","chinese":"戶外烤肉；燒烤","sentence":"Our community organized an outdoor summer ______ in the park, and neighbors grilled chicken together.","translation":"我們社區在公園舉辦了戶外夏季烤肉，鄰居們一起烤雞肉。"},{"word":"supper","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an informal meal eaten in the evening","chinese":"晚餐；晚飯","sentence":"Grandmother prepared a warm pot of beef noodle soup for our family ______ on the cold winter evening.","translation":"在寒冷的冬夜裡，祖母為我們全家的晚餐準備了一鍋熱騰騰的牛肉麵湯。"},{"word":"drug","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a medicine or substance used to treat disease or illness","chinese":"藥物；藥品；毒品","sentence":"Medical scientists are testing a powerful new ______ that may help cure patients with lung cancer.","translation":"醫學科學家正在測試一種強效新藥物，它可能有助於治癒肺癌患者。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The coach asked the team captain to step ______ from the line to receive the champion trophy.","options":["supper","forward","barbecue","diet"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: forward (向前) 【全文中譯】教練請隊長從隊伍中向前邁步，以領取冠軍獎盃。 【選項解析】(A) supper 晚餐 (B) forward 向前 (C) barbecue 烤肉 (D) diet 飲食。step forward 表「向前邁步」。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Dark thunderclouds began drifting ______ the eastern coastal towns, prompting a flood warning.","options":["toward","bar","drug","degree"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: toward (朝向) 【全文中譯】烏黑的雷雨雲開始朝著東部沿海城鎮飄移，引發了淹水警報。 【選項解析】(A) toward 朝向 (B) bar 條塊 (C) drug 藥物 (D) degree 度數。drifting toward 表「朝…飄移」。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The final success of this scientific expedition relies ______ the collective dedication of all team members.","options":["diet","supper","upon","gesture"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: upon (在…之上；取決於) 【全文中譯】這次科學探險的最終成功取決於所有團隊成員的共同奉獻。 【選項解析】(A) diet 飲食 (B) supper 晚餐 (C) upon 取決於 (D) gesture 手勢。relies upon 表「依賴；取決於」。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Yesterday afternoon, the thermometer registered thirty-eight ______ Celsius, setting a new summer temperature record.","options":["gestures","degrees","bars","suppers"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: degree (度；度數) 【全文中譯】昨天下午溫度計顯示攝氏三十八度，創下了夏季氣溫新紀錄。 【選項解析】(A) gesture 手勢 (B) degree 度數 (C) bar 條塊 (D) supper 晚餐。thirty-eight degrees Celsius 表「攝氏38度」。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Raising your right hand with an open palm is an unmistakable universal ______ that signals others to stop.","options":["barbecue","supper","gesture","drug"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: gesture (手勢；姿態) 【全文中譯】舉起右手手掌張開是示意他人停下的明確通用手勢。 【選項解析】(A) barbecue 烤肉 (B) supper 晚餐 (C) gesture 手勢 (D) drug 藥物。universal gesture 表「通用手勢」。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Incorporating fresh fruits and leafy vegetables into your daily ______ is essential for maintaining health.","options":["diet","bar","gesture","degree"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: diet (日常飲食) 【全文中譯】將新鮮水果與葉菜類納入你的日常飲食中，對維持健康至關重要。 【選項解析】(A) diet 飲食 (B) bar 條塊 (C) gesture 手勢 (D) degree 度數。daily diet 表「日常飲食」。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The chef chopped a solid ______ of dark chocolate into small pieces to melt for the dessert cake.","options":["supper","bar","diet","degree"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: bar (條；塊) 【全文中譯】主廚將一整條黑巧克力切碎，以便融化用於製作甜點蛋糕。 【選項解析】(A) supper 晚餐 (B) bar 條塊 (C) diet 飲食 (D) degree 度數。a solid bar of chocolate 表「一整塊巧克力」。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Every year on Mid-Autumn Festival, families in Taiwan gather on balconies to enjoy an evening ______.","options":["drug","degree","barbecue","gesture"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: barbecue (烤肉) 【全文中譯】每年中秋節台灣許多家庭都會聚集在陽台享受晚間烤肉。 【選項解析】(A) drug 藥物 (B) degree 度數 (C) barbecue 烤肉 (D) gesture 手勢。an evening barbecue 表「晚間烤肉」。"},{"number":9,"stem":"After working late at the office, uncle Frank arrived home just in time to join us for hot ______.","options":["barbecue","supper","degree","gesture"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: supper (晚餐) 【全文中譯】在辦公室加班後，法蘭克叔叔及時到家與我們共進熱騰騰的晚餐。 【選項解析】(A) barbecue 烤肉 (B) supper 晚餐 (C) degree 度數 (D) gesture 手勢。join us for supper 表「共進晚餐」。"},{"number":10,"stem":"The doctor warned the patient that taking this prescription ______ with alcohol could cause severe dizziness.","options":["bar","gesture","diet","drug"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: drug (藥物) 【全文中譯】醫生警告病患將這種處方藥物與酒精一起服用可能會引起嚴重暈眩。 【選項解析】(A) bar 條塊 (B) gesture 手勢 (C) diet 飲食 (D) drug 藥物。prescription drug 表「處方藥物」。"},{"number":11,"stem":"When the speaker invited questions from the auditorium, a student moved ______ to the floor microphone.","options":["forward","supper","diet","barbecue"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: forward (向前) 【全文中譯】當演講者邀請聽眾提問時，一名學生走到地面的麥克風前。 【選項解析】(A) forward 向前 (B) supper 晚餐 (C) diet 飲食 (D) barbecue 烤肉。moved forward 表「向前走」。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The frightened hikers turned their flashlights ______ the thick forest bushes when they heard strange rustling noises.","options":["toward","bar","drug","degree"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: toward (朝向) 【全文中譯】當迷路的登山客聽到奇怪的沙沙聲時，他們把手電筒照向茂密的森林灌木叢。 【選項解析】(A) toward 朝向 (B) bar 條塊 (C) drug 藥物 (D) degree 度數。turned toward 表「轉向；朝向」。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The professor emphasized that academic integrity is built ______ complete honesty and rigorous research.","options":["diet","supper","upon","gesture"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: upon (建立於…之上) 【全文中譯】教授強調學術誠信是建立在完全誠實與嚴謹研究的基礎之上。 【選項解析】(A) diet 飲食 (B) supper 晚餐 (C) upon 建立於 (D) gesture 手勢。built upon 表「建立在…之上」。"},{"number":14,"stem":"After four years of study at the university, Kevin received his master's ______ in computer science.","options":["gestures","bars","degrees","suppers"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: degree (學位) 【全文中譯】在大學研讀四年後，凱文獲得了電腦科學碩士學位。 【選項解析】(A) gesture 手勢 (B) bar 條塊 (C) degree 學位 (D) supper 晚餐。master's degree 表「碩士學位」。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Sending a handwritten thank-you card to your host after dinner is a gracious social ______ of appreciation.","options":["barbecue","gesture","supper","drug"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: gesture (姿態；心意) 【全文中譯】晚餐後寄一張手寫感謝卡給主人是一種展現感激的優雅社交姿態。 【選項解析】(A) barbecue 烤肉 (B) gesture 姿態 (C) supper 晚餐 (D) drug 藥物。social gesture 表「社交姿態；心意表達」。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Nutritionists advise people with high cholesterol to follow a low-fat ______ with minimal processed foods.","options":["bar","gesture","diet","degree"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: diet (飲食) 【全文中譯】營養師建議高膽固醇患者遵循加工食品極少的低脂飲食。 【選項解析】(A) bar 條塊 (B) gesture 手勢 (C) diet 飲食 (D) degree 度數。low-fat diet 表「低脂飲食」。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Grandma gave each grandchild a sweet ______ of strawberry candy after they finished cleaning the kitchen.","options":["bar","supper","diet","degree"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: bar (條；塊) 【全文中譯】在孫子孫女們打掃完廚房後，奶奶給了每個人一小條甜草莓糖。 【選項解析】(A) bar 條塊 (B) supper 晚餐 (C) diet 飲食 (D) degree 度數。a sweet bar of candy 表「一條糖果」。"},{"number":18,"stem":"During the seaside camping trip, the high school students grilled hot dogs and sweet corn on the ______.","options":["drug","degree","gesture","barbecue"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: barbecue (烤肉；烤架) 【全文中譯】在海邊露營旅行期間，高中生們在烤肉架上烤熱狗和甜玉米。 【選項解析】(A) drug 藥物 (B) degree 度數 (C) gesture 手勢 (D) barbecue 烤肉架。grilled on the barbecue 表「在烤肉架上燒烤」。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Mother set the wooden dining table with bowls and chopsticks, calling everyone downstairs for delicious ______.","options":["supper","barbecue","degree","gesture"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: supper (晚餐) 【全文中譯】母親擺好碗筷呼喚大家下樓享用美味的晚餐。 【選項解析】(A) supper 晚餐 (B) barbecue 烤肉 (C) degree 度數 (D) gesture 手勢。delicious supper 表「美味的晚餐」。"},{"number":20,"stem":"Pharmacists must explain the potential side effects of every new ______ before dispensing it to patients.","options":["bar","gesture","drug","diet"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: drug (藥品) 【全文中譯】藥劑師在向病患配發每一種新藥物之前，都必須解釋其潛在副作用。 【選項解析】(A) bar 條塊 (B) gesture 手勢 (C) drug 藥物 (D) diet 飲食。side effects of every new drug 表「新藥的副作用」。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The curious little boy took a cautious step ______ to touch the soft wool of the friendly sheep.","options":["forward","supper","barbecue","diet"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: forward (向前) 【全文中譯】好奇的小男孩謹慎地向前邁出一小步，去摸友善綿羊的柔軟羊毛。 【選項解析】(A) forward 向前 (B) supper 晚餐 (C) barbecue 烤肉 (D) diet 飲食。step forward 表「向前邁步」。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The mother walked slowly ______ the school gate to meet her seven-year-old daughter after afternoon classes.","options":["bar","toward","drug","degree"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: toward (朝向) 【全文中譯】母親緩步走向校門口，去接下午放學的七歲女兒。 【選項解析】(A) bar 條塊 (B) toward 朝向 (C) drug 藥物 (D) degree 度數。walked toward the gate 表「朝校門走去」。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Once ______ a time, a brave young warrior lived in a peaceful village surrounded by misty mountains.","options":["diet","supper","upon","gesture"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: upon (從前從前) 【全文中譯】從前從前，一位年輕英勇的戰士住在被雲霧繚繞群山包圍的寧靜村莊裡。 【選項解析】(A) diet 飲食 (B) supper 晚餐 (C) upon 從前 (D) gesture 手勢。Once upon a time 為童話經典開頭「從前從前」。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The fever was so high that the boy's body temperature reached forty ______ Celsius yesterday morning.","options":["gestures","bars","degrees","suppers"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: degrees (度數) 【全文中譯】發燒非常嚴重，以致於男孩昨天早晨的體溫高達攝氏四十度。 【選項解析】(A) gestures 手勢 (B) bars 條塊 (C) degrees 度數 (D) suppers 晚餐。forty degrees Celsius 表「攝氏40度」。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Shrugging your shoulders with your palms turned upward is a common ______ indicating that you do not know.","options":["barbecue","supper","gesture","drug"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: gesture (手勢；動作) 【全文中譯】手掌朝上聳聳肩是一種表示自己不知情的常見肢體手勢動作。 【選項解析】(A) barbecue 烤肉 (B) supper 晚餐 (C) gesture 手勢動作 (D) drug 藥品。common gesture 表「常見手勢」。"}]},{"unit":95,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 95 (095.mp3) Topic Focus: International Commerce, Manufacturing Quality, Consumer Feedback & Statistical Trends","topic":"Topic Focus: International Commerce, Manufacturing Quality, Consumer Feedback & Statistical Trends | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"export","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to send goods to another country for sale; goods sold abroad","chinese":"出口；外銷","sentence":"Taiwanese technology factories ______ millions of advanced computer chips to international markets every year.","translation":"台灣科技廠每年外銷數百萬顆先進電腦晶片至國際市場。"},{"word":"import","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to bring goods into a country from abroad to sell; goods bought from abroad","chinese":"進口；輸入","sentence":"Because this island nation has limited natural petroleum reserves, it must ______ most of its crude oil.","translation":"因為這座島國的天然石油儲量有限，它必須進口大部分的原油。"},{"word":"product","pos":"(n.)","definition":"something that is made or grown to be sold","chinese":"產品；製品","sentence":"The software company launched an innovative new ______ that helps high school students practice spoken English.","translation":"這家軟體公司推出了一款創新的新產品，幫助高中生練習英語口說。"},{"word":"quality","pos":"(n.)","definition":"how good or bad something is; a characteristic","chinese":"品質；特質","sentence":"Consumers are willing to pay higher prices for handmade shoes because of their superior leather ______.","translation":"消費者願意為手工鞋支付較高價格，因為其皮革品質卓越。"},{"word":"control","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"the power to direct or manage something; to regulate","chinese":"控制；管理；管制","sentence":"During heavy weekend traffic, automated electronic systems help ______ vehicle speeds on the highway.","translation":"在週末繁忙的車流中，自動化電子系統協助控制高速公路上的車速。"},{"word":"complain","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to say that something is wrong or not satisfactory","chinese":"抱怨；發牢騷","sentence":"Dozens of train passengers went to the service counter to ______ about the two-hour departure delay.","translation":"數十名火車乘客前往服務台抱怨發車延誤兩小時。"},{"word":"explain","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to make something clear or easy to understand by giving details","chinese":"解釋；說明","sentence":"The science teacher used colorful physical models to ______ how the solar system orbits around the sun.","translation":"自然老師使用色彩繽紛的實體模型來解釋太陽系如何圍繞太陽公轉。"},{"word":"argue","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to speak angrily to someone because you disagree; to give reasons for or against","chinese":"爭論；爭辯","sentence":"The two business partners began to ______ loudly over budget allocations during the morning board meeting.","translation":"兩位商業夥伴在早晨董事會議期間開始為了預算分配大聲爭辯。"},{"word":"increase","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to become larger in amount, number, or degree; a rise","chinese":"增加；增長","sentence":"Regular physical exercise and healthy nutrition will significantly ______ your energy levels throughout the workday.","translation":"規律的身體運動與健康的營養將在整個工作日內顯著增加你的活力水平。"},{"word":"decrease","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to become less or to make something become less; a reduction","chinese":"減少；降低","sentence":"Installing energy-efficient LED light bulbs will dramatically ______ monthly electricity bills for schools.","translation":"安裝節能 LED 燈泡將大幅降低學校的每月電費支出。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"High technology firms in Hsinchu Science Park ______ advanced electronic equipment to clients around the globe.","options":["explain","export","complain","argue"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: export (外銷；出口) 【全文中譯】新竹科學園區的高科技公司向全球客戶出口先進的電子設備。 【選項解析】(A) explain 解釋 (B) export 出口 (C) complain 抱怨 (D) argue 爭論。export to international markets 表「出口到國際市場」。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Taiwan does not produce sufficient wheat locally, so food companies must ______ large quantities from North America.","options":["import","complain","explain","argue"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: import (進口) 【全文中譯】台灣本地無法生產足夠的小麥，因此食品公司必須從北美進口大量小麥。 【選項解析】(A) import 進口 (B) complain 抱怨 (C) explain 解釋 (D) argue 爭執。import from abroad 表「從國外進口」。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The new skincare ______ received wonderful reviews from customers because it contains all-natural plant extracts.","options":["control","product","quality","increase"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: product (產品) 【全文中譯】這款新護膚產品獲得了顧客的極佳評價，因為它含有全天然植物萃取物。 【選項解析】(A) control 控制 (B) product 產品 (C) quality 品質 (D) increase 增加。skincare product 表「護膚產品」。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Before products leave the assembly line, factory inspectors check each item carefully to ensure top ______.","options":["increase","control","quality","product"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: quality (品質) 【全文中譯】在產品離開裝配線之前，工廠檢驗員仔細檢查每件物品以確保頂級品質。 【選項解析】(A) increase 增加 (B) control 控制 (C) quality 品質 (D) product 產品。ensure top quality 表「確保最高品質」。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The pilot struggled to maintain ______ of the light aircraft when violent crosswinds hit during landing.","options":["control","product","quality","increase"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: control (控制；操控) 【全文中譯】降落時遭遇強烈側風襲擊，飛行員奮力維持輕型飛機的操控。 【選項解析】(A) control 控制 (B) product 產品 (C) quality 品質 (D) increase 增加。maintain control of 表「維持對…的控制」。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Dissatisfied hotel guests called the front desk to ______ about the lack of hot water in their bathrooms.","options":["argue","explain","complain","export"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: complain (抱怨) 【全文中譯】感到不滿的飯店房客打電話給櫃台，抱怨浴室裡沒有熱水。 【選項解析】(A) argue 爭辯 (B) explain 解釋 (C) complain 抱怨 (D) export 出口。complain about 表「抱怨…」。"},{"number":7,"stem":"Could you please ______ this complicated grammar rule once again so the whole class can understand it?","options":["explain","export","argue","import"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: explain (解釋；說明) 【全文中譯】能否請你把這條複雜的文法規則再解釋一遍，讓全班都能聽懂？ 【選項解析】(A) explain 解釋 (B) export 出口 (C) argue 爭論 (D) import 進口。explain grammar rule 表「解釋文法規則」。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The stubborn brothers always ______ about who should wash the dinner dishes after family meals on Sunday.","options":["export","import","argue","explain"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: argue (爭辯；爭吵) 【全文中譯】這對頑固的兄弟在週日全家用餐後，總是為了誰該洗晚餐碗盤而大聲爭執。 【選項解析】(A) export 出口 (B) import 進口 (C) argue 爭論 (D) explain 解釋。argue about who should wash dishes 表「為了誰該洗碗而爭吵」。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Government statistics show that the number of foreign tourists visiting Taiwan will ______ steadily this winter.","options":["complain","argue","explain","increase"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: increase (增加) 【全文中譯】政府統計數據顯示，今年冬季來台觀光的外國遊客人數將會穩定增加。 【選項解析】(A) complain 抱怨 (B) argue 爭辯 (C) explain 解釋 (D) increase 增加。increase steadily 表「穩定增長」。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Eating less processed sugar and exercising regularly will help ______ the risk of developing diabetes.","options":["export","decrease","complain","argue"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: decrease (降低；減少) 【全文中譯】少吃精緻糖類並定期運動將有助於降低罹患糖尿病的風險。 【選項解析】(A) export 出口 (B) decrease 降低 (C) complain 抱怨 (D) argue 爭辯。decrease the risk 表「降低風險」。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Agricultural cooperatives in southern Taiwan ______ sweet mangoes and fresh pineapples to Japan every summer.","options":["export","explain","complain","argue"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: export (外銷；出口) 【全文中譯】南台灣的農業合作社每年夏天都向日本外銷香甜芒果與新鮮鳳梨。 【選項解析】(A) export 出口 (B) explain 解釋 (C) complain 抱怨 (D) argue 爭辯。export fruit to Japan 表「外銷水果至日本」。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Due to freezing winter weather, local markets had to ______ fresh vegetables from neighboring southern regions.","options":["complain","import","argue","explain"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: import (進口；輸入) 【全文中譯】由於嚴寒冬日氣候，在地市場不得不從鄰近的南部地區輸入新鮮蔬菜。 【選項解析】(A) complain 抱怨 (B) import 進口 (C) argue 爭辯 (D) explain 解釋。import from neighboring regions 表「自鄰近地區輸入」。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The company's most popular consumer ______ is a lightweight waterproof backpack designed for outdoor hiking.","options":["quality","increase","product","control"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: product (產品) 【全文中譯】該公司最受歡迎的消費產品是一款專為戶外健行設計的輕量防水背包。 【選項解析】(A) quality 品質 (B) increase 增加 (C) product 產品 (D) control 控制。consumer product 表「消費產品」。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Japanese audio equipment is internationally famous for its remarkable sound clarity and manufacturing ______.","options":["increase","quality","product","control"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: quality (品質) 【全文中譯】日本音響設備以其非凡的聲音清晰度與製造品質在國際上聞名遐邇。 【選項解析】(A) increase 增加 (B) quality 品質 (C) product 產品 (D) control 控制。manufacturing quality 表「製造品質」。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Parents should monitor and set reasonable limits to ______ how much time young children spend playing video games.","options":["control","export","complain","argue"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: control (管制；控制) 【全文中譯】家長應監督並設定合理界線，以管控幼童玩電玩遊戲的時間。 【選項解析】(A) control 控制 (B) export 出口 (C) complain 抱怨 (D) argue 爭論。control screen time 表「管控使用螢幕時間」。"},{"number":16,"stem":"It is completely useless to ______ about bad weather, so we might as well make the best of a rainy afternoon.","options":["argue","explain","export","complain"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: complain (抱怨) 【全文中譯】抱怨惡劣天氣是完全徒勞無功的，我們還不如在下雨午後隨遇而安。 【選項解析】(A) argue 爭吵 (B) explain 解釋 (C) export 出口 (D) complain 抱怨。complain about bad weather 表「抱怨天氣差」。"},{"number":17,"stem":"The financial advisor took time to ______ various retirement savings plans to the young couple in detail.","options":["explain","export","argue","import"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: explain (說明；解釋) 【全文中譯】財務顧問撥出時間向這對年輕夫婦詳細說明各種退休儲蓄方案。 【選項解析】(A) explain 說明 (B) export 出口 (C) argue 爭論 (D) import 進口。explain savings plans 表「說明儲蓄方案」。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Lawyers on both sides began to ______ passionately about the validity of the new evidence presented in court.","options":["export","argue","import","explain"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: argue (辯論；爭辯) 【全文中譯】雙方律師在法庭上開始就所呈新證據的有效性展開激烈辯論。 【選項解析】(A) export 出口 (B) argue 辯論 (C) import 進口 (D) explain 說明。argue about validity 表「就有效性展開辯論」。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Rising global fuel prices will inevitably ______ international airline ticket costs for holiday travelers.","options":["complain","argue","increase","explain"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: increase (增加；抬高) 【全文中譯】全球燃料價格上漲勢必會增加度假旅客的國際機票費用成本。 【選項解析】(A) complain 抱怨 (B) argue 爭執 (C) increase 增加 (D) explain 解釋。increase ticket costs 表「增加機票成本」。"},{"number":20,"stem":"As autumn turns into cold winter, daylight hours gradually ______ across the northern hemisphere.","options":["export","import","complain","decrease"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: decrease (減少；縮短) 【全文中譯】隨著秋去冬來，北半球各地的白晝時間逐漸縮短減少。 【選項解析】(A) export 出口 (B) import 進口 (C) complain 抱怨 (D) decrease 減少。daylight hours decrease 表「白晝時間減少」。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Taiwan continues to ______ high-precision bicycle components to cycling enthusiasts throughout Europe.","options":["explain","export","complain","argue"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: export (外銷) 【全文中譯】台灣持續向全歐洲的自行車愛好者外銷高精度自行車零件。 【選項解析】(A) explain 解釋 (B) export 外銷 (C) complain 抱怨 (D) argue 爭論。export components 表「外銷零組件」。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Because local coffee production cannot meet domestic demand, cafes must ______ specialty beans from Colombia.","options":["import","complain","explain","argue"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: import (進口) 【全文中譯】因為本土咖啡產量無法滿足國內需求，咖啡館必須從哥倫比亞進口精品豆。 【選項解析】(A) import 進口 (B) complain 抱怨 (C) explain 解釋 (D) argue 爭辯。import specialty beans 表「進口精品豆」。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The latest electronic ______ unveiled at the international exhibition was an ultra-thin foldable tablet computer.","options":["control","quality","product","increase"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: product (產品) 【全文中譯】在國際展覽會上亮相的最新電子產品是一款超薄可折疊平板電腦。 【選項解析】(A) control 控制 (B) quality 品質 (C) product 產品 (D) increase 增加。electronic product 表「電子產品」。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The strict quality inspector rejected several batches of fabric because their thread ______ did not meet standards.","options":["quality","increase","control","product"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: quality (品質) 【全文中譯】嚴格的品質檢驗員退回了幾批布料，因為它們的織線品質未達標準。 【選項解析】(A) quality 品質 (B) increase 增加 (C) control 控制 (D) product 產品。thread quality 表「織線品質」。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Doctors urged the patient to take daily prescribed medication to keep his high blood pressure under ______.","options":["product","quality","control","increase"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: control (控制；受控) 【全文中譯】醫生敦促病患每日服用處方藥物，以將他的高血壓維持在受控狀態。 【選項解析】(A) product 產品 (B) quality 品質 (C) control 受控 (D) increase 增加。keep under control 表「維持在控制之下」。"}]},{"unit":96,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 96 (096.mp3) Topic Focus: Household Maintenance, Domestic Objects, Human Health & Personal Preferences","topic":"Topic Focus: Household Maintenance, Domestic Objects, Human Health & Personal Preferences | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"furniture","pos":"(n.)","definition":"movable objects such as tables, chairs, and beds used in rooms","chinese":"家具","sentence":"When moving into their new apartment, the newlywed couple purchased solid wooden ______ for the living room.","translation":"搬進新公寓時，這對新婚夫婦為客廳購買了實木家具。"},{"word":"gather","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to come together in a group; to collect things","chinese":"聚集；收集","sentence":"Thousands of eager baseball fans will ______ at the stadium tonight to watch the championship game.","translation":"今晚成千上萬熱切的棒球迷將聚集在體育場觀看冠軍賽。"},{"word":"collection","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a group of objects or art brought together in one place","chinese":"收藏品；收集物","sentence":"Uncle Robert has built an impressive ______ of rare postage stamps from around the world over thirty years.","translation":"三十年來，羅伯特叔叔建立了一套令人印象深刻的全球罕見郵票收藏品。"},{"word":"blood","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the red liquid that circulates through the arteries and veins","chinese":"血液","sentence":"The local hospital organized a blood donation drive, inviting healthy citizens to give ______ to help patients.","translation":"當地醫院組織了一次捐血活動，邀請健康市民捐出血液以救助病患。"},{"word":"injure","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to hurt a person or animal physically, especially in an accident","chinese":"傷害；受傷","sentence":"Skiers should always wear safety helmets on the slopes so they do not seriously ______ their heads.","translation":"滑雪者在雪坡上應始終佩戴安全帽，以免頭部受到嚴重傷害。"},{"word":"mop (mop / mopped / mopped)","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to clean floors with a wet tool; the tool itself","chinese":"拖地；拖把","sentence":"After cooking Sunday dinner for the large family, father used soapy water to ______ the greasy kitchen floor.","translation":"在為大家庭烹調完週日晚餐後，父親用肥皂水拖拭油膩的廚房地板。"},{"word":"sweep (sweep / swept / swept)","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to clean dust or dirt from floors using a broom","chinese":"掃地；打掃","sentence":"The teacher asked students to take brooms and ______ the fallen leaves off the front courtyard stairs.","translation":"老師請學生們拿掃帚清掃前庭台階上的落葉。"},{"word":"opportunity","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a chance to do something desirable or advantageous","chinese":"機會；良機","sentence":"Studying abroad in England provided Maria with an invaluable ______ to improve her English fluency.","translation":"在英國留學為瑪麗亞提供了一個寶貴的機會以提升她的英語流利度。"},{"word":"powder","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a dry substance in the form of very fine grains","chinese":"粉末；粉狀物","sentence":"The mother mixed three spoons of milk ______ with warm water to prepare a bottle for her infant baby.","translation":"母親將三匙奶粉與溫水混合，為她的嬰兒準備了一瓶奶。"},{"word":"prefer (prefer / preferred / preferred)","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to like one thing or person better than another","chinese":"更喜歡；偏好","sentence":"During hot summer afternoons, many office workers ______ iced green tea to hot coffee.","translation":"在炎熱的夏日午後，許多上班族比起熱咖啡更喜歡冰綠茶。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The moving company carefully wrapped our antique dining ______ in blankets to prevent scratches during transit.","options":["blood","furniture","powder","opportunity"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: furniture (家具) 【全文中譯】搬家公司在搬運過程中用毛毯小心包覆我們的仿古餐桌家具，以防刮傷。 【選項解析】(A) blood 血液 (B) furniture 家具 (C) powder 粉末 (D) opportunity 機會。dining furniture 指「餐廳家具」。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Every Friday evening, neighborhood residents ______ in the community center to practice choir singing.","options":["gather","mop","sweep","injure"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: gather (聚集) 【全文中譯】每逢週五傍晚，社區居民都會聚集在活動中心練習合唱。 【選項解析】(A) gather 聚集 (B) mop 拖地 (C) sweep 掃地 (D) injure 傷害。gather in community center 表「聚集在活動中心」。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The national museum displays a priceless ______ of ancient Chinese porcelain vases from the Ming dynasty.","options":["furniture","powder","collection","blood"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: collection (收藏品) 【全文中譯】國立博物館展示了一組明代古中國瓷瓶的無價珍貴收藏品。 【選項解析】(A) furniture 家具 (B) powder 粉末 (C) collection 收藏品 (D) blood 血液。priceless collection 表「無價收藏」。"},{"number":4,"stem":"If you cut your finger while preparing vegetables, press a clean cloth firmly on the wound to stop the ______.","options":["powder","blood","furniture","opportunity"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: blood (血液) 【全文中譯】若切菜時割傷手指，請用乾淨布料緊壓傷口以止血。 【選項解析】(A) powder 粉末 (B) blood 血液 (C) furniture 家具 (D) opportunity 機會。stop the blood / stop the bleeding 表「止血」。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Football players wear padded shoulder guards to ensure that opponents do not ______ them during tackles.","options":["gather","sweep","mop","injure"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: injure (受傷；傷害) 【全文中譯】美式足球員穿戴襯墊護肩，以確保在攔截衝撞時對手不會使他們受傷。 【選項解析】(A) gather 聚集 (B) sweep 掃地 (C) mop 拖地 (D) injure 傷害。injure them 表「使他們受傷」。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Please take off your muddy shoes outside, because mother just finished using a wet tool to ______ the tiles.","options":["gather","mop","prefer","injure"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: mop (拖地) 【全文中譯】請在門外脫掉沾滿泥巴的鞋子，因為母親剛用拖地工具拖過地磚。 【選項解析】(A) gather 聚集 (B) mop 拖地 (C) prefer 偏好 (D) injure 受傷。mop the tiles 表「拖拭地磚」。"},{"number":7,"stem":"Every morning before school begins, campus volunteers use long brooms to ______ dusty hallways.","options":["injure","sweep","gather","prefer"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: sweep (掃地) 【全文中譯】每天早晨上課前，校園志工都拿著長掃帚清掃佈滿灰塵的走廊。 【選項解析】(A) injure 受傷 (B) sweep 掃地 (C) gather 聚集 (D) prefer 偏好。sweep hallways 表「打掃走廊」。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Participating in this international conference is a rare ______ for young researchers to present their findings.","options":["furniture","collection","opportunity","powder"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: opportunity (機會；良機) 【全文中譯】參加這場國際會議是年輕研究人員展示其成果的難得良機。 【選項解析】(A) furniture 家具 (B) collection 收藏品 (C) opportunity 機會 (D) powder 粉末。rare opportunity 表「難得良機」。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The baker sprinkled fine white sugar ______ over the freshly baked apple pie before serving it to guests.","options":["powder","blood","furniture","collection"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: powder (粉末) 【全文中譯】麵包師在將剛出爐的蘋果派端給客人前，在上方灑上細緻的白糖粉。 【選項解析】(A) powder 粉末 (B) blood 血液 (C) furniture 家具 (D) collection 收藏品。white sugar powder 表「白糖粉」。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Most high school students in Taiwan ______ studying in air-conditioned libraries during hot summer vacations.","options":["injure","prefer","sweep","mop"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: prefer (偏好；更喜歡) 【全文中譯】在炎熱暑假期間，台灣多數高中生更喜歡在有空調的圖書館裡讀書。 【選項解析】(A) injure 受傷 (B) prefer 偏好 (C) sweep 掃地 (D) mop 拖地。prefer A to B 表「比起B更偏好A」。"},{"number":11,"stem":"We need to buy new living room ______, including a comfortable sofa and two matching reading chairs.","options":["furniture","blood","powder","collection"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: furniture (家具) 【全文中譯】我們需要購買新的客廳家具，包括一張舒適沙發與兩張配套閱讀椅。 【選項解析】(A) furniture 家具 (B) blood 血液 (C) powder 粉末 (D) collection 收藏品。living room furniture 表「客廳家具」。"},{"number":12,"stem":"During autumn harvest, village farmers ______ in the fields to pick ripe grapes for making wine.","options":["mop","sweep","gather","prefer"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: gather (聚集) 【全文中譯】秋收期間，村裡的農民們聚集在田野裡採摘成熟葡萄釀酒。 【選項解析】(A) mop 拖地 (B) sweep 掃地 (C) gather 聚集 (D) prefer 偏好。gather in the fields 表「在田野聚集」。"},{"number":13,"stem":"My grandfather has a wonderful ______ of vintage vinyl records that he plays on special family holidays.","options":["blood","furniture","powder","collection"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: collection (收藏品) 【全文中譯】我的祖父擁有一套精彩的老黑膠唱片收藏，每逢家族節日時他都會播放。 【選項解析】(A) blood 血液 (B) furniture 家具 (C) powder 粉末 (D) collection 收藏品。collection of records 表「唱片收藏」。"},{"number":14,"stem":"A routine laboratory test will check the patient's ______ sample for signs of anemia or infection.","options":["powder","blood","furniture","opportunity"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: blood (血液) 【全文中譯】例行的實驗室化驗將檢查病患的血液樣本，看是否有貧血或感染跡象。 【選項解析】(A) powder 粉末 (B) blood 血液 (C) furniture 家具 (D) opportunity 機會。blood sample 表「血液樣本」。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Wearing protective gloves while working with power tools ensures that you will not ______ your hands.","options":["prefer","sweep","injure","mop"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: injure (受傷) 【全文中譯】操作電動工具時佩戴防護手套，能確保你不會傷到雙手。 【選項解析】(A) prefer 偏好 (B) sweep 掃地 (C) injure 傷害 (D) mop 拖地。injure your hands 表「弄傷雙手」。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Someone spilled a bowl of noodle soup on the floor, so the waiter hurried over with a cloth to ______ it up.","options":["mop","prefer","gather","injure"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: mop (拖拭) 【全文中譯】有人把一碗麵湯打翻在地板上，服務生趕忙拿著布過來拖擦乾淨。 【選項解析】(A) mop 拖拭 (B) prefer 偏好 (C) gather 聚集 (D) injure 受傷。mop it up 表「拖拭乾淨」。"},{"number":17,"stem":"After the strong typhoon passed, street sweepers worked tirelessly to ______ fallen tree branches off the road.","options":["injure","prefer","sweep","gather"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: sweep (清掃) 【全文中譯】強颱過境後，清潔隊員不知疲倦地工作，將斷落的樹枝從路上掃開。 【選項解析】(A) injure 傷害 (B) prefer 偏好 (C) sweep 清掃 (D) gather 聚集。sweep fallen branches 表「清掃落枝」。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Learning a second language opens up a tremendous ______ for personal growth and international career success.","options":["powder","furniture","collection","opportunity"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: opportunity (機會) 【全文中譯】學習第二外語為個人成長與國際職場成功開啟了巨大的機會。 【選項解析】(A) powder 粉末 (B) furniture 家具 (C) collection 收藏品 (D) opportunity 機會。tremendous opportunity 表「絕佳機會」。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Mix this green tea ______ with hot water and whisk it vigorously to prepare a traditional Japanese drink.","options":["powder","blood","furniture","collection"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: powder (粉末) 【全文中譯】將這種綠茶粉與熱水混合並均勻攪打，即可調製成傳統日本抹茶飲品。 【選項解析】(A) powder 粉末 (B) blood 血液 (C) furniture 家具 (D) collection 收藏品。green tea powder 表「綠茶粉（抹茶粉）」。"},{"number":20,"stem":"My parents ______ taking the scenic coastal train to driving on busy crowded expressways.","options":["sweep","mop","injure","prefer"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: prefer (偏好) 【全文中譯】我的父母比起在擁擠的高速公路上開車，更喜歡搭乘風景秀麗的沿海火車。 【選項解析】(A) sweep 掃地 (B) mop 拖地 (C) injure 受傷 (D) prefer 偏好。prefer taking train to driving 表「比起開車更喜歡搭火車」。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The carpentry workshop sells handcrafted pine ______, such as bookshelves, bedside tables, and desks.","options":["furniture","blood","powder","opportunity"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: furniture (家具) 【全文中譯】這家木工工作坊販售手工製作的松木家具，如書架、床頭櫃與書桌。 【選項解析】(A) furniture 家具 (B) blood 血液 (C) powder 粉末 (D) opportunity 機會。pine furniture 表「松木家具」。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Protesters began to ______ peacefully in front of city hall to demand cleaner air and green parks.","options":["mop","gather","injure","prefer"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: gather (聚集) 【全文中譯】抗議者開始和平聚集在市政廳前，要求更乾淨的空氣與綠地公園。 【選項解析】(A) mop 拖地 (B) gather 聚集 (C) injure 傷害 (D) prefer 偏好。gather peacefully 表「和平聚集」。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The art gallery exhibits an extraordinary ______ of oil paintings created by contemporary Taiwanese artists.","options":["blood","furniture","collection","powder"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: collection (收藏品) 【全文中譯】美術館展出了一批由台灣當代藝術家創作的非凡油畫收藏品。 【選項解析】(A) blood 血液 (B) furniture 家具 (C) collection 收藏品 (D) powder 粉末。collection of oil paintings 表「油畫收藏」。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The doctor said the patient lost a dangerous amount of ______ in the motorcycle accident and needs a transfusion.","options":["powder","blood","furniture","opportunity"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: blood (血液) 【全文中譯】醫生說病患在機車車禍中失血量達到危險程度，需要緊急輸血。 【選項解析】(A) powder 粉末 (B) blood 血液 (C) furniture 家具 (D) opportunity 機會。lost a dangerous amount of blood 表「失血過多」。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Be careful when lifting heavy boxes with your back, or you might severely ______ your spinal muscles.","options":["injure","sweep","mop","prefer"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: injure (受傷；扭傷) 【全文中譯】用背部搬運沉重箱子時要小心，否則你可能會嚴重弄傷脊椎肌肉。 【選項解析】(A) injure 受傷 (B) sweep 掃地 (C) mop 拖地 (D) prefer 偏好。injure muscles 表「弄傷肌肉」。"}]},{"unit":97,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 97 (097.mp3) Topic Focus: Media Press, Velocity, Achievement, Communication & Concerns","topic":"Topic Focus: Media Press, Velocity, Achievement, Communication & Concerns | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"press","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"newspapers and journalists; to push firmly against something","chinese":"新聞媒體；按壓","sentence":"The government held an urgent press conference to address public concerns, and the minister took questions from the ______.","translation":"政府召開緊急新聞發布會以回應公眾關切，部長接受了新聞媒體記者的提問。"},{"word":"rapid","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"happening in a short period of time or at great speed","chinese":"快速的；迅速的","sentence":"The widespread use of smartphones has led to ______ development in electronic payment systems across Asia.","translation":"智慧型手機的廣泛普及引發了全亞洲電子支付系統的迅速發展。"},{"word":"speed","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"the rate at which someone or something moves; to move fast","chinese":"速度；超速行駛","sentence":"Traffic cameras were installed on the highway to catch reckless drivers who ______ over the legal limit.","translation":"高速公路上安裝了測速照相機，以取締超過法定限制超速行駛的魯莽司機。"},{"word":"sharp","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"having a thin edge or point that can cut easily; clear and quick-witted","chinese":"鋒利的；尖銳的；敏銳的","sentence":"The chef used an exceptionally ______ knife to slice the raw tuna fillets into delicate pieces.","translation":"主廚使用一把異常鋒利的刀子，將生鮪魚柳切成細緻薄片。"},{"word":"achieve","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to successfully finish or gain something after hard work","chinese":"達成；實現","sentence":"With continuous discipline and daily practice, the young athlete hoped to ______ his dream of an Olympic medal.","translation":"憑藉持續的自律與每日訓練，這位年輕運動員希望能實現奪得奧運獎牌的夢想。"},{"word":"reach","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to arrive at a place; to stretch out an arm to touch something","chinese":"抵達；伸手觸及","sentence":"After climbing steep mountain paths for six exhausting hours, the hikers finally managed to ______ the summit.","translation":"在陡峭山徑上艱難攀登了筋疲力竭的六小時後，登山客們終於成功抵達了山頂。"},{"word":"regard","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to consider or think of in a particular way; respect","chinese":"看待；尊重；問候","sentence":"Many literary critics ______ this classic novel as one of the greatest masterpieces of the twentieth century.","translation":"許多文學評論家將這本經典小說視為二十世紀最偉大的傑作之一。"},{"word":"concern","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a feeling of worry; to cause worry to someone","chinese":"擔憂；關切；涉及","sentence":"Parents expressed deep ______ regarding the safety of school pedestrian crossings near busy morning intersections.","translation":"家長們對繁忙晨間十字路口附近的學校行人穿越道安全表達了深切的擔憂。"},{"word":"reply (reply / replied / replied)","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to answer someone by words or writing; an answer","chinese":"回覆；答覆","sentence":"I sent an urgent email inquiry to the airline customer service desk, but I have received no ______ yet.","translation":"我給航空公司客服處寄去了一封緊急電子郵件諮詢，但我至今尚未收到回覆。"},{"word":"result","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"something that happens because of something else; an outcome","chinese":"結果；後果；成效","sentence":"The hard work of the research team produced an impressive ______ that was published in a prestigious journal.","translation":"研究團隊的辛勤工作產生了令人矚目的成果（結果），該成果發表在一本聲譽卓著的期刊上。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Reputable journalists from international ______ agencies gathered in the capital to cover the presidential election.","options":["speed","press","result","concern"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: press (新聞媒體) 【全文中譯】來自國際新聞機構的信譽卓著記者聚集在首都，採訪報導總統大選。 【選項解析】(A) speed 速度 (B) press 媒體 (C) result 結果 (D) concern 關切。press agencies 指「新聞通訊社」。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The technology company achieved ______ economic growth after introducing its innovative artificial intelligence tools.","options":["sharp","rapid","concern","result"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: rapid (快速的；迅速的) 【全文中譯】這家科技公司在推出創新的生成式人工智慧工具後，實現了迅速的經濟成長。 【選項解析】(A) sharp 銳利的 (B) rapid 迅速的 (C) concern 擔憂 (D) result 結果。rapid economic growth 表「迅速經濟成長」。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Driving at high ______ during heavy rain increases the risk of slipping on wet highway pavement.","options":["speed","press","reply","result"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: speed (速度) 【全文中譯】大雨期間在高速公路上高速行駛會增加在濕滑路面打滑的危險。 【選項解析】(A) speed 速度 (B) press 媒體 (C) reply 回覆 (D) result 結果。high speed 表「高速」。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Be extremely careful when using those ______ scissors, or you might accidentally cut your fingers.","options":["rapid","sharp","speed","press"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: sharp (鋒利的) 【全文中譯】使用那把鋒利的剪刀時要格外小心，否則你可能會不小心割破手指。 【選項解析】(A) rapid 快速的 (B) sharp 鋒利的 (C) speed 速度 (D) press 按壓。sharp scissors 表「鋒利的剪刀」。"},{"number":5,"stem":"If you work consistently with determination, you will surely ______ your academic goals this semester.","options":["reply","reach","achieve","concern"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: achieve (達成；實現) 【全文中譯】如果你帶著決心堅持不懈地努力，本學期你必定能實現你的學業目標。 【選項解析】(A) reply 回覆 (B) reach 抵達 (C) achieve 實現 (D) concern 擔憂。achieve goals 表「達成目標」。"},{"number":6,"stem":"After traveling on the night train for eight hours, we will ______ Taitung station just in time for sunrise.","options":["reach","achieve","reply","press"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: reach (抵達) 【全文中譯】搭乘夜車行駛八小時後，我們剛好會在日出時抵達台東火車站。 【選項解析】(A) reach 抵達 (B) achieve 達成 (C) reply 回覆 (D) press 按壓。reach Taitung station 表「抵達台東站」。"},{"number":7,"stem":"Most historians ______ this peace treaty as the crucial turning point that ended the long continental war.","options":["reply","regard","achieve","speed"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: regard (視為；看待) 【全文中譯】多數歷史學家將這份和平條約視為結束這場漫長歐陸戰爭的關鍵轉折點。 【選項解析】(A) reply 回答 (B) regard 視為 (C) achieve 達成 (D) speed 飛馳。regard A as B 表「將A視為B」。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Environmental pollution remains a major ______ for local residents living near industrial chemical plants.","options":["press","speed","concern","reply"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: concern (擔憂；關切) 【全文中譯】環境污染依然是居住在化工廠附近當地居民的主要擔憂關切事項。 【選項解析】(A) press 媒體 (B) speed 速度 (C) concern 擔憂 (D) reply 回答。major concern 表「主要擔憂」。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The school principal promised to ______ promptly to the parents' petition regarding cafeteria food hygiene.","options":["reply","achieve","reach","regard"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: reply (回覆) 【全文中譯】校長承諾將就家長們關於學校餐廳食品衛生的請願迅速給予回覆。 【選項解析】(A) reply 回覆 (B) achieve 達成 (C) reach 抵達 (D) regard 視為。reply to petition 表「回覆請願」。"},{"number":10,"stem":"As a direct ______ of regular physical exercise, grandfather's blood pressure returned to a healthy level.","options":["speed","press","concern","result"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: result (結果；成效) 【全文中譯】規律運動的直接成效是，祖父的血壓恢復到了健康的水準。 【選項解析】(A) speed 速度 (B) press 媒體 (C) concern 擔憂 (D) result 結果。direct result 表「直接結果」。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Freedom of the ______ is an essential democratic right that allows citizens to stay informed about government decisions.","options":["press","speed","result","concern"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: press (新聞界；媒體) 【全文中譯】新聞自由是一項不可或缺的民主權利，能讓公民充分了解政府決策。 【選項解析】(A) press 新聞媒體 (B) speed 速度 (C) result 結果 (D) concern 關心。freedom of the press 表「新聞自由」。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Medical doctors noticed a ______ improvement in the patient's condition after the new medicine was administered.","options":["sharp","rapid","result","speed"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: rapid (快速的) 【全文中譯】在施用了新藥物後，醫生們注意到病患的病情出現了迅速的改善。 【選項解析】(A) sharp 銳利的 (B) rapid 迅速的 (C) result 結果 (D) speed 速度。rapid improvement 表「迅速好轉」。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Police officers used handheld radar guns to monitor traffic ______ along the winding mountain highway.","options":["result","reply","speed","press"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: speed (速度) 【全文中譯】警官們使用手持雷達測速槍監控蜿蜒山區公路沿線的交通車速。 【選項解析】(A) result 結果 (B) reply 回覆 (C) speed 速度 (D) press 媒體。traffic speed 表「行車速度」。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The teacher has a very ______ memory for historical dates and names, never forgetting a single detail.","options":["sharp","rapid","speed","press"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: sharp (敏銳的) 【全文中譯】老師對歷史年代與人名有著非常敏銳清晰的記憶力，從不遺漏任何細節。 【選項解析】(A) sharp 敏銳的 (B) rapid 快速的 (C) speed 速度 (D) press 媒體。sharp memory 表「敏銳清晰的記憶力」。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The dedicated charity foundation worked tirelessly to ______ its mission of providing clean drinking water to remote villages.","options":["reach","achieve","reply","regard"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: achieve (實現；達成) 【全文中譯】這家熱心的慈善基金會不知疲倦地工作，以實現為偏遠村莊提供乾淨飲用水的使命。 【選項解析】(A) reach 抵達 (B) achieve 實現 (C) reply 回覆 (D) regard 視為。achieve its mission 表「實現其使命」。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Can you please stretch your arm and see if you can ______ the dictionary on the uppermost bookshelf?","options":["achieve","reply","reach","press"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: reach (伸手觸碰；夠到) 【全文中譯】能否請你伸展手臂，看你能不能夠到最高層書架上的字典？ 【選項解析】(A) achieve 達成 (B) reply 回答 (C) reach 伸手夠到 (D) press 按壓。reach the book on the shelf 表「夠到書架上的書」。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Please give my warmest ______ to your grandparents when you return home to visit them this weekend.","options":["replies","regards","speeds","results"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: regards (問候；致意) 【全文中譯】這週末你回家探望祖父母時，請代我向他們致以最溫暖誠摯的問候。 【選項解析】(A) replies 回覆 (B) regards 問候 (C) speeds 速度 (D) results 結果。give my regards to 表「向…致意問候」。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The sudden rise in housing prices has caused widespread ______ among young families hoping to purchase a home.","options":["speed","press","concern","result"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: concern (擔憂) 【全文中譯】房價的突然上漲引發了渴望購屋的年輕家庭廣泛的擔憂。 【選項解析】(A) speed 速度 (B) press 媒體 (C) concern 擔憂 (D) result 結果。widespread concern 表「廣泛擔憂」。"},{"number":19,"stem":"When the teacher asked a question about Taiwanese history, several eager students raised their hands to ______.","options":["reply","reach","achieve","regard"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: reply (回答；答覆) 【全文中譯】當老師提出一個關於台灣歷史的問題時，幾位積極的學生舉手回答。 【選項解析】(A) reply 回答 (B) reach 觸及 (C) achieve 達成 (D) regard 視為。raised hands to reply 表「舉手作答」。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The final examination ______ will be posted on the school bulletin board next Monday morning.","options":["speed","results","presses","concerns"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: results (成績；結果) 【全文中譯】期末考試的成績結果將於下週一早晨張貼在學校公佈欄上。 【選項解析】(A) speed 速度 (B) results 結果；成績 (C) presses 媒體 (D) concerns 擔憂。examination results 表「考試成績」。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The president invited foreign ______ correspondents to the palace for a special briefing on international trade.","options":["speed","press","result","concern"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: press (新聞媒體) 【全文中譯】總統邀請駐外媒體通訊記者前往總統府，就國際貿易進行專案簡報。 【選項解析】(A) speed 速度 (B) press 媒體 (C) result 結果 (D) concern 擔憂。foreign press correspondents 表「外國新聞記者」。"},{"number":22,"stem":"There has been a ______ rise in electric vehicle sales across Europe over the past two years.","options":["sharp","speed","rapid","press"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: rapid (快速的) 【全文中譯】過去兩年來全歐洲的電動車銷售量出現了迅速增長。 【選項解析】(A) sharp 鋒利的 (B) speed 速度 (C) rapid 迅速的 (D) press 媒體。rapid rise 表「迅速攀升」。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The high-speed bullet train travels at a maximum ______ of three hundred kilometers per hour.","options":["result","speed","press","concern"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: speed (速度) 【全文中譯】高速子彈列車以每小時最高三百公里的速度行駛疾馳。 【選項解析】(A) result 結果 (B) speed 速度 (C) press 媒體 (D) concern 擔憂。at a maximum speed of 表「以最高時速…」。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Look at that eagle circling in the sky; it has exceptionally ______ eyesight to spot mice in the grass.","options":["rapid","speed","sharp","press"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: sharp (敏銳的) 【全文中譯】看那隻在空中盤旋的老鷹，牠有著格外敏銳的視力，能發現草叢中的老鼠。 【選項解析】(A) rapid 迅速的 (B) speed 速度 (C) sharp 敏銳的 (D) press 媒體。sharp eyesight 表「敏銳視力」。"},{"number":25,"stem":"With great courage and team collaboration, the rescue squad was able to ______ the trapped miners safely.","options":["reach","achieve","reply","regard"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: reach (抵達；接觸到) 【全文中譯】憑藉巨大的勇氣與團隊協作，搜救隊成功安全接觸到了受困礦工。 【選項解析】(A) reach 抵達；接觸到 (B) achieve 達成 (C) reply 回覆 (D) regard 視為。reach the trapped miners 表「接觸/抵達受困礦工處」。"}]},{"unit":98,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 98 (098.mp3) Topic Focus: Vision, Landscapes, Human Intelligence, Abilities & Hygiene","topic":"Topic Focus: Vision, Landscapes, Human Intelligence, Abilities & Hygiene | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"return","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to come or go back to a place; to give something back; an act of returning","chinese":"返回；歸還","sentence":"Students must ______ all borrowed library books before the end of the semester to avoid late fines.","translation":"學生必須在學期結束前歸還所有借閱的圖書館書籍，以避免繳交逾期罰款。"},{"word":"sight","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the ability to see; something that is seen; vision","chinese":"視力；景物；景象","sentence":"Watching fireworks explode over Sun Moon Lake on New Year's Eve was truly a breathtaking ______ to behold.","translation":"在除夕夜觀看煙火在日月潭上空綻放，確實是一幅令人屏息的壯麗景象。"},{"word":"view","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"what you can see from a particular place; an opinion; to look at","chinese":"視野；景色；看法；觀看","sentence":"From the top floor of Taipei 101, visitors can enjoy a panoramic ______ of the entire mountain basin.","translation":"從台北101的頂樓，遊客可以欣賞整座盆地山景的全景視野。"},{"word":"silent","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"without any sound; not speaking","chinese":"寂靜的；無聲的；沉默的","sentence":"The auditorium remained completely ______ while the pianist performed a delicate classical piece on stage.","translation":"當鋼琴家在舞台上演奏一首細緻的古典樂曲時，禮堂裡保持著完全的寂靜無聲。"},{"word":"ability","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the physical or mental power or skill needed to do something","chinese":"能力；本領","sentence":"Regular language practice will greatly enhance your ______ to communicate fluently with native speakers.","translation":"規律的語言練習將大幅提升你與母語人士流利溝通的能力。"},{"word":"skill","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an ability to do an activity or job well, especially that is learned","chinese":"技能；技巧","sentence":"Learning carpentry requires both creative patience and the practical ______ to use specialized hand tools.","translation":"學習木工既需要創造性的耐心，也需要使用專業手工具的實用技能。"},{"word":"tip","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"the pointed end of something; useful advice; extra money given for service","chinese":"尖端；秘訣；小費","sentence":"The experienced English teacher shared a helpful ______ on how to memorize vocabulary through reading.","translation":"那位富有經驗的英語老師分享了一個關於如何透過閱讀記憶單字的實用秘訣。"},{"word":"talent","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a natural ability to be good at something, especially in arts or sports","chinese":"天賦；才華","sentence":"From early childhood, Mozart displayed an extraordinary musical ______ for composing orchestral melodies.","translation":"從幼年時期起，莫札特就展現了創作管弦樂旋律的非凡音樂天賦。"},{"word":"genius","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an exceptionally talented or intelligent person","chinese":"天才；天賦才智","sentence":"Albert Einstein is universally celebrated as a scientific ______ whose theories reshaped modern physics.","translation":"愛因斯坦被世人公認為一位科學天才，他的理論重塑了現代物理學。"},{"word":"soap","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a substance used with water for washing and cleaning","chinese":"肥皂","sentence":"Always wash your hands thoroughly with warm water and antibacterial ______ before preparing food.","translation":"在準備食物之前，務必用溫水與抗菌肥皂徹底清洗雙手。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Please remember to ______ your apartment keys to the landlord before moving out this Saturday morning.","options":["soap","return","sight","talent"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: return (歸還) 【全文中譯】請記得在本週六早晨搬出前將公寓鑰匙歸還給房東。 【選項解析】(A) soap 肥皂 (B) return 歸還 (C) sight 視力 (D) talent 天賦。return keys to landlord 表「還鑰匙給房東」。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The dense sea fog gradually cleared, and the picturesque coastal lighthouse came into ______.","options":["sight","soap","genius","ability"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: sight (景象；視野) 【全文中譯】濃郁的海霧逐漸散去，如畫般的沿海燈塔映入眼簾。 【選項解析】(A) sight 景象；眼簾 (B) soap 肥皂 (C) genius 天才 (D) ability 能力。came into sight 為固定片語「映入眼簾」。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Our hillside hotel room offered a magnificent mountain ______ overlooking the sparkling lake below.","options":["soap","tip","view","ability"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: view (景觀；視野) 【全文中譯】我們位於半山腰的飯店房間提供了俯瞰下方波光粼粼湖泊的壯麗山景視野。 【選項解析】(A) soap 肥皂 (B) tip 秘訣 (C) view 景緻 (D) ability 能力。mountain view 表「山景」。"},{"number":4,"stem":"The entire library was peaceful and ______ as students studied diligently for their college exams.","options":["silent","view","skill","talent"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: silent (寂靜無聲的) 【全文中譯】當學生們為大學考試勤奮溫習時，整座圖書館顯得安詳而寂靜無聲。 【選項解析】(A) silent 寂靜的 (B) view 景色 (C) skill 技能 (D) talent 天賦。peaceful and silent 表「安詳寂靜」。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Developing the ______ to think critically and solve problems independently is a major goal of education.","options":["soap","tip","ability","sight"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: ability (能力) 【全文中譯】培養批判性思考與獨立解決問題的能力是教育的主要目標之一。 【選項解析】(A) soap 肥皂 (B) tip 秘訣 (C) ability 能力 (D) sight 視力。ability to think critically 表「批判思考能力」。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Mastering the specialized culinary ______ of making French pastry requires years of professional training.","options":["skill","soap","sight","genius"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: skill (技能；技巧) 【全文中譯】精通製作法式糕點的專業烹飪技巧需要多年的專業訓練。 【選項解析】(A) skill 技能 (B) soap 肥皂 (C) sight 視力 (D) genius 天才。culinary skill 表「廚藝技能」。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The chef gave us a useful cooking ______: sprinkle sea salt over roasted vegetables to bring out flavor.","options":["soap","sight","view","tip"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: tip (秘訣；小訣竅) 【全文中譯】主廚給了我們一個實用的烹飪秘訣：在烤蔬菜上灑上海鹽以提味。 【選項解析】(A) soap 肥皂 (B) sight 視力 (C) view 景色 (D) tip 秘訣。cooking tip 表「烹飪小秘訣」。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The young gymnast showed exceptional athletic ______ at the national championship competition.","options":["talent","soap","view","tip"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: talent (天賦；才華) 【全文中譯】這位年輕體操選手在全國錦標大賽中展現了非凡的運動天賦。 【選項解析】(A) talent 天賦 (B) soap 肥皂 (C) view 景色 (D) tip 秘訣。athletic talent 表「運動天賦」。"},{"number":9,"stem":"People considered Leonardo da Vinci a true universal ______ who excelled in both painting and engineering.","options":["soap","genius","tip","sight"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: genius (天才) 【全文中譯】人們認為達文西是一位真正的全才天才，在繪畫與工程學方面均卓爾不群。 【選項解析】(A) soap 肥皂 (B) genius 天才 (C) tip 小費 (D) sight 景象。universal genius 表「全才天才」。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Before having dinner with the family, the children washed their hands with fragrant lavender ______.","options":["talent","ability","view","soap"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: soap (肥皂) 【全文中譯】在與家人共進晚餐之前，孩子們用芬芳的薰衣草肥皂洗手。 【選項解析】(A) talent 天賦 (B) ability 能力 (C) view 景色 (D) soap 肥皂。lavender soap 表「薰衣草肥皂」。"},{"number":11,"stem":"When does the overseas flight ______ to Taiwan after completing the scheduled international tour?","options":["return","soap","talent","skill"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: return (返回) 【全文中譯】在完成預定的國際行程後，那架海外班機何時返回台灣？ 【選項解析】(A) return 返回 (B) soap 肥皂 (C) talent 天賦 (D) skill 技能。flight return to Taiwan 表「班機返回台灣」。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Losing one's eye ______ is a tragedy that medical doctors work hard to prevent with modern laser surgery.","options":["soap","sight","tip","genius"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: sight (視力) 【全文中譯】失去視力是一場悲劇，醫生們透過現代雷射手術竭力防止此一情況。 【選項解析】(A) soap 肥皂 (B) sight 視力 (C) tip 秘訣 (D) genius 天才。eye sight / eyesight 表「視力」。"},{"number":13,"stem":"From the balcony of our apartment, we have an unobstructed ocean ______ stretching to the horizon.","options":["soap","tip","view","ability"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: view (視野；海景) 【全文中譯】從我們公寓的陽台望去，我們擁有延伸至地平線的無遮蔽海景視野。 【選項解析】(A) soap 肥皂 (B) tip 秘訣 (C) view 景緻 (D) ability 能力。ocean view 表「海景」。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The forest was completely ______ at midnight, with only the distant sound of an owl breaking the quiet.","options":["silent","skill","talent","view"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: silent (寂靜的) 【全文中譯】午夜時分的森林完全一片寂靜，只有遠處貓頭鷹的叫聲打破寧靜。 【選項解析】(A) silent 寂靜的 (B) skill 技能 (C) talent 天賦 (D) view 景色。completely silent 表「完全寂靜」。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Many animals have an extraordinary ______ to detect earthquakes hours before human sensors feel them.","options":["tip","ability","soap","sight"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: ability (能力；本領) 【全文中譯】許多動物擁有非凡的本領，能在人類感測器感受到地震前數小時察覺地震。 【選項解析】(A) tip 秘訣 (B) ability 能力 (C) soap 肥皂 (D) sight 視力。extraordinary ability 表「非凡本領」。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Computer programming is an indispensable technical ______ in today's digital economic environment.","options":["skill","soap","sight","genius"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: skill (技能) 【全文中譯】電腦程式設計在當今數位經濟環境中是一項不可或缺的專業技術技能。 【選項解析】(A) skill 技能 (B) soap 肥皂 (C) sight 景象 (D) genius 天才。technical skill 表「技術技能」。"},{"number":17,"stem":"In American restaurants, it is customary to leave a fifteen percent cash ______ for attentive waiters.","options":["view","soap","tip","sight"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: tip (小費) 【全文中譯】在美國餐廳，給予服務周到的服務生百分之十五的現金小費是慣例。 【選項解析】(A) view 觀點 (B) soap 肥皂 (C) tip 小費 (D) sight 視力。cash tip 表「現金小費」。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The audition judges were amazed by her vocal ______ when she sang an opera solo effortlessly.","options":["soap","talent","tip","view"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: talent (才華；天賦) 【全文中譯】當她毫不費力地演唱一首歌劇獨唱時，選拔評審為她的歌唱才華驚嘆不已。 【選項解析】(A) soap 肥皂 (B) talent 才華 (C) tip 秘訣 (D) view 景觀。vocal talent 表「歌唱才華」。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Steve Jobs was widely recognized as a design ______ who transformed consumer technology products.","options":["soap","tip","genius","sight"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: genius (天才) 【全文中譯】史蒂夫·賈伯斯被世人廣泛公認為一位改變了消費性科技產品的設計天才。 【選項解析】(A) soap 肥皂 (B) tip 秘訣 (C) genius 天才 (D) sight 景象。design genius 表「設計天才」。"},{"number":20,"stem":"Remember to take a bar of facial ______ and a clean towel when you go to the hot spring resort.","options":["soap","talent","view","ability"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: soap (肥皂) 【全文中譯】前往溫泉度假村時，記得攜帶一塊洗面皂和乾淨毛巾。 【選項解析】(A) soap 肥皂 (B) talent 天賦 (C) view 視野 (D) ability 能力。facial soap 表「洗面皂」。"},{"number":21,"stem":"I must ______ to the office immediately because I forgot an important client contract on my desk.","options":["soap","return","sight","skill"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: return (返回) 【全文中譯】我必須立刻返回辦公室，因為我把一份重要的客戶合約忘在辦公桌上了。 【選項解析】(A) soap 肥皂 (B) return 返回 (C) sight 視力 (D) skill 技能。return to the office 表「返回辦公室」。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The cherry blossoms blooming across Yangmingshan in spring are a spectacular ______ that attracts crowds.","options":["soap","sight","tip","genius"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: sight (景象；美景) 【全文中譯】春天陽明山上櫻花盛開是一幅壯觀的景象，吸引了大批人潮。 【選項解析】(A) soap 肥皂 (B) sight 景象 (C) tip 秘訣 (D) genius 天才。spectacular sight 表「壯觀景象」。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The committee members expressed different ______ on whether to construct a new sports stadium in the city.","options":["tips","soaps","views","sights"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: views (觀點；看法) 【全文中譯】委員會成員對於是否在該市建造一座新體育場表達了不同的觀點看法。 【選項解析】(A) tips 秘訣 (B) soaps 肥皂 (C) views 觀點 (D) sights 視力。different views on 表「對…的不同看法」。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The theater audience remained reverently ______ until the final emotional violin chord faded away.","options":["silent","skill","talent","view"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: silent (沉默肅靜的) 【全文中譯】劇場觀眾虔敬地保持肅靜，直到最後一個富有情感的小提琴和弦消逝。 【選項解析】(A) silent 肅靜的 (B) skill 技能 (C) talent 天賦 (D) view 景觀。remained silent 表「保持肅靜」。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Humans possess the unique cognitive ______ to create complex languages and write literature.","options":["tip","soap","sight","ability"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: ability (能力) 【全文中譯】人類具備獨特的認知能力，能夠創造複雜語言並撰寫文學著作。 【選項解析】(A) tip 秘訣 (B) soap 肥皂 (C) sight 視力 (D) ability 能力。cognitive ability 表「認知能力」。"}]},{"unit":99,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 99 (099.mp3) Topic Focus: Information Resources, Organization, Aid Supplies, Infrastructure & Willingness","topic":"Topic Focus: Information Resources, Organization, Aid Supplies, Infrastructure & Willingness | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"source","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the place or thing where something comes from; an information provider","chinese":"來源；出處","sentence":"The internet has become the primary ______ of international news for university students today.","translation":"網際網路已成為當今大學生獲取國際新聞的主要來源。"},{"word":"stamp","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a small piece of paper stuck on a letter; to put a foot down hard","chinese":"郵票；印章；蓋章；踩踏","sentence":"Don't forget to affix an airmail ______ to the envelope before dropping it into the postbox.","translation":"在將信封投入郵筒之前，別忘了在信封上貼上一枚航空郵票。"},{"word":"step (step / stepped / stepped)","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"the movement of lifting foot; a stage in a process","chinese":"步伐；步驟；踏步","sentence":"The government took a decisive ______ forward by investing heavily in renewable solar energy systems.","translation":"政府藉由大力投資可再生太陽能系統，向前邁出了決定性的一步（步驟）。"},{"word":"stick (stick / stuck / stuck)","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a thin piece of wood; to attach with glue; to push into","chinese":"枝條；棍棒；黏貼；卡住","sentence":"The campers collected dry wooden ______ in the pine forest to build a warm fire for the evening.","translation":"露營者在松樹林裡收集乾燥木枝條，以便為夜晚生起溫暖的營火。","answer":"sticks"},{"word":"support","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to help someone emotionally or practically; to hold up physically","chinese":"支持；支撐；擁護","sentence":"Parents should always provide loving ______ and encouragement when their children face difficult challenges.","translation":"當孩子面臨艱難挑戰時，父母應始終給予充滿愛意的支持與鼓勵。"},{"word":"supply (supply / supplied / supplied)","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"an amount of something available for use; to provide","chinese":"供應；補給；物資；提供","sentence":"The international charity delivered an urgent ______ of clean drinking water and canned food to the disaster zone.","translation":"國際慈善機構向災區運送了緊急的純淨飲用水與罐頭食品物資（供應）。"},{"word":"system","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a set of connected things or rules working together","chinese":"系統；體系；體制","sentence":"Taipei boasts an efficient underground metro ______ that transports millions of daily commuters quickly and safely.","translation":"台北擁有高效的地下捷運系統，能迅速且安全地運送數百萬名每日通勤族。"},{"word":"task","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a piece of work to be done, especially one that is difficult","chinese":"任務；差事；工作","sentence":"Completing the complicated science project before Friday was a challenging ______ for the high school group.","translation":"在星期五之前完成這項複雜的自然科學專案，對該高中組別而言是一項具挑戰性的任務。"},{"word":"track","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a path or rough road; railway rails; to follow movement","chinese":"軌道；跑道；行蹤；追蹤","sentence":"Meteorologists use modern satellites to ______ the exact path of the powerful tropical typhoon approaching Taiwan.","translation":"氣象學家利用現代人造衛星來追蹤逼近台灣的強烈熱帶颱風的確切路徑（軌跡）。"},{"word":"willing","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"ready, eager, or prepared to do something without complaining","chinese":"樂意的；情願的","sentence":"Many kindhearted community volunteers were ______ to help rebuild homes damaged by the mountain earthquake.","translation":"許多熱心的社區志願者樂意協助重建被山區地震損毀的家園。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Reputable journalists always verify information with a reliable ______ before publishing breaking news.","options":["stamp","source","stick","task"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: source (來源) 【全文中譯】信譽卓著的記者在發布突發新聞之前，總是會向可靠的來源查證資訊。 【選項解析】(A) stamp 郵票 (B) source 來源 (C) stick 枝條 (D) task 任務。reliable source 表「可靠消息來源」。"},{"number":2,"stem":"When entering a foreign country, the immigration officer will examine your passport and ______ an official visa entry.","options":["stamp","source","supply","track"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: stamp (蓋章) 【全文中譯】入境國外時，移民官會檢查你的護照並蓋上官方簽證入境章。 【選項解析】(A) stamp 蓋章 (B) source 來源 (C) supply 供應 (D) track 追蹤。stamp an entry 表「蓋上入境章」。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Following every safety ______ outlined in the laboratory manual will prevent dangerous chemical accidents.","options":["stick","source","step","task"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: step (步驟) 【全文中譯】遵循實驗室手冊中列出的每一步安全步驟，將能防止危險化學事故。 【選項解析】(A) stick 枝條 (B) source 來源 (C) step 步驟 (D) task 任務。safety step 表「安全步驟」。"},{"number":4,"stem":"The little boy used paste to ______ colorful pictures of wild animals into his school scrapbook.","options":["support","stick","supply","track"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: stick (黏貼) 【全文中譯】小男孩用漿糊把色彩繽紛的野生動物圖片黏貼到他的學校剪貼簿裡。 【選項解析】(A) support 支持 (B) stick 黏貼 (C) supply 提供 (D) track 追蹤。stick pictures into 表「把圖片貼入」。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Teachers always ______ students who actively participate in class discussions and ask thoughtful questions.","options":["stamp","track","support","stick"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: support (支持；鼓勵) 【全文中譯】老師總是支持並鼓勵積極參與課堂討論並提出深刻問題的學生。 【選項解析】(A) stamp 蓋印 (B) track 追蹤 (C) support 支持 (D) stick 黏貼。support students 表「支持學生」。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Severe winter blizzards disrupted the local electricity ______, leaving thousands of suburban households in the dark.","options":["supply","source","stamp","task"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: supply (供應) 【全文中譯】嚴重的冬季暴風雪中斷了當地的電力供應，使數千戶郊區家庭陷入黑暗。 【選項解析】(A) supply 供應 (B) source 來源 (C) stamp 郵票 (D) task 任務。electricity supply 表「電力供應」。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The hospital upgraded its computerized medical record ______ to improve patient care efficiency.","options":["system","stick","stamp","task"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: system (系統) 【全文中譯】醫院升級了電腦化病歷系統，以提高病患照護的效率。 【選項解析】(A) system 系統 (B) stick 枝條 (C) stamp 印章 (D) task 任務。record system 表「紀錄系統」。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Organizing all the company financial records for the annual tax audit was an exhausting ______ for the accountant.","options":["stamp","source","task","system"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: task (任務；差事) 【全文中譯】為年度稅務審計整理公司所有財務紀錄，對會計師而言是一項筋疲力竭的任務。 【選項解析】(A) stamp 郵票 (B) source 來源 (C) task 任務 (D) system 系統。exhausting task 表「累人的任務」。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The high-speed train glided smoothly along the steel ______ through the green countryside.","options":["stamp","track","source","stick"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: track (軌道) 【全文中譯】高速火車沿著鋼鐵軌道在綠色鄉間平穩滑行馳騁。 【選項解析】(A) stamp 郵票 (B) track 鐵軌 (C) source 來源 (D) stick 棍棒。steel track 表「鋼鐵軌道」。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Are you ______ to work overtime this weekend to help the marketing team meet the project deadline?","options":["willing","system","track","task"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: willing (樂意的) 【全文中譯】你這週末願意加班以協助行銷團隊趕上專案截止期限嗎？ 【選項解析】(A) willing 樂意的 (B) system 系統 (C) track 追蹤 (D) task 任務。willing to work overtime 表「願意加班」。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Fresh mountain springs provide a clean, natural ______ of drinking water for the remote valley village.","options":["source","stamp","task","stick"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: source (來源) 【全文中譯】新鮮高山泉水為偏遠山谷村莊提供了乾淨、天然的飲用水來源。 【選項解析】(A) source 來源 (B) stamp 郵票 (C) task 任務 (D) stick 枝條。natural source of water 表「天然水源」。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The postal clerk handed me an anniversary postage ______ featuring rare Taiwanese wildlife.","options":["stick","stamp","source","track"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: stamp (郵票) 【全文中譯】郵局職員遞給我一枚印有稀有台灣野生動物圖案的紀念郵票。 【選項解析】(A) stick 枝條 (B) stamp 郵票 (C) source 來源 (D) track 跑道。postage stamp 表「郵票」。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Taking the first ______ toward learning a new foreign language can feel intimidating, but practice brings confidence.","options":["track","stick","step","system"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: step (腳步；步驟) 【全文中譯】邁出學習一門新外語的第一步可能會感到令人卻步，但練習會帶來信心。 【選項解析】(A) track 軌道 (B) stick 棍棒 (C) step 腳步 (D) system 系統。first step 表「第一步」。"},{"number":14,"stem":"We gathered dry pine ______ from the forest floor to roast marshmallows over the evening campfire.","options":["stamps","sticks","sources","tasks"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: sticks (枝條；木棒) 【全文中譯】我們從森林地面收集乾燥松樹枝，以便在夜晚營火上烤棉花糖。 【選項解析】(A) stamps 郵票 (B) sticks 枝條 (C) sources 來源 (D) tasks 任務。pine sticks 表「松樹小枝條」。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The government introduced special tax subsidies to ______ farmers affected by the prolonged summer drought.","options":["track","stick","support","stamp"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: support (支持；扶助) 【全文中譯】政府推出特別稅收補貼，以扶助支持受到漫長夏日乾旱影響的農民。 【選項解析】(A) track 追蹤 (B) stick 黏貼 (C) support 扶助支持 (D) stamp 踩踏。support farmers 表「扶助農民」。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Emergency relief planes will air-drop a fresh ______ of medical kits to the cut-off mountain villages.","options":["stamp","source","supply","system"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: supply (補給；物資) 【全文中譯】緊急救援飛機將向受困隔絕的山區村莊空投一批新鮮的醫療急救包補給物資。 【選項解析】(A) stamp 郵票 (B) source 來源 (C) supply 補給物資 (D) system 系統。supply of medical kits 表「醫療物資補給」。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Taiwan's national healthcare ______ is internationally praised for its high quality and affordable accessibility.","options":["system","stick","stamp","task"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: system (體制；系統) 【全文中譯】台灣的全民健保體制因其高品質與平價便利性而在國際上廣受讚譽。 【選項解析】(A) system 體制系統 (B) stick 枝條 (C) stamp 郵票 (D) task 任務。healthcare system 表「健保醫療體系」。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Cleaning out the garage on a sunny Saturday afternoon was an arduous ______ that took our entire family four hours.","options":["system","stamp","task","source"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: task (任務；苦差事) 【全文中譯】在晴朗週六下午清理車庫是一件費力的苦差事，花費了我們全家四個小時。 【選項解析】(A) system 系統 (B) stamp 郵票 (C) task 差事任務 (D) source 來源。arduous task 表「費力任務」。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Wildlife biologists placed GPS collars on mountain deer to ______ their seasonal migration patterns.","options":["track","support","supply","stamp"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: track (追蹤) 【全文中譯】野生動物生物學家在山鹿身上安裝 GPS 項圈，以追蹤其季節性遷徙模式。 【選項解析】(A) track 追蹤 (B) support 支持 (C) supply 供應 (D) stamp 蓋印。track migration patterns 表「追蹤遷徙模式」。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The generous philanthropist was ______ to donate half of his wealth to establish educational scholarships.","options":["system","willing","track","source"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: willing (樂意的；願意的) 【全文中譯】這位慷慨的慈善家樂意捐出自己一半的財富來設立教育獎學金。 【選項解析】(A) system 系統 (B) willing 樂意的 (C) track 軌道 (D) source 來源。willing to donate 表「樂意捐贈」。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The sun is the ultimate renewable energy ______ that sustains plant life and powers solar panels across Earth.","options":["stamp","source","stick","task"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: source (來源) 【全文中譯】太陽是維持植物生命並為全地球太陽能板提供動力的終極可再生能源來源。 【選項解析】(A) stamp 郵票 (B) source 來源 (C) stick 枝條 (D) task 任務。energy source 表「能源來源」。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Don't forget to affix an official postal ______ in the top right corner of the envelope before mailing.","options":["stamp","source","task","track"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: stamp (郵票) 【全文中譯】在寄出信件前，別忘了在信封右上角貼上一枚官方郵票。 【選項解析】(A) stamp 郵票 (B) source 來源 (C) task 任務 (D) track 軌道。postal stamp 表「郵票」。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The school principal outlined three practical ______ that students can take to reduce plastic waste on campus.","options":["sticks","steps","sources","tasks"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: steps (步驟；措施) 【全文中譯】校長列出了學生在校園內減少塑膠垃圾可以採取的項實用步驟措施。 【選項解析】(A) sticks 枝條 (B) steps 步驟 (C) sources 來源 (D) tasks 任務。practical steps 表「實用步驟措施」。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Use adhesive tape to ______ the informational announcement firmly onto the bulletin board glass.","options":["stick","support","track","stamp"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: stick (黏貼) 【全文中譯】使用膠帶將這張通知公告牢牢黏貼在公佈欄玻璃上。 【選項解析】(A) stick 黏貼 (B) support 支持 (C) track 追蹤 (D) stamp 蓋印。stick announcement 表「黏貼公告」。"},{"number":25,"stem":"When the student felt discouraged about her test score, her tutor offered heartfelt words of ______.","options":["source","stamp","support","task"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: support (支持；鼓勵) 【全文中譯】當學生對自己的測驗成績感到沮喪時，她的家教老師給予了由衷的支持與鼓勵。 【選項解析】(A) source 來源 (B) stamp 郵票 (C) support 支持 (D) task 任務。words of support 表「支持與鼓勵的話語」。"}]},{"unit":100,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 100 (100.mp3) Topic Focus: Intellectual Curiosity, Reflection, Ethics, Media Promotion & Interpersonal Contact","topic":"Topic Focus: Intellectual Curiosity, Reflection, Ethics, Media Promotion & Interpersonal Contact | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"wonder","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to want to know something; a feeling of great surprise and admiration","chinese":"納悶；想知道；奇蹟","sentence":"Sitting under the starry night sky, the young boy began to ______ how many distant galaxies exist.","translation":"坐在繁星點點的夜空下，小男孩開始納悶想知道究竟存在著多少遙遠星系。"},{"word":"actually","pos":"(adv.)","definition":"in fact or really, especially when stating the truth","chinese":"實際上；事實上","sentence":"People assumed the two rivals were unfriendly, but they were ______ close childhood friends.","translation":"人們以為這兩位競爭對手關係不睦，但事實上他們是親密的兒時玩伴。"},{"word":"admire","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to respect or approve of someone or their behavior","chinese":"欽佩；讚賞","sentence":"Students around the world deeply ______ Mother Teresa for her lifelong selfless dedication to the poor.","translation":"全世界的學生都深深欽佩德蕾莎修女一生對窮人的無私奉獻。"},{"word":"basic","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"forming the foundation or most important part; simple","chinese":"基礎的；基本的","sentence":"Mastering ______ grammar rules and everyday vocabulary is the first essential step in learning English.","translation":"掌握基礎文法規則與日常單字是學習英語的第一個重要步驟。"},{"word":"admit (admit / admitted / admitted)","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to agree that something is true, especially unwillingly","chinese":"承認；准許進入","sentence":"The honest student had the moral courage to ______ his mistake after accidentally breaking the beaker.","translation":"那位誠實的學生在不小心打碎燒杯後，有道德勇氣承認自己的錯誤。"},{"word":"adopt","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to take someone else's child as one's own; to accept a new method or policy","chinese":"收養；採納；採用","sentence":"The city government decided to ______ a modern green transportation policy to reduce urban smog.","translation":"市政府決定採納一項現代綠色交通政策，以減少城市煙霧。"},{"word":"advertisement","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a public promotion of a product or service; an ad","chinese":"廣告；宣傳","sentence":"The local bookstore placed a creative ______ in the weekend newspaper to promote its annual book sale.","translation":"那家在地書店在週末報紙上刊登了一則有創意的廣告，以宣傳其年度書展大特賣。"},{"word":"available","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"ready to be used, bought, or found; not busy","chinese":"可取得的；可買到的；有空的","sentence":"Are you ______ this Saturday afternoon to meet at the quiet cafe and review our final presentation slides?","translation":"你這個星期六下午有空在安靜的咖啡館碰面，並檢視我們期末簡報的投影片嗎？"},{"word":"certain","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"having no doubt or knowing for sure; particular","chinese":"確定的；確信的；某個","sentence":"The lead detective was completely ______ that the fingerprint on the broken glass belonged to the suspect.","translation":"主任偵探完全確定碎玻璃上的指紋屬於該名嫌犯。"},{"word":"contact","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to communicate with someone by phone, email, or letter; communication","chinese":"聯絡；聯繫","sentence":"If you have any further questions regarding the job interview, please ______ our human resources department.","translation":"如果您對工作面試有任何進一步的問題，請聯絡我們的人力資源部門。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Looking out at the vast ocean, the poet began to ______ what miraculous creatures dwell beneath the waves.","options":["admit","wonder","adopt","contact"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: wonder (納悶；想知道) 【全文中譯】望著遼闊的大海，詩人開始納悶想知道浪濤之下究竟棲息著怎樣神奇的生物。 【選項解析】(A) admit 承認 (B) wonder 想知道 (C) adopt 採納 (D) contact 聯絡。began to wonder 表「開始想知道」。"},{"number":2,"stem":"He seemed very calm during the speech, but ______ his hands were trembling with nervousness inside his pockets.","options":["basic","certain","available","actually"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: actually (實際上；事實上) 【全文中譯】他在演講時表面上看起來非常冷靜，但事實上他的雙手在口袋裡因緊張而顫抖。 【選項解析】(A) basic 基礎的 (B) certain 確信的 (C) available 可取得的 (D) actually 事實上。actually 表轉折「事實上」。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Teachers and classmates ______ Sarah for her unwavering persistence in winning the national science fair.","options":["admire","admit","adopt","wonder"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: admire (欽佩；讚賞) 【全文中譯】老師與同學們都欽佩莎拉在贏得全國科展方面所展現的堅定不移毅力。 【選項解析】(A) admire 欽佩 (B) admit 承認 (C) adopt 收養 (D) wonder 納悶。admire Sarah for persistence 表「欽佩其毅力」。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Knowing how to read a map and use a compass are ______ wilderness survival skills for every scout.","options":["basic","actually","certain","available"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: basic (基礎的；基本的) 【全文中譯】懂得如何看地圖和使用指南針是每位童軍必備的荒野求生基礎技能。 【選項解析】(A) basic 基礎的 (B) actually 事實上 (C) certain 確信的 (D) available 可取得的。basic survival skills 表「基礎求生技能」。"},{"number":5,"stem":"It takes genuine maturity and humility to ______ when you have made a serious judgment error.","options":["adopt","wonder","admit","admire"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: admit (承認) 【全文中譯】當你犯了嚴重的判斷錯誤時，坦承承認需要真正的成熟與謙遜。 【選項解析】(A) adopt 採納 (B) wonder 想知道 (C) admit 承認 (D) admire 欽佩。admit error 表「承認錯誤」。"},{"number":6,"stem":"After years of careful thought, the loving couple made the heartwarming decision to ______ an orphaned girl.","options":["adopt","admit","wonder","admire"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: adopt (收養) 【全文中譯】經過多年的深思熟慮，這對有愛心的夫婦做出了令人暖心的決定，收養了一名孤兒女童。 【選項解析】(A) adopt 收養 (B) admit 承認 (C) wonder 納悶 (D) admire 欽佩。adopt a girl 表「收養一名女孩」。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The technology corporation launched a multimillion-dollar television ______ to introduce its new electric car.","options":["wonder","advertisement","contact","basic"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: advertisement (廣告) 【全文中譯】這家科技大企業推出了一則耗資數百萬美元的電視廣告，以介紹其新款電動車。 【選項解析】(A) wonder 奇蹟 (B) advertisement 廣告 (C) contact 聯絡 (D) basic 基本。television advertisement 表「電視廣告」。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Free parking spaces are seldom ______ in downtown Taipei during busy holiday shopping weekends.","options":["certain","available","basic","actually"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: available (可取得的；有空的) 【全文中譯】在繁忙的假日購物週末，台北市中心鮮少有空的免費停車位。 【選項解析】(A) certain 確信的 (B) available 可用的；空的 (C) basic 基本的 (D) actually 事實上。free spaces are seldom available 表「車位很少是有空的」。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The doctor felt ______ that the prescribed antibiotics would cure the throat infection within five days.","options":["basic","available","certain","actually"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: certain (確信的；有把握的) 【全文中譯】醫生確信處方的抗生素將在五天內治癒喉嚨感染。 【選項解析】(A) basic 基礎的 (B) available 可取得的 (C) certain 確信的 (D) actually 事實上。felt certain that 表「確信…」。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Please feel free to ______ our customer support hotline if you experience any technical difficulties.","options":["adopt","admit","wonder","contact"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: contact (聯絡；聯繫) 【全文中譯】如果您遇到任何技術問題，請隨時聯繫聯絡我們的客戶支援服務專線。 【選項解析】(A) adopt 採納 (B) admit 承認 (C) wonder 納悶 (D) contact 聯絡。contact support hotline 表「聯絡支援專線」。"},{"number":11,"stem":"I often ______ how ancient Egyptians managed to construct the magnificent pyramids with simple tools.","options":["wonder","admit","adopt","contact"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: wonder (納悶；想知道) 【全文中譯】我常常納悶想知道古埃及人是如何使用簡單工具建造出如此宏偉的金字塔的。 【選項解析】(A) wonder 想知道 (B) admit 承認 (C) adopt 採納 (D) contact 聯絡。wonder how 表「想知道如何…」。"},{"number":12,"stem":"She sounded like a native speaker of English, but she was ______ born and raised in central Tainan.","options":["basic","actually","certain","available"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: actually (實際上) 【全文中譯】她英語聽起來像母語人士，但她實際上是在台南土生長大的。 【選項解析】(A) basic 基本的 (B) actually 實際上 (C) certain 確定的 (D) available 有空的。actually born and raised 表「實際上出生長大於」。"},{"number":13,"stem":"We all ______ uncle Robert for his generous philanthropy and dedication to helping disadvantaged children.","options":["adopt","admit","admire","wonder"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: admire (欽佩；讚賞) 【全文中譯】我們大家都欽佩羅伯特叔叔慷慨的慈善事業，以及他致力於救助弱勢兒童的奉獻精神。 【選項解析】(A) adopt 收養 (B) admit 承認 (C) admire 欽佩 (D) wonder 納悶。admire him for dedication 表「欽佩其奉獻」。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The course syllabus covers ______ computer skills, such as word processing, spreadsheets, and sending emails.","options":["certain","basic","available","actually"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: basic (基礎的) 【全文中譯】該課程教學大綱涵蓋了基礎電腦技能，例如文書處理、試算表與寄發電子郵件。 【選項解析】(A) certain 確定的 (B) basic 基礎的 (C) available 可用的 (D) actually 實際上。basic computer skills 表「基礎電腦技能」。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The suspect refused to ______ any involvement in the bank robbery, claiming he was out of town.","options":["wonder","adopt","admit","admire"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: admit (承認) 【全文中譯】該嫌犯拒絕承認參與銀行搶案，堅稱自己當時不在城裡。 【選項解析】(A) wonder 納悶 (B) adopt 採用 (C) admit 承認 (D) admire 欽佩。refused to admit 表「拒絕承認」。"},{"number":16,"stem":"School administrators voted to ______ a new digital attendance tracking software to streamline records.","options":["adopt","wonder","admit","contact"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: adopt (採納；採用) 【全文中譯】學校行政人員投票贊成採用一款新的數位出缺勤追蹤軟體，以簡化紀錄作業。 【選項解析】(A) adopt 採用 (B) wonder 納悶 (C) admit 承認 (D) contact 聯絡。adopt new software 表「採用新軟體」。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Posting an online job ______ attracted hundreds of qualified candidates from universities across the island.","options":["wonder","contact","advertisement","basic"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: advertisement (廣告) 【全文中譯】在網路上刊登徵才廣告吸引了來自全島各大學的數百名合格應徵者。 【選項解析】(A) wonder 奇蹟 (B) contact 聯繫 (C) advertisement 廣告 (D) basic 基本。job advertisement 表「求職/徵才廣告」。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Fresh seasonal strawberries are now widely ______ at local fruit markets as harvest season begins.","options":["certain","available","basic","actually"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: available (可買到的；供應的) 【全文中譯】隨著採收季節展開，新鮮當季草莓現在在各地水果市場上都隨處可買到。 【選項解析】(A) certain 確定的 (B) available 可買到的 (C) basic 基本的 (D) actually 實際上。widely available 表「普遍可取得/買到」。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Are you entirely ______ that you locked the front door securely before we left the house this morning?","options":["basic","available","certain","actually"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: certain (確定的) 【全文中譯】你完全確定今早我們出門前你把大門鎖好了嗎？ 【選項解析】(A) basic 基本的 (B) available 有空的 (C) certain 確定的 (D) actually 實際上。entirely certain 表「完全確定」。"},{"number":20,"stem":"You can ______ me via text message or telephone if our train schedule changes unexpectedly.","options":["adopt","admit","wonder","contact"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: contact (聯絡) 【全文中譯】如果我們的火車時刻表意外發生變更，你可以透過簡訊或電話聯絡我。 【選項解析】(A) adopt 採納 (B) admit 承認 (C) wonder 納悶 (D) contact 聯絡。contact me via text 表「透過簡訊聯絡我」。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Scientists still ______ about the mysteries of dark matter and how the universe initially came into being.","options":["adopt","wonder","admit","contact"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: wonder (想知道；探索納悶) 【全文中譯】科學家們依然對暗物質的奧秘以及宇宙最初是如何形成的感到好奇探索（納悶）。 【選項解析】(A) adopt 採用 (B) wonder 納悶好奇 (C) admit 承認 (D) contact 聯繫。wonder about mysteries 表「對奧秘感到好奇想探究」。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The small antique bookstore looked closed, but it was ______ open and welcoming readers inside.","options":["actually","basic","certain","available"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: actually (實際上) 【全文中譯】那家古樸的舊書店看起來像打烊了，但它實際上開著，並歡迎讀者進入。 【選項解析】(A) actually 實際上 (B) basic 基本的 (C) certain 確定的 (D) available 可用的。actually open 表「實際上開著」。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Young artists deeply ______ Picasso for his revolutionary cubist style that transformed modern visual art.","options":["adopt","admire","admit","wonder"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: admire (欽佩；讚賞) 【全文中譯】年輕藝術家們深為欽佩畢卡索，因其革命性的立體派風格改變了現代視覺藝術。 【選項解析】(A) adopt 採納 (B) admire 欽佩 (C) admit 承認 (D) wonder 納悶。deeply admire Picasso 表「深為欽佩畢卡索」。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Clean drinking water, nutritious food, and safe shelter are ______ human rights that belong to everyone.","options":["basic","actually","certain","available"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: basic (基本人權) 【全文中譯】乾淨飲用水、營養食物與安全住所是屬於每個人的基本人權。 【選項解析】(A) basic 基本的 (B) actually 實際上 (C) certain 確定的 (D) available 可用的。basic human rights 表「基本人權」。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Although he felt embarrassed, the student was brave enough to ______ that he did not finish his homework.","options":["adopt","wonder","admit","contact"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: admit (承認) 【全文中譯】雖然他感到尷尬，那位學生還是勇敢地承認自己沒有完成家庭作業。 【選項解析】(A) adopt 採納 (B) wonder 納悶 (C) admit 承認 (D) contact 聯絡。brave enough to admit 表「勇敢承認」。"}]}];
